#: manual/api/ball_float.md:50
msgid "Add the package and the endpoint package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中添加该包及端点包："

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:60
msgid "The examples refer to the packages as `@ball_float.`, `@bin_float.` and `@lf_arith.` (for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, which defines `ArithmeticError`, `RoundingMode` and the enclosure traits). They use two helpers: `iv(lo, hi)` builds the 53-bit interval with integer endpoints, and `fmt(x)` prints the endpoints as six-digit decimals, the lower one rounded down and the upper one rounded up, so the text still encloses the stored set."
msgstr "示例中将这些包称为 `@ball_float.`、`@bin_float.` 和 `@lf_arith.`（对应 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`，它定义了 `ArithmeticError`、`RoundingMode` 以及包络 trait）。示例使用两个辅助函数：`iv(lo, hi)` 构建端点为整数的 53 位区间；`fmt(x)` 将端点输出为六位十进制数，下端点向下舍入、上端点向上舍入，因此文本仍然包络所存储的集合。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:97
msgid "Types"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:101
msgid "`BallFloat` is a closed interval with `BinFloat` endpoints and a precision tag."
msgstr "`BallFloat` 是一个以 `BinFloat` 为端点并带有精度标记的闭区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:109
msgid "A non-empty value satisfies $\\underline{x} \\le \\overline{x}$, has no NaN endpoint, never has $\\underline{x} = +\\infty$ or $\\overline{x} = -\\infty$, and has precision $\\ge 1$. The empty set is a separate state. The fields are private; construct values with the functions in [Construction](#construction). `==` is the `equal` of IEEE 1788-2015 Table 10.3: it compares the sets, not the representation; see [`BallFloat::equal`](#ballfloatsubset-ballfloatinterior-ballfloatequal-ballfloatdisjoint) and [`BallFloat::identical`](#ballfloatidentical)."
msgstr "非空值满足 $\\underline{x} \\le \\overline{x}$，没有 NaN 端点，绝不会出现 $\\underline{x} = +\\infty$ 或 $\\overline{x} = -\\infty$，且精度 $\\ge 1$。空集是一个单独的状态。字段是私有的；请使用[构造](#construction)中的函数构造值。`==` 是 IEEE 1788-2015 表 10.3 的 `equal`：它比较的是集合，而不是表示；参见 [`BallFloat::equal`](#ballfloatsubset-ballfloatinterior-ballfloatequal-ballfloatdisjoint) 和 [`BallFloat::identical`](#ballfloatidentical)。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:120
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated` is a `BallFloat` paired with an IEEE 1788 [`Decoration`](#decoration), or the special value NaI (not an interval)."
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated` 是一个 `BallFloat` 与一个 IEEE 1788 [`Decoration`](#decoration) 的组合，或者是特殊值 NaI（not an interval，非区间）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:129
msgid "The decoration is kept canonical: an empty interval always carries `Trv`, an unbounded interval never carries `Com`, and only `BallFloatDecorated::nai` carries `Ill`."
msgstr "装饰始终保持规范形式：空区间总是带有 `Trv`，无界区间绝不带有 `Com`，并且只有 `BallFloatDecorated::nai` 带有 `Ill`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:135
msgid "`Decoration` is the IEEE 1788 decoration of a decorated interval, ordered `Ill < Trv < Def < Dac < Com`."
msgstr "`Decoration` 是装饰区间的 IEEE 1788 装饰，其顺序为 `Ill < Trv < Def < Dac < Com`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:148
msgid "For a decorated result $(\\boldsymbol{y}, d)$ of a function $f$ evaluated on a box $\\boldsymbol{x}$:"
msgstr "对于函数 $f$ 在矩形 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上求值所得的装饰结果 $(\\boldsymbol{y}, d)$："

