msgstr "$\\boldsymbol{x}$ 非空，$f$ 在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上有定义，且其在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上的限制连续"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:155
msgid "$\\boldsymbol{x}$ is non-empty and $f$ is defined on $\\boldsymbol{x}$"
msgstr "$\\boldsymbol{x}$ 非空，且 $f$ 在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上有定义"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:156
msgid "nothing is known"
msgstr "一无所知"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:157
msgid "the value is NaI"
msgstr "值为 NaI"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:159
msgid "Each property implies the ones below it, which is why the decorations are totally ordered; `Decoration` derives `Compare` in that order, so `<`, `<=`, `>` and `>=` are the comparisons of decorations of IEEE 1788-2015 11.5.3. `Show` prints the lower-case IEEE 1788 names `com`, `dac`, `def`, `trv`, `ill`."
msgstr "每个性质都蕴含其下方的性质，因此装饰是全序的；`Decoration` 按该顺序派生 `Compare`，所以 `<`、`<=`、`>` 和 `>=` 就是 IEEE 1788-2015 11.5.3 的装饰比较。`Show` 输出 IEEE 1788 的小写名称 `com`、`dac`、`def`、`trv`、`ill`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:166
msgid "`OverlapState` is the result of `overlap`: the IEEE 1788 classification of the relative position of two intervals."
msgstr "`OverlapState` 是 `overlap` 的结果：IEEE 1788 对两个区间相对位置的分类。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:191
msgid "The constructors are the 16 states of IEEE 1788-2015 Table 10.7 (10.6.4), with the standard's names: `bothEmpty`, `firstEmpty`, `secondEmpty`, `before`, `meets`, `overlaps`, `starts`, `containedBy`, `finishes`, `equals`, `after`, `metBy`, `overlappedBy`, `startedBy`, `contains` and `finishedBy`. There is no 17th state: the decorated `overlap` has no value for NaI (11.7.2) and returns `None`."
msgstr "构造子就是 IEEE 1788-2015 表 10.7（10.6.4）的 16 个状态，名称与标准一致：`bothEmpty`、`firstEmpty`、`secondEmpty`、`before`、`meets`、`overlaps`、`starts`、`containedBy`、`finishes`、`equals`、`after`、`metBy`、`overlappedBy`、`startedBy`、`contains` 和 `finishedBy`。没有第 17 个状态：带装饰版本的 `overlap` 对 NaI 没有值（11.7.2），返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:200
msgid "`BallContext` describes a target binary format of IEEE 754-2019 3.3: a precision in bits and the exponent range $[1 - e_{\\max}, e_{\\max}]$ (`e_min` is derived, not a parameter)."
msgstr "`BallContext` 描述 IEEE 754-2019 3.3 的目标二进制格式：以位为单位的精度和指数范围 $[1 - e_{\\max}, e_{\\max}]$（`e_min` 是推导出来的，不是参数）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:210
msgid "$e_{\\min}$ and $e_{\\max}$ follow IEEE 754: a finite nonzero value $v$ with $2^{e} \\le |v| < 2^{e+1}$ is in range when $e \\le e_{\\max}$, and it is normal when $e \\ge e_{\\min}$. See [Contexts and flags](#contexts-and-flags)."
msgstr "$e_{\\min}$ 和 $e_{\\max}$ 遵循 IEEE 754：满足 $2^{e} \\le |v| < 2^{e+1}$ 的有限非零值 $v$，当 $e \\le e_{\\max}$ 时在范围内，当 $e \\ge e_{\\min}$ 时为正规数。参见[上下文与标志](#contexts-and-flags)。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:216
msgid "`BallFlags` records the conditions raised while rounding an interval into a `BallContext`."
msgstr "`BallFlags` 记录将区间舍入到某个 `BallContext` 时触发的条件。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:225
msgid "`inexact` is set when an endpoint (or, for `midpoint_ctx`, the midpoint) changed; `overflow` when it was beyond $e_{\\max}$; `underflow` when it is tiny and inexact, as IEEE 754 defines it (see [`BallFloat::apply_ctx`](#ballfloatapply_ctx)). The fields are private; each flag is read with the accessor method of the same name, listed under [`BallFlags::new`](#ballflagsnew-ballflagscombine-ballflagsinexact-ballflagsoverflow-ballflagsunderflow)."
msgstr "当端点（对 `midpoint_ctx` 而言是中点）发生改变时设置 `inexact`；当其超出 $e_{\\max}$ 时设置 `overflow`；当其为微小值且不精确时设置 `underflow`，与 IEEE 754 的定义一致（参见 [`BallFloat::apply_ctx`](#ballfloatapply_ctx)）。字段为私有；每个标志都用同名访问器方法读取，这些方法列于 [`BallFlags::new`](#ballflagsnew-ballflagscombine-ballflagsinexact-ballflagsoverflow-ballflagsunderflow) 之下。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:231
#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:59
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:63
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:63
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:68
msgid "Construction"
msgstr "构造"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:235
msgid "`BallFloat::new` builds the interval $[c - r, c + r]$ from a center and a radius, enlarged so that it is exact at the requested precision. `BallFloat::try_new` returns the same interval, or an `ArithmeticError` where `new` aborts."
msgstr "`BallFloat::new` 由中心和半径构建区间 $[c - r, c + r]$，并适当扩大以使其在所请求的精度下可精确表示。`BallFloat::try_new` 返回同一个区间，在 `new` 会中止的地方返回 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:245
msgid "The default precision is the larger of the precisions of `center` and `radius`. With $p$ that precision, the stored interval is"
msgstr "默认精度是 `center` 与 `radius` 精度中的较大者。记该精度为 $p$，则存储的区间为"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:254
msgid "which contains $[c - r, c + r]$ (proof in the [design page](../design/ball_float.md#from-midpointradius-to-endpoints)). The endpoints $\\tilde c \\pm R$ are formed exactly, so they may carry more than $p$ bits. `new` aborts, and `try_new` returns a domain error, when `center` or `radius` is not finite or when `radius` is negative, and when `precision` is outside `1..=binary_precision_max`."
msgstr "它包含 $[c - r, c + r]$（证明见[设计文档](../design/ball_float.md#from-midpointradius-to-endpoints)）。端点 $\\tilde c \\pm R$ 是精确构成的，因此其位数可能多于 $p$。当 `center` 或 `radius` 非有限，或 `radius` 为负时，`new` 中止，`try_new` 返回定义域错误。当 `precision` 不在 `1..=binary_precision_max` 范围内时，`new` 中止，`try_new` 返回定义域错误。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:261
msgid "When $c$ already has at most $p$ bits and $r = 0$, the result is the singleton $\\{c\\}$. When $c$ needs more than $p$ bits, the rounding error of the center is added to the radius on *both* sides, so the interval is wider than $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(c - r), \\operatorname{RU}_p(c + r)]$; use `from_bounds` for the tightest enclosure of known bounds."
msgstr "当 $c$ 已至多有 $p$ 位且 $r = 0$ 时，结果为单点集 $\\{c\\}$。当 $c$ 需要多于 $p$ 位时，中心的舍入误差会在*两侧*都加到半径上，因此区间比 $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(c - r), \\operatorname{RU}_p(c + r)]$ 更宽；若要得到已知界的最紧包络，请使用 `from_bounds`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:267
msgid "`BallFloat::from_string` and `BallFloatDecorated::from_string`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_string` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::from_string`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:269
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 `textToInterval` (10.5.8, 12.12.7, 13.2): the interval literal `s`, as the hull of its value at `precision` bits."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 `textToInterval`（10.5.8、12.12.7、13.2）：把区间字面量 `s` 转成其值在 `precision` 位下的区间包。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:278
msgid "The portable literals of 12.11 are accepted, with the case ignored and no whitespace except the spaces and tabs the grammar allows inside the brackets:"
msgstr "接受 12.11 的可移植字面量，不区分大小写，除文法允许的括号内空格和制表符外不允许其他空白："

