msgstr "`[1.5, 2.5]`、`[-Inf, 2/3]`、`[0x1.3p-1,]`（省略的端点为无穷）、`[,]`（Entire）"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:285
msgid "point"
msgstr "单点"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:286
msgid "uncertain `m?rve`"
msgstr "不确定形式 `m?rve`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:286
msgid "`3.56?1` ($[3.55, 3.57]$), `3.56?1e2` ($[355, 357]$), `3.560?2u`, `-10?` (half an ulp), `-10??u` ($[-10, +\\infty]$), `-10??` (Entire)"
msgstr "`3.56?1`（$[3.55, 3.57]$）、`3.56?1e2`（$[355, 357]$）、`3.560?2u`、`-10?`（半个 ulp）、`-10??u`（$[-10, +\\infty]$）、`-10??`（Entire）"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:287
msgid "special"
msgstr "特殊形式"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:288
msgid "decorated"
msgstr "带装饰"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:290
msgid "The bounds are parsed exactly (the decimal, hexadecimal and rational value, the ulp of the last place of an uncertain form) and rounded outward: the lower bound down and the upper bound up. The comparison $l \\le u$ is decided from the exact values, so a literal is never rejected or emptied by rounding; a decimal exponent or a binary exponent beyond the range is decided from the exponent and the digits without forming the value (a lower bound above the range is the largest finite float and an upper bound is $+\\infty$; below the smallest stored value they are 0 and the smallest positive stored value). Only two finite bounds of different radices that are equal to the working size and have an exponent beyond 65,536 cannot be ordered; then (12.12.7 case (b), `PossiblyUndefinedOperation`) the result contains both bounds."
msgstr "端点按精确值解析（十进制、十六进制与有理数的值，不确定形式的末位 ulp）并向外舍入：下端点向下，上端点向上。比较 $l \\le u$ 由精确值判定，所以字面量不会因舍入而被拒绝或变空；超出范围的十进制或二进制指数由指数和数字个数判定，无需构造该值（超出范围的下端点是最大有限浮点数，上端点是 $+\\infty$；小于最小存储值时分别是 0 和最小正存储值）。只有两个不同基数的有限端点在工作规模上相等且指数超过 65,536 时无法排序；此时（12.12.7 情形 (b)，`PossiblyUndefinedOperation`）结果包含两个端点。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:299
msgid "`Err` is the failed call of the standard (the result Empty for a bare literal, NaI for a decorated one, and the exception `UndefinedOperation`). It is an `ArithmeticError` of the parse kind whose message names the rule that was broken (for example \"the lower bound is greater than the upper bound (l <= u is required)\", \"rational literal: the denominator must be a positive natural number\", \"the decoration com needs a bounded interval (11.4)\"). A decoration or `[nai]` in a bare literal is such a failure for `BallFloat::from_string`. `BallFloatDecorated::from_string` accepts a bare literal (decorated by `newDec`, so `com` for a bounded interval and `dac` otherwise), `bare_dec`, and `[nai]`, which is `Ok(NaI)`; a decoration not permitted for the value (11.4: only `trv` for Empty, `com` only for a bounded interval) is an `Err`, and `com` becomes `dac` if the rounding of a bounded literal overflowed. A string longer than `interval_literal_max_length` (65,536 characters) is not parsed: 12.11.5 allows an implementation to \"restrict support of some input strings (too long strings or strings with a rational number literal)\" and then requires that the constructor \"shall always return a Level 2 interval (possibly Entire in this case) that contains the Level 1 interval\", so the result is Entire (decorated: `dac`, or the `trv` or `def` the string ends with)."
msgstr "`Err` 是标准中的失败调用（裸字面量的结果为 Empty，装饰字面量为 NaI，并发出异常 `UndefinedOperation`）。它是解析类的 `ArithmeticError`，消息指明被违反的规则（例如“下端点大于上端点（要求 l <= u）”“有理数字面量：分母必须是正自然数”“装饰 com 需要有界区间（11.4）”）。对 `BallFloat::from_string` 而言，裸字面量中带装饰或 `[nai]` 就是这样的失败。`BallFloatDecorated::from_string` 接受裸字面量（由 `newDec` 装饰：有界为 `com`，否则为 `dac`）、`bare_dec` 和 `[nai]`（即 `Ok(NaI)`）；对该值不允许的装饰（11.4：Empty 只允许 `trv`，`com` 只用于有界区间）是 `Err`，有界字面量舍入后溢出时 `com` 变为 `dac`。长于 `interval_literal_max_length`（65,536 个字符）的字符串不被解析：12.11.5 允许实现“限制对某些输入字符串（过长的字符串或含有理数字面量的字符串）的支持”，并要求构造函数“必须始终返回一个包含 Level 1 区间的 Level 2 区间（这种情况下可以是 Entire）”，所以结果是 Entire（装饰版本为 `dac`，或字符串所带的 `trv`、`def`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:328
msgid "`BallFloat::from_bounds` and `BallFloat::try_from_bounds`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_bounds` 与 `BallFloat::try_from_bounds`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:330
msgid "`BallFloat::from_bounds` builds the interval $[\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$ from its endpoints, rounded outward to the requested precision."
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_bounds` 由端点构建区间 $[\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$，并向外舍入到所请求的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:338
msgid "The default precision is the larger of the endpoint precisions. Infinite endpoints build unbounded intervals: `from_bounds(-inf, +inf)` is Entire. The inputs are invalid when an endpoint is NaN, the lower endpoint is $+\\infty$, the upper endpoint is $-\\infty$, or $\\underline{x} > \\overline{x}$; `from_bounds` aborts and `try_from_bounds` returns a domain error. There is no way to build Empty from bounds; use `BallFloat::empty`."
msgstr "默认精度是两个端点精度中的较大者。无穷端点构建无界区间：`from_bounds(-inf, +inf)` 即 Entire。当某个端点为 NaN、下端点为 $+\\infty$、上端点为 $-\\infty$ 或 $\\underline{x} > \\overline{x}$ 时，输入无效；此时 `from_bounds` 中止，`try_from_bounds` 返回定义域错误。无法由端点构建 Empty；请使用 `BallFloat::empty`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:355
msgid "`BallFloat::exact` and `BallFloat::try_exact`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::exact` 与 `BallFloat::try_exact`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:357
msgid "`BallFloat::exact` builds the singleton $\\{x\\}$ of a finite `BinFloat`."
msgstr "`BallFloat::exact` 构建有限 `BinFloat` 的单点集 $\\{x\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:364
msgid "The default precision is that of `x`. When `x` has more significant bits than the requested precision, the singleton is rounded outward to the two-point interval $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(x), \\operatorname{RU}_p(x)]$. A non-finite `x` aborts `exact` and makes `try_exact` return a domain error."
msgstr "默认精度为 `x` 的精度。当 `x` 的有效位数多于所请求的精度时，单点集会向外舍入为两点区间 $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(x), \\operatorname{RU}_p(x)]$。非有限的 `x` 会使 `exact` 中止，并使 `try_exact` 返回定义域错误。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:369
msgid "`BallFloat::from_int` and `BallFloat::from_coefficient`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_int` 与 `BallFloat::from_coefficient`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:371
msgid "`BallFloat::from_int` and `BallFloat::from_coefficient` build an enclosure of an integer."
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_int` 和 `BallFloat::from_coefficient` 构建整数的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:379
msgid "The precision of `from_int` is required and counts bits (it was 53 by default). `from_coefficient` takes a non-negative `BinCoeff` magnitude and a separate sign. The integer is converted to a `BinFloat` exactly and then passed to `exact`, so the result is the singleton $\\{n\\}$ when $n$ fits in $p$ bits and the two-point interval $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(n), \\operatorname{RU}_p(n)]$ otherwise. Either way it contains $n$. Pass a precision at least as large as the bit length of the integer to get a singleton."
msgstr "`from_int` 的精度是必需的，按位计（原来默认是 53）。`from_coefficient` 接受一个非负的 `BinCoeff` 绝对值和一个单独的符号。整数先被精确转换为 `BinFloat`，再传给 `exact`，因此当 $n$ 能用 $p$ 位表示时结果为单点集 $\\{n\\}$，否则为两点区间 $[\\operatorname{RD}_p(n), \\operatorname{RU}_p(n)]$。无论哪种情况结果都包含 $n$。要得到单点集，请传入不小于该整数位长的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:387
msgid "`BallFloat::from_double`, `BallFloat::try_from_double`, `BallFloat::from_float` and `BallFloat::try_from_float`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::from_double`、`BallFloat::try_from_double`、`BallFloat::from_float` 和 `BallFloat::try_from_float`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:389
msgid "These functions build the singleton of the exact binary value of a `Double` or `Float`."
msgstr "这些函数构建 `Double` 或 `Float` 的精确二进制值的单点集。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:399
msgid "Default precisions are 53 and 24. The conversion to `BinFloat` is exact; a smaller requested precision rounds the singleton outward. NaN and infinities abort the plain forms and are domain errors for the `try_` forms. The result encloses the binary value, not the decimal literal it was written as: `from_double(0.1)` does not contain $1/10$."
msgstr "默认精度分别为 53 和 24。到 `BinFloat` 的转换是精确的；若请求的精度更小，则单点集会向外舍入。NaN 和无穷会使普通形式中止，对 `try_` 形式则是定义域错误。结果包络的是二进制值，而不是书写时的十进制字面量：`from_double(0.1)` 不包含 $1/10$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:405
msgid "`BallFloat::entire` and `BallFloat::empty`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::entire` 与 `BallFloat::empty`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:407
msgid "`BallFloat::entire` returns Entire and `BallFloat::empty` returns Empty."
msgstr "`BallFloat::entire` 返回 Entire，`BallFloat::empty` 返回 Empty。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:414
msgid "The default precision is 53."
msgstr "默认精度为 53。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:416
msgid "Observers"
msgstr "观察函数"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:418
msgid "`BallFloat::lower_bound` and `BallFloat::upper_bound`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::lower_bound` 与 `BallFloat::upper_bound`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:420
msgid "`lower_bound` and `upper_bound` are `inf` and `sup` of IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8: they return the endpoints."
msgstr "`lower_bound` 和 `upper_bound` 是 IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8 的 `inf` 和 `sup`：它们返回端点。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:428
msgid "For an unbounded side the endpoint is an infinity. For Empty they return $+\\infty$ and $-\\infty$ respectively, so test `is_empty` first."
msgstr "在无界的一侧，端点是无穷。对于 Empty，二者分别返回 $+\\infty$ 和 $-\\infty$，因此请先检查 `is_empty`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:431
msgid "The sign of a zero follows 12.12.8: in a format with a signed zero a Level 1 value of 0 is returned as $-0$ by `lower_bound` and as $+0$ by every other function of the subclause (`upper_bound`, `midpoint`, `radius`, `width`, `magnitude`, `mignitude` and their contextual forms). So the lower bound of `[0, 1]` is $-0$ and the upper bound of `[-1, 0]` is $+0$, whatever sign of zero the interval was built from; `[0, 0]` has the representative $(-0, +0)$. An interval is a set: the sign of a stored zero is not part of it. `BinFloat`'s `==` agrees with `compare` (`-0 == +0`); `identical` tells the two zeros apart."
msgstr "零的符号遵循 12.12.8：在有符号零的格式中，Level 1 的值 0 由 `lower_bound` 返回为 $-0$，由该子条款的其他所有函数（`upper_bound`、`midpoint`、`radius`、`width`、`magnitude`、`mignitude` 及其带上下文的形式）返回为 $+0$。所以 `[0, 1]` 的下界是 $-0$，`[-1, 0]` 的上界是 $+0$，不论区间由哪种符号的零构造；`[0, 0]` 的代表是 $(-0, +0)$。区间是一个集合：存储的零的符号不是它的一部分。`BinFloat` 的 `==` 与 `compare` 一致（`-0 == +0`）；`identical` 区分这两个零。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:439
msgid "The label of an endpoint, `endpoint.precision()`, is the precision $p$ of the interval exactly when the endpoint is a number of the format of $p$ bits (at most $p$ significant bits and on the grid of $p$ bits, the band below the range floor included); the infinities and the zeros carry $p$ too. The one exception is an exact endpoint that is not such a number (an end of `new` or of `cancel_minus` kept unrounded with more than $p$ bits, or finer than the grid of $p$ bits below the range floor): it keeps the label of its own bit count. `BinFloat`'s `==` agrees with `compare` and ignores the label (`BinFloat::identical` compares it), so `x.lower_bound() == y` holds for a value `y` of the same number; `BallFloat`'s own `==` and `identical` compare the endpoints by value and never read a label. The sign of a stored zero is not part of the interval: the accessors decide it, as the paragraph above says."
msgstr "端点的标签 `endpoint.precision()` 恰好在端点是 $p$ 位格式的数（至多 $p$ 位有效位，且落在 $p$ 位的网格上，包括范围下限以下的频带）时等于区间的精度 $p$；无穷和零也带 $p$。唯一的例外是不是这种数的精确端点（`new` 或 `cancel_minus` 未舍入保留的多于 $p$ 位的端点，或在范围下限以下比 $p$ 位网格更细的端点）：它保留自己位数的标签。`BinFloat` 的 `==` 与 `compare` 一致并忽略标签（`BinFloat::identical` 比较标签），所以对于同一个数的值 `y`，`x.lower_bound() == y` 成立；`BallFloat` 自己的 `==` 和 `identical` 按值比较端点，从不读取标签。存储的零的符号不是区间的一部分：由访问函数决定，如上一段所述。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:451
msgid "`BallFloat::midpoint` and `BallFloat::radius`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::midpoint` 与 `BallFloat::radius`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:453
msgid "`midpoint` is `mid` and `radius` is `rad` of IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8 (the names `mid`, `rad`, `wid`, `inf`, `sup`, `mag` and `mig` are spelled out here; the standard's short names would sit next to `BinFloat::inf`, so the long names are a documented exception)."
msgstr "`midpoint` 即 IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8 的 `mid`，`radius` 即其 `rad`（`mid`、`rad`、`wid`、`inf`、`sup`、`mag` 和 `mig` 这些名字在此用全称拼写；标准的短名字会与 `BinFloat::inf` 并列，所以长名字是有记录的例外）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:463
msgid "Both are total; none aborts. `midpoint` returns NaN for Empty, 0 for Entire, the largest finite number of the format (the interval's precision, the widest exponent range of `BinFloat`) with the sign of the unbounded side for a half-bounded interval, and otherwise the exact midpoint rounded to nearest (ties to even) at the interval's precision. `midpoint_ctx` is the same observer for a given `BallContext` as the result format. `radius` returns NaN for Empty, $+\\infty$ for every unbounded interval, and otherwise the smallest number $r$ of the precision with $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq [m - r, m + r]$, where $m$ is the value `midpoint` returns: the larger of $m - \\underline{x}$ and $\\overline{x} - m$, rounded up. This is measured from the rounded midpoint, not from the exact center, so `[midpoint - radius, midpoint + radius]` always contains the interval (before 0.12 the radius was the half-width and could miss a bound by up to half an ulp). For $[1, 1 + 3 \\cdot 2^{-52}]$ at 53 bits the midpoint is $1 + 2^{-51}$ and the radius $2^{-51}$."
msgstr "两者都是全函数，没有一个会中止。`midpoint` 对 Empty 返回 NaN，对 Entire 返回 0，对半无界区间返回该格式（区间的精度、`BinFloat` 最宽的指数范围）的最大有限数，符号与无界的一侧相同，其余情形返回精确中点按就近舍入（偶数优先）到区间精度的值。`midpoint_ctx` 是以给定的 `BallContext` 为结果格式的同一个观测量。`radius` 对 Empty 返回 NaN，对每个无界区间返回 $+\\infty$，其余情形返回满足 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq [m - r, m + r]$ 的该精度下最小的数 $r$，其中 $m$ 是 `midpoint` 返回的值：即 $m - \\underline{x}$ 与 $\\overline{x} - m$ 中较大者，向上舍入。它是从舍入后的中点而不是精确中心量起的，所以 `[midpoint - radius, midpoint + radius]` 总是包含该区间（0.12 之前半径是半宽，最多可能比某个端点少半个 ulp）。对于 53 位下的 $[1, 1 + 3 \\cdot 2^{-52}]$，中点为 $1 + 2^{-51}$，半径为 $2^{-51}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:480
msgid "`width` returns $\\operatorname{RU}_p(\\overline{x} - \\underline{x})$, an upper bound of the exact width. It is NaN for Empty and $+\\infty$ for unbounded intervals."
msgstr "`width` 返回 $\\operatorname{RU}_p(\\overline{x} - \\underline{x})$，是精确宽度的上界。对 Empty 为 NaN，对无界区间为 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:484
msgid "`BallFloat::magnitude` and `BallFloat::mignitude`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::magnitude` 与 `BallFloat::mignitude`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:486
msgid "`magnitude` returns $\\sup\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$ and `mignitude` returns $\\inf\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$."
msgstr "`magnitude` 返回 $\\sup\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$，`mignitude` 返回 $\\inf\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:494
msgid "For a non-empty interval,"
msgstr "对于非空区间，"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:506
msgid "because $|\\xi|$ is convex, so its maximum over an interval is at an endpoint, and it is monotone on each side of 0. Both are exact. Empty gives NaN for both (12.12.8); `magnitude` of an unbounded interval is $+\\infty$."
msgstr "这是因为 $|\\xi|$ 是凸函数，其在区间上的最大值位于端点处，并且它在 0 的两侧各自单调。二者都是精确的。Empty 对二者都给出 NaN（12.12.8）；无界区间的 `magnitude` 为 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:525
msgid "`precision` returns the precision tag."
msgstr "`precision` 返回精度标记。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:533
msgid "These predicates test the shape of the set."
msgstr "这些谓词检测集合的形状。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:542
msgid "`is_common_interval` holds when the interval is non-empty with two finite endpoints (IEEE 1788-2015 10.6.3). `is_singleton` holds when $\\underline{x} = \\overline{x}$. To ask whether an interval contains 0, use `is_member` with a zero."
msgstr "当区间非空且两个端点都是有限数时，`is_common_interval` 成立（IEEE 1788-2015 10.6.3）。当 $\\underline{x} = \\overline{x}$ 时，`is_singleton` 成立。要询问一个区间是否包含 0，请对零使用 `is_member`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:547
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:446
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "精度"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:551
msgid "`with_precision` re-rounds an interval to a new precision without shrinking it."
msgstr "`with_precision` 将区间重新舍入到新的精度，且不会使其缩小。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:558
msgid "The endpoints are rounded outward: the lower bound toward $-\\infty$ and the upper bound toward $+\\infty$, because outward rounding is the only direction that keeps the result an enclosure; there is no rounding-mode argument. Empty stays Empty with the new precision."
msgstr "端点向外取整：下界朝 $-\\infty$，上界朝 $+\\infty$，因为向外取整是唯一能让结果保持为包络的方向；没有舍入模式参数。Empty 仍为 Empty，并带上新精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:563
msgid "[!NOTE] The result is the tightest representable enclosure of the input, so widening the precision is exact and re-rounding at an unchanged precision is an identity. The center–radius rebuild this function used to perform is not an identity: if the exact center $(\\underline{x} + \\overline{x})/2$ needs more than $p$ bits, both endpoints move outward by the rounding error of the center, so at 53 bits $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ became $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$. `normalized`, `convex_hull` with an Empty operand, the checked capabilities (`div_checked`, `pow_nat_checked`, `pow_int_checked`) and the `pow_nat`/`pown` methods of `ball_float_checked` round endpoints the same way and do not widen a representable interval either."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 结果是输入的可表示最紧包络，因此加宽精度是精确的，在精度不变时重新取整是恒等操作。本函数过去采用的中心–半径重建并非恒等：若精确中心 $(\\underline{x} + \\overline{x})/2$ 需要多于 $p$ 位，两个端点都会按中心的舍入误差向外移动，因此在 53 位下 $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 曾变成 $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。`normalized`、带 Empty 操作数的 `convex_hull`、checked 能力（`div_checked`、`pow_nat_checked`、`pow_int_checked`）以及 `ball_float_checked` 的 `pow_nat`/`pown` 方法以同样的方式舍入端点，同样不会加宽可表示的区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:596
msgid "`normalized` normalizes the two endpoints (`BinFloat::normalized` removes trailing zero bits) and stores them at the interval's precision."
msgstr "`normalized` 规范化两个端点（`BinFloat::normalized` 去掉末尾的零位），并以区间的精度存储它们。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:603
msgid "The stored endpoints are already representable at that precision, so the result is the same set as the input: `normalized` of $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ at 53 bits is $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$. Empty stays Empty."
msgstr "存储的端点在该精度下本就可表示，因此结果与输入是同一个集合：53 位下 $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 的 `normalized` 就是 $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。Empty 仍为 Empty。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:607
msgid "Set operations"
msgstr "集合运算"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:609
msgid "`BallFloat::intersection` and `BallFloat::convex_hull`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::intersection` 与 `BallFloat::convex_hull`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:611
msgid "`intersection` returns $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap \\boldsymbol{y}$ and `convex_hull` returns the smallest interval containing $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cup \\boldsymbol{y}$."
msgstr "`intersection` 返回 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap \\boldsymbol{y}$，`convex_hull` 返回包含 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cup \\boldsymbol{y}$ 的最小区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:619
msgid "For non-empty operands both are computed by endpoint `max`/`min` ($[\\max(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\min(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$ and $[\\min(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\max(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$), exact apart from the final outward rounding to the larger precision. Disjoint intervals intersect to Empty, and an Empty operand makes the intersection Empty. When one operand of `convex_hull` is Empty, the result is the other operand passed through `with_precision`, so it can be one ulp wider per side than that operand (see the warning under [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision))."
msgstr "对于非空操作数，二者都通过端点的 `max`/`min` 计算（$[\\max(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\min(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$ 和 $[\\min(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\max(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$），除最后向外舍入到较大精度外都是精确的。不相交的区间求交得到 Empty，有 Empty 操作数时交集为 Empty。当 `convex_hull` 的一个操作数为 Empty 时，结果是另一个操作数经过 `with_precision` 的结果，因此每侧可能比该操作数宽一个 ulp（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision) 下的警告）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:629
msgid "`BallFloat::cancel_plus` and `BallFloat::cancel_minus`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::cancel_plus` 与 `BallFloat::cancel_minus`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:631
msgid "`cancel_minus(x, y)` is the IEEE 1788 cancellative subtraction: in exact arithmetic it returns the interval $\\boldsymbol{z}$ with $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = \\boldsymbol{x}$, which undoes a previous sum; `cancel_plus(x, y)` is `cancel_minus(x, -y)`."
msgstr "`cancel_minus(x, y)` 是 IEEE 1788 的消去减法：在精确算术下，它返回满足 $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = \\boldsymbol{x}$ 的区间 $\\boldsymbol{z}$，从而撤销先前的求和；`cancel_plus(x, y)` 即 `cancel_minus(x, -y)`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:641
msgid "For bounded operands `cancel_minus` is $[\\operatorname{RD}(\\underline{x} - \\underline{y}), \\operatorname{RU}(\\overline{x} - \\overline{y})]$. Indeed $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = [\\underline{y} + \\underline{z}, \\overline{y} + \\overline{z}]$, so $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = \\boldsymbol{x}$ forces $\\underline{z} = \\underline{x} - \\underline{y}$ and $\\overline{z} = \\overline{x} - \\overline{y}$, and this is an interval exactly when $w(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\ge w(\\boldsymbol{y})$. Because of the outward rounding, the computed $\\boldsymbol{z}$ satisfies $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} \\supseteq \\boldsymbol{x}$. When $w(\\boldsymbol{y}) > w(\\boldsymbol{x})$, when an operand is unbounded, or when only $\\boldsymbol{y}$ is empty, the result is Entire. Empty $\\boldsymbol{x}$ with bounded or empty $\\boldsymbol{y}$ gives Empty."
msgstr "对于有界操作数，`cancel_minus` 为 $[\\operatorname{RD}(\\underline{x} - \\underline{y}), \\operatorname{RU}(\\overline{x} - \\overline{y})]$。事实上 $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = [\\underline{y} + \\underline{z}, \\overline{y} + \\overline{z}]$，因此 $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} = \\boldsymbol{x}$ 迫使 $\\underline{z} = \\underline{x} - \\underline{y}$ 且 $\\overline{z} = \\overline{x} - \\overline{y}$，而它恰在 $w(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\ge w(\\boldsymbol{y})$ 时是一个区间。由于向外舍入，计算所得的 $\\boldsymbol{z}$ 满足 $\\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{z} \\supseteq \\boldsymbol{x}$。当 $w(\\boldsymbol{y}) > w(\\boldsymbol{x})$、有操作数无界或仅 $\\boldsymbol{y}$ 为空时，结果为 Entire。$\\boldsymbol{x}$ 为空且 $\\boldsymbol{y}$ 有界或为空时，结果为 Empty。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:668
msgid "Relations"
msgstr "关系"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:670
msgid "All relations are set relations of IEEE 1788; none of them is a total order. They never abort."
msgstr "所有关系都是 IEEE 1788 的集合关系；它们都不是全序。它们从不中止。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:675
msgid "`is_member` tests whether a point belongs to the interval."
msgstr "`is_member` 检测一个点是否属于该区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:681
msgid "It returns false for Empty and for a non-finite point (an unbounded interval contains all sufficiently large reals, but not $\\pm\\infty$ or NaN). The trait method `@lf_arith.Contains::contains` instead takes two intervals and tests inclusion; see [Enclosure relations](#arithmeticcontains-arithmeticoverlaps-arithmeticdefinitelylt-arithmeticdefinitelyle-arithmeticmaybeeq)."
msgstr "对 Empty 和非有限的点，它返回假（无界区间包含所有足够大的实数，但不包含 $\\pm\\infty$ 或 NaN）。trait 方法 `@lf_arith.Contains::contains` 则接受两个区间并检测包含关系；参见[包络关系](#arithmeticcontains-arithmeticoverlaps-arithmeticdefinitelylt-arithmeticdefinitelyle-arithmeticmaybeeq)。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:689
msgid "These test inclusion, inclusion in the interior, equality and disjointness of sets."
msgstr "这些函数检测集合的包含、内部包含、相等与不相交。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:699
msgid "`x.subset(y)` is $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq \\boldsymbol{y}$, that is $\\underline{y} \\le \\underline{x}$ and $\\overline{x} \\le \\overline{y}$. `x.interior(y)` is $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq \\operatorname{int} \\boldsymbol{y}$: each endpoint comparison is strict, except that two equal infinite endpoints count as interior (the interior of $[a, +\\infty)$ is $(a, +\\infty)$, so Entire is interior to itself). Empty is a subset of, interior to and disjoint from every interval. `equal` is the method of the `Eq` implementation, so `x == y` is `x.equal(y)`: the two intervals are the same set (two empty intervals are equal), whatever their precision tags and the representation of their endpoints (IEEE 1788-2015 12.3 and 12.12.9)."
msgstr "`x.subset(y)` 即 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq \\boldsymbol{y}$，也就是 $\\underline{y} \\le \\underline{x}$ 且 $\\overline{x} \\le \\overline{y}$。`x.interior(y)` 即 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\subseteq \\operatorname{int} \\boldsymbol{y}$：每个端点比较都是严格的，但两个相等的无穷端点视为位于内部（$[a, +\\infty)$ 的内部为 $(a, +\\infty)$，因此 Entire 在其自身内部）。Empty 是任何区间的子集、位于任何区间内部，并且与任何区间不相交。`equal` 是 `Eq` 实现的方法，所以 `x == y` 就是 `x.equal(y)`：两个区间是同一个集合（两个空区间相等），与它们的精度标记和端点的表示方式无关（IEEE 1788-2015 12.3 和 12.12.9）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:712
msgid "`identical` compares the datum, not only the set (12.3): the same set and the same precision tag."
msgstr "`identical` 比较的是数据本身，而不只是集合（12.3）：同一个集合且精度标记相同。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:719
msgid "The same interval at 24 and at 113 bits is `==` and not `identical`; use `identical` where the precision matters, for example to check that a result has the precision that was asked for. Two empty intervals are identical when their precisions are equal."
msgstr "24 位和 113 位下的同一个区间是 `==` 的，但不是 `identical` 的；当精度很重要时，例如要检查结果是否具有所要求的精度，请使用 `identical`。两个空区间在精度相等时是 identical 的。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:724
msgid "The same holds for any other part of the format of an interval that a later release adds (the optional exponent range of the 754-conforming types, issue 232): the format is not part of `==` or of `compare`; only `identical` may look at it."
msgstr "区间格式的其他任何部分，若以后的版本加入（754 兼容类型的可选指数范围，issue 232），同理：格式不属于 `==` 或 `compare`；只有 `identical` 可以查看它。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:730
msgid "These are the order relations of IEEE 1788."
msgstr "这些是 IEEE 1788 的序关系。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:739
msgid "For non-empty operands:"
msgstr "对于非空操作数："

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:741
msgid "Relation"
msgstr "关系"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:741
msgid "Set definition"
msgstr "集合定义"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:741
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:743
msgid "$\\forall\\xi\\,\\exists\\eta: \\xi \\le \\eta$ and $\\forall\\eta\\,\\exists\\xi: \\xi \\le \\eta$"
msgstr "$\\forall\\xi\\,\\exists\\eta: \\xi \\le \\eta$ 且 $\\forall\\eta\\,\\exists\\xi: \\xi \\le \\eta$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:743
msgid "$\\underline{x} \\le \\underline{y}$ and $\\overline{x} \\le \\overline{y}$"
msgstr "$\\underline{x} \\le \\underline{y}$ 且 $\\overline{x} \\le \\overline{y}$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:744
msgid "the same with $<$"
msgstr "同上，改用 $<$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:744
msgid "$\\underline{x} < \\underline{y}$ (or both $-\\infty$) and $\\overline{x} < \\overline{y}$ (or both $+\\infty$)"
msgstr "$\\underline{x} < \\underline{y}$（或二者均为 $-\\infty$）且 $\\overline{x} < \\overline{y}$（或二者均为 $+\\infty$）"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:748
msgid "With Empty: `less` and `strict_less` hold only when both are Empty; `precedes` and `strict_precedes` hold when either is Empty."
msgstr "涉及 Empty 时：`less` 和 `strict_less` 仅当两者均为 Empty 时成立；`precedes` 和 `strict_precedes` 在任一者为 Empty 时成立。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:753
msgid "`overlap` classifies the relative position of two intervals."
msgstr "`overlap` 对两个区间的相对位置进行分类。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:759
msgid "The result is one of the sixteen states of [`OverlapState`](#overlapstate); it is computed from the comparisons of the four endpoints, testing equal endpoints first, so a singleton that coincides with an endpoint of the other interval gives `Starts`, `Finishes`, `StartedBy` or `FinishedBy` rather than `Meets` or `MetBy`, as IEEE 1788 requires."
msgstr "结果是 [`OverlapState`](#overlapstate) 的十六种状态之一；它由四个端点之间的比较计算得出，并先检测相等的端点，因此与另一区间某个端点重合的单点集会按 IEEE 1788 的要求给出 `Starts`、`Finishes`、`StartedBy` 或 `FinishedBy`，而不是 `Meets` 或 `MetBy`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:781
#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:217
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:185
msgid "Arithmetic"
msgstr "算术"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:785
msgid "The four basic operations return the outward-rounded hull of $\\{\\xi \\circ \\eta : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}\\}$; they are also available as the operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`."
msgstr "四则基本运算返回 $\\{\\xi \\circ \\eta : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}\\}$ 向外舍入后的包；它们也可以通过运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 使用。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:796
msgid "The result precision is the larger operand precision; an Empty operand gives Empty. Endpoint formulas:"
msgstr "结果精度为操作数中较大的精度；有 Empty 操作数时结果为 Empty。端点公式如下："

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:807
msgid "with $0 \\cdot \\infty$ taken as 0 in $S$ (a zero endpoint times an unbounded side contributes 0). The sums and products are formed exactly and rounded once. For bounded operands the signs select the products that can be extremal: two when both operands have constant sign, four (the minimum of $\\underline{x}\\,\\overline{y}$ and $\\overline{x}\\,\\underline{y}$, the maximum of $\\underline{x}\\,\\underline{y}$ and $\\overline{x}\\,\\overline{y}$) when either operand has 0 in its interior. The design page proves the [sign-case table](../design/ball_float.md#endpoint-formulas)."
msgstr "其中在 $S$ 中将 $0 \\cdot \\infty$ 取为 0（零端点乘以无界的一侧贡献 0）。各和与积都精确构造，并只舍入一次。对于有界操作数，由符号选出可能取极值的乘积：两个操作数符号都不变时取两个，任一操作数在内部含 0 时取四个（$\\underline{x}\\,\\overline{y}$ 与 $\\overline{x}\\,\\underline{y}$ 的最小值，$\\underline{x}\\,\\underline{y}$ 与 $\\overline{x}\\,\\overline{y}$ 的最大值）。设计文档证明了[符号情形表](../design/ball_float.md#endpoint-formulas)。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:816
msgid ""
"Division follows IEEE 1788: $\\boldsymbol{x} / \\boldsymbol{y}$ is the hull of $\\{\\xi/\\eta : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}, \\eta \\n"
"e 0\\}$."
msgstr ""
"除法遵循 IEEE 1788：$\\boldsymbol{x} / \\boldsymbol{y}$ 是 $\\{\\xi/\\eta : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}, \\eta \\n"
"e 0\\}$ 的包。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:819
msgid "Divisor $\\boldsymbol{y}$"
msgstr "除数 $\\boldsymbol{y}$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:819
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:46
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:273
#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:107
#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:176
#: manual/performance_audit.md:122
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:821
msgid "$[\\operatorname{RD}\\min Q, \\operatorname{RU}\\max Q]$ over the endpoint quotients $Q$"
msgstr "$[\\operatorname{RD}\\min Q, \\operatorname{RU}\\max Q]$，其中 $Q$ 取遍端点之商"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:822
#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1887
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "Empty"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:823
msgid "Entire, unless $\\boldsymbol{x} = \\{0\\}$"
msgstr "Entire，除非 $\\boldsymbol{x} = \\{0\\}$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:824
msgid "$[0, \\overline{y}]$ or $[\\underline{y}, 0]$"
msgstr "$[0, \\overline{y}]$ 或 $[\\underline{y}, 0]$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:824
msgid "half-unbounded (see below), or Entire when $\\underline{x} < 0 < \\overline{x}$"
msgstr "半无界（见下文），当 $\\underline{x} < 0 < \\overline{x}$ 时为 Entire"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:826
msgid "When the divisor touches 0 at one end, the quotient is unbounded on one side: for example $[1, 2]/[0, 4] = [1/4, +\\infty)$ and $[-2, -1]/[0, 4] = (-\\infty, -1/4]$. A dividend equal to $\\{0\\}$ gives $\\{0\\}$ for any divisor other than $\\{0\\}$. Each selected quotient is computed by one directed division at the result precision."
msgstr "当除数在一端触及 0 时，商在一侧无界：例如 $[1, 2]/[0, 4] = [1/4, +\\infty)$，$[-2, -1]/[0, 4] = (-\\infty, -1/4]$。被除数等于 $\\{0\\}$ 时，对除 $\\{0\\}$ 以外的任何除数都得到 $\\{0\\}$。每个选出的商都在结果精度下通过一次定向除法计算。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:846
msgid "`BallFloat::neg` and `BallFloat::abs`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::neg` 与 `BallFloat::abs`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:848
msgid "`neg` returns $[-\\overline{x}, -\\underline{x}]$ and `abs` returns $\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$."
msgstr "`neg` 返回 $[-\\overline{x}, -\\underline{x}]$，`abs` 返回 $\\{|\\xi| : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:856
msgid "`abs` is $\\boldsymbol{x}$ when $\\underline{x} \\ge 0$, $-\\boldsymbol{x}$ when $\\overline{x} \\le 0$, and $[0, \\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{x}]$ otherwise. Both are exact. `neg` is also the unary operator `-`."
msgstr "当 $\\underline{x} \\ge 0$ 时 `abs` 为 $\\boldsymbol{x}$，当 $\\overline{x} \\le 0$ 时为 $-\\boldsymbol{x}$，否则为 $[0, \\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{x}]$。二者都是精确的。`neg` 也是一元运算符 `-`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:862
msgid "`recip` returns $1/\\boldsymbol{x}$ with the division rules above."
msgstr "`recip` 按上述除法规则返回 $1/\\boldsymbol{x}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:868
msgid "`BallFloat::sqr` and `BallFloat::pown`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::sqr` 与 `BallFloat::pown`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:870
msgid "`sqr` returns $\\{\\xi^2\\}$ and `pown` returns $\\{\\xi^n\\}$ for an integer exponent $n$."
msgstr "`sqr` 返回 $\\{\\xi^2\\}$，`pown` 对整数指数 $n$ 返回 $\\{\\xi^n\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:878
msgid "Unlike `x * x`, these use the same point twice, so `[-1, 2].sqr()` is $[0, 4]$ (while `x * x` is $[-2, 4]$): `sqr` is $[\\operatorname{mig}(\\boldsymbol{x})^2, \\operatorname{mag}(\\boldsymbol{x})^2]$. `pown` evaluates the monotone pieces of $\\xi^n$ at the endpoints with directed rounding: odd positive powers are increasing; even positive powers decrease then increase, with minimum 0 when $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x}$; negative powers have a pole at 0. `pown(x, 0)` is $\\{1\\}$ for every non-empty `x`; Empty stays Empty. `pown(x, n)` with $n < 0$ returns Empty for $\\boldsymbol{x} = \\{0\\}$, a half-unbounded interval when 0 is an endpoint, and for 0 in the interior Entire (odd $n$) or $[\\min(\\underline{x}^n, \\overline{x}^n), +\\infty)$ (even $n$). As a shortcut, $n < -4096$ with 0 in the interior returns Entire even for even $n$; this is a valid but not tight enclosure."
msgstr "与 `x * x` 不同，这些函数两次使用的是同一个点，因此 `[-1, 2].sqr()` 为 $[0, 4]$（而 `x * x` 为 $[-2, 4]$）：`sqr` 为 $[\\operatorname{mig}(\\boldsymbol{x})^2, \\operatorname{mag}(\\boldsymbol{x})^2]$。`pown` 以定向舍入在端点处计算 $\\xi^n$ 的各单调分段：奇数正次幂递增；偶数正次幂先减后增，当 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x}$ 时最小值为 0；负次幂在 0 处有极点。对每个非空的 `x`，`pown(x, 0)` 为 $\\{1\\}$；Empty 仍为 Empty。当 $n < 0$ 时，`pown(x, n)` 对 $\\boldsymbol{x} = \\{0\\}$ 返回 Empty，当 0 为端点时返回半无界区间，当 0 位于内部时返回 Entire（$n$ 为奇数）或 $[\\min(\\underline{x}^n, \\overline{x}^n), +\\infty)$（$n$ 为偶数）。作为捷径，当 $n < -4096$ 且 0 位于内部时，即使 $n$ 为偶数也返回 Entire；这是一个有效但不紧的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:905
msgid "`fma(x, y, z)` returns an enclosure of $\\{\\xi\\eta + \\zeta\\}$ with a single outward rounding."
msgstr "`fma(x, y, z)` 以单次向外舍入返回 $\\{\\xi\\eta + \\zeta\\}$ 的一个包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:912
msgid "The exact product bounds are computed as for `mul` and added to the endpoints of $\\boldsymbol{z}$ before the final rounding, so the result is never wider than `x * y + z`."
msgstr "精确的乘积界按 `mul` 的方式计算，并在最终舍入之前加到 $\\boldsymbol{z}$ 的端点上，因此结果绝不会比 `x * y + z` 更宽。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:916
msgid "`BallFloat::min` and `BallFloat::max`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::min` 和 `BallFloat::max`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:918
msgid "`min` and `max` return $\\{\\min(\\xi, \\eta)\\}$ and $\\{\\max(\\xi, \\eta)\\}$."
msgstr "`min` 和 `max` 分别返回 $\\{\\min(\\xi, \\eta)\\}$ 和 $\\{\\max(\\xi, \\eta)\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:926
msgid "`min` is $[\\min(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\min(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$ and `max` is the analogue with `max`: $\\min$ is increasing in each argument. An Empty operand gives Empty."
msgstr "`min` 为 $[\\min(\\underline{x}, \\underline{y}), \\min(\\overline{x}, \\overline{y})]$，`max` 则是将其中的 min 换成 `max` 的类似形式：$\\min$ 关于每个参数都是递增的。有 Empty 操作数时结果为 Empty。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:932
msgid "The integer functions of IEEE 1788-2015 Table 9.1. `sign` is $-1$, $0$ or $1$ by the sign of the point; `ceil` and `floor` give the smallest integer not less and the largest integer not greater than the point; `trunc` the nearest integer toward zero; `round_ties_to_even` and `round_ties_to_away` the nearest integer, a tie going to the even integer or away from zero (the names are the 754 `roundTiesToEven` and `roundTiesToAway`)."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 表 9.1 的整数函数。`sign` 按点的符号取 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$；`ceil` 与 `floor` 分别给出不小于和不大于该点的最小、最大整数；`trunc` 给出朝零方向最近的整数；`round_ties_to_even` 与 `round_ties_to_away` 给出最近的整数，平局时分别取偶数或远离零的整数（这两个名称对应 754 的 `roundTiesToEven` 与 `roundTiesToAway`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:948
msgid "Each function $f$ is nondecreasing, so the result is $[f(\\underline{x}), f(\\overline{x})]$. The values are integers (or $-1$, $0$, $1$), so the result is exact: nothing is rounded, the precision tag is kept, and a zero bound is stored as $+0$. The function of $\\pm\\infty$ is $\\pm\\infty$ (for `sign`, $\\pm 1$). An Empty operand gives Empty. There is no `try_` form: no input fails."
msgstr "每个函数 $f$ 都是非递减的，因此结果为 $[f(\\underline{x}), f(\\overline{x})]$。取值是整数（或 $-1$、$0$、$1$），所以结果是精确的：不做任何舍入，精度标记保持不变，零端点存为 $+0$。$\\pm\\infty$ 的函数值为 $\\pm\\infty$（`sign` 为 $\\pm 1$）。空操作数给出空集。没有 `try_` 形式：任何输入都不会失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:970
msgid "`BallFloat::sqr_rev`, `BallFloat::abs_rev`, `BallFloat::pown_rev` and `BallFloat::cosh_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::sqr_rev`、`BallFloat::abs_rev`、`BallFloat::pown_rev` 与 `BallFloat::cosh_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:972
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4 and Table 10.1. Each is the natural reverse extension: the hull of $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\varphi(x) \\in \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$, where $\\boldsymbol{c}$ is the receiver and the prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ is the optional last argument (default Entire). The hull is taken after meeting the preimage with $\\boldsymbol{x}$, not before: for $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 4]$, `sqr_rev` is $[-2, 2]$ and with the prior $[0, 1.2]$ it is $[1, 1.2]$, while $[-2, 2] \\cap [0, 1.2] = [0, 1.2]$."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4 与表 10.1。每个函数都是自然反向扩展：即 $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\varphi(x) \\in \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包，其中 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 是接收者，先验 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 是可选的最后一个参数（默认 Entire）。区间包是在原像与 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 相交之后取的，而不是之前：对 $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 4]$，`sqr_rev` 为 $[-2, 2]$，给定先验 $[0, 1.2]$ 时为 $[1, 1.2]$，而 $[-2, 2] \\cap [0, 1.2] = [0, 1.2]$。"

