#: manual/api/ball_float.md:999
msgid "`pown_rev`, $p$ odd and negative"
msgstr "`pown_rev`，$p$ 为负奇数"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:999
msgid "the positive part of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ gives positive $x$ and the negative part gives negative $x$, each by $\\sqrt[p]{\\cdot}$ with the pole 0 excluded"
msgstr "$\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的正部分给出正的 $x$，负部分给出负的 $x$，各自通过 $\\sqrt[p]{\\cdot}$ 计算，并排除极点 0"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1001
msgid "An Empty $\\boldsymbol{c}$, or a $\\boldsymbol{c}$ outside the range of the function (negative for `sqr_rev`, below 1 for `cosh_rev`), gives Empty. The root endpoints are directed roundings of exact points, so the results are the tightest in the type. For a negative power the value $x = 0$ is not in the domain, so the component that ends at 0 (when $\\boldsymbol{c}$ is unbounded above for an even $p$, or reaches the pole) is open there: with $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, +\\infty)$ and $p = -2$ the set is $[-1, 0) \\cup (0, 1]$ and the prior $[0, 0]$ gives Empty. The result precision is the largest of the operands'."
msgstr "空的 $\\boldsymbol{c}$，或位于函数值域之外的 $\\boldsymbol{c}$（`sqr_rev` 为负，`cosh_rev` 小于 1），给出 Empty。根的端点是对精确点的定向舍入，所以结果在该类型中是最紧的。对于负幂，值 $x = 0$ 不在定义域内，因此止于 0 的分量（偶数 $p$ 且 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 上方无界，或到达极点时）在该处为开：当 $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, +\\infty)$、$p = -2$ 时集合为 $[-1, 0) \\cup (0, 1]$，先验 $[0, 0]$ 给出 Empty。结果精度取各操作数精度中的最大值。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1021
msgid "`BallFloat::sin_rev`, `BallFloat::cos_rev` and `BallFloat::tan_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::sin_rev`、`BallFloat::cos_rev` 与 `BallFloat::tan_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1023
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4 and Table 10.1. Each is the hull of $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\varphi(x) \\in \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ for the receiver $\\boldsymbol{c}$ and the optional prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ (default Entire)."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4 与表 10.1。每个函数都是 $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\varphi(x) \\in \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包，其中 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 是接收者，先验 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 可省略（默认 Entire）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1033
msgid "The preimage is a periodic union of intervals. With $\\boldsymbol{c}' = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap [-1, 1]$, $A = \\arcsin \\underline{c'}$ and $B = \\arcsin \\overline{c'}$, the preimage of `sin_rev` is $\\bigcup_k [A + 2\\pi k, B + 2\\pi k] \\cup [\\pi - B + 2\\pi k, \\pi - A + 2\\pi k]$; `cos_rev` and `tan_rev` are analogous (`tan_rev`: $\\bigcup_k (\\arctan \\underline{c} + \\pi k, \\arctan \\overline{c} + \\pi k)$, a bound at $\\pm\\infty$ giving the pole $\\pm\\pi/2 + \\pi k$, which is not in the domain). With the default prior the result is Entire for every $\\boldsymbol{c}$ that meets the range of the function; $\\boldsymbol{c}$ outside $[-1, 1]$ gives Empty for `sin_rev` and `cos_rev`, and $\\boldsymbol{c} \\supseteq [-1, 1]$ (`tan_rev`: $\\boldsymbol{c} = $ Entire) returns the prior itself. With a bounded prior only the first and the last piece that meet it matter, so the cost does not depend on how many periods the prior spans."
msgstr "原像是区间的周期性并集。令 $\\boldsymbol{c}' = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap [-1, 1]$、$A = \\arcsin \\underline{c'}$、$B = \\arcsin \\overline{c'}$，则 `sin_rev` 的原像为 $\\bigcup_k [A + 2\\pi k, B + 2\\pi k] \\cup [\\pi - B + 2\\pi k, \\pi - A + 2\\pi k]$；`cos_rev` 与 `tan_rev` 类似（`tan_rev`：$\\bigcup_k (\\arctan \\underline{c} + \\pi k, \\arctan \\overline{c} + \\pi k)$，位于 $\\pm\\infty$ 的端点给出极点 $\\pm\\pi/2 + \\pi k$，它不在定义域内）。使用默认先验时，只要 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 与函数的值域相交，结果就是 Entire；对 `sin_rev` 与 `cos_rev`，$\\boldsymbol{c}$ 在 $[-1, 1]$ 之外给出 Empty，而 $\\boldsymbol{c} \\supseteq [-1, 1]$（`tan_rev`：$\\boldsymbol{c} = $ Entire）直接返回先验本身。对有界先验，只有与之相交的第一个和最后一个片段起作用，因此开销与先验跨越多少个周期无关。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1045
msgid "The result is the hull of the true set in the type: every comparison of a prior end with a piece end is decided exactly, and an end of the result that comes from a piece is the exact directed rounding of that end (`RD` for a lower end, `RU` for an upper end). This is the tightest result, and it can be narrower than a reference value that leaves an ulp of slack. For example `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 7])` is $[RD(2\\pi), RU(2\\pi)]$ and `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 6])` is Empty. How the ends are decided is on the [design page](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-sine-cosine-and-tangent). The one limit is the forward trigonometric one: an end of the prior at or beyond $2^{\\max(65536, 4p) + 1}$ in magnitude is kept as it is (valid, not tight), decided before any work is done, and a prior whose finite ends are all beyond it is returned at once. For a prior end of magnitude $2^e$ inside the limit the cost grows with $e$ like the cost of the forward functions of the [trigonometric functions section](#ballfloatsin-ballfloatcos-ballfloattan-ballfloattry_sin-ballfloattry_cos-ballfloattry_tan), the working precision following $e$."
msgstr "结果是该类型中真实集合的区间包：每次先验端点与片段端点的比较都被精确判定，来自片段的结果端点是该片段端点的精确定向舍入（下端取 `RD`，上端取 `RU`）。这是最紧的结果，可以比留有一个 ulp 余量的参考值更窄。例如 `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 7])` 是 $[RD(2\\pi), RU(2\\pi)]$，而 `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 6])` 为 Empty。各端点如何判定见[设计页面](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-sine-cosine-and-tangent)。唯一的限制与前向三角函数相同：先验的端点若其量级不小于 $2^{\\max(65536, 4p) + 1}$，则原样保留（有效，但不紧），该判定在做任何工作之前完成，所有有限端点都在限制之外的先验直接原样返回。对限制之内量级为 $2^e$ 的先验端点，开销随 $e$ 增长，与[trigonometric functions section](#ballfloatsin-ballfloatcos-ballfloattan-ballfloattry_sin-ballfloattry_cos-ballfloattry_tan)中前向函数的开销相同，工作精度随 $e$ 增加。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1081
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 Table 10.1. `b.pow_rev1(c, x?)` is the hull of $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, \\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : x^\\beta \\text{ is defined and in } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ for the optional prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ (default Entire); the receiver is the exponent interval $\\boldsymbol{b}$. $x^\\beta$ is defined for $x > 0$ and for $x = 0$ with $\\beta > 0$ (value 0)."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 表 10.1。`b.pow_rev1(c, x?)` 是 $\\{\\, x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, \\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : x^\\beta \\text{ 有定义且属于 } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包，其中先验 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 可省略（默认 Entire）；接收者是指数区间 $\\boldsymbol{b}$。$x^\\beta$ 对 $x > 0$ 有定义，对 $x = 0$ 且 $\\beta > 0$ 时也有定义（值为 0）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1090
msgid "For $x > 0$, $x^\\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ means $\\beta \\ln x \\in \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$, so the set is $\\exp(L /_{\\text{set}} \\boldsymbol{b})$ with $L = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$, the set division of [`mul_rev`](#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev) in logarithm coordinates, plus the point 0 when $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ and $\\boldsymbol{b}$ has a positive point. Every end of a piece is $c_\\text{end}^{1/\\beta_\\text{end}}$, 0, 1 or infinite. The ends that are not attained are open: 0 (from $\\ln x \\to -\\infty$, unless the zero part closes it) and 1 (the limit of a quotient by an unbounded $\\boldsymbol{b}$); a prior that only touches such an end does not meet the set. For example `pow_rev1([1, +inf), [2, +inf))` is $(1, +\\infty)$, so with the prior $[0, 1]$ the result is Empty, and `pow_rev1([-1, 1], [0.5, 2])` is $(0, +\\infty)$, so with the prior $[0, 0]$ it is Empty."
msgstr "对 $x > 0$，$x^\\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ 意味着 $\\beta \\ln x \\in \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$，因此该集合是 $\\exp(L /_{\\text{set}} \\boldsymbol{b})$，其中 $L = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$，即 [`mul_rev`](#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev) 的集合除法在对数坐标下的形式；当 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ 且 $\\boldsymbol{b}$ 含有正点时，再加上点 0。每个片段的端点是 $c_\\text{end}^{1/\\beta_\\text{end}}$、0、1 或无穷。未达到的端点为开：0（来自 $\\ln x \\to -\\infty$，除非零部分使其闭合）与 1（被无界 $\\boldsymbol{b}$ 除所得商的极限）；只触及这样端点的先验不与该集合相交。例如 `pow_rev1([1, +inf), [2, +inf))` 是 $(1, +\\infty)$，所以给定先验 $[0, 1]$ 时结果为 Empty，而 `pow_rev1([-1, 1], [0.5, 2])` 是 $(0, +\\infty)$，所以给定先验 $[0, 0]$ 时结果为 Empty。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1101
msgid "The result is the hull in the type: every comparison of a prior end with a piece end is exact and an end written to the result is the exact directed rounding of the piece end. The exact value of $c^{1/\\beta}$ is classified from the structure of $c$ and $\\beta$ (no squaring): it is a float candidate (dyadic), a rational that is not a float (for example $9^{1/(-2)} = 1/3$), or irrational, and the last is decided by a loop that raises the working precision as `sin_rev` does. The [design page](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-power-with-an-interval-exponent) has the classes, the budgets and their cost. An end of the set above the largest finite float is written as $+\\infty$ when it is an upper end and as the largest finite float of the result precision when it is a lower end; an end below the smallest positive stored value is written as 0 when it is a lower end and as the smallest positive stored value when it is an upper end; in between, including the subnormal range, the end is the usual directed rounding. An exponent of magnitude $2^{10^9}$ is decided at once because the sign of $\\ln(c)/\\beta$ is exact."
msgstr "结果是该类型中的区间包：先验端点与片段端点的每次比较都是精确的，写入结果的端点是 $c^{1/\\beta}$ 的精确定向舍入。$c^{1/\\beta}$ 的精确值依据 $c$ 与 $\\beta$ 的结构分类（不做乘方）：可能是浮点数的（二进制有限小数）、非浮点数的有理数（例如 $9^{1/(-2)} = 1/3$）、或无理数，最后一类由像 `sin_rev` 那样提高工作精度的循环判定。分类、预算及其开销见[设计页面](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-power-with-an-interval-exponent)。该集合在最大有限浮点数之上的端点，若是上端点则写成 $+\\infty$，若是下端点则写成结果精度下的最大有限浮点数；在最小正存储值之下的端点，若是下端点则写成 0，若是上端点则写成最小正存储值；两者之间（包括非正规数范围）的端点是通常的定向舍入。量级为 $2^{10^9}$ 的指数可立即判定，因为 $\\ln(c)/\\beta$ 的符号是精确的。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1128
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 Table 10.1. `a.pow_rev2(c, x?)` is the hull of $\\{\\, \\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, a_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a} : a_0^\\beta \\text{ is defined and in } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ for the optional prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ (default Entire); the receiver is the base interval $\\boldsymbol{a}$ and the unknown is the exponent. $a_0^\\beta$ is defined for $a_0 > 0$ and for $a_0 = 0$ with $\\beta > 0$ (value 0)."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 表 10.1。`a.pow_rev2(c, x?)` 是 $\\{\\, \\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, a_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a} : a_0^\\beta \\text{ 有定义且属于 } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包，其中 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 为可选先验区间（默认 Entire）；接收者是底数区间 $\\boldsymbol{a}$，未知量是指数。$a_0^\\beta$ 在 $a_0 > 0$ 时有定义，在 $a_0 = 0$ 且 $\\beta > 0$ 时也有定义（值为 0）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1138
msgid ""
"For $a_0 > 0$, $a_0^\\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ means $\\beta \\ln a_0 \\in \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$, so the set is $L /_{\\text{set}} M$ with $L = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$ and $M = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{a} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$, the set division of [`mul_rev`](#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev) in logarithm coordinates, plus $(0, +\\infty)$ when $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a}$ and $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ (the base 0). The base 1 is the branch \"$0$ in the divisor\": if $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{a}$ and $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ every exponent qualifies, and if $\\boldsymbol{a} = [1, 1]$ and $1 \\n"
"otin \\boldsymbol{c}$ there is none. Every end of a piece is $\\ln(c_\\text{end}) / \\ln(a_\\text{end})$, 0 or infinite. The ends that are not attained are open: the infinities, and 0 when it is the limit of a quotient by an unbounded $M$ (and $0 \\n"
"otin L$); a prior that only touches such an end does not meet the set. For example `pow_rev2([2, +inf), [2, 4])` is $(0, 2]$, so with the prior $[-3, 0]$ the result is Empty, while with $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 4]$ the end 0 is attained and the result is $[0, 0]$."
msgstr ""
"对 $a_0 > 0$，$a_0^\\beta \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ 意味着 $\\beta \\ln a_0 \\in \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$，因此该集合是 $L /_{\\text{set}} M$，其中 $L = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$，$M = \\ln(\\boldsymbol{a} \\cap (0, +\\infty))$，即 [`mul_rev`](#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev) 的集合除法在对数坐标下的形式，再加上当 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a}$ 且 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$ 时的 $(0, +\\infty)$（底数 0）。底数 1 是“除数含 $0$”的分支：若 $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{a}$ 且 $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$，则每个指数都满足；若 $\\boldsymbol{a} = [1, 1]$ 且 $1 \\n"
"otin \\boldsymbol{c}$，则没有解。每个片段的端点是 $\\ln(c_\\text{end}) / \\ln(a_\\text{end})$、0 或无穷。取不到的端点是开的：无穷，以及当 0 是被无界的 $M$ 除所得商的极限（且 $0 \\n"
"otin L$）时的 0；只碰到这样一个端点的先验区间不与该集合相交。例如 `pow_rev2([2, +inf), [2, 4])` 是 $(0, 2]$，所以先验区间取 $[-3, 0]$ 时结果为 Empty，而 $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 4]$ 时端点 0 可取到，结果为 $[0, 0]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1151
msgid "The result is the hull in the type: every comparison of a prior end with a piece end is exact and an end written to the result is the exact directed rounding of the piece end. The value $r = \\ln(C)/\\ln(A)$ of an end is classified from the structure of $A$ and $C$: it is rational iff $A$ and $C$ are multiplicatively dependent, decided by the multiplicative Euclidean algorithm on the odd parts (an inexact division proves independence). A rational is a float iff its reduced denominator is a power of two, and otherwise it is a rational that is not a float (for example $\\ln 3 / \\ln 27 = 1/3$); every other end is irrational and is decided by a loop that raises the working precision as `sin_rev` does. The [design page](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-power-with-an-interval-base) has the classes, the budgets and their cost. A base one unit from 1 gives a huge quotient, and the first working precision follows its magnitude."
msgstr "结果是该类型中的区间包：先验端点与片段端点的每次比较都是精确的，写入结果的端点是片段端点的精确定向舍入。端点的值 $r = \\ln(C)/\\ln(A)$ 按 $A$ 和 $C$ 的结构分类：当且仅当 $A$ 与 $C$ 在乘法意义下相关时它是有理数，这由对奇部的乘法欧几里得算法判定（除法不整除就证明无关）。有理数当且仅当其约分后的分母是 2 的幂时是浮点数，否则是不为浮点数的有理数（例如 $\\ln 3 / \\ln 27 = 1/3$）；其余端点是无理数，由一个像 `sin_rev` 那样提高工作精度的循环判定。[设计页面](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-power-with-an-interval-base)给出了各类别、预算及其代价。离 1 只差一个单位的底数会给出很大的商，首个工作精度随其量级而定。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1175
msgid "`BallFloat::atan2_rev1` and `BallFloat::atan2_rev2`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::atan2_rev1` 与 `BallFloat::atan2_rev2`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1177
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 Table 10.1, equations (6) and (7) of 10.5.4. `b.atan2_rev1(c, x?)` is the hull of $\\{\\, y \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, b_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : \\operatorname{atan2}(y, b_0) \\text{ is defined and in } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$: the receiver is the abscissa interval $\\boldsymbol{b}$ and the unknown is the ordinate $y$. `a.atan2_rev2(c, x?)` is the hull of $\\{\\, x_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, a_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a} : \\operatorname{atan2}(a_0, x_0) \\text{ is defined and in } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$: the receiver is the ordinate interval $\\boldsymbol{a}$ and the unknown is the abscissa $x_0$. The optional prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ defaults to Entire."
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 表 10.1，10.5.4 的式 (6) 与 (7)。`b.atan2_rev1(c, x?)` 是 $\\{\\, y \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, b_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : \\operatorname{atan2}(y, b_0) \\text{ 有定义且属于 } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包：接收者是横坐标区间 $\\boldsymbol{b}$，未知量是纵坐标 $y$。`a.atan2_rev2(c, x?)` 是 $\\{\\, x_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists\\, a_0 \\in \\boldsymbol{a} : \\operatorname{atan2}(a_0, x_0) \\text{ 有定义且属于 } \\boldsymbol{c} \\,\\}$ 的区间包：接收者是纵坐标区间 $\\boldsymbol{a}$，未知量是横坐标 $x_0$。可选的先验区间 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 默认为 Entire。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1190
msgid "$\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)$ is defined on the plane minus the origin, with the range $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ (Table 9.1, footnote f): the angle $\\pi$ is attained on the half-line $y = 0$, $x < 0$, and $-\\pi$ is never attained. With $\\Theta = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (-\\pi, \\pi]$ the set is the projection of the sector $\\{\\, r(\\cos t, \\sin t) : r > 0,\\ t \\in \\Theta \\,\\}$ on the axis of the unknown, cut by the strip of the given operand. The [design page](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-arctangent-of-two-arguments) has the case table by angle region and by the sign of the operand, the open ends, the branch cut and the origin. The set is empty when $\\boldsymbol{c}$ has no point in $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ (for example $[4, 5]$), when an operand or the prior is Empty, and for the abscissa $\\{0\\}$ (Rev1) or the ordinate $\\{0\\}$ (Rev2) when $\\boldsymbol{c}$ misses the angles $\\pm\\pi/2$ (Rev1) or $0$ and $\\pi$ (Rev2); the origin is never part of the set."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)$ 在去掉原点的平面上有定义，值域为 $(-\\pi, \\pi]$（表 9.1 脚注 f）：角度 $\\pi$ 在半直线 $y = 0$、$x < 0$ 上取到，$-\\pi$ 永远取不到。记 $\\Theta = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap (-\\pi, \\pi]$，该集合是扇形 $\\{\\, r(\\cos t, \\sin t) : r > 0,\\ t \\in \\Theta \\,\\}$ 在未知量坐标轴上的投影，并受给定操作数所在带形的限制。[设计页面](../design/ball_float.md#reverse-arctangent-of-two-arguments)给出了按角度区域与操作数符号划分的情形表、开端点、分支切割和原点。当 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 在 $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ 中没有点（例如 $[4, 5]$）、某个操作数或先验区间为 Empty 时，集合为空；当横坐标 $\\{0\\}$（Rev1）或纵坐标 $\\{0\\}$（Rev2）且 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 错过角度 $\\pm\\pi/2$（Rev1）或 $0$ 与 $\\pi$（Rev2）时也为空；原点从不属于该集合。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1200
msgid "The result is the hull in the type: every comparison of a prior end with a piece end is exact, and an end written to the result is the exact directed rounding of the piece end. The exact ends are 0 and the infinities; every other end is $b_\\text{end} \\tan(c_\\text{end})$ (Rev1) or $a_\\text{end} / \\tan(c_\\text{end})$ (Rev2) of nonzero floats, which is irrational (the tangent of a nonzero algebraic number is transcendental), so it differs from every float and a loop that raises the working precision decides it, as in `sin_rev`. Whether an end of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ is below or above a multiple of $\\pi/2$ is decided exactly ($\\pi$ is irrational, so a float is never equal to such a multiple)."
msgstr "结果是该类型中的区间包：先验端点与片段端点的每次比较都是精确的，写入结果的端点是片段端点的精确定向舍入。精确的端点是 0 和无穷；其余端点是非零浮点数的 $b_\\text{end} \\tan(c_\\text{end})$（Rev1）或 $a_\\text{end} / \\tan(c_\\text{end})$（Rev2），它们是无理数（非零代数数的正切是超越数），所以与每个浮点数都不同，由一个像 `sin_rev` 那样提高工作精度的循环判定。$\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的端点位于 $\\pi/2$ 的某个倍数之下还是之上是精确判定的（$\\pi$ 是无理数，所以浮点数永远不等于这样的倍数）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1221
msgid "`BallFloat::mul_rev_to_pair` and `BallFloat::mul_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::mul_rev_to_pair` 与 `BallFloat::mul_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1223
msgid "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.5 and Table 10.1. For intervals $\\boldsymbol{b}$ and $\\boldsymbol{c}$ the set"
msgstr "IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.5 与表 10.1。对区间 $\\boldsymbol{b}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{c}$，集合"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1230
msgid "has zero, one or two connected components, and is not always closed ($[1, 1] /_{\\text{set}} [1, +\\infty) = (0, 1]$). `mul_rev_to_pair` returns the closures of the components, ordered, as a pair; `mul_rev` returns the hull of the part of the set that lies in the prior interval `x`."
msgstr "有零个、一个或两个连通分量，且并不总是闭集（$[1, 1] /_{\\text{set}} [1, +\\infty) = (0, 1]$）。`mul_rev_to_pair` 以有序二元组返回各分量的闭包；`mul_rev` 返回该集合落在先验区间 `x` 内的部分的区间包。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1240
msgid "`mul_rev_to_pair(b, c)` is `(Empty, Empty)` when there is no component, `(u, Empty)` for one, and `(u, v)` with $u < v$ for two. The two closures can share an endpoint: $[1, 1] /_{\\text{set}} \\text{Entire} = (-\\infty, 0) \\cup (0, +\\infty)$ gives `([-inf, 0], [0, +inf])`. An Empty operand gives `(Empty, Empty)`. The receiver is $\\boldsymbol{b}$ and the argument is $\\boldsymbol{c}$, as in the standard's `mulRevToPair(b, c)`."
msgstr "没有分量时 `mul_rev_to_pair(b, c)` 为 `(Empty, Empty)`，一个分量时为 `(u, Empty)`，两个分量时为 `(u, v)` 且 $u < v$。两个闭包可以共享一个端点：$[1, 1] /_{\\text{set}} \\text{Entire} = (-\\infty, 0) \\cup (0, +\\infty)$ 给出 `([-inf, 0], [0, +inf])`。空操作数给出 `(Empty, Empty)`。接收者是 $\\boldsymbol{b}$，参数是 $\\boldsymbol{c}$，与标准的 `mulRevToPair(b, c)` 一致。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1247
msgid "`mul_rev(b, c, x?)` is $\\operatorname{hull}\\{x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists y \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : x y \\in \\boldsymbol{c}\\}$ with the default $\\boldsymbol{x} = $ Entire. The hull is of the set and not of its closure, and not the intersection of `x` with the hull of the set: with $\\boldsymbol{b} = [-1, 1]$, $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 1]$ and $\\boldsymbol{x} = [0, 0.5]$ the result is Empty, whereas the hull of the set is Entire. An endpoint 0 that is the unattained limit of a quotient by an unbounded $\\boldsymbol{b}$ counts as open, so `mul_rev([1, +inf), [1, 1], x=[-1, 0])` is Empty (the set is $(0, 1]$) and with $\\boldsymbol{x} = [0, 0.5]$ it is $[0, 0.5]$. The endpoints of the components are quotients rounded outward, so the results are the tightest in the type. The result precision is the largest of the operands'."
msgstr "`mul_rev(b, c, x?)` 是 $\\operatorname{hull}\\{x \\in \\boldsymbol{x} \\mid \\exists y \\in \\boldsymbol{b} : x y \\in \\boldsymbol{c}\\}$，默认 $\\boldsymbol{x} = $ Entire。区间包取自该集合本身，而不是它的闭包，也不是 `x` 与该集合区间包的交：当 $\\boldsymbol{b} = [-1, 1]$、$\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 1]$、$\\boldsymbol{x} = [0, 0.5]$ 时结果为 Empty，而该集合的区间包是 Entire。作为被无界 $\\boldsymbol{b}$ 除所得商的未达到的极限的端点 0 视为开端点，因此 `mul_rev([1, +inf), [1, 1], x=[-1, 0])` 为 Empty（该集合是 $(0, 1]$），而 $\\boldsymbol{x} = [0, 0.5]$ 时结果为 $[0, 0.5]$。各分量的端点是向外舍入的商，所以结果在该类型中是最紧的。结果精度取各操作数精度中的最大值。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1274
#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:428
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1615
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:489
#: manual/api/decimal.md:1427
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:156
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:451
msgid "Elementary functions"
msgstr "初等函数"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1276
msgid "Each function $f$ returns an interval containing $f(\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap D_f)$, where $D_f$ is the domain of $f$; points of $\\boldsymbol{x}$ outside $D_f$ are ignored and the result is Empty when $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap D_f$ is empty. The result precision is the argument's precision."
msgstr "每个函数 $f$ 返回一个包含 $f(\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap D_f)$ 的区间，其中 $D_f$ 是 $f$ 的定义域；$\\boldsymbol{x}$ 中位于 $D_f$ 之外的点被忽略，当 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap D_f$ 为空时结果为 Empty。结果精度为参数的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1282
msgid "Functions come in two forms, and there is one kernel. The `try_` form (`try_exp`, …) evaluates each endpoint with the corresponding `bin_float` `try_*_ctx` function rounded toward $-\\infty$ or $+\\infty$, and returns `Err(ArithmeticError)` with a certification-failure detail naming the operation, stage and reason when that evaluation runs out of its work budget. The total form (`exp`, `sin`, …) is the `try_` form with a fallback: it returns the same interval whenever the `try_` form succeeds, and otherwise the range of the function over its domain (the fallbacks are listed below), which is a valid but wide enclosure. A total form never aborts, at any precision the type accepts; a domain error is not a failure (the result is Empty), so an argument outside the domain and a certification failure give different results. Nothing is computed twice: the total form calls the `try_` form once."
msgstr "函数有两种形式，且只有一个内核。`try_` 形式（`try_exp` 等）用 `bin_float` 中对应的 `try_*_ctx` 函数分别对每个端点求值，下端点向 $-\\infty$ 舍入，上端点向 $+\\infty$ 舍入；当该求值耗尽其工作预算时，返回带认证失败详情（说明运算、阶段和原因）的 `Err(ArithmeticError)`。全函数形式（`exp`、`sin` 等）就是带回退的 `try_` 形式：只要 `try_` 形式成功，它就返回相同的区间，否则返回该函数在其定义域上的值域（回退见下文），这是有效但较宽的包络。全函数形式在类型接受的任何精度下都不会中止；定义域错误不是失败（结果为 Empty），因此定义域之外的参数与认证失败给出不同的结果。没有任何东西被计算两次：全函数形式只调用一次 `try_` 形式。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1298
msgid "`sqrt` returns $\\sqrt{\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap [0, +\\infty)}$."
msgstr "`sqrt` 返回 $\\sqrt{\\boldsymbol{x} \\cap [0, +\\infty)}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1304
msgid "The endpoints are the downward and upward square roots at the interval's precision. Empty when $\\overline{x} < 0$. There is no `try_` form: square root never fails."
msgstr "端点是区间精度下向下和向上舍入的平方根。当 $\\overline{x} < 0$ 时为 Empty。没有 `try_` 形式：平方根从不失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1310
msgid "These return enclosures of $e^{\\xi}$, $2^{\\xi}$, $10^{\\xi}$ and $e^{\\xi} - 1$."
msgstr "这些函数分别返回 $e^{\\xi}$、$2^{\\xi}$、$10^{\\xi}$ 和 $e^{\\xi} - 1$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1324
msgid "All four are increasing, so the result is $[\\operatorname{RD} f(\\underline{x}), \\operatorname{RU} f(\\overline{x})]$. For $|\\xi| \\ge 2^{30}$ the enclosure is $[\\text{largest finite}, +\\infty)$ or $[0, \\text{smallest positive}]$, which is valid because $e^{2^{30}}$ exceeds $2^{e_{\\max}+1}$ and $e^{-2^{30}}$ is below the smallest positive `BinFloat` at every precision. `exp2` and `exp10` return exact powers for integer endpoints whose power is representable at the interval's precision (`exp2` of $\\{10\\}$ is $\\{1024\\}$, `exp10` of $\\{3\\}$ is $\\{1000\\}$); an integer endpoint outside the exponent range keeps the outward-rounded enclosure, so `exp2` of $\\{-1073742000\\}$ is $[0, \\text{smallest positive}]$ and of $\\{2^{30}\\}$ is $[\\text{largest finite}, +\\infty)$. The fallback of the total forms is $[0, +\\infty)$ for `exp`, `exp2` and `exp10` and $[-1, +\\infty)$ for `expm1`."
msgstr "四者都是递增的，因此结果为 $[\\operatorname{RD} f(\\underline{x}), \\operatorname{RU} f(\\overline{x})]$。当 $|\\xi| \\ge 2^{30}$ 时，包络为 $[\\text{largest finite}, +\\infty)$ 或 $[0, \\text{smallest positive}]$，这是有效的，因为在任何精度下 $e^{2^{30}}$ 都超过 $2^{e_{\\max}+1}$，而 $e^{-2^{30}}$ 都低于最小的正 `BinFloat`。对于幂在区间精度下可表示的整数端点，`exp2` 和 `exp10` 返回精确的幂（$\\{10\\}$ 的 `exp2` 为 $\\{1024\\}$，$\\{3\\}$ 的 `exp10` 为 $\\{1000\\}$）；超出指数范围的整数端点保留向外舍入的包络，因此 $\\{-1073742000\\}$ 的 `exp2` 为 $[0, \\text{smallest positive}]$，$\\{2^{30}\\}$ 的结果为 $[\\text{largest finite}, +\\infty)$。全函数形式的回退对 `exp`、`exp2` 和 `exp10` 为 $[0, +\\infty)$，对 `expm1` 为 $[-1, +\\infty)$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1341
msgid "These return enclosures of $\\ln \\xi$, $\\log_2 \\xi$, $\\log_{10} \\xi$ and $\\ln(1 + \\xi)$ over their domains $(0, \\infty)$ and $(-1, \\infty)$."
msgstr "这些函数分别在其定义域 $(0, \\infty)$ 和 $(-1, \\infty)$ 上返回 $\\ln \\xi$、$\\log_2 \\xi$、$\\log_{10} \\xi$ 和 $\\ln(1 + \\xi)$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1355
msgid "When the interval reaches the domain boundary ($\\underline{x} \\le 0$, or $\\underline{x} \\le -1$ for `log1p`) the lower endpoint is $-\\infty$; when it lies entirely outside the domain ($\\overline{x} \\le 0$, or $\\overline{x} < -1$ for `log1p`) the result is Empty. `log10` returns exact integers at endpoints $10^k$, $0 \\le k \\le 9$. The fallback of the total forms is Entire (an endpoint at or below the domain boundary is decided before the kernel runs and is not a failure)."
msgstr "当区间到达定义域边界（$\\underline{x} \\le 0$，对 `log1p` 为 $\\underline{x} \\le -1$）时，下端点为 $-\\infty$；当区间完全位于定义域之外（$\\overline{x} \\le 0$，对 `log1p` 为 $\\overline{x} < -1$）时，结果为 Empty。`log10` 在端点 $10^k$（$0 \\le k \\le 9$）处返回精确整数。全函数形式的回退为 Entire（端点位于定义域边界或其外在内核运行之前就已判定，不算失败）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1381
msgid "`BallFloat::pow` and `BallFloat::try_pow`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::pow` 和 `BallFloat::try_pow`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1383
msgid "`pow(x, y)` returns an enclosure of $\\{\\xi^{\\eta} : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}\\}$ over the IEEE 1788 domain of `pow`: $\\xi > 0$, or $\\xi = 0$ and $\\eta > 0$."
msgstr "`pow(x, y)` 在 IEEE 1788 中 `pow` 的定义域（$\\xi > 0$，或 $\\xi = 0$ 且 $\\eta > 0$）上返回 $\\{\\xi^{\\eta} : \\xi \\in \\boldsymbol{x}, \\eta \\in \\boldsymbol{y}\\}$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1392
msgid "Negative parts of the base are ignored (use `pown` or `rootn` for negative bases). Since $\\xi^\\eta = e^{\\eta \\ln \\xi}$ and $\\eta \\ln \\xi$ is bilinear in $(\\ln \\xi, \\eta)$, the extrema over a box with $\\underline{x} > 0$ are at the four corners. When the base reaches 0, $\\xi^\\eta \\to 0$ for $\\eta > 0$ and $\\to +\\infty$ for $\\eta < 0$, so the result is extended by 0 or $+\\infty$ accordingly. The code also adds the value 1 when the base interval contains 1 or the exponent interval contains 0; it already lies between the corner values, so this changes nothing but is harmless. $0^{\\eta}$ for $\\eta \\le 0$ is excluded, so `pow([0, 0], y)` is Empty when $\\overline{y} \\le 0$. The result precision is the larger operand precision. A corner whose power is representable at the result precision, such as $16^{3/4} = 8$, gives that power exactly. The total form falls back to $[0, +\\infty)$."
msgstr "底数的负值部分被忽略（负底数请使用 `pown` 或 `rootn`）。由于 $\\xi^\\eta = e^{\\eta \\ln \\xi}$，且 $\\eta \\ln \\xi$ 关于 $(\\ln \\xi, \\eta)$ 是双线性的，在 $\\underline{x} > 0$ 的矩形上极值位于四个角点。当底数到达 0 时，对 $\\eta > 0$ 有 $\\xi^\\eta \\to 0$，对 $\\eta < 0$ 则 $\\to +\\infty$，因此结果相应地扩展到 0 或 $+\\infty$。当底数区间包含 1 或指数区间包含 0 时，代码还会加入值 1；该值本已位于角点值之间，因此这不会改变任何东西，但也无害。$\\eta \\le 0$ 时的 $0^{\\eta}$ 被排除，因此当 $\\overline{y} \\le 0$ 时 `pow([0, 0], y)` 为 Empty。结果精度为操作数中较大的精度。若某个角点的幂在结果精度下可表示（例如 $16^{3/4} = 8$），则精确给出该幂。全函数形式回退为 $[0, +\\infty)$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1406
msgid "`BallFloat::rootn` and `BallFloat::try_rootn`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::rootn` 与 `BallFloat::try_rootn`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1408
msgid "`rootn(x, n)` returns an enclosure of the real $n$-th roots $\\{\\xi^{1/n}\\}$: for even $n$ over $\\xi \\ge 0$, for odd $n$ over all reals, and for negative $n$ the reciprocal of the root."
msgstr "`rootn(x, n)` 返回实 $n$ 次方根 $\\{\\xi^{1/n}\\}$ 的包络：$n$ 为偶数时在 $\\xi \\ge 0$ 上，$n$ 为奇数时在全体实数上，$n$ 为负时取方根的倒数。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1417
msgid "`rootn(x, 0)` and `rootn(x, Int min)` are Empty; `try_rootn(x, 0)` is a domain error. `rootn(x, 1)` is `x` and `rootn(x, 2)` is `sqrt`. The total form is `try_rootn` with a fallback ($[0, +\\infty)$ for an even degree, Entire for an odd one). For negative $n$, `try_rootn` returns Entire when an odd root's argument contains 0. Exact roots are returned exactly for every degree, so `try_rootn({8}, -3)` is $\\{1/2\\}$."
msgstr "`rootn(x, 0)` 和 `rootn(x, Int min)` 为 Empty；`try_rootn(x, 0)` 为定义域错误。`rootn(x, 1)` 即 `x`，`rootn(x, 2)` 即 `sqrt`。全函数形式就是带回退的 `try_rootn`（偶次为 $[0, +\\infty)$，奇次为 Entire）。当 $n$ 为负且奇次方根的参数包含 0 时，`try_rootn` 返回 Entire。对任何次数，精确根都会被精确返回，因此 `try_rootn({8}, -3)` 为 $\\{1/2\\}$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1437
msgid "`BallFloat::hypot` and `BallFloat::try_hypot`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::hypot` 与 `BallFloat::try_hypot`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1439
msgid "`hypot` returns an enclosure of $\\{\\sqrt{\\xi^2 + \\eta^2}\\}$."
msgstr "`hypot` 返回 $\\{\\sqrt{\\xi^2 + \\eta^2}\\}$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1446
msgid "The function is increasing in $|\\xi|$ and $|\\eta|$, so the result is $[\\operatorname{RD}\\operatorname{hypot}(\\operatorname{mig}\\boldsymbol{x}, \\operatorname{mig}\\boldsymbol{y}), \\operatorname{RU}\\operatorname{hypot}(\\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{x}, \\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{y})]$, evaluated on the endpoints of `abs(x)` and `abs(y)`. The total form falls back to `sqrt(sqr(x) + sqr(y))`."
msgstr "该函数关于 $|\\xi|$ 和 $|\\eta|$ 递增，因此结果为 $[\\operatorname{RD}\\operatorname{hypot}(\\operatorname{mig}\\boldsymbol{x}, \\operatorname{mig}\\boldsymbol{y}), \\operatorname{RU}\\operatorname{hypot}(\\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{x}, \\operatorname{mag}\\boldsymbol{y})]$，在 `abs(x)` 与 `abs(y)` 的端点处求值。全函数形式回退为 `sqrt(sqr(x) + sqr(y))`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1454
msgid "These return enclosures of $\\sin$, $\\cos$ and $\\tan$ over the interval (in radians)."
msgstr "这些函数返回 $\\sin$、$\\cos$ 和 $\\tan$ 在区间上（以弧度计）的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1466
msgid "Both forms evaluate the `bin_float` functions at the endpoints (a point interval) or at the endpoints and the critical points. A critical point $k\\pi/2$ inside the interval contributes the extremum $\\pm 1$ of `sin`/`cos` (`sin` reaches $+1$ at $k \\equiv 1$ and $-1$ at $k \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, `cos` reaches $+1$ at $k \\equiv 0$ and $-1$ at $k \\equiv 2$); for `tan` an odd multiple of $\\pi/2$ inside the interval (a pole) makes the result Entire. The set of candidate indices $k$ is computed from the enclosure of $\\pi$ and can only be too large, which widens but never invalidates the result. Unbounded arguments give $[-1, 1]$ (Entire for `tan`). When the larger endpoint magnitude is at least $2^{\\max(65536,\\, 4p) + 1}$ the `try_` forms return a resource-limit error without evaluating; the total forms return $[-1, 1]$ (Entire for `tan`), the same fallback they use when the certification budget (12 work precisions) is exhausted."
msgstr "两种形式都在端点（点区间）或在端点和临界点处对 `bin_float` 的函数求值。区间内的临界点 $k\\pi/2$ 贡献 `sin`/`cos` 的极值 $\\pm 1$（`sin` 在 $k \\equiv 1$ 处取 $+1$，在 $k \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$ 处取 $-1$；`cos` 在 $k \\equiv 0$ 处取 $+1$，在 $k \\equiv 2$ 处取 $-1$）；对于 `tan`，区间内若有 $\\pi/2$ 的奇数倍（极点），结果为 Entire。候选下标 $k$ 的集合由 $\\pi$ 的包络计算得出，只可能偏大，这只会使结果变宽而绝不会使其失效。无界参数给出 $[-1, 1]$（对 `tan` 为 Entire）。当较大端点的绝对值至少为 $2^{\\max(65536,\\, 4p) + 1}$ 时，`try_` 形式不经求值直接返回资源限制错误；全函数形式返回 $[-1, 1]$（`tan` 为 Entire），当认证预算（12 个工作精度）耗尽时也使用同样的回退。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1482
msgid "These return enclosures of $\\sin \\pi\\xi$, $\\cos \\pi\\xi$ and $\\tan \\pi\\xi$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 $\\sin \\pi\\xi$、$\\cos \\pi\\xi$ 和 $\\tan \\pi\\xi$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1493
msgid "Here the critical points are the exact half-integers $k/2$, located from the dyadic endpoints without approximating $\\pi$. `tanpi` returns a half-unbounded interval when a pole is exactly an endpoint and no other pole lies in the interval (for example $[1/2, 1]$ gives $(-\\infty, 0]$, whose upper endpoint is $\\tan \\pi = -0$), Empty for the singleton of a pole, and Entire when a pole lies inside. Unbounded arguments and fallbacks give $[-1, 1]$ (Entire for `tanpi`)."
msgstr "此处临界点是精确的半整数 $k/2$，由二进有理数端点直接定位，无需近似 $\\pi$。当极点恰好是端点且区间内没有其他极点时，`tanpi` 返回半无界区间（例如 $[1/2, 1]$ 给出 $(-\\infty, 0]$，其上端点为 $\\tan \\pi = -0$）；对极点的单点集返回 Empty；当极点位于区间内部时返回 Entire。无界参数和回退给出 $[-1, 1]$（对 `tanpi` 为 Entire）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1516
msgid "These return enclosures of $\\arcsin$, $\\arccos$ (over $[-1, 1]$) and $\\arctan$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 $\\arcsin$、$\\arccos$（在 $[-1, 1]$ 上）和 $\\arctan$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1528
msgid "`asin` and `atan` are increasing and `acos` is decreasing, so only endpoints are evaluated. `atan` of an infinite endpoint is $\\pm\\pi/2$. The fallback of the total forms is $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$ for `atan` and `asin` and $[0, \\pi]$ for `acos`, with $\\pi$ taken from a constant of at most 64 bits and rounded outward to the interval's precision, so the fallback itself cannot fail."
msgstr "`asin` 和 `atan` 递增，`acos` 递减，因此只需对端点求值。无穷端点的 `atan` 为 $\\pm\\pi/2$。全函数形式的回退对 `atan` 和 `asin` 为 $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$，对 `acos` 为 $[0, \\pi]$，其中 $\\pi$ 取自至多 64 位的常数并向外舍入到区间的精度，因此回退本身不会失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1534
msgid "`BallFloat::atan2` and `BallFloat::try_atan2`"
msgstr "`BallFloat::atan2` 和 `BallFloat::try_atan2`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1536
msgid ""
"`y.atan2(x)` returns an enclosure of the angles $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\eta, \\xi) \\in (-\\pi, \\pi]$ of the points $(\\xi, \\eta) \\n"
"e (0, 0)$ of the box $\\boldsymbol{x} \\times \\boldsymbol{y}$."
msgstr ""
"`y.atan2(x)` 返回矩形 $\\boldsymbol{x} \\times \\boldsymbol{y}$ 中各点 $(\\xi, \\eta) \\n"
"e (0, 0)$ 的辐角 $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\eta, \\xi) \\in (-\\pi, \\pi]$ 的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1545
msgid "The receiver is the ordinate. The result is the hull of the angles at the four corners and at the points where the box meets the axes. When the box crosses the branch cut ($\\underline{x} < 0$ and $\\underline{y} < 0 \\le \\overline{y}$) the result is $[-\\pi, \\pi]$. The box $\\{(0, 0)\\}$ gives Empty. The total form falls back to $[-\\pi, \\pi]$."
msgstr "接收者是纵坐标。结果是四个角点以及矩形与坐标轴交点处的辐角的包。当矩形跨越分支切割线（$\\underline{x} < 0$ 且 $\\underline{y} < 0 \\le \\overline{y}$）时，结果为 $[-\\pi, \\pi]$。矩形 $\\{(0, 0)\\}$ 给出 Empty。全函数形式回退为 $[-\\pi, \\pi]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1553
msgid "These return enclosures of the hyperbolic functions and their inverses over their domains ($[1, \\infty)$ for `acosh`, $(-1, 1)$ for `atanh`)."
msgstr "这些函数在各自定义域上（`acosh` 为 $[1, \\infty)$，`atanh` 为 $(-1, 1)$）返回双曲函数及其反函数的包络。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1571
msgid "`cosh` has its minimum 1 at 0; the others are monotone. `atanh` of an interval reaching $\\pm 1$ is unbounded on that side, and an interval whose only point in the domain's closure is $1$ or $-1$ gives Empty. The fallback of the total forms is Entire for `sinh`, `asinh` and `atanh`, $[-1, 1]$ for `tanh`, $[1, +\\infty)$ for `cosh` and $[0, +\\infty)$ for `acosh`."
msgstr "`cosh` 在 0 处取最小值 1，其余函数单调。到达 $\\pm 1$ 的 `atanh` 区间在该侧无界；若区间在定义域闭包中唯一的点是 $1$ 或 $-1$，则结果为 Empty。全函数形式的回退对 `sinh`、`asinh` 和 `atanh` 为 Entire，对 `tanh` 为 $[-1, 1]$，对 `cosh` 为 $[1, +\\infty)$，对 `acosh` 为 $[0, +\\infty)$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1577
msgid "The total forms keep their relative accuracy for a tiny argument, since they are the `bin_float` kernels: at 53 bits `sinh` of $\\{2^{-300}\\}$ is the two-ulp interval $[2^{-300}, (1 + 2^{-52})\\,2^{-300}]$."
msgstr "全函数形式对很小的参数也保持相对精度，因为它们就是 `bin_float` 的内核：在 53 位下，$\\{2^{-300}\\}$ 的 `sinh` 是两个 ulp 宽的区间 $[2^{-300}, (1 + 2^{-52})\\,2^{-300}]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1593
msgid "Contexts and flags"
msgstr "上下文与标志"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1595
msgid "`BallContext::new` and `BallContext::try_new`"
msgstr "`BallContext::new` 与 `BallContext::try_new`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1597
msgid "`BallContext::new` builds a context from a precision and the largest exponent `e_max`; `e_min` is `1 - e_max` (IEEE 754-2019 3.3)."
msgstr "`BallContext::new` 由精度和最大指数 `e_max` 构建上下文；`e_min` 为 `1 - e_max`（IEEE 754-2019 3.3）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1605
msgid "The defaults are precision 53 and, for `e_max`, the implementation limit `binary_implementation_e_max` of `bin_float`, the same as `BinaryContext::new` given a precision alone (so `BallContext::new()` is not binary64: use `binary64()` for that). The legality of the pair is decided by `BinaryContext::try_new`, so `bin_float` and `ball_float` have one definition of a format: the precision is between 1 and `binary_precision_max` and `e_max` is at least 1. An illegal pair aborts `new`, naming the parameter, and is a domain error for `try_new`. Before 0.12 `e_min` was a parameter, any pair with `e_min <= e_max` was accepted, and the precision had no upper limit."
msgstr "默认精度为 53，`e_max` 的默认值为 `bin_float` 的实现上限 `binary_implementation_e_max`，与只给出精度的 `BinaryContext::new` 相同（所以 `BallContext::new()` 不是 binary64：要 binary64 请用 `binary64()`）。这一对参数是否合法由 `BinaryContext::try_new` 决定，因此 `bin_float` 与 `ball_float` 对格式只有一个定义：精度在 1 到 `binary_precision_max` 之间，`e_max` 至少为 1。非法的参数对使 `new` 中止并指明参数，对 `try_new` 则是定义域错误。0.12 之前 `e_min` 是参数，任何满足 `e_min <= e_max` 的对都被接受，精度也没有上限。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1615
msgid "`BallContext::with_precision` and `BallContext::with_e_max`"
msgstr "`BallContext::with_precision` 与 `BallContext::with_e_max`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1617
msgid "These return the same format with another precision, or another largest exponent (and `e_min = 1 - e_max`); they abort when the result is not legal."
msgstr "它们返回精度不同、或最大指数不同（同时 `e_min = 1 - e_max`）的同一种格式；结果不合法时中止。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1627
msgid "These return the contexts of the IEEE 754 interchange formats: binary16 ($p = 11$, $[-14, 15]$), binary32 ($p = 24$, $[-126, 127]$), binary64 ($p = 53$, $[-1022, 1023]$) and binary128 ($p = 113$, $[-16382, 16383]$)."
msgstr "它们返回 IEEE 754 交换格式的上下文：binary16（$p = 11$，$[-14, 15]$）、binary32（$p = 24$，$[-126, 127]$）、binary64（$p = 53$，$[-1022, 1023]$）和 binary128（$p = 113$，$[-16382, 16383]$）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1640
msgid "These return the parameters of a context."
msgstr "它们返回上下文的参数。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1650
msgid "`BallFlags::new` returns the flags with nothing raised; `combine` is their union; the accessors read the fields."
msgstr "`BallFlags::new` 返回未触发任何条件的标志；`combine` 求二者的并；访问器读取各字段。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1663
msgid "`apply_ctx` rounds an interval outward into a context and reports the flags."
msgstr "`apply_ctx` 将区间向外舍入到上下文中并报告标志。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1669
msgid "Each finite nonzero endpoint is rounded outward to the context precision. An endpoint whose rounded exponent exceeds $e_{\\max}$ overflows: it becomes $\\mp\\infty$ if it is a negative lower or a positive upper endpoint, and the largest finite value of the right sign otherwise (a positive lower endpoint becomes the largest finite value, which is still below it). An endpoint below the normal range is then rounded outward on the subnormal grid $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}\\mathbb{Z}$, so a tiny positive upper endpoint becomes the smallest subnormal rather than 0. Rounding twice in the same direction equals rounding once onto the coarser grid, so the endpoints are the directed roundings of the stored ones. Zeros and infinities are kept. Empty gives Empty with no flags. The result has the context precision."
msgstr "每个有限非零端点都向外舍入到上下文精度。舍入后指数超过 $e_{\\max}$ 的端点发生上溢：若它是负的下端点或正的上端点，则变为 $\\mp\\infty$；否则变为相应符号的最大有限值（正的下端点变为最大有限值，仍低于原值）。随后，低于正规范围的端点在次正规网格 $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}\\mathbb{Z}$ 上向外舍入，因此极小的正上端点会变为最小次正规数而不是 0。同一方向的两次舍入等于一次舍入到较粗的网格上，因此所得端点就是所存储端点的定向舍入。零和无穷保持不变。Empty 给出 Empty 且不设任何标志。结果具有上下文精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1681
msgid "`underflow` follows IEEE 754 with tininess detected after rounding: it is raised when an endpoint is inexact and its rounding to $p$ bits with an unbounded exponent range lies below $2^{e_{\\min}}$, whichever of the two steps lost the bits. With $p = 4$ and $e_{\\min} = -2$, the lower endpoint $2^{-3}(1 + 2^{-10})$ becomes $2^{-3}$, which is already on the subnormal grid, and raises both `inexact` and `underflow`. An exact tiny endpoint raises nothing."
msgstr "`underflow` 遵循 IEEE 754，并在舍入之后检测微小性：当端点不精确，且其在指数范围无界时舍入到 $p$ 位的结果低于 $2^{e_{\\min}}$ 时引发，无论丢失位数的是两步中的哪一步。在 $p = 4$、$e_{\\min} = -2$ 时，下端点 $2^{-3}(1 + 2^{-10})$ 变为 $2^{-3}$，它已在次正规网格上，并同时引发 `inexact` 和 `underflow`。精确的微小端点不引发任何标志。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1689
msgid "There is no `add_ctx` or `exp_ctx`: the operation and the context are composed, `(x + y).apply_ctx(ctx)`. When the operands' precision is at least the context precision, the double rounding gives the same endpoints as a single outward rounding into the context (see the [design page](../design/ball_float.md#contexts-and-double-rounding))."
msgstr "没有 `add_ctx` 或 `exp_ctx`：运算与上下文是组合起来的，即 `(x + y).apply_ctx(ctx)`。当操作数的精度不低于上下文精度时，这种两次舍入得到的端点与一次向外舍入到上下文所得的端点相同（参见[设计文档](../design/ball_float.md#contexts-and-double-rounding)）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1697
msgid "`midpoint_ctx` is the IEEE 1788 `mid` operation with the context as the result format."
msgstr "`midpoint_ctx` 是以上下文为结果格式的 IEEE 1788 `mid` 运算。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1704
msgid "Following IEEE 1788-2015 §12.12.8, Empty gives NaN, Entire gives $+0$, an interval unbounded only above gives the largest finite value of the context, $(2 - 2^{1-p})\\,2^{e_{\\max}}$, and one unbounded only below gives its negative; none of these raises a flag. A bounded interval gives its exact center rounded once to nearest (ties to even) onto the context's grid, including the subnormal grid $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}\\mathbb{Z}$, so with $p = 4$, $e_{\\min} = -2$ the center $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ gives $2^{-5}$. A zero center gives $+0$. `inexact` is set when the result differs from the center and `underflow` when it is also tiny, as for `apply_ctx`. A center that rounds beyond $e_{\\max}$ overflows to an infinity of its sign with `overflow` and `inexact`: rounding to nearest maps it to $\\pm\\infty$ in IEEE 754, and IEEE 1788 uses that rounding for the bounded case. Only an interval whose endpoints are themselves outside the context's range can do this."
msgstr "按照 IEEE 1788-2015 §12.12.8，Empty 给出 NaN，Entire 给出 $+0$，仅上方无界的区间给出上下文的最大有限值 $(2 - 2^{1-p})\\,2^{e_{\\max}}$，仅下方无界的区间给出其相反数；这些情形都不引发标志。有界区间给出其精确中心一次性按就近舍入（平局取偶）到上下文网格（包括次正规网格 $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}\\mathbb{Z}$）上的值，因此在 $p = 4$、$e_{\\min} = -2$ 时，中心 $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ 给出 $2^{-5}$。零中心给出 $+0$。结果与中心不同时设置 `inexact`，若同时为微小值则设置 `underflow`，与 `apply_ctx` 相同。舍入后超出 $e_{\\max}$ 的中心溢出为同号的无穷，并设置 `overflow` 和 `inexact`：在 IEEE 754 中就近舍入将其映射为 $\\pm\\infty$，而 IEEE 1788 在有界情形下使用的正是这种舍入。只有端点本身就超出上下文范围的区间才会出现这种情况。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1734
msgid "Decorated intervals"
msgstr "装饰区间"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1736
msgid "A decorated operation computes the bare result and the decoration $d = \\min(d_1, \\dots, d_k, d_f)$, where $d_i$ are the operand decorations and $d_f$ is the decoration of the operation on these operands (`Com` when the function is defined and continuous on the whole input box, `Trv` when the input leaves the domain, as listed below). The minimum is then made canonical (Empty → `Trv`, unbounded with `Com` → `Dac`). Any NaI operand gives NaI."
msgstr "装饰运算计算裸结果以及装饰 $d = \\min(d_1, \\dots, d_k, d_f)$，其中 $d_i$ 是操作数的装饰，$d_f$ 是该运算在这些操作数上的装饰（当函数在整个输入矩形上有定义且连续时为 `Com`，当输入超出定义域时为 `Trv`，如下文所列）。随后将该最小值规范化（Empty → `Trv`，无界且为 `Com` → `Dac`）。任何 NaI 操作数都给出 NaI。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1745
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::new` decorates a bare interval."
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::new` 为裸区间添加装饰。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1751
msgid "The default decoration is `Com`. `new` is `setDec` of IEEE 1788-2015 11.5.2: the decoration `Ill` gives NaI for any interval, empty or not (at the precision of the interval, so the result equals `BallFloatDecorated::nai`); otherwise the decoration is made canonical, so `new(entire())` is decorated `Dac` and `new(empty())` is decorated `Trv`, as in IEEE 1788 `newDec`."
msgstr "默认装饰为 `Com`。`new` 就是 IEEE 1788-2015 第 11.5.2 条的 `setDec`：装饰 `Ill` 对任何区间（无论是否为空）都给出 NaI（精度与该区间相同，因此结果等于 `BallFloatDecorated::nai`）；否则装饰会被规范化，所以 `new(entire())` 的装饰为 `Dac`，`new(empty())` 的装饰为 `Trv`，与 IEEE 1788 的 `newDec` 一致。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1757
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::nai` and `BallFloatDecorated::is_nai`"
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::nai` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::is_nai`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1759
msgid "`nai` returns NaI, the result of an invalid decorated construction; `is_nai` tests for it."
msgstr "`nai` 返回 NaI，即无效装饰构造的结果；`is_nai` 检测它。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1767
msgid "NaI has decoration `Ill` and an Empty interval (default precision 53), but it is not Empty: `is_empty` is false for NaI."
msgstr "NaI 的装饰为 `Ill`，区间为 Empty（默认精度 53），但它不是 Empty：对 NaI，`is_empty` 为假。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1770
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::interval` and `BallFloatDecorated::decoration`"
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::interval` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::decoration`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1772
msgid "These return the bare interval and the decoration."
msgstr "它们返回裸区间和装饰。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1781
msgid "These predicates apply the bare predicate to the interval and return false for NaI."
msgstr "这些谓词将相应的裸谓词作用于区间，对 NaI 返回假。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1794
msgid "These relations apply the bare relation to the intervals and return false when an operand is NaI."
msgstr "这些关系将相应的裸关系作用于区间，当有操作数为 NaI 时返回假。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1810
msgid "`overlap` returns `None` when an operand is NaI, which has no value for a non-interval-valued operation (IEEE 1788-2015 11.7.2), and `Some(state)` otherwise."
msgstr "当某个操作数为 NaI 时，`overlap` 返回 `None`，因为对非区间值的运算，NaI 没有值（IEEE 1788-2015 11.7.2）；否则返回 `Some(state)`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1816
msgid "These apply the bare operation and always lower the decoration to `Trv` (set operations are not point functions, so no property of a function can be claimed for their results)."
msgstr "这些函数应用裸运算，并总是将装饰降为 `Trv`（集合运算不是逐点函数，因此无法对其结果断言函数的任何性质）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1829
msgid "The arithmetic operations apply the bare operation; their operation decoration is `Com` except where the table says otherwise."
msgstr "算术运算应用裸运算；除表中另有说明外，其运算装饰为 `Com`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1848
#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:15
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:382
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:830
#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:122
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:129
#: manual/verification.md:77
#: manual/verification.md:253
#: manual/verification.md:296
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1848
#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1885
msgid "Operation decoration"
msgstr "运算装饰"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1850
msgid "`Trv` when the divisor contains 0"
msgstr "除数包含 0 时为 `Trv`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1851
msgid "`Trv` when $n < 0$ and $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x}$"
msgstr "当 $n < 0$ 且 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{x}$ 时为 `Trv`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1852
msgid "identity (IEEE 1788 `pos`)"
msgstr "恒等（IEEE 1788 `pos`）"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1853
msgid "others"
msgstr "其他"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1857
msgid "The decorated elementary functions apply the bare total form (there are no decorated `try_` forms) and lower the decoration when the input leaves the domain of the function, as listed in the table at the end of this group."
msgstr "装饰初等函数应用裸的全函数形式（没有装饰版的 `try_` 形式），并在输入超出函数定义域时降低装饰，具体见本组末尾的表格。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1861
msgid "These are the decorated square root, exponentials, logarithms, powers and `hypot`."
msgstr "这些是装饰版的平方根、指数函数、对数函数、幂函数以及 `hypot`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1881
msgid "The interval part is the bare result. The operation decoration is the strongest decoration of 11.2 for the function over the input box, and the result is the minimum of it and the input decoration (11.6, equation 18):"
msgstr "区间部分是裸结果。操作装饰是 11.2 中该函数在输入盒上的最强装饰，结果是它与输入装饰的最小值（11.6，式 18）："

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1885
msgid "Input box $\\boldsymbol{x}$"
msgstr "输入盒 $\\boldsymbol{x}$"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1888
msgid "the function is not constant on $\\boldsymbol{x}$"
msgstr "函数在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上不是常数"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1889
msgid "constant, and $\\boldsymbol{x}$ unbounded"
msgstr "为常数，且 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 无界"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1890
msgid "constant, bounded, and $\\boldsymbol{x}$ contains a point of discontinuity of the function on the real line"
msgstr "为常数、有界，且 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 含有该函数在实数轴上的一个不连续点"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1891
msgid "constant, bounded, and no such point in $\\boldsymbol{x}$"
msgstr "为常数、有界，且 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 中没有这样的点"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1893
msgid "The functions take integer values, so their restriction to $\\boldsymbol{x}$ is continuous exactly when it is constant (`dac` asks for continuity of the restriction, `com` for continuity at each point of $\\boldsymbol{x}$). The points of discontinuity are the integers for `ceil` and `floor`, the nonzero integers for `trunc`, $0$ for `sign`, and the half-integers for the two roundings. For example `ceil` of the box $[1.1, 2.0]$ is $[2, 2]$ with `Dac`: the restriction is constant, but $2$ is a point of discontinuity of `ceil`. `floor` of the same box is $[1, 2]$ with `Def`. NaI gives NaI."
msgstr "这些函数取整数值，因此它们在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 上的限制连续当且仅当为常数（`dac` 要求限制连续，`com` 要求在 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 的每个点处连续）。不连续点：`ceil` 和 `floor` 为整数，`trunc` 为非零整数，`sign` 为 $0$，两个舍入函数为半整数。例如盒 $[1.1, 2.0]$ 的 `ceil` 为 $[2, 2]$，装饰为 `Dac`：限制是常数，但 $2$ 是 `ceil` 的不连续点。同一个盒的 `floor` 为 $[1, 2]$，装饰为 `Def`。NaI 给出 NaI。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1911
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::sqr_rev`, `BallFloatDecorated::abs_rev`, `BallFloatDecorated::pown_rev` and `BallFloatDecorated::cosh_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::sqr_rev`、`BallFloatDecorated::abs_rev`、`BallFloatDecorated::pown_rev` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::cosh_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1913
msgid "Reverse-mode operations have the trivial decorated version of 11.7.1: NaI if any input (the interval or the prior) is NaI, else the bare result decorated `Trv`."
msgstr "反向模式运算采用 11.7.1 的平凡装饰版本：任一输入（区间或先验）为 NaI 则为 NaI，否则为装饰 `Trv` 的裸结果。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1923
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::sin_rev`, `BallFloatDecorated::cos_rev` and `BallFloatDecorated::tan_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::sin_rev`、`BallFloatDecorated::cos_rev` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::tan_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1925
msgid "The trivial decorated version of 11.7.1: NaI if any input (the interval or the prior) is NaI, else the bare result decorated `Trv`."
msgstr "11.7.1 的平凡装饰版本：任一输入（区间或先验）为 NaI 则为 NaI，否则为装饰 `Trv` 的裸结果。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1936
msgid "The trivial decorated version of 11.7.1: NaI if any input is NaI, else the bare result decorated `Trv`."
msgstr "11.7.1 的平凡装饰版本：任一输入为 NaI 则为 NaI，否则为装饰 `Trv` 的裸结果。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1942
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::mul_rev_to_pair` and `BallFloatDecorated::mul_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::mul_rev_to_pair` 与 `BallFloatDecorated::mul_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1944
msgid ""
"`mul_rev_to_pair` follows 12.12.3. If either input is NaI both outputs are NaI. Otherwise, when both are nonempty and $0 \\n"
"otin \\boldsymbol{b}$, the first output is the decorated quotient $\\boldsymbol{c} / \\boldsymbol{b}$ (the same decoration as `/`) and the second is Empty with `Trv`. Every other output, empty or not, is decorated `Trv`. `mul_rev` is a reverse-mode operation and has the trivial decorated version of 11.7.1: NaI if any input is NaI, else the bare result decorated `Trv`."
msgstr ""
"`mul_rev_to_pair` 遵循 12.12.3。任一输入为 NaI 时两个输出都是 NaI。否则，当两者非空且 $0 \\n"
"otin \\boldsymbol{b}$ 时，第一个输出是带装饰的商 $\\boldsymbol{c} / \\boldsymbol{b}$（装饰与 `/` 相同），第二个输出是装饰为 `Trv` 的 Empty。其他所有输出，无论是否为空，都装饰为 `Trv`。`mul_rev` 是反向模式运算，采用 11.7.1 的平凡装饰版本：任一输入为 NaI 则为 NaI，否则为装饰 `Trv` 的裸结果。"

