#: manual/api/ball_float.md:2001
msgid "All other functions have operation decoration `Com`. For `y.atan2(x)` the decoration is `Def` when the box crosses the branch cut ($\\underline{x} < 0$, $\\underline{y} < 0 \\le \\overline{y}$: the restriction jumps from $-\\pi$ to $\\pi$) and `Dac` when it touches the cut from above ($\\overline{x} < 0$, $\\underline{y} = 0$: the restriction is continuous, but `atan2` itself is not continuous at those points)."
msgstr "其他所有函数的运算装饰均为 `Com`。对于 `y.atan2(x)`，当矩形跨越分支切割线（$\\underline{x} < 0$，$\\underline{y} < 0 \\le \\overline{y}$：限制函数从 $-\\pi$ 跳到 $\\pi$）时装饰为 `Def`，当它从上方触及切割线（$\\overline{x} < 0$，$\\underline{y} = 0$：限制函数连续，但 `atan2` 本身在这些点不连续）时装饰为 `Dac`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:2010
