#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:44
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:47
msgid "The wrapper type"
msgstr "包装类型"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:48
msgid "`BallFloatResult` is either a successful `BallFloat` or an `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 要么是成功的 `BallFloat`，要么是 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:56
msgid "The single private field holds a `Result[@ball_float.BallFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`. The type has no `Eq` or `Show`; use `result()`."
msgstr "唯一的私有字段保存一个 `Result[@ball_float.BallFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`。该类型没有 `Eq` 或 `Show`；请使用 `result()`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:63
msgid "These functions wrap an existing interval, error or `Result` unchanged."
msgstr "这些函数原样包装一个已有的区间、错误或 `Result`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:73
msgid "These constructors enclose an integer through `BallFloat::from_int` / `BallFloat::from_coefficient`; they never fail."
msgstr "这些构造函数通过 `BallFloat::from_int` / `BallFloat::from_coefficient` 构建整数的包络；它们从不失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:81
msgid "The default precision is **53 bits**. The integer is converted exactly and then rounded outward to the precision, so the result always contains it: a singleton when the integer fits in the precision, otherwise the two-point interval of its neighbours (for example `from_int(100001, precision=8)`, a 17-bit odd integer, gives an interval of width 2^9). Pass a precision large enough for the integer to get a point."
msgstr "默认精度为 **53 位**。整数先被精确转换，再向外舍入到该精度，因此结果总是包含它：当整数能用该精度表示时为单点集，否则为由其两个相邻值构成的两点区间（例如 `from_int(100001, precision=8)` 是一个 17 位的奇数，给出宽度为 2^9 的区间）。要得到点区间，请传入足以表示该整数的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:90
msgid "These constructors enclose a finite `Double` or `Float`."
msgstr "这些构造函数包络一个有限的 `Double` 或 `Float`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:97
msgid "The source is converted exactly (at least 53 or 24 bits) and then rounded outward to `precision` (defaults 53 and 24), so the result always contains the source value. A NaN or infinite source gives a `DomainError` (`ball double source must be finite`, `ball float source must be finite`)."
msgstr "源值先被精确转换（至少 53 或 24 位），然后向外舍入到 `precision`（默认分别为 53 和 24），因此结果总是包含源值。NaN 或无穷的源值给出 `DomainError`（`ball double source must be finite`、`ball float source must be finite`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:104
msgid "`exact(x, precision~)` encloses a finite `BinFloat`."
msgstr "`exact(x, precision~)` 包络一个有限的 `BinFloat`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:110
msgid "`precision` defaults to `x.precision()`. The bounds are `x` rounded down and up to that precision, so the result contains `x`. A non-finite `x` gives a `DomainError` (`ball exact source must be finite`)."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为 `x.precision()`。两个界分别是 `x` 向下和向上舍入到该精度的结果，因此结果包含 `x`。非有限的 `x` 给出 `DomainError`（`ball exact source must be finite`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:116
msgid "`from_bounds(lo, hi, precision~)` builds the interval $[\\textit{lo}, \\textit{hi}]$."
msgstr "`from_bounds(lo, hi, precision~)` 构建区间 $[\\textit{lo}, \\textit{hi}]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:123
msgid "`precision` defaults to the larger bound precision; `lo` is rounded down and `hi` up. It returns a `DomainError` when a bound is NaN, when `lo` is $+\\infty$, when `hi` is $-\\infty$ (IEEE 1788 intervals are subsets of $\\mathbb{R}$, so $[+\\infty, +\\infty]$ is not an interval), or when `lo > hi`. Infinite bounds on the open side are allowed: $[-\\infty, 0]$ is valid."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为两个界中较大的精度；`lo` 向下舍入，`hi` 向上舍入。当某个界为 NaN、`lo` 为 $+\\infty$、`hi` 为 $-\\infty$（IEEE 1788 区间是 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的子集，因此 $[+\\infty, +\\infty]$ 不是区间），或 `lo > hi` 时，返回 `DomainError`。开放一侧允许使用无穷界：$[-\\infty, 0]$ 是有效的。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:132
msgid "`entire(precision~)` is the entire real line $[-\\infty, +\\infty]$ (default precision 53); it never fails."
msgstr "`entire(precision~)` 是整条实轴 $[-\\infty, +\\infty]$（默认精度 53）；它从不失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:166
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:103
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:153
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:104
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "观察"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:170
msgid "These methods expose the wrapped `Result`, test its branch, or return the error as an option."
msgstr "这些方法暴露被包装的 `Result`、检测其分支，或以 option 形式返回错误。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:180
msgid "`error()` is `Some(e)` exactly when `result()` is `Err(e)`."
msgstr "当且仅当 `result()` 为 `Err(e)` 时，`error()` 为 `Some(e)`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:182
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:118
msgid "Composition"
msgstr "组合"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:186
msgid "`map(f)` applies an infallible interval function to a success; `bind(f)` applies one that may fail. Errors pass through unchanged."
msgstr "`map(f)` 将一个不会失败的区间函数应用于成功值；`bind(f)` 应用一个可能失败的函数。错误原样传递。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:194
msgid "They satisfy the monad and functor laws proved in the [`bin_float_checked` design](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws); the proof does not depend on the value type."
msgstr "它们满足 [`bin_float_checked` 设计文档](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws)中证明的 monad 定律与 functor 定律；该证明不依赖于值的类型。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:198
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:166
msgid "Unary value maps"
msgstr "一元值映射"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:202
msgid "These methods are `map` of the `BallFloat` method of the same name."
msgstr "这些方法是对同名 `BallFloat` 方法的 `map`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:211
msgid "`neg` and `abs` are the exact interval images $\\{-t\\}$ and $\\{|t|\\}$; `with_precision` rounds the endpoints outward to the new precision, which is the tightest enclosure of the input. Neither it nor `normalized` changes an interval that is already representable at the target precision (see [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision))."
msgstr "`neg` 和 `abs` 是精确的区间像 $\\{-t\\}$ 和 $\\{|t|\\}$；`with_precision` 把端点向外舍入到新精度，这就是输入的最紧包络。它和 `normalized` 都不会改变在目标精度下已可表示的区间（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision)）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:221
msgid "These methods combine two wrappers with the `BallFloat` operators."
msgstr "这些方法用 `BallFloat` 运算符组合两个包装值。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:230
msgid "The left operand's error comes first, then the right one's. Interval arithmetic itself never fails: the result encloses $\\{\\, s \\circ t : s \\in X, t \\in Y \\,\\}$. Division by an interval that is exactly $\\{0\\}$ gives the empty set, and division by an interval that contains zero in its interior gives the whole line."
msgstr "左操作数的错误优先，其次是右操作数的。区间算术本身从不失败：结果包络 $\\{\\, s \\circ t : s \\in X, t \\in Y \\,\\}$。除以恰为 $\\{0\\}$ 的区间得到空集，除以内部包含零的区间得到整条实轴。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:238
msgid "These methods are `map` of the `BallFloat` method of the same name (IEEE 1788-2015 Table 9.1): the directed square root, the square of one point (`sqr`, so the square of $[-1, 1]$ is $[0, 1]$) and the reciprocal. None of them can fail."
msgstr "这些方法都是对同名 `BallFloat` 方法的 `map`（IEEE 1788-2015 表 9.1）：定向平方根、对同一个点取平方（`sqr`，因此 $[-1, 1]$ 的平方是 $[0, 1]$）以及倒数。它们都不会失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:251
msgid "These methods are `map` of the `BallFloat` integer functions of Table 9.1 (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatsign-ballfloatceil-ballfloatfloor-ballfloattrunc-ballfloatround_ties_to_even-ballfloatround_ties_to_away)). They are exact and cannot fail."
msgstr "这些方法是表 9.1 中 `BallFloat` 整数函数的 `map`（见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatsign-ballfloatceil-ballfloatfloor-ballfloattrunc-ballfloatround_ties_to_even-ballfloatround_ties_to_away)）。它们是精确的，不会失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:264
msgid "`BallFloatResult::sqr_rev`, `BallFloatResult::abs_rev`, `BallFloatResult::pown_rev` and `BallFloatResult::cosh_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult::sqr_rev`、`BallFloatResult::abs_rev`、`BallFloatResult::pown_rev` 与 `BallFloatResult::cosh_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:266
msgid "These methods apply the `BallFloat` method of the same name to the interval part (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatsqr_rev-ballfloatabs_rev-ballfloatpown_rev-and-ballfloatcosh_rev)). They cannot fail themselves; an earlier failure in the receiver or in the optional prior is passed on."
msgstr "这些方法对区间部分应用同名的 `BallFloat` 方法（见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatsqr_rev-ballfloatabs_rev-ballfloatpown_rev-and-ballfloatcosh_rev)）。它们自身不会失败；接收者或可选先验中先前的失败会被传递。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:278
msgid "`BallFloatResult::sin_rev`, `BallFloatResult::cos_rev` and `BallFloatResult::tan_rev`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult::sin_rev`、`BallFloatResult::cos_rev` 与 `BallFloatResult::tan_rev`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:280
msgid "These methods apply the `BallFloat` method of the same name to the interval part (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatsin_rev-ballfloatcos_rev-and-ballfloattan_rev)). They cannot fail themselves; an earlier failure in the receiver or in the optional prior is passed on."
msgstr "这些方法对区间部分应用同名的 `BallFloat` 方法（见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatsin_rev-ballfloatcos_rev-and-ballfloattan_rev)）。它们自身不会失败；接收者或可选先验中先前的失败会被传递。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:293
msgid "`BallFloat::pow_rev1` on the interval parts (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev1)). It cannot fail itself; an earlier failure in the receiver, in `c` or in the optional prior is passed on."
msgstr "对区间部分应用 `BallFloat::pow_rev1`（见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev1)）。它自身不会失败；接收者、`c` 或可选先验中先前的失败会被传递。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:302
msgid "`BallFloat::pow_rev2` on the interval parts (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev2)). It cannot fail itself; an earlier failure in the receiver, in `c` or in the optional prior is passed on."
msgstr "区间部分上的 `BallFloat::pow_rev2`（参见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev2)）。它本身不会失败；接收者、`c` 或可选先验区间中先前的失败会被传递下去。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:309
msgid "`BallFloatResult::atan2_rev1` and `BallFloatResult::atan2_rev2`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult::atan2_rev1` 与 `BallFloatResult::atan2_rev2`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:311
msgid "`BallFloat::atan2_rev1` and `BallFloat::atan2_rev2` on the interval parts (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatatan2_rev1-and-ballfloatatan2_rev2)). They cannot fail themselves; an earlier failure in the receiver, in `c` or in the optional prior is passed on."
msgstr "区间部分上的 `BallFloat::atan2_rev1` 与 `BallFloat::atan2_rev2`（参见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatatan2_rev1-and-ballfloatatan2_rev2)）。它们本身不会失败；接收者、`c` 或可选先验区间中先前的失败会被传递下去。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:321
msgid "`BallFloat::from_string` (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatfrom_string-and-ballfloatdecoratedfrom_string)) as a result: the failed call is the failure of the result."
msgstr "区间部分上的 `BallFloat::from_string`（参见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatfrom_string-and-ballfloatdecoratedfrom_string)），写成结果：失败的调用就是该结果的失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:327
msgid "`BallFloatResult::mul_rev` and `BallFloatResult::mul_rev_to_pair`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult::mul_rev` 与 `BallFloatResult::mul_rev_to_pair`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:329
msgid "These methods apply `BallFloat::mul_rev` and `BallFloat::mul_rev_to_pair` to the interval parts (see the [`ball_float` page](ball_float.md#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev)). They cannot fail themselves; an earlier failure in an input is passed on, and for `mul_rev_to_pair` both outputs carry it. `x` is optional."
msgstr "这些方法对区间部分应用 `BallFloat::mul_rev` 与 `BallFloat::mul_rev_to_pair`（见 [`ball_float` 页面](ball_float.md#ballfloatmul_rev_to_pair-and-ballfloatmul_rev)）。它们自身不会失败；输入中先前的失败会被传递，对 `mul_rev_to_pair` 两个输出都带有该失败。`x` 可省略。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:341
msgid "These methods combine two or three wrappers with the `BallFloat` method of the same name (Table 9.1 `min`, `max`, `fma`; 9.2 and 9.3 the cancellative and set operations). The first error comes first, in argument order, as for `add`."
msgstr "这些方法把两个或三个包装器与同名的 `BallFloat` 方法组合起来（表 9.1 的 `min`、`max`、`fma`；9.2 和 9.3 的消去与集合运算）。第一个错误按参数顺序优先，与 `add` 相同。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:357
msgid "`pown` raises an interval to an integer power through the Luna-Flow/arithmetic trait `PowIntChecked`."
msgstr "`pown` 通过 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 trait `PowIntChecked` 计算区间的整数次幂。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:364
msgid "The context is `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`; `ball_float` uses only its precision, and re-rounds the base and the result outward with `with_precision`, which adds nothing when they are already representable. `pown` encloses $\\{t^{n}\\}$ with `BallFloat::pown`, which treats the base as one point (so `pown(2)` of $[-1, 1]$ is $[0, 1]$, tighter than `x * x`, which is $[-1, 1]$). A zero base with a negative exponent gives the empty set. An empty base stays empty for every exponent, including `pown(0)`. There is no `pow_nat` here: a non-negative exponent is a `pown`, and the trait form `BallFloat::pow_nat_checked` takes a `UInt`."
msgstr "上下文为 `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`；`ball_float` 只使用其精度，并用 `with_precision` 将底数和结果向外重新舍入，当它们已可表示时不会增加任何宽度。`pown` 用 `BallFloat::pown` 包络 $\\{t^{n}\\}$，它把底数视为同一个点（因此 $[-1, 1]$ 的 `pown(2)` 为 $[0, 1]$，比 `x * x` 的 $[-1, 1]$ 更紧）。零底数配负指数得到空集。空底数对任何指数都保持为空，包括 `pown(0)`。这里没有 `pow_nat`：非负指数就是 `pown`，而 trait 形式 `BallFloat::pow_nat_checked` 接受 `UInt`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:376
msgid "`rootn(n)` encloses the real $n$-th root with `BallFloat::try_rootn`."
msgstr "`rootn(n)` 用 `BallFloat::try_rootn` 包络实 $n$ 次方根。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:382
msgid "Degree $0$ gives a `DomainError`. Even roots ignore the negative part of the interval (set semantics): the root of $[-1, 1]$ is $[0, 1]$."
msgstr "次数 $0$ 给出 `DomainError`。偶次方根忽略区间的负值部分（集合语义）：$[-1, 1]$ 的方根为 $[0, 1]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:387
msgid "These binary functions enclose $x^{y}$, $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$ and the angle of $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$."
msgstr "这些二元函数包络 $x^{y}$、$\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$ 以及 $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$ 的辐角。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:396
msgid "They call `try_pow`, `try_hypot` and `try_atan2`. Operand errors are taken left first; the operation can fail with a `CertificationFailure`. Points outside the real domain are dropped from the result set, so $(-2)^{0.5}$ is the empty interval."
msgstr "它们调用 `try_pow`、`try_hypot` 和 `try_atan2`。操作数错误先取左侧；运算本身可能以 `CertificationFailure` 失败。实定义域之外的点会从结果集合中去除，因此 $(-2)^{0.5}$ 是空区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:432
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the exponentials and logarithms."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在指数函数和对数函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:448
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the trigonometric functions and their inverses."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在三角函数及其反函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:465
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the hyperbolic functions and their inverses."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在双曲函数及其反函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:477
msgid "Each method is `bind` of `BallFloat::try_<name>_interval` at the interval's precision. The result $Y$ satisfies $f(X \\cap \\operatorname{dom} f) \\subseteq Y$; parts of $X$ outside the domain are ignored, so $\\ln([-1, 1]) = [-\\infty, 0]$ and $\\ln([-2, -2])$ is empty. The only error is a `CertificationFailure` when an enclosure cannot be certified, for example the cosine of $2^{8000000}$ (reason `ResourceLimit`). There are no context variants; precision is set with `with_precision`."
msgstr "每个方法都是以区间精度对 `BallFloat::try_<name>_interval` 进行 `bind`。结果 $Y$ 满足 $f(X \\cap \\operatorname{dom} f) \\subseteq Y$；$X$ 中位于定义域之外的部分被忽略，因此 $\\ln([-1, 1]) = [-\\infty, 0]$，而 $\\ln([-2, -2])$ 为空。唯一的错误是无法认证包络时的 `CertificationFailure`，例如 $2^{8000000}$ 的余弦（原因为 `ResourceLimit`）。没有上下文变体；精度通过 `with_precision` 设置。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:515
msgid "`Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div`, `Neg` for `BallFloatResult`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 的 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div`、`Neg`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:517
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:824
msgid "The operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-` call `add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div` and `neg`."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 和一元 `-` 调用 `add`、`sub`、`mul`、`div` 和 `neg`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:530
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:842
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:403
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:320
#: manual/api/def.md:430
#: manual/api/semantic.md:375
msgid "The following snapshot is the complete generated interface of the package."
msgstr "以下快照是该包完整的生成接口。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:1
msgid "bench API"
msgstr "bench API"

#: manual/api/bench.md:5
msgid "`bench` is the shared benchmark toolkit of `floating`, built on the Maremark framework (`Luna-Flow/mare_mark`). It builds immutable benchmark specifications, describes the measurement environment, runs a specification under a validated protocol, and reduces the recorded observations: paired comparisons with bootstrap confidence intervals, a regression verdict, and per-dataset auto-tuning decisions. The per-core suites [bench/bin_float](bench/bin_float.md), [bench/decimal](bench/decimal.md), [bench/decimal_gda](bench/decimal_gda.md) and [bench/ball_float](bench/ball_float.md) use it. The [tutorial](../tutorial/bench.md) shows how to run the suites and the [design page](../design/bench.md) derives the statistics."
msgstr "`bench` 是 `floating` 共用的基准测试工具包，构建于 Maremark 框架（`Luna-Flow/mare_mark`）之上。它构建不可变的基准测试规格，描述测量环境，在经过验证的协议下运行规格，并对记录下来的观测数据进行归约：带 bootstrap 置信区间的配对比较、回归判定，以及按数据集的自动调优决策。各核心的基准套件 [bench/bin_float](bench/bin_float.md)、[bench/decimal](bench/decimal.md)、[bench/decimal_gda](bench/decimal_gda.md) 和 [bench/ball_float](bench/ball_float.md) 都使用它。[教程](../tutorial/bench.md)介绍如何运行这些套件，[设计页面](../design/bench.md)推导其中的统计方法。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:19
msgid "Import the package in `moon.pkg`. The Maremark packages are needed only to build specifications and observations; the reduction functions take plain arrays and observations:"
msgstr "在 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包。只有在构建规格和观测数据时才需要 Maremark 的包；归约函数接受普通数组和观测数据："

#: manual/api/bench.md:32
msgid "The examples on this page use the alias `@bench`. The benchmark suites import the same package under the alias `@benchkit` (`\"Luna-Flow/floating-tools/bench\" @benchkit`). Types prefixed `@model`, `@runner`, `@event` and `@stats` belong to `Luna-Flow/mare_mark`. An `@model.Observation` records one timed batch: case, implementation, dataset, repetition and block ids, phase (exploratory or confirmatory), `raw_elapsed_us` (batch time divided by the batch's iteration count, so the mean time of one call in microseconds), and a `valid` flag."
msgstr "本页示例使用别名 `@bench`。基准测试套件以别名 `@benchkit`（`\"Luna-Flow/floating-tools/bench\" @benchkit`）导入同一个包。带 `@model`、`@runner`、`@event` 和 `@stats` 前缀的类型属于 `Luna-Flow/mare_mark`。一个 `@model.Observation` 记录一次计时批次：用例、实现、数据集、重复编号和区块编号、阶段（探索性或确认性）、`raw_elapsed_us`（批次耗时除以该批次的迭代次数，即单次调用的平均耗时，单位为微秒），以及一个 `valid` 标志。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:40
msgid "Building and running benchmarks"
msgstr "构建和运行基准测试"

#: manual/api/bench.md:44
msgid "`immutable_bench(id, operation, scales, scale_text, generate, fingerprint, implementations, reference, comparator, input_text, output_text)` builds a benchmark whose input is generated once per scale and never mutated."
msgstr "`immutable_bench(id, operation, scales, scale_text, generate, fingerprint, implementations, reference, comparator, input_text, output_text)` 构建一个基准测试，其输入在每个规模下只生成一次，且从不被修改。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:52
#: manual/api/cli.md:38
msgid "Argument"
msgstr "参数"

#: manual/api/bench.md:54
msgid "case id, also used for the fixture (`id-fixture`, version `\"1\"`) and the oracle (`id-reference`)"
msgstr "用例 id，也用于夹具（`id-fixture`，版本 `\"1\"`）和预言机（`id-reference`）"

#: manual/api/bench.md:55
msgid "operation name recorded in the case descriptor"
msgstr "记录在用例描述符中的运算名"

#: manual/api/bench.md:56
msgid "the datasets (for example bit or digit sizes) and their labels; dataset $k$ is `scales[k]`"
msgstr "数据集（例如位数或数字位数）及其标签；数据集 $k$ 为 `scales[k]`"

#: manual/api/bench.md:57
msgid "build the input for a scale; identify it in reports"
msgstr "为某一规模构建输入；在报告中标识该输入"

#: manual/api/bench.md:58
msgid "stateless implementations compared on the same input"
msgstr "在同一输入上进行比较的无状态实现"

#: manual/api/bench.md:59
msgid "the expected value for an input and the check of every output against it; nothing forces `reference` to be independent of the implementations"
msgstr "某个输入的期望值，以及将每个输出与之对照的检查；没有任何机制强制 `reference` 独立于各实现"

#: manual/api/bench.md:60
msgid "text forms for reports and replay"
msgstr "用于报告和重放的文本形式"

#: manual/api/bench.md:62
msgid "The specification keeps the last output of each batch as a sink (so the work cannot be optimized away), validates outputs with the reference oracle, uses one repetition unit, and describes each case as stateless and exact."
msgstr "该规格将每个批次的最后一个输出保留为汇点（sink，使计算无法被优化掉），用参考预言机验证输出，使用单一重复单位，并将每个用例描述为无状态且精确的。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:68
msgid "`environment(target, dtype_abi, run_id)` builds the environment snapshot recorded with every run."
msgstr "`environment(target, dtype_abi, run_id)` 构建随每次运行一起记录的环境快照。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:75
msgid "It records the target, a fixed toolchain label, the `release` profile and the given data-type ABI label; the performance and provenance fields that only the calling tool knows (CPU, frequency policy, commit) are marked `external-metadata`, and the source state as `working-tree`."
msgstr "它记录目标平台、一个固定的工具链标签、`release` 配置以及给定的数据类型 ABI 标签；只有调用工具才知道的性能与来源字段（CPU、频率策略、提交）被标记为 `external-metadata`，源码状态被标记为 `working-tree`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:82
msgid "`run(spec, environment, sink, seed, protocol)` compiles a specification and executes it, streaming observations to `sink`."
msgstr "`run(spec, environment, sink, seed, protocol)` 编译并执行一个规格，将观测数据以流的方式写入 `sink`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:89
msgid "`seed` is passed to the input generators through `@model.GenerationContext` and, under a `BalancedBlocks(s)` order policy, fixes the rotation offset $(s \\oplus \\mathit{seed}) \\bmod K$ of the $K$ implementations in every block; `protocol` is normally a preset such as `@runner.ProtocolPreset::Development.validated()`. The function aborts if the specification does not compile. The returned summary counts observations, calibrations, validations and oracle outcomes (`passed_count`, `failed_count`, …)."
msgstr "`seed` 通过 `@model.GenerationContext` 传给输入生成器，并且在 `BalancedBlocks(s)` 顺序策略下，固定每个区块中 $K$ 个实现的轮换偏移 $(s \\oplus \\mathit{seed}) \\bmod K$；`protocol` 通常是一个预设，例如 `@runner.ProtocolPreset::Development.validated()`。若规格无法编译，函数会中止。返回的摘要统计观测、校准、验证和预言机结果的数量（`passed_count`、`failed_count`、…）。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:98
msgid "Reducing observations"
msgstr "归约观测数据"

#: manual/api/bench.md:102
msgid "`paired_hotspot(observations, case_id, dataset_id, baseline_id, candidate_id, practical_delta_pct, seed)` compares two implementations on one dataset."
msgstr "`paired_hotspot(observations, case_id, dataset_id, baseline_id, candidate_id, practical_delta_pct, seed)` 在一个数据集上比较两个实现。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:109
msgid "It selects the valid confirmatory observations of each implementation for the case and dataset, orders them by block id, pairs them by position (the $j$-th remaining baseline sample with the $j$-th remaining candidate sample, not by equal block id) and calls `@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap` with 2000 resamples. The comparison's `relative_delta_pct` is $\\Delta_{\\%} = 100 \\cdot \\operatorname{med}(c - b) / \\operatorname{med}(b)$ (0 when $\\operatorname{med}(b) = 0$), and its `decision` is `Faster` when $\\Delta_{\\%} \\le -\\delta$, `Slower` when $\\Delta_{\\%} \\ge \\delta$ and `Equivalent` otherwise, for $\\delta$ = `practical_delta_pct`. Its `interval` is the 95 % percentile-bootstrap interval of the median paired difference $\\operatorname{med}(c - b)$, in microseconds. Errors: `MismatchedPairs` when the two implementations have different numbers of samples, `EmptySamples` when there are none, `NonFiniteSample` when a time is NaN or infinite."
msgstr "它为该用例和数据集选出每个实现的有效确认性观测，按区块编号排序，按位置配对（剩余的第 $j$ 个基线样本与剩余的第 $j$ 个候选样本配对，而不是按相同的区块编号配对），然后以 2000 次重采样调用 `@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap`。比较结果的 `relative_delta_pct` 为 $\\Delta_{\\%} = 100 \\cdot \\operatorname{med}(c - b) / \\operatorname{med}(b)$（当 $\\operatorname{med}(b) = 0$ 时为 0），其 `decision` 在 $\\Delta_{\\%} \\le -\\delta$ 时为 `Faster`，在 $\\Delta_{\\%} \\ge \\delta$ 时为 `Slower`，否则为 `Equivalent`，其中 $\\delta$ = `practical_delta_pct`。其 `interval` 为配对差中位数 $\\operatorname{med}(c - b)$ 的 95 % 百分位 bootstrap 区间，单位为微秒。错误：两个实现的样本数不同时为 `MismatchedPairs`，没有样本时为 `EmptySamples`，某个耗时为 NaN 或无穷时为 `NonFiniteSample`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:124
msgid "Pairing is by position after the filter: if one implementation has an invalid observation in some block and the other does not, the counts differ and the call returns `MismatchedPairs`; if both lose one observation in different blocks, the counts agree and later samples are paired across blocks."
msgstr "配对是在过滤之后按位置进行的：如果一个实现在某个区块中有一个无效观测而另一个没有，则两者的数量不同，调用返回 `MismatchedPairs`；如果两者各自在不同区块中丢失一个观测，则数量一致，后面的样本会跨区块配对。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:131
msgid "`confirmatory_regression(baseline, candidate, seed)` compares two paired sample arrays with a 95 % percentile-bootstrap interval."
msgstr "`confirmatory_regression(baseline, candidate, seed)` 用 95 % 百分位 bootstrap 区间比较两个配对的样本数组。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:138
msgid "The practical threshold is 3 %, the bootstrap uses 10 000 resamples, and the interval is on the median paired difference `candidate[j] - baseline[j]` in the samples' unit. The labels identify the baseline and the current candidate."
msgstr "实用阈值为 3 %，bootstrap 使用 10 000 次重采样，区间针对的是配对差值 `candidate[j] - baseline[j]` 的中位数，单位与样本相同。标签分别标识基线和当前候选。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:145
msgid "`is_significant_regression(comparison)` is true when the candidate is practically slower and the interval of the median difference lies entirely above zero."
msgstr "当候选在实用意义上更慢，且中位数差值的区间完全位于零之上时，`is_significant_regression(comparison)` 为真。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:153
msgid "That is, `decision` is `Slower` and `interval.low > 0`."
msgstr "即 `decision` 为 `Slower` 且 `interval.low > 0`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:168
msgid "Auto-tuning"
msgstr "自动调优"

#: manual/api/bench.md:172
msgid "`TuneDecision` is the implementation chosen for one dataset."
msgstr "`TuneDecision` 是为一个数据集选定的实现。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:183
msgid "`median_us` is the median per-call time of the chosen candidate and `valid_samples` the number of finite, non-negative confirmatory samples it was computed from."
msgstr "`median_us` 是所选候选的单次调用耗时中位数，`valid_samples` 是计算该中位数所用的有限且非负的确认性样本数。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:189
msgid "`tune_dataset(observations, case_id, dataset_id, candidate_ids, practical_delta_pct)` picks the fastest candidate for one dataset."
msgstr "`tune_dataset(observations, case_id, dataset_id, candidate_ids, practical_delta_pct)` 为一个数据集挑选最快的候选。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:196
msgid "For every candidate it takes the valid confirmatory observations of the case and dataset, and scores the candidate by the median of the finite, non-negative samples. Candidates without such samples are invalid. The result is the valid candidate with the smallest median, ties broken by the smaller candidate id; `None` when no candidate is valid. Because the score is used as both the primary and the secondary criterion of `@tune.select_best`, `practical_delta_pct` does not change the choice. Which secondary criterion is intended is open in [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60)."
msgstr "对每个候选，它取该用例和数据集的有效确认性观测，并以其中有限且非负样本的中位数为候选打分。没有此类样本的候选无效。结果是中位数最小的有效候选，平局时取候选 id 较小者；没有有效候选时为 `None`。由于该分数同时用作 `@tune.select_best` 的主要和次要判据，`practical_delta_pct` 不会改变选择结果。预期采用哪个次要判据尚在 [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60) 中讨论。"

