msgstr "`kernel/coefficient`（`BigInt`）、`core/bin-float`（`BinFloat` 运算符）、`full/checked`（`BinFloatResult`）"

#: manual/api/bench/bin_float.md:35
#: manual/design/bench/bin_float.md:36
msgid "`bin-float/elementary/OP` for 28 functions (`exp`, `exp2`, `exp10`, `expm1`, `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `log1p`, `sqrt`, `rootn`, `pow`, `hypot`, `sin`, `cos`, `tan`, `sinpi`, `cospi`, `tanpi`, `asin`, `acos`, `atan`, `atan2`, `sinh`, `cosh`, `tanh`, `asinh`, `acosh`, `atanh`)"
msgstr "`bin-float/elementary/OP`，涵盖 28 个函数（`exp`、`exp2`、`exp10`、`expm1`、`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`log1p`、`sqrt`、`rootn`、`pow`、`hypot`、`sin`、`cos`、`tan`、`sinpi`、`cospi`、`tanpi`、`asin`、`acos`、`atan`、`atan2`、`sinh`、`cosh`、`tanh`、`asinh`、`acosh`、`atanh`）"

#: manual/api/bench/bin_float.md:35
#: manual/design/bench/bin_float.md:36
