msgid "`external/binary/OP` for `add`, `mul`, `div`, `sqrt`, `exp`, `ln`, `sin`"
msgstr "`external/binary/OP`，OP 为 `add`、`mul`、`div`、`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln`、`sin`"

