msgstr "`floating`（以该规模为精度的 `BinFloat` 方法，舍入到最近偶数）"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:41
msgid "the MPFR result for each operand, bit for bit"
msgstr "每个操作数的 MPFR 结果，逐位一致"

