#: manual/api/bench/external.md:42
msgid "the libmpdec result for each operand, value for value"
msgstr "每个操作数的 libmpdec 结果，数值一致"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:44
msgid "Every case has a second implementation, `null`, next to `floating`: the same closure call and result store with the library call removed. Maremark runs the blocks of the two implementations interleaved (each with its own calibration), and the runner pairs them by block number. The null reads `expected` instead of the operands so that its output validates against the reference."
msgstr "每个用例在 `floating` 旁边都有第二个实现 `null`：同样的闭包调用和结果存储，但去掉库调用。Maremark 交错运行两个实现的块（各自单独校准），运行器按块号把它们配成对。`null` 读取 `expected` 而不是操作数，使其输出能通过对参考结果的验证。"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:50
msgid "One iteration of the timed function is one pass over the eight operand sets of the case, so a reported time per operation is the observation divided by eight. The scales and the operation list come from the operand file: the test runs the cases named by `EXTBENCH_CASES`, in that order, or every case of the file."
msgstr "被计时函数的一次迭代是对该用例八组操作数的一遍处理，因此报告的每次操作时间是观测值除以八。规模和操作列表来自操作数文件：测试按 `EXTBENCH_CASES` 指定的用例及其顺序运行，未设置时运行文件中的所有用例。"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:56
msgid "The inputs of the test are environment variables set by the runner:"
msgstr "测试的输入是由运行器设置的环境变量："

