msgstr "测量协议，与 C 测试程序收到的数值相同"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:66
msgid "The performance test is built for native, wasm (run by `moonrun`) and js (run by node), which is how the runner measures the floating side on those runtimes (`--target`). It is not built for wasm-gc: the module initialiser of the `moonbitlang/async` dependency (a cast between two struct types) is rejected by the runtime at validation there. The environment variables and the files are read the same way on the three targets."
msgstr "性能测试为 native、wasm（由 `moonrun` 运行）和 js（由 node 运行）构建，运行器正是借此在这些运行时上测量 `floating` 一侧（`--target`）。它不为 wasm-gc 构建：`moonbitlang/async` 依赖的模块初始化函数（一次在两个结构体类型之间的转换）在那里会被运行时在验证时拒绝。环境变量和文件在这三个目标上的读取方式相同。"

#: manual/api/bench/external.md:73
msgid "Three plan tests run in normal test runs (`external input rows group by case`, `external binary and decimal_gda plans compile`, `external operand parsing is exact`). The performance test `external baseline floating` is marked `#skip(\"performance benchmark\")` and builds on native only; the runner prints a `MAREMARK_JSONL=` line for every event, `EXTBENCH_CASE=kind/op/size round=R passed=P failed=F` for every case, and `EXTBENCH_FAILED=N` at the end."
msgstr "三个计划测试在常规测试运行中执行（`external input rows group by case`、`external binary and decimal_gda plans compile`、`external operand parsing is exact`）。性能测试 `external baseline floating` 标记为 `#skip(\"performance benchmark\")`，且仅在 native 上构建；运行器为每个事件打印一行 `MAREMARK_JSONL=`，为每个用例打印 `EXTBENCH_CASE=kind/op/size round=R passed=P failed=F`，最后打印 `EXTBENCH_FAILED=N`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1
msgid "bin_float API"
msgstr "bin_float API"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:5
msgid "`bin_float` is the binary floating-point core of `floating`. A `BinFloat` is a signed dyadic number $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$ with an arbitrary-precision coefficient, an attached working precision, and the IEEE 754 special values (signed zero, infinities, quiet and signaling NaNs with payloads). Every arithmetic operation rounds the exact result once. A `BinaryContext` gives the precision, exponent range, rounding direction and tininess rule of one operation, and the `*_ctx` methods return the IEEE status flags with the value. The [tutorial](../tutorial/bin_float.md) shows the common workflows and the [design page](../design/bin_float.md) derives the rounding, range and certification rules used below. The verified IEEE 754 scope is listed in [conformance](../conformance/bin_float.md)."
msgstr "`bin_float` 是 `floating` 的二进制浮点核心。`BinFloat` 是一个带符号的二进有理数 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$，具有任意精度的系数、附带的工作精度，以及 IEEE 754 特殊值（带符号零、无穷、带 payload 的静默 NaN 和信号 NaN）。每个算术运算都对精确结果只舍入一次。`BinaryContext` 给出单次运算的精度、指数范围、舍入方向和微小性（tininess）规则，`*_ctx` 方法在返回值的同时返回 IEEE 状态标志。[教程](../tutorial/bin_float.md)展示常见工作流程，[设计文档](../design/bin_float.md)推导下文所用的舍入、范围与认证规则。经过验证的 IEEE 754 范围列于[符合性](../conformance/bin_float.md)页面。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:17
msgid "Throughout this page, $p$ is a precision in bits, $\\circ(x)$ is the rounding of the real number $x$ under the active context, and \"the flags\" are the five IEEE exception flags of a `BinaryFlags` value."
msgstr "本页中，$p$ 表示以位为单位的精度，$\\circ(x)$ 表示实数 $x$ 在当前上下文下的舍入结果，“标志”指 `BinaryFlags` 值中的五个 IEEE 异常标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:23
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`, together with the two packages whose types appear in its signatures:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中添加该包，以及类型出现在其签名中的两个包："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:34
msgid "The examples call the package as `@bin_float.`. `@lf_arith` is `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`: its `RoundingMode`, `ArithmeticContext` and `ArithmeticError` types appear in several signatures, where the interface file prints the package as `@arithmetic`. `@def` is `Luna-Flow/floating/def`, which provides `Sign`, `PartialOrder` and the `Floating` trait. No helper functions are shared between examples."
msgstr "示例中以 `@bin_float.` 调用该包。`@lf_arith` 即 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`：其 `RoundingMode`、`ArithmeticContext` 和 `ArithmeticError` 类型出现在若干签名中，接口文件在这些签名中将该包打印为 `@arithmetic`。`@def` 即 `Luna-Flow/floating/def`，它提供 `Sign`、`PartialOrder` 以及 `Floating` trait。各示例之间不共享辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:41
msgid "Three ways to call an operation"
msgstr "调用运算的三种方式"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:43
msgid "Most operations come in up to three forms with one numerical algorithm behind them."
msgstr "大多数运算最多有三种形式，背后是同一个数值算法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:46
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:46
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:729
#: manual/api/decimal.md:547
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:485
msgid "Context"
msgstr "上下文"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:48
msgid "plain"
msgstr "普通"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:48
msgid "`BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`, nearest-even, `p` the precision of the operands"
msgstr "`BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`，就近偶数舍入，`p` 为操作数的精度"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:48
msgid "the value only"
msgstr "仅返回值"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:49
msgid "contextual"
msgstr "上下文式"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:49
#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:129
msgid "the given `BinaryContext`"
msgstr "给定的 `BinaryContext`"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:50
msgid "checked"
msgstr "checked"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:50
msgid "the given context, or the plain one"
msgstr "给定的上下文，或普通形式的上下文"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:50
msgid "`Result` with an `@lf_arith.ArithmeticError`"
msgstr "带 `@lf_arith.ArithmeticError` 的 `Result`"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:52
msgid "The plain form of a binary operation works at the larger precision of the two operands (the largest of three for `fma`). Its context is the extendable precision format of IEEE 754-2019 3.7 given by $p$ alone (see `BinaryContext`), whose exponent range is the implementation range below, so it overflows to an infinity and underflows to a signed zero or a tiny value only at about $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$."
msgstr "二元运算的普通形式以两个操作数中较大的精度工作（对 `fma` 为三者中最大的）。其上下文是 IEEE 754-2019 3.7 的可扩展精度格式，仅由 $p$ 给出（见 `BinaryContext`），其指数范围为下文所述的实现范围，因此只有在约 $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$ 时才会上溢为无穷或下溢为带符号零或极小值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:59
msgid "Values and limits"
msgstr "值与限制"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:63
msgid "The largest and smallest exponent of the leading bit that a finite `BinFloat` may carry."
msgstr "有限 `BinFloat` 的最高位所能具有的最大和最小指数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:71
msgid "They are $2^{30}-1 = 1073741823$ and $1 - (2^{30}-1) = -1073741822$, so $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$ as IEEE 754-2019 3.3 requires of every format. A context given by its precision alone, and every plain operation, uses them as $e_{\\max}$ and $e_{\\min}$: a result whose leading bit would lie above $e_{\\max}$ overflows, and below $e_{\\min}$ the value is subnormal with quantum $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$. The range of a context given by its precision alone is this range, so every stored value is a member of that context."
msgstr "它们是 $2^{30}-1 = 1073741823$ 和 $1 - (2^{30}-1) = -1073741822$，所以 $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$，正如 IEEE 754-2019 3.3 对每种格式所要求的。仅由精度给出的上下文以及每个普通运算都以它们作为 $e_{\\max}$ 和 $e_{\\min}$：最高位将位于 $e_{\\max}$ 之上的结果发生上溢，而在 $e_{\\min}$ 之下的值是量子为 $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$ 的次正规数。该范围同样适用于只由精度给出的上下文，所以每个存储的值都是该上下文的成员。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:81
msgid "The largest precision a `BinaryContext` accepts and the largest precision a `BinFloat` may carry. Every constructor that takes a precision checks it against `1..=binary_precision_max`: a value-returning constructor aborts with a message that names the constructor, the range and the offending value, and a constructor that returns a `Result` (`from_string`, `from_hex`, and the constructors of `BinFloatResult`) returns an `ArithmeticError` of kind `DomainError`. A precision is never replaced by another one."
msgstr "`BinaryContext` 接受的最大精度，也是 `BinFloat` 可以携带的最大精度。每个接受精度的构造函数都会按 `1..=binary_precision_max` 检查：返回值的构造函数会中止，并给出包含构造函数名、取值范围和错误取值的信息；返回 `Result` 的构造函数（`from_string`、`from_hex` 以及 `BinFloatResult` 的构造函数）返回类别为 `DomainError` 的 `ArithmeticError`。精度绝不会被替换成别的值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:93
msgid "It is $2^{28} = 268435456$ bits. Together with the exponent range it keeps every coefficient exponent inside the 32-bit `Int` range."
msgstr "它是 $2^{28} = 268435456$ 位。连同指数范围，它保证每个系数指数都在 32 位 `Int` 范围之内。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:96
msgid "Exact coefficients"
msgstr "精确系数"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:100
msgid "A non-negative arbitrary-precision integer, used as the coefficient of a `BinFloat` and as the bit pattern of an interchange encoding."
msgstr "一个非负的任意精度整数，用作 `BinFloat` 的系数以及交换编码的位模式。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:107
msgid "The inner type `@bin_kernel.Coeff` belongs to the internal package `internal/bin_kernel`, which only code inside `Luna-Flow/floating` can import. It carries no compatibility promise and a user cannot call a method on it, read it, compare it or build one: from outside the module a `BinCoeff` is opaque, and the field is public only so that the other packages of the library can unwrap it. The value is exact: on the native, LLVM and Wasm targets an inline 64- or 128-bit word or an array of 64-bit limbs, on JavaScript a host `bigint`; the representation is not observable, and the algorithm selection (schoolbook, Karatsuba, Toom-3, number-theoretic transform, staged division) is described in the [design page](../design/bin_float.md#the-coefficient-kernel). `Debug` prints the integer value."
msgstr "内部类型 `@bin_kernel.Coeff` 属于内部包 `internal/bin_kernel`，只有 `Luna-Flow/floating` 内部的代码才能导入它。它不带任何兼容性承诺，用户也无法对它调用方法、读取、比较或构造：在模块之外，`BinCoeff` 是不透明的，字段是公开的只是为了让库的其他包能够解包。其值是精确的：在 Native、LLVM 和 Wasm 目标上是内联的 64 位或 128 位字，或 64 位肢的数组；在 JavaScript 上是宿主 `bigint`；表示不可观察，算法选择（朴素乘法、Karatsuba、Toom-3、数论变换、分阶段除法）见[设计页](../design/bin_float.md#the-coefficient-kernel)。`Debug` 打印整数值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:121
msgid "Build a coefficient from a machine value."
msgstr "由机器值构建系数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:131
msgid "Convert between a coefficient and digits."
msgstr "在系数与数字串之间转换。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:139
msgid "`parse` reads a digit string in base `radix` (default 10, letters for digits above 9, an optional leading `+`); an empty string, a `-` sign, a digit outside the radix or a radix outside $[2, 36]$ is an `Err`. `to_string` prints base 10 and `to_radix_string` any radix in $[2, 36]$, in lower case without a prefix; it aborts for another radix."
msgstr "`parse` 读取以 `radix` 为基数的数字串（默认 10，大于 9 的数字用字母表示，可带一个前导 `+`）；空串、`-` 号、超出基数的数字或不在 $[2, 36]$ 内的基数均为 `Err`。`to_string` 输出十进制，`to_radix_string` 输出 $[2, 36]$ 内任意基数，使用小写且不带前缀；对其他基数它会中止。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:147
msgid "Convert between a coefficient and big-endian bytes."
msgstr "在系数与大端字节序列之间转换。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:154
msgid "`to_bytes_be` uses the minimal number of bytes; leading zero bytes are ignored by `from_bytes_be`."
msgstr "`to_bytes_be` 使用最少的字节数；`from_bytes_be` 忽略前导零字节。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:159
msgid "Returns the value as a `UInt64`, or `None` when it needs more than 64 bits."
msgstr "以 `UInt64` 返回该值；若需要多于 64 位则返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:167
msgid "Queries."
msgstr "查询。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:174
msgid "`bit_length` is $\\lfloor \\log_2 c \\rfloor + 1$ for $c > 0$ and $0$ for zero."
msgstr "对 $c > 0$，`bit_length` 是 $\\lfloor \\log_2 c \\rfloor + 1$；对零是 $0$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:178
msgid "Exact comparison."
msgstr "精确比较。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:185
msgid "`compare` returns $-1$, $0$ or $1$; `equal` is numerical equality, which for natural numbers is the same as equality of representations. The operators `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=`, `==` and `!=` use them (see [Trait implementations](#trait-implementations))."
msgstr "`compare` 返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$；`equal` 是数值相等，对自然数而言与表示相等相同。运算符 `<`、`<=`、`>`、`>=`、`==` 和 `!=` 使用它们（参见 [trait 实现](#trait-implementations)）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:190
msgid "`BinCoeff` also implements `Eq`, `Compare`, `Show` and `Debug`; the promoted trait methods are listed under [Trait implementations](#trait-implementations). It has no arithmetic, shifts, bit operations or GCD: they are internal to the library (the package `internal/bin_kernel`), and arithmetic on values is done with `BinFloat` or, on a coefficient read with `coefficient()`, after converting it with `to_string` or `to_bytes_be`."
msgstr "`BinCoeff` 还实现了 `Eq`、`Compare`、`Show` 和 `Debug`；提升后的 trait 方法列在 [Trait 实现](#trait-implementations)下。它没有算术、移位、位运算或 GCD：这些是库的内部功能（包 `internal/bin_kernel`），对值的算术请用 `BinFloat`，或者对用 `coefficient()` 读出的系数，先用 `to_string` 或 `to_bytes_be` 转换。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:209
msgid "The value type"
msgstr "值类型"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:213
msgid "A binary floating-point value: a finite dyadic number, a signed infinity or a NaN, with a working precision. Its representation is an internal type (`@bin_kernel.BinRepr`, like the coefficient of `BinCoeff`) that carries no compatibility promise and is read only inside the package; a value is one heap object."
msgstr "一个二进制浮点值：有限的二进有理数、带符号的无穷或 NaN，并带有工作精度。其表示是内部类型（`@bin_kernel.BinRepr`，与 `BinCoeff` 的系数类似），不承诺兼容性，只在包内读取；一个值就是一个堆对象。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:223
msgid "A finite value is $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$ with $s$ the sign bit, $c$ a `BinCoeff` and $e$ = `exponent2()`. Every value built through this API is normalized: a nonzero $c$ is odd (factors of two are moved into $e$), a zero has $c = 0$ and $e = 0$ and keeps its sign, and $c$ has at most `precision()` bits. The precision is an attribute of the value: plain operations work at the larger precision of their operands, and contextual operations stamp the context precision on their result."
msgstr "有限值为 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$，其中 $s$ 为符号位，$c$ 为 `BinCoeff`，$e$ = `exponent2()`。通过本 API 构建的每个值都是规范化的：非零的 $c$ 是奇数（2 的因子移入 $e$），零具有 $c = 0$ 和 $e = 0$ 并保留其符号，且 $c$ 至多有 `precision()` 位。精度是值的属性：普通运算以其操作数中较大的精度工作，上下文式运算则将上下文精度标记到结果上。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:231
msgid "`==` agrees with `compare`: `a == b` exactly when `a.compare(b) == 0`, so two values are equal when they are the same number, whatever their precisions (`one(precision=53) == one(precision=24)`, `-0 == +0`), and every NaN equals every other NaN. This is the total preorder in which `<`, `<=` and sorting work (every NaN equal to every NaN and above every number), the rule of `Decimal` too. It is not IEEE equality: use `compare_quiet_equal` (IEEE Std 754-2019 5.6.1, 5.11) when a NaN must be unordered. `BinFloat` has no `Hash`. `identical` is the structural question."
msgstr "`==` 与 `compare` 一致：`a == b` 恰好在 `a.compare(b) == 0` 时成立，所以两个值是同一个数时相等，不论精度如何（`one(precision=53) == one(precision=24)`、`-0 == +0`），并且每个 NaN 与其他每个 NaN 相等。这是 `<`、`<=` 和排序所用的全预序（每个 NaN 与每个 NaN 相等，且在每个数之上），`Decimal` 也是这条规则。它不是 IEEE 相等：当 NaN 必须无序时，使用 `compare_quiet_equal`（IEEE Std 754-2019 5.6.1、5.11）。`BinFloat` 没有 `Hash`。`identical` 是结构性的判断。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:245
msgid "The structural equality of two values: the same class, sign (the sign of a zero included), coefficient, exponent and precision, and for a NaN the same signaling bit and payload. It distinguishes `-0` from `+0`, a value of precision 53 from the same value of precision 24, and two NaNs of different kind or payload, and a NaN is identical to an identical NaN. It is what `==` was before 0.12; use it where a result is checked as a datum (a test of the sign of a zero or of the precision stamped by a contextual operation), and `==` where the number is meant."
msgstr "两个值的结构相等：类别、符号（包括零的符号）、系数、指数和精度都相同，对 NaN 则信号位和有效载荷也相同。它区分 `-0` 与 `+0`、精度 53 的值与精度 24 的同一个值、以及种类或有效载荷不同的两个 NaN；NaN 与一个相同的 NaN 是 identical。它就是 0.12 之前的 `==`；在把结果当作数据检查时使用它（检查零的符号或上下文运算盖上的精度的测试），在意指数时用 `==`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:255
msgid "Builds a finite value $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$ rounded to `precision` bits."
msgstr "构建舍入到 `precision` 位的有限值 $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot c \\cdot 2^{e}$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:262
msgid "The arguments are the coefficient, the exponent $e$ and the precision. When the coefficient has more significant bits than the precision it is rounded with `mode` (default `ToNearestEven`). The result is normalized. A precision outside `1..=binary_precision_max` aborts. A value outside the implementation exponent range is replaced as an overflow or underflow would be: above it by $\\pm\\infty$ or, for a mode that rounds toward zero, the largest finite magnitude $(2^p - 1)\\,2^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$; below the smallest implementation subnormal $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$ by $\\pm 0$ or, for a mode that rounds away from zero (and for nearest when the value exceeds half of it), by that subnormal. `make` rounds precision and range together, in `mode`: a value between the smallest subnormal and $2^{e_{\\min}}$ keeps only the bits on the subnormal grid $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$ (at least one), so the stored value never has a bit below that grid. This matters only at magnitudes near $2^{-2^{30}}$; `round_ctx` additionally reports the flags."
msgstr "参数依次为系数、指数 $e$ 和精度。当系数的有效位数多于精度时，按 `mode`（默认为 `ToNearestEven`）舍入。结果是规范化的。超出 `1..=binary_precision_max` 的精度会中止。超出实现指数范围的值会像发生上溢或下溢时那样被替换：高于该范围时替换为 $\\pm\\infty$，或者对向零舍入的模式替换为最大有限绝对值 $(2^p - 1)\\,2^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$；低于实现的最小次正规数 $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$ 时替换为 $\\pm 0$，或者对远离零舍入的模式（以及值超过其一半时的就近舍入）替换为该次正规数。`make` 把精度和范围放在一起舍入，按 `mode`：介于最小次正规数与 $2^{e_{\\min}}$ 之间的值只保留次正规网格 $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$ 上的位（至少一位），所以存储的值在该网格之下没有任何位。这只在绝对值接近 $2^{-2^{30}}$ 时才有影响；`round_ctx` 还会额外报告标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:279
msgid "Build a value from an integer."
msgstr "由整数构建值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:286
msgid "The default precision is 53. The integer is rounded to nearest-even when it has more significant bits than the precision; `from_int(n)` is exact for every `Int` at the default precision."
msgstr "默认精度为 53。当整数的有效位多于精度时，按就近舍入（偶数优先）处理；在默认精度下，`from_int(n)` 对每个 `Int` 都是精确的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:292
msgid "Decode a host binary64 or binary32 value exactly."
msgstr "精确解码宿主的 binary64 或 binary32 值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:299
msgid "The defaults are 53 and 24 bits, so the conversion is exact. `from_double` preserves signed zeros, infinities, the NaN sign, the quiet/signaling distinction and the NaN payload (the fraction field without the quiet bit). `from_float` first widens the `Float` to a `Double` on the host and then decodes that: numbers, zeros and infinities are unaffected, but a NaN keeps the payload of the widened binary64 encoding (the binary32 payload times $2^{29}$), and on the native target a signaling `Float` NaN arrives as a quiet NaN. Use `BinaryInterchange::from_hex` with `Binary32` to decode binary32 NaNs bit-exactly. The value is the one the host already rounded: `from_double(0.1)` is $3602879701896397 \\cdot 2^{-55}$, not one tenth. Use `from_string` to round a decimal literal directly."
msgstr "默认值分别为 53 位和 24 位，因此转换是精确的。`from_double` 保留有符号零、无穷、NaN 的符号、静默/信号之分以及 NaN 载荷（不含 quiet 位的小数字段）。`from_float` 先在宿主上将 `Float` 扩宽为 `Double`，再对其解码：数值、零和无穷不受影响，但 NaN 保留的是扩宽后 binary64 编码的载荷（binary32 载荷乘以 $2^{29}$），并且在 native 目标上，信号 `Float` NaN 到达时已成为静默 NaN。若要逐位精确地解码 binary32 NaN，请将 `BinaryInterchange::from_hex` 与 `Binary32` 一起使用。所得的值是宿主已经舍入过的值：`from_double(0.1)` 为 $3602879701896397 \\cdot 2^{-55}$，而不是十分之一。若要直接舍入十进制字面量，请使用 `from_string`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:313
msgid "Build the constants $+0$, $-0$, $1$ and $\\pm\\infty$."
msgstr "构建常量 $+0$、$-0$、$1$ 和 $\\pm\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:322
msgid "The default precision is 53, and it must be within `1..=binary_precision_max` (see `binary_precision_max`). `inf(Sign::Negative)` is $-\\infty$; any other sign gives $+\\infty$."
msgstr "默认精度为 53，并且必须在 `1..=binary_precision_max` 之内（见 `binary_precision_max`）。`inf(Sign::Negative)` 为 $-\\infty$；任何其他符号都给出 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:328
msgid "Build NaNs."
msgstr "构建 NaN。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:336
msgid "`nan()` is a positive quiet NaN with payload 0. A signaling NaN always has a nonzero payload (the default and a requested 0 both become 1)."
msgstr "`nan()` 是 payload 为 0 的正静默 NaN。信号 NaN 的 payload 总是非零（默认值和请求的 0 都会变为 1）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:339
msgid "A NaN of precision $p$ has $p - 2$ payload bits (IEEE 754-2019 6.2.1: the trailing significand field has $p - 1$ bits and the first is the quiet bit), so none for $p \\le 2$. `quiet_nan` and `signaling_nan` abort when the payload is wider, and `signaling_nan` aborts for $p < 3$, where no signaling NaN exists (a signaling NaN needs a non-zero payload bit). Conversions never abort: a payload that the destination cannot hold keeps its low bits (6.2.3), and a signaling NaN whose payload does not survive becomes quiet. This is the rule of `with_precision`, `from_double`, `from_float`, `from_hex` (a `snan` literal below precision 3 is a quiet NaN), every operation that returns a quiet NaN under a context (the payload is cut to the context precision) and the interchange encodings."
msgstr "精度为 $p$ 的 NaN 有 $p - 2$ 位 payload（IEEE 754-2019 6.2.1：尾数字段有 $p - 1$ 位，其中第一位是 quiet 位），所以 $p \\le 2$ 时没有 payload 位。payload 更宽时，`quiet_nan` 和 `signaling_nan` 会中止；$p < 3$ 时 `signaling_nan` 也会中止，因为那里不存在信号 NaN（信号 NaN 需要一个非零的 payload 位）。转换从不中止：目标无法容纳的 payload 保留其低位（6.2.3），payload 未能保留的信号 NaN 变为静默 NaN。这条规则适用于 `with_precision`、`from_double`、`from_float`、`from_hex`（精度低于 3 时 `snan` 字面量是静默 NaN）、在某个上下文下返回静默 NaN 的每个运算（payload 被截断到上下文精度）以及交换格式编码。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:351
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:251
msgid "Observing a value"
msgstr "观察值"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:355
msgid "Report the class and sign of a value."
msgstr "报告值的类别和符号。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:363
msgid "`classify` returns `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN` (zeros are `Finite`). `sign` is `Zero` for every zero and every NaN, and `Positive` or `Negative` otherwise. `is_negative` returns the sign bit itself, which is set for $-0$, $-\\infty$ and negative NaNs. `@def.is_finite`, `@def.is_nan`, `@def.is_infinite` and `@def.is_zero` work on `BinFloat` through the `Floating` trait; the methods of the next section give the same answers without the trait."
msgstr "`classify` 返回 `Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`（零属于 `Finite`）。`sign` 对所有零和所有 NaN 为 `Zero`，否则为 `Positive` 或 `Negative`。`is_negative` 返回符号位本身，它对 $-0$、$-\\infty$ 和负 NaN 是置位的。`@def.is_finite`、`@def.is_nan`、`@def.is_infinite` 和 `@def.is_zero` 通过 `Floating` trait 作用于 `BinFloat`；下一节的方法不经过 trait 给出相同的答案。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:372
msgid "The ten-valued class of IEEE 754-2019 clause 5.7.2 and its predicates."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 第 5.7.2 条的十值类别及其谓词。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:383
msgid "`class_of` returns one of the ten values of [`IeeeClass`](def.md#ieeeclass): `SignalingNaN`, `QuietNaN`, `NegativeInfinity`, `NegativeNormal`, `NegativeSubnormal`, `NegativeZero`, `PositiveZero`, `PositiveSubnormal`, `PositiveNormal` and `PositiveInfinity`. A nonzero finite value is normal when the exponent of its leading bit is at least the context's $e_{\\min}$ and subnormal when it is below; a `BinFloat` carries no format, so the context decides, and `BinaryInterchangeFormat::context` gives the one of a binary interchange format. A context given by its precision alone has the implementation limit `binary_implementation_e_min` as `e_min`. `is_normal` and `is_subnormal` are true exactly for the normal and subnormal classes; `is_finite` is true for zeros, subnormals and normals, `is_infinite` for the two infinities and `is_nan` for both NaNs. None of them rounds or raises a flag, and `classify` keeps its three-valued meaning."
msgstr "`class_of` 返回 [`IeeeClass`](def.md#ieeeclass) 十个值之一：`SignalingNaN`、`QuietNaN`、`NegativeInfinity`、`NegativeNormal`、`NegativeSubnormal`、`NegativeZero`、`PositiveZero`、`PositiveSubnormal`、`PositiveNormal` 和 `PositiveInfinity`。非零有限值在其最高位的指数不小于上下文的 $e_{\\min}$ 时是正规数，小于时是次正规数；`BinFloat` 不带格式，所以由上下文决定，二进制交换格式对应的上下文由 `BinaryInterchangeFormat::context` 给出。仅由精度给出的上下文以实现极限 `binary_implementation_e_min` 作为 `e_min`。`is_normal` 和 `is_subnormal` 恰好对正规类和次正规类为真；`is_finite` 对零、次正规数和正规数为真，`is_infinite` 对两个无穷为真，`is_nan` 对两种 NaN 为真。它们都不舍入，也不产生标志，`classify` 仍是三值的含义。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:399
msgid "Special-value predicates."
msgstr "特殊值谓词。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:409
msgid "`nan_payload` is zero for a value that is not a NaN."
msgstr "对非 NaN 的值，`nan_payload` 为零。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:413
msgid "Return the stored representation."
msgstr "返回存储的表示。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:421
msgid "For a finite value the number is `coefficient()` $\\times 2^{\\texttt{exponent2()}}$ with the sign applied. The coefficient and exponent of an infinity or NaN carry no meaning."
msgstr "对有限值，其数值为 `coefficient()` $\\times 2^{\\texttt{exponent2()}}$ 再带上符号。无穷或 NaN 的系数和指数没有意义。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:425
msgid "`coefficient()` builds a `BinCoeff` on each call for a value of at most 128 coefficient bits (the value stores its coefficient as one or two machine words), so it allocates there; for a wider value it returns the stored coefficient. A loop that reads the coefficient of many small values pays one allocation per call. `BinFloat` has no public word reader; the result's `BinCoeff::to_uint64` gives the value when it fits 64 bits. The exponent of the leading bit, which is what most callers read the coefficient for, is `ilogb()`, which does not allocate."
msgstr "对于系数至多 128 位的值，`coefficient()` 每次调用都会构造一个 `BinCoeff`（该值把系数存为一个或两个机器字），所以在这里会分配内存；对于更宽的值，它返回已存储的系数。对许多小值逐个读取系数的循环，每次调用付出一次分配。`BinFloat` 没有公开的字读取器；结果的 `BinCoeff::to_uint64` 在值适合 64 位时给出该值。多数调用者读取系数是为了得到最高位的指数，这个指数是 `ilogb()`，它不分配内存。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:436
msgid "Returns the canonical representation of a finite value at its own precision."
msgstr "返回有限值在其自身精度下的规范表示。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:442
msgid "Values built through the public API are already canonical, so this is the identity on them; infinities and NaNs are returned unchanged."
msgstr "通过公共 API 构建的值已经是规范的，因此对它们而言这是恒等操作；无穷和 NaN 原样返回。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:447
msgid "Rounds a value to a new working precision."
msgstr "将值舍入到新的工作精度。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:453
msgid "A finite value with more significant bits than the new precision is rounded in the given direction (`@lf_arith.RoundingMode` has no ties-to-away mode; use `round_ctx` for it). Zeros, infinities and NaNs only change their precision attribute. No flags are reported; use `round_ctx` when they matter."
msgstr "有效位多于新精度的有限值按给定方向舍入（`@lf_arith.RoundingMode` 没有 ties-to-away 模式；如需该模式请使用 `round_ctx`）。零、无穷和 NaN 只改变其精度属性。不报告标志；需要标志时请使用 `round_ctx`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:460
msgid "Returns the unit in the last place of a finite value at its own precision."
msgstr "返回有限值在其自身精度下的最后一位单位（ulp）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:466
msgid ""
"For $x \\n"
"e 0$ with leading-bit exponent $t = \\lfloor \\log_2 |x| \\rfloor$ the result is $2^{t-p+1}$. For zero it is $2^{1-p}$, and for an infinity or NaN it is a quiet NaN. The spacing ignores any context exponent range, so it is not the subnormal spacing of an IEEE format."
msgstr ""
"对于 $x \\n"
"e 0$，记最高位指数为 $t = \\lfloor \\log_2 |x| \\rfloor$，结果为 $2^{t-p+1}$。对零为 $2^{1-p}$，对无穷或 NaN 为静默 NaN。该间距忽略任何上下文指数范围，因此它不是 IEEE 格式中的次正规间距。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:494
msgid "Plain arithmetic"
msgstr "普通算术"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:498
msgid "The four operations and negation, also available as `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-`."
msgstr "四则运算与取负，也可以通过 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 和一元 `-` 使用。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:514
msgid "The result is the exact sum, difference, product or quotient rounded once to nearest-even at the larger operand precision, with the implementation exponent range. Special values follow IEEE 754: NaNs propagate (the first NaN operand, quieted), $\\infty - \\infty$, $0 \\cdot \\infty$, $0/0$ and $\\infty/\\infty$ are NaN, and a nonzero number divided by zero is a signed infinity. Flags are discarded; use the [contextual forms](#contextual-arithmetic) to observe them. `neg` flips the sign bit of every value, including zeros and NaNs, and never rounds."
msgstr "结果是精确的和、差、积或商，以较大的操作数精度、在实现指数范围内就近舍入（偶数优先）一次。特殊值遵循 IEEE 754：NaN 会传播（取第一个 NaN 操作数并静默化），$\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\cdot \\infty$、$0/0$ 和 $\\infty/\\infty$ 为 NaN，非零数除以零得到带符号无穷。标志被丢弃；要观察标志请使用[上下文式形式](#contextual-arithmetic)。`neg` 翻转每个值的符号位，包括零和 NaN，并且从不舍入。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:525
msgid "Clear or copy the sign bit."
msgstr "清除或复制符号位。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:532
msgid "Both are quiet IEEE sign-bit operations: they never round, never raise a flag and keep NaN payloads. `x.copy_sign(y)` has the magnitude of `x` and the sign bit of `y`."
msgstr "二者都是静默的 IEEE 符号位运算：从不舍入，从不触发标志，并保留 NaN payload。`x.copy_sign(y)` 具有 `x` 的绝对值和 `y` 的符号位。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:538
msgid "Divides, returning an error for an invalid operation or a division by zero."
msgstr "做除法，遇到无效运算或除以零时返回错误。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:544
msgid "The result is that of `div`, except for the two IEEE 754-2019 exceptions without a usable value: an invalid operation (§7.2: $0/0$, $\\infty/\\infty$ or a signaling NaN operand) is a `domain_error`, and a finite non-zero dividend over a signed zero (§7.3) is a `division_by_zero` error. A quiet NaN operand gives `Ok` of a quiet NaN (§6.2), and $\\pm\\infty/0$ gives `Ok` of the signed infinity."
msgstr "结果与 `div` 相同，只有两种没有可用值的 IEEE 754-2019 异常除外：无效运算（§7.2：$0/0$、$\\infty/\\infty$ 或信号 NaN 操作数）为 `domain_error`，有限非零被除数除以带符号零（§7.3）为 `division_by_zero` 错误。静默 NaN 操作数给出静默 NaN 的 `Ok`（§6.2），$\\pm\\infty/0$ 给出带符号无穷的 `Ok`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:553
msgid "Correctly rounded square root."
msgstr "正确舍入的平方根。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:559
msgid "`x.sqrt()` rounds $\\sqrt{x}$ to nearest-even at the precision of `x`: it is `sqrt_ctx` under the working context and never fails. An invalid operation (IEEE 754-2019 7.2: a negative nonzero argument, $-\\infty$ included, or a signaling NaN) is a quiet NaN, and the flag is read through `sqrt_ctx(...).1.invalid_operation()`. $\\sqrt{-0} = -0$, and a quiet NaN of either sign gives a quiet NaN. For a square root at another precision or rounding direction use `sqrt_ctx`; its results under `RoundTowardNegative` and `RoundTowardPositive` enclose $\\sqrt{x}$ and coincide when the root is exact."
msgstr "`x.sqrt()` 以 `x` 的精度将 $\\sqrt{x}$ 就近舍入（偶数优先）：它是工作上下文下的 `sqrt_ctx`，从不失败。无效运算（IEEE 754-2019 7.2：负的非零参数，包括 $-\\infty$，或信号 NaN）得到静默 NaN，原因通过 `sqrt_ctx(...).1.invalid_operation()` 读取。$\\sqrt{-0} = -0$，任一符号的静默 NaN 给出静默 NaN。需要其他精度或舍入方向的平方根时使用 `sqrt_ctx`：它在 `RoundTowardNegative` 与 `RoundTowardPositive` 下的结果夹住 $\\sqrt{x}$，平方根精确时两者相等。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:570
msgid "Raise a value to an integer power."
msgstr "计算值的整数次幂。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:576
msgid "The result is $x^n$ correctly rounded to nearest-even at the precision of `x`, computed as in `pown_ctx`, and never fails. A zero base with a negative exponent is an infinity (the sign of the base for an odd exponent; `pown_ctx(...).1.division_by_zero()` is the pole), and a signaling NaN base a quiet NaN for every exponent, zero included (IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 excludes it from $x^0 = 1$; `invalid_operation` through `pown_ctx`); $x^0 = 1$ for every other $x$, a quiet NaN included."
msgstr "结果是以 `x` 的精度就近舍入（偶数优先）的正确舍入 $x^n$，计算方式同 `pown_ctx`，从不失败。零底数配负指数为无穷（奇数指数时取底数的符号；`pown_ctx(...).1.division_by_zero()` 表示极点），信号 NaN 底数对任意指数（包括零）都为静默 NaN（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 将其排除在 $x^0 = 1$ 之外；通过 `pown_ctx` 得到 `invalid_operation`）；对其余任意 $x$（包括静默 NaN），$x^0 = 1$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:586
msgid "Fused multiply-add: $x \\cdot y + z$ with a single rounding."
msgstr "融合乘加：只舍入一次的 $x \\cdot y + z$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:592
msgid "The precision is the largest of the three operand precisions. See [`fma_ctx`](#binfloatfma_ctx) for the special cases."
msgstr "精度为三个操作数精度中的最大者。特殊情形参见 [`fma_ctx`](#binfloatfma_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:597
msgid "IEEE 754 remainder $x - n y$, where $n$ is the integer nearest $x/y$ with ties to even."
msgstr "IEEE 754 余数 $x - n y$，其中 $n$ 是最接近 $x/y$ 的整数，平局时取偶数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:604
msgid "The result is exact whenever it fits the larger operand precision, which is always the case for operands of that precision (the proof is on the [design page](../design/bin_float.md#ieee-remainder-is-exact)). See [`remainder_ctx`](#binfloatremainder_ctx)."
msgstr "只要结果能以较大的操作数精度表示，它就是精确的；对于该精度的操作数，这总是成立（证明见[设计文档](../design/bin_float.md#ieee-remainder-is-exact)）。参见 [`remainder_ctx`](#binfloatremainder_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:623
msgid "Contexts, rounding and flags"
msgstr "上下文、舍入与标志"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:627
msgid "The rounding-direction attribute of a context."
msgstr "上下文的舍入方向属性。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:639
msgid "These are the five IEEE 754-2019 rounding-direction attributes (clauses 4.3.1 and 4.3.2); `RoundTiesToAway` is not required of a binary format but is defined. There is no away-from-zero mode: `@lf_arith.RoundingMode::AwayFromZero` has no IEEE 754-2019 counterpart and is refused by `from_arithmetic` and `from_arithmetic_context`. Each mode is a monotone map $\\mathbb{R} \\to F \\cup \\{\\pm\\infty\\}$; the [design page](../design/bin_float.md#rounding-functions) defines them."
msgstr "这些是 IEEE 754-2019 的五种舍入方向属性（4.3.1 和 4.3.2 条）；`RoundTiesToAway` 对二进制格式不是必需的，但有定义。没有远离零的模式：`@lf_arith.RoundingMode::AwayFromZero` 在 IEEE 754-2019 中没有对应项，会被 `from_arithmetic` 和 `from_arithmetic_context` 拒绝。每种模式都是一个单调映射 $\\mathbb{R} \\to F \\cup \\{\\pm\\infty\\}$；[设计页面](../design/bin_float.md#rounding-functions)对它们作了定义。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:649
msgid "Convert to and from `@lf_arith.RoundingMode`."
msgstr "与 `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` 相互转换。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:656
msgid "`to_arithmetic(RoundTiesToAway)` is `None`, because `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` has no ties-to-away mode, and `from_arithmetic(AwayFromZero)` is `None`, because IEEE 754-2019 4.3 has no such attribute; the other modes map one to one."
msgstr "`to_arithmetic(RoundTiesToAway)` 为 `None`，因为 `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` 没有 ties-to-away 模式，`from_arithmetic(AwayFromZero)` 为 `None`，因为 IEEE 754-2019 4.3 没有这样的属性；其他模式一一对应。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:662
msgid "When a nonzero result counts as tiny for the underflow flag."
msgstr "非零结果在何种情况下对下溢标志而言算作微小。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:671
msgid "`BeforeRounding` calls a result tiny when the exact value has $|x| < 2^{e_{\\min}}$. `AfterRounding` calls it tiny when $x$ rounded to $p$ bits with an unbounded exponent range has magnitude below $2^{e_{\\min}}$ (IEEE 754-2019 clause 7.5). The default is `AfterRounding`. Underflow is signaled only for a tiny result that is also inexact."
msgstr "`BeforeRounding` 在精确值满足 $|x| < 2^{e_{\\min}}$ 时认为结果微小。`AfterRounding` 在 $x$ 以无界指数范围舍入到 $p$ 位后绝对值低于 $2^{e_{\\min}}$ 时认为结果微小（IEEE 754-2019 第 7.5 条）。默认为 `AfterRounding`。只有既微小又不精确的结果才会触发下溢。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:679
msgid "The format and the attributes of one operation: the precision $p$, the exponent $e_{\\max}$ (with $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$, IEEE 754-2019 3.3), the rounding-direction attribute and the tininess rule."
msgstr "一次运算的格式和属性：精度 $p$、指数 $e_{\\max}$（其中 $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$，IEEE 754-2019 3.3）、舍入方向属性和 tininess 规则。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:689
msgid "A context is an immutable value; there is no global or thread state. $e_{\\min}$ and $e_{\\max}$ are exponents of the leading bit, as in IEEE 754: a normal number satisfies $2^{e_{\\min}} \\le |x| < 2^{e_{\\max}+1}$, the largest finite value is $(2 - 2^{1-p})\\,2^{e_{\\max}}$ and the smallest positive subnormal is $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$. A context has no separate $e_{\\min}$: it is $1 - e_{\\max}$. Without an `e_max` the context is the extendable precision format of IEEE 754-2019 3.7 specified by $p$ alone, and $e_{\\max}$ is `binary_implementation_e_max`."
msgstr "上下文是不可变的值；不存在全局或线程状态。与 IEEE 754 一样，$e_{\\min}$ 和 $e_{\\max}$ 是最高位的指数：正规数满足 $2^{e_{\\min}} \\le |x| < 2^{e_{\\max}+1}$，最大有限值为 $(2 - 2^{1-p})\\,2^{e_{\\max}}$，最小正次正规数为 $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$。上下文没有单独的 $e_{\\min}$：它就是 $1 - e_{\\max}$。没有 `e_max` 时，上下文是仅由 $p$ 指定的 IEEE 754-2019 3.7 的可扩展精度格式，$e_{\\max}$ 为 `binary_implementation_e_max`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:700
msgid "Build a context."
msgstr "构建上下文。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:707
msgid "Defaults: $p = 53$, `e_max = binary_implementation_e_max`, `RoundTiesToEven`, `AfterRounding`; `new()` is therefore the extendable format of 53 bits, and every operation of the package runs in it. `new` aborts when $p$ is outside $[1, 2^{28}]$ or $e_{\\max}$ is outside $[1, 2^{30}-1]$, naming the parameter; `try_new` returns a `domain_error` in those cases. $e_{\\max} \\ge 1$ is what makes $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max} \\le e_{\\max}$; IEEE 754-2019 3.7 NOTE 3 recommends $p \\ge 3$ and $e_{\\max} \\ge 2$, which are not enforced. There is no one-sided or asymmetric range: `unbounded(p)` and the `e_min` argument no longer exist."
msgstr "默认值：$p = 53$，`e_max = binary_implementation_e_max`，`RoundTiesToEven`，`AfterRounding`；因此 `new()` 是 53 位的可扩展格式，本包的每个运算都能在其中运行。当 $p$ 超出 $[1, 2^{28}]$ 或 $e_{\\max}$ 超出 $[1, 2^{30}-1]$ 时，`new` 会中止并指出该参数；这些情况下 `try_new` 返回 `domain_error`。$e_{\\max} \\ge 1$ 保证 $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max} \\le e_{\\max}$；IEEE 754-2019 3.7 的注 3 建议 $p \\ge 3$ 且 $e_{\\max} \\ge 2$，但不强制执行。不存在单侧或不对称的范围：`unbounded(p)` 和 `e_min` 参数都不再存在。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:718
msgid "Contexts of the IEEE 754 interchange formats."
msgstr "IEEE 754 交换格式的上下文。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:727
msgid "Each is `BinaryInterchangeFormat::context` of the format:"
msgstr "每个都是相应格式的 `BinaryInterchangeFormat::context`："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:738
msgid "Converts an `@lf_arith.ArithmeticContext`."
msgstr "转换一个 `@lf_arith.ArithmeticContext`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:744
msgid "Precision and rounding are copied; the `clamp` field has no binary meaning and is ignored; tininess is `AfterRounding`. A given `e_min` must equal $1 - e_{\\max}$, and `e_min` alone gives $e_{\\max} = 1 - e_{\\min}$. The result is an `Err` for `AwayFromZero`, an `e_min` that is not $1 - e_{\\max}$, and a precision or `e_max` outside the limits of `try_new`."
msgstr "精度和舍入被复制；`clamp` 字段在二进制中没有意义，被忽略；tininess 为 `AfterRounding`。给定的 `e_min` 必须等于 $1 - e_{\\max}$，仅给出 `e_min` 时得到 $e_{\\max} = 1 - e_{\\min}$。对于 `AwayFromZero`、不等于 $1 - e_{\\max}$ 的 `e_min`，以及超出 `try_new` 限制的精度或 `e_max`，结果为 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:752
msgid "Read the fields of a context."
msgstr "读取上下文的字段。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:762
msgid "`e_min` is always $1 - e_{\\max}$; both are plain integers."
msgstr "`e_min` 恒为 $1 - e_{\\max}$；二者都是普通整数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:766
msgid "Copy a context with one parameter changed."
msgstr "复制上下文并更改一个参数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:775
msgid "`with_precision` and `with_e_max` abort outside the limits of `new`; there is no `try_with_*`."
msgstr "`with_precision` 和 `with_e_max` 在超出 `new` 的限制时中止；没有 `try_with_*`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:780
#: manual/api/decimal.md:588
msgid "Read and set the refinement limit of the certified elementary functions."
msgstr "读取和设置认证初等函数的细化限制。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:787
msgid "Every certified elementary function (`exp`, `ln`, the trigonometric, hyperbolic and inverse functions, `pow`, `rootn`, `hypot`, `atan2` and their `try_*_ctx` forms) evaluates an enclosure at a growing working precision until both ends round alike. The limit is the number of refinement steps: `Some(n)` allows `n` of them (a value below 1 counts as 1), the default is `Some(12)`, and `None` removes the count limit. When the limit is reached without a decision, `try_*_ctx` returns the `CertificationFailure` error with the refinement count, as before, and the plain and `*_ctx` forms return a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`. With `None` the loop still stops when the working precision passes a cap, the larger of 8,000,000 bits and 256 times the first working precision, and the trigonometric work limit of 8,000,000 bits still refuses an argument that would need more. The default changes no result. The field takes part in `==`: two contexts that differ only in the limit are different."
msgstr "每个认证初等函数（`exp`、`ln`、三角函数、双曲函数和反函数、`pow`、`rootn`、`hypot`、`atan2` 及其 `try_*_ctx` 形式）都在不断增大的工作精度下求包络，直到两端舍入结果相同。该限制是细化步数：`Some(n)` 允许 `n` 步（小于 1 的值按 1 计），默认为 `Some(12)`，`None` 则取消步数限制。达到限制仍未能判定时，`try_*_ctx` 像以前一样返回带细化次数的 `CertificationFailure` 错误，普通形式和 `*_ctx` 形式返回带 `invalid_operation` 的静默 NaN。使用 `None` 时，循环仍会在工作精度超过上限时停止，该上限取 8,000,000 位与首个工作精度的 256 倍中较大者；三角函数 8,000,000 位的工作上限仍会拒绝需要更多位的参数。默认值不改变任何结果。该字段参与 `==`：仅限制不同的两个上下文是不同的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:821
msgid "The five IEEE 754 exception flags raised by one or more operations, and `not_computed`, which reports a result the library could not compute."
msgstr "由一个或多个运算触发的五个 IEEE 754 异常标志，以及 `not_computed`，后者表示库无法计算出的结果。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:830
msgid "Two flag sets are `==` when all six flags agree."
msgstr "当六个标志全部一致时，两个标志集 `==`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:834
msgid "Build an empty flag set and read the individual flags."
msgstr "构建空的标志集并读取各个标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:846
msgid "`new()` has every flag clear. There is no `contains`: that method exists only where a package has a signal enum, and the six accessors cover the six flags. A contextual operation returns only the flags it raised itself; nothing is sticky until you combine flags. The flags mean: `inexact`, the returned value differs from the exact result; `underflow`, the result is tiny and inexact; `overflow`, the rounded result exceeded the largest finite value (always together with `inexact`); `division_by_zero`, an exact infinite result from finite operands (such as $1/0$ or $\\log 0$); `invalid_operation`, no useful real result exists and a quiet NaN was returned, or a signaling NaN was an operand. The non-`try` elementary functions also raise it when they return NaN for a domain error (the `try_` forms still return an `Err` for one; they become values in a later step of S4). `not_computed`, the operation could not be carried out within a limit of the implementation (a certification that did not conclude, a context beyond what the kernels support) and the value is a NaN; it is not a flag of IEEE 754-2019 and is distinct from `invalid_operation`. The non-`try` elementary functions raise it when the `try_` form returns an `Err` of the certification-failure kind (they raised `invalid_operation` before), and the checked tiers turn it into that `Err`."
msgstr "`new()` 的所有标志均为清除状态。没有 `contains`：该方法只存在于带有信号枚举的包中，六个访问器已覆盖这六个标志。上下文式运算只返回它自身触发的标志；在你组合标志之前，没有任何标志是粘滞的。各标志含义如下：`inexact`，返回值与精确结果不同；`underflow`，结果微小且不精确；`overflow`，舍入后的结果超过最大有限值（总是与 `inexact` 一同出现）；`division_by_zero`，有限操作数得到精确的无穷结果（如 $1/0$ 或 $\\log 0$）；`invalid_operation`，不存在有意义的实数结果并返回了静默 NaN，或者某个操作数是信号 NaN。非 `try` 的初等函数在因定义域错误而返回 NaN 时也会触发它（其 `try_` 形式目前仍返回 `Err`；在 S4 的后续步骤中它们将成为值）。`not_computed`：运算无法在实现的某个限制内完成（认证未得出结论、上下文超出内核支持的范围），其值为 NaN；它不是 IEEE 754-2019 的标志，并且不同于 `invalid_operation`。当 `try_` 形式返回认证失败一类的 `Err` 时，非 `try` 的初等函数会触发它（此前触发 `invalid_operation`），检查层则把它变为该 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:866
msgid "Returns the union of two flag sets."
msgstr "返回两个标志集合的并。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:872
msgid "`combine` is a bitwise OR: associative, commutative and idempotent with `new()` as identity, so the flags of a computation can be accumulated in any order."
msgstr "`combine` 是按位或：满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，并以 `new()` 为单位元，因此一次计算的标志可以按任意顺序累积。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:876
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:263
msgid "Contextual arithmetic"
msgstr "上下文式算术"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:878
msgid "Every method in this group returns `(value, flags)`, rounds the exact result once under the context, and applies the context exponent range: an overflow returns $\\pm\\infty$ or the largest finite magnitude depending on the rounding direction, and a tiny result is rounded on the subnormal grid with quantum $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$. The returned value carries the context precision. A NaN operand produces the first NaN operand quieted, with its sign and payload, and `invalid_operation` only when some operand was a signaling NaN."
msgstr "本组中的每个方法都返回 `(value, flags)`，在上下文下对精确结果只舍入一次，并施加上下文的指数范围：上溢时根据舍入方向返回 $\\pm\\infty$ 或最大有限绝对值，微小结果在量子为 $2^{e_{\\min}-p+1}$ 的次正规网格上舍入。返回值带有上下文精度。NaN 操作数产生静默化后的第一个 NaN 操作数（保留其符号和 payload），并且仅当某个操作数为信号 NaN 时才触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:888
msgid "Rounds a value into a context."
msgstr "将值舍入到上下文中。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:894
msgid "This is the IEEE conversion of a wider value to a narrower format. Finite values are rounded with the full overflow, subnormal and tininess rules; infinities are kept; a signaling NaN is quieted with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "这是 IEEE 中将较宽的值转换为较窄格式的操作。有限值按完整的上溢、次正规和微小性规则舍入；无穷保持不变；信号 NaN 被静默化并触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:900
msgid "The four operations under a context."
msgstr "上下文下的四则运算。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:913
msgid "Invalid operations ($\\infty - \\infty$ with equal signs after `sub`'s negation, $0 \\cdot \\infty$, $0/0$, $\\infty/\\infty$) give a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`; a nonzero finite number divided by zero gives a signed infinity with `division_by_zero`. An exact zero sum of operands with opposite signs is $+0$, except $-0$ under `RoundTowardNegative`; $(-0) + (-0) = -0$ (IEEE 754-2019 clause 6.3)."
msgstr "无效运算（`sub` 取负后符号相同的 $\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\cdot \\infty$、$0/0$、$\\infty/\\infty$）给出静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`；非零有限数除以零给出带符号无穷并触发 `division_by_zero`。符号相反的操作数的精确零和为 $+0$，但在 `RoundTowardNegative` 下为 $-0$；$(-0) + (-0) = -0$（IEEE 754-2019 第 6.3 条）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:922
msgid "Square root under a context."
msgstr "上下文下的平方根。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:928
msgid "$\\sqrt{\\pm 0} = \\pm 0$, $\\sqrt{+\\infty} = +\\infty$, and a negative nonzero argument gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "$\\sqrt{\\pm 0} = \\pm 0$，$\\sqrt{+\\infty} = +\\infty$，负的非零参数给出静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:933
msgid "Fused multiply-add $\\circ(x \\cdot y + z)$ under a context."
msgstr "上下文下的融合乘加 $\\circ(x \\cdot y + z)$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:939
msgid "The product is formed exactly and the sum is rounded once (IEEE 754-2019 clause 5.4.1). A NaN operand propagates the first NaN of `self`, multiplier, addend. `invalid_operation` is raised for a signaling NaN, for $\\infty \\cdot 0$ (also when the addend is a quiet NaN, as SoftFloat does), and for $\\pm\\infty \\cdot y + (\\mp\\infty)$."
msgstr "乘积被精确构成，和只舍入一次（IEEE 754-2019 第 5.4.1 条）。NaN 操作数按 `self`、乘数、加数的顺序传播第一个 NaN。以下情况触发 `invalid_operation`：信号 NaN；$\\infty \\cdot 0$（与 SoftFloat 一样，加数为静默 NaN 时也是如此）；$\\pm\\infty \\cdot y + (\\mp\\infty)$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:947
msgid "IEEE 754 remainder under a context."
msgstr "上下文下的 IEEE 754 余数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:953
msgid "The result is $r = x - n y$ with $n = \\operatorname{round\\_ties\\_even}(x/y)$, so $|r| \\le |y|/2$. A zero result has the sign of $x$. $x = \\pm\\infty$ or $y = 0$ gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`; $y = \\pm\\infty$ or $x = 0$ returns $x$ rounded into the context. The exact $r$ is then rounded; for operands representable in the context this rounding is exact and no flag is raised. The quotient is never formed: the operands are reduced modulo $2y$, so huge exponent gaps cost $O(\\log)$ multiplications."
msgstr "结果为 $r = x - n y$，其中 $n = \\operatorname{round\\_ties\\_even}(x/y)$，因此 $|r| \\le |y|/2$。零结果带有 $x$ 的符号。$x = \\pm\\infty$ 或 $y = 0$ 给出静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`；$y = \\pm\\infty$ 或 $x = 0$ 时返回舍入到上下文中的 $x$。随后对精确的 $r$ 进行舍入；对于可在上下文中表示的操作数，这次舍入是精确的，不触发任何标志。商从不被显式构成：操作数按模 $2y$ 约简，因此巨大的指数差距只需 $O(\\log)$ 次乘法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:963
msgid "Integer power $\\circ(x^n)$ under a context."
msgstr "上下文下的整数次幂 $\\circ(x^n)$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:969
msgid "This is IEEE 754 `pown`. $x^0 = 1$ without a flag for every $x$ except a signaling NaN (a quiet NaN included); a signaling NaN base gives a quiet NaN with its payload and `invalid_operation` for every exponent, zero included (§9.2.1, §7.2 a); $(\\pm 0)^{n<0} = \\pm\\infty$ (sign for odd $n$) with `division_by_zero`; $(\\pm\\infty)^n$ is an infinity or zero with the sign of an odd power. Small powers are computed exactly; otherwise a Ziv loop rounds an enclosure, with an exact fallback, so the result is always correctly rounded."
msgstr "这是 IEEE 754 的 `pown`。除信号 NaN 外，对任意 $x$（包括静默 NaN），$x^0 = 1$ 且不触发标志；信号 NaN 底数对任意指数（包括零）都给出保留载荷的静默 NaN，并触发 `invalid_operation`（§9.2.1、§7.2 a）；$(\\pm 0)^{n<0} = \\pm\\infty$（奇数 $n$ 时保留符号）并触发 `division_by_zero`；$(\\pm\\infty)^n$ 是无穷或零，符号按奇次幂规则确定。小次幂精确计算；否则用 Ziv 循环对包络进行舍入，并有精确回退，因此结果总是正确舍入的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:990
msgid "IEEE 754 operations"
msgstr "IEEE 754 运算"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:994
msgid "Round to an integral value in the context's rounding direction."
msgstr "按上下文的舍入方向舍入为整数值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1001
msgid "These are IEEE `roundToIntegral` (in the context's direction) and `roundToIntegralExact`. Only the rounding direction of the context is used; the result keeps the operand's precision and the sign of a zero result. `to_integral_exact_ctx` raises `inexact` when the value changed; `to_integral_value_ctx` never raises it. Infinities are returned unchanged and a signaling NaN is quieted with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "它们是 IEEE 的 `roundToIntegral`（按上下文方向）和 `roundToIntegralExact`。只使用上下文的舍入方向；结果保留操作数的精度以及零结果的符号。值发生改变时，`to_integral_exact_ctx` 触发 `inexact`；`to_integral_value_ctx` 从不触发它。无穷原样返回，信号 NaN 被静默化并触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1010
msgid "Round to an integral value in a fixed direction."
msgstr "按固定方向舍入为整数值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1020
msgid "They are `roundToIntegralTowardNegative`, `…TowardPositive`, `…TowardZero`, `…TiesToAway` and `…TiesToEven`. `round` rounds halfway cases away from zero: `round(-2.5) = -3`, while `round_ties_even(-2.5) = -2`."
msgstr "它们是 `roundToIntegralTowardNegative`、`…TowardPositive`、`…TowardZero`、`…TiesToAway` 和 `…TiesToEven`。`round` 将正好居中的情形向远离零的方向舍入：`round(-2.5) = -3`，而 `round_ties_even(-2.5) = -2`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1026
msgid "IEEE `convertToInteger` to a machine integer, rounding in the context's direction."
msgstr "IEEE `convertToInteger`：按上下文的舍入方向转换为机器整数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1036
msgid "The value is first rounded to an integer. If that integer fits the target type the result is `Some`; with `exact=true` (`convertToIntegerExact`) `inexact` is raised when rounding changed the value. A NaN, an infinity or an integer outside the target range gives `None` with `invalid_operation`, where a C implementation would return an unspecified sentinel. A negative value that rounds to zero converts to `0` for the unsigned targets."
msgstr "值先被舍入为整数。若该整数在目标类型范围内，结果为 `Some`；使用 `exact=true`（`convertToIntegerExact`）时，若舍入改变了值则触发 `inexact`。NaN、无穷或超出目标范围的整数给出 `None` 并触发 `invalid_operation`，而 C 实现在此会返回未指定的哨兵值。对无符号目标，舍入为零的负值转换为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1045
msgid "IEEE `nextUp` and `nextDown` in the context's format."
msgstr "上下文格式中的 IEEE `nextUp` 和 `nextDown`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1052
msgid "`next_up_ctx(x)` is the least value of the context's format (precision and exponent range, subnormals included) that is greater than $x$; `next_down_ctx` is $-\\texttt{next\\_up}(-x)$. The context's rounding direction is ignored. The operations are quiet: $\\operatorname{nextUp}(\\pm 0)$ is the smallest positive subnormal, $\\operatorname{nextUp}(-\\infty)$ is the most negative finite value, $\\operatorname{nextUp}(\\Omega) = +\\infty$ with no overflow flag, and only a signaling NaN raises `invalid_operation`. An operand with more bits than the context precision is accepted."
msgstr "`next_up_ctx(x)` 是上下文格式（精度和指数范围，包括次正规数）中大于 $x$ 的最小值；`next_down_ctx` 为 $-\\texttt{next\\_up}(-x)$。上下文的舍入方向被忽略。这些运算是静默的：$\\operatorname{nextUp}(\\pm 0)$ 是最小正次正规数，$\\operatorname{nextUp}(-\\infty)$ 是最负的有限值，$\\operatorname{nextUp}(\\Omega) = +\\infty$ 且不触发上溢标志，只有信号 NaN 会触发 `invalid_operation`。位数多于上下文精度的操作数也被接受。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1063
msgid "IEEE `scaleB` and `logB`."
msgstr "IEEE `scaleB` 与 `logB`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1071
msgid "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` is $\\circ(x \\cdot 2^n)$ with the usual overflow and underflow handling; it is exact unless the result leaves the normal range. The count `n` is a `BinFloat`, the kind `logb_ctx` returns, as in `Decimal::scaleb_ctx` and `decimal_gda`: it must be an integer value. A NaN count propagates (invalid for a signaling NaN); an infinite or non-integer count is a NaN with `invalid_operation`, whatever the receiver is (an infinite receiver with a finite count is returned as it is); an integer count beyond the `Int` range acts as the largest count of its sign, which overflows or underflows every finite non-zero value of any format. IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 defines scaleB for integral counts only and leaves a non-integral second operand (an infinity is not integral) to the language: the NaN with `invalid_operation` is this library's choice, as in `decimal`. `x.logb_ctx(ctx)` is $\\lfloor \\log_2 |x| \\rfloor$ as an exact integral value (also for subnormal $x$): $\\operatorname{logB}(0) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, $\\operatorname{logB}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$, and a NaN propagates."
msgstr "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` 为 $\\circ(x \\cdot 2^n)$，按常规方式处理上溢和下溢；除非结果离开正规范围，否则它是精确的。计数 `n` 是 `BinFloat`，即 `logb_ctx` 返回的种类，与 `Decimal::scaleb_ctx` 和 `decimal_gda` 相同：它必须是整数值。NaN 计数会传播（signaling NaN 为 invalid）；无穷或非整数的计数得到带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，与接收者无关（接收者为无穷而计数为有限值时按原样返回）；超出 `Int` 范围的整数计数相当于该符号下最大的计数，会使任何格式的有限非零值上溢或下溢。IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 只对整数计数定义 scaleB，非整数的第二操作数（无穷不是整数）留给语言处理：带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN 是本库的选择，与 `decimal` 相同。`x.logb_ctx(ctx)` 是作为精确整数值的 $\\lfloor \\log_2 |x| \\rfloor$（对次正规的 $x$ 同样如此）：$\\operatorname{logB}(0) = -\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`，$\\operatorname{logB}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$，NaN 会传播。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1087
msgid "`x.ilogb()` is the same exponent as an integer: the $e$ with $2^e \\le |x| < 2^{e+1}$, that is $\\texttt{exponent2()} + \\texttt{coefficient().bit\\_length()} - 1$, read from the value without building its coefficient. It is `logB` of IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 with an integral `logBFormat`: the standard defines $\\operatorname{logB}(x)$ as the exponent of $x$ \"determined as though x were represented with infinite range and minimum exponent\", so a subnormal $x$ gives the exponent of its leading bit. For $\\operatorname{logB}(0)$, $\\operatorname{logB}(\\pm\\infty)$ and $\\operatorname{logB}(\\text{NaN})$ with an integer `logBFormat` the standard returns language-defined values outside $\\pm 2 (e_{\\max} + p - 1)$ and signals the invalid operation exception (5.3.3 and 7.2); `ilogb` renders those three cases as `None` and raises no flag. `logb_ctx` is the operation with a floating-point `logBFormat` ($-\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, $+\\infty$, NaN)."
msgstr "`x.ilogb()` 是同一个指数，以整数给出：满足 $2^e \\le |x| < 2^{e+1}$ 的 $e$，即 $\\texttt{exponent2()} + \\texttt{coefficient().bit\\_length()} - 1$，直接从值读取，不构造其系数。它是 IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 的 `logB`，`logBFormat` 为整数：标准把 $\\operatorname{logB}(x)$ 定义为 $x$ 的指数，“按 x 具有无限范围和最小指数来确定”，所以次正规的 $x$ 给出其最高位的指数。对于整数 `logBFormat` 的 $\\operatorname{logB}(0)$、$\\operatorname{logB}(\\pm\\infty)$ 和 $\\operatorname{logB}(\\text{NaN})$，标准返回落在 $\\pm 2 (e_{\\max} + p - 1)$ 之外的语言自定义值，并发出无效操作异常（5.3.3 和 7.2）；`ilogb` 把这三种情形给为 `None`，不引发任何标志。`logb_ctx` 是浮点 `logBFormat` 的操作（带 `division_by_zero` 的 $-\\infty$、$+\\infty$、NaN）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1127
#: manual/api/decimal.md:1196
msgid "Comparison and ordering"
msgstr "比较与排序"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1131
msgid "Numerical three-way comparison that is total on every value."
msgstr "在所有值上都为全的数值三路比较。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1138
msgid "`compare` returns $-1$, $0$ or $1$ by numerical value, with $-0 = +0$ and precision ignored. NaN has no numerical order, so `compare` places every NaN equal to every other NaN and above every non-NaN value; it never aborts. The result is a total preorder, which is what `Compare` (and sorting) needs, but it is not the IEEE comparison: under it `nan > 1` holds. The operators `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=` and the promoted `op_*` methods use `compare`. For IEEE semantics use `compare_checked`, the quiet and signaling predicates below, or `total_order`. The [design page](../design/bin_float.md#ordering-nan-in-compare) explains the choice."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$，其中 $-0 = +0$，并忽略精度。NaN 没有数值顺序，因此 `compare` 将所有 NaN 视为彼此相等，并大于所有非 NaN 值；它从不中止。结果是一个全预序，这正是 `Compare`（以及排序）所需要的，但它不是 IEEE 比较：在它之下 `nan > 1` 成立。运算符 `<`、`<=`、`>`、`>=` 以及被提升的 `op_*` 方法使用 `compare`。若需要 IEEE 语义，请使用 `compare_checked`、下文的静默与信号谓词，或 `total_order`。[设计文档](../design/bin_float.md#ordering-nan-in-compare)解释了这一选择。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1150
msgid "Numerical comparison that rejects NaN."
msgstr "拒绝 NaN 的数值比较。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1157
msgid "Returns the same value as `compare` when neither operand is a NaN, and an `unordered_comparison` error otherwise."
msgstr "当两个操作数都不是 NaN 时返回与 `compare` 相同的值，否则返回 `unordered_comparison` 错误。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1162
msgid "IEEE comparison as a four-valued relation with flags."
msgstr "带标志的四值关系形式的 IEEE 比较。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1169
msgid "The relation is `Less`, `Equal`, `Greater` or `Unordered` (some operand is a NaN), with $-0 = +0$. The quiet form raises `invalid_operation` only for a signaling NaN; the signaling form raises it for every unordered comparison (IEEE 754-2019 clause 5.11)."
msgstr "关系为 `Less`、`Equal`、`Greater` 或 `Unordered`（某个操作数为 NaN），其中 $-0 = +0$。静默形式只对信号 NaN 触发 `invalid_operation`；信号形式对每次无序比较都触发它（IEEE 754-2019 第 5.11 条）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1176
msgid "The IEEE comparison predicates."
msgstr "IEEE 比较谓词。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1188
msgid "`compareQuietEqual`, `compareQuietLess`, `compareQuietLessEqual`, `compareQuietUnordered` and the signaling `Equal`, `Less`, `LessEqual`. Each is derived from `compare_quiet` or `compare_signaling` and returns its flags; every predicate except `compare_quiet_unordered` is false on an unordered pair."
msgstr "即 `compareQuietEqual`、`compareQuietLess`、`compareQuietLessEqual`、`compareQuietUnordered` 以及信号版本的 `Equal`、`Less`、`LessEqual`。每个谓词都由 `compare_quiet` 或 `compare_signaling` 派生并返回其标志；除 `compare_quiet_unordered` 外，每个谓词在无序对上都为假。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1193
msgid "`BinFloat::compare_quiet_not_equal` and the other comparison predicates of Tables 5.1 and 5.2"
msgstr "`BinFloat::compare_quiet_not_equal` 及表 5.1 和表 5.2 的其他比较谓词"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1195
#: manual/api/decimal.md:1277
msgid "The fifteen predicates of IEEE 754-2019 5.11 not listed above."
msgstr "上文未列出的 IEEE 754-2019 5.11 的另外十五个谓词。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1215
#: manual/api/decimal.md:1297
msgid "Clause 5.11 lists 22 predicates, 10 in Table 5.1 (with the common mathematical symbols) and 12 in Table 5.2; with the seven above every one of them has a function. Each is defined from `compare_quiet` or `compare_signaling` through the relations that make it true, which is how the tables define it, and returns the flags of that comparison: a quiet predicate raises `invalid_operation` for a signaling NaN only, a signaling predicate for every NaN operand. The doc comment of each names its row. Name spelling follows the seven above: `compare_`, `quiet` or `signaling`, then the predicate name of the table in snake case. The pairs the standard states as negations of one another (the two predicates of one line of a table) return opposite values and the same flags."
msgstr "5.11 条列出 22 个谓词，表 5.1 中 10 个（带常用数学符号），表 5.2 中 12 个；加上上面的七个，每一个都有对应的函数。每个谓词都由 `compare_quiet` 或 `compare_signaling` 通过使其为真的关系来定义，这正是表中的定义方式，并返回该比较的标志：quiet 谓词仅对 signaling NaN 触发 `invalid_operation`，signaling 谓词对每个 NaN 操作数都触发。每个谓词的文档注释都指明它在表中的行。名称拼写沿用上面的七个：`compare_`，`quiet` 或 `signaling`，然后是表中的谓词名称的蛇形写法。标准中互为否定的谓词对（表中同一行的两个谓词）返回相反的值和相同的标志。"

