#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1254
msgid "The IEEE 754 `totalOrder` relation."
msgstr "IEEE 754 的 `totalOrder` 关系。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1262
msgid "`total_order_compare` orders all values as"
msgstr "`total_order_compare` 将所有值排序为"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1268
msgid "with NaNs of one sign and kind ordered by payload (reversed for the negative side). `x.total_order(y)` is `total_order_compare(x, y) <= 0` and `total_order_mag` compares absolute values. Values that are numerically equal but differ in precision compare equal. The operations are quiet."
msgstr "同一符号和种类的 NaN 按 payload 排序（负侧顺序相反）。`x.total_order(y)` 即 `total_order_compare(x, y) <= 0`，`total_order_mag` 比较绝对值。数值相等但精度不同的值比较为相等。这些运算是静默的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1275
msgid "The smaller or larger of two values, ignoring a NaN operand."
msgstr "两个值中较小或较大的一个，忽略 NaN 操作数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1282
msgid "When exactly one operand is a NaN the other is returned (the IEEE 754-2008 `minNum`/`maxNum` convention for quiet NaNs); a signaling NaN is ignored in the same way, without quieting or a flag, and two NaNs give the argument. When the operands compare equal under `compare` (for example $-0$ and $+0$) the receiver is returned. No flags are produced."
msgstr "当恰有一个操作数为 NaN 时，返回另一个（即 IEEE 754-2008 中针对静默 NaN 的 `minNum`/`maxNum` 约定）；信号 NaN 也以同样方式被忽略，不会被静默化，也不触发标志；两个都是 NaN 时返回参数。当两个操作数在 `compare` 下相等时（例如 $-0$ 和 $+0$），返回接收者。不产生标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1290
msgid "Restrict a value to `[min, max]`."
msgstr "将值限制在 `[min, max]` 内。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1297
msgid "A NaN receiver is returned unchanged. `clamp` aborts when a bound is a NaN or `min > max`; `clamp_checked` returns a `domain_error` in those cases."
msgstr "NaN 接收者原样返回。当某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时，`clamp` 中止；在这些情况下 `clamp_checked` 返回 `domain_error`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1321
msgid "Text and hexadecimal conversion"
msgstr "文本与十六进制转换"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1325
msgid "Prints the exact stored value as `coefficient p exponent`."
msgstr "以 `coefficient p exponent` 形式输出精确的存储值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1332
msgid "A finite nonzero value prints as `[-]<c>p<e>` with $c$ in decimal, meaning $c \\cdot 2^e$ (for example `3p-1` is $1.5$). Zeros print as `0` and `-0`, infinities as `inf` and `-inf`, and every NaN as `nan`. The form is exact and unambiguous but not a decimal rendering; use `to_shortest_string` for that."
msgstr "有限非零值输出为 `[-]<c>p<e>`，其中 $c$ 以十进制表示，含义为 $c \\cdot 2^e$（例如 `3p-1` 为 $1.5$）。零输出为 `0` 和 `-0`，无穷输出为 `inf` 和 `-inf`，所有 NaN 输出为 `nan`。该形式精确且无歧义，但不是十进制表示；如需十进制表示请使用 `to_shortest_string`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1339
msgid "Parse a decimal literal with correct rounding (IEEE `convertFromDecimalCharacter`)."
msgstr "以正确舍入解析十进制字面量（IEEE `convertFromDecimalCharacter`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1347
msgid "The accepted syntax is `[+-]digits[.digits][e[+-]digits]` (a leading or trailing point is allowed, the exponent marker is `e` or `E`), and the case-insensitive words `inf`, `infinity`, `nan`, `qnan` and `snan`, with surrounding whitespace ignored. Anything else is a `parse_error`. The exact decimal value $D \\cdot 10^k$ is rounded once under the context, for any number of digits and any exponent; overflow, underflow and inexact are reported as for arithmetic. `from_string(s, precision=p)` uses `BinaryContext::new(precision=p)` (default 53) and drops the flags."
msgstr "接受的语法为 `[+-]digits[.digits][e[+-]digits]`（允许前导或末尾的小数点，指数标记为 `e` 或 `E`），以及不区分大小写的单词 `inf`、`infinity`、`nan`、`qnan` 和 `snan`，两侧空白被忽略。其他任何内容都是 `parse_error`。精确的十进制值 $D \\cdot 10^k$ 在上下文下只舍入一次，无论位数多少、指数多大；上溢、下溢和不精确与算术运算一样报告。`from_string(s, precision=p)` 使用 `BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`（默认 53）并丢弃标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1358
msgid "Formats a value with a fixed number of significant decimal digits (IEEE `convertToDecimalCharacter`)."
msgstr "以固定的十进制有效位数格式化值（IEEE `convertToDecimalCharacter`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1365
msgid "The output is `[-]d.ddd…e±x` with exactly `digits` significant digits (at least 1), correctly rounded in the context's rounding direction; `inexact` is raised when nonzero digits were dropped. Only the rounding direction of the context is used. Zero prints as `0.00…e+0` with its sign, infinities as `inf`/`-inf`, NaNs as `nan`/`snan` with their sign. The text parses back with `from_string_ctx`."
msgstr "输出为 `[-]d.ddd…e±x`，恰有 `digits` 位有效数字（至少 1 位），按上下文的舍入方向正确舍入；丢弃了非零数字时触发 `inexact`。只使用上下文的舍入方向。零输出为带符号的 `0.00…e+0`，无穷输出为 `inf`/`-inf`，NaN 输出为带符号的 `nan`/`snan`。该文本可用 `from_string_ctx` 解析回来。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1374
msgid "Formats the shortest decimal that reads back as the same value."
msgstr "格式化为能读回同一值的最短十进制数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1381
msgid "`to_shortest_string_ctx(x, ctx)` returns the decimal with the fewest significant digits that `from_string_ctx(_, ctx)` maps back to $x$ under round-to-nearest-even (the context's own rounding direction is ignored). When two candidates of that length read back, the nearer one is chosen, then the one with an even last digit. The layout follows ECMAScript `Number#toString`: positional notation for decimal exponents in $[-6, 21)$, otherwise `d.ddde±x`; unlike ECMAScript, $-0$ prints as `-0`. For binary64 values in `BinaryContext::binary64()` the result equals the host `Double` formatter. `to_shortest_string()` uses `BinaryContext::new(precision=precision())`, so it is the shortest string that `from_string(text, precision=x.precision())` maps back to `x`. An operand that is not representable in the context is first rounded into it (`round_ctx`, in the rounding direction of the context, with the overflow and underflow of the context), and the result is the shortest string of that rounded value: `inf` or `-inf` on overflow, `0` or `-0` on underflow (the largest finite value for a direction that rounds toward zero). A value of the format prints as itself."
msgstr "`to_shortest_string_ctx(x, ctx)` 返回有效位数最少、且在就近舍入（偶数优先）下经 `from_string_ctx(_, ctx)` 映射回 $x$ 的十进制数（上下文自身的舍入方向被忽略）。当该长度下有两个候选都能读回时，选择较近的那个，其次选择末位为偶数的那个。版式遵循 ECMAScript `Number#toString`：十进制指数在 $[-6, 21)$ 内时使用定点记法，否则使用 `d.ddde±x`；与 ECMAScript 不同，$-0$ 输出为 `-0`。对于 `BinaryContext::binary64()` 中的 binary64 值，结果与宿主 `Double` 的格式化器一致。`to_shortest_string()` 使用 `BinaryContext::new(precision=precision())`，因此它是 `from_string(text, precision=x.precision())` 能映射回 `x` 的最短字符串。不能在该上下文中表示的操作数会先被舍入到其中（`round_ctx`，按该上下文的舍入方向，带上下文的上溢和下溢），结果是该舍入值的最短字符串：上溢时为 `inf` 或 `-inf`，下溢时为 `0` 或 `-0`（向零舍入的方向则为最大有限值）。格式内的值按其自身输出。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1400
msgid "Read and write the exact value with a hexadecimal coefficient."
msgstr "以十六进制系数读写精确值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1408
msgid "The syntax is the IEEE 754-2019 §5.12.3 hexSequence: an optional sign, `0x` or `0X`, hexadecimal digits with at most one point (`1.8`, `.8` or `1.`), and a required `p` or `P` exponent with an optional sign and decimal digits. The value is the hexadecimal significand times $2^{\\text{exponent}}$, so `0x3p-1` and `0x1.8p0` are both $1.5$. `from_hex(s, p)` rounds once to precision `p` with nearest-even and reports no flags; a `p` outside `1..=binary_precision_max` is an `Err`. `from_hex_ctx(s, context)` is the §5.12.3 conversion: it rounds the exact value once under the rounding direction, precision, exponent range and tininess rule of `context` and returns the `inexact`, `underflow` and `overflow` flags, like `from_string_ctx`. An exponent field of any length is a valid text: it is read with saturation at $2^{60}$, as the decimal reader does, so an exponent outside the 32-bit range overflows or underflows there (the result of the context with its flags, in every rounding direction) instead of being a parse error, and a zero significand is the zero of the sign for any exponent. `from_hex`, which stores the exact value, reports an exponent outside the 32-bit range as a parse error (a zero significand is still a zero). Both accept `inf`, `infinity`, `nan` and `snan` in any case with an optional sign (§5.12.1); `snan` gives a signaling NaN. Surrounding whitespace is trimmed; any other text is a `parse_error`. `to_hex` prints the stored coefficient in lower case, `0x0p0` or `-0x0p0` for a zero, and `nan`/`inf` with a sign."
msgstr "语法为 IEEE 754-2019 §5.12.3 的 hexSequence：可选符号、`0x` 或 `0X`、最多含一个小数点的十六进制数字（`1.8`、`.8` 或 `1.`），以及必需的 `p` 或 `P` 指数，指数带可选符号、由十进制数字组成。其值为十六进制有效数乘以 $2^{\\text{exponent}}$，因此 `0x3p-1` 和 `0x1.8p0` 都是 $1.5$。`from_hex(s, p)` 以就近舍入（偶数优先）一次舍入到精度 `p`，不报告标志；`p` 超出 `1..=binary_precision_max` 时返回 `Err`。`from_hex_ctx(s, context)` 是 §5.12.3 的转换：它按 `context` 的舍入方向、精度、指数范围和 tininess 规则把精确值一次舍入，并像 `from_string_ctx` 一样返回 `inexact`、`underflow` 和 `overflow` 标志；任意长度的指数字段都是有效文本：它像十进制读取器那样以 $2^{60}$ 饱和读取，所以超出 32 位范围的指数在这里会上溢或下溢（上下文的结果及其标志，在每个舍入方向上），而不是解析错误；零有效数字对任何指数都是带符号的零。存储精确值的 `from_hex` 把超出 32 位范围的指数报告为解析错误（零有效数字仍然是零）。两者都接受任意大小写、带可选符号的 `inf`、`infinity`、`nan` 和 `snan`（§5.12.1）；`snan` 得到 signaling NaN。首尾空白会被去掉；其他任何文本都是 `parse_error`。`to_hex` 以小写输出存储的系数，零输出为 `0x0p0` 或 `-0x0p0`，`nan`/`inf` 带符号输出。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1450
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1339
#: manual/design/decimal.md:750
#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:344
msgid "Interchange encodings"
msgstr "交换编码"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1454
msgid "The four IEEE 754 binary interchange formats."
msgstr "四种 IEEE 754 二进制交换格式。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1467
msgid "The parameters of a format."
msgstr "格式的参数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1479
#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:46
#: manual/design/bin_float.md:107
#: manual/design/decimal.md:89
#: manual/design/decimal.md:756
#: manual/design/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:48
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1488
msgid "Returns the `BinaryContext` of the format."
msgstr "返回该格式的 `BinaryContext`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1496
msgid "An encoded value: a format and its bit pattern."
msgstr "一个编码值：格式及其位模式。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1504
msgid "Equality compares the format and the bits, so two encodings of NaN with different payloads differ and $\\pm 0$ differ."
msgstr "相等性比较格式和位，因此 payload 不同的两个 NaN 编码不相等，$\\pm 0$ 也不相等。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1509
msgid "Return the format and the bit pattern of an encoding."
msgstr "返回编码的格式和位模式。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1516
msgid "`bits()` is the encoding as a natural number below $2^k$, $k$ = `total_bits`: the sign bit is bit $k-1$, the biased exponent field the next $w$ bits and the trailing significand field the low $p-1$ bits."
msgstr "`bits()` 是将编码视为小于 $2^k$ 的自然数的值，其中 $k$ = `total_bits`：符号位为第 $k-1$ 位，接下来的 $w$ 位为带偏置的指数字段，低 $p-1$ 位为尾随有效数字段。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1522
msgid "Build or print an encoding."
msgstr "构建或输出编码。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1530
msgid "`from_bits` keeps the low `total_bits` bits. `from_hex` needs exactly `total_bits / 4` hexadecimal digits, optionally prefixed with `0x` or `#`, and returns `None` otherwise. `to_hex` prints upper-case digits padded to the full width."
msgstr "`from_bits` 保留低 `total_bits` 位。`from_hex` 需要恰好 `total_bits / 4` 个十六进制数字，可带 `0x` 或 `#` 前缀，否则返回 `None`。`to_hex` 输出补齐到完整宽度的大写数字。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1537
msgid "Decodes an encoding exactly."
msgstr "精确解码一个编码。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1543
msgid "The result has the format precision. Normal and subnormal numbers, signed zeros and infinities decode exactly; a NaN keeps its sign and payload (the fraction without the quiet bit), and a signaling NaN stays signaling. No host `Float` or `Double` is involved."
msgstr "结果具有该格式的精度。正规数、次正规数、带符号零和无穷都被精确解码；NaN 保留其符号和 payload（不含静默位的尾数），信号 NaN 仍为信号 NaN。整个过程不涉及宿主的 `Float` 或 `Double`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1550
msgid "Convert a value to a binary interchange format and return it as a `BinFloat`."
msgstr "把一个值转换为二进制交换格式，并以 `BinFloat` 返回。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1556
msgid "The IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 formatOf-convertFormat operation, with the parameters of `to_interchange` and the value instead of the encoding. A conversion to a wider precision and range is exact and raises nothing; to a narrower one the value is rounded under `rounding` and `tininess` with `inexact`, `underflow` and `overflow`. A signaling NaN gives a quiet NaN and `invalid_operation`, also when the source already has the destination's precision (the canonicalizing conversion). A NaN payload is kept when the destination holds it and truncated to its low bits otherwise (§6.2.3), so the result is exactly what decoding `to_interchange` returns. `round_ctx` and `to_interchange` stay."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 的 formatOf-convertFormat 运算，参数与 `to_interchange` 相同，返回值而不是编码。转换到精度和范围都更大的格式是精确的，不产生任何标志；转换到更窄的格式则按 `rounding` 和 `tininess` 舍入，并给出 `inexact`、`underflow` 和 `overflow`。signaling NaN 得到 quiet NaN 和 `invalid_operation`，即使源的精度已经等于目标格式的精度（规范化转换）。NaN 的载荷在目标格式能容纳时保留，否则截断为其低位（§6.2.3），所以结果恰好是对 `to_interchange` 解码所得的值。`round_ctx` 和 `to_interchange` 保持不变。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1584
msgid "Round a value into a format and encode it."
msgstr "将值舍入到某格式并编码。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1591
msgid "The two are the same operation: `round_ctx` with the format's context, then encoding. A signaling NaN is encoded as a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`, and a payload is truncated to the payload field."
msgstr "二者是同一个操作：先以该格式的上下文执行 `round_ctx`，再编码。信号 NaN 被编码为静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`，payload 被截断到 payload 字段。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1617
msgid "Each elementary function has three forms:"
msgstr "每个初等函数都有三种形式："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1619
msgid "`f(x)` rounds to nearest-even at the precision of `x` (the larger precision for two operands) with the implementation exponent range;"
msgstr "`f(x)` 以 `x` 的精度（两个操作数时取较大精度）在实现指数范围内就近舍入（偶数优先）；"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1621
msgid "`f_ctx(x, ctx)` rounds under `ctx` and returns `(value, flags)`;"
msgstr "`f_ctx(x, ctx)` 在 `ctx` 下舍入并返回 `(value, flags)`；"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1622
msgid "`try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` returns the same pair in `Ok`, or an `@lf_arith.ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` 在 `Ok` 中返回同样的值对，或返回 `@lf_arith.ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1625
msgid ""
"All three run the same certified algorithm. It computes an enclosure $[L, U] \\n"
"i f(x)$ whose every internal operation is rounded downward for $L$ and upward for $U$, at a working precision $w$ that starts at $p + 64$ bits (or at the operand precision plus 16 when that is larger, for `rootn`, the inverse trigonometric and the hyperbolic functions). If $L$ and $U$ round to the same value with the same flags, that value is returned; otherwise $w$ grows by $\\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$, for at most 12 attempts. Because rounding is monotone, a returned value is the correctly rounded result $\\circ(f(x))$, never an uncertified approximation; the [design page](../design/bin_float.md#certified-elementary-functions) gives the argument for the value and the flags."
msgstr ""
"三者运行同一个认证算法。它计算包络 $[L, U] \\n"
"i f(x)$，其中每个内部运算对 $L$ 向下舍入、对 $U$ 向上舍入，工作精度 $w$ 从 $p + 64$ 位开始（对 `rootn`、反三角函数和双曲函数，若操作数精度加 16 更大则从该值开始）。若 $L$ 与 $U$ 以相同的标志舍入为相同的值，则返回该值；否则 $w$ 增加 $\\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$，最多尝试 12 次。由于舍入是单调的，返回值就是正确舍入的结果 $\\circ(f(x))$，绝不是未经认证的近似值；[设计文档](../design/bin_float.md#certified-elementary-functions)给出了关于该值及标志的论证。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1637
msgid "When the attempts run out, `try_f_ctx` returns a `certification_failure` error whose `CertificationFailureDetail` names the operation, the stage (`RangeReduction` or `TargetRounding`), the reason and the last working precision. An argument outside the real domain of `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `log1p`, `log2p1`, `log10p1`, `asin`, `acos`, `acosh`, `atanh`, `asinpi` and `acospi`, and an infinite argument of the trigonometric functions (`sin`, `cos`, `tan`, `sinpi`, `cospi`, `tanpi`), is a value of `try_f_ctx`, a NaN with `invalid_operation`, as it is for the plain form, and so is a domain case of `rootn`, `pow`, `powr`, `rsqrt` and `compound`: `try_f_ctx` returns `Err` only for a result that could not be computed. The non-`try` forms turn that `Err` into a quiet NaN with `not_computed`. NaN operands propagate quietly (a signaling NaN raises `invalid_operation`), and poles return a signed infinity with `division_by_zero` (for example $\\ln 0 = -\\infty$, $\\operatorname{atanh}(1) = +\\infty$). Exactly representable results that an enclosure cannot isolate are detected before the loop, for example $\\log_2 2^k = k$, $2^n$ for integral $n$, $10^n$ for integral $n \\ge 0$, dyadic powers such as $16^{3/4} = 8$, exact roots such as $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3) = 1/2$, $\\sin(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{sinpi}(1/2) = 1$; each function lists its own cases below. They are rounded once from their exact value, so their flags are right in every rounding mode."
msgstr "当尝试次数用完时，`try_f_ctx` 返回 `certification_failure` 错误，其 `CertificationFailureDetail` 指明运算、阶段（`RangeReduction` 或 `TargetRounding`）、原因以及最后的工作精度。`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`log1p`、`log2p1`、`log10p1`、`asin`、`acos`、`acosh`、`atanh`、`asinpi` 和 `acospi` 的实定义域之外的参数，以及三角函数（`sin`、`cos`、`tan`、`sinpi`、`cospi`、`tanpi`）的无穷参数，其 `try_f_ctx` 给出值，即带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，与非 `try` 形式相同，`rootn`、`pow`、`powr`、`rsqrt` 和 `compound` 的定义域情形也是如此：`try_f_ctx` 只对无法计算出的结果返回 `Err`。非 `try` 形式把该 `Err` 转为带 `not_computed` 的静默 NaN。NaN 操作数静默传播（信号 NaN 触发 `invalid_operation`），极点返回带符号无穷并触发 `division_by_zero`（例如 $\\ln 0 = -\\infty$，$\\operatorname{atanh}(1) = +\\infty$）。包络无法分离的可精确表示结果会在循环之前被检测出来，例如 $\\log_2 2^k = k$、整数 $n$ 的 $2^n$、整数 $n \\ge 0$ 的 $10^n$、诸如 $16^{3/4} = 8$ 的二进有理幂、诸如 $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3) = 1/2$ 的精确根、$\\sin(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ 以及 $\\operatorname{sinpi}(1/2) = 1$；各函数在下文列出各自的情形。这些结果由其精确值只舍入一次，因此在任何舍入模式下其标志都是正确的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1657
msgid "Every result that reaches the loop is not a rounding breakpoint, so an enclosure end that is itself representable (such as $1$ for $e^x$ or $x$ for $\\sin x$ at a tiny $x$) cannot be the result. The functions other than `rootn` move such an end just inside the enclosure before rounding it; `pow` does so once its exactness test has excluded a breakpoint. In addition, `sin`, `tan`, `asin`, `sinh`, `tanh`, `asinh` and `atanh` decide an argument with $|x|^3$ below the target spacing at $x$ directly from $|f(x) - x| \\le |x|^3$, and `cos`, `cosh`, `expm1` and `log1p` do the same with $x^2$ (around $1$ for `cos` and `cosh`, around $x$ for the others), before the loop. Tiny arguments are therefore certified in every rounding mode: `sin` of $2^{-6000}$ at 53 bits is $2^{-6000}$ with `inexact`, and $e^{2^{-20000}}$ rounded toward zero is $1$ with `inexact`."
msgstr "到达循环的结果都不是舍入断点，因此本身可表示的包络端点（例如 $e^x$ 的 $1$，或极小 $x$ 处 $\\sin x$ 的 $x$）不可能是结果。除 `rootn` 之外的函数在舍入之前会把这样的端点移到包络内侧紧邻处；`pow` 在其精确性检测排除舍入断点之后也会这样做。此外，在进入循环之前，`sin`、`tan`、`asin`、`sinh`、`tanh`、`asinh` 和 `atanh` 对 $|x|^3$ 低于 $x$ 处目标间距的参数，直接由 $|f(x) - x| \\le |x|^3$ 判定结果；`cos`、`cosh`、`expm1` 和 `log1p` 则以 $x^2$ 做同样的判定（`cos` 和 `cosh` 在 $1$ 附近，其他函数在 $x$ 附近）。因此极小参数在任何舍入模式下都能得到认证：在 53 位下，$2^{-6000}$ 的 `sin` 为 $2^{-6000}$ 并触发 `inexact`，向零舍入的 $e^{2^{-20000}}$ 为 $1$ 并触发 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1672
msgid "The exponential $e^x$."
msgstr "指数函数 $e^x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1680
msgid "Defined on all of $\\mathbb{R}$: $e^{\\pm 0} = 1$ exactly, $e^{-\\infty} = +0$ and $e^{+\\infty} = +\\infty$. Results certainly beyond the exponent range are decided from certified bounds on $\\log_2 e$ before the main loop, so huge arguments overflow or underflow with the correct flags instead of failing."
msgstr "在整个 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上有定义：$e^{\\pm 0} = 1$ 精确成立，$e^{-\\infty} = +0$，$e^{+\\infty} = +\\infty$。确定超出指数范围的结果会在主循环之前由 $\\log_2 e$ 的认证界判定，因此巨大的参数会带着正确的标志上溢或下溢，而不会失败。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1687
msgid "$e^x - 1$ without the cancellation of `exp(x) - 1` near zero."
msgstr "$e^x - 1$，避免了 `exp(x) - 1` 在零附近的抵消。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1695
msgid "$\\operatorname{expm1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{expm1}(-\\infty) = -1$ and $\\operatorname{expm1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$. For $x \\le -(p+3)\\ln 2$ the value lies within $2^{-(p+3)}$ above $-1$, and the result is decided from the rounding direction alone: $-1$, or $-(1 - 2^{-p})$ when rounding toward zero or $+\\infty$, always inexact."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{expm1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{expm1}(-\\infty) = -1$，$\\operatorname{expm1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$。当 $x \\le -(p+3)\\ln 2$ 时，值位于 $-1$ 上方 $2^{-(p+3)}$ 以内，结果仅由舍入方向决定：为 $-1$，或者在向零或向 $+\\infty$ 舍入时为 $-(1 - 2^{-p})$，且总是不精确的。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1703
msgid "$2^x - 1$ without the cancellation of `exp2(x) - 1` near zero."
msgstr "$2^x - 1$，避免了 `exp2(x) - 1` 在零附近的抵消。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1711
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2: $\\operatorname{exp2m1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{exp2m1}(-\\infty) = -1$ and $\\operatorname{exp2m1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$, with no exception. An integral $x$ gives the exact integer $2^x - 1$ (or $-(1 - 2^{x})$ for $x < 0$), rounded as a dyadic: exact or a rounding tie while it has at most $p + 1$ bits, and otherwise the neighbour of $2^x$ chosen by the rounding direction without forming $2^x - 1$. For $x \\le -(p + 3)$ the value lies within $2^{-(p+3)}$ above $-1$ and the rounding direction alone decides (as for `expm1`). A result certainly beyond the exponent range is decided before the main loop, so $x$ near $e_{\\max} + 1$ overflows with the correct flags."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2：$\\operatorname{exp2m1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$、$\\operatorname{exp2m1}(-\\infty) = -1$、$\\operatorname{exp2m1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$，均无异常。整数 $x$ 给出精确的整数 $2^x - 1$（$x < 0$ 时为 $-(1 - 2^{x})$），并作为二进有理数舍入：当它至多有 $p + 1$ 位时精确或恰为舍入平局，否则由舍入方向在 $2^x$ 的邻点中选择，而不构造 $2^x - 1$。对 $x \\le -(p + 3)$，值位于 $-1$ 之上 $2^{-(p+3)}$ 以内，仅由舍入方向决定（与 `expm1` 相同）。必然超出指数范围的结果在主循环之前就已判定，因此 $x$ 接近 $e_{\\max} + 1$ 时会带着正确的标志上溢。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1723
msgid "$10^x - 1$ without the cancellation of `exp10(x) - 1` near zero."
msgstr "$10^x - 1$，避免了 `exp10(x) - 1` 在零附近的抵消。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1731
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2: the special values of `exp2m1`. A positive integer $x \\le \\max(4096, p)$ gives the exact integer $10^x - 1$, rounded as a dyadic. Saturation towards $-1$ and the overflow decision follow `exp2m1`, with $\\log_2 10$ in place of 1."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2：特殊值与 `exp2m1` 相同。不超过 $\\max(4096, p)$ 的正整数 $x$ 给出精确的整数 $10^x - 1$，并作为二进有理数舍入。向 $-1$ 的饱和与上溢判定同 `exp2m1`，只是以 $\\log_2 10$ 代替 1。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1738
msgid "The power of two $2^x$."
msgstr "2 的幂 $2^x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1746
msgid "An integral $x$ with $|x| < 2^{31}$ gives the exact $2^x$, rounded into the context only when it leaves the exponent range. The other special values are those of `exp`."
msgstr "满足 $|x| < 2^{31}$ 的整数 $x$ 给出精确的 $2^x$，仅当其超出指数范围时才舍入到上下文中。其他特殊值与 `exp` 相同。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1752
msgid "The power of ten $10^x$."
msgstr "10 的幂 $10^x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1760
msgid "An integral $x$ in $[0, \\max(4096, p)]$ gives the exact $10^x = 5^x 2^x$, rounded once. For a larger integral $x$ the odd part $5^x$ has more than $p + 1$ bits, so the result is neither representable nor a midpoint, and a negative integral $x$ gives a value that is never dyadic; both are always inexact. The other special values are those of `exp`."
msgstr "$[0, \\max(4096, p)]$ 中的整数 $x$ 给出精确的 $10^x = 5^x 2^x$，只舍入一次。对更大的整数 $x$，奇数部分 $5^x$ 多于 $p + 1$ 位，因此结果既不可表示也不是中点；负整数 $x$ 给出的值永远不是二进有理数。这两种情形总是不精确的。其他特殊值与 `exp` 相同。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1768
msgid "The natural logarithm $\\ln x$."
msgstr "自然对数 $\\ln x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1776
msgid "The domain is $x > 0$. $\\ln 1 = +0$ exactly; $\\ln(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`; $\\ln(+\\infty) = +\\infty$. A negative finite argument is a `domain_error`, while $-\\infty$ gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation` also from `try_ln_ctx`."
msgstr "定义域为 $x > 0$。$\\ln 1 = +0$ 精确成立；$\\ln(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`；$\\ln(+\\infty) = +\\infty$。负的有限参数为 `domain_error`，而 $-\\infty$ 即使在 `try_ln_ctx` 中也给出静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1783
msgid "The two directed roundings of $e^x$ or $\\ln x$ in one call, for the interval types."
msgstr "一次调用得到 $e^x$ 或 $\\ln x$ 的两个定向舍入，供区间类型使用。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1790
msgid ""
"`x.try_exp_directed_pair(p)` returns the values of `x.try_exp_ctx` at precision $p$ under `RoundTowardNegative` and under `RoundTowardPositive`, as `(low, high)`, and the error of the first of the two calls that fails; `try_ln_directed_pair` is the same for `try_ln_ctx`. For every operand the result is exactly what the two calls give. Where one certified enclosure can decide both roundings (a finite $x \\n"
"e 0$ with an in-range result for `exp`, a finite positive $x \\n"
"e 1$ for `ln`) it costs one evaluation instead of two; every other operand is answered by the two calls themselves."
msgstr ""
"`x.try_exp_directed_pair(p)` 返回 `x.try_exp_ctx` 在精度 $p$ 下分别取 `RoundTowardNegative` 与 `RoundTowardPositive` 的两个值，写作 `(low, high)`，以及两次调用中先失败的那一次的错误；`try_ln_directed_pair` 对 `try_ln_ctx` 同理。对每个操作数，结果恰好就是那两次调用给出的结果。当一个认证包络能同时决定两个舍入时（`exp` 是有限的 $x \\n"
"e 0$ 且结果在范围内，`ln` 是有限的正数 $x \\n"
"e 1$），它只需一次求值而不是两次；其他所有操作数由那两次调用本身回答。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1794
msgid "$\\ln(1 + x)$ without the rounding of `1 + x`."
msgstr "$\\ln(1 + x)$，避免了 `1 + x` 的舍入。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1802
msgid "The domain is $x > -1$. $\\operatorname{log1p}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{log1p}(-1) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, a finite $x < -1$ is a `domain_error`, and $-\\infty$ gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "定义域为 $x > -1$。$\\operatorname{log1p}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{log1p}(-1) = -\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`，有限的 $x < -1$ 为 `domain_error`，$-\\infty$ 给出静默 NaN 并触发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1809
msgid "$\\log_2(1 + x)$ without the rounding of `1 + x`."
msgstr "$\\log_2(1 + x)$，不经过 `1 + x` 的舍入。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1817
msgid "The domain is $x \\ge -1$ (Table 9.1). $\\operatorname{log2p1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{log2p1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$, $\\operatorname{log2p1}(-1) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, a finite $x < -1$ is a `domain_error`, and $-\\infty$ gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`. $x = 2^k - 1$ (and $x = -(1 - 2^{-k})$) gives the exact integer $k$ (and $-k$)."
msgstr "定义域为 $x \\ge -1$（表 9.1）。$\\operatorname{log2p1}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{log2p1}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$，$\\operatorname{log2p1}(-1) = -\\infty$ 并伴随 `division_by_zero`，有限的 $x < -1$ 是 `domain_error`，$-\\infty$ 给出带 `invalid_operation` 的安静 NaN。$x = 2^k - 1$（以及 $x = -(1 - 2^{-k})$）给出精确的整数 $k$（以及 $-k$）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1825
msgid "$\\log_{10}(1 + x)$ without the rounding of `1 + x`."
msgstr "$\\log_{10}(1 + x)$，不经过 `1 + x` 的舍入。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1833
msgid "The special values of `log2p1`. $x = 10^k - 1$ for an integer $k \\ge 1$ gives the exact integer $k$."
msgstr "特殊值与 `log2p1` 相同。整数 $k \\ge 1$ 时，$x = 10^k - 1$ 给出精确的整数 $k$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1838
msgid "The binary logarithm $\\log_2 x$."
msgstr "二进制对数 $\\log_2 x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1846
msgid "Special values and domain as for `ln`. A power of two $2^k$ gives the exact integer $k$, rounded into the context."
msgstr "特殊值和定义域同 `ln`。2 的幂 $2^k$ 给出精确整数 $k$，并舍入到上下文中。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1851
msgid "The decimal logarithm $\\log_{10} x$."
msgstr "十进制对数 $\\log_{10} x$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1859
msgid "Special values and domain as for `ln`. $x = 10^k$ with $k \\ge 1$ (stored as the coefficient $5^k$ and exponent $k$) gives the exact integer $k$, rounded into the context, at any precision that holds $10^k$."
msgstr "特殊值和定义域同 `ln`。在能容纳 $10^k$ 的任何精度下，$k \\ge 1$ 的 $x = 10^k$（存储为系数 $5^k$ 和指数 $k$）给出精确整数 $k$，并舍入到上下文中。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1865
msgid "The real power $x^y$."
msgstr "实数幂 $x^y$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1873
msgid "The cases are tried in this order, as in IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1:"
msgstr "按以下顺序尝试各情形，与 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 一致："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1875
msgid "$x^{\\pm 0} = 1$ for every $x$, and $1^y = 1$ for every $y$, NaN included (also a signaling NaN, without `invalid_operation`)."
msgstr "对任意 $x$，$x^{\\pm 0} = 1$；对任意 $y$，$1^y = 1$，包括 NaN（信号 NaN 亦然，且不触发 `invalid_operation`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1877
msgid "An integral $y$ with $|y| < 2^{31}$ is `pown_ctx(x, y)`."
msgstr "满足 $|y| < 2^{31}$ 的整数 $y$ 即 `pown_ctx(x, y)`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1878
msgid "A NaN operand propagates."
msgstr "NaN 操作数会传播。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1879
msgid "An infinite $y$: $(\\pm 1)^{\\pm\\infty} = 1$; otherwise the result is $+\\infty$ when $|x| > 1$ and $y = +\\infty$ or $|x| < 1$ and $y = -\\infty$, and $+0$ in the other two cases, $x = \\pm 0$ included ($(\\pm 0)^{-\\infty} = +\\infty$). No flag is raised."
msgstr "$y$ 为无穷：$(\\pm 1)^{\\pm\\infty} = 1$；否则，当 $|x| > 1$ 且 $y = +\\infty$，或 $|x| < 1$ 且 $y = -\\infty$ 时，结果为 $+\\infty$，其余两种情形为 $+0$，$x = \\pm 0$ 也包括在内（$(\\pm 0)^{-\\infty} = +\\infty$）。不触发任何标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1883
msgid "An infinite $x$: $(\\pm\\infty)^{y < 0}$ is a zero and $(\\pm\\infty)^{y > 0}$ an infinity, negative only for $x = -\\infty$ and an odd integral $y$. No flag is raised."
msgstr "$x$ 为无穷：$(\\pm\\infty)^{y < 0}$ 为零，$(\\pm\\infty)^{y > 0}$ 为无穷，仅当 $x = -\\infty$ 且 $y$ 为奇整数时为负。不触发任何标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1886
msgid "A zero $x$: $(\\pm 0)^{y < 0}$ is an infinity with `division_by_zero` and $(\\pm 0)^{y > 0}$ a zero, negative only for $x = -0$ and an odd integral $y$; so $(-0)^{3/4} = +0$."
msgstr "$x$ 为零：$(\\pm 0)^{y < 0}$ 为无穷并触发 `division_by_zero`，$(\\pm 0)^{y > 0}$ 为零，仅当 $x = -0$ 且 $y$ 为奇整数时为负；因此 $(-0)^{3/4} = +0$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1889
msgid "A negative finite $x$ with a non-integral $y$ is a `domain_error`. With an integral $y$ (here $|y| \\ge 2^{31}$) the result is $|x|^y$ for an even $y$ and $-|x|^y$ for an odd one, computed with the directed rounding modes swapped."
msgstr "负的有限 $x$ 配非整数 $y$ 为 `domain_error`。对整数 $y$（此处 $|y| \\ge 2^{31}$），$y$ 为偶数时结果为 $|x|^y$，为奇数时为 $-|x|^y$，计算时交换两种定向舍入模式。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1893
msgid "$y = \\pm 2^{-k}$ with $1 \\le k \\le 29$ is `try_rootn_ctx(x, \\pm 2^k)`."
msgstr "满足 $1 \\le k \\le 29$ 的 $y = \\pm 2^{-k}$ 即 `try_rootn_ctx(x, \\pm 2^k)`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1894
msgid "A result certainly outside the exponent range is decided from certified bounds on $\\log_2 x$."
msgstr "必然超出指数范围的结果由 $\\log_2 x$ 的认证界判定。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1896
msgid "An exactly dyadic result is computed and rounded once. For $x = c \\cdot 2^e$ and $y = m / 2^k$ ($c$, $m$ odd, $1 \\le k \\le 30$) it exists exactly when $2^k$ divides $e$ and $c$ is a perfect $2^k$-th power $r$ (tested as for `rootn`, for coefficients of any size); then $x^y = r^m \\cdot 2^{me/2^k}$, which is dyadic for $m < 0$ only when $r = 1$. So $16^{3/4} = 8$ without `inexact`. A dyadic result whose odd part would need more than $2p + 64$ bits is not a rounding breakpoint and is left to the next step."
msgstr "恰为二进有理数的结果会被精确计算并只舍入一次。对 $x = c \\cdot 2^e$ 和 $y = m / 2^k$（$c$、$m$ 为奇数，$1 \\le k \\le 30$），这样的结果存在当且仅当 $2^k$ 整除 $e$ 且 $c$ 是完全 $2^k$ 次幂 $r$（与 `rootn` 一样进行检验，适用于任意大小的系数）；此时 $x^y = r^m \\cdot 2^{me/2^k}$，当 $m < 0$ 时仅在 $r = 1$ 时为二进有理数。因此 $16^{3/4} = 8$ 不触发 `inexact`。奇数部分需要多于 $2p + 64$ 位的二进有理结果不是舍入断点，留给下一步处理。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1904
msgid "Otherwise the value is certified from enclosures of $e^{y \\ln x}$."
msgstr "否则，由 $e^{y \\ln x}$ 的包络认证该值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1906
msgid "Integrality and parity of $y$ are read from its odd coefficient: a finite nonzero $y$ is integral when `exponent2()` $\\ge 0$ and odd when it is $0$. When step 10 has shown that the result is not a rounding breakpoint, step 11 moves a representable enclosure end just inside before rounding, so an exponent so small that $x^y$ lies closer to $1$ than the target spacing is still certified: $2^{2^{-16000}}$ in `binary128()` is $1$ with `inexact`. A few results with a power-of-two base that step 10 cannot classify (an exponent of magnitude at least $2^{31}$, or a scale outside the 32-bit range) keep the plain test."
msgstr "$y$ 的整数性和奇偶性由其奇数系数读出：有限非零的 $y$ 在 `exponent2()` $\\ge 0$ 时为整数，在其为 $0$ 时为奇数。当第 10 步已表明结果不是舍入断点时，第 11 步会在舍入之前把可表示的包络端点移到内侧紧邻处，因此即使指数小到 $x^y$ 距 $1$ 比目标间距还近，结果仍能得到认证：`binary128()` 中的 $2^{2^{-16000}}$ 为 $1$ 并触发 `inexact`。少数底数为 2 的幂、第 10 步无法分类的结果（指数的绝对值至少为 $2^{31}$，或缩放超出 32 位范围）保留普通测试。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1918
msgid "The real $n$-th root $x^{1/n}$."
msgstr "实数 $n$ 次方根 $x^{1/n}$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1926
msgid "$n = 0$ is a `domain_error`, an invalid operation, for every $x$, a quiet NaN and $\\pm 0$ included (IEEE 754-2019 Table 9.1, \"n = 0: invalid operation\"); it is not `division_by_zero`, which §7.3 keeps for an exact infinite result on finite operands, here $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n)$ with $n < 0$. `rootn_ctx` then returns a quiet NaN with `invalid`. Every other `Int` degree is supported, including `Int.min`; a NaN propagates. A negative $n$ gives $x^{-1/|n|}$."
msgstr "$n = 0$ 为 `domain_error`，即无效操作，对任意 $x$ 都成立，安静 NaN 与 $\\pm 0$ 也不例外（IEEE 754-2019 表 9.1：“n = 0: invalid operation”）；它不是 `division_by_zero`，后者按 §7.3 只留给有限操作数上的精确无穷结果，这里即 $n < 0$ 的 $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n)$。此时 `rootn_ctx` 返回带 `invalid` 的安静 NaN。其他所有 `Int` 次数均受支持，包括 `Int.min`；NaN 会传播。负的 $n$ 给出 $x^{-1/|n|}$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1929
msgid "odd $n > 0$"
msgstr "奇数 $n > 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1929
msgid "even $n > 0$"
msgstr "偶数 $n > 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1929
msgid "odd $n < 0$"
msgstr "奇数 $n < 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1929
msgid "even $n < 0$"
msgstr "偶数 $n < 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1935
msgid "finite $x < 0$"
msgstr "有限 $x < 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1937
msgid "So $\\operatorname{rootn}(-8, 3) = -2$. $n = 1$ rounds $x$ into the context and $n = -1$ is the correctly rounded $1/x$. For any other degree an exact root is detected when $|n|$ divides the exponent of $x = c \\cdot 2^e$ and the odd coefficient $c$ (of any size) is a perfect $|n|$-th power $r$; the result is then $\\pm r \\cdot 2^{e/|n|}$ rounded once, or for $n < 0$ the correctly rounded reciprocal of it. So $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3) = 1/2$ without `inexact` in every rounding mode, and an exact square root of a 6001-bit coefficient is found as well."
msgstr "因此 $\\operatorname{rootn}(-8, 3) = -2$。$n = 1$ 将 $x$ 舍入到上下文中，$n = -1$ 为正确舍入的 $1/x$。对其他任何次数，当 $|n|$ 整除 $x = c \\cdot 2^e$ 的指数，且奇数系数 $c$（任意大小）是完全 $|n|$ 次幂 $r$ 时，会检测到精确根；此时结果为只舍入一次的 $\\pm r \\cdot 2^{e/|n|}$，当 $n < 0$ 时则为其正确舍入的倒数。因此在任何舍入模式下 $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3) = 1/2$ 都不触发 `inexact`，6001 位系数的精确平方根也同样能被找到。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1948
msgid "The reciprocal square root $1/\\sqrt{x}$ (`rSqrt` of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2)."
msgstr "倒数平方根 $1/\\sqrt{x}$（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的 `rSqrt`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1956
msgid "§9.2.1: $\\operatorname{rSqrt}(+\\infty) = +0$ with no exception and $\\operatorname{rSqrt}(\\pm 0) = \\pm\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, so $\\operatorname{rSqrt}(-0) = -\\infty$ (MPFR's `mpfr_rec_sqrt` returns $+\\infty$ there by its own convention, and the oracle rows follow the standard). A negative finite $x$ and $-\\infty$ are a `domain_error` (Table 9.1, \"$x < 0$: invalid operation\"); a signaling NaN is invalid and a quiet NaN propagates. A positive finite $x$ is `rootn_ctx(x, -2)`: a power of four $4^k$ gives the exact $2^{-k}$ without `inexact`, and an exponent far outside the range is decided without forming the root."
msgstr "§9.2.1：$\\operatorname{rSqrt}(+\\infty) = +0$，无异常；$\\operatorname{rSqrt}(\\pm 0) = \\pm\\infty$，并触发 `division_by_zero`，所以 $\\operatorname{rSqrt}(-0) = -\\infty$（MPFR 的 `mpfr_rec_sqrt` 按其自身约定在此返回 $+\\infty$，预言行遵循标准）。负的有限 $x$ 和 $-\\infty$ 是 `domain_error`（表 9.1，“$x < 0$：无效操作”）；信号 NaN 无效，安静 NaN 传播。正的有限 $x$ 即 `rootn_ctx(x, -2)`：4 的幂 $4^k$ 给出精确的 $2^{-k}$ 且不触发 `inexact`，指数远超范围时无需形成平方根即可判定。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1968
msgid "The compound factor $(1 + x)^n$ for an integer $n$, with the exact sum $1 + x$ (interest and growth rates, without the rounding of `1 + x`)."
msgstr "整数 $n$ 的复合因子 $(1 + x)^n$，使用精确的和 $1 + x$（利率与增长率，不经过 `1 + x` 的舍入）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1977
msgid "The special values of §9.2.1 are decided first, a signaling NaN before any of them:"
msgstr "先判定 §9.2.1 的特殊值，信号 NaN 在所有特殊值之前："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1982
msgid "quiet NaN"
msgstr "安静 NaN"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1983
msgid "$-\\infty$, finite $x < -1$"
msgstr "$-\\infty$，有限的 $x < -1$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1988
msgid "Otherwise $1 + x$ is formed exactly (for any operand up to $2^{26}$ bits) and the result is `pown_ctx(1 + x, n)`, so the exact cases, the range decision and the single rounding are those of `pown`. When $|n x|$ is below $2^{-(p + 9)}$ the result is the neighbour of $1$ (or $1$) that the rounding direction chooses, always inexact and never an underflow. A wider operand (beyond $2^{26}$ bits) is not representable in the context and is certified from $n \\cdot \\operatorname{log1p}(x)$."
msgstr "否则精确地形成 $1 + x$（操作数不超过 $2^{26}$ 位时），结果为 `pown_ctx(1 + x, n)`，所以精确情形、范围判定和唯一一次舍入都与 `pown` 相同。当 $|n x|$ 小于 $2^{-(p + 9)}$ 时，结果是舍入方向所选的 $1$ 的邻值（或 $1$），总是不精确且从不下溢。更宽的操作数（超过 $2^{26}$ 位）无法在上下文中表示，由 $n \\cdot \\operatorname{log1p}(x)$ 认证。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:1998
msgid "The real power $x^y$ defined as $\\exp(y \\ln x)$, so that the domain excludes a negative $x$ (`powr` of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2)."
msgstr "实数幂 $x^y$，定义为 $\\exp(y \\ln x)$，因此定义域不含负的 $x$（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的 `powr`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2007
msgid "The cases are tried in this order, as in §9.2.1; every `domain_error` below is a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation` from `powr_ctx`:"
msgstr "各情形按 §9.2.1 的顺序依次判定；下面每个 `domain_error` 在 `powr_ctx` 中都是带 `invalid_operation` 的安静 NaN："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2010
msgid "A signaling NaN operand is invalid; a quiet NaN base gives a quiet NaN."
msgstr "信号 NaN 操作数无效；安静 NaN 底数给出安静 NaN。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2011
msgid "A negative $x$ ($-\\infty$ included, a quiet NaN exponent too) is invalid: $\\operatorname{powr}(x, y)$ for $x < 0$ is never a real number."
msgstr "负的 $x$（含 $-\\infty$，指数为安静 NaN 时也一样）无效：$x < 0$ 时 $\\operatorname{powr}(x, y)$ 永远不是实数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2013
msgid "A quiet NaN $y$ gives a quiet NaN."
msgstr "安静 NaN 的 $y$ 给出安静 NaN。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2014
msgid "$x = \\pm 0$: $y = \\pm 0$ is invalid; $y = -\\infty$ gives $+\\infty$ with no exception; a finite $y < 0$ gives $+\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`; $y > 0$ gives $+0$."
msgstr "$x = \\pm 0$：$y = \\pm 0$ 无效；$y = -\\infty$ 给出 $+\\infty$，无异常；有限的 $y < 0$ 给出 $+\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`；$y > 0$ 给出 $+0$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2017
msgid "$x = +\\infty$: $y = \\pm 0$ is invalid; $y < 0$ gives $+0$; $y > 0$ gives $+\\infty$."
msgstr "$x = +\\infty$：$y = \\pm 0$ 无效；$y < 0$ 给出 $+0$；$y > 0$ 给出 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2019
msgid "$x = +1$: $\\pm\\infty$ is invalid, any other $y$ gives $1$."
msgstr "$x = +1$：$\\pm\\infty$ 无效，其他任何 $y$ 给出 $1$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2020
msgid "$y = \\pm 0$ gives $1$."
msgstr "$y = \\pm 0$ 给出 $1$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2021
msgid "Otherwise $x > 0$ and $y$ is finite and nonzero: `try_pow_ctx(x, y)`, which owns the exact dyadic cases, the range decision and the rounding."
msgstr "否则 $x > 0$ 且 $y$ 为有限非零：`try_pow_ctx(x, y)`，由它负责精确的二进有理数情形、范围判定和舍入。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2024
msgid "So $\\operatorname{powr}(\\pm 0, \\pm 0)$, $\\operatorname{powr}(+\\infty, \\pm 0)$ and $\\operatorname{powr}(1, \\pm\\infty)$ are invalid operations, where `pow` gives $1$ for the first two and for $1^{\\pm\\infty}$ (§9.2.1)."
msgstr "所以 $\\operatorname{powr}(\\pm 0, \\pm 0)$、$\\operatorname{powr}(+\\infty, \\pm 0)$ 和 $\\operatorname{powr}(1, \\pm\\infty)$ 是无效操作，而 `pow` 对前两者以及 $1^{\\pm\\infty}$ 给出 $1$（§9.2.1）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2030
msgid "$\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ without intermediate overflow or underflow."
msgstr "$\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$，不会发生中间上溢或下溢。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2038
msgid "The squares are formed exactly and one correctly rounded square root is taken, so the result is $\\circ(\\sqrt{x^2+y^2})$ and exact when the root is. $\\operatorname{hypot}(\\pm\\infty, y) = +\\infty$ even when $y$ is a NaN (`invalid_operation` is raised only for a signaling NaN). When the smaller operand $b$ is too small to move $\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}$ past the next rounding breakpoint above $|a|$, it is replaced by a power of two that rounds the same way: for $|a| = c \\cdot 2^e$ with leading bit $2^t$ and $g = \\min(e, t - p - 1)$, every $|b| < 2^{g - 3}$ becomes $2^{g - 3}$. The exact sum stays small however far apart the exponents are: $\\operatorname{hypot}(1, 2^{-600000})$ is $1$ with `inexact`. The exact sum is refused with a `certification_failure` only when its two squares would still be shifted against each other by more than $10^6$ bits, which needs an operand or target precision near $500\\,000$ bits."
msgstr "两个平方被精确构成，然后只取一次正确舍入的平方根，因此结果为 $\\circ(\\sqrt{x^2+y^2})$，且当平方根精确时结果也精确。即使 $y$ 为 NaN，$\\operatorname{hypot}(\\pm\\infty, y) = +\\infty$（仅对信号 NaN 触发 `invalid_operation`）。当较小的操作数 $b$ 小到不足以把 $\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}$ 推过 $|a|$ 之上的下一个舍入断点时，它会被替换为一个舍入方式相同的 2 的幂：对首位为 $2^t$ 的 $|a| = c \\cdot 2^e$ 以及 $g = \\min(e, t - p - 1)$，所有 $|b| < 2^{g - 3}$ 都变为 $2^{g - 3}$。无论两个指数相差多远，精确和的规模都保持很小：$\\operatorname{hypot}(1, 2^{-600000})$ 为 $1$ 并触发 `inexact`。只有当两个平方之间仍需相互移位超过 $10^6$ 位时，精确和才会以 `certification_failure` 被拒绝，这需要操作数或目标精度接近 $500\\,000$ 位。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2054
msgid "The sine of an argument in radians."
msgstr "以弧度为参数的正弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2062
msgid "$\\sin(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ exactly; an infinite argument is a `domain_error`. The argument is reduced by an enclosure of $\\pi/2$ computed at a working precision of at least $p + \\max(0, \\lfloor\\log_2|x|\\rfloor + 1) + 96$ bits, so the quadrant is certain for every finite input. When that starting precision exceeds $10^6$ bits, that is for $|x| \\ge 2^{10^6 - p - 96}$, the result is a `certification_failure` with stage `RangeReduction` and reason `ResourceLimit`, returned at once; no attempt goes beyond $10^6$ bits."
msgstr "$\\sin(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ 精确成立；无穷参数为 `domain_error`。参数用在至少 $p + \\max(0, \\lfloor\\log_2|x|\\rfloor + 1) + 96$ 位的工作精度下计算的 $\\pi/2$ 包络进行约简，因此对每个有限输入，象限都是确定的。当该起始精度超过 $10^6$ 位，即 $|x| \\ge 2^{10^6 - p - 96}$ 时，立即返回阶段为 `RangeReduction`、原因为 `ResourceLimit` 的 `certification_failure`；任何尝试都不会超过 $10^6$ 位。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2072
msgid "The cosine of an argument in radians."
msgstr "以弧度为参数的余弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2080
msgid "$\\cos(\\pm 0) = 1$ exactly. Reduction, domain and limits as for `sin`."
msgstr "$\\cos(\\pm 0) = 1$ 精确成立。约简、定义域和限制同 `sin`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2084
msgid "The tangent of an argument in radians."
msgstr "以弧度为参数的正切。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2092
msgid "$\\tan(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ exactly. Reduction, domain and limits as for `sin`. No binary argument is an odd multiple of $\\pi/2$, so there is no pole; an enclosure of the cosine that contains zero is refined like any other."
msgstr "$\\tan(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ 精确成立。约简、定义域和限制同 `sin`。没有任何二进制参数是 $\\pi/2$ 的奇数倍，因此不存在极点；包含零的余弦包络会像其他包络一样被细化。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2106
msgid "The period is reduced exactly on the binary representation, so huge arguments cost nothing extra. For integral $n$, $\\operatorname{sinpi}(n)$ is $\\pm 0$ with the sign of $n$; at $n + \\frac12$ it is $\\pm 1$. An infinite argument is a `domain_error`. By Niven's theorem these are the only dyadic arguments with a dyadic result."
msgstr "周期在二进制表示上被精确约简，因此巨大参数不会带来额外开销。对整数 $n$，$\\operatorname{sinpi}(n)$ 为 $\\pm 0$（符号与 $n$ 相同）；在 $n + \\frac12$ 处为 $\\pm 1$。无穷参数为 `domain_error`。由 Niven 定理，这些是仅有的给出二进有理数结果的二进有理数参数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2122
msgid "$\\operatorname{cospi}(n) = (-1)^n$ for integral $n$ and $\\operatorname{cospi}(n + \\frac12) = +0$. Reduction and domain as for `sinpi`."
msgstr "对整数 $n$，$\\operatorname{cospi}(n) = (-1)^n$，且 $\\operatorname{cospi}(n + \\frac12) = +0$。约简和定义域同 `sinpi`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2136
msgid "For integral $n$, $\\operatorname{tanpi}(n)$ is a zero with the sign of $\\operatorname{sinpi}(n) / \\operatorname{cospi}(n)$: $-0$ for positive odd and negative even $n$ (including $-0$), $+0$ otherwise, so `tanpi(1)` is $-0$ and `tanpi(-1)` is $+0$. $\\operatorname{tanpi}(n + \\frac12)$ is $+\\infty$ for even $n$ and $-\\infty$ for odd $n$, with `division_by_zero`; $\\operatorname{tanpi}(n \\pm \\frac14) = \\pm 1$ exactly. Reduction and domain as for `sinpi`."
msgstr "对整数 $n$，$\\operatorname{tanpi}(n)$ 为零，其符号同 $\\operatorname{sinpi}(n) / \\operatorname{cospi}(n)$：对正奇数和负偶数 $n$（包括 $-0$）为 $-0$，否则为 $+0$，因此 `tanpi(1)` 为 $-0$，`tanpi(-1)` 为 $+0$。$\\operatorname{tanpi}(n + \\frac12)$ 对偶数 $n$ 为 $+\\infty$，对奇数 $n$ 为 $-\\infty$，并触发 `division_by_zero`；$\\operatorname{tanpi}(n \\pm \\frac14) = \\pm 1$ 精确成立。约简和定义域同 `sinpi`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2146
msgid "The arcsine, with values in $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$."
msgstr "反正弦，取值于 $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2154
msgid "The domain is $[-1, 1]$; a finite argument outside it and both infinities are a `domain_error`. $\\operatorname{asin}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{asin}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\pi/2$ correctly rounded."
msgstr "定义域为 $[-1, 1]$；其外的有限参数以及两个无穷都是 `domain_error`。$\\operatorname{asin}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{asin}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\pi/2$（正确舍入）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2160
msgid "The arccosine, with values in $[0, \\pi]$."
msgstr "反余弦，取值于 $[0, \\pi]$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2168
msgid "The domain is $[-1, 1]$; a finite argument outside it and both infinities are a `domain_error`, and a NaN propagates as for `asin`. On $[-1, 1]$ the result is $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin}(x)$ evaluated as one enclosure; $\\operatorname{acos}(1) = +0$ exactly and $\\operatorname{acos}(-1) = \\pi$ correctly rounded."
msgstr "定义域为 $[-1, 1]$；其外的有限参数以及两个无穷都是 `domain_error`，NaN 与 `asin` 一样传播。在 $[-1, 1]$ 上，结果为作为一个包络求值的 $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin}(x)$；$\\operatorname{acos}(1) = +0$ 精确成立，$\\operatorname{acos}(-1) = \\pi$（正确舍入）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2176
msgid "The arctangent, with values in $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$."
msgstr "反正切，取值于 $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2184
msgid "Defined on all of $\\mathbb{R}$: $\\operatorname{atan}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{atan}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\pi/2$ correctly rounded."
msgstr "在整个 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上有定义：$\\operatorname{atan}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{atan}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\pi/2$（正确舍入）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2189
msgid "The angle of the point $(x, y)$ for `y.atan2(x)`, in $[-\\pi, \\pi]$."
msgstr "`y.atan2(x)` 中点 $(x, y)$ 的辐角，取值于 $[-\\pi, \\pi]$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2197
msgid "The receiver is the ordinate $y$. The special cases follow IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1; $x \\ge +0$ below means $+0$ or a positive $x$, $x \\le -0$ means $-0$ or a negative $x$, infinities included:"
msgstr "接收者是纵坐标 $y$。特殊情形遵循 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1；下文中 $x \\ge +0$ 表示 $+0$ 或正的 $x$，$x \\le -0$ 表示 $-0$ 或负的 $x$，均包括无穷："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2201
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2285
msgid "result"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2203
msgid "$\\pm 0$ (exact)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$（精确）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2207
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2291
msgid "finite"
msgstr "有限"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2208
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2209
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2210
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2292
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2293
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2294
msgid ""
"finite $y \\n"
"e 0$"
msgstr ""
"有限 $y \\n"
"e 0$"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2208
msgid "$\\pm\\pi/2$ (sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pm\\pi/2$（符号同 $y$）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2209
msgid "$\\pm 0$ (sign of $y$, exact)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$（符号同 $y$，精确）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2210
msgid "$\\pm\\pi$ (sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pm\\pi$（符号同 $y$）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2212
msgid "A NaN operand propagates. Multiples of $\\pi$ are correctly rounded and `inexact`. So $\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, -0) = -\\pi$ and $\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, +0) = -0$."
msgstr "NaN 操作数会传播。$\\pi$ 的倍数经过正确舍入并且为 `inexact`。因此 $\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, -0) = -\\pi$，$\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, +0) = -0$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2218
msgid "$\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$, the angle in half-revolutions (`asinPi` of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2)."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$，以半圈为单位的角度（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的 `asinPi`）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2226
msgid "The domain is $[-1, 1]$ (Table 9.1): $|x| > 1$ and $\\pm\\infty$ are a `domain_error` (a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation` from `asinpi_ctx`). $\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ with no exception, and $\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/2$ exactly. $\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1/2) = \\pm 1/6$ is rational but not dyadic, so it is rounded and `inexact` like every other argument (by Niven's theorem these are the only rational values). For a tiny $x$ the result is $x/\\pi$ up to a relative error of order $x^2$ and is rounded from a certified enclosure whatever the exponent range, down to the implementation subnormal limit."
msgstr "定义域为 $[-1, 1]$（表 9.1）：$|x| > 1$ 和 $\\pm\\infty$ 是 `domain_error`（`asinpi_ctx` 给出带 `invalid_operation` 的安静 NaN）。$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，无异常；$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/2$，精确。$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1/2) = \\pm 1/6$ 是有理数但不是二进有理数，所以和其他参数一样被舍入并触发 `inexact`（由 Niven 定理，这些是仅有的有理值）。对微小的 $x$，结果是 $x/\\pi$，相对误差为 $x^2$ 量级，无论指数范围如何，都由认证的包络舍入，直到实现的次正规数极限。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2246
msgid "The domain is $[-1, 1]$ as for `asinpi`. $\\operatorname{acosPi}(1) = +0$, $\\operatorname{acosPi}(-1) = 1$ and $\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm 0) = 1/2$, exact and without exception (§9.2.1). For a tiny $|x|$ the result is $1/2 \\mp \\delta$ with $0 < \\delta < |x|/2$, so it clusters at the representable $1/2$: when $|x| < 2^{-(p + 4)}$ the rounding direction alone decides between $1/2$ and its neighbour on that side (below for $x > 0$, above for $x < 0$), before the main loop, and the result is always `inexact`."
msgstr "定义域与 `asinpi` 相同，为 $[-1, 1]$。$\\operatorname{acosPi}(1) = +0$、$\\operatorname{acosPi}(-1) = 1$、$\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm 0) = 1/2$，均精确且无异常（§9.2.1）。对微小的 $|x|$，结果为 $1/2 \\mp \\delta$，$0 < \\delta < |x|/2$，所以聚集在可表示的 $1/2$ 处：当 $|x| < 2^{-(p + 4)}$ 时，在主循环之前仅由舍入方向决定结果是 $1/2$ 还是它在该侧的邻值（$x > 0$ 时在下方，$x < 0$ 时在上方），并且结果总是 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2264
msgid "Defined on all of $\\mathbb{R}$. $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ with no exception, $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm 1/2$ with no exception (§9.2.1) and $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/4$ exactly. For $|x| \\ge 2^{p + 8}$ the result is $\\pm(1/2 - \\delta)$ with $0 < \\delta < 2^{-t}$ for $2^t \\le |x|$, so the rounding direction alone decides between $\\pm 1/2$ and its neighbour inside, without forming a value that close to $1/2$. A tiny $x$ gives $x/\\pi$ rounded from a certified enclosure (underflow with the flags of §7.5 and §7.6)."
msgstr "在整个 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上有定义。$\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，无异常；$\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm 1/2$，无异常（§9.2.1）；$\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/4$，精确。对 $|x| \\ge 2^{p + 8}$，结果为 $\\pm(1/2 - \\delta)$，其中 $2^t \\le |x|$ 时 $0 < \\delta < 2^{-t}$，所以仅由舍入方向决定结果是 $\\pm 1/2$ 还是它内侧的邻值，无需形成与 $1/2$ 如此接近的值。微小的 $x$ 给出 $x/\\pi$，由认证的包络舍入（按 §7.5 和 §7.6 的标志下溢）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2274
msgid "$\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$ for `y.atan2pi(x)`, in $[-1, 1]$."
msgstr "`y.atan2pi(x)` 的 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$，范围为 $[-1, 1]$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2282
msgid "The receiver is the ordinate $y$. Every special case of §9.2.1 is an exact constant that signals no exception:"
msgstr "接收者是纵坐标 $y$。§9.2.1 的每个特殊情形都是不触发任何异常的精确常量："

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2292
msgid "$\\pm 1/2$ (sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pm 1/2$（$y$ 的符号）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2293
msgid "$\\pm 0$ (sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$（$y$ 的符号）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2294
msgid "$\\pm 1$ (sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pm 1$（$y$ 的符号）"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2296
msgid "For finite nonzero operands $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$ is $\\operatorname{atan}(|y/x|)/\\pi$ for $x > 0$ and $1 - \\operatorname{atan}(|y/x|)/\\pi$ for $x < 0$, with the sign of $y$. $|y| = |x|$ gives the exact $\\pm 1/4$ or $\\pm 3/4$. With $D$ the difference of the leading-bit exponents of $y$ and $x$ (so $2^{D-1} < |y/x| < 2^{D+1}$), an extreme ratio is decided from the anchors before the main loop, from $|D| \\ge p + 8$: $D \\ge p + 8$ gives $1/2 - \\delta$ ($1/2 + \\delta$ for $x < 0$) with $0 < \\delta < 2^{-D}$, and $D \\le -(p + 8)$ with $x < 0$ gives $1 - \\delta$ with $0 < \\delta < 2^{D}$, each rounded by direction alone. With $x > 0$ and a tiny ratio the result is $\\approx t/\\pi$; when $D$ is below a quarter of the smallest subnormal ($D \\le e_{\\min} - p - 1$) it is the tiny nonzero result of the direction with `underflow` and `inexact`. The ratio $y/x$ itself is never formed outside the range where it is representable, so operands at the two ends of the exponent range are handled."
msgstr "对有限非零操作数，$\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$ 在 $x > 0$ 时为 $\\operatorname{atan}(|y/x|)/\\pi$，在 $x < 0$ 时为 $1 - \\operatorname{atan}(|y/x|)/\\pi$，符号取 $y$ 的符号。$|y| = |x|$ 给出精确的 $\\pm 1/4$ 或 $\\pm 3/4$。设 $D$ 为 $y$ 与 $x$ 的最高位指数之差（于是 $2^{D-1} < |y/x| < 2^{D+1}$），极端比值在主循环之前由锚点决定，从 $|D| \\ge p + 8$ 起：$D \\ge p + 8$ 给出 $1/2 - \\delta$（$x < 0$ 时为 $1/2 + \\delta$），$0 < \\delta < 2^{-D}$；$x < 0$ 且 $D \\le -(p + 8)$ 给出 $1 - \\delta$，$0 < \\delta < 2^{D}$，均仅由方向舍入。$x > 0$ 且比值很小时结果约为 $t/\\pi$；当 $D$ 低于最小次正规数的四分之一（$D \\le e_{\\min} - p - 1$）时，结果是方向所决定的微小非零结果，并伴随 `underflow` 与 `inexact`。比值 $y/x$ 本身在不可表示的范围内从不被构造，所以位于指数范围两端的操作数也能处理。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2312
msgid "The hyperbolic sine."
msgstr "双曲正弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2320
msgid "$\\sinh(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\sinh(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\infty$. Certain overflow is decided before the loop from $|\\sinh x| \\ge e^{|x|}/4$."
msgstr "$\\sinh(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\sinh(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\infty$。确定的上溢会在循环之前由 $|\\sinh x| \\ge e^{|x|}/4$ 判定。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2325
msgid "The hyperbolic cosine."
msgstr "双曲余弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2333
msgid "$\\cosh(\\pm 0) = 1$ and $\\cosh(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$; certain overflow is decided as for `sinh`."
msgstr "$\\cosh(\\pm 0) = 1$，$\\cosh(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$；确定的上溢按 `sinh` 的方式判定。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2338
msgid "The hyperbolic tangent."
msgstr "双曲正切。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2346
msgid "$\\tanh(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\tanh(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm 1$ exactly."
msgstr "$\\tanh(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\tanh(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm 1$，均精确成立。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2350
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic sine."
msgstr "反双曲正弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2358
msgid "Defined on all of $\\mathbb{R}$; $\\operatorname{asinh}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{asinh}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\infty$."
msgstr "在整个 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上有定义；$\\operatorname{asinh}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{asinh}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2363
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic cosine."
msgstr "反双曲余弦。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2371
msgid "The domain is $x \\ge 1$; any smaller argument, $-\\infty$ included, is a `domain_error`. $\\operatorname{acosh}(1) = +0$ and $\\operatorname{acosh}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$."
msgstr "定义域为 $x \\ge 1$；任何更小的参数（包括 $-\\infty$）都是 `domain_error`。$\\operatorname{acosh}(1) = +0$，$\\operatorname{acosh}(+\\infty) = +\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2377
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic tangent."
msgstr "反双曲正切。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2385
msgid "The domain is $|x| \\le 1$; outside it, infinities included, the result is a `domain_error`. $\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`."
msgstr "定义域为 $|x| \\le 1$；在其之外（包括无穷）结果为 `domain_error`。$\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2433
msgid "Structural equality, the derived `Eq`."
msgstr "结构相等，即派生的 `Eq`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2440
msgid "See [`BinFloat`](#binfloat): this compares representations, not numbers, so `==` distinguishes $\\pm 0$ and precisions and identifies equal NaNs."
msgstr "参见 [`BinFloat`](#binfloat)：它比较的是表示，而不是数值，因此 `==` 会区分 $\\pm 0$ 和精度，并将相同的 NaN 视为相等。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2445
msgid "The `Compare` methods behind `<`, `<=`, `>` and `>=`."
msgstr "`<`、`<=`、`>` 和 `>=` 背后的 `Compare` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2454
msgid "They use [`compare`](#binfloatcompare), so NaN is greater than every number: `nan > x` is `true`. Use the [IEEE predicates](#binfloatcompare_quiet_equal-binfloatcompare_quiet_less-binfloatcompare_quiet_less_equal-binfloatcompare_quiet_unordered-binfloatcompare_signaling_equal-binfloatcompare_signaling_less-binfloatcompare_signaling_less_equal) when NaN must be unordered."
msgstr "它们使用 [`compare`](#binfloatcompare)，因此 NaN 大于所有数：`nan > x` 为 `true`。当 NaN 必须是无序的时，请使用 [IEEE 谓词](#binfloatcompare_quiet_equal-binfloatcompare_quiet_less-binfloatcompare_quiet_less_equal-binfloatcompare_quiet_unordered-binfloatcompare_signaling_equal-binfloatcompare_signaling_less-binfloatcompare_signaling_less_equal)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2460
msgid "The `Show` and `Debug` methods."
msgstr "`Show` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2467
msgid "`output` writes the exact `c p e` form of [`to_string`](#binfloatto_string). `to_repr` (used by `debug_inspect`) shows every private field."
msgstr "`output` 写出 [`to_string`](#binfloatto_string) 的精确 `c p e` 形式。`to_repr`（供 `debug_inspect` 使用）显示所有私有字段。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2472
msgid "The shared floating-point vocabulary of `floating`."
msgstr "`floating` 共享的浮点词汇。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2478
msgid "`classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized` are the inherent methods above. Generic code uses `@def.is_finite`, `@def.is_nan`, `@def.is_infinite` and `@def.is_zero`."
msgstr "`classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized` 即上文的固有方法。泛型代码使用 `@def.is_finite`、`@def.is_nan`、`@def.is_infinite` 和 `@def.is_zero`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2484
msgid "`@lf_arith` traits whose methods return `Result`."
msgstr "方法返回 `Result` 的 `@lf_arith` trait。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2497
msgid "Each converts the `ArithmeticContext` with `BinaryContext::from_arithmetic_context` (an `Err` for `AwayFromZero`, a range that is not of the IEEE 754-2019 3.3 shape or a precision above `binary_precision_max`) and runs the contextual operation. The invalid flag becomes a `domain_error` and the division-by-zero flag a `division_by_zero` error; the other flags are dropped, so a NaN, an infinity, an overflow or an underflow is the IEEE 754-2019 default result in `Ok`, as for the `Double` instances of Luna-Flow/arithmetic. `sqrt_checked` is a `domain_error` for a negative nonzero argument (including $-\\infty$) and a signaling NaN; a quiet NaN of either sign is `Ok`. `DivChecked::div_checked` is a `domain_error` for $0/0$, $\\infty/\\infty$ and a signaling NaN operand, and a `division_by_zero` error for a finite non-zero dividend over a signed zero; NaN$/0$ and $\\infty/0$ are `Ok`. `pow_int_checked` is a `division_by_zero` error for a zero base with a negative exponent, and both powers are a `domain_error` for a signaling NaN base, zero exponent included. The trait's `div_checked(x, y, ctx)` takes a context; the inherent [`BinFloat::div_checked`](#binfloatdiv_checked) does not. `CompareChecked::compare_checked` is the inherent [`compare_checked`](#binfloatcompare_checked)."
msgstr "每个方法都用 `BinaryContext::from_arithmetic_context`（对 `AwayFromZero`、不具 IEEE 754-2019 3.3 形状的范围或超过 `binary_precision_max` 的精度为 `Err`）转换 `ArithmeticContext`，并运行上下文式运算。invalid 标志变为 `domain_error`，除以零标志变为 `division_by_zero` 错误；其余标志被丢弃，因此 NaN、无穷、上溢或下溢都是放在 `Ok` 中的 IEEE 754-2019 默认结果，与 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 `Double` 实例一致。`sqrt_checked` 对负的非零参数（包括 $-\\infty$）和信号 NaN 为 `domain_error`；任一符号的静默 NaN 为 `Ok`。`DivChecked::div_checked` 对 $0/0$、$\\infty/\\infty$ 和信号 NaN 操作数为 `domain_error`，对有限非零被除数除以带符号零为 `division_by_zero` 错误；NaN$/0$ 与 $\\infty/0$ 为 `Ok`。`pow_int_checked` 对零底数配负指数为 `division_by_zero` 错误，两种幂对信号 NaN 底数（包括零指数）都为 `domain_error`。trait 的 `div_checked(x, y, ctx)` 接受上下文；固有方法 [`BinFloat::div_checked`](#binfloatdiv_checked) 则不接受。`CompareChecked::compare_checked` 即固有方法 [`compare_checked`](#binfloatcompare_checked)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2519
msgid "`@lf_arith` traits that return an `ArithmeticOutcome` with diagnostics."
msgstr "返回带诊断信息的 `ArithmeticOutcome` 的 `@lf_arith` trait。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2538
msgid "Each runs the matching `*_ctx` method (for `abs`, `abs` followed by `round_ctx`; for `exp`, `try_exp_ctx`) under the converted context. A result with `division_by_zero` becomes a `division_by_zero` error and one with `invalid_operation` a `domain_error`, one with `not_computed` a `certification_failure`; a certification failure of `exp` is returned as is. Otherwise the value is returned with `ArithmeticDiagnostics` whose `inexact` and `rounded` are the inexact flag and whose `overflow` and `underflow` are the matching flags."
msgstr "每个方法都在转换后的上下文下运行对应的 `*_ctx` 方法（对 `abs` 为先 `abs` 再 `round_ctx`；对 `exp` 为 `try_exp_ctx`）。带有 `division_by_zero` 的结果变为 `division_by_zero` 错误，带有 `invalid_operation` 的结果变为 `domain_error`，带有 `not_computed` 的结果变为 `certification_failure`；`exp` 的认证失败原样返回。否则返回值以及 `ArithmeticDiagnostics`，其 `inexact` 和 `rounded` 为不精确标志，`overflow` 和 `underflow` 为相应的标志。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2548
msgid "The `Compare` and `Eq` methods of `BinCoeff`, behind `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=` and `!=`."
msgstr "`BinCoeff` 的 `Compare` 和 `Eq` 方法，位于 `<`、`<=`、`>`、`>=` 和 `!=` 背后。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2563
msgid "They agree with [`BinCoeff::compare`](#bincoeffcompare-bincoeffequal)."
msgstr "它们与 [`BinCoeff::compare`](#bincoeffcompare-bincoeffequal) 一致。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2567
msgid "The `Show` and `Debug` methods of `BinCoeff`; `to_repr` is the integer value."
msgstr "`BinCoeff` 的 `Show` 和 `Debug` 方法；`to_repr` 是整数值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2574
msgid "`output` writes the decimal digits of [`to_string`](#bincoeffparse-bincoeffto_string-bincoeffto_radix_string)."
msgstr "`output` 写出 [`to_string`](#bincoeffparse-bincoeffto_string-bincoeffto_radix_string) 的十进制数字。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2578
msgid "The derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of `BinaryRoundingMode`."
msgstr "`BinaryRoundingMode` 派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2588
msgid "The derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of `TininessDetection`."
msgstr "`TininessDetection` 派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2598
msgid "The derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of `BinaryContext`."
msgstr "`BinaryContext` 派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2606
msgid "Equality compares the fields, so `BinaryContext::new(precision=53)` equals `BinaryContext::new(precision=53, e_max=binary_implementation_e_max)`: there is one representation of every context."
msgstr "相等性比较各字段，所以 `BinaryContext::new(precision=53)` 等于 `BinaryContext::new(precision=53, e_max=binary_implementation_e_max)`：每个上下文只有一种表示。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2612
msgid "The derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of `BinaryFlags`."
msgstr "`BinaryFlags` 派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2622
msgid "The derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of `BinaryInterchangeFormat`."
msgstr "`BinaryInterchangeFormat` 派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:2632
msgid "The derived `Eq` of `BinaryInterchange`: format and bits must agree."
msgstr "`BinaryInterchange` 派生的 `Eq`：格式和位必须一致。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:1
msgid "bin_float_checked API"
msgstr "bin_float_checked API"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:5
msgid "`bin_float_checked` provides `BinFloatResult`, a closed wrapper around `Result[BinFloat, ArithmeticError]`. Every operation takes and returns a `BinFloatResult`, applies the corresponding [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) operation when all operands are successes, and otherwise passes on the first error without running the operation. The wrapper keeps no IEEE flags: the checked operations turn the invalid operation and divideByZero exceptions into errors, and the arithmetic `_ctx` methods drop them. The [tutorial](../tutorial/bin_float_checked.md) builds pipelines step by step; the [design page](../design/bin_float_checked.md) models the wrapper as the error monad and proves the composition laws it relies on."
msgstr "`bin_float_checked` 提供 `BinFloatResult`，它是对 `Result[BinFloat, ArithmeticError]` 的封闭包装。每个运算都接受并返回 `BinFloatResult`：当所有操作数均为成功值时，执行相应的 [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) 运算，否则不执行运算而直接传递第一个错误。该包装不保留任何 IEEE 标志：受检运算把无效运算和除以零异常变为错误，算术 `_ctx` 方法则丢弃它们。[教程](../tutorial/bin_float_checked.md)逐步构建运算流水线；[设计页面](../design/bin_float_checked.md)将该包装建模为错误单子（error monad），并证明了它所依赖的复合律。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:18
msgid "Add the wrapper and the packages whose types appear in its signatures to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中添加该包装，以及类型出现在其签名中的各个包："

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:30
msgid "The examples call the packages as `@bin_float_checked.`, `@bin_float.`, `@def.` and `@lf_arith.` (`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, printed as `@arithmetic` in the interface). They print a result with this helper:"
msgstr "示例中以 `@bin_float_checked.`、`@bin_float.`、`@def.` 和 `@lf_arith.`（即 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`，在接口中打印为 `@arithmetic`）调用这些包。示例使用以下辅助函数输出结果："

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:44
msgid "`BinFloat::to_string` prints the exact value as `coefficient p exponent`, so `3p-1` is $3 \\cdot 2^{-1} = 1.5$."
msgstr "`BinFloat::to_string` 以 `coefficient p exponent` 的形式打印精确值，因此 `3p-1` 表示 $3 \\cdot 2^{-1} = 1.5$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:51
msgid "`BinFloatResult` is either a successful `BinFloat` or an `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`BinFloatResult` 要么是一个成功的 `BinFloat`，要么是一个 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:59
msgid "The only field is private; it holds a `Result[@bin_float.BinFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`. The type has no `Eq` or `Show` instance; compare or print through `result()`."
msgstr "唯一的字段是私有的，保存一个 `Result[@bin_float.BinFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`。该类型没有 `Eq` 或 `Show` 实例；请通过 `result()` 进行比较或打印。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:67
msgid "These functions wrap an existing value, error or `Result` without changing it."
msgstr "这些函数包装已有的值、错误或 `Result`，不做任何改变。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:75
msgid "`from_result(r).result() == r` for every `r`, and `ok(x)` is the unit of the monad described in the design page."
msgstr "对每个 `r` 都有 `from_result(r).result() == r`，而 `ok(x)` 是设计页面中所述单子的单位元。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:80
msgid "These constructors build a successful wrapper from a MoonBit number through the matching `BinFloat` constructor."
msgstr "这些构造函数通过对应的 `BinFloat` 构造函数，由 MoonBit 数值构建一个成功的包装值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:90
msgid "Default `precision`"
msgstr "默认 `precision`"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:90
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:273
msgid "Delegates to"
msgstr "委托给"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:93
msgid "53 (`negative` defaults to `false`)"
msgstr "53（`negative` 默认为 `false`）"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:97
msgid "They never produce an error: NaN and infinity inputs become successful NaN or infinite values, and a value that does not fit `precision` is rounded to nearest-even as by the delegated constructor. `from_float` widens through a host `Double`, so a signaling `Float` NaN may arrive quiet (see [`BinFloat::from_float`](bin_float.md#binfloatfrom_double-binfloatfrom_float))."
msgstr "它们从不产生错误：NaN 与无穷输入会变成成功的 NaN 或无穷值；无法容纳于 `precision` 的值按被委托的构造函数那样以就近舍入（偶数优先）处理。`from_float` 经由宿主的 `Double` 扩宽，因此信号 `Float` NaN 到达时可能已是静默的（参见 [`BinFloat::from_float`](bin_float.md#binfloatfrom_double-binfloatfrom_float)）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:107
msgid "These methods expose the wrapped `Result` and test its branch."
msgstr "这些方法暴露被包装的 `Result` 并检测其分支。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:115
msgid "`is_err(r) == !is_ok(r)`. Call `result()` once, at the boundary where the error is handled."
msgstr "`is_err(r) == !is_ok(r)`。只在处理错误的边界处调用一次 `result()`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:122
msgid "`map(f)` applies an infallible function to a success and leaves an error unchanged."
msgstr "`map(f)` 将一个不会失败的函数作用于成功值，错误则保持不变。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:129
msgid "$\\texttt{map}(\\texttt{Ok}(x), f) = \\texttt{Ok}(f(x))$ and $\\texttt{map}(\\texttt{Err}(e), f) = \\texttt{Err}(e)$; `f` is not called on an error. `map` can never turn a success into an error."
msgstr "$\\texttt{map}(\\texttt{Ok}(x), f) = \\texttt{Ok}(f(x))$ 且 $\\texttt{map}(\\texttt{Err}(e), f) = \\texttt{Err}(e)$；遇到错误时不会调用 `f`。`map` 永远不会把成功值变成错误。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:135
msgid "`bind(f)` applies a function that may itself fail."
msgstr "`bind(f)` 应用一个自身可能失败的函数。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:141
msgid "$\\texttt{bind}(\\texttt{Ok}(x), f) = f(x)$ and $\\texttt{bind}(\\texttt{Err}(e), f) = \\texttt{Err}(e)$. With `ok` it satisfies the monad laws (left and right identity, associativity), derived in the [design page](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws)."
msgstr "$\\texttt{bind}(\\texttt{Ok}(x), f) = f(x)$ 且 $\\texttt{bind}(\\texttt{Err}(e), f) = \\texttt{Err}(e)$。与 `ok` 一起，它满足单子律（左单位律、右单位律与结合律），推导见[设计页面](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:170
msgid "These methods are `map` of the `BinFloat` method of the same name; they never introduce an error."
msgstr "这些方法是同名 `BinFloat` 方法的 `map`，从不引入错误。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:181
msgid "`with_precision(p, mode)` rounds to $\\max(1,p)$ bits in direction `mode` with an unbounded exponent; `ulp` is the unit in the last place at the value's precision (NaN for non-finite values)."
msgstr "`with_precision(p, mode)` 以方向 `mode` 舍入到 $\\max(1,p)$ 位，指数无界；`ulp` 是该值精度下的末位单位（对非有限值为 NaN）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:189
msgid "These methods combine two wrappers with the `BinFloat` operator."
msgstr "这些方法用 `BinFloat` 运算符组合两个包装值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:197
msgid "If `self` is an error it is returned; otherwise if `other` is an error that error is returned; otherwise the result is `Ok(lhs op rhs)`. The `BinFloat` operators round to nearest-even at the larger of the two operand precisions and never fail: invalid cases such as $\\infty - \\infty$ produce a successful NaN."
msgstr "若 `self` 是错误则返回它；否则若 `other` 是错误则返回该错误；否则结果为 `Ok(lhs op rhs)`。`BinFloat` 运算符以两个操作数中较大的精度进行就近舍入（偶数优先），且从不失败：诸如 $\\infty - \\infty$ 的无效情形会产生一个成功的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:204
msgid "`div` divides two wrappers and reports invalid divisions and division by zero."
msgstr "`div` 对两个包装值做除法，并报告无效除法和除以零。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:210
msgid "After the operand errors (left first), the result is `BinFloat::div_checked(lhs, rhs)`: a `DomainError` for $0/0$, $\\infty/\\infty$ or a signaling NaN operand, a `DivisionByZero` error for a finite non-zero dividend over a zero divisor ($\\pm 0$), and the IEEE 754-2019 result otherwise: a quiet NaN for a quiet NaN operand (NaN$/0$ included), $\\pm\\infty$ for $\\infty/0$, and the rounded quotient."
msgstr "在处理完操作数错误（先左后右）之后，结果为 `BinFloat::div_checked(lhs, rhs)`：对 $0/0$、$\\infty/\\infty$ 或信号 NaN 操作数返回 `DomainError`，对有限非零被除数除以零除数（$\\pm 0$）返回 `DivisionByZero` 错误，其余情况返回 IEEE 754-2019 结果：静默 NaN 操作数（包括 NaN$/0$）得到静默 NaN，$\\infty/0$ 得到 $\\pm\\infty$，否则得到舍入后的商。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:219
msgid "These methods take the smaller or larger operand with `BinFloat::min` / `BinFloat::max`, which ignore a NaN operand in favour of the other one and return the receiver when the operands compare equal (so `min(-0, +0)` is $-0$ and `min(+0, -0)` is $+0$)."
msgstr "这些方法用 `BinFloat::min` / `BinFloat::max` 取较小或较大的操作数，二者会忽略 NaN 操作数而取另一个，并在两个操作数比较相等时返回接收者（因此 `min(-0, +0)` 为 $-0$，`min(+0, -0)` 为 $+0$）。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:231
msgid "`clamp(min~, max~)` restricts a value to an interval."
msgstr "`clamp(min~, max~)` 将值限制在一个区间内。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:237
msgid "Errors are taken in the order `self`, `min`, `max`; then `BinFloat::clamp_checked` returns a `DomainError` when a bound is NaN or when `min > max`, and the clamped value otherwise."
msgstr "错误按 `self`、`min`、`max` 的顺序选取；之后 `BinFloat::clamp_checked` 在某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时返回 `DomainError`，否则返回截断后的值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:267
msgid "These methods apply the `BinFloat::*_ctx` operation under an explicit `BinaryContext` and keep only its value."
msgstr "这些方法在显式的 `BinaryContext` 下执行 `BinFloat::*_ctx` 运算，只保留其值。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:277
msgid "The result has the context's precision, rounding direction and exponent range, with IEEE overflow, underflow and subnormal handling. The flags of the step are mapped as in `add`, `div` and the elementary methods: invalid operation is a `DomainError` and divideByZero a `DivisionByZero`; overflow, underflow and inexact are dropped. So `div_ctx` by a zero divisor is `DivisionByZero`, and $0/0$, $\\infty/\\infty$, $\\infty - \\infty$ and $0 \\cdot \\infty$ are `DomainError`, exactly as without a context; a quiet NaN operand is still a successful NaN. The full table is in the [design page](../design/bin_float_checked.md). Use `BinFloat::div_ctx` and its siblings when the raw default result and the flags matter."
msgstr "结果具有上下文的精度、舍入方向和指数范围，并按 IEEE 处理上溢、下溢和次正规数。该步的标志与 `add`、`div` 和初等函数方法中的映射一致：invalid operation 为 `DomainError`，divideByZero 为 `DivisionByZero`；上溢、下溢和 inexact 被丢弃。因此除数为零的 `div_ctx` 是 `DivisionByZero`，$0/0$、$infty/infty$、$infty - infty$ 和 $0 cdot infty$ 是 `DomainError`，与不带上下文时完全一致；静默 NaN 操作数仍然是成功的 NaN。完整的表见[设计页](../design/bin_float_checked.md)。需要原始默认结果和标志时，请使用 `BinFloat::div_ctx` 及其同类方法。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:302
msgid "Powers and roots"
msgstr "幂与方根"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:306
msgid "`sqrt` takes the square root at the operand's precision; `sqrt_ctx` under a context."
msgstr "`sqrt` 以操作数的精度求平方根；`sqrt_ctx` 在上下文下求平方根。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:314
msgid "`sqrt` is `BinFloat::sqrt`, which returns a `DomainError` for a negative non-zero argument, including $-\\infty$, and for a signaling NaN; $\\sqrt{-0} = -0$ and a quiet NaN of either sign gives a successful NaN. `sqrt_ctx` does the same under a context: a negative argument is a `DomainError`."
msgstr "`sqrt` 即 `BinFloat::sqrt`，对负的非零参数（包括 $-infty$）以及信号 NaN 返回 `DomainError`；$sqrt{-0} = -0$，任一符号的静默 NaN 得到一个成功的 NaN。`sqrt_ctx` 在上下文下行为相同：负参数是 `DomainError`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:321
msgid "These methods raise a value to an integer power."
msgstr "这些方法将值提升到整数次幂。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:329
msgid "`pow_nat(n)` calls the Luna-Flow/arithmetic trait method `PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked` with `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`, which `bin_float` maps to the binary context of that precision (`BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`) with nearest-even rounding. `pown` returns a `DivisionByZero` error for a zero base with a negative exponent, a `DomainError` for a signaling NaN base, zero exponent included (as does `pow_nat`), and the rounded power otherwise, at the operand's precision. The `_ctx` forms map the flags the same way: a `DivisionByZero` error for a zero base with a negative exponent and a `DomainError` for a signaling NaN base."
msgstr "`pow_nat(n)` 调用 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 trait 方法 `PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked`，参数为 `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`，`bin_float` 将其映射为该精度下的二进制上下文（`BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`），采用就近偶数舍入。`pown` 对零底数与负指数返回 `DivisionByZero` 错误，对信号 NaN 底数（包括零指数，`pow_nat` 同样如此）返回 `DomainError`，其余情形在操作数精度下返回舍入后的幂。`_ctx` 形式以同样方式映射标志：零底数与负指数是 `DivisionByZero` 错误，信号 NaN 底数是 `DomainError`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:340
msgid "`rootn(n)` computes the real $n$-th root with `BinFloat::try_rootn_ctx`."
msgstr "`rootn(n)` 用 `BinFloat::try_rootn_ctx` 计算实数 $n$ 次方根。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:347
msgid "`rootn` uses an unbounded context at the operand's precision; `rootn_ctx` the given context. Both report a `DomainError` for degree $0$ (for every operand, a quiet NaN and $\\pm 0$ included, and never `DivisionByZero`: IEEE 754-2019 Table 9.1, \"n = 0: invalid operation\"), for an even root of a negative number ($-\\infty$ included) and for a signaling NaN, a `DivisionByZero` error for $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n)$ with $n < 0$ (IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1), and can report a `CertificationFailure`. Odd roots of negative numbers are negative: `rootn(-8, 3)` is $-2$. The full table of special values is in [`BinFloat::rootn`](bin_float.md#binfloatrootn-binfloatrootn_ctx-binfloattry_rootn_ctx)."
msgstr "`rootn` 使用操作数精度下的无界上下文；`rootn_ctx` 使用给定的上下文。二者在次数为 $0$（对任意操作数，安静 NaN 与 $\\pm 0$ 也包括在内，且绝不是 `DivisionByZero`：IEEE 754-2019 表 9.1，“n = 0: invalid operation”）、对负数（包括 $-\\infty$）开偶次方根以及遇到信号 NaN 时报告 `DomainError`，对 $n < 0$ 的 $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n)$ 报告 `DivisionByZero` 错误（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1），并且可能报告 `CertificationFailure`。负数的奇次方根为负：`rootn(-8, 3)` 为 $-2$。完整的特殊值表见 [`BinFloat::rootn`](bin_float.md#binfloatrootn-binfloatrootn_ctx-binfloattry_rootn_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:357
msgid "`pow(y)` computes $x^{y}$ for a binary exponent with `BinFloat::try_pow_ctx`."
msgstr "`pow(y)` 用 `BinFloat::try_pow_ctx` 计算二进制指数下的 $x^{y}$。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:364
msgid "`pow` uses an unbounded context at the larger operand precision. Errors of the operands come first (base, then exponent); the operation itself reports a `DomainError` for a negative finite base with a non-integer exponent (for example $(-2)^{0.5}$) and for a signaling NaN operand, a `DivisionByZero` error for a zero base with a finite negative exponent ($(\\pm 0)^{-1.5}$, IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1), and can report a `CertificationFailure`. A base of $-0$, a negative base with an integral exponent of any size and an infinite exponent all give the IEEE 754 values listed in [`BinFloat::pow`](bin_float.md#binfloatpow-binfloatpow_ctx-binfloattry_pow_ctx), for example $(-1)^{\\infty} = 1$ and $(-0)^{0.75} = +0$."
msgstr "`pow` 使用较大操作数精度下的无界上下文。操作数的错误优先（先底数，后指数）；运算本身在底数为负的有限数且指数非整数时（例如 $(-2)^{0.5}$）以及遇到信号 NaN 操作数时报告 `DomainError`，在零底数配有限负指数时（$(\\pm 0)^{-1.5}$，IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1）报告 `DivisionByZero` 错误，并且可能报告 `CertificationFailure`。底数为 $-0$、负底数配任意大小的整数指数以及无穷指数，都得到 [`BinFloat::pow`](bin_float.md#binfloatpow-binfloatpow_ctx-binfloattry_pow_ctx) 中列出的 IEEE 754 值，例如 $(-1)^{\\infty} = 1$ 和 $(-0)^{0.75} = +0$。"

