#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:750
msgid "$\\tanh x$, delegated to [`BinFloat::try_tanh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloattanh-binfloattanh_ctx-binfloattry_tanh_ctx)."
msgstr "$\\tanh x$，委托给 [`BinFloat::try_tanh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloattanh-binfloattanh_ctx-binfloattry_tanh_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:759
msgid "$\\operatorname{asinh} x$, delegated to [`BinFloat::try_asinh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatasinh-binfloatasinh_ctx-binfloattry_asinh_ctx)."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{asinh} x$，委托给 [`BinFloat::try_asinh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatasinh-binfloatasinh_ctx-binfloattry_asinh_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:768
msgid "$\\operatorname{acosh} x$, delegated to [`BinFloat::try_acosh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatacosh-binfloatacosh_ctx-binfloattry_acosh_ctx)."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{acosh} x$，委托给 [`BinFloat::try_acosh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatacosh-binfloatacosh_ctx-binfloattry_acosh_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:775
msgid "Errors: a `DomainError` below $1$."
msgstr "错误：小于 $1$ 时为 `DomainError`。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:779
msgid "$\\operatorname{atanh} x$, delegated to [`BinFloat::try_atanh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatatanh-binfloatatanh_ctx-binfloattry_atanh_ctx)."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{atanh} x$，委托给 [`BinFloat::try_atanh_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatatanh-binfloatatanh_ctx-binfloattry_atanh_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:786
msgid "Errors: a `DomainError` for $|x| > 1$; a `DivisionByZero` error for $\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 1)$."
msgstr "错误：$|x| > 1$ 时为 `DomainError`；$\\operatorname{atanh}(\\pm 1)$ 为 `DivisionByZero` 错误。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:790
msgid "The angle of the point $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$, delegated to [`BinFloat::try_atan2_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatatan2-binfloatatan2_ctx-binfloattry_atan2_ctx)."
msgstr "点 $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$ 的辐角，委托给 [`BinFloat::try_atan2_ctx`](bin_float.md#binfloatatan2-binfloatatan2_ctx-binfloattry_atan2_ctx)。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:798
msgid "Errors are taken in the order ordinate, abscissa, operation. `atan2` uses `BinaryContext::new(precision=p)` at the larger operand precision. Signed zeros follow IEEE 754: `atan2` of $(-0, -0)$ is $-\\pi$ and of $(-0, +0)$ is $-0$. A signaling NaN operand is a `DomainError`; `atan2` raises no other exception."
msgstr "错误按纵坐标、横坐标、运算的顺序取用。`atan2` 使用较大操作数精度下的 `BinaryContext::new(precision=p)`。带符号零遵循 IEEE 754：$(-0, -0)$ 的 `atan2` 为 $-\\pi$，$(-0, +0)$ 的则为 $-0$。信号 NaN 操作数为 `DomainError`；`atan2` 不触发其他异常。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:822
msgid "`Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div` and `Neg` for `BinFloatResult`"
msgstr "`BinFloatResult` 的 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div` 和 `Neg`"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:835
msgid "So `/` on wrappers reports division by zero, while `/` on plain `BinFloat` values returns an infinity."
msgstr "因此，包装值上的 `/` 会报告除以零，而普通 `BinFloat` 值上的 `/` 返回无穷。"

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:838
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已弃用"

#: manual/api/cli.md:1
msgid "cli API"
msgstr "cli API"

#: manual/api/cli.md:5
msgid "`cli` is the native executable `floating-conformance`. It dispatches its arguments to one of the four conformance runners (`gda`, `testfloat`, `mpfr`, `itl`) and exits with the runner's code. The package has no public MoonBit items; this page documents its command-line interface. The [tutorial](../tutorial/cli.md) shows typical invocations and the [design page](../design/cli.md) explains the layering."
msgstr "`cli` 是原生可执行文件 `floating-conformance`。它将参数分派给四个符合性运行器（`gda`、`testfloat`、`mpfr`、`itl`）之一，并以该运行器的返回码退出。该包没有公开的 MoonBit 项；本页记录其命令行接口。[教程](../tutorial/cli.md)展示典型的调用方式，[设计页面](../design/cli.md)解释其分层结构。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:14
msgid "`cli` is an executable package (`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`) and cannot be imported. It is only the entry point: its `moon.pkg` imports the dispatcher [`cli/dispatch`](cli/dispatch.md), which holds the behaviour described below, and the process helpers:"
msgstr "`cli` 是可执行包（`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`），不能被导入。它只是入口：其 `moon.pkg` 导入调度器 [`cli/dispatch`](cli/dispatch.md)（下文描述的行为都在其中）和进程辅助包："

#: manual/api/cli.md:27
msgid "To run a corpus from your own MoonBit code, import a runner such as [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](cli/gda_expr_cli.md) and call its `run`, or call a frontend directly."
msgstr "要从你自己的 MoonBit 代码运行语料，请导入一个运行器（例如 [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](cli/gda_expr_cli.md)）并调用其 `run`，或者直接调用某个前端。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:31
#: manual/api/differential.md:36
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: manual/api/cli.md:40
msgid "selects the runner; required, non-empty, at most once (an empty `--backend=` is an error)"
msgstr "选择运行器；必需，非空，至多出现一次（空的 `--backend=` 是错误）"

#: manual/api/cli.md:41
msgid "prints the usage line and exits with 0 when reached, even after `--backend` (the runners' own `--help` is therefore not reachable through the dispatcher)"
msgstr "一旦遇到即打印用法行并以 0 退出，即使出现在 `--backend` 之后也是如此（因此无法通过分派器使用运行器自身的 `--help`）"

#: manual/api/cli.md:42
msgid "anything else"
msgstr "其他任何参数"

#: manual/api/cli.md:42
msgid "forwarded, in order, to the runner"
msgstr "按顺序转发给运行器"

#: manual/api/cli.md:44
msgid "Arguments are scanned from left to right and the first error ends the scan: `--backend` without a value, or a second `--backend`, exits with 2 before a later `--help` is seen. The value after `--backend` is taken as is, so `--backend --help` asks for a backend named `--help` (exit 2). An empty `--backend=` is the error `--backend requires a value` (exit 2), or the at-most-once error when a backend was already given."
msgstr "参数从左到右扫描，遇到第一个错误即结束扫描：没有值的 `--backend` 或第二个 `--backend` 会在看到后面的 `--help` 之前以 2 退出。`--backend` 之后的值按原样采用，因此 `--backend --help` 请求一个名为 `--help` 的后端（退出码 2）。空的 `--backend=` 是错误 `--backend requires a value`（退出码 2）；若此前已给出后端，则是至多一次的错误。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:51
msgid "The runner receives the program name followed by the forwarded arguments and interprets them as documented in [gda_expr_cli](cli/gda_expr_cli.md), [testfloat_expr_cli](cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md), [mpfr_expr_cli](cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and [itl_expr_cli](cli/itl_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "运行器接收程序名及其后转发的参数，并按 [gda_expr_cli](cli/gda_expr_cli.md)、[testfloat_expr_cli](cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)、[mpfr_expr_cli](cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) 和 [itl_expr_cli](cli/itl_expr_cli.md) 中的说明解释它们。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:56
msgid "Exit status"
msgstr "退出状态"

#: manual/api/cli.md:58
#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:116
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: manual/api/cli.md:60
msgid "`--help`, or the runner reported success"
msgstr "`--help`，或运行器报告成功"

#: manual/api/cli.md:61
msgid "the runner found failing cases; for `itl` also diagnostic cases; with `--strict-supported` (`gda`, `itl`) also unsupported cases, and for `gda` legacy ones"
msgstr "运行器发现了失败的用例；对 `itl` 还包括诊断用例；指定 `--strict-supported`（`gda`、`itl`）时还包括不支持的用例，对 `gda` 还包括遗留用例"

#: manual/api/cli.md:62
msgid "a missing, repeated or unknown `--backend`, or a runner usage, file or parse error"
msgstr "缺少、重复或未知的 `--backend`，或者运行器的用法、文件或解析错误"

#: manual/api/cli.md:64
msgid "Messages go to standard output."
msgstr "消息输出到标准输出。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:66
msgid "Build"
msgstr "构建"

#: manual/api/cli.md:68
msgid "The executable is built by the conformance tooling:"
msgstr "该可执行文件由符合性工具链构建："

#: manual/api/cli.md:75
msgid "`tools/conformance_cli.py` builds `tooling/src/cli` once per backend into `_build/conformance/<backend>/` and copies it to `<backend>-conformance.exe`, so parallel builds for different backends do not share a target directory."
msgstr "`tools/conformance_cli.py` 为每个后端构建一次 `tooling/src/cli`，输出到 `_build/conformance/<backend>/`，并将其复制为 `<backend>-conformance.exe`，从而使不同后端的并行构建不共享目标目录。"

#: manual/api/cli/dispatch.md:1
msgid "cli/dispatch API"
msgstr "cli/dispatch API"

#: manual/api/cli/dispatch.md:5
msgid "`cli/dispatch` holds the behaviour of the `floating-conformance` executable: it scans the program arguments for `--backend`, forwards the rest to one of the four conformance runners and returns the process exit code. The package `cli` is only the entry point that passes `@env.args()` to it and exits with the result, so that the dispatcher is a library with its own tests. The command line is documented on the [`cli` page](../cli.md); the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/dispatch.md) calls it from a test and the [design page](../../design/cli/dispatch.md) explains the split."
msgstr "`cli/dispatch` 承载可执行文件 `floating-conformance` 的行为：它在程序参数中扫描 `--backend`，把其余参数转发给四个一致性运行器之一，并返回进程退出码。包 `cli` 只是入口，把 `@env.args()` 交给它并以其结果退出，因此调度器是一个带有自己测试的库。命令行见 [`cli` 页面](../cli.md)；[教程](../../tutorial/cli/dispatch.md)在测试中调用它，[设计页](../../design/cli/dispatch.md)解释这一拆分。"

#: manual/api/cli/dispatch.md:22
msgid "The examples use the alias `@dispatch`."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@dispatch`。"

#: manual/api/cli/dispatch.md:24
#: manual/api/differential/harness.md:26
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:29
msgid "Function specification"
msgstr "函数规格"

#: manual/api/cli/dispatch.md:32
msgid "`dispatch(arguments)` expects the program name at index 0, followed by the command line. It returns `0` after `--help`, `2` for a missing, repeated, empty or unknown `--backend`, and otherwise the return value of the runner (`0`, `1` or `2`). Messages go to standard output. It never exits the process; the caller does."
msgstr "`dispatch(arguments)` 要求下标 0 为程序名，其后是命令行。`--help` 之后返回 `0`；`--backend` 缺失、重复、为空或未知时返回 `2`；其余情况返回运行器的返回值（`0`、`1` 或 `2`）。消息输出到标准输出。它从不退出进程，由调用方退出。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/gda_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/gda_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/gda_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for General Decimal Arithmetic `.decTest` corpora. It reads files, parses them with [`frontend/gda_expr`](../frontend/gda_expr.md), executes them against `decimal_gda` and prints a text or JSON summary. It is normally reached through the [`cli`](../cli.md) dispatcher as `floating-conformance --backend gda …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/gda_expr_cli` 是 General Decimal Arithmetic `.decTest` 测试语料的命令行运行器。它读取文件，用 [`frontend/gda_expr`](../frontend/gda_expr.md) 解析，针对 `decimal_gda` 执行，并打印文本或 JSON 摘要。通常通过 [`cli`](../cli.md) 分派器以 `floating-conformance --backend gda …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:16
#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:14
#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:14
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:15
msgid "The runner is a library, so it can be called from MoonBit code as well as through the dispatcher. Add it to the `import` block of your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "运行器是一个库，因此既可以通过分派器调用，也可以从 MoonBit 代码中调用。将它添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 的 `import` 块中："

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:25
msgid "The examples use the alias `@gda_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@gda_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:31
#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:29
#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:29
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:30
msgid "`run(arguments)` executes one invocation and returns the exit code."
msgstr "`run(arguments)` 执行一次调用并返回退出码。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:37
#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:35
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:36
msgid "`arguments[0]` is the program name and is ignored. Options:"
msgstr "`arguments[0]` 是程序名，会被忽略。选项："

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:39
#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:37
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:38
#: manual/api/differential.md:44
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:41
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:44
msgid "print one JSON object instead of text"
msgstr "打印一个 JSON 对象而非文本"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:42
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "`--shard-count N`, `--shard-index I` (also `=` forms)"
msgstr "`--shard-count N`、`--shard-index I`（也接受 `=` 形式）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:42
msgid "run shard `I` of `N` (default `1`, `0`)"
msgstr "运行 `N` 个分片中的第 `I` 个（默认分别为 `1`、`0`）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "also fail when a selected row is unsupported or legacy"
msgstr "当所选的行不受支持或属于遗留行时也判为失败"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:44
msgid "row filter: comma-separated ids or `first..last` ranges (see `RunOptions::new`)"
msgstr "行过滤器：逗号分隔的 id 或 `first..last` 范围（参见 `RunOptions::new`）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "print the usage line and return `2`"
msgstr "打印用法行并返回 `2`"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "`.decTest` files or directories (direct file entries ending in `.decTest`); default `testdata/decimal_gda/smoke.decTest`"
msgstr "`.decTest` 文件或目录（目录中直接以 `.decTest` 结尾的文件条目）；默认为 `testdata/decimal_gda/smoke.decTest`"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:48
msgid "Any other argument starting with `-` is an error `unknown option: …`. A directory contributes its direct file entries whose names end in `.decTest` (a directory without any adds no file); a named file without that suffix is the error `not a .decTest file: PATH`, and a path that does not exist is the error `path does not exist: PATH`, both with exit status 2. Files are sorted, each file is run once even if named twice, parsed in order (the first parse diagnostic of a file is printed as `source:line:1: message` and ends the run), and executed together, so row ordinals and shards span all files."
msgstr "其他任何以 `-` 开头的参数都会产生错误 `unknown option: …`。目录贡献其名称以 `.decTest` 结尾的直接文件条目（不含此类文件的目录不添加任何文件）；被指定的文件若没有该后缀，则是错误 `not a .decTest file: PATH`，不存在的路径是错误 `path does not exist: PATH`，二者的退出状态都是 2。文件经过排序，每个文件即使被指定两次也只运行一次，依次解析（文件的第一条解析诊断以 `source:line:1: message` 的形式打印，并结束本次运行），然后一并执行，因此行序号和分片跨越所有文件。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:57
msgid "Text output lists the counts (`cases`, `selected cases`, `executable cases`, `passed cases`, `failed cases`, `skipped cases`), the shard, and one `failed ID: MESSAGE` line per failing row. JSON output has the keys `totalCases`, `supportedCases` (executable rows), `diagnosticCases`, `legacyConditionCases`, `unsupportedCases` and an `execution` object with `executableCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases`, `skippedCases`, `failedIds`, `shardCount`, `shardIndex`. `totalCases` counts the rows that match `--cases` in all shards; every other counter, including the top-level `supportedCases`, `diagnosticCases`, `legacyConditionCases` and `unsupportedCases`, counts only the rows of this shard. `legacyConditionCases` is always 0 with the current frontend."
msgstr "文本输出列出各项计数（`cases`、`selected cases`、`executable cases`、`passed cases`、`failed cases`、`skipped cases`）、分片信息，并为每个失败的行输出一行 `failed ID: MESSAGE`。JSON 输出包含键 `totalCases`、`supportedCases`（可执行的行）、`diagnosticCases`、`legacyConditionCases`、`unsupportedCases`，以及一个 `execution` 对象，其中含有 `executableCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases`、`skippedCases`、`failedIds`、`shardCount`、`shardIndex`。`totalCases` 统计所有分片中与 `--cases` 匹配的行数；其他每个计数器，包括顶层的 `supportedCases`、`diagnosticCases`、`legacyConditionCases` 和 `unsupportedCases`，都只统计本分片的行。在当前前端下，`legacyConditionCases` 始终为 0。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:69
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, file or parse errors; `1` when a row failed, or with `--strict-supported` when any legacy or unsupported row was selected; `0` otherwise. Diagnostic rows (`#` and `?` placeholders) never change the exit status, even with `--strict-supported`."
msgstr "返回值：用法、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有行失败，或指定 `--strict-supported` 时选中了任何遗留或不支持的行，为 `1`；否则为 `0`。诊断行（`#` 和 `?` 占位符）从不改变退出状态，即使指定了 `--strict-supported` 也是如此。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/itl_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/itl_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/itl_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for ITF1788 `.itl` interval test files. It parses them with [`frontend/itl_expr`](../frontend/itl_expr.md), executes every case against `ball_float` and prints a JSON report. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend itl …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/itl_expr_cli` 是 ITF1788 `.itl` 区间测试文件的命令行运行器。它用 [`frontend/itl_expr`](../frontend/itl_expr.md) 解析这些文件，针对 `ball_float` 执行每个用例，并打印 JSON 报告。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend itl …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:23
msgid "The examples use the alias `@itl_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@itl_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:39
msgid "also fail when any case is unsupported"
msgstr "当有任何用例不受支持时也判为失败"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:40
msgid "keep only cases of this operation; repeatable (cases of any listed operation are kept)"
msgstr "只保留该运算的用例；可重复指定（保留所列任一运算的用例）"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:41
msgid "`.itl` files, read in the given order; default `testdata/interval/smoke.itl`"
msgstr "`.itl` 文件，按给定顺序读取；默认为 `testdata/interval/smoke.itl`"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "Any other argument starting with `-` (including `--json`, `--help` and the shard options, which this runner does not have) is an error `unknown option: …`; `--operation` without a value prints `missing value for --operation`. Paths are files; directories are not expanded, and an unreadable path prints `cannot read ITL file: PATH`. Every file is parsed completely before the operation filter is applied, so a parse error in a statement of an unselected operation still ends the run: every diagnostic of that file is printed as `PATH: MESSAGE`."
msgstr "其他任何以 `-` 开头的参数（包括本运行器不支持的 `--json`、`--help` 和分片选项）都会产生错误 `unknown option: …`；没有值的 `--operation` 会打印 `missing value for --operation`。路径均视为文件；目录不会被展开，无法读取的路径会打印 `cannot read ITL file: PATH`。每个文件都会在应用运算过滤器之前被完整解析，因此即使解析错误出现在未选中运算的语句中，也会结束本次运行：该文件的每条诊断都以 `PATH: MESSAGE` 的形式打印。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:52
msgid "The output is always one JSON object with the keys `schemaVersion` (`1`), `runner` (`\"itl-expression-interpreter\"`), `totalCases`, `executableCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases`, `unsupportedCases`, `diagnosticCases`, `failedIds`, `failedMessages` (`ID: MESSAGE`), `unsupportedIds` and `diagnosticIds`."
msgstr "输出始终是一个 JSON 对象，包含键 `schemaVersion`（`1`）、`runner`（`\"itl-expression-interpreter\"`）、`totalCases`、`executableCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases`、`unsupportedCases`、`diagnosticCases`、`failedIds`、`failedMessages`（`ID: MESSAGE`）、`unsupportedIds` 和 `diagnosticIds`。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:58
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, file or parse errors; `1` when a case failed, a case was a diagnostic, or with `--strict-supported` a case was unsupported; `0` otherwise. Cases are executed with the default precision 53."
msgstr "返回值：用法、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有用例失败、有用例属于诊断，或指定 `--strict-supported` 时有用例不受支持，为 `1`；否则为 `0`。用例以默认精度 53 执行。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/mpfr_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/mpfr_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/mpfr_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for MPFR reference data. It reads one file, detects its format, parses and executes it with [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md) and prints a summary. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend mpfr …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/mpfr_expr_cli` 是 MPFR 参考数据的命令行运行器。它读取一个文件，检测其格式，用 [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md) 解析并执行，然后打印摘要。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend mpfr …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:23
msgid "The examples use the alias `@mpfr_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@mpfr_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:35
msgid "`arguments[0]` is the program name and is ignored. The runner accepts `--json` and exactly one path. After `--json` is removed, any other number of arguments (none, or two or more, including shard options, which are disabled for this runner) prints `usage: mpfr-expr [--json] <MPFR sqrt, pow, or elementary corpus>`. A single remaining argument is always taken as the path, even when it starts with `-`: `--help` or a mistyped option is reported as `cannot read file: --help`. Both cases return `2`."
msgstr "`arguments[0]` 是程序名，会被忽略。该运行器接受 `--json` 和恰好一个路径。去掉 `--json` 后，若剩余参数个数为其他值（零个，或两个及以上，包括本运行器禁用的分片选项），会打印 `usage: mpfr-expr [--json] <MPFR sqrt, pow, or elementary corpus>`。剩下的单个参数总是被当作路径，即使它以 `-` 开头：`--help` 或拼错的选项会被报告为 `cannot read file: --help`。这两种情况都返回 `2`。"

