#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/testfloat_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/testfloat_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/testfloat_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for Berkeley TestFloat vector files. It builds a `TestFloatSpec` from its options, parses one vector file with [`frontend/testfloat_expr`](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md), executes it against `bin_float` and prints a summary. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend testfloat …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/testfloat_expr_cli` 是 Berkeley TestFloat 向量文件的命令行运行器。它根据选项构建一个 `TestFloatSpec`，用 [`frontend/testfloat_expr`](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md) 解析一个向量文件，针对 `bin_float` 执行，并打印摘要。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend testfloat …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:24
msgid "The examples use the alias `@testfloat_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@testfloat_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:40
msgid "TestFloat function, for example `f64_mulAdd` (required)"
msgstr "TestFloat 函数，例如 `f64_mulAdd`（必需）"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:41
msgid "rounding mode, default `rnear_even`"
msgstr "舍入模式，默认为 `rnear_even`"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:42
msgid "`after` (default) or `before`"
msgstr "`after`（默认）或 `before`"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "the `-exact` variant of `roundToInt` and integer conversions"
msgstr "`roundToInt` 及整数转换的 `-exact` 变体"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "run shard `I` of `N`"
msgstr "运行 `N` 个分片中的第 `I` 个"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "exactly one vector file (required)"
msgstr "恰好一个向量文件（必需）"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:48
msgid "The names are interpreted by `TestFloatSpec::parse`. A value option given twice keeps the last value. `--help` is not an option of this runner and is reported as `unknown option: --help`. Errors such as `--function is required`, `a TestFloat vector path is required`, `only one TestFloat vector file is accepted per invocation`, `unknown option: …` or an unsupported name are printed and return `2`; so is the first parse diagnostic of the file (`source:line:1: message`)."
msgstr "这些名称由 `TestFloatSpec::parse` 解释。带值的选项给出两次时保留最后一个值。`--help` 不是本运行器的选项，会被报告为 `unknown option: --help`。诸如 `--function is required`、`a TestFloat vector path is required`、`only one TestFloat vector file is accepted per invocation`、`unknown option: …` 或不支持的名称之类的错误会被打印并返回 `2`；文件的第一条解析诊断（`source:line:1: message`）也是如此。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:56
msgid "Text output prints the function, rounding, tininess, the counts `cases`, `selected cases`, `passed cases`, `failed cases` and one `failed ID: MESSAGE` line per failure. JSON output has the keys `function`, `rounding`, `tininess`, `exact`, `totalCases`, `selectedCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases` and `failedIds`."
msgstr "文本输出打印函数、舍入、微小性（tininess）、计数 `cases`、`selected cases`、`passed cases`、`failed cases`，并为每个失败输出一行 `failed ID: MESSAGE`。JSON 输出包含键 `function`、`rounding`、`tininess`、`exact`、`totalCases`、`selectedCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases` 和 `failedIds`。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:62
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, specification, file or parse errors; `1` when a vector failed; `0` otherwise."
msgstr "返回值：用法、规格、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有向量失败时为 `1`；否则为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency API"
msgstr "consistency API"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:5
msgid "`consistency` is a white-box test package. It exports no MoonBit items; its content is a suite of about 250 deterministic tests (28 in `api_audit_wbtest.mbt` and 228 in `core_wbtest.mbt` on the current branch) that check laws *across* the packages of `floating`: that the binary, decimal, GDA and interval cores, their checked wrappers, `semantic`, and the shared `internal` helpers agree with each other and with exact `BigInt` and rational oracles. This page records the package's role and its (empty) interface; the [tutorial](../tutorial/consistency.md) shows how to run and extend it and the [design page](../design/consistency.md) explains what is checked."
msgstr "`consistency` 是一个白盒测试包。它不导出任何 MoonBit 项；其内容是一套约 250 个确定性测试（在当前分支上，`api_audit_wbtest.mbt` 中有 28 个，`core_wbtest.mbt` 中有 228 个），用于检查*跨越* `floating` 各包的规律：二进制、十进制、GDA 和区间核心，它们的 checked 包装，`semantic`，以及共享的 `internal` 辅助函数，彼此之间以及与精确的 `BigInt` 和有理数预言机之间是否一致。本页记录该包的作用及其（空的）接口；[教程](../tutorial/consistency.md)介绍如何运行和扩展它，[设计页面](../design/consistency.md)解释检查了哪些内容。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:17
msgid "Nothing can be imported from `consistency`. It is a package of the tools module `Luna-Flow/floating-tools`; its `moon.pkg` imports the cores of the library for white-box tests only:"
msgstr "无法从 `consistency` 导入任何内容。它是工具模块 `Luna-Flow/floating-tools` 的一个包；其 `moon.pkg` 仅为白盒测试导入库的各核心："

#: manual/api/consistency.md:39
msgid "Test files"
msgstr "测试文件"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:41
#: manual/tutorial/bench/external.md:45
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:41
#: manual/api/differential.md:66
#: manual/tutorial/bench/external.md:45
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:43
msgid "audits of public behaviour that spans packages: `def` predicates, `internal` rounding and parsing helpers, error and context types, the decimal interchange facade (bit-exact encodings, canonical predicates, sign operations), checked compare of `bin_float`, generic checked traits through `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, and the `semantic` interpretation of binary, decimal and interval values"
msgstr "对跨包公开行为的审计：`def` 谓词、`internal` 的舍入与解析辅助函数、错误与上下文类型、十进制交换格式门面（逐位精确的编码、规范性谓词、符号操作）、`bin_float` 的 checked 比较、通过 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 使用的泛型 checked trait，以及二进制、十进制和区间值的 `semantic` 解释"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:44
msgid "cross-package arithmetic laws: `internal` digit and trimming helpers against `BigInt`, `bin_float` exactness on dyadics and generic trait use, `decimal` and `decimal_gda` cohort, signed-zero and NaN-payload rules (many rows taken from the official decTest suite), `ball_float` enclosure properties, checked-pipeline closure, and total constructors"
msgstr "跨包的算术规律：`internal` 的数字与截尾辅助函数对照 `BigInt` 的检验、`bin_float` 在二进有理数上的精确性及泛型 trait 用法、`decimal` 与 `decimal_gda` 的同值类（cohort）、有符号零及 NaN 载荷规则（许多行取自官方 decTest 套件）、`ball_float` 的包络性质、checked 流水线的封闭性，以及全域构造函数"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:45
msgid "helpers that build `BinFloat` values from `BigInt` for the tests above"
msgstr "为上述测试从 `BigInt` 构建 `BinFloat` 值的辅助函数"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:47
msgid "All tests are white-box (`*_wbtest.mbt`) and import every core package for `wbtest` only, so the package adds nothing to any build of the library."
msgstr "所有测试都是白盒测试（`*_wbtest.mbt`），且只在 `wbtest` 中导入各核心包，因此该包不会给库的任何构建增加内容。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1
msgid "decimal API"
msgstr "decimal API"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/floating/decimal` is the IEEE 754-2019 decimal floating-point package of `floating`. A `Decimal` is an arbitrary-precision decimal value that keeps its quantum (exponent), its sign of zero and its NaN payload; a `DecimalContext` is an IEEE 754-2019 format (a precision and an exponent range) with one rounding-direction attribute; every context operation returns the rounded value together with the `DecimalFlags` it raised. The package also encodes and decodes the decimal32/64/128 interchange formats in both DPD and BID, and evaluates elementary functions with certified rounding."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/floating/decimal` 是 `floating` 中的 IEEE 754-2019 十进制浮点包。`Decimal` 是任意精度的十进制值，保留其量子（指数）、零的符号以及 NaN 的载荷；`DecimalContext` 是一种 IEEE 754-2019 格式（一个精度和一个指数范围），带有一个舍入方向属性；每个上下文运算都返回舍入后的值及其引发的 `DecimalFlags`。该包还能以 DPD 和 BID 两种方式编码与解码 decimal32/64/128 交换格式，并以经过认证的舍入计算初等函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:14
msgid "The [decimal tutorial](../tutorial/decimal.md) walks through typical tasks and the [decimal design](../design/decimal.md) explains the arithmetic model, encodings, rounding and certification. The finite evidence for the IEEE claim is recorded in [decimal conformance](../conformance/decimal.md). Sticky General Decimal Arithmetic status and traps live in the separate [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) package; [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) accumulates the flags of a pipeline of `Decimal` operations."
msgstr "[decimal 教程](../tutorial/decimal.md)介绍常见任务，[decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)解释算术模型、编码、舍入与认证。支持 IEEE 声明的有限证据记录在 [decimal 符合性](../conformance/decimal.md)中。粘滞的 General Decimal Arithmetic 状态与陷阱（trap）位于独立的 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 包中；[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) 则累积一串 `Decimal` 运算的标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:22
msgid "[!WARNING] Exact results of non-integral powers among the [elementary functions](#elementary-functions) do not yet meet the contracts described below. The note there links the GitHub issue that tracks them and the proposed fix."
msgstr "[!WARNING] [初等函数](#elementary-functions)中非整数次幂的精确结果尚不满足下文所述的约定。那里的说明链接到跟踪它们的 GitHub issue 以及所提出的修复。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:30
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:30
#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:18
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/decimal.md:38
msgid "The examples call the package through the alias `@decimal.`. Some of them also use `@def.` for `Luna-Flow/floating/def` (the shared `RoundingMode` and `Sign`), `@lf_arith.` for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, `@lf_alg.` for `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` and `@bigint.` for `moonbitlang/core/bigint`; import those packages too when you copy such an example. Most examples build values with a local helper `d(s)`, which is `@decimal.Decimal::from_string(s).unwrap()`."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@decimal.` 调用该包。其中一些示例还使用 `@def.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/floating/def`（共享的 `RoundingMode` 与 `Sign`）、`@lf_arith.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`、`@lf_alg.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`、`@bigint.` 表示 `moonbitlang/core/bigint`；复制此类示例时也请导入这些包。大多数示例用局部辅助函数 `d(s)` 构造值，它即 `@decimal.Decimal::from_string(s).unwrap()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:45
msgid "Notation"
msgstr "记号"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:47
msgid "Notation used below: a finite value is $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{q}$ with sign $s$, non-negative integer coefficient $c$ and exponent (quantum) $q$; $p$ is the context precision, $e_{\\max}$ and $e_{\\min}$ the context exponent limits for the *adjusted* exponent $q + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$, and $E_{\\text{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ the smallest exponent of a subnormal."
msgstr "下文记号：有限值为 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{q}$，其中符号为 $s$，非负整数系数为 $c$，指数（量子）为 $q$；$p$ 为上下文精度，$e_{\\max}$ 与 $e_{\\min}$ 为上下文对*调整后*指数 $q + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$ 的限制，$E_{\\text{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ 为次正规数的最小指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:53
msgid "Values and representation"
msgstr "值与表示"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:57
msgid "`Decimal` is an immutable decimal floating-point value."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是不可变的十进制浮点值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:65
msgid "A `Decimal` is one of: a finite value $(-1)^s c\\,10^q$ (including $\\pm 0$), $\\pm\\infty$, or a quiet or signaling NaN with a sign and a non-negative integer payload. Every value also carries a working `precision`, used by the plain operators and by conversions that have no context argument. The fields are private; use the observers below. Two values with the same mathematical value but different exponents (for example `1.2` and `1.20`) are different members of the same *cohort*: they compare equal numerically but are distinguished by `quantum`, `same_quantum`, `total_order_compare`, formatting and interchange encoding."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是以下之一：有限值 $(-1)^s c\\,10^q$（包括 $\\pm 0$）、$\\pm\\infty$，或带符号与非负整数载荷的静默 NaN 或信号 NaN。每个值还带有一个工作精度 `precision`，供普通运算符以及没有上下文参数的转换使用。字段是私有的；请使用下面的观察函数。数学值相同但指数不同的两个值（例如 `1.2` 与 `1.20`）是同一*同值类（cohort）*的不同成员：它们在数值上比较相等，但可以通过 `quantum`、`same_quantum`、`total_order_compare`、格式化以及交换编码加以区分。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:75
msgid "The derived `Debug` implementation is promoted as `Decimal::to_repr`; see [Trait implementations](#trait-implementations)."
msgstr "派生的 `Debug` 实现被提升为 `Decimal::to_repr`；参见 [trait 实现](#trait-implementations)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:80
msgid "These observers return the stored representation of a value."
msgstr "这些观察函数返回值的存储表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:89
msgid "`precision` is the working precision stored in the value: the precision of a format a context could have, `1..=999999999` (`decimal_precision_max`). Every constructor that returns a `Decimal` aborts on a precision outside that range, naming the function; the operations that return a `Result` return `Err`. `coefficient` returns the non-negative coefficient $c$; for a NaN they return the payload and for an infinity `0`. The sign is never part of the coefficient: use `is_negative`. `exponent10` and `quantum` both return the stored exponent $q$; for special values it is `0`."
msgstr "`precision` 是值中存储的工作精度：即上下文可能具有的某个格式的精度，范围 `1..=999999999`（`decimal_precision_max`）。每个返回 `Decimal` 的构造函数在精度超出该范围时都会中止，并指出函数名；返回 `Result` 的运算则返回 `Err`。`coefficient` 返回非负系数 $c$；对 NaN 返回载荷，对无穷返回 `0`。符号从不属于系数：请使用 `is_negative`。`exponent10` 和 `quantum` 都返回存储的指数 $q$；对特殊值为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:108
msgid "These observers report the sign of a value."
msgstr "这些观察函数报告值的符号。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:115
msgid "`sign` returns `@def.Sign::Zero` for both zeros and for every NaN, and `Negative`/`Positive` otherwise. `is_negative` returns the stored sign bit, so it is `true` for $-0$, for $-\\infty$ and for a negative NaN."
msgstr "`sign` 对两个零以及所有 NaN 返回 `@def.Sign::Zero`，其余情况返回 `Negative`/`Positive`。`is_negative` 返回存储的符号位，因此对 $-0$、$-\\infty$ 以及负 NaN 都为 `true`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:121
msgid "`classify` returns the coarse class of a value; `class_of` returns the ten-valued class of IEEE 754-2019 clause 5.7.2 under a context."
msgstr "`classify` 返回值的粗略类别；`class_of` 返回某上下文下 IEEE 754-2019 第 5.7.2 条的十值类别。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:129
msgid "`classify` returns `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`. `class_of` returns one of the ten [`IeeeClass`](def.md#ieeeclass) values; the normal/subnormal split uses the context's $e_{\\min}$. It has no text form: `match` on the `IeeeClass` (the former `class_name` strings were `\"sNaN\"`, `\"NaN\"`, `\"+Zero\"` and so on)."
msgstr "`classify` 返回 `Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。`class_of` 返回十个 [`IeeeClass`](def.md#ieeeclass) 值之一；正规/次正规的划分使用上下文的 $e_{\\min}$。它没有文本形式：请对 `IeeeClass` 做 `match`（原来的 `class_name` 字符串是 `\"sNaN\"`、`\"NaN\"`、`\"+Zero\"` 等）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:136
msgid "These predicates test the class of a value."
msgstr "这些谓词检测值的类别。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:151
msgid "`is_canonical` always returns `true`: a `Decimal` has no non-canonical form; non-canonical *encodings* are a property of [`DecimalInterchange`](#decimalinterchange-decimalinterchangeformat-encoding-to_hex). A value is normal under a context when it is finite, non-zero and its adjusted exponent is at least $e_{\\min}$; it is subnormal when it is finite, non-zero and its adjusted exponent is below $e_{\\min}$. Zeros, infinities and NaNs are neither."
msgstr "`is_canonical` 总是返回 `true`：`Decimal` 不存在非规范形式；非规范的*编码*是 [`DecimalInterchange`](#decimalinterchange-decimalinterchangeformat-encoding-to_hex) 的性质。在某上下文下，若值有限、非零且调整后指数至少为 $e_{\\min}$，则它是正规的；若值有限、非零且调整后指数小于 $e_{\\min}$，则它是次正规的。零、无穷与 NaN 两者都不是。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:160
msgid "These functions read and replace the payload of a NaN."
msgstr "这些函数读取并替换 NaN 的载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:169
msgid "`nan_payload` returns the payload of a NaN and `0` for every other value. `get_payload` is IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 getPayload: the payload of a NaN, and `-1` for any other value. `set_payload` and `set_payload_signaling` are setPayload and setPayloadSignaling: when the argument is a non-negative integer of at most `precision - 1` digits (the receiver's `precision`, like the trailing significand of an interchange NaN) the result is a quiet (respectively signaling) NaN with that payload and the receiver's sign bit; otherwise it is `+0` with exponent 0. The result does not depend on whether the receiver is a NaN."
msgstr "`nan_payload` 返回 NaN 的载荷，对其他值返回 `0`。`get_payload` 即 IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 的 getPayload：对 NaN 返回其载荷，对其他任何值返回 `-1`。`set_payload` 与 `set_payload_signaling` 即 setPayload 与 setPayloadSignaling：当参数是不超过 `precision - 1` 位（接收者的 `precision`，与交换格式 NaN 的尾数字段一致）的非负整数时，结果是带该载荷和接收者符号位的静默（相应地，信号）NaN；否则结果是指数为 0 的 `+0`。结果与接收者是否为 NaN 无关。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:179
msgid "Construction and conversion"
msgstr "构造与转换"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:183
msgid "The limits of a stored finite value."
msgstr "一个已存储有限值的限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:190
msgid "A finite `Decimal` holds only a value with `exponent + digits - 1 <= decimal_value_e_max` (the largest adjusted exponent, $2\\,147\\,483\\,646$; a zero has one digit) and `exponent >= decimal_value_e_tiny` (the smallest exponent, $-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$). They are the `e_max` and the `etiny` of the private working context of the plain operators, the largest and smallest the 32-bit exponent field allows once `e_max`, `e_min` and `etiny = e_min - p + 1` have to be representable in it, so that `x + 0 == x`, `x - 0 == x` and `x * 1 == x` hold for every stored value. The exact constructors (`make`, `try_make`, `parse`, `from_string`) refuse a value outside the range; the constructors from integers, floats and binary floats cannot produce one; an operation that rounds (the plain operators, `with_precision`) overflows to an infinity or the largest finite value of the rounding direction, or underflows to the smallest exponent, like a context result. These are not the limits of a context (`decimal_implementation_e_max`, below): a context is narrower than what can be stored, and a value outside every context range can still be stored and is rounded when a context operation reads it."
msgstr "有限的 `Decimal` 只保存满足 `exponent + digits - 1 <= decimal_value_e_max`（最大调整指数，$2\\,147\\,483\\,646$；零按一位数计）且 `exponent >= decimal_value_e_tiny`（最小指数，$-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$）的值。它们是普通运算符的私有工作上下文的 `e_max` 与 `etiny`，也是在 `e_max`、`e_min` 以及 `etiny = e_min - p + 1` 都必须能用 32 位指数字段表示的前提下，该字段所允许的最大值与最小值，因此对每个已存储的值，`x + 0 == x`、`x - 0 == x` 与 `x * 1 == x` 都成立。精确构造函数（`make`、`try_make`、`parse`、`from_string`）拒绝范围之外的值；由整数、浮点数与二进制浮点数构造的函数不可能产生这样的值；进行舍入的运算（普通运算符、`with_precision`）与上下文结果一样，会上溢为无穷或所取舍入方向的最大有限值，或下溢到最小指数。这些不是上下文的限制（`decimal_implementation_e_max`，见下）：上下文比所能存储的范围更窄，位于所有上下文范围之外的值仍可被存储，当上下文运算读取它时再被舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:209
msgid "`make` builds a finite value from a signed integer coefficient and an exponent, rounding it to a precision; `try_make` is its `Result` form."
msgstr "`make` 由带符号的整数系数和指数构建有限值，并将其舍入到某个精度；`try_make` 是其 `Result` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:217
msgid "`Decimal::make(c, q, p, mode~)` represents $c \\cdot 10^{q}$; the sign comes from `c`. A coefficient of at most `p` digits keeps the exponent `q` (the cohort member asked for is not reduced: `make(100, 0, 5)` is `100`, `make(0, 5, 5)` is `0E+5`); a longer one is rounded to exactly `p` digits with `mode` (default `RoundTiesToEven`) and not reduced (`make(1000000, 0, 3)` is `100E+4`). No context exponent range applies, but the value must be within the [stored range](#decimal_value_e_max-decimal_value_e_tiny), checked after the rounding: `make` aborts naming the exponent and both limits, `try_make` returns the domain error (and an error for a `p` outside `1..=999999999`)."
msgstr "`Decimal::make(c, q, p, mode~)` 表示 $c \\cdot 10^{q}$；符号取自 `c`。系数不超过 `p` 位时保留给定的指数 `q`（所要求的同值类成员不被约简：`make(100, 0, 5)` 是 `100`，`make(0, 5, 5)` 是 `0E+5`）；更长的系数以 `mode`（默认 `RoundTiesToEven`）舍入到恰好 `p` 位且不约简（`make(1000000, 0, 3)` 是 `100E+4`）。不适用任何上下文指数范围，但值必须在[存储范围](#decimal_value_e_max-decimal_value_e_tiny)之内，且在舍入之后检查：`make` 中止并指出指数与两个限制，`try_make` 返回域错误（`p` 超出 `1..=999999999` 时也返回错误）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:229
msgid "These constructors build the special and unit values."
msgstr "这些构造函数构建特殊值与单位值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:241
msgid "The default precision is 34. `zero`, `negative_zero` and `one` have exponent `0`. `inf(negative=true)` is $-\\infty$ and `inf()` is $+\\infty$. `nan` is a positive quiet NaN with payload 0; `quiet_nan` and `signaling_nan` default to payload 0 and a positive sign. The payload is the trailing significand field (IEEE 754-2019 3.5.2): a non-negative integer of at most `precision - 1` digits, otherwise the constructor aborts; a conversion to a narrower format keeps the low digits of the payload, construction never truncates. The precision must be within `1..=999999999`."
msgstr "默认精度为 34。`zero`、`negative_zero` 和 `one` 的指数为 `0`。`inf(negative=true)` 是 $-\\infty$，`inf()` 是 $+\\infty$。`nan` 是载荷为 0 的正安静 NaN；`quiet_nan` 和 `signaling_nan` 默认载荷为 0、符号为正。载荷是尾数后缀字段（IEEE 754-2019 3.5.2）：不超过 `precision - 1` 位的非负整数，否则构造函数中止；向更窄格式的转换保留载荷的低位数字，构造绝不截断。精度必须在 `1..=999999999` 之内。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:252
msgid "These constructors convert an integer."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:259
msgid "Both implement convertFromInt (IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.1, preferred exponent 0) with the default precision 34: an integer of at most `precision` digits keeps exponent 0, so `from_int(1000)` is `1000` and not the reduced `1E+3`; a longer one is rounded half-even to exactly `precision` digits (§5.2), so `from_int(99999, precision=3)` is `1.00E+5`. Zero is $+0$ with exponent 0."
msgstr "两者实现 convertFromInt（IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.1，首选指数为 0），默认精度为 34：不超过 `precision` 位的整数保持指数 0，因此 `from_int(1000)` 为 `1000`，而不是约简后的 `1E+3`；更长的整数按半值取偶舍入到恰好 `precision` 位（§5.2），因此 `from_int(99999, precision=3)` 为 `1.00E+5`。零为指数为 0 的 $+0$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:267
msgid "These constructors convert a binary floating-point number."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换二进制浮点数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:274
msgid "Every finite `Double` is a dyadic rational $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ and therefore has a finite decimal expansion $m \\cdot 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$ for $k<0$; the conversion forms that exact expansion and, when it fits in `precision` digits (default 34), returns it with the exponent closest to the preferred exponent 0 (`from_double(0.5)` is `0.5`, `from_double(100.0)` is `100`). Otherwise it is rounded half-even to exactly `precision` digits, the least possible exponent (IEEE 754-2019 §5.2): `from_double(0.1, precision=16)` is `0.1000000000000000`. Signed zeros and infinities are preserved; every NaN becomes a quiet NaN with payload 0 and the input's sign. `from_float` widens to `Double` first, which is exact."
msgstr "每个有限 `Double` 都是二进有理数 $m \\cdot 2^{k}$，因而当 $k<0$ 时具有有限十进制展开 $m \\cdot 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$；转换会构造这一精确展开，若它能容纳于 `precision` 位（默认 34），就以最接近首选指数 0 的指数返回（`from_double(0.5)` 为 `0.5`，`from_double(100.0)` 为 `100`）；否则按半值取偶舍入到恰好 `precision` 位，即尽可能小的指数（IEEE 754-2019 §5.2）：`from_double(0.1, precision=16)` 为 `0.1000000000000000`。带符号的零与无穷得以保留；每个 NaN 都变为载荷为 0、符号与输入相同的静默 NaN。`from_float` 先扩展为 `Double`，这一步是精确的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:287
msgid "These functions convert between `Decimal` and the binary [`BinFloat`](bin_float.md)."
msgstr "这些函数在 `Decimal` 与二进制 [`BinFloat`](bin_float.md) 之间转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:295
msgid "`from_bin_float(x, precision~, mode~)` is exact whenever the decimal expansion of `x` fits in `precision` decimal digits, with the exponent closest to 0 as for `from_double`, and is otherwise rounded once to exactly `precision` digits in `mode` (default `RoundTiesToEven`, the rounding type of the radix of the result). The precision is required and counts digits; it was the number of bits of `x` by default, a count of the wrong kind. A binary zero keeps its sign ($-0$ becomes $-0$, as IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 and §6.3 require), and a NaN becomes a quiet NaN with payload 0. `to_bin_float(precision~, mode~)` rounds the exact decimal value once to a `BinFloat` of `precision` bits with `mode`, one of the five rounding-direction attributes of IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1 (default `RoundTiesToEven`). The precision is required and counts bits, from 1 to `@bin_float.binary_precision_max`; outside that range the call aborts (it was the number of digits of the decimal by default). Most decimal fractions are not dyadic, so this direction is usually inexact; converting with `RoundTowardNegative` and `RoundTowardPositive` gives a binary enclosure of the decimal value. Zeros keep their sign and NaN payloads are not kept. The same conversions are in `decimal_gda`, with `GdaRoundingMode` for the decimal result."
msgstr "只要 `x` 的十进制展开能容纳于 `precision` 位十进制数字，`from_bin_float(x, precision~, mode~)` 就是精确的，其指数与 `from_double` 一样取最接近 0 的指数；否则按 `mode`（默认 `RoundTiesToEven`，即结果所属基数的舍入类型）一次舍入到恰好 `precision` 位。精度是必需的，按十进制数字计；它原来默认取 `x` 的位数，那是种类不对的计数。二进制零保留其符号（$-0$ 变为 $-0$，这是 IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 与 §6.3 的要求），NaN 变为载荷为 0 的静默 NaN。`to_bin_float(precision~, mode~)` 以 `mode`（IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1 的五种舍入方向属性之一，默认 `RoundTiesToEven`）将精确的十进制值一次舍入为 `precision` 位的 `BinFloat`。精度是必需的，按位计，范围为 1 到 `@bin_float.binary_precision_max`；超出范围时调用中止（它原来默认取该十进制值的位数）。大多数十进制小数都不是二进有理数，因此这一方向通常不精确；分别以 `RoundTowardNegative` 和 `RoundTowardPositive` 转换可得到该十进制值的二进制包络。零保留其符号，NaN 载荷不予保留。`decimal_gda` 中有相同的转换，其十进制结果使用 `GdaRoundingMode`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:315
msgid "These functions are IEEE 754-2019 convertFormat (§5.4.2) with the flags, for the conversions between decimal formats and between the radices."
msgstr "这些函数是带标志的 IEEE 754-2019 convertFormat（§5.4.2），用于十进制格式之间以及不同基数之间的转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:324
msgid "`convert_format(format)` converts to decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128: the value is rounded once, to nearest even, to the precision and exponent range of the format, with the flags of that rounding. The preferred exponent is the quantum of the source (\"For conversions between decimal formats, the preferred exponent is Q(source)\"): a conversion to a wider format is exact and keeps the cohort member, a narrower one rounds, can overflow or underflow, and folds a large exponent down. `from_bin_float_ctx(x, ctx)` rounds the exact value of a binary float once under the decimal context (precision, exponent range, direction) with the flags of the rounding: an exact conversion has the preferred exponent 0 (the exponent closest to 0 that holds the digits: `0.5` is `5E-1`, `96` is `96`), an inexact one has `precision` digits (\"the preferred exponent is the least possible\"). A value beyond the exponent range, or far below it, overflows or underflows without its digits being formed. An in-range value is converted at any binary exponent, correctly rounded, at a cost that does not grow with the exponent; a binary exponent beyond $2^{22}$ is refused with NaN and `invalid_operation`. `to_bin_float_ctx(ctx)` rounds the exact decimal value once under a `BinaryContext` (binary16 to binary128, or any precision and range) and returns the `BinaryFlags` (inexact, overflow, underflow); it is the conversion of `BinFloat::from_string_ctx`, correctly rounded for any exponent. A zero keeps its sign in every direction. A signaling NaN gives a quiet NaN and the invalid operation exception; the sign of a NaN is kept, and so is its payload when the destination holds it (§6.2.3): `p - 1` digits for the decimal formats and `p - 2` bits for a binary format, otherwise the low digits or bits. `from_bin_float` and `to_bin_float` are unchanged."
msgstr "`convert_format(format)` 转换为 decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128：值按就近偶一次舍入到该格式的精度和指数范围，并带有该舍入的标志。首选指数是源的量子（“对于十进制格式之间的转换，首选指数是 Q(source)”）：转换到更宽的格式是精确的并保留同值类成员，转换到更窄的格式则舍入，可能上溢或下溢，并折叠较大的指数。`from_bin_float_ctx(x, ctx)` 在十进制上下文（精度、指数范围、方向）下把二进制浮点数的精确值一次舍入，并带有该舍入的标志：精确转换的首选指数是 0（容纳这些数字且最接近 0 的指数：`0.5` 是 `5E-1`，`96` 是 `96`），不精确的转换有 `precision` 位数字（“首选指数是尽可能小的”）。超出指数范围或远低于它的值，不构造其数字就上溢或下溢。范围内的值在任何二进制指数下都被正确舍入转换，代价不随指数增长；二进制指数超过 $2^{22}$ 时会以 NaN 和 `invalid_operation` 拒绝。`to_bin_float_ctx(ctx)` 在 `BinaryContext`（binary16 到 binary128，或任意精度和范围）下一次舍入精确的十进制值，并返回 `BinaryFlags`（inexact、overflow、underflow）；它是 `BinFloat::from_string_ctx` 的转换，对任意指数都正确舍入。零在每个方向上都保持符号。信号 NaN 给出安静 NaN 和无效操作异常；NaN 的符号被保留，目标能容纳时载荷也被保留（§6.2.3）：十进制格式为 `p - 1` 位数字，二进制格式为 `p - 2` 位，否则取低位数字或低位。`from_bin_float` 和 `to_bin_float` 保持不变。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:350
msgid "The `FromNat` and `FromInteger` implementations"
msgstr "`FromNat` 和 `FromInteger` 的实现"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:352
msgid "`Decimal` implements the `luna-generic` traits `FromNat` and `FromInteger`, the canonical maps out of the naturals and the integers. There are no `Decimal::from_natural` or `Decimal::from_integer` methods: call `Decimal::from_bigint(n)` (exponent 0, the cohort of the integer) or the trait functions."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `luna-generic` 的 trait `FromNat` 和 `FromInteger`，即从自然数和整数出发的规范映射。没有 `Decimal::from_natural` 或 `Decimal::from_integer` 方法：请调用 `Decimal::from_bigint(n)`（指数为 0，即该整数的队列成员）或 trait 函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:357
msgid "The trait functions return `from_bigint(n).normalized()` with precision 34, that is, with the trailing zeros removed. To convert another Luna-Flow integer type, pick its representative with `Integral::normalize` first, or use `lift_to`."
msgstr "trait 函数以精度 34 返回 `from_bigint(n).normalized()`，也就是去掉了尾随零。要转换其他 Luna-Flow 整数类型，请先用 `Integral::normalize` 取其代表元，或使用 `lift_to`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:361
msgid "Parsing and formatting"
msgstr "解析与格式化"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:365
msgid "`from_string` converts decimal text to a `Decimal` while keeping its quantum."
msgstr "`from_string` 将十进制文本转换为 `Decimal`，同时保留其量子。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:371
msgid "The accepted syntax is an optional sign, digits with an optional decimal point, an optional exponent `E`/`e` with optional sign, or one of `Inf`, `Infinity`, `NaN` and `sNaN` (any letter case) followed for NaNs by optional decimal payload digits. Conversion rounds once, half-even, to `precision` (default 34), while preserving the preferred exponent as far as the precision and representation permit. For example, `\"1.2300\"` has coefficient 12300 and exponent $-4$; `\"1.0001\"` at precision 3 rounds to `1.00`, and the exact `\"1.000\"` at precision 3 is `1.00` because its four coefficient digits do not fit. `\"10001\"` at precision 3 rounds to `1.00E+4`. Invalid text returns `Err(parse_error)`."
msgstr "可接受的语法为：可选符号、带可选小数点的数字、带可选符号的可选指数 `E`/`e`；或者 `Inf`、`Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN` 之一（不区分大小写），NaN 后面还可跟可选的十进制载荷数字。转换以半值取偶方式一次舍入到 `precision`（默认 34），并在精度与表示范围允许时保留首选指数。例如，`\"1.2300\"` 的系数为 12300、指数为 $-4$；精度为 3 时，`\"1.0001\"` 舍入为 `1.00`，精确的 `\"1.000\"` 也为 `1.00`，因为其四位系数无法容纳。精度为 3 时，`\"10001\"` 舍入为 `1.00E+4`。无效文本返回 `Err(parse_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:382
msgid "No context exponent range is applied; the limits are those of the [stored range](#decimal_value_e_max-decimal_value_e_tiny): the exponent of the value must be at least `decimal_value_e_tiny` ($-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$) and its adjusted exponent at most `decimal_value_e_max` ($2\\,147\\,483\\,646$), checked after the rounding to `precision` (a carry included) and for a zero as for any finite value. A text whose value is outside them is refused, never replaced: `from_string` returns the domain error, which names the exponent and both limits (`\"1e3000000000\"`, `\"12e2147483647\"`, `\"0e-2147483646\"` are refused; `\"1249e-2147483646\"` at precision 3 is `1.25E-2147483643`, its exponent after the rounding being inside the range). Read the text with [`from_string_ctx`](#decimalfrom_string_ctx) when a rounded value (an infinity, a zero) and the `overflow` and `underflow` flags are wanted."
msgstr "不适用任何上下文指数范围；限制是[存储范围](#decimal_value_e_max-decimal_value_e_tiny)的限制：值的指数必须至少为 `decimal_value_e_tiny`（$-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$），其调整指数至多为 `decimal_value_e_max`（$2\\,147\\,483\\,646$），在舍入到 `precision` 之后（包括进位）检查，零与任何有限值一样处理。值在这些限制之外的文本会被拒绝，绝不替换：`from_string` 返回域错误，错误信息指出指数与两个限制（`\"1e3000000000\"`、`\"12e2147483647\"`、`\"0e-2147483646\"` 被拒绝；精度为 3 时 `\"1249e-2147483646\"` 是 `1.25E-2147483643`，其舍入后的指数在范围之内）。需要舍入后的值（无穷、零）以及 `overflow` 与 `underflow` 标志时，请用 [`from_string_ctx`](#decimalfrom_string_ctx) 读取该文本。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:397
msgid "`from_string_ctx` converts text under a context and reports conversion flags."
msgstr "`from_string_ctx` 在上下文下转换文本并报告转换标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:403
msgid "The syntax is the one of `from_string`. The value is rounded to the context precision (raising `inexact` when non-zero digits are discarded), checked against the exponent range (overflow, underflow) and folded down. A NaN payload with more digits than the format allows (precision $-1$ digits) is a syntax error. Invalid text returns a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "语法与 `from_string` 相同。值被舍入到上下文精度（丢弃非零数字时引发 `inexact`），按指数范围检查（上溢、下溢）并折叠。若 NaN 载荷的位数超过该格式允许的位数（精度 $-1$ 位），则视为语法错误。无效文本返回带 `invalid_operation` 的静默 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:425
msgid "These functions implement the General Decimal Arithmetic `to-scientific-string` and `to-engineering-string` conversions of a value."
msgstr "这些函数对值实现 General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `to-scientific-string` 与 `to-engineering-string` 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:433
msgid "Both format the value they are called on; to convert text under a context, read it with `from_string_ctx` first, which also gives the flags of the conversion (`Decimal::from_string_ctx(\"1000000000\", ctx).0.to_sci_string()`). Scientific form writes the coefficient with an exponent `E±n` whenever the exponent is positive or the adjusted exponent is below $-6$, and plain digits otherwise; engineering form uses an exponent that is a multiple of three. Special values are written `Infinity`, `-Infinity`, `NaN`, `sNaN`, with a payload such as `NaN7`."
msgstr "二者格式化调用它们的值；要在上下文下转换文本，请先用 `from_string_ctx` 读取，它同时给出转换的标志（`Decimal::from_string_ctx(\"1000000000\", ctx).0.to_sci_string()`）。科学记数形式在指数为正或调整后指数小于 $-6$ 时，用指数 `E±n` 书写系数，否则写成普通数字；工程记数形式使用 3 的倍数作为指数。特殊值写作 `Infinity`、`-Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN`，带载荷时如 `NaN7`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:442
msgid "Values without a context are formatted by `Decimal::to_string` (the `Show` implementation), which uses the same scientific rule; see [`Show` and `Debug`](#show-and-debug-decimalto_string-output-to_repr)."
msgstr "不带上下文的值由 `Decimal::to_string`（`Show` 实现）格式化，它使用同样的科学记数规则；参见 [`Show` 与 `Debug`](#show-and-debug-decimalto_string-output-to_repr)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:446
msgid "Contexts"
msgstr "上下文"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:450
msgid "A `DecimalContext` is an immutable set of arithmetic parameters."
msgstr "`DecimalContext` 是一组不可变的算术参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:458
msgid "A context is the IEEE 754-2019 format of a precision $p$ and an exponent range $[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$ with $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$ (§3.3), and one rounding-direction attribute (`rounding`, a `DecimalRoundingMode`). Every finite result of a context operation is a member of the format: its exponent $q$ satisfies $e_{\\min} \\le q + p - 1 \\le e_{\\max}$, so $q \\le e_{\\max} - p + 1$ (large exponents are folded down, as the format requires), and tininess is detected before rounding (§7.5). There is no option for any of this. No operation reads ambient state: every context operation receives its context as an argument."
msgstr "上下文是由精度 $p$ 和指数范围 $[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$（其中 $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$）确定的 IEEE 754-2019 格式（§3.3），外加一个舍入方向属性（`rounding`，即 `DecimalRoundingMode`）。上下文运算的每个有限结果都是该格式的成员：其指数 $q$ 满足 $e_{\\min} \\le q + p - 1 \\le e_{\\max}$，因此 $q \\le e_{\\max} - p + 1$（按格式的要求折叠大指数），并且微小性在舍入之前检测（§7.5）。这些都没有任何选项。没有任何运算读取环境状态：每个上下文运算都把其上下文作为参数接收。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:470
msgid "The limits of the context parameters that `DecimalContext::try_new` accepts."
msgstr "`DecimalContext::try_new` 接受的上下文参数的上限。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:478
msgid "They are $999\\,999\\,999$, $-999\\,999\\,998$ ($1 - e_{\\max}$, the smallest $e_{\\min}$ of a context) and $999\\,999\\,999$, the decNumber `decContext.h` limits (`decimal_implementation_e_min` was $-999\\,999\\,999$ before 0.12). `try_new` and `new` check `precision` and `e_max` against these constants (`precision` in `1..=decimal_precision_max`, `e_max` in `1..=decimal_implementation_e_max`), so the values cannot drift from the validation. They bound the context only: the certified elementary functions have their own, lower limit ($e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ and $p \\le 999\\,999$), which is documented in [Elementary functions](#elementary-functions)."
msgstr "它们是 $999\\,999\\,999$、$-999\\,999\\,998$（$1 - e_{\\max}$，即上下文的最小 $e_{\\min}$）和 $999\\,999\\,999$，即 decNumber `decContext.h` 的限制（`decimal_implementation_e_min` 在 0.12 之前为 $-999\\,999\\,999$）。`try_new` 和 `new` 用这些常量检查 `precision` 和 `e_max`（`precision` 在 `1..=decimal_precision_max`，`e_max` 在 `1..=decimal_implementation_e_max`），因此这些值不会与校验脱节。它们只限制上下文：经认证的初等函数有各自更低的限制（$e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ 且 $p \\le 999\\,999$），见 [Elementary functions](#elementary-functions)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:490
msgid "`new` builds the context of an IEEE 754-2019 decimal format from a precision and an `e_max` and aborts on an invalid one; `try_new` takes the same parameters and returns a `Result`."
msgstr "`new` 根据精度和 `e_max` 构造 IEEE 754-2019 十进制格式的上下文，参数无效时中止；`try_new` 接受相同的参数并返回 `Result`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:499
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:499
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:501
msgid "coefficient digits $p$"
msgstr "系数位数 $p$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:502
msgid "the largest exponent $e_{\\max}$; $e_{\\min}$ is $1 - e_{\\max}$"
msgstr "最大指数 $e_{\\max}$；$e_{\\min}$ 为 $1 - e_{\\max}$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:503
msgid "rounding-direction attribute (IEEE 754-2019 §4.3)"
msgstr "舍入方向属性（IEEE 754-2019 §4.3）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:505
msgid "`precision` must be in `1..=999,999,999` and `e_max` in `1..=999,999,999`. The default of `e_max` follows IEEE 754-2019 §3.7: an extendable format given by its precision alone needs $e_{\\max} \\ge 1000\\,p$ from 51 digits on, and 999,999 is the widest range in which every operation of the package runs. `new()` is therefore the format $(34,\\ 999\\,999)$, not decimal128: use `decimal128()` for that. A precision above 999,999 has no default range (1000 $p$ exceeds the limit): pass `e_max`. `try_new` returns `Err(domain_error)` naming the invalid field; `new` aborts with a message that names it, like `BinaryContext::new`, so use `try_new` for parameters that come from outside. NOTE 3 of §3.7 says that $e_{\\max}$ should be at least 2; the library accepts 1, the least value for which $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$ (§3.3)."
msgstr "`precision` 必须在 `1..=999,999,999` 内，`e_max` 必须在 `1..=999,999,999` 内。`e_max` 的默认值遵循 IEEE 754-2019 §3.7：仅由精度给定的可扩展格式，从 51 位数字起需要 $e_{\\max} \\ge 1000\\,p$，而 999,999 是包中所有运算都能运行的最宽范围。因此 `new()` 是格式 $(34,\\ 999\\,999)$，而不是 decimal128：要得到后者请用 `decimal128()`。精度超过 999,999 时没有默认范围（1000 $p$ 超出限制）：请传入 `e_max`。`try_new` 返回 `Err(domain_error)` 并指明无效字段；`new` 以指明该字段的消息中止，与 `BinaryContext::new` 相同，因此对来自外部的参数请使用 `try_new`。§3.7 的注 3 说 $e_{\\max}$ 应至少为 2；本库接受 1，即满足 $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$ 的最小值（§3.3）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:517
msgid "There is one rounding parameter: finite results, infinities and every other use of the context round by it, and `rounding()` reports exactly the mode that is applied. The commercial rounding of GDA (`round-half-up`) is `RoundTiesToAway`; the GDA modes `round-half-down`, `round-up` and `round-05up` are not attributes of an IEEE 754-2019 decimal format and exist only in [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md). A context has no `clamp`, `extended` or `tininess` setting and no unlimited precision (`exact()` is gone): an IEEE format always has the exponent range of its quantum, the subset arithmetic of the General Decimal Arithmetic appendix is not an IEEE format, and exact results are obtained with a precision large enough for the digits (a context of `digits(a) + digits(b)` digits and an `e_max` of at least the exponent of the product makes `mul_ctx` exact)."
msgstr "舍入参数只有一个：有限结果、无穷以及上下文的其他一切用途都按它舍入，`rounding()` 报告的恰是实际使用的模式。GDA 的商业舍入（`round-half-up`）即 `RoundTiesToAway`；GDA 的 `round-half-down`、`round-up` 和 `round-05up` 不是 IEEE 754-2019 十进制格式的属性，只存在于 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 中。上下文没有 `clamp`、`extended` 或 `tininess` 设置，也没有无限精度（`exact()` 已移除）：IEEE 格式始终具有其量子的指数范围，通用十进制算术附录中的子集算术不是 IEEE 格式，而精确结果通过足以容纳数字的精度获得（`digits(a) + digits(b)` 位的上下文，加上至少为乘积指数的 `e_max`，可使 `mul_ctx` 精确）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:530
msgid "[!NOTE] The certified elementary functions accept contexts with $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ and $p \\le 999\\,999$. The default range of `DecimalContext::new` is the largest one inside that limit for $p \\le 999$; a context with a larger range (explicit `e_max`, or $p \\ge 1000$) makes them return NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 经认证的初等函数接受 $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ 且 $p \\le 999\\,999$ 的上下文。对于 $p \\le 999$，`DecimalContext::new` 的默认范围是该限制内最大的范围；范围更大的上下文（显式 `e_max`，或 $p \\ge 1000$）会使它们返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:538
msgid "These constructors return the contexts of the IEEE 754-2019 interchange formats (§3.6)."
msgstr "这些构造函数返回 IEEE 754-2019 交换格式的上下文（§3.6）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:553
msgid "All three use `RoundTiesToEven` by default (pass `rounding~` for another attribute)."
msgstr "三者默认都使用 `RoundTiesToEven`（传入 `rounding~` 可使用其他属性）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:558
msgid "`from_arithmetic_context` converts the shared Luna-Flow context."
msgstr "`from_arithmetic_context` 转换共享的 Luna-Flow 上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:564
msgid "Precision and rounding are copied; `clamp` is ignored (it is a property of every IEEE format, and the `arithmetic` package's default is `false`). A given `e_max` is used; a given `e_min` must equal `1 - e_max` or the conversion returns `Err(domain_error)`; `e_min` alone gives `e_max = 1 - e_min`; neither gives the default range of `new`. The conversion also returns `Err(domain_error)` for `AwayFromZero` (no attribute of §4.3) and when the precision or `e_max` is out of range. GDA 1.70 itself sets no fixed limits; these are the adopted decNumber `decContext.h` limits."
msgstr "精度和舍入被复制；`clamp` 被忽略（它是每个 IEEE 格式的属性，而 `arithmetic` 包的默认值是 `false`）。给定的 `e_max` 会被使用；给定的 `e_min` 必须等于 `1 - e_max`，否则转换返回 `Err(domain_error)`；仅给定 `e_min` 时 `e_max = 1 - e_min`；两者都未给定时取 `new` 的默认范围。对于 `AwayFromZero`（不是 §4.3 的属性），以及精度或 `e_max` 超出范围时，转换同样返回 `Err(domain_error)`。GDA 1.70 本身没有设定固定的限制；这些是采用的 decNumber `decContext.h` 的限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:575
msgid "These accessors return the fields of a context."
msgstr "这些访问函数返回上下文的字段。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:584
msgid "`e_min` is always `1 - e_max`."
msgstr "`e_min` 始终为 `1 - e_max`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:595
msgid "The certified elementary functions evaluate an enclosure at a growing working precision until both ends round alike. The limit is the number of evaluations: `Some(n)` allows `n` (a value below 1 counts as 1), the default is `Some(12)`, and `None` removes the count limit. When the limit is reached without a decision, `try_*_ctx` returns the `CertificationFailure` error with the refinement count, as before, and the plain and `*_ctx` forms return NaN with `invalid_operation`. With `None` the loop stops when the working precision passes a cap, the larger of 8,000,000 bits and 256 times the first working precision. The default changes no result. The field takes part in `==`: two contexts that differ only in the limit are different."
msgstr "认证初等函数在不断增大的工作精度下求包络，直到两端舍入结果相同。该限制是求值次数：`Some(n)` 允许 `n` 次（小于 1 的值按 1 计），默认为 `Some(12)`，`None` 则取消次数限制。达到限制仍未能判定时，`try_*_ctx` 像以前一样返回带细化次数的 `CertificationFailure` 错误，普通形式和 `*_ctx` 形式返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。使用 `None` 时，循环在工作精度超过上限时停止，该上限取 8,000,000 位与首个工作精度的 256 倍中较大者。默认值不改变任何结果。该字段参与 `==`：仅限制不同的两个上下文是不同的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:622
msgid "These functions derive a context."
msgstr "这些函数派生上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:630
msgid "`with_precision` replaces the precision and `with_e_max` the exponent range (`e_min` follows); both abort outside the limits of `new`. `with_rounding` replaces the rounding-direction attribute."
msgstr "`with_precision` 替换精度，`with_e_max` 替换指数范围（`e_min` 随之变化）；二者在超出 `new` 的限制时都会中止。`with_rounding` 替换舍入方向属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:634
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:447
msgid "Rounding modes"
msgstr "舍入模式"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:638
msgid "`DecimalRoundingMode` lists the five rounding-direction attributes of IEEE 754-2019 §4.3 that a decimal format has, in the spelling of `BinaryRoundingMode`."
msgstr "`DecimalRoundingMode` 列出十进制格式拥有的 IEEE 754-2019 §4.3 的五种舍入方向属性，拼写与 `BinaryRoundingMode` 一致。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:651
msgid "Let $x>0$ lie strictly between two adjacent representable coefficients $c$ and $c+1$ (in units of the last place). `RoundTowardZero` returns $c$; `RoundTowardPositive` and `RoundTowardNegative` round toward $+\\infty$ and $-\\infty$ (so they depend on the sign); `RoundTiesToEven` and `RoundTiesToAway` return the nearer of the two and break an exact tie toward the even coefficient and away from zero respectively. The kernels also have three working modes that no context can select (`HalfDown`, `Up` and `ZeroFiveUp`: the double-rounding guard digit of division and the directed bounds of the certified functions); they are internal."
msgstr "设 $x>0$ 严格位于两个相邻可表示系数 $c$ 与 $c+1$ 之间（以末位单位计）。`RoundTowardZero` 返回 $c$；`RoundTowardPositive` 和 `RoundTowardNegative` 分别向 $+\\infty$ 和 $-\\infty$ 舍入（因此依赖于符号）；`RoundTiesToEven` 和 `RoundTiesToAway` 返回两者中较近的一个，恰好处于中点时分别取偶系数和远离零。内核另有三种上下文无法选择的工作模式（`HalfDown`、`Up` 和 `ZeroFiveUp`：除法的双重舍入保护位，以及认证函数的定向界）；它们是内部的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:663
msgid "These functions map between the attributes and the shared `@arithmetic.RoundingMode`."
msgstr "这些函数在各舍入方向属性与共享的 `@arithmetic.RoundingMode` 之间映射。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:677
msgid "none (`from_arithmetic` returns `None`)"
msgstr "无（`from_arithmetic` 返回 `None`）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:679
msgid "`to_arithmetic` returns `None` for `RoundTiesToAway`, which the shared enum does not have. `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` and the `_contextual` forms return `Err` for `AwayFromZero`."
msgstr "`to_arithmetic` 对 `RoundTiesToAway` 返回 `None`，因为共享枚举中没有该模式。`DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 和各 `_contextual` 形式对 `AwayFromZero` 返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:683
msgid "Tininess is detected before rounding in every context (IEEE 754-2019 §7.5: \"For decimal formats, tininess is detected before rounding\"): a non-zero result whose exact magnitude is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ is tiny, whatever the delivered value. A tiny result raises `underflow` when it is inexact. There is no option for the binary-style after-rounding rule."
msgstr "在每个上下文中，微小性都在舍入之前检测（IEEE 754-2019 §7.5：“对于十进制格式，微小性在舍入之前检测”）：精确绝对值低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的非零结果是微小的，无论最终交付的值是什么。微小的结果在不精确时引发 `underflow`。没有采用二进制风格的舍入之后规则的选项。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:689
msgid "Status flags"
msgstr "状态标志"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:693
msgid "`DecimalFlags` records the conditions raised by one operation."
msgstr "`DecimalFlags` 记录一次运算所引发的条件。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:701
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:34
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:701
msgid "Raised when"
msgstr "引发条件"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:703
msgid "the result differs from the exact result"
msgstr "结果与精确结果不同"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:704
msgid "the result is tiny and inexact"
msgstr "结果微小且不精确"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:705
msgid "the rounded result's adjusted exponent exceeds $e_{\\max}$"
msgstr "舍入后结果的调整后指数超过 $e_{\\max}$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:706
msgid "an exact infinite result from finite operands ($x/0$, $\\ln 0$, $\\log_2 0$, $\\log_{10} 0$, $\\operatorname{logb} 0$, $\\operatorname{log1p}(-1)$, $\\operatorname{log2p1}(-1)$, $\\operatorname{log10p1}(-1)$, $\\operatorname{rSqrt}(\\pm 0)$, $\\operatorname{compound}(-1, n<0)$, $\\operatorname{powr}(\\pm 0, y<0)$)"
msgstr "有限操作数产生的精确无穷结果（$x/0$、$\\ln 0$、$\\log_2 0$、$\\log_{10} 0$、$\\operatorname{logb} 0$、$\\operatorname{log1p}(-1)$、$\\operatorname{log2p1}(-1)$、$\\operatorname{log10p1}(-1)$、$\\operatorname{rSqrt}(\\pm 0)$、$\\operatorname{compound}(-1, n<0)$、$\\operatorname{powr}(\\pm 0, y<0)$）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:707
msgid "no usefully definable result (signaling NaN, $\\infty-\\infty$, $0\\times\\infty$, $0/0$, bad quantize, text that is not a number, a context outside the range an elementary function supports)"
msgstr "没有可用的有意义定义的结果（信号 NaN、$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$、$0/0$、错误的 quantize、不是数字的文本、超出某个初等函数所支持范围的上下文）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:708
msgid "a result the library could not compute within a limit of the implementation (a context beyond the elementary kernels, an operand beyond their range, an exact sum with an exponent gap beyond the work bound, a certification that did not conclude): the value is a NaN, `invalid_operation` is not raised, and the `try_` form returns `Err` (certification failure kind)"
msgstr "库无法在实现的某个限制内计算出的结果（超出初等内核的上下文、超出其范围的操作数、指数间隔超过工作界限的精确和、未得出结论的认证）：值为 NaN，不触发 `invalid_operation`，`try_` 形式返回 `Err`（认证失败一类）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:710
msgid "These are the five flags of IEEE 754-2019 7.2 to 7.6 and `not_computed`. The General Decimal Arithmetic flags `rounded`, `subnormal`, `clamped`, `lost_digits`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined` and `invalid_context` are not part of `decimal`; `decimal_gda` keeps them."
msgstr "这是 IEEE 754-2019 第 7.2 至 7.6 节的五个标志，加上 `not_computed`。General Decimal Arithmetic 的标志 `rounded`、`subnormal`、`clamped`、`lost_digits`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined` 和 `invalid_context` 不属于 `decimal`；`decimal_gda` 保留了它们。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:712
msgid "The fields are private. Each flag is read with a method of the same name, such as `flags.inexact()` or `flags.division_by_zero()`; the flags never accumulate implicitly."
msgstr "字段为私有。每个标志都用同名方法读取，例如 `flags.inexact()` 或 `flags.division_by_zero()`；标志不会被隐式累积。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:716
msgid "These functions create, merge and query flag sets."
msgstr "这些函数创建、合并与查询标志集合。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:724
msgid "`new` has every flag clear. `combine` is the field-wise OR, so it is associative, commutative and idempotent with `new()` as identity. `has_error` is"
msgstr "`new` 的所有标志均为清除状态。`combine` 是逐字段的 OR，因此满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，并以 `new()` 为单位元。`has_error` 为"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:731
msgid "the conditions for which IEEE 754-2019 delivers no usable number (7.2: invalid operation is \"no usefully definable result\"). A failed `from_string_ctx`, which raises `invalid_operation`, therefore counts as an error. `has_error` does not include `overflow`, `underflow` or `inexact`: those deliver a usable result (IEEE 754-2019 7.4 to 7.6 define it, as 7.3 does for division by zero). `division_by_zero` is in the set only so that the checked forms of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` can return `Err` for a division by zero."
msgstr "即 IEEE 754-2019 无法给出可用数的那些条件（7.2：无效操作是“没有可用的有意义定义的结果”）。因此，引发 `invalid_operation` 的失败的 `from_string_ctx` 也算作错误。`has_error` 不包括 `overflow`、`underflow` 或 `inexact`：这些条件都会给出可用的结果（IEEE 754-2019 的 7.4 至 7.6 对其作了定义，7.3 对除以零同样如此）。`division_by_zero` 之所以在集合中，只是为了让 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 checked 形式能对除以零返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:752
msgid "Plain operations without a context"
msgstr "无上下文的普通运算"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:754
msgid "The operators and the functions in this group take no context and return no flags. They are convenient for exact work and for generic code over the Luna-Flow algebra traits; use the [context arithmetic](#context-arithmetic) whenever rounding, the exponent range or flags matter."
msgstr "本组中的运算符和函数既不接受上下文，也不返回标志。它们便于进行精确计算，以及编写基于 Luna-Flow 代数 trait 的泛型代码；只要舍入、指数范围或标志有影响，就请使用[上下文算术](#context-arithmetic)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:761
msgid "These functions are the arithmetic operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-`."
msgstr "这些函数即算术运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 以及一元 `-`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:771
msgid "Each operator is the matching [context operation](#context-arithmetic) (`add_ctx`, `sub_ctx`, `mul_ctx`, `div_ctx`, `sqrt_ctx`) in a private working context with the flags dropped: the format of the larger precision $\\max(p_a, p_b)$ of the operand precision fields, round half even, the storage range of a value (`decimal_value_e_max`, $2\\,147\\,483\\,646$, and `decimal_value_e_tiny`, $-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$) and no fold-down. The result precision field is $\\max(p_a, p_b)$."
msgstr "每个运算符都是对应的[上下文运算](#context-arithmetic)（`add_ctx`、`sub_ctx`、`mul_ctx`、`div_ctx`、`sqrt_ctx`）在一个私有工作上下文中的结果，并丢弃标志：该上下文取操作数精度字段中较大的精度 $\\max(p_a, p_b)$，半值取偶舍入，采用值的存储范围（`decimal_value_e_max`，$2\\,147\\,483\\,646$，与 `decimal_value_e_tiny`，$-2\\,147\\,483\\,645$），且不做折叠。结果的精度字段为 $\\max(p_a, p_b)$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:779
msgid "An exact result takes the cohort member closest to the preferred exponent (IEEE 754-2019 5.4.1: $\\min(q_a, q_b)$ for `add` and `sub`, $q_a+q_b$ for `mul`, $q_a-q_b$ for `div`): `1.20 + 3.40` is `4.60`, `6.0 / 2` is `3.0`, `1.25 * 2.50` is `3.1250`, `1.20 - 1.20` is `0.00`."
msgstr "正确结果取最接近首选指数的同值类成员（IEEE 754-2019 5.4.1：`add` 与 `sub` 为 $\\min(q_a, q_b)$，`mul` 为 $q_a+q_b$，`div` 为 $q_a-q_b$）：`1.20 + 3.40` 是 `4.60`，`6.0 / 2` 是 `3.0`，`1.25 * 2.50` 是 `3.1250`，`1.20 - 1.20` 是 `0.00`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:783
msgid "An inexact result has exactly $p$ digits (the least exponent, 5.2) and is not reduced: `1 / 3` at seven digits is `0.3333333`, a product of two five-digit values is rounded to five digits. The product used to be returned exact, with up to $2p$ digits."
msgstr "不精确的结果恰有 $p$ 位（最小指数，5.2）且不被约简：7 位精度下 `1 / 3` 是 `0.3333333`，两个五位数的乘积舍入到五位。乘积过去是精确返回的，最多有 $2p$ 位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:787
msgid "`neg` flips the sign bit of every value, including zeros and NaNs."
msgstr "`neg` 翻转每个值的符号位，包括零和 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:789
msgid "Special values follow the context operations: a NaN operand gives a quiet NaN with the payload of the first NaN; $\\infty-\\infty$, $0\\times\\infty$, $0/0$ and $\\infty/\\infty$ give a NaN; $x/0$ is an infinity with the sign of the exact quotient (the sign of a zero counts: `1 / -0` is $-\\infty$); the sign of a zero product is the exclusive or of the signs; finite$/\\infty$ is a signed zero at the smallest exponent of the working context. A result beyond the working range is an overflow of that context, an infinity, and a result below it rounds half-even to the smallest exponent, possibly to a signed zero (`1E+2147483646 * 1E+2147483646` is `inf`, `123E-2147483640 * 1E-10` is `0E-2147483645`). `x + 0 == x`, `x - 0 == x` and `x * 1 == x` hold for every finite value inside that range, at any exponent: the sum or product is the value, at the cohort member closest to the preferred exponent that holds it in $p$ digits."
msgstr "特殊值遵循上下文运算：NaN 操作数给出带有第一个 NaN 载荷的安静 NaN；$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$、$0/0$ 和 $\\infty/\\infty$ 给出 NaN；$x/0$ 是符号为精确商符号的无穷（零的符号也计入：`1 / -0` 是 $-\\infty$）；零乘积的符号是各操作数符号的异或；有限值$/\\infty$ 是工作上下文最小指数处的带符号零。超出工作范围的结果是该上下文的上溢，即无穷；低于它的结果半值取偶舍入到最小指数，可能得到带符号的零（`1E+2147483646 * 1E+2147483646` 是 `inf`，`123E-2147483640 * 1E-10` 是 `0E-2147483645`）。对该范围内的每个有限值、任意指数，`x + 0 == x`、`x - 0 == x` 与 `x * 1 == x` 都成立：和或积就是该值，取最接近首选指数且能以 $p$ 位容纳它的同值类成员。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:818
msgid "These functions change only the sign bit."
msgstr "这些函数只改变符号位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:826
msgid "They never round, never raise flags and keep exponent, payload and NaN kind. `abs` clears the sign, `neg` flips it, `copy_sign` copies the sign bit of the second operand and `copy` returns its argument."
msgstr "它们从不舍入，从不引发标志，并保持指数、载荷与 NaN 种类不变。`abs` 清除符号，`neg` 翻转符号，`copy_sign` 复制第二个操作数的符号位，`copy` 返回其参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:832
msgid "These functions change the cohort member or the precision field."
msgstr "这些函数改变同值类成员或精度字段。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:839
msgid "`normalized` returns the reduced member of the cohort (all trailing zeros removed, zero with exponent 0), rounding half-even to the value's own precision if the coefficient is longer. It is the only way to strip trailing zeros: IEEE 754-2019 has no operation for it, so `decimal` no longer has `reduce_ctx` or `trim` (`x.apply_ctx(ctx).0.normalized()` is the former `reduce_ctx`). `with_precision(p, mode)` rounds a finite value to `p` digits with `mode`, reduces it and stores `p` as the precision field; special values only get the new precision field. All of them are flag-free."
msgstr "`normalized` 返回同值类中的约简成员（去除所有尾随零，零的指数为 0），若系数更长则按半值取偶舍入到该值自身的精度。它是去除尾随零的唯一方式：IEEE 754-2019 没有对应的运算，因此 `decimal` 不再有 `reduce_ctx` 或 `trim`（`x.apply_ctx(ctx).0.normalized()` 即原来的 `reduce_ctx`）。`with_precision(p, mode)` 以 `mode` 将有限值舍入到 `p` 位，约简后将 `p` 存为精度字段；特殊值只获得新的精度字段。它们都不产生标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:848
msgid "`div_checked` divides, reporting domain errors as `Result`; `sqrt` takes the square root of the value under its own format."
msgstr "`div_checked` 做除法并以 `Result` 报告域错误；`sqrt` 按值自身的格式取平方根。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:855
msgid "`div_checked(a, b)` is `div_ctx` under `DecimalContext::new(precision=max(p_a, p_b))`; it returns `Err(division_by_zero)` for $x/0$ and `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid division. `sqrt` is `sqrt_ctx` in the working context of the plain operators (precision $p$) and returns NaN for a negative non-zero operand (IEEE 754-2019 7.2; `sqrt_checked` reports it as `Err`). Both are correctly rounded half-even."
msgstr "`div_checked(a, b)` 即 `DecimalContext::new(precision=max(p_a, p_b))` 下的 `div_ctx`；对 $x/0$ 返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效除法返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`sqrt` 即普通运算符工作上下文（精度 $p$）下的 `sqrt_ctx`，对负的非零操作数返回 NaN（IEEE 754-2019 7.2；`sqrt_checked` 将其报告为 `Err`）。二者都按半值取偶正确舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:862
msgid "Context arithmetic"
msgstr "上下文算术"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:864
msgid "Every function in this group takes a `DecimalContext` and returns `(result, flags)`. The result is the exact result rounded once to the context precision with the context's decimal rounding mode, then checked against the exponent range: overflow gives the rounding-mode-dependent result of the [design page](../design/decimal.md#overflow), a result whose exact magnitude is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ is rounded directly to the subnormal grid $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ (a normal result is rounded only to $p$ digits, even when its exact exponent is below $E_{\\text{tiny}}$), and large exponents are folded down to $e_{\\max}-p+1$. When the exact result fits, the exponent is the *preferred exponent* of the operation, so cohorts carry information. NaN operands propagate as a quiet NaN with the first NaN's sign and payload (the payload is cut to its low $p-1$ digits, as in `from_string_ctx` and the interchange encodings); any signaling NaN operand raises `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "本组中的每个函数都接受一个 `DecimalContext` 并返回 `(result, flags)`。结果是将精确结果以上下文的十进制舍入模式一次性舍入到上下文精度，再按指数范围检查：上溢得到依赖于舍入模式的结果（见[设计页面](../design/decimal.md#overflow)），精确绝对值小于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的结果被直接舍入到次正规网格 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$（正规结果只舍入到 $p$ 位，即使其精确指数低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$），大指数被折叠到 $e_{\\max}-p+1$。当精确结果可以容纳时，指数取该运算的*首选指数*，因此同值类携带了信息。NaN 操作数以静默 NaN 传播，其符号和载荷取自第一个 NaN（载荷截取为其低 $p-1$ 位，与 `from_string_ctx` 和交换编码一致）；任何信号 NaN 操作数都会引发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:879
msgid "Near the underflow threshold the single rounding matters. In decimal32, the exact product `3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45` is $4.5000045000015\\cdot 10^{-90}$, a normal number whose exact exponent is below $E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$; it is rounded once to seven digits, `4.500005E-90`. The quotient `1 / 1.9999999999998E+101` is $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$, which is subnormal; its guarded quotient is rounded once to the grid $10^{-101}$, giving `1E-101` with `inexact` and `underflow`."
msgstr "在下溢阈值附近，单次舍入至关重要。在 decimal32 中，精确乘积 `3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45` 为 $4.5000045000015\\cdot 10^{-90}$，这是一个精确指数低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$ 的正规数；它被一次舍入到七位数字，得到 `4.500005E-90`。商 `1 / 1.9999999999998E+101` 为 $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$，是次正规的；其带保护位的商被一次舍入到网格 $10^{-101}$，得到 `1E-101`，并带 `inexact` 和 `underflow`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:889
msgid "These functions are the correctly rounded arithmetic operations."
msgstr "这些函数是正确舍入的算术运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:898
msgid "Preferred exponents: $\\min(q_a,q_b)$ for addition and subtraction, $q_a+q_b$ for multiplication, $q_a-q_b$ for division. An exact quotient is returned in the member closest to the preferred exponent; an inexact quotient has $p$ digits, except a subnormal one, which ends at $E_{\\text{tiny}}$. A zero sum is $+0$ except under `Floor` (where it is $-0$ if either operand is negative) or when both operands are $-0$."
msgstr "首选指数：加法与减法为 $\\min(q_a,q_b)$，乘法为 $q_a+q_b$，除法为 $q_a-q_b$。精确的商以最接近首选指数的成员返回；不精确的商有 $p$ 位数字，但次正规的商除外，它截止于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$。零和为 $+0$，除非在 `Floor` 下（此时只要有一个操作数为负即为 $-0$）或两个操作数均为 $-0$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:905
msgid "Special cases: $\\infty-\\infty$ and $0\\times\\infty$, $\\infty/\\infty$ give NaN with `invalid_operation`; $0/0$ gives NaN with `invalid_operation`; $x/0$ for finite non-zero $x$ gives a signed infinity with `division_by_zero`; finite$/\\infty$ gives a signed zero with exponent $E_{\\text{tiny}}$."
msgstr "特殊情形：$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$ 与 $\\infty/\\infty$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$0/0$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；对有限非零的 $x$，$x/0$ 产生带 `division_by_zero` 的带符号无穷；有限值$/\\infty$ 产生指数为 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 的带符号零。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:910
msgid "When one operand of `add_ctx` or `sub_ctx` lies entirely below every rounding boundary of the sum, the operation does not align it digit by digit: it is replaced by a sticky unit of the same sign just below those boundaries, and the sum is rounded once (see the [design](../design/decimal.md#addition-with-a-far-smaller-addend)). With precision 7, `1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` is `1598616` under `Down`, and `6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` is `6.000001E-73` under `HalfEven`."
msgstr "当 `add_ctx` 或 `sub_ctx` 的一个操作数完全低于和的每个舍入边界时，该运算不会逐位对齐它：它被替换为一个恰好低于这些边界、符号相同的粘滞单位，然后对和只舍入一次（参见[设计](../design/decimal.md#addition-with-a-far-smaller-addend)）。在精度 7 下，`1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` 在 `Down` 下为 `1598616`，`6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` 在 `HalfEven` 下为 `6.000001E-73`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:951
msgid "`fma_ctx` computes $x \\cdot y + z$ with a single rounding."
msgstr "`fma_ctx` 以单次舍入计算 $x \\cdot y + z$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:957
msgid "The product is formed exactly and added to `z` exactly; only the sum is rounded. $0\\times\\infty + z$ is invalid for a number or infinite `z`; when `z` is a quiet NaN the result is that NaN **without** `invalid_operation` (IEEE 754-2019 §7.2 leaves this case to the implementation). $\\infty \\cdot y + (-\\infty)$ with opposite signs is invalid."
msgstr "乘积被精确地构造并精确地加到 `z` 上；只对和进行舍入。当 `z` 为数值或无穷时，$0\\times\\infty + z$ 是无效的；当 `z` 是静默 NaN 时，结果即该 NaN，**不**引发 `invalid_operation`（IEEE 754-2019 §7.2 将这种情形留给实现决定）。符号相反的 $\\infty \\cdot y + (-\\infty)$ 是无效的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:965
msgid "`sqrt_ctx` returns the correctly rounded square root."
msgstr "`sqrt_ctx` 返回正确舍入的平方根。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:971
msgid "The preferred exponent is $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$. An exact root is returned in the member closest to it (`sqrt(0.0400)` is `0.20`); an inexact root has $p$ digits and raises `inexact`. $\\sqrt{-0} = -0$; a negative non-zero operand or $-\\infty$ gives NaN with `invalid_operation`; $\\sqrt{+\\infty}=+\\infty$."
msgstr "首选指数为 $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$。精确的根以最接近它的成员返回（`sqrt(0.0400)` 为 `0.20`）；不精确的根有 $p$ 位数字，并引发 `inexact`。$\\sqrt{-0} = -0$；负的非零操作数或 $-\\infty$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$\\sqrt{+\\infty}=+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:978
msgid "These functions round one operand to the context."
msgstr "这些函数将单个操作数舍入到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:985
msgid "`apply_ctx` rounds a value to the context (precision, exponent range, clamping) and quiets a NaN, keeping the sign of zero. It replaces the former `plus_ctx` (and `minus_ctx` is `neg` followed by `apply_ctx`). `abs_ctx` is $|x|$ rounded to the context; signaling NaNs raise `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "`apply_ctx` 将值舍入到上下文（精度、指数范围、钳制），并将 NaN 静默化，保留零的符号。它取代了原来的 `plus_ctx`（而 `minus_ctx` 即 `neg` 后接 `apply_ctx`）。`abs_ctx` 即舍入到上下文的 $|x|$；信号 NaN 会引发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:992
msgid "This function computes the IEEE remainder."
msgstr "此函数计算 IEEE 余数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:998
msgid "`remainder_ctx(x, y)` is $x - y\\cdot n$ where $n$ is $x/y$ rounded to the nearest integer, ties to even (IEEE 754 *remainder*; the GDA name of it is `remainder-near`, which `decimal_gda` keeps). The remainder is exact when it fits, with preferred exponent $\\min(q_x, q_y)$, and its sign is that of $x$ when it is zero. $x \\operatorname{rem} 0$ and $\\infty \\operatorname{rem} y$ are invalid (so is $0 \\operatorname{rem} 0$); $x \\operatorname{rem} \\infty = x$."
msgstr "`remainder_ctx(x, y)` 为 $x - y\\cdot n$，其中 $n$ 是将 $x/y$ 就近舍入（偶数优先）得到的整数（IEEE 754 的 *remainder*；它的 GDA 名称是 `remainder-near`，由 `decimal_gda` 保留）。余数在可容纳时是精确的，首选指数为 $\\min(q_x, q_y)$；余数为零时其符号与 $x$ 相同。$x \\operatorname{rem} 0$ 与 $\\infty \\operatorname{rem} y$ 是无效的（$0 \\operatorname{rem} 0$ 也是）；$x \\operatorname{rem} \\infty = x$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1016
msgid "Quantum and exponent operations"
msgstr "量子与指数运算"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1020
msgid "`quantize_ctx` rounds a value to the exponent of another value."
msgstr "`quantize_ctx` 将值舍入到另一个值的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1026
msgid "`x.quantize_ctx(y, ctx)` returns the value of `x` with exponent $q_y$, rounding with the context's mode when digits are dropped (raising `inexact` if they were non-zero). The result is NaN with `invalid_operation` when the target exponent is outside $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$, when the resulting coefficient needs more than $p$ digits, when its adjusted exponent exceeds $e_{\\max}$, or when exactly one operand is infinite. Two infinities give the infinity of `x`. The quantum never silently changes to another value of the cohort range: if the result cannot have exponent $q_y$ the operation fails. The one exception is the fold-down: a target exponent in $(e_{\\max}-p+1,\\ e_{\\max}]$ is accepted and the result is then folded down to exponent $e_{\\max}-p+1$, like every other result (`1E+384` quantized to `1E+384` in decimal64 is `1.000000000000000E+384`)."
msgstr "`x.quantize_ctx(y, ctx)` 返回指数为 $q_y$ 的 `x` 的值，丢弃数字时以上下文的模式舍入（若丢弃的数字非零则引发 `inexact`）。当目标指数超出 $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$、结果系数需要多于 $p$ 位数字、其调整后指数超过 $e_{\\max}$，或恰有一个操作数为无穷时，结果为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。两个无穷产生 `x` 的无穷。量子从不悄然变为同值类范围内的另一个值：若结果无法具有指数 $q_y$，运算即失败。唯一的例外是折叠：位于 $(e_{\\max}-p+1,\\ e_{\\max}]$ 的目标指数会被接受，随后结果像其他所有结果一样被折叠到指数 $e_{\\max}-p+1$（在 decimal64 中，将 `1E+384` 量化到 `1E+384` 得到 `1.000000000000000E+384`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1056
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:395
msgid "`same_quantum` tests whether two values have the same exponent."
msgstr "`same_quantum` 检测两个值是否具有相同的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1062
msgid "Two finite values have the same quantum when their exponents are equal; two infinities, and two NaNs, always have the same quantum; any other pair does not. It never raises flags."
msgstr "两个有限值在指数相等时具有相同的量子；两个无穷、两个 NaN 总是具有相同的量子；其他任何组合都不具有。它从不引发标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1068
msgid "These functions round to an integer."
msgstr "这些函数舍入到整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1075
msgid "A finite value with exponent $\\ge 0$ is already an integer and is returned unchanged, even when it is longer than $p$ digits (the fold-down of the format still applies to its exponent). A value with negative exponent is quantized to exponent 0 with the context's rounding mode, at a working precision of $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$, so the integral part is never rounded to $p$ digits: at precision 3, `12345.6` gives `12346`. `to_integral_exact_ctx` reports `inexact` when non-zero digits are dropped; `to_integral_value_ctx` returns the same value with `inexact` cleared. Infinities are returned unchanged; NaNs are quieted."
msgstr "指数 $\\ge 0$ 的有限值本身已是整数，按原样返回，即使它长于 $p$ 位（格式的折叠仍适用于它的指数）。指数为负的值以上下文的舍入模式、以 $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$ 的工作精度量化到指数 0，因此整数部分从不被舍入到 $p$ 位：精度为 3 时，`12345.6` 得到 `12346`。丢弃非零数字时 `to_integral_exact_ctx` 报告 `inexact`；`to_integral_value_ctx` 返回相同的值，但清除 `inexact`。无穷原样返回；NaN 被静默化。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1085
msgid "IEEE 754 §5.9 defines roundToIntegral for an operand in the context's format (at most $p$ digits), and for such an operand these are its results. An operand longer than $p$ digits is not a value of the format, so §5.9 does not cover it and the result is implementation-defined. The behaviour described above for such operands (a longer integer unchanged, a longer fraction quantized at $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$ digits) is the package's chosen, GDA-style behaviour: General Decimal Arithmetic rounds to an integral value at the operand's own precision."
msgstr "IEEE 754 §5.9 为上下文格式内（至多 $p$ 位）的操作数定义 roundToIntegral，对这类操作数，上述结果就是它的结果。长于 $p$ 位的操作数不是该格式的值，§5.9 不涵盖它，其结果由实现定义。上文对这类操作数描述的行为（更长的整数原样返回，更长的小数以 $\\max(p, \\text{其位数})$ 位量化）是本包选定的 GDA 风格行为：通用十进制算术（General Decimal Arithmetic）以操作数自身的精度舍入为整数值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1096
msgid "These functions are IEEE 754-2019 convertToInteger (§5.4.1, §5.8): they round a decimal to a fixed-width integer in the context's rounding direction."
msgstr "这些函数是 IEEE 754-2019 的 convertToInteger（§5.4.1、§5.8）：按上下文的舍入方向把十进制数舍入为定宽整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1106
msgid "They have the shape of the `BinFloat` functions of the same names. The value is rounded to an integer with the `rounding` of the context: ties to even, toward zero, toward positive, toward negative and ties to away are the five directions of §5.8. A NaN (quiet or signaling), an infinity and a value outside the range of the integer type give `None` with `invalid_operation`; the result of a negative value that rounds to zero is `0` (also for the unsigned types), and any other negative value is out of range for them. With `exact=true` (convertToIntegerExact) `inexact` is raised when rounding changed the value; without it the flags of a valid conversion are empty. The context's precision and exponent range play no part: an integer of any number of digits that fits the type is converted exactly. The conversion never forms the power of ten of the exponent: `1E+999999` is out of range and `1E-999999` rounds to zero (or to one unit in an away direction) at once."
msgstr "它们的形状与同名的 `BinFloat` 函数相同。值按上下文的 `rounding` 舍入为整数：就近偶、向零、向正、向负和就近远离是 §5.8 的五个方向。NaN（安静或信号）、无穷以及超出整数类型范围的值给出 `None` 并带 `invalid_operation`；负值舍入为零的结果是 `0`（无符号类型也是），其他负值对无符号类型超出范围。带 `exact=true`（convertToIntegerExact）时，舍入改变了值就会引发 `inexact`；不带时，有效转换的标志为空。上下文的精度和指数范围不起作用：任意位数的整数只要能放进该类型，就被精确转换。转换从不构造指数对应的十的幂：`1E+999999` 立即判为超出范围，`1E-999999` 立即舍入为零（在远离方向则为一个单位）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1122
msgid "These functions scale by a power of ten and extract the adjusted exponent."
msgstr "这些函数按 10 的幂进行缩放，并提取调整后指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1129
msgid "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` returns $x \\cdot 10^{n}$ by adding $n$ to the exponent; $n$ must be a finite integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max}+p)$, otherwise the result is NaN with `invalid_operation` (IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 defines scaleB for integral counts only and leaves a non-integral second operand, an infinity included, to the language; the bound on $|n|$ is the GDA `scaleb` rule, where `BinFloat::scaleb_ctx` clamps a larger count instead). The scaled value is then rounded once like every other context result: a coefficient longer than $p$ digits is rounded to $p$ digits (`12345678901234567890` scaled by 0 in decimal64 is `1.234567890123457E+19` with `inexact`), a subnormal result is rounded to $E_{\\text{tiny}}$, overflow gives the rounding-mode-dependent result with `overflow` and `inexact` (in decimal64 with `TowardZero`, `9E+384` scaled by 1 is `9.999999999999999E+384`), and large exponents are folded down. A zero keeps its sign and has its exponent clamped into the range: `0` scaled by 700 in decimal64 is `0E+369`."
msgstr "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` 通过将 $n$ 加到指数上返回 $x \\cdot 10^{n}$；$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max}+p)$ 的有限整数，否则结果为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN（IEEE 754-2019 5.3.3 只对整数计数定义 scaleB，非整数的第二操作数，包括无穷，留给语言处理；$|n|$ 的上界是 GDA `scaleb` 的规则，而 `BinFloat::scaleb_ctx` 对更大的计数是截断）。缩放后的值随后像其他所有上下文结果一样只舍入一次：长于 $p$ 位的系数被舍入到 $p$ 位（在 decimal64 中，`12345678901234567890` 缩放 0 得到带 `inexact` 的 `1.234567890123457E+19`），次正规结果被舍入到 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$，上溢得到依赖于舍入模式的结果并带 `overflow` 和 `inexact`（在 decimal64 中使用 `TowardZero` 时，`9E+384` 缩放 1 得到 `9.999999999999999E+384`），大指数被折叠下来。零保留其符号，其指数被钳制到范围内：在 decimal64 中，`0` 缩放 700 得到 `0E+369`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1160
msgid "`logb_ctx(x)` returns the adjusted exponent $\\lfloor\\log_{10}|x|\\rfloor$ as an integer `Decimal`; $\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` and $\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$."
msgstr "`logb_ctx(x)` 以整数 `Decimal` 的形式返回调整后指数 $\\lfloor\\log_{10}|x|\\rfloor$；$\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，$\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1164
msgid "Adjacent values"
msgstr "相邻值"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1168
msgid "These functions return the neighbouring representable values."
msgstr "这些函数返回相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1176
msgid "`next_up_ctx` is the smallest representable value greater than `x` in the context and `next_down_ctx` the largest smaller one, including subnormals down to $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ and the largest finite value $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$; `next_up_ctx(-∞)` is the most negative finite value. They raise no flags for finite results. `next_toward_ctx(x, y)` moves `x` one step toward `y`; when $x = y$ it returns `x` with the sign of `y` for zeros. A step of `next_toward_ctx` that ends in an infinity raises `overflow` and `inexact`; one that ends subnormal or zero raises `underflow` and `inexact`."
msgstr "`next_up_ctx` 是上下文中大于 `x` 的最小可表示值，`next_down_ctx` 是比它小的最大可表示值，范围包括低至 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ 的次正规数以及最大有限值 $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$；`next_up_ctx(-∞)` 是最小（最负）的有限值。对有限结果，它们不引发任何标志。`next_toward_ctx(x, y)` 将 `x` 朝 `y` 移动一步；当 $x = y$ 时返回 `x`，对零则取 `y` 的符号。`next_toward_ctx` 的一步若落到无穷，则引发 `overflow` 和 `inexact`；若落到次正规数或零，则引发 `underflow` 和 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1200
msgid "`compare` is the numeric three-way comparison used by `Compare`, `==` and the comparison operators."
msgstr "`compare` 是 `Compare`、`==` 及比较运算符所使用的数值三路比较。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1207
msgid "`compare` returns $-1$, 0 or 1 by numeric value, with $-0 = +0$ and all members of a cohort equal. NaN has no numeric order, so that `Compare` stays a total preorder (sorting never aborts) every NaN compares equal to every other NaN and greater than every non-NaN. `equal` (`==`) agrees with `compare`: NaN `==` NaN is `true`. This is *not* IEEE equality; use [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked), `compare_quiet` or the predicates when NaN must be unordered. The operator methods are listed under [trait implementations](#eq-and-compare-decimalequal-not_equal-op_lt-op_le-op_gt-op_ge)."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值返回 $-1$、0 或 1，其中 $-0 = +0$，同值类的所有成员相等。NaN 没有数值顺序，为使 `Compare` 保持全预序（排序永不中止），每个 NaN 与其他任何 NaN 比较相等，且大于所有非 NaN。`equal`（`==`）与 `compare` 一致：NaN `==` NaN 为 `true`。这*不是* IEEE 相等；当 NaN 必须无序时，请使用 [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)、`compare_quiet` 或这些谓词。运算符方法列在 [trait 实现](#eq-and-compare-decimalequal-not_equal-op_lt-op_le-op_gt-op_ge)下。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1231
msgid "`compare_checked` is the IEEE numeric comparison with NaN as an error."
msgstr "`compare_checked` 是将 NaN 视为错误的 IEEE 数值比较。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1237
msgid "It returns `Ok(compare(x, y))` when neither operand is a NaN and `Err(unordered_comparison)` otherwise. It is the `CompareChecked` implementation."
msgstr "当两个操作数都不是 NaN 时，它返回 `Ok(compare(x, y))`，否则返回 `Err(unordered_comparison)`。它是 `CompareChecked` 的实现。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1243
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 5.11 comparison as a four-valued relation with flags."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 5.11 的比较，结果是带标志的四值关系。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1250
msgid "The relation is `Less`, `Equal`, `Greater` or `Unordered` (some operand is a NaN), with $-0 = +0$ and all members of a cohort equal. The quiet form raises `invalid_operation` only for a signaling NaN; the signaling form raises it for every unordered comparison. These are the functions of `BinFloat`; they replace `compare_ctx` and `compare_signal_ctx`, which returned the `Decimal` $-1$, 0, 1 or a NaN, a General Decimal Arithmetic result and not an IEEE one."
msgstr "关系为 `Less`、`Equal`、`Greater` 或 `Unordered`（某个操作数是 NaN），其中 $-0 = +0$，同值类的所有成员相等。quiet 形式仅对 signaling NaN 触发 `invalid_operation`；signaling 形式对每个无序比较都触发。这些是 `BinFloat` 所具有的函数；它们取代 `compare_ctx` 和 `compare_signal_ctx`——后者返回 `Decimal` 的 $-1$、0、1 或 NaN，那是 General Decimal Arithmetic 的结果而非 IEEE 的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1257
msgid "`Decimal::compare_quiet_equal` and the other comparison predicates"
msgstr "`Decimal::compare_quiet_equal` 及其他比较谓词"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1259
msgid "The predicates of IEEE 754-2019 Tables 5.1 and 5.2 that `BinFloat` has."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 表 5.1 和表 5.2 中 `BinFloat` 具有的谓词。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1271
msgid "Each is defined from `compare_quiet` or `compare_signaling` and returns its flags; every predicate except `compare_quiet_unordered` is false on an unordered pair."
msgstr "每个谓词都由 `compare_quiet` 或 `compare_signaling` 定义并返回其标志；除 `compare_quiet_unordered` 外，每个谓词在无序对上都为 false。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1275
msgid "`Decimal::compare_quiet_not_equal` and the other comparison predicates of Tables 5.1 and 5.2"
msgstr "`Decimal::compare_quiet_not_equal` 及表 5.1 和表 5.2 的其他比较谓词"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1336
msgid "These functions implement the IEEE 754-2019 §5.10 `totalOrder` and `totalOrderMag` predicates, and the same order as a three-way comparison."
msgstr "这些函数实现 IEEE 754-2019 §5.10 的 `totalOrder` 和 `totalOrderMag` 谓词，以及同一顺序的三路比较形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1345
msgid "`total_order(x, y)` is `true` when `x` is ordered at or before `y`, and `total_order_compare(x, y)` is `-1`, `0` or `1` for the same order. The order covers every representation:"
msgstr "当 `x` 排在 `y` 之前或与之相同时，`total_order(x, y)` 为 `true`；`total_order_compare(x, y)` 对同一顺序返回 `-1`、`0` 或 `1`。该顺序覆盖每一种表示："

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1354
msgid "Equal finite values are ordered by exponent: for positive values the smaller exponent comes first ($1.00 < 1.0$), for negative values the larger. NaNs of the same sign and kind are ordered by payload (reversed for negative NaNs). `total_order_compare` returns 0 only for identical representations. `total_order_mag(x, y)` is `total_order` of the absolute values. None of them takes a context, rounds or raises a flag."
msgstr "数值相等的有限值按指数排序：对于正值，指数较小者在前（$1.00 < 1.0$），对于负值则指数较大者在前。符号和种类相同的 NaN 按载荷排序（负 NaN 则反过来）。`total_order_compare` 仅对相同的表示返回 0。`total_order_mag(x, y)` 是对绝对值做 `total_order`。它们都不接受上下文、不舍入、也不引发标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1363
msgid "`identical` tests that two values are the same datum."
msgstr "`identical` 判断两个值是否为同一个数据。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1369
msgid "`x.identical(y)` is true when the class, sign, signaling bit, coefficient (the payload of a NaN), exponent and precision label are all equal. It is finer than `==`, which compares values (`1.20 == 1.2`), and than `total_order_compare`, which ignores the precision label: `1.20` and `1.2` are not identical, a zero and its negative are not identical, and two NaNs that differ in payload are not identical."
msgstr "`x.identical(y)` 在类别、符号、信号位、系数（NaN 的载荷）、指数和精度标记全部相等时为真。它比 `==`（比较值，`1.20 == 1.2`）更细，也比忽略精度标记的 `total_order_compare` 更细：`1.20` 与 `1.2` 不相同，零与其负零不相同，载荷不同的两个 NaN 不相同。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1388
msgid "These functions select by numeric order without a context."
msgstr "这些函数在无上下文的情况下按数值顺序进行选择。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1397
msgid "`min` and `max` return the other operand when exactly one is a quiet NaN, a quiet NaN when both are NaNs or either is signaling, and the receiver on ties. `clamp` returns `min` below the range, `max` above it, and the value (including a NaN) otherwise; it aborts when a bound is NaN or `min > max`. `clamp_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)` in those cases."
msgstr "当恰有一个操作数是静默 NaN 时，`min` 和 `max` 返回另一个操作数；当两者都是 NaN 或任一为信号 NaN 时，返回静默 NaN；相等时返回接收者。`clamp` 在低于范围时返回 `min`，高于范围时返回 `max`，否则返回该值（包括 NaN）；当某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时中止。`clamp_checked` 在这些情形下返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1405
msgid "These eight functions are the IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 minimum and maximum operations. The General Decimal Arithmetic `min`, `max`, `min-magnitude` and `max-magnitude` are in `decimal_gda`."
msgstr "这八个函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 的最小值与最大值运算。General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `min`、`max`、`min-magnitude` 和 `max-magnitude` 在 `decimal_gda` 中。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1420
msgid "`minimum_ctx` and `maximum_ctx` propagate NaN: any NaN operand gives a quiet NaN. The `_number_` variants return the number when exactly one operand is a NaN. In both, a signaling NaN raises `invalid_operation`. The magnitude variants compare $|x|$ and $|y|$ and fall back to the signed order on equal magnitudes. Ties are broken by `total_order_compare`, so $-0 < +0$. The selected value is rounded to the context."
msgstr "`minimum_ctx` 和 `maximum_ctx` 传播 NaN：任何 NaN 操作数都产生静默 NaN。`_number_` 变体在恰有一个操作数为 NaN 时返回数值。在这两种情形下，信号 NaN 都会引发 `invalid_operation`。按大小比较的变体比较 $|x|$ 与 $|y|$，大小相等时退回到带符号的顺序。相等时由 `total_order_compare` 决定，因此 $-0 < +0$。所选的值被舍入到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1429
msgid "Every elementary function exists in two forms. `f_ctx(x, ctx)` returns `(result, flags)`. `try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` returns the same pair in `Ok`, or `Err` with an `ArithmeticError` whose `certification_failure_detail()` names the operation, the target precision and the exhausted refinement budget when the result could not be certified. When certification fails, `f_ctx` returns NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "每个初等函数都有两种形式。`f_ctx(x, ctx)` 返回 `(result, flags)`。`try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` 在 `Ok` 中返回同样的二元组；当结果无法认证时返回 `Err`，其中的 `ArithmeticError` 的 `certification_failure_detail()` 给出运算名称、目标精度以及已耗尽的细化预算。认证失败时，`f_ctx` 返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1436
msgid "Transcendental results are **certified**: the implementation evaluates a guaranteed enclosure of $f(x)$ in [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) and accepts it only when both endpoints round to the same `Decimal` with the same flags (see the [design](../design/decimal.md#certified-elementary-functions)). Because rounding is monotone, an accepted result is the rounding of $f(x)$ in every `DecimalRoundingMode`. A list of exact cases (such as $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$, $e^0 = 1$, $\\sin 0 = 0$, $\\operatorname{cospi}(1) = -1$, $\\operatorname{tanpi}(0.25) = 1$, $\\operatorname{acos}(1) = 0$, $x^{0.5}$, exact roots such as `rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` $= 0.2$, exact norms such as `hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` $= 0.5$) is decided before the enclosure loop and returned without `inexact`, and an exact binary result such as `pow_ctx(4, 1.5)` $= 8$ is returned exactly by the enclosure itself. Integer powers are not certified: [`pow_ctx`](#decimalpow_ctx-pown_ctx-rootn_ctx-hypot_ctx-try_pow_ctx-try_pown_ctx-try_rootn_ctx-try_hypot_ctx) rounds them once from the exact power or from refined directed bounds."
msgstr "超越函数的结果是**经过认证**的：实现会在 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 中计算 $f(x)$ 的一个有保证的包络，仅当两个端点以相同标志舍入到同一个 `Decimal` 时才接受它（参见[设计](../design/decimal.md#certified-elementary-functions)）。由于舍入是单调的，被接受的结果在每种 `DecimalRoundingMode` 下都是 $f(x)$ 的舍入。一系列精确情形（例如 $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$、$e^0 = 1$、$\\sin 0 = 0$、$\\operatorname{cospi}(1) = -1$、$\\operatorname{tanpi}(0.25) = 1$、$\\operatorname{acos}(1) = 0$、$x^{0.5}$、精确的根如 `rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` $= 0.2$、精确的范数如 `hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` $= 0.5$）会在包络循环之前判定，并以不带 `inexact` 的形式返回；而像 `pow_ctx(4, 1.5)` $= 8$ 这样的精确二进制结果则由包络本身精确返回。整数次幂不经过认证：[`pow_ctx`](#decimalpow_ctx-pown_ctx-rootn_ctx-hypot_ctx-try_pow_ctx-try_pown_ctx-try_rootn_ctx-try_hypot_ctx) 从精确幂或细化后的定向界出发，对其只舍入一次。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1452
msgid "[!NOTE] **Exact non-integral powers.** A power whose exact value is a representable decimal but not a binary fraction is decided in decimal before the loop, so in decimal64 `pow_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` is `0.2`, `pow_ctx(32, 0.2)` is `2` and `pow_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` is `0.008`, all without `inexact` and in every rounding mode. The exponent is reduced to $p/q$ in lowest terms — a decimal exponent is $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$, so $q$ keeps only the twos and fives the coefficient cannot cancel — and the power is exact exactly when $x$ itself is a perfect $q$-th power. The root is taken first and then raised to $p$, so the test never handles a number longer than the result. It finds every exact result of at most `precision + 1` digits, the only ones that sit on a rounding boundary; a longer exact value lies inside its rounding cell and the enclosure rounds it like any other."
msgstr "[!NOTE] **精确的非整数次幂。** 精确值是可表示的十进制数但不是二进分数的幂，会在循环之前在十进制中判定，因此在 decimal64 下 `pow_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` 为 `0.2`、`pow_ctx(32, 0.2)` 为 `2`、`pow_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` 为 `0.008`，全都不带 `inexact`，且在每种舍入模式下都如此。指数被约化为最简形式 $p/q$——十进制指数为 $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$，因此 $q$ 只保留系数无法约掉的 2 和 5——而该幂精确的充要条件是 $x$ 本身为完全 $q$ 次幂。代码先开根，再把根升到 $p$ 次，因此检验处理的数从不比结果更长。它能找出所有至多 `precision + 1` 位的精确结果，而只有这些结果会落在舍入边界上；更长的精确值位于其舍入单元内部，包络会像对待其他值一样舍入它。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1466
msgid "These operations return NaN with `not_computed` (and the `try_` forms `Err`, of the certification-failure kind) when $p > 999\\,999$, $e_{\\max} > 999\\,999$ or $e_{\\min} < -999\\,999$, or when a finite operand has more than 999,999 digits or an adjusted exponent beyond about $\\pm 10^6$. In such a context every operand is `not_computed`, the special ones (NaN, infinities, zero) included, although IEEE 754-2019 defines those results (the order of the checks is that of the implementation; lifting it is the subject of #478). Only `pow_ctx` and `pown_ctx` handle their IEEE power cases before this restricted-context check. For example, `pow_ctx(1, 1.1)` is exactly `1` even in a restricted context, while `ln_ctx(1)` and `exp_ctx(-inf)` still return `not_computed`. Integral powers in `decimal` support counts through 999,999,999 for positive exponents and -1,999,999,997 for negative exponents; these are adopted decNumber implementation limits, not limits imposed by GDA 1.70. Integer powers above those counts use bounded square-and-multiply when the exact exponent coefficient has at most 4,096 decimal digits. Larger coefficients return NaN with `invalid_operation` before expansion. Thus `pow_ctx(2, 1E+9)` is finite under `DecimalContext::new()`, while `pow_ctx(2, 1E+9999999)` is rejected within the fixed work bound. The same large input to `decimal_gda` still follows the GDA adapter's decNumber count limit and returns `invalid_operation`; IEEE `decimal` and `decimal_gda` therefore intentionally differ on this input. Non-integral powers such as `pow_ctx(2, 1.5)` and `exp2_ctx(2)` remain subject to the elementary-function context limits."
msgstr "这些运算在以下情况下返回带 `not_computed` 的 NaN（`try_` 形式返回认证失败一类的 `Err`）：$p > 999\\,999$、$e_{\\max} > 999\\,999$ 或 $e_{\\min} < -999\\,999$，或者有限操作数超过 999,999 位数字，或调整后指数超出约 $\\pm 10^6$。在这样的上下文中，每个操作数（包括 NaN、无穷和零等特殊操作数）都是 `not_computed`，尽管 IEEE 754-2019 定义了这些结果（检查的顺序是实现的顺序；改变它是 #478 的内容）。只有 `pow_ctx` 和 `pown_ctx` 会在受限上下文检查之前处理 IEEE 定义的幂特殊情况。例如，在受限上下文中，`pow_ctx(1, 1.1)` 仍精确为 `1`，而 `ln_ctx(1)` 和 `exp_ctx(-inf)` 仍返回 `not_computed`。`decimal` 的整数幂支持正指数 999,999,999 和负指数 -1,999,999,997；这些是采用的 decNumber 实现限制，不是 GDA 1.70 的限制。超过这些计数的整数幂在精确指数系数不超过 4,096 位时使用有界平方乘法。更大的系数在展开前返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。因此 `pow_ctx(2, 1E+9)` 在 `DecimalContext::new()` 下为有限值，而 `pow_ctx(2, 1E+9999999)` 在固定工作量上限内被拒绝。同样的大输入在 `decimal_gda` 中仍遵循 GDA 适配器的 decNumber 计数限制并返回 `invalid_operation`；IEEE `decimal` 与 `decimal_gda` 在此输入上的行为有意不同。`pow_ctx(2, 1.5)` 和 `exp2_ctx(2)` 等非整数幂仍受初等函数上下文限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1491
msgid "These functions are the General Decimal Arithmetic exponential and logarithms."
msgstr "这些函数是 General Decimal Arithmetic 的指数函数与对数函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1503
msgid "$e^{\\pm 0} = 1$, $e^{+\\infty}=+\\infty$, $e^{-\\infty} = +0$. $\\ln$ and $\\log_{10}$ of $\\pm 0$ are $-\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, as IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 requires and as `log2_ctx`, `log1p_ctx` and `logb_ctx` do (General Decimal Arithmetic, which [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) follows, raises no condition here); of $+\\infty$ are $+\\infty$, of a negative value or $-\\infty$ are NaN with `invalid_operation`; $\\ln 1 = 0$, and $\\log_{10}$ of a power of ten is the exact integer exponent. Arguments so large or small that $e^x$ certainly overflows or underflows are decided without evaluation."
msgstr "$e^{\\pm 0} = 1$，$e^{+\\infty}=+\\infty$，$e^{-\\infty} = +0$。$\\pm 0$ 的 $\\ln$ 和 $\\log_{10}$ 为 $-\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，这是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 的要求，与 `log2_ctx`、`log1p_ctx` 和 `logb_ctx` 的行为一致（[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 所遵循的 General Decimal Arithmetic 在此不引发任何条件）；$+\\infty$ 的为 $+\\infty$，负值或 $-\\infty$ 的为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$\\ln 1 = 0$，10 的幂的 $\\log_{10}$ 为精确的整数指数。对于大到或小到 $e^x$ 必然上溢或下溢的参数，无需求值即可判定。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1514
msgid "These functions compute powers, roots and the Euclidean norm."
msgstr "这些函数计算幂、方根和欧几里得范数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1527
msgid "`pow_ctx(x, y)` is the IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 power operation. A signaling NaN operand is quieted and raises `invalid_operation`; this takes precedence over the identities below. Otherwise $x^{\\pm 0}=1$, including for zero, infinity, and quiet NaN, and $\\operatorname{pow}(+1,y)=1$ for every $y$ (including quiet NaN). Also $\\operatorname{pow}(-1,\\pm\\infty)=1$. An infinite exponent classifies the magnitude of any other base: $|x|<1$ tends to zero for $+\\infty$ and infinity for $-\\infty$, while $|x|>1$ does the reverse; the sign of a negative base does not make these cases invalid."
msgstr "`pow_ctx(x, y)` 遵循 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的幂运算。`signaling NaN` 操作数会先静默化并设置 `invalid_operation`，优先于下面的恒等式。否则，$x^{\\pm 0}=1$，包括零、无穷和 quiet NaN；`pow(+1, y)` 对任意 $y$（包括 quiet NaN）都为 `1`。此外，`pow(-1, ±inf)=1`。无穷指数按其他底数的绝对值分类：$|x|<1$ 时，指数为 $+\\infty$ 趋向零、为 $-\\infty$ 趋向无穷；$|x|>1$ 时相反；负底数的符号不会使这些情况无效。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1536
msgid "For a zero base and a negative integer exponent, the result is the signed infinity selected by the zero sign and exponent parity, with `division_by_zero`: for example, $(-0)^{-1}=-\\infty$ and $(-0)^{-2}=+\\infty$. Positive integer powers preserve the zero sign by parity: $(-0)^3=-0$ and $(-0)^2=+0$. Zero raised to a negative non-integer exponent is positive infinity with `division_by_zero`."
msgstr "对于零底数和负整数指数，结果是由零的符号和指数奇偶性决定的带符号无穷，并引发 `division_by_zero`；例如 $(-0)^{-1}=-\\infty$，$(-0)^{-2}=+\\infty$。正整数幂按奇偶性保留零的符号：$(-0)^3=-0$、$(-0)^2=+0$。零底数的负非整数幂是带 `division_by_zero` 的正无穷。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1542
msgid "Integer powers within the bounded count use binary square-and-multiply. An exact power is returned when it fits in $p$ digits; otherwise the result is correctly rounded. An integral exponent outside the bounded count is still supported: the magnitude is certified, and an odd power of a negative base swaps the directed rounding modes before restoring its sign. For large integer exponents the zero and infinity cases are decided from sign and parity without expanding the exponent: for example, `pown_ctx(-0, Int::max_value())` is `-0`, `pown_ctx(-0, Int::min_value())` is `+infinity` with `division_by_zero`, and `pown_ctx(-infinity, Int::min_value())` is `+0`."
msgstr "有界计数范围内的整数幂使用二进制平方-乘法。结果能容纳于 $p$ 位数字时返回精确幂，否则返回正确舍入的结果。超出有界计数的整数指数仍受支持：实现会认证其绝对值幂；负底数的奇数幂会先交换两种定向舍入模式，再恢复符号。对于很大的整数指数，零和无穷情况根据符号与奇偶性决定，不展开指数；例如，`pown_ctx(-0, Int::max_value())` 为 `-0`，`pown_ctx(-0, Int::min_value())` 为带 `division_by_zero` 的 `+infinity`，`pown_ctx(-infinity, Int::min_value())` 为 `+0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1553
msgid ""
"For other integral exponents, an exact power is returned when it fits in $p$ digits and otherwise the correctly rounded power (in decimal32, `pow_ctx(3.339434, 3)` is `37.24077`; the exact cube is $37.240765000\\ldots$); $x^{0.5}$ is `sqrt_ctx`; positive non-integer powers are certified and negative bases with a finite non-integer exponent are invalid. These IEEE rules intentionally differ from [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md), which follows General Decimal Arithmetic (including its `0^0` invalid result and the `powx2015` rounded `1.00` vector). `pown_ctx(x, n)` converts the integer `n` exactly, so $(-1)^{12345679}=-1$ at any precision. `rootn_ctx(x, n)` is $x^{1/n}$ for integer $n \\n"
"e 0$; an even root of a negative value and $n=0$ are invalid, and $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n<0)$ is an infinity with `division_by_zero`; an exactly representable root is returned exactly (`rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` is `0.2` with no flag). `hypot_ctx(x, y)` is $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$; it is $+\\infty$ if either operand is infinite, even if the other is a quiet NaN, and an exactly representable norm, or $|x|$ when $y$ is zero, is returned exactly (`hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` is `0.5`)."
msgstr ""
"对于其他整数指数，结果能容纳于 $p$ 位数字时返回精确幂，否则返回正确舍入的幂（decimal32 中，`pow_ctx(3.339434, 3)` 为 `37.24077`；精确立方为 $37.240765000\\ldots$）；$x^{0.5}$ 是 `sqrt_ctx`；正的非整数幂经过认证，有限非整数指数下的负底数无效。这些 IEEE 规则有意不同于 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)，后者遵循 General Decimal Arithmetic（包括无效的 `0^0` 结果和舍入为 `1.00` 的 `powx2015` 向量）。`pown_ctx(x, n)` 将整数 `n` 精确转换，因此 $(-1)^{12345679}=-1$，与精度无关。`rootn_ctx(x, n)` 是整数 $n \\n"
"e 0$ 的 $x^{1/n}$；负值的偶数次根和 $n=0$ 无效，$\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n<0)$ 是带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷；可精确表示的根会精确返回（`rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` 为 `0.2`，无标志）。`hypot_ctx(x, y)` 是 $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$；任一操作数为无穷时结果为 $+\\infty$，即使另一操作数是静默 NaN；可精确表示的范数，或 $y$ 为零时的 $|x|$，会精确返回（`hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` 为 `0.5`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1571
msgid "An integral exponent with more than 4,096 digits is never expanded: for a base other than $\\pm 1$, $\\pm 0$ and $\\pm\\infty$ the magnitude $|y \\ln |x||$ is far beyond any context, so the result is the overflow or the underflow value of the rounding direction (decided from the base being above or below 1 and the sign of the exponent) and the sign follows the parity, not an `invalid_operation`. A base with more than about 4,000 fractional digits, whose bound is not met, still returns NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "位数超过 4,096 的整数指数绝不会被展开：对于 $\\pm 1$、$\\pm 0$ 和 $\\pm\\infty$ 以外的底数，$|y \\ln |x||$ 远超任何上下文，因此结果是按舍入方向给出的上溢或下溢值（由底数大于还是小于 1 以及指数的符号决定），符号由奇偶性决定，而不是 `invalid_operation`。小数位超过约 4,000 位、不满足该界的底数仍返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1579
msgid "An exact result is delivered in the cohort member whose exponent is closest to the preferred exponent of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.2, $\\lfloor y\\,q_x \\rfloor$ for `pow_ctx(x, y)` and $\\lfloor n\\,q_x \\rfloor$ for `pown_ctx(x, n)`, where $q_x$ is the exponent of the stored `x` and the member must fit in $p$ digits: in decimal64 `pown_ctx(1.00, 2)` is `1.0000`, `pown_ctx(-1.0, 3)` is `-1.000`, `pown_ctx(-1E+5, 5)` is `-1E+25` (exact, no flags), `pow_ctx(1.00, 1.5)` is `1.000` and `pow_ctx(4.00, 1.5)` is `8.000`; a negative exponent cannot reach a preferred exponent above the value (`pown_ctx(1.00, -2)` is `1`). The standard defines no preferred exponent when $y$ is infinite or a NaN, so `pow_ctx(1.00, Infinity)` stays `1`. `decimal_gda` follows the repeated multiplication exponent of General Decimal Arithmetic instead."
msgstr "精确结果以其指数最接近 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.2 首选指数的同值类成员给出：`pow_ctx(x, y)` 为 $\\lfloor y\\,q_x \\rfloor$，`pown_ctx(x, n)` 为 $\\lfloor n\\,q_x \\rfloor$，其中 $q_x$ 是所存储的 `x` 的指数，且该成员必须能容纳于 $p$ 位：在 decimal64 中，`pown_ctx(1.00, 2)` 为 `1.0000`，`pown_ctx(-1.0, 3)` 为 `-1.000`，`pown_ctx(-1E+5, 5)` 为 `-1E+25`（精确，无标志），`pow_ctx(1.00, 1.5)` 为 `1.000`，`pow_ctx(4.00, 1.5)` 为 `8.000`；负指数无法达到高于该值的首选指数（`pown_ctx(1.00, -2)` 为 `1`）。当 $y$ 为无穷或 NaN 时，标准没有定义首选指数，因此 `pow_ctx(1.00, Infinity)` 仍为 `1`。`decimal_gda` 则遵循 General Decimal Arithmetic 的重复乘法指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1593
msgid "These functions are the IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 exponentials and logarithms in bases 2 and 10 and near zero. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 中以 2 和 10 为底以及在零附近的指数函数与对数函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1611
msgid "These functions are $2^x - 1$, $10^x - 1$, $\\log_2(1 + x)$ and $\\log_{10}(1 + x)$ of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2, without the cancellation of `exp2(x) - 1` or the rounding of `1 + x` near zero. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的 $2^x - 1$、$10^x - 1$、$\\log_2(1 + x)$ 与 $\\log_{10}(1 + x)$，在零附近没有 `exp2(x) - 1` 的相消，也没有对 `1 + x` 的舍入。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1627
msgid "The special values are those of §9.2.1: $f(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ and $f(+\\infty) = +\\infty$ for all four, $-\\infty \\mapsto -1$ for `exp2m1` and `exp10m1`, and $-1 \\mapsto -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` for `log2p1` and `log10p1`, whose domain is $[-1, +\\infty]$ ($x < -1$, including $-\\infty$, is invalid). The exact results are $2^n - 1$ and $10^n - 1$ for an integer $n$ and the integer $k$ when $1 + x = 2^k$ (resp. $10^k$); they take the preferred exponent 0 of §9.2.2, so in decimal64 `exp2m1_ctx(4)` is `15`, `exp2m1_ctx(-1)` is `-0.5`, `exp10m1_ctx(-2.0)` is `-0.99` and `log2p1_ctx(-0.50)` is `-1`, all without flags. A context that cannot hold an exact value rounds it with its flags: `log2p1_ctx(32767)` at precision 1 is `2E+1` (a midpoint, `inexact`). $\\operatorname{log2p1}(1) = 1$ exactly and $\\operatorname{log10p1}(1) = \\log_{10} 2$; the rule $f(1) = +0$ of §9.2.1 belongs to `log`, `log2` and `log10` only. Results below the subnormal range are rounded, never replaced, so they keep the sign of $x$ (`exp2m1_ctx(-1E-500)` is `-0E-398` in decimal64, `-1E-398` when rounding toward $-\\infty$), and the same restricted contexts as `exp_ctx` give `not_computed`."
msgstr "特殊值遵循 §9.2.1：四个函数都有 $f(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$ 与 $f(+\\infty) = +\\infty$；`exp2m1` 与 `exp10m1` 把 $-\\infty$ 映为 $-1$；`log2p1` 与 `log10p1` 把 $-1$ 映为 $-\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，它们的定义域是 $[-1, +\\infty]$（$x < -1$，包括 $-\\infty$，为无效操作）。精确结果是整数 $n$ 处的 $2^n - 1$ 与 $10^n - 1$，以及 $1 + x = 2^k$（相应地 $10^k$）时的整数 $k$；它们取 §9.2.2 的首选指数 0，因此在 decimal64 中 `exp2m1_ctx(4)` 为 `15`，`exp2m1_ctx(-1)` 为 `-0.5`，`exp10m1_ctx(-2.0)` 为 `-0.99`，`log2p1_ctx(-0.50)` 为 `-1`，都不带标志。上下文容纳不下的精确值会连同其标志一起被舍入：精度 1 时 `log2p1_ctx(32767)` 为 `2E+1`（中点，`inexact`）。$\\operatorname{log2p1}(1) = 1$ 是精确的，而 $\\operatorname{log10p1}(1) = \\log_{10} 2$；§9.2.1 中 $f(1) = +0$ 的规则只属于 `log`、`log2` 与 `log10`。低于次正规范围的结果是被舍入而不是被替换，因此保留 $x$ 的符号（在 decimal64 中 `exp2m1_ctx(-1E-500)` 为 `-0E-398`，向 $-\\infty$ 舍入时为 `-1E-398`）；与 `exp_ctx` 相同的受限上下文给出 `not_computed`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1662
msgid "These functions are $1/\\sqrt{x}$, $(1 + x)^n$ for an `Int32` $n$ and $x^y = e^{y \\ln x}$ of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的 $1/\\sqrt{x}$、对 `Int32` 整数 $n$ 的 $(1 + x)^n$，以及 $x^y = e^{y \\ln x}$。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1675
msgid "`rsqrt_ctx` has domain $[0, +\\infty]$: $x < 0$ (including $-\\infty$) is invalid, $\\pm 0 \\mapsto \\pm\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` and $+\\infty \\mapsto +0$ (§9.2.1). It is exact when $x = 2^{2i}5^{2j}$; the result then takes the preferred exponent $-\\lfloor Q(x)/2 \\rfloor$ of §9.2.2, so in decimal64 `rsqrt_ctx(4.00)` is `0.5`, `rsqrt_ctx(1E+2)` is `0.1` and `rsqrt_ctx(1E-400)` is `1E+200`."
msgstr "`rsqrt_ctx` 的定义域是 $[0, +\\infty]$：$x < 0$（包括 $-\\infty$）为无效操作，$\\pm 0 \\mapsto \\pm\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，$+\\infty \\mapsto +0$（§9.2.1）。当 $x = 2^{2i}5^{2j}$ 时结果是精确的，此时取 §9.2.2 的首选指数 $-\\lfloor Q(x)/2 \\rfloor$，因此在 decimal64 中 `rsqrt_ctx(4.00)` 为 `0.5`，`rsqrt_ctx(1E+2)` 为 `0.1`，`rsqrt_ctx(1E-400)` 为 `1E+200`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1682
msgid "`compound_ctx(x, n)` follows the list of §9.2.1: `compound(x, 0)` is 1 for $x \\ge -1$ and for a quiet NaN, $x < -1$ (also with $n = 0$) is invalid, `compound(-1, n)` is $+\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` for $n < 0$ and $+0$ for $n > 0$, `compound(±0, n)` is 1 and `compound(+∞, n)` is $+\\infty$ or $+0$. An exact result takes the preferred exponent $\\lfloor n \\min(0, Q(x)) \\rfloor$: `compound_ctx(0.10, 2)` is `1.2100` and `compound_ctx(0.00, 3)` is `1.000000`. Every $n$ of `Int32` is accepted, also the `Int32` minimum $-2^{31}$."
msgstr "`compound_ctx(x, n)` 遵循 §9.2.1 的列表：对 $x \\ge -1$ 和静默 NaN，`compound(x, 0)` 为 1；$x < -1$（$n = 0$ 时也一样）为无效操作；`compound(-1, n)` 在 $n < 0$ 时为 $+\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，在 $n > 0$ 时为 $+0$；`compound(±0, n)` 为 1；`compound(+∞, n)` 为 $+\\infty$ 或 $+0$。精确结果取首选指数 $\\lfloor n \\min(0, Q(x)) \\rfloor$：`compound_ctx(0.10, 2)` 为 `1.2100`，`compound_ctx(0.00, 3)` 为 `1.000000`。接受 `Int32` 的每个 $n$，包括 `Int32` 的最小值 $-2^{31}$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1691
msgid "`powr_ctx(x, y)` is $e^{y \\ln x}$, so its domain excludes $x < 0$ (invalid, also when $y$ is a quiet NaN). It returns a quiet NaN for a NaN operand even when $y = \\pm 0$, is invalid for `powr(±0, ±0)`, `powr(+∞, ±0)` and `powr(1, ±∞)`, and otherwise equals `pow_ctx` on $|x|$ (results, cohort and flags): `powr_ctx(-0, 3)` is `0` where `pow_ctx` gives `-0`."
msgstr "`powr_ctx(x, y)` 是 $e^{y \\ln x}$，因此其定义域不含 $x < 0$（无效操作，$y$ 为静默 NaN 时也一样）。操作数为 NaN 时即使 $y = \\pm 0$ 也返回静默 NaN；`powr(±0, ±0)`、`powr(+∞, ±0)` 与 `powr(1, ±∞)` 为无效操作；其余情形与 $|x|$ 上的 `pow_ctx` 相同（结果、同值类与标志）：`powr_ctx(-0, 3)` 为 `0`，而 `pow_ctx` 给出 `-0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1715
msgid "These functions are the trigonometric functions of $x$ and of $\\pi x$. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 $x$ 和 $\\pi x$ 的三角函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1735
msgid "These functions are the inverse trigonometric functions; `atan2(y, x)` is the angle of the point $(x, y)$. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是反三角函数；`atan2(y, x)` 是点 $(x, y)$ 的辐角。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1751
msgid "These functions are the inverse circular functions measured in half-revolutions of IEEE 754-2019 §9.2: $\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$, $\\operatorname{acos}(x)/\\pi$, $\\operatorname{atan}(x)/\\pi$ and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$, the last with the ordinate as the receiver (`y.atan2pi_ctx(x, ctx)`) and a result in $[-1, 1]$. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是以半圈为单位度量角度的反圆函数（IEEE 754-2019 §9.2）：$\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$、$\\operatorname{acos}(x)/\\pi$、$\\operatorname{atan}(x)/\\pi$ 与 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$；最后一个以纵坐标作为接收者（`y.atan2pi_ctx(x, ctx)`），结果在 $[-1, 1]$ 内。每个函数都有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1769
msgid "The exact results are those of §9.2.1, and by Niven's theorem the only ones: $\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\tfrac12$; $\\operatorname{acosPi}(1) = +0$, $\\operatorname{acosPi}(-1) = 1$, $\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm 0) = \\tfrac12$; $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$, $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\tfrac14$ and $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\tfrac12$ with no exception; and the eleven rows of $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}$ for zero and infinite operands ($\\pm 0$, $\\pm 1$, $\\pm\\tfrac12$, $\\pm\\tfrac14$, $\\pm\\tfrac34$, the sign bit of a zero abscissa choosing the half-plane), plus $\\lvert y\\rvert = \\lvert x\\rvert$ for finite nonzero operands ($\\pm\\tfrac14$ for $x > 0$, $\\pm\\tfrac34$ for $x < 0$). None of them signals an exception. They take the preferred exponent 0 of §9.2.2, so $\\tfrac12$ is `0.5`, $\\tfrac14$ is `0.25`, $\\tfrac34$ is `0.75` and 1 is `1`, whatever the cohort of the operand; a context too narrow for the constant (precision 1) rounds it, with `inexact`. $\\lvert x\\rvert > 1$ (also $\\pm\\infty$) is invalid for `asinpi` and `acospi`. Every other result is inexact ($\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm\\tfrac12) = \\pm\\tfrac16$ and $\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm\\tfrac12) = \\tfrac13, \\tfrac23$ are not terminating decimals) and is correctly rounded, also next to the representable values $\\pm\\tfrac12$ and $\\pm 1$ that `atanpi` (large $\\lvert x\\rvert$), `acospi` (tiny $\\lvert x\\rvert$) and `atan2pi` (extreme ratios) approach from one side: there the rounding mode decides between the anchor and its neighbour."
msgstr "精确结果即 §9.2.1 所列者，并且由 Niven 定理，只有这些：$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\tfrac12$；$\\operatorname{acosPi}(1) = +0$，$\\operatorname{acosPi}(-1) = 1$，$\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm 0) = \\tfrac12$；$\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm\\tfrac14$，以及 $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm\\infty) = \\pm\\tfrac12$（不触发异常）；还有 $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}$ 在零与无穷操作数上的十一行（$\\pm 0$、$\\pm 1$、$\\pm\\tfrac12$、$\\pm\\tfrac14$、$\\pm\\tfrac34$，零横坐标的符号位决定所在半平面），以及有限非零操作数的 $\\lvert y\\rvert = \\lvert x\\rvert$（$x > 0$ 时为 $\\pm\\tfrac14$，$x < 0$ 时为 $\\pm\\tfrac34$）。它们都不触发任何异常。它们取 §9.2.2 的首选指数 0，因此无论操作数属于哪个同类，$\\tfrac12$ 都是 `0.5`，$\\tfrac14$ 是 `0.25`，$\\tfrac34$ 是 `0.75`，1 是 `1`；上下文过窄（精度为 1）装不下该常量时对其舍入并置 `inexact`。$\\lvert x\\rvert > 1$（包括 $\\pm\\infty$）对 `asinpi` 与 `acospi` 无效。其余每个结果都不精确（$\\operatorname{asinPi}(\\pm\\tfrac12) = \\pm\\tfrac16$ 与 $\\operatorname{acosPi}(\\pm\\tfrac12) = \\tfrac13, \\tfrac23$ 不是有限小数），并且正确舍入，即使结果从一侧逼近可表示值 $\\pm\\tfrac12$ 与 $\\pm 1$（`atanpi` 的大 $\\lvert x\\rvert$、`acospi` 的微小 $\\lvert x\\rvert$、`atan2pi` 的极端比值）：此时由舍入模式在锚点与其邻值之间取舍。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1810
msgid "These functions are the hyperbolic functions and their inverses. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是双曲函数及其反函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

