#: manual/api/decimal.md:1840
msgid "NaN for a NaN operand; otherwise as `power` on $\\lvert x\\rvert$"
msgstr "NaN 操作数给出 NaN；其余同 $\\lvert x\\rvert$ 上的 `power`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1842
msgid "`tanpi` at odd half-integers"
msgstr "`tanpi` 在奇数的一半处"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1842
msgid "integers, half-integers, `tanpi` at odd quarter-integers ($\\pm 1$)"
msgstr "整数、半整数，以及 `tanpi` 在四分之一的奇数倍处（$\\pm 1$）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1844
msgid "$\\pm 0$; $\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\pi/2$ (certified)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$；$\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\pi/2$（经过认证）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1846
msgid "$\\pm 0$; $\\pm 1 \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac14$; $\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac12$ (no exception)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$；$\\pm 1 \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac14$；$\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac12$（不触发异常）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1847
msgid "the eleven exact rows of §9.2.1 ($\\pm0$, $\\pm\\tfrac12$, $\\pm\\tfrac14$, $\\pm\\tfrac34$, $\\pm1$) and $\\lvert y\\rvert = \\lvert x\\rvert \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac14, \\pm\\tfrac34$"
msgstr "§9.2.1 的十一个精确行（$\\pm0$、$\\pm\\tfrac12$、$\\pm\\tfrac14$、$\\pm\\tfrac34$、$\\pm1$）以及 $\\lvert y\\rvert = \\lvert x\\rvert \\mapsto \\pm\\tfrac14, \\pm\\tfrac34$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1848
msgid "$\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x) = \\pm 0$ for $x = +0$ or $x > 0$, and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$ for finite $y$; any other zero or infinite operand gives $\\pi$, $\\pi/2$, $\\pi/4$ or $3\\pi/4$ with the sign of $y$ (certified)"
msgstr "当 $x = +0$ 或 $x > 0$ 时 $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x) = \\pm 0$，对有限的 $y$ 有 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$；其他任何零或无穷操作数都得到符号同 $y$ 的 $\\pi$、$\\pi/2$、$\\pi/4$ 或 $3\\pi/4$（经过认证）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1849
msgid "$\\pm0\\mapsto\\pm0$; $\\sinh$, $\\operatorname{asinh}$ keep $\\pm\\infty$; $\\tanh(\\pm\\infty)=\\pm 1$"
msgstr "$\\pm0\\mapsto\\pm0$；$\\sinh$、$\\operatorname{asinh}$ 保持 $\\pm\\infty$；$\\tanh(\\pm\\infty)=\\pm 1$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1854
msgid "These special values follow IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1: in decimal64, `atan2_ctx(-0, -1)` is `-3.141592653589793`, `atan2_ctx(+∞, -∞)` is `2.356194490192345` and `atan2_ctx(-1, +∞)` is `-0`."
msgstr "这些特殊值遵循 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1：在 decimal64 中，`atan2_ctx(-0, -1)` 为 `-3.141592653589793`，`atan2_ctx(+∞, -∞)` 为 `2.356194490192345`，`atan2_ctx(-1, +∞)` 为 `-0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1907
msgid "Interchange formats"
msgstr "交换格式"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1911
msgid "`DecimalInterchangeFormat` names an IEEE 754 decimal interchange format."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchangeFormat` 指定一种 IEEE 754 十进制交换格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1922
msgid "`context` returns `DecimalContext::decimal32()`, `decimal64()` or `decimal128()`."
msgstr "`context` 返回 `DecimalContext::decimal32()`、`decimal64()` 或 `decimal128()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1927
msgid "`DecimalInterchangeEncoding` selects how the coefficient is stored in the bits."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchangeEncoding` 选择系数在比特中的存储方式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1937
msgid "`DPD` stores three decimal digits per 10-bit declet (densely packed decimal); `BID` stores the coefficient as a binary integer. Functions without an encoding argument use `DPD`."
msgstr "`DPD` 每个 10 位 declet 存储三个十进制数字（densely packed decimal，密集压缩十进制）；`BID` 将系数存储为二进制整数。没有编码参数的函数使用 `DPD`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1943
msgid "These functions encode a value as interchange bits written in hexadecimal."
msgstr "这些函数将值编码为以十六进制书写的交换比特。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1950
msgid "A finite value is first rounded with `apply_ctx` under the format context (its flags are returned), then encoded with its exponent, so the cohort is kept when it fits. The text is `#` followed by 8, 16 or 32 upper-case hex digits. Infinities are encoded with a zero trailing field. A NaN keeps its sign and kind, and its payload is stored as an integer, independent of the value's precision field (IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2): a payload below $10^{p-1}$ is kept, and a longer one keeps its low $p-1$ digits, in DPD and BID alike. `NaN7` encodes to decimal64 as `#7C00000000000007` in both encodings."
msgstr "有限值先在格式上下文下用 `apply_ctx` 舍入（返回其标志），再连同其指数一起编码，因此在可容纳时会保留同值类成员。文本为 `#` 后跟 8、16 或 32 个大写十六进制数字。无穷以全零的尾随字段编码。NaN 保留其符号和种类，其载荷作为整数存储，与值的精度字段无关（IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2）：小于 $10^{p-1}$ 的载荷被保留，更长的载荷保留其低 $p-1$ 位，DPD 与 BID 皆然。`NaN7` 在两种编码下都编码为 decimal64 的 `#7C00000000000007`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1961
msgid "These functions decode interchange hex text."
msgstr "这些函数解码交换十六进制文本。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1968
msgid "The text may have surrounding ASCII whitespace and a leading `#`; it must have exactly the format's number of hex digits, in either case. Anything else is an `Err` (a parse error) that says what was wrong: the number of digits wanted and found (`\"#A23003D\"` for decimal32 has 7 of 8), or the first character that is not a hexadecimal digit and its place among the digits. The length is checked first. No bit pattern of the right length is refused: decoding is exact and keeps the exponent, the sign of zero, the NaN kind and payload. Non-canonical encodings decode to the value IEEE 754 assigns them: a non-canonical DPD declet to its digits, a BID coefficient $\\ge 10^{p}$ to zero, an out-of-range BID NaN payload to 0; the unused exponent bits of infinities and NaNs are ignored. The result has the format's precision. `GdaInterchange::from_hex` of `decimal_gda` accepts the same texts and refuses the same ones, but its message is one sentence for both faults."
msgstr "文本两侧可以有 ASCII 空白，并可带前导 `#`；它必须恰好具有该格式规定数量的十六进制数字（大小写均可）。其他任何文本都是 `Err`（解析错误），并指出错在哪里：所需与实际的数字个数（decimal32 的 `\"#A23003D\"` 有 7 位而不是 8 位），或第一个不是十六进制数字的字符及其在数字中的位置；先检查长度。长度正确的比特模式一律不拒绝：解码是精确的，并保留指数、零的符号、NaN 种类和载荷。非规范编码被解码为 IEEE 754 为其指定的值：非规范的 DPD declet 解码为其数字，满足 $\\ge 10^{p}$ 的 BID 系数解码为零，超出范围的 BID NaN 载荷解码为 0；无穷与 NaN 中未使用的指数位被忽略。结果具有该格式的精度。`decimal_gda` 的 `GdaInterchange::from_hex` 接受相同的文本、拒绝相同的文本，但两种错误用同一句话说明。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2005
msgid "`DecimalInterchange` holds the raw bits of one interchange value together with its format and encoding."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchange` 保存一个交换值的原始比特及其格式和编码。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2017
msgid "Use it when bits must be inspected or kept exactly, including non-canonical encodings that a `Decimal` cannot represent. `format` and `encoding` return the format and encoding the bits belong to; `to_hex` writes `#` and the full-width upper-case hex digits."
msgstr "当需要检查或精确保留比特时（包括 `Decimal` 无法表示的非规范编码），请使用它。`format` 和 `encoding` 返回这些比特所属的格式和编码；`to_hex` 写出 `#` 以及全宽的大写十六进制数字。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2024
msgid "These functions build an interchange value from text or from a `Decimal`."
msgstr "这些函数由文本或 `Decimal` 构建交换值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2033
msgid "`from_hex` stores the bits unchanged (text rules and errors as in `from_interchange_hex`). `from_decimal` encodes like `to_interchange_hex` and returns the same flags. The forms without an encoding use `DPD`."
msgstr "`from_hex` 原样存储比特（文本规则与错误同 `from_interchange_hex`）。`from_decimal` 的编码方式与 `to_interchange_hex` 相同，并返回相同的标志。不带编码参数的形式使用 `DPD`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2039
msgid "These functions decode the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数解码所存储的比特。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2046
msgid "Decoding is exact: `to_decimal_ctx` raises no flag."
msgstr "解码是精确的：`to_decimal_ctx` 不引发任何标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2050
msgid "These functions canonicalize the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数将所存储的比特规范化。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2057
msgid "`canonical` decodes and re-encodes in the same format and encoding: every non-canonical declet, out-of-range BID coefficient, and unused bit of an infinity or NaN is replaced by its canonical form. It is idempotent. `is_canonical` tests whether the bits are already canonical."
msgstr "`canonical` 以相同的格式和编码进行解码并重新编码：每个非规范的 declet、超出范围的 BID 系数以及无穷或 NaN 中未使用的比特都被替换为其规范形式。它是幂等的。`is_canonical` 检测比特是否已经是规范的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2064
msgid "These functions change only the sign bit of the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数只改变所存储比特中的符号位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2073
msgid "All other bits, canonical or not, are kept. `copy_sign` aborts unless both operands have the same format and encoding."
msgstr "其他所有比特（无论是否规范）都被保留。除非两个操作数具有相同的格式和编码，否则 `copy_sign` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2078
msgid "`Zero`, `One`, `Ring` and the operator traits"
msgstr "`Zero`、`One`、`Ring` 与运算符 trait"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2080
msgid "`Decimal` implements the Luna-Flow algebra traits through the plain operators."
msgstr "`Decimal` 通过普通运算符实现 Luna-Flow 代数 trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2102
msgid "`Zero::zero()` and `One::one()` are `Decimal::zero()` and `Decimal::one()`. The ring laws hold exactly for `+`, `-` and `*` as long as no sum is rounded (sums whose exact coefficient fits the operand precision, and every product, since `*` is exact); a rounded sum is only approximately associative. `FromNat` and `FromInteger` are documented under [construction](#the-fromnat-and-frominteger-implementations)."
msgstr "`Zero::zero()` 和 `One::one()` 即 `Decimal::zero()` 和 `Decimal::one()`。只要没有和被舍入（精确系数能容纳于操作数精度的和，以及所有乘积，因为 `*` 是精确的），环公理对 `+`、`-` 和 `*` 精确成立；经过舍入的和只是近似满足结合律。`FromNat` 和 `FromInteger` 的说明见[构造](#the-fromnat-and-frominteger-implementations)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2111
msgid "`Decimal` implements the `floating` scalar trait."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `floating` 的标量 trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2117
msgid "The trait methods are `classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized`, all documented above; `@def.is_finite(x)` and the other generic predicates work through it."
msgstr "trait 方法为 `classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized`，均已在上文说明；`@def.is_finite(x)` 及其他泛型谓词都通过它工作。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2123
msgid "These functions implement the contextual traits of [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)."
msgstr "这些函数实现了 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的 contextual trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2150
msgid "Each `*_contextual` operation converts the context with `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context`, runs the matching `*_ctx` operation and returns `Err(division_by_zero)` when `division_by_zero` was raised, `Err(domain_error)` when another `has_error` flag was raised, and otherwise `Ok` with diagnostics `inexact`, `overflow` and `underflow` copied from the flags. Because the converted context has the default exponent range, which the certified functions accept for precisions up to 999, `exp_contextual` works at the default range; an explicit `e_max` above 999,999 fails with `certification_failure` (`not_computed`). A result with `invalid_operation` is a `domain_error`; one with `not_computed` is a `certification_failure`; the `try_` forms return `Err` only for the second kind."
msgstr "每个 `*_contextual` 运算都用 `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 转换上下文，执行对应的 `*_ctx` 运算：若引发了 `division_by_zero` 则返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，若引发了其他 `has_error` 标志则返回 `Err(domain_error)`，否则返回 `Ok`，其诊断信息 `inexact`、`overflow` 和 `underflow` 复制自标志。由于转换后的上下文采用默认指数范围，而经认证的函数对不超过 999 的精度接受该范围，因此 `exp_contextual` 可在默认范围下工作；显式的 `e_max` 超过 999,999 时会以 `certification_failure`（`not_computed`）失败。结果带 `invalid_operation` 的是 `domain_error`，带 `not_computed` 的是 `certification_failure`；`try_` 形式只对第二种返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2160
msgid "`zero_contextual` and `one_contextual` have the context precision. `epsilon_contextual` is $10^{1-p}$ (`next_up_ctx(1) - 1`). `min_normal_contextual` is $10^{e_{\\min}}$ (default $e_{\\min} = -999\\,999\\,999$). `max_finite_contextual` is $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$. `classify_contextual` is `classify`."
msgstr "`zero_contextual` 和 `one_contextual` 具有上下文精度。`epsilon_contextual` 为 $10^{1-p}$（`next_up_ctx(1) - 1`）。`min_normal_contextual` 为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$（默认 $e_{\\min} = -999\\,999\\,999$）。`max_finite_contextual` 为 $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$。`classify_contextual` 即 `classify`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2168
msgid "These functions implement the checked traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`."
msgstr "`parse_checked(s, ctx)` 将 `ctx` 转换为 `DecimalContext` 并使用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx`，因此会应用上下文的精度、舍入方向、指数边界和 clamp 设置。它返回转换后的值；溢出等标志仍可从 `from_string_ctx` 获取。语法无效时返回 `Err(parse_error)`。 `DivChecked::div_checked(x, y, ctx)` 即转换后上下文下的 `div_ctx`，其 `Err(division_by_zero)` 与 `Err(domain_error)` 同 [`div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-sqrt)。`sqrt_checked` 即转换后上下文下的 `sqrt_ctx`，对负操作数失败。`pow_nat_checked` 和 `pow_int_checked` 即把整数指数精确转换为 `Decimal`（至少十位数字，足以容纳每个可接受的指数）后的 `power_ctx`，因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`；它们对零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效的幂返回 `Err(domain_error)`，且 `pow_nat_checked` 对大于 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`CompareChecked` 即 [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2183
msgid "`parse_checked(s, ctx)` converts `ctx` to `DecimalContext` and uses `Decimal::from_string_ctx`, so the context's precision, rounding direction, exponent range applies. It returns the converted value; flags such as overflow remain available from `from_string_ctx`. Invalid syntax returns `Err(parse_error)`. `DivChecked::div_checked(x, y, ctx)` is `div_ctx` under the converted context with `Err(division_by_zero)` and `Err(domain_error)` as in [`div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-sqrt). `sqrt_checked` is `sqrt_ctx` under the converted context and fails for negative operands. `pow_nat_checked` and `pow_int_checked` call `pow_ctx` with the integer exponent converted exactly (with at least ten digits, which hold every accepted exponent), so at precision 7 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` is `-1`. They return `Ok(1)` for a zero or quiet-NaN base with exponent zero, `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero base with a negative exponent, and `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid result such as a signaling NaN operand. `pow_nat_checked` returns `Err(unsupported)` for exponents above 999,999,999. `CompareChecked` is [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)."
msgstr "`parse_checked(s, ctx)` 将 `ctx` 转换为 `DecimalContext` 并使用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx`，因此会应用上下文的精度、舍入方向和指数范围。它返回转换后的值；溢出等标志仍可从 `from_string_ctx` 获取。语法无效时返回 `Err(parse_error)`。`DivChecked::div_checked(x, y, ctx)` 在转换后的上下文中执行 `div_ctx`，并像 [`div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-sqrt) 一样返回 `Err(division_by_zero)` 或 `Err(domain_error)`。`sqrt_checked` 在转换后的上下文中执行 `sqrt_ctx`，负操作数会失败。`pow_nat_checked` 和 `pow_int_checked` 调用 `pow_ctx`，并将整数指数精确转换（至少十位数字，足以容纳所有可接受的指数），因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`。零或静默 NaN 底数配零指数返回 `Ok(1)`，零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，信号 NaN 操作数等无效结果返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`pow_nat_checked` 对超过 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`CompareChecked` 即 [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2201
msgid "`Eq` and `Compare`: `Decimal::equal`, `not_equal`, `op_lt`, `op_le`, `op_gt`, `op_ge`"
msgstr "`Eq` 与 `Compare`：`Decimal::equal`、`not_equal`、`op_lt`、`op_le`、`op_gt`、`op_ge`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2203
msgid "These are the operator methods of `Eq` and `Compare`."
msgstr "这些是 `Eq` 与 `Compare` 的运算符方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2214
msgid "They are defined by [`compare`](#decimalcompare): `x == y` is `compare(x, y) == 0`, `x < y` is `compare(x, y) < 0`, and so on. Cohort members are equal (`1.0 == 1.00`), $-0 = +0$, every NaN equals every NaN and is greater than every number. Use `total_order_compare` to tell representations apart."
msgstr "它们由 [`compare`](#decimalcompare) 定义：`x == y` 即 `compare(x, y) == 0`，`x < y` 即 `compare(x, y) < 0`，依此类推。同值类成员相等（`1.0 == 1.00`），$-0 = +0$，每个 NaN 都等于每个 NaN，且大于所有数。要区分不同的表示，请使用 `total_order_compare`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2220
msgid "Derived equality: `DecimalContext::equal`, `DecimalContext::not_equal`, `DecimalFlags::equal`, `DecimalFlags::not_equal`, `DecimalRoundingMode::equal`, `DecimalRoundingMode::not_equal`, `DecimalSignal::equal`, `DecimalSignal::not_equal`, `DecimalInterchangeFormat::equal`, `DecimalInterchangeFormat::not_equal`, `DecimalInterchangeEncoding::equal`, `DecimalInterchangeEncoding::not_equal`"
msgstr "派生相等：`DecimalContext::equal`、`DecimalContext::not_equal`、`DecimalFlags::equal`、`DecimalFlags::not_equal`、`DecimalRoundingMode::equal`、`DecimalRoundingMode::not_equal`、`DecimalSignal::equal`、`DecimalSignal::not_equal`、`DecimalInterchangeFormat::equal`、`DecimalInterchangeFormat::not_equal`、`DecimalInterchangeEncoding::equal`、`DecimalInterchangeEncoding::not_equal`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2222
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` methods of the context, flag and enum types."
msgstr "这些是上下文、标志与枚举类型的派生 `Eq` 方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2239
msgid "Contexts compare field by field (precision, rounding, exponent limits, refinement limit); flag sets compare all thirteen fields. `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context(ArithmeticContext::decimal64())` is equal to `DecimalContext::decimal64()`."
msgstr "上下文逐字段比较（精度、舍入、指数界限、细化上限）；标志集比较全部十三个字段。`DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context(ArithmeticContext::decimal64())` 等于 `DecimalContext::decimal64()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2244
msgid "`Show` and `Debug`: `Decimal::to_string`, `output`, `to_repr`"
msgstr "`Show` 与 `Debug`：`Decimal::to_string`、`output`、`to_repr`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2246
msgid "`Decimal` implements `Show` and `Debug`."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `Show` 和 `Debug`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:2255
msgid "`to_string` formats a value in scientific notation without a context. Finite values use the scientific-string rule of [`to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-to_eng_string), so trailing zeros and the exponent are visible: `1.20`, `1E+3`, `1.2E-7`. Special values are written in lower case: `inf`, `-inf`, `nan`, `snan`, `-nan12`. `output` writes the same text to a logger. `to_repr` is the derived structural representation used by `debug_inspect` and `assert_eq`."
msgstr "`to_string` 在不带上下文的情况下以科学记数法格式化值。有限值使用 [`to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-to_eng_string) 的科学记数字符串规则，因此尾随零和指数均可见：`1.20`、`1E+3`、`1.2E-7`。特殊值以小写书写：`inf`、`-inf`、`nan`、`snan`、`-nan12`。`output` 将相同文本写入 logger。`to_repr` 是 `debug_inspect` 和 `assert_eq` 所使用的派生结构表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_checked API"
msgstr "decimal_checked API"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:5
msgid "`decimal_checked` provides `DecimalChecked`, an immutable pipeline state for IEEE 754 decimal arithmetic with [`decimal`](decimal.md). The state holds the current value, one `DecimalContext`, the flags raised by the latest step, the flags accumulated over all steps, and an optional `ArithmeticError`. Each operation applies the matching `Decimal::*_ctx` operation under the stored context. IEEE exceptional results (infinities, NaNs, rounded values) remain values and only set flags; an error is recorded only when an elementary function cannot certify its result, and it stops the pipeline. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_checked.md) shows typical pipelines; the [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md) models the state as a writer monad over the flag monoid and proves that the accumulated flags are the union of the per-step flags."
msgstr "`decimal_checked` 提供 `DecimalChecked`，这是基于 [`decimal`](decimal.md) 的 IEEE 754 十进制算术的不可变流水线状态。该状态保存当前值、一个 `DecimalContext`、最近一步引发的标志、所有步骤累积的标志，以及一个可选的 `ArithmeticError`。每个运算都在所存储的上下文下执行对应的 `Decimal::*_ctx` 运算。IEEE 异常结果（无穷、NaN、舍入后的值）仍然是值，只设置标志；只有当初等函数无法认证其结果时才记录错误，并使流水线停止。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_checked.md)展示了典型的流水线；[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md)将该状态建模为标志幺半群上的 writer 单子，并证明累积标志是各步标志的并。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:20
msgid "Add both packages to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将这两个包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:29
msgid "The examples use the aliases `@decimal_checked.` and `@decimal.`, and list flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@decimal_checked.` 和 `@decimal.`，并用以下辅助函数列出标志："

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:46
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:52
msgid "The state type"
msgstr "状态类型"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:50
msgid "`DecimalChecked` is the state of an IEEE decimal pipeline."
msgstr "`DecimalChecked` 是 IEEE 十进制流水线的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:58
msgid "Write a state as $\\sigma = (v, c, r, F, \\varepsilon)$: value $v$, context $c$, raised flags $r$ of the latest step, accumulated flags $F$, and error $\\varepsilon$ (absent or one `ArithmeticError`). Every operation returns a new state; nothing is mutated."
msgstr "将状态记为 $\\sigma = (v, c, r, F, \\varepsilon)$：值 $v$、上下文 $c$、最近一步引发的标志 $r$、累积标志 $F$，以及错误 $\\varepsilon$（不存在或为一个 `ArithmeticError`）。每个运算都返回新的状态；不修改任何东西。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:67
msgid "`from_outcome(value, context, flags)` starts a pipeline from a value and the flags that produced it."
msgstr "`from_outcome(value, context, flags)` 由一个值及产生它的标志开始一条流水线。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:74
msgid "The result is $(\\textit{value}, c', \\textit{flags}, \\textit{flags}, \\text{none})$ with $c' = \\textit{context}$. The value is *not* re-rounded; use it with the `(value, flags)` pair returned by a `Decimal::*_ctx` call."
msgstr "结果为 $(\\textit{value}, c', \\textit{flags}, \\textit{flags}, \\text{none})$，其中 $c' = \\textit{context}$。值*不会*被重新舍入；请将它与 `Decimal::*_ctx` 调用返回的 `(value, flags)` 二元组配合使用。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:81
msgid "`from_decimal(value, context)` rounds a value into the context."
msgstr "`from_decimal(value, context)` 将值舍入到上下文中。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:87
msgid "It applies `Decimal::apply_ctx`, which rounds the value to the context's precision and exponent range, and records the resulting flags as both raised and accumulated."
msgstr "它执行 `Decimal::apply_ctx`，将值舍入到上下文的精度和指数范围，并把所得标志同时记录为引发标志和累积标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:93
msgid "`parse(source, context)` converts a decimal string under the context."
msgstr "`parse(source, context)` 在上下文下转换十进制字符串。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:99
msgid "It uses `Decimal::from_string_ctx`. Extra digits are rounded (`inexact`); an invalid string gives a NaN value with `invalid_operation` raised, not an error."
msgstr "它使用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx`。多余的数字会被舍入（`inexact`）；无效字符串得到一个 NaN 值并引发 `invalid_operation`，而不是错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:105
msgid "These constructors convert a MoonBit number."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换 MoonBit 数值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:114
msgid "`from_int` and `from_bigint` parse the integer's decimal string, so integers longer than the precision are rounded with flags. `from_double` first converts the binary value to a decimal of 17 significant digits and `from_float` to 9 digits (enough to identify the binary value), then rounds into the context with `from_decimal`. So `from_double(0.1, decimal64)` is `0.1000000000000000` with `inexact` raised."
msgstr "`from_int` 和 `from_bigint` 解析整数的十进制字符串，因此长于精度的整数会被舍入并带有标志。`from_double` 先将二进制值转换为 17 位有效数字的十进制数，`from_float` 则转换为 9 位（足以唯一确定该二进制值），然后用 `from_decimal` 舍入到上下文中。因此 `from_double(0.1, decimal64)` 为 `0.1000000000000000`，并引发 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:121
msgid "This is a conversion in two roundings, not the correctly rounded value of the binary number. With a context precision above 17 (decimal128) the result keeps only 17 digits: `from_double(0.1, decimal128)` is `0.10000000000000001`, not the exact `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`, and its flags describe only the second rounding. With a precision below 17 the half modes can round twice (a 17-digit midpoint created by the first rounding). For the exact binary value use `from_decimal(Decimal::from_double(x, precision=p), context)` with `p` at least the context precision plus one, or with `p = 767`, which holds every `Double` exactly."
msgstr "这是经过两次舍入的转换，而不是该二进制数的正确舍入值。当上下文精度高于 17（decimal128）时，结果只保留 17 位数字：`from_double(0.1, decimal128)` 为 `0.10000000000000001`，而不是精确的 `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`，并且其标志只描述第二次舍入。当精度低于 17 时，half 模式可能舍入两次（第一次舍入产生了一个 17 位的中点）。如需精确的二进制值，请使用 `from_decimal(Decimal::from_double(x, precision=p), context)`，其中 `p` 至少为上下文精度加一，或取 `p = 767`，它能精确容纳每个 `Double`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:157
msgid "These accessors return the components of the state."
msgstr "这些访问函数返回状态的各个分量。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:166
msgid "`raised()` is $r$, the flags of the latest successful step only. `flags()` is $F$, the bitwise OR of the flags of every successful step since construction or the last `clear_flags`. After an error, `value`, `raised` and `flags` keep the state reached before the failing step."
msgstr "`raised()` 即 $r$，仅为最近一次成功步骤的标志。`flags()` 即 $F$，是自构造或上次 `clear_flags` 以来所有成功步骤标志的按位 OR。出错之后，`value`、`raised` 和 `flags` 保持失败步骤之前所达到的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:173
msgid "These methods return the value with the accumulated flags."
msgstr "这些方法返回值及累积标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:180
msgid "`outcome()` is $(v, F)$ regardless of the error; `result()` is $\\mathrm{Err}(\\varepsilon)$ when an error is recorded and $\\mathrm{Ok}((v, F))$ otherwise."
msgstr "`outcome()` 无论是否有错误都为 $(v, F)$；`result()` 在记录了错误时为 $\\mathrm{Err}(\\varepsilon)$，否则为 $\\mathrm{Ok}((v, F))$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:186
msgid "These methods test for and return the recorded error."
msgstr "这些方法检测并返回所记录的错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:194
msgid "Controlling the state"
msgstr "控制状态"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:198
msgid "`clear_flags()` resets both $r$ and $F$ to the empty flag set."
msgstr "`clear_flags()` 将 $r$ 和 $F$ 都重置为空标志集。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:204
msgid "Value, context and error are kept. It also applies to a state with an error."
msgstr "值、上下文与错误保持不变。它同样适用于带有错误的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:208
msgid "`with_context(context)` switches to a new context and rounds the current value into it."
msgstr "`with_context(context)` 切换到新的上下文，并将当前值舍入到其中。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:215
msgid "The value is re-applied with `apply_ctx` under the new context; the new flags become $r$ and are ORed into $F$. On a state with an error it returns the state unchanged."
msgstr "值在新上下文下用 `apply_ctx` 重新应用；新的标志成为 $r$，并 OR 到 $F$ 中。对带有错误的状态，它原样返回该状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:221
msgid "`apply()` rounds the current value into the stored context and records the flags."
msgstr "`apply()` 将当前值舍入到所存储的上下文中，并记录标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:249
msgid "Operations that cannot fail"
msgstr "不会失败的运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:253
msgid "These methods apply the IEEE decimal operation of the same meaning to the current value and a plain `Decimal` operand under the stored context."
msgstr "这些方法在所存储的上下文下，对当前值和一个普通 `Decimal` 操作数执行含义相同的 IEEE 十进制运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:273
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:275
msgid "$\\lvert v\\rvert$ rounded into the context"
msgstr "舍入到上下文的 $\\lvert v\\rvert$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:276
msgid "$v \\circ y$ correctly rounded"
msgstr "正确舍入的 $v \\circ y$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:277
msgid "$v \\cdot m + a$ with one rounding"
msgstr "只舍入一次的 $v \\cdot m + a$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:278
msgid "$\\sqrt{v}$ correctly rounded"
msgstr "正确舍入的 $\\sqrt{v}$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:279
msgid "$v$ rounded to the exponent of `q`"
msgstr "舍入到 `q` 的指数的 $v$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:280
msgid "IEEE remainder $v - d \\cdot n$, $n$ = $v/d$ rounded to nearest, ties to even"
msgstr "IEEE 余数 $v - d \\cdot n$，$n$ = $v/d$ 舍入到最近（平局取偶）"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:281
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 `minimumNumber`/`maximumNumber`: a quiet NaN loses to a number, a signaling NaN gives the number and `invalid_operation` (the General Decimal Arithmetic `min`/`max` are in `decimal_gda`)"
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 的 `minimumNumber`/`maximumNumber`：静默 NaN 输给数值，信号 NaN 给出数值并引发 `invalid_operation`（General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `min`/`max` 在 `decimal_gda` 中）"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:282
msgid "adjacent representable value"
msgstr "相邻的可表示值"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:284
msgid "If an error is recorded, each method returns the state unchanged. Otherwise the step $(v', r') = \\mathrm{op}(v, c)$ gives the new state $(v', c, r', F \\lor r', \\text{none})$. Invalid operations produce NaN with `invalid_operation`, division by zero produces an infinity with `division_by_zero`, overflow produces an infinity or the largest finite number with `overflow` and `inexact`, as in IEEE 754 decimal arithmetic."
msgstr "若已记录错误，每个方法都原样返回状态。否则，步骤 $(v', r') = \\mathrm{op}(v, c)$ 给出新状态 $(v', c, r', F \\lor r', \\text{none})$。与 IEEE 754 十进制算术一致：无效运算产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，除以零产生带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷，上溢产生无穷或最大有限数，并带 `overflow` 和 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:311
msgid "Operations that can record an error"
msgstr "可能记录错误的运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:315
msgid "These methods apply the certified `Decimal::try_*_ctx` functions of the same name."
msgstr "这些方法应用同名的经认证的 `Decimal::try_*_ctx` 函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:360
msgid "The results are those of `decimal`, including its documented exception to correct rounding (exact decimal results of non-integral powers, such as $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$; see the [decimal API](decimal.md#elementary-functions)). Zero and infinite operands of `atan2` give the IEEE 754 values (`atan2` of $+\\infty$ and 1 is $\\pi/2$, inexact). Domain violations are IEEE values with flags (`ln` of a negative number is NaN with `invalid_operation`, `tanpi(0.5)` is an infinity with `division_by_zero`). An error is recorded only when `try_*_ctx` returns `Err`, which these functions do for a `CertificationFailure` (the correctly rounded result could not be certified within the refinement budget). On error the new state is $(v, c, r, F, \\mathrm{Some}(e))$: the value and flags before the step are kept."
msgstr "结果即 `decimal` 的结果，包括其文档所述的正确舍入例外（非整数次幂的精确十进制结果，例如 $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$；参见 [decimal API](decimal.md#elementary-functions)）。`atan2` 的零与无穷操作数得到 IEEE 754 值（$+\\infty$ 和 1 的 `atan2` 为 $\\pi/2$，不精确）。定义域违例是带标志的 IEEE 值（负数的 `ln` 是带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，`tanpi(0.5)` 是带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷）。只有当 `try_*_ctx` 返回 `Err` 时才记录错误，这些函数在发生 `CertificationFailure`（无法在细化预算内认证正确舍入的结果）时会如此。出错时新状态为 $(v, c, r, F, \\mathrm{Some}(e))$：保留该步骤之前的值和标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:372
msgid "[!IMPORTANT] As an implementation limit (decNumber's `DEC_MAX_MATH`, required by the decTest suite and permitted by the GDA Invalid context condition), these operations require a context with precision and exponent limits within 999,999. A context with a larger `e_max`, or with a precision of 1000 digits or more and no explicit `e_max`, makes them return NaN with `not_computed`; the `try_` mirrors return `Err` (certification failure). Use `decimal32()`, `decimal64()`, `decimal128()` or an explicit `e_max` up to 999,999. `pow` and `pown` with an integral exponent, and `pow` with the exponent `0.5`, are not restricted."
msgstr "[!IMPORTANT] 作为一项实现限制（decNumber 的 `DEC_MAX_MATH`，decTest 套件要求它，GDA 的 Invalid context 条件允许它），这些运算要求上下文的精度和指数限制在 999,999 以内。`e_max` 更大的上下文，或精度为 1000 位及以上且没有显式 `e_max` 的上下文，会使它们返回带 `not_computed` 的 NaN；`try_` 镜像返回 `Err`（认证失败）。请使用 `decimal32()`、`decimal64()`、`decimal128()` 或不超过 999,999 的显式 `e_max`。带整数指数的 `pow` 和 `pown`，以及指数为 `0.5` 的 `pow`，不受此限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda API"
msgstr "decimal_gda API"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:5
msgid "`decimal_gda` implements the General Decimal Arithmetic Specification (GDA, version 1.70) by M. F. Cowlishaw. Its `Decimal` is a sign, an arbitrary-length decimal coefficient and a decimal exponent; its `GdaContext` carries the precision, rounding mode, exponent limits, clamping, the extended/subset switch, the sticky status and the enabled traps; and every GDA operation is a pure function that returns a `GdaOutcome` holding the defined result, the next context and the conditions it raised. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_gda.md) shows the package in use; the [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md) derives the rules stated here."
msgstr "`decimal_gda` 实现了 M. F. Cowlishaw 的 General Decimal Arithmetic 规范（GDA，1.70 版）。其 `Decimal` 由符号、任意长度的十进制系数和十进制指数组成；其 `GdaContext` 携带精度、舍入模式、指数限制、钳制、扩展/子集开关、粘滞状态以及已启用的陷阱；每个 GDA 运算都是纯函数，返回一个 `GdaOutcome`，其中包含所定义的结果、下一个上下文以及它所引发的条件。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_gda.md)展示了该包的用法；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md)推导了此处陈述的规则。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:15
msgid "The package does not depend on the IEEE 754 package `decimal`. It publishes the GDA layer only (`Decimal`, `GdaContext`, the `Gda*` types and the functions named after the GDA operations) and adapters to the `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` and `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` traits. The status-free engine the functions are built on is private to the package."
msgstr "该包不依赖 IEEE 754 包 `decimal`。它只公开 GDA 层（`Decimal`、`GdaContext`、`Gda*` 类型以及以 GDA 运算命名的函数），以及面向 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 和 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` trait 的适配器。这些函数所基于的无状态引擎是包内私有的。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Throughout, a finite value is written $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{e}$ with coefficient $c \\ge 0$ and exponent $e$; its *adjusted exponent* is $\\hat e = e + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$, the exponent of its leading digit. For a context with precision $p$, $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ is the smallest exponent a result may have, and with clamping $E_{\\mathrm{top}} = e_{\\max} - p + 1$ is the largest."
msgstr "全文中，有限值记作 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{e}$，其中系数 $c \\ge 0$，指数为 $e$；其*调整后指数*为 $\\hat e = e + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$，即其首位数字的指数。对于精度为 $p$ 的上下文，$E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ 是结果可以具有的最小指数，在钳制时 $E_{\\mathrm{top}} = e_{\\max} - p + 1$ 是最大指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:38
msgid "The examples on this page call the package through the alias `@decimal_gda.`, and the trait adapters through `@lf_arith.` for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`. Several examples define a local helper `d(s)`, which parses a literal with `Decimal::from_string` and keeps its exponent."
msgstr "本页示例通过别名 `@decimal_gda.` 调用该包，并通过 `@lf_arith.`（对应 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`）调用 trait 适配器。若干示例定义了局部辅助函数 `d(s)`，它用 `Decimal::from_string` 解析字面量并保留其指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:44
msgid "The `Decimal` value"
msgstr "`Decimal` 值"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:48
msgid "`Decimal` is an immutable GDA number: a finite value, an infinity, a quiet NaN or a signaling NaN."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是不可变的 GDA 数：有限值、无穷、静默 NaN 或信号 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:57
msgid "Finite values keep their exponent, so `2.50` and `2.5` are distinct members of the same *cohort*: they compare equal numerically and differ in `compare_total`, `same_quantum` and printing. Zero is signed. NaNs carry a sign and a non-negative integer payload. Every value also stores a *precision attribute* (`precision()`), the precision of the context or constructor that produced it; GDA operations ignore it and use the context precision instead. The coefficient is stored as a persistent decimal limb array, so a value can be shared freely."
msgstr "有限值保留其指数，因此 `2.50` 与 `2.5` 是同一*同值类*的不同成员：它们在数值上比较相等，但在 `compare_total`、`same_quantum` 和打印上有所不同。零带有符号。NaN 携带符号和非负整数载荷。每个值还存储一个*精度属性*（`precision()`），即产生它的上下文或构造函数的精度；GDA 运算忽略它，而改用上下文精度。系数以持久化的十进制分段（limb）数组存储，因此值可以自由共享。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:68
msgid "These return $+0$, $-0$ and $1$, each with exponent 0."
msgstr "它们分别返回 $+0$、$-0$ 和 $1$，指数均为 0。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:76
msgid "`precision` (default 34) is the stored precision attribute: the number of digits the coefficient may have, from 1 to 999,999,999 (the limit a context has). A precision outside that range aborts and names the function and the argument; no constructor replaces it by 1. The same check applies to every constructor that takes a `precision`."
msgstr "`precision`（默认 34）是所存储的精度属性：系数可以有的位数，范围从 1 到 999,999,999（与上下文的限制相同）。超出该范围的精度会中止并指明函数和参数；没有任何构造函数会把它替换为 1。所有接受 `precision` 的构造函数都做同样的检查。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:84
msgid "These build the special values."
msgstr "这些函数构建特殊值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:93
msgid "`inf(negative=true)` is $-\\infty$ and `inf()` is $+\\infty$. `nan()` is a positive quiet NaN with payload 0. GDA 1.70 (page 11) says a payload is no larger than the coefficient can represent less one digit, so a payload has at most `precision - 1` digits: a negative payload, or one that is too wide for the `precision` given, aborts (at precision 1 only the payload 0 exists). A signaling NaN raises `InvalidOperation` when an arithmetic operation consumes it and is replaced by the quiet NaN with the same sign and payload."
msgstr "`inf(negative=true)` 是 $-\\infty$，`inf()` 是 $+\\infty$。`nan()` 是载荷为 0 的正静默 NaN。GDA 1.70（第 11 页）说明载荷不大于系数所能表示的值少一位，所以载荷至多有 `precision - 1` 位：负载荷，或对给定的 `precision` 而言过宽的载荷，会中止（精度为 1 时只有载荷 0）。信号 NaN 在被算术运算使用时引发 `InvalidOperation`，并被替换为符号和载荷相同的静默 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:103
msgid "These are the limits of the exponents a finite `Decimal` can hold."
msgstr "这些是有限 `Decimal` 所能持有的指数的限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:110
msgid "`gda_value_e_max` is $2^{31}-2 = 2{,}147{,}483{,}646$, a limit on the adjusted exponent. `gda_value_e_tiny` is $-2^{31}+3 = -2{,}147{,}483{,}645$, a limit on the exponent of the least digit (the `Etiny` of the working context of the plain operators, whatever the precision). A finite value, a zero included (it has one digit), is stored only if `e_tiny <= exponent` and `exponent + digits - 1 <= e_max`. The constructors `make`, `try_make` and `from_string` reject what is outside; the operations keep the values they produce inside, by rounding, underflow or overflow, so every `Decimal` you can obtain satisfies the condition. This is the invariant behind `x + 0 == x` and `x * 1 == x` for every stored finite value (see [the plain operators](#decimaladd-decimalsub-decimalmul-decimaldiv-decimalneg)). A text outside the limits is read with a context when a rounded value is wanted: [`to_number`](#to_number) rounds, overflows and underflows by the context."
msgstr "`gda_value_e_max` 为 $2^{31}-2 = 2{,}147{,}483{,}646$，是对调整指数的限制。`gda_value_e_tiny` 为 $-2^{31}+3 = -2{,}147{,}483{,}645$，是对最低位数字的指数的限制（即普通运算符的工作上下文的 `Etiny`，与精度无关）。有限值（包括零，它有一位数字）只有在 `e_tiny <= exponent` 且 `exponent + digits - 1 <= e_max` 时才会被存储。构造函数 `make`、`try_make` 和 `from_string` 拒绝范围之外的值；运算通过舍入、下溢或上溢使产生的值保持在范围之内，因此你能得到的每个 `Decimal` 都满足该条件。这是对每个已存储的有限值 `x + 0 == x` 和 `x * 1 == x` 成立的不变量（见[普通运算符](#decimaladd-decimalsub-decimalmul-decimaldiv-decimalneg)）。需要舍入后的值时，请用上下文读取范围之外的文本：[`to_number`](#to_number) 按上下文舍入、上溢和下溢。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:126
msgid "`make(c, e, p)` returns $c \\cdot 10^{e}$ as a value of `p` digits of coefficient, the way the GDA to-number conversion does (page 21)."
msgstr "`make(c, e, p)` 返回 $c \\cdot 10^{e}$，作为系数为 `p` 位的值，方式与 GDA 的 to-number 转换（第 21 页）相同。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:134
msgid "The sign comes from the sign of `c`. The exponent is kept when `c` has at most `p` digits: `make(1200, 0, 34)` is `1200`, `make(1200, -2, 34)` is `12.00` and `make(0, 5, 5)` is `0E+5`. A longer coefficient is rounded once, in `mode` (default `HalfEven`, one of the eight modes of the context), to `p` digits, and the rounded coefficient is not reduced: `make(1000000, 0, 3)` is `1.00E+6`. To strip trailing zeros use `Decimal::normalized` or `Decimal::trim`. No flags are reported."
msgstr "符号取自 `c` 的符号。当 `c` 至多有 `p` 位时保留给定的指数：`make(1200, 0, 34)` 为 `1200`，`make(1200, -2, 34)` 为 `12.00`，`make(0, 5, 5)` 为 `0E+5`。更长的系数按 `mode`（默认 `HalfEven`，上下文的八种模式之一）一次性舍入到 `p` 位，且舍入后的系数不被约简：`make(1000000, 0, 3)` 为 `1.00E+6`。要去掉尾随零，请用 `Decimal::normalized` 或 `Decimal::trim`。不报告任何标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:142
msgid "The value must be inside the [stored range](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny) after the rounding: an exponent below `gda_value_e_tiny`, or an adjusted exponent above `gda_value_e_max` (a carry of the rounding into the next power of ten included), is never replaced by a zero or an infinity. `make` then aborts with a message that names both limits and the exponent, and `try_make` returns `Err` of the domain-error kind with the same message. `try_make` also returns that error for a precision outside `1..=999999999`, where `make` aborts."
msgstr "值在舍入之后必须位于[存储范围](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny)之内：指数低于 `gda_value_e_tiny`，或调整指数高于 `gda_value_e_max`（包括舍入进位到下一个 10 的幂），都绝不会被零或无穷悄悄替换。此时 `make` 中止并给出同时指明两个限制和该指数的消息，`try_make` 返回定义域错误一类的 `Err`，消息相同。对于超出 `1..=999999999` 的精度，`try_make` 也返回该错误，而 `make` 则中止。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:152
msgid "These convert binary values to decimal. An integer of at most `precision` digits keeps exponent 0 and an exact binary fraction takes the exponent closest to 0 (trailing zeros are removed only down to exponent 0); a longer or inexact value is rounded to exactly `precision` digits, half to even unless `mode` (for `from_bin_float`) says otherwise."
msgstr "这些函数将二进制值转换为十进制。不超过 `precision` 位的整数保持指数 0，精确的二进制小数取最接近 0 的指数（只在指数降到 0 之前去掉尾随零）；更长或不精确的值舍入到恰好 `precision` 位，除非（对 `from_bin_float`）`mode` 另有规定，否则按半值取偶。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:166
msgid "`precision` defaults to 34 digits; for `from_bin_float` it is required and counts decimal digits, not the bits of the argument. A binary float $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ with $k < 0$ is first written exactly as $m 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$, so the conversion is exact whenever the result fits in `precision` digits; for example `from_double(0.1)` is the exact binary64 value nearest to $0.1$ rounded half to even to 34 digits. NaNs become the quiet NaN (sign kept by `from_double`), infinities keep their sign, zeros keep their sign (`from_bin_float` returns $+0$). `from_int(100)` is `100` (exponent 0), `from_int(99999, precision=3)` is `1.00E+5` and `from_double(0.5)` is `0.5`."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为 34 位；对 `from_bin_float` 而言它是必需的，并按十进制位数计，而不是参数的位数。$k < 0$ 的二进制浮点数 $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ 首先被精确写成 $m 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$，因此只要结果能容纳于 `precision` 位，转换就是精确的；例如 `from_double(0.1)` 是最接近 $0.1$ 的 binary64 的精确值按半值取偶舍入到 34 位的结果。NaN 变为静默 NaN（`from_double` 保留符号），无穷保留符号，零保留符号（`from_bin_float` 返回 $+0$）。`from_int(100)` 为 `100`（指数 0），`from_int(99999, precision=3)` 为 `1.00E+5`，`from_double(0.5)` 为 `0.5`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:177
msgid "`to_bin_float` rounds the value to a binary `BinFloat` with `precision` significant bits."
msgstr "`to_bin_float` 将值舍入为具有 `precision` 位有效二进制位的 `BinFloat`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:184
msgid "`precision` is required and counts bits, from 1 to `@bin_float.binary_precision_max` (outside that range the call aborts). `mode` is a rounding attribute of the radix of the result (IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1) and defaults to `RoundTiesToEven`; ties-to-away rounds the exact value once, too. With `RoundTowardNegative` and `RoundTowardPositive` the two results enclose the decimal value; the elementary functions use exactly this to build their certified input intervals. Zeros map to $+0$, NaNs to the binary NaN."
msgstr "`precision` 是必需的，按位数计，范围从 1 到 `@bin_float.binary_precision_max`（超出该范围则调用中止）。`mode` 是结果的基数的舍入属性（IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1），默认 `RoundTiesToEven`；ties-to-away 也只对精确值舍入一次。用 `RoundTowardNegative` 和 `RoundTowardPositive` 得到的两个结果包住该十进制值；初等函数正是借此构建其经过认证的输入区间。零映射为 $+0$，NaN 映射为二进制 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:194
msgid "This reads a GDA numeric string without a GDA context."
msgstr "该函数在没有 GDA 上下文的情况下读取 GDA 数值字符串。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:200
msgid "Accepted syntax is the GDA numeric-string grammar: an optional sign, digits with an optional decimal point, an optional exponent `E±n`, or `Infinity`/`Inf`/`NaN`/`sNaN` (case-insensitive) with an optional decimal NaN payload. The exponent is kept exactly, so `from_string(\"2.50\")` has exponent $-2$. A literal with more than `precision` (default 34) significant digits is rounded half to even and its trailing zeros are removed. A malformed literal gives `Err(parse_error)`; so does a precision outside `1..=999999999` (`Err` of the domain-error kind) and a NaN whose payload is wider than `precision - 1` digits (page 11). No context exponent range applies, only the [stored range](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny): a literal whose value (zero included) has an exponent below `gda_value_e_tiny` after the rounding, or an adjusted exponent above `gda_value_e_max`, gives `Err` of the domain-error kind that names both limits and the exponent. It is not a malformed literal, and it is no longer folded into an infinity or a zero (`\"1e3000000000\"` and `\"1e-3000000000\"` are errors). Use the package function [`to_number`](#to_number) when a rounded value is wanted or when the exponent limits, flags, status or traps of a context must apply."
msgstr "可接受的语法为 GDA 数值字符串文法：可选符号、带可选小数点的数字、可选指数 `E±n`，或者 `Infinity`/`Inf`/`NaN`/`sNaN`（不区分大小写）并可带十进制 NaN 载荷。指数被精确保留，因此 `from_string(\"2.50\")` 的指数为 $-2$。有效数字多于 `precision`（默认 34）位的字面量按半值取偶舍入，并去除尾随零。格式错误的字面量得到 `Err(parse_error)`；精度超出 `1..=999999999`（`Err` 为定义域错误一类）和载荷宽于 `precision - 1` 位的 NaN（第 11 页）也是如此。不适用任何上下文指数范围，只适用[存储范围](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny)：其值（包括零）在舍入之后的指数低于 `gda_value_e_tiny`，或调整指数高于 `gda_value_e_max` 的字面量，得到指明两个限制和该指数的定义域错误一类的 `Err`。它不是格式错误的字面量，也不再被折叠成无穷或零（`\"1e3000000000\"` 和 `\"1e-3000000000\"` 都是错误）。需要舍入后的值，或必须应用上下文的指数限制、标志、状态或陷阱时，请使用包函数 [`to_number`](#to_number)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:220
msgid "These print the value in GDA scientific notation, with lowercase special values."
msgstr "这些函数以 GDA 科学记数法打印值，特殊值使用小写。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:229
msgid "A finite value with $e \\le 0$ and $\\hat e \\ge -6$ prints without an exponent (`0.000123`, `7.50`); otherwise it prints one digit, the remaining digits after a point, and `E±`$\\hat e$ (`1.23E+7`, `1E-7`, `0E+2`). Infinities print as `inf`/`-inf`, NaNs as `nan`, `snan`, `-nan`, followed by the payload when it is not zero. For the GDA spellings `Infinity`/`NaN`/`sNaN` use [`Decimal::to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-decimalto_eng_string)."
msgstr "满足 $e \\le 0$ 且 $\\hat e \\ge -6$ 的有限值不带指数打印（`0.000123`、`7.50`）；否则打印一位数字、小数点后的其余数字以及 `E±`$\\hat e$（`1.23E+7`、`1E-7`、`0E+2`）。无穷打印为 `inf`/`-inf`，NaN 打印为 `nan`、`snan`、`-nan`，载荷非零时后跟载荷。若要使用 GDA 写法 `Infinity`/`NaN`/`sNaN`，请使用 [`Decimal::to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-decimalto_eng_string)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:238
msgid "These print a value with GDA to-scientific-string or to-engineering-string. Neither conversion uses a context."
msgstr "这些函数用 GDA 的 to-scientific-string 或 to-engineering-string 打印一个值。两种转换都不使用上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:246
msgid "Engineering notation uses an exponent that is a multiple of three (`123E+5` prints as `12.3E+6`). Special values print as `Infinity`, `-Infinity`, `NaN`, `sNaN` with payload. To convert a numeric string under a context first, call [`to_number`](#to_number) and print its value."
msgstr "工程记数法使用 3 的倍数作为指数（`123E+5` 打印为 `12.3E+6`）。特殊值打印为 `Infinity`、`-Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN`，并带载荷。若要先在某个上下文下转换数值字符串，请先调用 [`to_number`](#to_number)，再打印其值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:255
msgid "These report the class, the numeric sign and the stored precision attribute."
msgstr "这些函数报告类别、数值符号以及所存储的精度属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:263
msgid "`classify` returns `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`. `sign` returns `Zero` for zeros of either sign and for NaNs, and `Positive`/`Negative` otherwise; use `is_signed` to read the sign bit."
msgstr "`classify` 返回 `Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。`sign` 对任一符号的零以及 NaN 返回 `Zero`，否则返回 `Positive`/`Negative`；若要读取符号位，请使用 `is_signed`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:269
msgid "These expose the stored representation $(c, e)$."
msgstr "这些函数暴露所存储的表示 $(c, e)$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:277
msgid "`coefficient` returns $c \\ge 0$ (the payload for a NaN, 0 for an infinity). `exponent10` and `quantum` both return $e$ (0 for special values)."
msgstr "`coefficient` 返回 $c \\ge 0$（对 NaN 为载荷，对无穷为 0）。`exponent10` 和 `quantum` 都返回 $e$（对特殊值为 0）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:283
msgid "These are the class and sign predicates."
msgstr "这些是类别与符号谓词。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:294
msgid "`is_signed` reads the sign bit, so it is true for $-0$, $-\\infty$ and negative NaNs. `is_zero` is true for finite zeros of any exponent."
msgstr "`is_signed` 读取符号位，因此对 $-0$、$-\\infty$ 和负 NaN 为真。`is_zero` 对任意指数的有限零为真。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:300
msgid "These distinguish quiet from signaling NaNs."
msgstr "这些函数区分静默 NaN 与信号 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:309
msgid "`is_canonical` always returns `true`: every `Decimal` value is canonical (only interchange encodings can be non-canonical, see [`GdaInterchange::is_canonical`](#gdainterchangecanonical-gdainterchangeis_canonical))."
msgstr "`is_canonical` 总是返回 `true`：每个 `Decimal` 值都是规范的（只有交换编码可能是非规范的，参见 [`GdaInterchange::is_canonical`](#gdainterchangecanonical-gdainterchangeis_canonical)）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:319
msgid "`nan_payload` reads a NaN payload."
msgstr "`nan_payload` 读取 NaN 的载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:325
msgid "`nan_payload` returns the payload of a NaN and 0 for any other value. The IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 payload operations (`getPayload`, `setPayload`, `setPayloadSignaling`) are in [`decimal`](decimal.md), not here."
msgstr "`nan_payload` 返回 NaN 的载荷，对其他任何值返回 0。IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 的载荷运算（`getPayload`、`setPayload`、`setPayloadSignaling`）在 [`decimal`](decimal.md) 中，不在这里。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:329
msgid "Sign, cohort and precision transformations"
msgstr "符号、同值类与精度变换"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:333
msgid "These change only the sign bit; they never round and never signal, even for a signaling NaN."
msgstr "这些函数只改变符号位；它们从不舍入，也从不发出信号，即使对信号 NaN 也是如此。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:345
msgid "`neg` and `copy_negate` flip the sign, `abs` and `copy_abs` clear it, `copy` returns the value, and `copy_sign(x, y)` gives `x` the sign bit of `y`. These are GDA *copy* operations; the rounding versions are the package functions [`minus`, `plus`, `abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs)."
msgstr "`neg` 和 `copy_negate` 翻转符号，`abs` 和 `copy_abs` 清除符号，`copy` 返回该值，`copy_sign(x, y)` 赋予 `x` 以 `y` 的符号位。这些是 GDA 的 *copy* 运算；会舍入的版本是包函数 [`minus`、`plus`、`abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:352
msgid "These move a value within its cohort or round it to a new precision attribute."
msgstr "这些函数在同值类内移动值，或将其舍入到新的精度属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:360
msgid "`normalized` rounds half to even to the stored precision and removes all trailing zeros (`7.50` becomes `7.5`, `1200` becomes `1.2E+3`). `trim` removes only fractional trailing zeros and never makes the exponent positive (`7.50` becomes `7.5`, `1200` stays `1200`); a zero becomes `0` with exponent 0. `with_precision(p, mode)` rounds to `p` digits with `mode`, removes trailing zeros and sets the precision attribute; special values only get the new attribute. None of them report flags. A carry of the rounding at the top of the [stored range](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny) follows the GDA Overflow rule of the working range, so the result is never a finite value above the limit: for example `9999E+2147483643` rounded to 2 digits is `inf` in the modes that round away from zero or to nearest, and `9.9E+2147483646`, the largest finite value of that width, in the modes toward zero."
msgstr "`normalized` 按半值取偶舍入到所存储的精度，并去除所有尾随零（`7.50` 变为 `7.5`，`1200` 变为 `1.2E+3`）。`trim` 只去除小数部分的尾随零，且从不使指数变为正（`7.50` 变为 `7.5`，`1200` 保持 `1200`）；零变为指数为 0 的 `0`。`with_precision(p, mode)` 以 `mode` 舍入到 `p` 位，去除尾随零并设置精度属性；特殊值只获得新的属性。它们都不报告标志。在[存储范围](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny)的顶端，舍入的进位遵循工作范围的 GDA 上溢规则，因此结果绝不会是高于限制的有限值：例如 `9999E+2147483643` 舍入到 2 位，在远离零或就近舍入的模式下为 `inf`，在趋向零的模式下为该宽度的最大有限值 `9.9E+2147483646`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:375
msgid "`identical` is the relation \"the same datum\"."
msgstr "`identical` 是\"同一个数据\"关系。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:381
msgid "It is true for two values with the same class, sign, coefficient and exponent, the same precision attribute and, for NaNs, the same payload and the same kind (quiet or signaling). `2.5` and `2.50` are equal by `==` and not identical; `0` and `-0` are equal and not identical; two NaNs with the same payload are identical although `==` and `compare` treat every NaN alike. It is `compare_total` being 0 together with equal precision attributes (GDA defines `compare_total` without a precision). The attribute is part of it because the plain operators round to the larger attribute of their operands: `1` with attribute 3 and `1` with attribute 34 are equal and have `compare_total` 0, but divided by `3` they give `0.333` and `0.3333333333333333333333333333333333`. Two identical values give the same result in every function."
msgstr "两个值的类别、符号、系数、指数和精度属性都相同时为真；对于 NaN，还要求载荷和种类（安静或信号）相同。`2.5` 与 `2.50` 按 `==` 相等但不相同；`0` 与 `-0` 相等但不相同；载荷相同的两个 NaN 是相同的，尽管 `==` 和 `compare` 对所有 NaN 一视同仁。它是 `compare_total` 为 0 且精度属性相等（GDA 定义的 `compare_total` 不含精度）。精度属性属于其中，是因为普通运算符按操作数中较大的属性舍入：属性为 3 的 `1` 与属性为 34 的 `1` 相等，`compare_total` 为 0，但除以 `3` 分别得到 `0.333` 和 `0.3333333333333333333333333333333333`。两个相同的值在每个函数中给出相同的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:401
msgid "It is true for two finite values with equal exponents, for two infinities and for two NaNs, and false otherwise."
msgstr "对于指数相等的两个有限值、两个无穷以及两个 NaN，它为真，否则为假。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:404
msgid "The GDA context"
msgstr "GDA 上下文"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:408
msgid "`GdaContext` is the immutable GDA context: arithmetic policy plus sticky status plus enabled traps."
msgstr "`GdaContext` 是不可变的 GDA 上下文：算术策略加上粘滞状态，再加上已启用的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:417
msgid "The policy is precision $p \\ge 1$, a `GdaRoundingMode`, $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$, `clamp` and `extended`. The status is a `GdaFlags` value that operations only ever enlarge; the traps are a `GdaTrapSet`. Neither status nor traps influence the numerical result of an operation: they only decide the next context and whether the outcome is `Completed` or `Trapped`."
msgstr "策略包括精度 $p \\ge 1$、一个 `GdaRoundingMode`、$e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$、`clamp` 以及 `extended`。状态是一个 `GdaFlags` 值，运算只会使它增大；陷阱是一个 `GdaTrapSet`。状态和陷阱都不影响运算的数值结果：它们只决定下一个上下文，以及结果是 `Completed` 还是 `Trapped`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:425
msgid "`new` builds a context with an empty status and aborts on an invalid parameter; `try_new` takes the same parameters and returns a `Result`."
msgstr "`new` 构造状态为空的上下文，参数无效时中止；`try_new` 接受相同的参数并返回 `Result`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:433
msgid "Defaults: `precision=34`, `rounding=HalfEven`, `e_min=-999_999_999`, `e_max=999_999_999`, `clamp=false`, `extended=true`, no traps. The parameters must satisfy these rules, and `try_new` returns `Err(domain_error)` naming the invalid one while `new` aborts with the same message:"
msgstr "默认值：`precision=34`、`rounding=HalfEven`、`e_min=-999_999_999`、`e_max=999_999_999`、`clamp=false`、`extended=true`，不设陷阱。参数必须满足下列规则；`try_new` 返回 `Err(domain_error)` 并指明无效的参数，`new` 则以同样的消息中止："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:438
msgid "precision within `1..=999_999_999`, `e_max` within `0..=999_999_999` and `e_min` within `-999_999_999..=0`. These adopted decNumber `decContext.h` limits keep Etiny/Etop and exponent arithmetic within `Int`; GDA 1.70 itself fixes no limit."
msgstr "精度在 `1..=999_999_999` 内，`e_max` 在 `0..=999_999_999` 内，`e_min` 在 `-999_999_999..=0` 内。这些采用的 decNumber `decContext.h` 限制使 Etiny/Etop 和指数运算保持在 `Int` 范围内；GDA 1.70 本身没有规定任何限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:442
msgid "`e_min` is `-e_max`, `1 - e_max` (the IEEE 754 rule) or `-e_max - 1`. GDA 1.70 (page 10) requires the magnitudes of Emin and Emax to differ by at most one, so that the range of results is balanced. A range such as `e_min=-50, e_max=60` is rejected. The text also requires `Elimit` to exceed five times the maximum coefficient length when there is one; the context has no maximum coefficient length, and 913 rows of the official decTest corpus run with an `e_max` below four times the precision, so that sentence is not enforced."
msgstr "`e_min` 是 `-e_max`、`1 - e_max`（IEEE 754 的规则）或 `-e_max - 1`。GDA 1.70（第 10 页）要求 Emin 与 Emax 的量级至多相差一，使结果范围保持平衡。像 `e_min=-50, e_max=60` 这样的范围会被拒绝。该文本还要求，存在最大系数长度时，`Elimit` 须大于其五倍；上下文没有最大系数长度，且官方 decTest 语料中有 913 行在 `e_max` 小于精度四倍的情况下运行，因此这句话不被强制执行。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:450
msgid "`clamp` and `extended` are not parameters of the context in the GDA text. They are decNumber extensions that the library keeps: `clamp=true` is the fold-down of the Clamped condition (page 51), which limits exponents to $e_{\\max} - p + 1$ as the interchange formats do, and `extended=false` selects the GDA *subset* arithmetic of Appendix A (page 55, footnote 43: a parameter of the context \"might\" select it): operands longer than $p$ digits are rounded first (raising `LostDigits` when that is inexact), special values cannot be parsed, zeros and some results are normalized, and `fma` is invalid. The official decTest files use both (`clamp:` in 30,649 rows, `extended: 0` in all 16,162 rows of `dectest0`)."
msgstr "在 GDA 文本中，`clamp` 和 `extended` 不是上下文的参数。它们是本库保留的 decNumber 扩展：`clamp=true` 是 Clamped 条件（第 51 页）的折叠，如同互换格式那样把指数限制在 $e_{\\max} - p + 1$；`extended=false` 选择附录 A（第 55 页，脚注 43：上下文的某个参数“可以”选择它）的 GDA *子集*算术：长于 $p$ 位的操作数先被舍入（不精确时引发 `LostDigits`），特殊值无法解析，零和部分结果被规范化，`fma` 无效。官方 decTest 文件两者都用（`clamp:` 出现在 30,649 行中，`extended: 0` 覆盖 `dectest0` 的全部 16,162 行）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:461
msgid "[!NOTE] `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` with a non-integer exponent require $p \\le 999\\,999$, $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ and $e_{\\min} \\ge -999\\,999$. This is a deliberate implementation limit, not a rule of the GDA operation text: it is decNumber's `DEC_MAX_MATH`, the official decTest suite requires it (`power.decTest` rows powx4001 to powx4005; the matching rows expx901 to expx906, lnx901 to lnx906 and logx901 to logx906 of `exp.decTest`, `ln.decTest` and `log10.decTest`, in a section that decTest labels decNumber's restricted range for the mathematical functions), and GDA 1.70 permits it through its Invalid context condition (the precision \"exceeds the capability of the underlying concrete representation\"). With the default exponent range they return NaN and raise `InvalidContext`."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 非整数指数的 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power` 要求 $p \\le 999\\,999$、$e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ 且 $e_{\\min} \\ge -999\\,999$。这是一项有意的实现限制，不是 GDA 运算正文的规则：它是 decNumber 的 `DEC_MAX_MATH`，官方 decTest 套件要求它（`power.decTest` 的 powx4001 至 powx4005 行；`exp.decTest`、`ln.decTest` 和 `log10.decTest` 中对应的 expx901 至 expx906、lnx901 至 lnx906、logx901 至 logx906 行，它们位于 decTest 标明为 decNumber 数学函数受限范围的部分），GDA 1.70 通过其 Invalid context 条件允许它（精度“超出底层具体表示的能力”）。使用默认指数范围时，它们返回 NaN 并引发 `InvalidContext`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:476
msgid "These return the default contexts of GDA 1.70 (page 16)."
msgstr "这些函数返回 GDA 1.70 的默认上下文（第 16 页）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:485
msgid "rounding"
msgstr "舍入"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:485
msgid "clamp"
msgstr "clamp"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:485
msgid "extended"
msgstr "扩展"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:485
msgid "traps"
msgstr "陷阱"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:487
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:596
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:597
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:598
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:449
#: manual/numeric_semantics.md:306
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:487
msgid "DivisionByZero, InvalidOperation, Overflow, Underflow, Clamped"
msgstr "DivisionByZero、InvalidOperation、Overflow、Underflow、Clamped"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:488
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:489
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:490
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:595
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:449
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:492
msgid "`basic_default` is what the specification calls the *basic default context*: precision 9, round-half-up, and every trap enabled except inexact, rounded and subnormal. The library also sets `extended=false` for it (the X3.274 subset of Appendix A); the text of the context does not set that parameter. `decimal32`, `decimal64` and `decimal128` are the *extended default contexts* for the IEEE 754 formats: round-half-even, no traps; `rounding` replaces the mode when given. `GdaContext::new()` is not `basic_default()`: it has precision 34, half-even and no traps. The values are created once and shared."
msgstr "`basic_default` 就是规范所称的*基本默认上下文*：精度 9、半值向上舍入，除 inexact、rounded 和 subnormal 外的所有陷阱都启用。库还为它设置 `extended=false`（附录 A 的 X3.274 子集）；规范中的上下文文本并未设置该参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:503
msgid "These return a copy with one setting changed."
msgstr "这些函数返回改变了一项设置的副本。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:511
msgid "The result is checked like `new`: a precision or exponent range outside the rules above aborts. The sticky status, the traps, `clamp`, `extended` and the refinement limit are kept."
msgstr "结果与 `new` 一样受到检查：精度或指数范围若不符合上述规则则中止。粘滞状态、陷阱、`clamp`、`extended` 和细化限制都会保留。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:517
msgid "These read the arithmetic policy."
msgstr "这些函数读取算术策略。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:529
msgid "`radix` always returns 10."
msgstr "`radix` 总是返回 10。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:533
msgid "These read the sticky status and the enabled traps."
msgstr "这些函数读取粘滞状态和已启用的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:542
msgid "These read and set the number of refinement steps of the certified elementary functions."
msgstr "这些函数读取和设置认证初等函数的细化步数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:550
msgid "`exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` refine an enclosure of the result at most `Some(12)` times by default. A rare argument close to a rounding boundary may need more: `with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` allows 24 steps and `None` removes the count (the working precision then stops at a resource bound). A limit below 1 is one step. When the limit is reached, the plain functions report `invalid_context` and [`try_exp`, `try_ln`, `try_log10`, `try_power`](#try_exp-try_ln-try_log10-try_power) return `Err`."
msgstr "`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power` 默认至多细化包络 `Some(12)` 次。极少数非常接近舍入边界的参数可能需要更多：`with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` 允许 24 步，`None` 取消步数限制（此时工作精度在某个资源上限处停止）。小于 1 的限制按一步计。达到限制时，普通函数报告 `invalid_context`，而 [`try_exp`、`try_ln`、`try_log10`、`try_power`](#try_exp-try_ln-try_log10-try_power) 返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:560
msgid "These return a new context with changed traps or status; the receiver is not modified."
msgstr "这些函数返回陷阱或状态被修改后的新上下文；接收者本身不被修改。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:570
msgid "`trap(s)` enables (or with `enabled=false` disables) one trap; `with_traps` replaces the whole set. `clear_status` empties the status and keeps the traps; `reset` empties both."
msgstr "`trap(s)` 启用（或在 `enabled=false` 时禁用）一个陷阱；`with_traps` 替换整个集合。`clear_status` 清空状态并保留陷阱；`reset` 将两者都清空。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:576
msgid "`GdaRoundingMode` lists the eight GDA rounding modes."
msgstr "`GdaRoundingMode` 列出八种 GDA 舍入模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:591
msgid "When the exact result lies strictly between two representable neighbours, `Down` takes the one nearer zero, `Up` the one farther from zero, `Ceiling` the larger, `Floor` the smaller; `HalfEven`, `HalfUp` and `HalfDown` take the nearer one and break an exact tie towards an even last digit, away from zero, or towards zero respectively; `ZeroFiveUp` rounds towards zero unless that leaves a last digit of 0 or 5, in which case it rounds away from zero. The [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md#rounding-to-precision) gives each mode as a formula."
msgstr "当精确结果严格位于两个可表示的相邻值之间时，`Down` 取更接近零的一个，`Up` 取离零更远的一个，`Ceiling` 取较大者，`Floor` 取较小者；`HalfEven`、`HalfUp` 和 `HalfDown` 取较近的一个，恰好处于中点时分别取末位为偶数者、远离零、趋向零；`ZeroFiveUp` 向零舍入，除非这样得到的末位数字为 0 或 5，此时改为远离零舍入。[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md#rounding-to-precision)以公式给出了每种模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:600
msgid "Signals, flags and traps"
msgstr "信号、标志与陷阱"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:604
msgid "`GdaSignal` names the nine signals of GDA 1.70. Each has a flag in the context status and a trap-enabler."
msgstr "`GdaSignal` 列出 GDA 1.70 的九种信号。每种信号在上下文状态中有一个标志，并有一个陷阱使能。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:621
msgid "The eight signals of the specification (page 15) are `Clamped`, `DivisionByZero`, `Inexact`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Rounded`, `Subnormal` and `Underflow`; `LostDigits` is the ninth, raised only in subset arithmetic (Appendix A). The conditions of pages 51 and 52 that the text says signal invalid-operation (conversion syntax, division impossible, division undefined and invalid context) are not signals: they are conditions of `GdaFlags`, and raising any of them raises the signal `InvalidOperation`."
msgstr "规范的八种信号（第 15 页）是 `Clamped`、`DivisionByZero`、`Inexact`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Rounded`、`Subnormal` 和 `Underflow`；`LostDigits` 是第九种，仅在子集算术中引发（附录 A）。第 51 和 52 页中文本称其发出 invalid-operation 的那些条件（转换语法错误、除法不可行、除法未定义和无效上下文）不是信号：它们是 `GdaFlags` 的条件，引发其中任何一个都会引发信号 `InvalidOperation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:631
msgid "`GdaFlags` is a set of conditions (the thirteen conditions the library raises, the fourteen of the specification without Insufficient storage), used both for the conditions raised by one operation and for the sticky status of a context. The decTest files name conditions, so the status keeps them apart."
msgstr "`GdaFlags` 是条件的集合（库引发的十三种条件，即规范的十四种条件去掉 Insufficient storage），既用于表示单个运算引发的条件，也用于表示上下文的粘滞状态。decTest 文件按条件命名，因此状态把它们区分开。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:642
msgid "The fields are private. Each of the 13 conditions is read with a method of the same name, such as `raised().inexact()` or `status().division_by_zero()`; there is no public constructor besides `new`, so sets are built only with `new` and `combine`. `GdaTrapSet` reads the same way, one method for each of the nine signals."
msgstr "字段为私有。13 个条件中的每一个都用同名方法读取，例如 `raised().inexact()` 或 `status().division_by_zero()`；除 `new` 外没有公开构造函数，因此集合只能通过 `new` 和 `combine` 构造。`GdaTrapSet` 的读取方式相同，九种信号各有一个方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:649
msgid "`new` is the empty set, `combine` the field-wise union and `contains` the membership test of a *signal*, with the GDA invalid-operation grouping. The accessor methods read one *condition* each."
msgstr "`new` 是空集，`combine` 是逐字段并集，`contains` 是对*信号*的成员检测，采用 GDA 的无效运算分组。访问器方法每个读取一个*条件*。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:659
msgid "`combine` is associative, commutative and idempotent with `new()` as identity. `contains(s)` reads the field for `s`, except that `contains(InvalidOperation)` is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined` or `invalid_context` is set. The accessor `invalid_operation()` reads the plain Invalid operation condition only, and the plain condition is not raised with every one of the four: a division undefined or impossible raises it, a conversion syntax error or an invalid context does not, as in decNumber, whose status word the decTest rows describe. Use `contains(InvalidOperation)` to ask whether the signal was raised."
msgstr "`combine` 满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，以 `new()` 为单位元。`contains(s)` 读取 `s` 对应的字段，但 `contains(InvalidOperation)` 在 `invalid_operation`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined` 或 `invalid_context` 中任何一个被设置时为真。访问器 `invalid_operation()` 只读取普通的 Invalid operation 条件，而且这四个条件并非每一个都会同时引发普通条件：除法未定义或不可行会引发它，转换语法错误或无效上下文则不会，这与 decNumber 一致，decTest 的各行描述的正是它的状态字。要询问信号是否被引发，请使用 `contains(InvalidOperation)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:672
msgid "`GdaTrapSet` is the set of enabled trap-enablers, one for each of the nine signals."
msgstr "`GdaTrapSet` 是已启用的陷阱使能的集合，九种信号各有一个。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:683
msgid "These build and query trap sets."
msgstr "这些函数构建并查询陷阱集。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:691
msgid "`new` enables no trap. `with_signal(s)` enables one trap (or disables it with `enabled=false`); `contains(s)` reads the trap-enabler of `s`. The trap of `InvalidOperation` fires for every condition that signals it."
msgstr "`new` 不启用任何陷阱。`with_signal(s)` 启用一个陷阱（或用 `enabled=false` 将其禁用）；`contains(s)` 读取 `s` 的陷阱使能。`InvalidOperation` 的陷阱对每一个发出该信号的条件都会触发。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:697
msgid "`GdaOutcome[T]` is the result of every GDA operation."
msgstr "`GdaOutcome[T]` 是每个 GDA 运算的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:706
msgid "Both variants carry the GDA-defined result, the next context and the conditions raised by this operation; `Trapped` also names the trap that fired."
msgstr "两个变体都携带 GDA 定义的结果、下一个上下文以及本次运算引发的条件；`Trapped` 还指明所触发的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:709
msgid "The enum is read-only outside the package: a caller can `match` on it and use the accessors, but only the GDA operations, `GdaOutcome::completed` and `GdaOutcome::absorb` construct an outcome. To turn a trapped outcome into its defined result, use `GdaOutcome::resume_defined`."
msgstr "该枚举在包外是只读的：调用方可以对它 `match` 并使用访问函数，但只有 GDA 运算、`GdaOutcome::completed` 和 `GdaOutcome::absorb` 才能构造 outcome。要把被陷阱拦截的 outcome 变成其定义结果，请使用 `GdaOutcome::resume_defined`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:716
msgid "These read the fields that both variants share, without a `match`."
msgstr "这些函数读取两个变体共有的字段，无需 `match`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:724
msgid "`value` is the defined result also for `Trapped`, `next_context` the context with the updated status, and `raised` the conditions of this operation only."
msgstr "`value` 是定义的结果（对 `Trapped` 亦然），`next_context` 是状态已更新的上下文，`raised` 只包含本次运算的条件。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:729
msgid "These build the outcomes a pipeline needs."
msgstr "这些函数构造流水线所需的 outcome。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:736
msgid "`completed(v, c)` is the outcome of an operation that raised nothing: `v` and `c` unchanged, empty `raised`. `a.absorb(b)` keeps the value, the context (traps included) and the trap of `a`; the conditions that `b` raised join `raised` and the sticky status of the next context (with `invalid_operation` set when one of the four detailed invalid conditions is among them); when `a` completed and `b` trapped, the result is `Trapped` with the signal of `b`. The traps of `a` are not tested against the conditions of `b`. [`GdaDecimalChecked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) uses it for the right operand of a binary operation."
msgstr "`completed(v, c)` 是什么都没有引发的运算的 outcome：`v` 和 `c` 不变，`raised` 为空。`a.absorb(b)` 保留 `a` 的值、上下文（包括陷阱）和陷阱；`b` 引发的条件并入 `raised` 和下一个上下文的粘滞状态（其中含四个细分的无效条件之一时设置 `invalid_operation`）；当 `a` 已完成而 `b` 陷入陷阱时，结果是带 `b` 的信号的 `Trapped`。`a` 的陷阱不会对 `b` 的条件进行检测。[`GdaDecimalChecked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) 用它处理二元运算的右操作数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:747
msgid "This is the only way to build a `Completed` outcome from a `Trapped` one."
msgstr "这是由 `Trapped` 得到 `Completed` outcome 的唯一方式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:753
msgid "`Completed` is returned unchanged; `Trapped(s, v, C, R)` becomes `Completed(v, C, none)`, the GDA rule for continuing after a trap with the defined result. `GdaDecimalChecked::resume_defined` calls it."
msgstr "`Completed` 原样返回；`Trapped(s, v, C, R)` 变为 `Completed(v, C, none)`，这是 GDA 规定的“陷阱后以定义结果继续”的规则。`GdaDecimalChecked::resume_defined` 调用它。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:757
msgid "Trap selection"
msgstr "陷阱选择"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:759
msgid "Every GDA function finishes the same way. Let $R$ be the conditions the operation raised and $C$ the input context."
msgstr "每个 GDA 函数都以相同的方式结束。设 $R$ 为运算引发的条件，$C$ 为输入上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:762
msgid "If $R$ is empty the outcome is `Completed(v, C, none)`: the very same context comes back."
msgstr "若 $R$ 为空，结果为 `Completed(v, C, none)`：返回的正是同一个上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:764
msgid "Otherwise the next context is $C$ with status $C.\\mathrm{status} \\cup R$, where the `invalid_operation` flag is also set whenever $R$ contains one of the four detailed invalid conditions."
msgstr "否则，下一个上下文是状态为 $C.\\mathrm{status} \\cup R$ 的 $C$；只要 $R$ 包含四种细分无效条件之一，`invalid_operation` 标志也会被设置。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:767
msgid "The trapped signal is the first $s$ in the order below with `raised.contains(s)` and `traps.contains(s)`: InvalidOperation, DivisionByZero, Overflow, Underflow, Subnormal, Inexact, Rounded, Clamped, LostDigits. If there is one the outcome is `Trapped(s, v, C', R)`, otherwise `Completed(v, C', R)`."
msgstr "被捕获的信号是按以下顺序中第一个同时满足 `raised.contains(s)` 与 `traps.contains(s)` 的 $s$：InvalidOperation、DivisionByZero、Overflow、Underflow、Subnormal、Inexact、Rounded、Clamped、LostDigits。若存在这样的信号，结果为 `Trapped(s, v, C', R)`，否则为 `Completed(v, C', R)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:773
msgid "Because `contains(InvalidOperation)` covers the detailed invalid conditions, the one `InvalidOperation` trap catches all of them, and the trapped signal is `InvalidOperation` whichever condition raised it."
msgstr "由于 `contains(InvalidOperation)` 涵盖了各细分无效条件，唯一的 `InvalidOperation` 陷阱会捕获所有这些条件，并且无论由哪个条件引发，被捕获的信号都是 `InvalidOperation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:797
msgid "GDA operations"
msgstr "GDA 运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:799
msgid "Every function in this section takes its operands and a `GdaContext`, rounds to that context, and returns a `GdaOutcome` built by the [trap selection](#trap-selection) rule. A signaling-NaN operand raises `InvalidOperation` and yields the corresponding quiet NaN; a quiet NaN operand propagates without raising anything (the first NaN operand wins). In subset contexts (`extended=false`) finite operands longer than the precision are rounded first. Unless stated otherwise the result is the exact mathematical result rounded once, with the *ideal exponent* listed for the operation when the result is exact."
msgstr "本节中的每个函数都接受其操作数和一个 `GdaContext`，舍入到该上下文，并返回按[陷阱选择](#trap-selection)规则构建的 `GdaOutcome`。信号 NaN 操作数引发 `InvalidOperation` 并产生对应的静默 NaN；静默 NaN 操作数直接传播，不引发任何条件（第一个 NaN 操作数优先）。在子集上下文（`extended=false`）中，长于精度的有限操作数会先被舍入。除非另有说明，结果是精确数学结果只舍入一次所得；当结果精确时，其指数为该运算所列的*理想指数*。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:811
msgid "`to_number` is the GDA to-number conversion of a string."
msgstr "`to_number` 是对字符串进行的 GDA to-number 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:817
msgid "The literal keeps its exponent unless it must be rounded to the precision or clamped to the exponent range; overflow and underflow are decided from the exact exponent of the text, however large. Malformed text gives a quiet NaN with `ConversionSyntax`. In subset contexts infinities and NaNs are also a conversion-syntax error."
msgstr "字面量保留其指数，除非必须舍入到精度或钳制到指数范围；上溢与下溢依据文本的精确指数判定，无论其多大。格式错误的文本得到带 `ConversionSyntax` 的静默 NaN。在子集上下文中，无穷与 NaN 也属于转换语法错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:825
msgid "These round one operand to the context: `plus` is $0 + x$, `minus` is $0 - x$, `abs` is $|x|$, and `apply` is the plain conversion of a value to the context."
msgstr "这些函数将单个操作数舍入到上下文：`plus` 即 $0 + x$，`minus` 即 $0 - x$，`abs` 即 $|x|$，`apply` 则是将值直接转换到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:836
msgid "Ideal exponent: that of the operand. A zero result takes its sign from the GDA rule for a zero sum: `plus(x)` is $0 + x$ and `minus(x)` is $0 - x$, so `plus(-0)` and `minus(0)` are $-0$ under `Floor` and $+0$ in every other mode, while `plus(0)`, `minus(-0)` and `abs` of either zero are $+0$ (in a subset context every zero result is $+0$). `apply` keeps the sign of a zero and does not round subset operands first."
msgstr "理想指数：操作数的指数。零结果的符号遵循 GDA 关于零和的规则：`plus(x)` 为 $0 + x$，`minus(x)` 为 $0 - x$，因此 `plus(-0)` 和 `minus(0)` 在 `Floor` 下为 $-0$，在其他所有模式下为 $+0$；而 `plus(0)`、`minus(-0)` 以及任一零的 `abs` 都是 $+0$（在子集上下文中，所有零结果都是 $+0$）。`apply` 保留零的符号，且不会先舍入子集操作数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:845
msgid "These are the basic arithmetic operations; `fma(a, b, c)` is $a \\times b + c$ with a single rounding."
msgstr "这些是基本算术运算；`fma(a, b, c)` 是只舍入一次的 $a \\times b + c$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:856
msgid "Ideal exponents: $\\min(e_1, e_2)$ for `add` and `subtract`; $e_1 + e_2$ for `multiply`; $e_1 - e_2$ for `divide` (an inexact quotient has a full $p$-digit coefficient); for `fma`, the `add` rule applied to the exact product and the addend. An exact zero sum is $-0$ when both operands (for `subtract`, the first operand and the negated second) are negative, $+0$ when both are positive, and otherwise $+0$, or $-0$ under `Floor`; so `add(0, -0)` is `0` in `HalfEven` and `-0` in `Floor`, while `add(0, 0)` is `0` in every mode. Special cases: $\\infty - \\infty$, $0 \\times \\infty$ and $\\infty / \\infty$ are invalid; $x / 0$ is $\\pm\\infty$ with `DivisionByZero`; $0 / 0$ is NaN with `DivisionUndefined`; $x / \\infty$ is a zero with exponent $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ and `Clamped`. `fma` is invalid in a subset context."
msgstr "理想指数：`add` 和 `subtract` 为 $\\min(e_1, e_2)$；`multiply` 为 $e_1 + e_2$；`divide` 为 $e_1 - e_2$（不精确的商具有完整的 $p$ 位系数）；`fma` 则将 `add` 的规则应用于精确乘积与加数。精确的零和：当两个操作数（对 `subtract` 而言，是第一个操作数与取负后的第二个操作数）均为负时为 $-0$，均为正时为 $+0$，否则为 $+0$，在 `Floor` 下则为 $-0$；因此 `add(0, -0)` 在 `HalfEven` 下为 `0`，在 `Floor` 下为 `-0`，而 `add(0, 0)` 在所有模式下都为 `0`。特殊情形：$\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\times \\infty$ 与 $\\infty / \\infty$ 是无效的；$x / 0$ 为 $\\pm\\infty$ 并带 `DivisionByZero`；$0 / 0$ 为带 `DivisionUndefined` 的 NaN；$x / \\infty$ 是指数为 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 的零并带 `Clamped`。在子集上下文中 `fma` 是无效的。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:868
msgid "A far smaller addend is absorbed as a sticky unit below every rounding boundary of the sum, and a result is rounded to the subnormal grid only when its exact value is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$, so every one of these operations rounds once: at precision 7, `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` is `1598619`, and in decimal32 `multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` is `4.500005E-90` and `divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` is `1E-101`."
msgstr "远小得多的加数会被吸收为低于和的每个舍入边界的粘滞单位，并且只有当结果的精确值低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 时才会被舍入到次正规网格，因此这些运算都只舍入一次：精度为 7 时，`add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` 为 `1598619`；在 decimal32 中，`multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` 为 `4.500005E-90`，`divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` 为 `1E-101`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:877
msgid "These divide to an integer quotient."
msgstr "这些函数做除法得到整数商。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:885
msgid "`divide_integer` returns $q = \\operatorname{trunc}(x / y)$ with preferred exponent 0; `remainder` returns $x - q y$ (the sign of $x$); `remainder_near` returns $x - n y$ where $n$ is $x / y$ rounded to the nearest integer, ties to even. The remainder has ideal exponent $\\min(e_x, e_y)$. When $q$ (or $n$) needs more than $p$ digits the result is NaN with `DivisionImpossible`. A zero divisor gives `DivisionByZero` (`divide_integer` of a nonzero number) or `DivisionUndefined` ($0 / 0$); a zero divisor or an infinite dividend makes both remainders invalid; a finite dividend with an infinite divisor is its own remainder. In an extended clamped context, a zero quotient keeps its exact sign and is folded to $e_{\\max}-p+1$ when needed, raising `Clamped` without raising `Rounded` or `Inexact`."
msgstr "`divide_integer` 返回首选指数为 0 的 $q = \\operatorname{trunc}(x / y)$；`remainder` 返回 $x - q y$（符号与 $x$ 相同）；`remainder_near` 返回 $x - n y$，其中 $n$ 是将 $x / y$ 就近舍入（偶数优先）得到的整数。余数的理想指数为 $\\min(e_x, e_y)$。当 $q$（或 $n$）需要多于 $p$ 位数字时，结果为带 `DivisionImpossible` 的 NaN。除数为零时得到 `DivisionByZero`（非零数的 `divide_integer`）或 `DivisionUndefined`（$0 / 0$）；除数为零或被除数为无穷都会使两种余数无效；有限被除数除以无穷除数时，余数就是被除数本身。在扩展钳制上下文中，零商保留其精确符号，并在需要时折叠到 $e_{\\max}-p+1$，产生 `Clamped` 而不会产生 `Rounded` 或 `Inexact`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:899
msgid "These round a value to a prescribed exponent."
msgstr "这些函数将值舍入到指定的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:906
msgid "`quantize(x, q)` returns the value of $x$ with exponent $e_q$, rounded with the context mode (raising `Rounded`, and `Inexact` when digits are lost). `rescale(x, n)` does the same with exponent $n$, where $n$ must be an integer value. The result is invalid when the target exponent lies outside $[E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$ ($[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$ in subset contexts), when the result coefficient would need more than $p$ digits, or when exactly one operand is infinite. Two infinities give the infinity. A subnormal result raises `Subnormal` (and `Inexact` and `Rounded` when digits are lost) but never `Underflow`: in `decimal32`, `quantize(1.55E-100, 1E-101)` is `1.6E-100` with `Subnormal`, `Inexact` and `Rounded`."
msgstr "`quantize(x, q)` 返回指数为 $e_q$ 的 $x$ 的值，并以上下文模式舍入（引发 `Rounded`，丢失数字时还引发 `Inexact`）。`rescale(x, n)` 以指数 $n$ 做同样的事，其中 $n$ 必须是整数值。当目标指数位于 $[E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$（子集上下文中为 $[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$）之外、结果系数需要多于 $p$ 位数字，或恰有一个操作数为无穷时，结果无效。两个无穷得到该无穷。次正规结果会引发 `Subnormal`（丢失数字时还引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`），但从不引发 `Underflow`：在 `decimal32` 中，`quantize(1.55E-100, 1E-101)` 为 `1.6E-100`，并带 `Subnormal`、`Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:919
msgid "These round to an integer with the context rounding mode."
msgstr "这些函数以上下文舍入模式舍入到整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:926
msgid "A value with exponent $\\ge 0$ is already an integer and is returned unchanged, even when it is longer than $p$ digits (a `clamp` context still folds its exponent down). A value with negative exponent is quantized to exponent 0 at a working precision of $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$, as decNumber does, so the integral part is never rounded to $p$ digits: at precision 3, `12345.6` gives `12346`. `round_to_integral_exact` raises `Inexact` and `Rounded` when digits are dropped and `round_to_integral_value` never does. In a subset context the operand is first rounded to $p$ digits, with `LostDigits`, like every other operand."
msgstr "指数 $\\ge 0$ 的值已经是整数，原样返回，即使它长于 $p$ 位（`clamp` 上下文仍会把其指数折叠下来）。指数为负的值以 $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$ 的工作精度量化到指数 0，与 decNumber 的做法相同，因此整数部分从不被舍入到 $p$ 位：在精度 3 下，`12345.6` 得到 `12346`。丢弃数字时 `round_to_integral_exact` 引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`，而 `round_to_integral_value` 从不引发。在子集上下文中，操作数与其他所有操作数一样，先被舍入到 $p$ 位并带 `LostDigits`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:952
msgid "These are the correctly rounded square root, exponential, natural logarithm and base-10 logarithm."
msgstr "这些是正确舍入的平方根、指数函数、自然对数和以 10 为底的对数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:962
msgid "They always round half to even, whatever the context rounding mode. Exact results: `sqrt` of a perfect square has the ideal exponent $\\lfloor e/2 \\rfloor$; `exp(0) = 1`; `ln(1) = 0`; `log10` of a power of ten $10^k$ is the integer $k$ (rounded if $k$ has more than $p$ digits). Every other finite result is inexact with $p$ digits. Domain: the square root and logarithms of a negative number are invalid, $\\ln 0 = \\log_{10} 0 = -\\infty$ (invalid in a subset context), $\\exp(-\\infty) = 0$, and $+\\infty$ maps to $+\\infty$ for all four. `exp`, `ln` and `log10` raise `InvalidContext` unless $p$, $e_{\\max}$ and $-e_{\\min}$ are at most 999,999, and also for a nonzero operand with more than 999,999 digits or an adjusted exponent above 999,999 or below $-1\\,999\\,997$. If the certified evaluation cannot decide the rounding within its refinement budget the result is NaN with `InvalidOperation`. In a subset context, `ln` reproduces the result of the classic reference algorithm, which can exceed the correctly rounded result by one unit in the last place."
msgstr "无论上下文舍入模式为何，它们总是按半值取偶舍入。精确结果：完全平方数的 `sqrt` 具有理想指数 $\\lfloor e/2 \\rfloor$；`exp(0) = 1`；`ln(1) = 0`；10 的幂 $10^k$ 的 `log10` 为整数 $k$（若 $k$ 多于 $p$ 位则舍入）。其他所有有限结果都是不精确的，具有 $p$ 位数字。定义域：负数的平方根和对数是无效的，$\\ln 0 = \\log_{10} 0 = -\\infty$（在子集上下文中无效），$\\exp(-\\infty) = 0$，且四者都将 $+\\infty$ 映射为 $+\\infty$。除非 $p$、$e_{\\max}$ 和 $-e_{\\min}$ 都不超过 999,999，否则 `exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 会引发 `InvalidContext`；当非零操作数多于 999,999 位数字，或其调整后指数大于 999,999 或小于 $-1\\,999\\,997$ 时，也会如此。若认证求值无法在其细化预算内确定舍入，结果为带 `InvalidOperation` 的 NaN。在子集上下文中，`ln` 重现经典参考算法的结果，该结果可能比正确舍入的结果大一个末位单位。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:980
msgid "`power(x, y)` is $x^y$."
msgstr "`power(x, y)` 即 $x^y$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:986
msgid "For an integer $y$ the result is computed by binary powering with $p + \\operatorname{digits}(|y|) + 2$ working digits (one fewer in subset contexts) and then rounded with the context mode; an exact power that fits in $p$ digits is returned exactly with exponent $y \\cdot e_x$. For a non-integer $y$, $x$ must be positive (a negative base is invalid) and the result is certified to be correctly rounded *with the context rounding mode*; $y = 0.5$ is computed as a square root under the context rounding mode. The same context limits as for `exp` apply to non-integer exponents. Special cases follow GDA: $x^0 = 1$ (and $0^0$ is invalid), powers of $\\pm\\infty$ and $\\pm 0$ take their sign from the parity of an integer exponent, and $1^y = 1$. In a subset context $0^0$ is `1` and $0^{-n}$ is invalid instead of $\\infty$."
msgstr "对整数 $y$，结果通过二进制幂算法以 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(|y|) + 2$ 位工作精度（子集上下文中少一位）计算，然后以上下文模式舍入；能容纳于 $p$ 位的精确幂以指数 $y \\cdot e_x$ 精确返回。对非整数 $y$，$x$ 必须为正（负底数无效），并且结果经认证是*按上下文舍入模式*正确舍入的；$y = 0.5$ 按上下文舍入模式作为平方根计算。对非整数指数施加与 `exp` 相同的上下文限制。特殊情形遵循 GDA：$x^0 = 1$（而 $0^0$ 无效），$\\pm\\infty$ 和 $\\pm 0$ 的幂的符号取决于整数指数的奇偶性，且 $1^y = 1$。在子集上下文中，$0^0$ 为 `1`，$0^{-n}$ 是无效的，而不是 $\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:999
msgid "GDA treats every non-integer power as inexact, even when its exact value is representable: `power(4, 1.5)` at precision 5 is `8.0000` with `Inexact` and `Rounded` in every rounding mode. Such exact values (an exponent $a/q$ in lowest terms with $x$ a perfect $q$-th power) are decided before the certified loop, because they lie on the boundary of a directed rounding cell or on a midpoint, which the loop cannot certify. The specification allows an inexact power to be up to one unit in the last place in error; this package always returns the correctly rounded value, so `Down`, `Floor` and `ZeroFiveUp` give `8.0000` where libmpdec gives `7.9999`."
msgstr "GDA 把所有非整数次幂都视为不精确，即使其精确值可以表示：精度为 5 时，`power(4, 1.5)` 在每种舍入模式下都是 `8.0000`，并带有 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。这类精确值（指数为既约分数 $a/q$，且 $x$ 是完全 $q$ 次幂）在认证循环之前判定，因为它们落在定向舍入单元的边界上或中点上，循环无法认证。规范允许不精确的幂有至多一个末位单位的误差；本包始终返回正确舍入的值，因此 `Down`、`Floor` 和 `ZeroFiveUp` 给出 `8.0000`，而 libmpdec 给出 `7.9999`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1011
msgid "These are `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` with a second channel for \"the library could not certify this result\"."
msgstr "这些函数是 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power`，另有一条通道用于表示“库无法认证该结果”。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1021
msgid "Every case the specification defines (domain errors, signaling NaNs, a context beyond the supported exponent range, which `exp` and its siblings report as `invalid_context`) is an `Ok` outcome exactly as the plain function returns it. `Err` means the refinement limit or a resource bound stopped the computation, where the plain function reports `invalid_context` for want of a better condition."
msgstr "规范定义的每种情形（定义域错误、信号 NaN、超出所支持指数范围的上下文，`exp` 及其同类函数将后者报告为 `invalid_context`）都是与普通函数完全相同的 `Ok` 结果。`Err` 表示细化限制或资源上限使计算中止，此时普通函数因没有更合适的条件而报告 `invalid_context`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1030
msgid "`reduce` rounds to the context and removes trailing zeros."
msgstr "`reduce` 舍入到上下文并去除尾随零。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1036
msgid "A zero becomes $0$ with exponent 0 (keeping its sign in extended contexts). In a clamped context the exponent is not raised above $e_{\\max} - p + 1$."
msgstr "零变为指数为 0 的 $0$（在扩展上下文中保留其符号）。在钳制上下文中，指数不会被提高到 $e_{\\max} - p + 1$ 以上。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1041
msgid "These scale by a power of ten and extract the adjusted exponent."
msgstr "这些函数按 10 的幂进行缩放，并提取调整后指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1048
msgid "`scaleb(x, n)` returns $x \\cdot 10^n$ by adding $n$ to the exponent; $n$ must be an integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max} + p)$, otherwise the result is invalid. The result then goes through the shared finalization: a coefficient longer than $p$ digits is rounded, an overflow gives $\\pm\\infty$ or the largest finite number by rounding direction (in decimal32 under `Down`, `scaleb(9E+96, 1)` is `9.999999E+96`), and a zero result is clamped into the exponent range (`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` in decimal64 is `0E+369`). `logb(x)` returns $\\hat e$ as an integer; `logb(0)` is $-\\infty$ with `DivisionByZero` and `logb(±∞)` is $+\\infty$."
msgstr "`scaleb(x, n)` 通过将 $n$ 加到指数上返回 $x \\cdot 10^n$；$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max} + p)$ 的整数，否则结果无效。之后结果经过共享的最终化例程：长于 $p$ 位的系数会被舍入，上溢按舍入方向给出 $\\pm\\infty$ 或最大有限数（在 decimal32 的 `Down` 下，`scaleb(9E+96, 1)` 为 `9.999999E+96`），零结果会被钳制到指数范围内（在 decimal64 中，`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` 为 `0E+369`）。`logb(x)` 以整数形式返回 $\\hat e$；`logb(0)` 为带 `DivisionByZero` 的 $-\\infty$，`logb(±∞)` 为 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1060
msgid "These step to the adjacent representable value."
msgstr "这些函数步进到相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1068
msgid "`next_plus` returns the smallest representable number greater than $x$ in the context and `next_minus` the largest smaller one; from a zero they step to $\\pm 10^{E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}}$, and past the largest finite number they reach $\\pm\\infty$. Neither raises flags for finite results. `next_toward(x, y)` steps from $x$ towards $y$ (returning $x$, with the sign of $y$ for zeros, when they compare equal) and raises `Overflow`, or `Underflow` and `Subnormal`, together with `Inexact` and `Rounded`, when the step leaves the normal range."
msgstr "`next_plus` 返回上下文中大于 $x$ 的最小可表示数，`next_minus` 返回比它小的最大可表示数；从零出发时它们步进到 $\\pm 10^{E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}}$，越过最大有限数时到达 $\\pm\\infty$。对有限结果，二者都不引发标志。`next_toward(x, y)` 从 $x$ 朝 $y$ 步进（当二者比较相等时返回 $x$，对零则取 $y$ 的符号）；当这一步离开正规范围时，引发 `Overflow`，或 `Underflow` 和 `Subnormal`，并同时引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1078
msgid "These are digit-wise logical operations on *logical operands*: non-negative integers with exponent 0 whose digits are all 0 or 1."
msgstr "这些是对*逻辑操作数*（指数为 0、各位均为 0 或 1 的非负整数）的逐位逻辑运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1088
msgid "Each operand is read as exactly $p$ digits: shorter operands are padded with leading zeros and only the low $p$ digits of longer ones are used. `logical_invert` inverts all $p$ digits. Any other operand makes the result invalid."
msgstr "每个操作数都恰好按 $p$ 位读取：较短的操作数以前导零填充，较长的只使用其低 $p$ 位。`logical_invert` 对全部 $p$ 位取反。任何其他操作数都会使结果无效。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1095
msgid "These move the coefficient digits of $x$ by $n$ places within a window of $p$ digits."
msgstr "这些函数在 $p$ 位的窗口内将 $x$ 的系数数字移动 $n$ 位。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1103
msgid "$n$ must be an integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le p$, otherwise the result is invalid. A positive $n$ moves digits to the left. `shift` drops the digits that leave the window and fills with zeros; `rotate` moves them round to the other end. The exponent and sign are unchanged; an infinite $x$ is returned unchanged."
msgstr "$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le p$ 的整数，否则结果无效。正的 $n$ 将数字向左移动。`shift` 丢弃移出窗口的数字并以零填充；`rotate` 将它们循环移到另一端。指数与符号不变；无穷的 $x$ 原样返回。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1111
msgid "These compare two values."
msgstr "这些函数比较两个值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1120
msgid "`compare` returns the decimal $-1$, $0$ or $1$ by numeric value ($-0 = +0$, $2.50 = 2.5$), or a quiet NaN when an operand is a NaN (raising `InvalidOperation` only for a signaling NaN). `compare_signal` is the same but raises `InvalidOperation` for any NaN. `compare_total` returns $-1$, $0$ or $1$ in the GDA total order: by sign bit first, then, for positive values, $\\text{finite} < \\infty < \\text{sNaN} < \\text{NaN}$, finite values by numeric value and then by exponent (`2.50` < `2.5`), NaNs by payload; the order is reversed for negative values. `compare_total_magnitude` applies the total order to the absolute values. The total orders never raise flags in an extended context. In a subset context (`extended=false`) the operands are first rounded to the precision like every other operand (Appendix A), which raises `Rounded` and `LostDigits`; the [`Decimal` methods of the same names](#decimalcompare_total-decimalcompare_total_magnitude) compare the numbers as they are."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值返回十进制值 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$（$-0 = +0$，$2.50 = 2.5$），当某个操作数为 NaN 时返回静默 NaN（仅对信号 NaN 引发 `InvalidOperation`）。`compare_signal` 与之相同，但对任何 NaN 都引发 `InvalidOperation`。`compare_total` 按 GDA 全序返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$：先比较符号位，然后对正值有 $\\text{finite} < \\infty < \\text{sNaN} < \\text{NaN}$，有限值先按数值、再按指数排序（`2.50` < `2.5`），NaN 按载荷排序；对负值则顺序相反。`compare_total_magnitude` 对绝对值应用该全序。在扩展上下文中，全序比较从不引发标志。在子集上下文（`extended=false`）中，操作数与其他所有操作数一样，先被舍入到该精度（附录 A），这会引发 `Rounded` 和 `LostDigits`；同名的 [`Decimal` 方法](#decimalcompare_total-decimalcompare_total_magnitude) 则按原样比较这些数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1137
msgid "These are the GDA max and min operations, on values or on magnitudes."
msgstr "这些是 GDA 的 max 与 min 运算，作用于值或其大小。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1146
msgid "A single quiet NaN is ignored in favour of the number; two quiet NaNs give the first; a signaling NaN gives a quiet NaN with `InvalidOperation`. Values that compare equal are separated by the total order (so `max(2.5, 2.50)` is `2.5`); in a subset context the first operand is chosen instead. The selected operand is then rounded to the context as by `plus`, except that in an extended context a zero keeps its sign (`max(-0, -0)` is `-0` in every mode, while `plus(-0)` is `0` unless the rounding is `Floor`)."
msgstr "单个静默 NaN 会被忽略而取数值；两个静默 NaN 时取第一个；信号 NaN 产生带 `InvalidOperation` 的静默 NaN。比较相等的值由全序加以区分（因此 `max(2.5, 2.50)` 为 `2.5`）；在子集上下文中则改为选择第一个操作数。所选操作数随后像 `plus` 那样被舍入到上下文，只是在扩展上下文中零会保留其符号（`max(-0, -0)` 在每种模式下都为 `-0`，而 `plus(-0)` 除非舍入模式为 `Floor`，否则为 `0`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1156
msgid "These classify values under a context; they never raise conditions, so they always return `Completed` with the input context."
msgstr "这些函数在上下文下对值进行分类；它们从不引发条件，因此总是返回带输入上下文的 `Completed`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1165
msgid "They need the exponent limits of the context (`Emin`), which is why they are functions of the context; `same_quantum` uses no context and is a [`Decimal` method](#decimalsame_quantum)."
msgstr "它们需要上下文的指数限制（`Emin`），所以是以上下文为参数的函数；`same_quantum` 不使用上下文，是 [`Decimal` 的方法](#decimalsame_quantum)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1195
msgid "Ordering and plain arithmetic on values"
msgstr "值上的排序与普通算术"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1197
msgid "These methods and operators take no context. They never signal and never trap; use the GDA functions when flags matter."
msgstr "这些方法和运算符不接受上下文。它们从不发出信号，也从不触发陷阱；当标志重要时，请使用 GDA 函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1202
msgid "`compare` is a three-way numeric comparison that is total on all values; `compare_checked` refuses NaNs."
msgstr "`compare` 是对所有值都完全的三路数值比较；`compare_checked` 拒绝 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1212
msgid "`compare` orders finite values and infinities numerically with $-0 = +0$ and places every NaN equal to every other NaN and above every number, so it is a total preorder and sorting never aborts. `compare_checked` returns `Err(unordered_comparison)` when either operand is a NaN."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值对有限值和无穷排序，其中 $-0 = +0$，并使每个 NaN 与其他所有 NaN 相等且大于所有数，因此它是全预序，排序永不中止。当任一操作数为 NaN 时，`compare_checked` 返回 `Err(unordered_comparison)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1219
msgid "These are the `Eq` and `Compare` operator methods."
msgstr "这些是 `Eq` 与 `Compare` 的运算符方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1231
msgid "`==` is numeric equality on finite values ($2.50 = 2.5$, $-0 = +0$), sign equality on infinities, and true for any two NaNs. `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=` follow `compare`."
msgstr "`==` 对有限值是数值相等（$2.50 = 2.5$，$-0 = +0$），对无穷是符号相等，对任意两个 NaN 为真。`<`、`<=`、`>`、`>=` 遵循 `compare`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1237
msgid "These are the GDA total orders as plain methods, returning $-1$, $0$ or $1$."
msgstr "这些是以普通方法形式提供的 GDA 全序，返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1244
msgid "They agree with the package functions [`compare_total`, `compare_total_magnitude`](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude) (without subset operand rounding)."
msgstr "它们与包函数 [`compare_total`、`compare_total_magnitude`](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude) 一致（但不进行子集操作数舍入）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1250
msgid "These select between values without rounding."
msgstr "这些函数在值之间进行选择，不做舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1259
msgid "`min` and `max` return the other operand when one is a quiet NaN, the first NaN (quieted) when a signaling NaN is involved or both are NaN, and the receiver when the two compare equal. `clamp` returns `min` or `max` when the value lies outside $[\\min, \\max]$ and the value otherwise (a NaN value is returned unchanged); it aborts when a bound is NaN or `min > max`, where `clamp_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)`."
msgstr "当一个操作数为静默 NaN 时，`min` 和 `max` 返回另一个操作数；涉及信号 NaN 或两者均为 NaN 时，返回（静默化的）第一个 NaN；两者比较相等时返回接收者。当值位于 $[\\min, \\max]$ 之外时，`clamp` 返回 `min` 或 `max`，否则返回该值（NaN 值原样返回）；当某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时它会中止，而 `clamp_checked` 在这些情形下返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1268
msgid "These implement `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-` without a context."
msgstr "这些函数在无上下文的情况下实现 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 以及一元 `-`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1282
msgid "Each operator runs the free function of the same name in a private working context and returns its value: precision $P$, the larger precision attribute of the operands, half-even rounding, the extended rules, no clamp and no traps. The result is therefore a member of the cohort GDA prescribes: `+` and `-` keep the smaller exponent (`1.10 + 3.50` is `4.60`), `*` adds the exponents, `/` starts from the difference of the exponents and removes only the trailing zeros that exact quotients allow (`1.5 / 0.5` is `3`, `1.50 / 0.5` is `3.0`), and a product or a quotient with more than $P$ digits is rounded to $P$ digits (`*` is no longer exact). `x + 0 == x` and `x * 1 == x` hold because equality compares values, not members of the cohort, and for every stored finite value, because the working range below is the [stored range](#gda_value_e_max-gda_value_e_tiny)."
msgstr "每个运算符都在私有的工作上下文中运行同名的自由函数并返回其值：精度 $P$ 为操作数中较大的精度属性，半值取偶舍入，扩展规则，无钳制，无陷阱。因此结果是 GDA 规定的同值类成员：`+` 和 `-` 保留较小的指数（`1.10 + 3.50` 为 `4.60`），`*` 将指数相加，`/` 从指数之差出发，只去掉精确商所允许去掉的尾随零（`1.5 / 0.5` 为 `3`，`1.50 / 0.5` 为 `3.0`），位数多于 $P$ 的乘积或商舍入到 $P$ 位（`*` 不再是精确的）。`x + 0 == x` 和 `x * 1 == x` 成立，因为相等比较的是值，而不是同值类中的成员。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1294
msgid "The working exponent range cannot be built with [`GdaContext::new`](#gdacontextnew-gdacontexttry_new), because GDA limits the exponent range of a context to $\\pm 999{,}999{,}999$ and this one fills the `Int` range: the largest adjusted exponent is $2^{31}-2 = 2{,}147{,}483{,}646$ and the smallest exponent is $\\text{Etiny} = -2^{31}+3 = -2{,}147{,}483{,}645$ for every $P$ (so `Etiny` is always a valid `Int` exponent). A result above the range is a signed infinity (`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` is `inf`); one below it is rounded half to even to `Etiny`, possibly to a signed zero. Special values follow IEEE rules without signals: NaN operands give a quiet NaN, $\\infty - \\infty$, $0 \\times \\infty$, $0/0$ and $\\infty/\\infty$ give NaN, $x/0$ gives a signed infinity and $x/\\infty$ gives a signed zero. Use the free functions with a `GdaContext` when you need another precision, rounding, range or the signals. `neg` is [`Decimal::neg`](#decimalneg-decimalabs-decimalcopy-decimalcopy_abs-decimalcopy_negate-decimalcopy_sign)."
msgstr "作业指数范围无法用 [`GdaContext::new`](#gdacontextnew-gdacontexttry_new) 构造，因为 GDA 将上下文的指数范围限制在 $\\pm 999{,}999{,}999$ 之内，而这个范围占满了整个 `Int` 范围：对每个 $P$，最大调整指数为 $2^{31}-2 = 2{,}147{,}483{,}646$，最小指数为 $\\text{Etiny} = -2^{31}+3 = -2{,}147{,}483{,}645$（因此 `Etiny` 总是合法的 `Int` 指数）。高于该范围的结果为带符号的无穷（`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` 为 `inf`）；低于该范围的结果按半值取偶舍入到 `Etiny`，可能得到带符号的零。特殊值遵循 IEEE 规则但不发出信号：NaN 操作数产生静默 NaN，$\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\times \\infty$、$0/0$ 和 $\\infty/\\infty$ 产生 NaN，$x/0$ 产生带符号的无穷，$x/\\infty$ 产生带符号的零。需要其他精度、舍入、范围或信号时，请用自由函数并传入 `GdaContext`。`neg` 即 [`Decimal::neg`](#decimalneg-decimalabs-decimalcopy-decimalcopy_abs-decimalcopy_negate-decimalcopy_sign)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1311
msgid "`sqrt` is the square root in the same working context as the operators, with the value's own precision attribute."
msgstr "`sqrt` 是在与运算符相同的工作上下文中，以该值自身的精度属性求平方根。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1318
msgid "A negative operand gives NaN, as the free function [`sqrt`](#sqrt-exp-ln-log10) does. The checked forms are `sqrt_checked` and `DivChecked::div_checked`; the `Decimal::div_checked` method is removed (use `1 / 0` for the infinity, or `divide` with a trapping `GdaContext` for an error)."
msgstr "负操作数给出 NaN，与自由函数 [`sqrt`](#sqrt-exp-ln-log10) 相同。带检查的形式是 `sqrt_checked` 和 `DivChecked::div_checked`；`Decimal::div_checked` 方法已删除（要得到无穷请用 `1 / 0`，要得到错误请用带陷阱的 `GdaContext` 调用 `divide`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1343
msgid "`GdaInterchangeFormat` names the three IEEE 754 decimal interchange formats."
msgstr "`GdaInterchangeFormat` 指定三种 IEEE 754 十进制交换格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1355
msgid "`context` returns the extended default `GdaContext` of the format."
msgstr "`context` 返回该格式的扩展默认 `GdaContext`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1361
msgid "The presets are `GdaContext::decimal32()`, `decimal64()` and `decimal128()`: precision 7, 16 or 34, half-even, clamped."
msgstr "预设为 `GdaContext::decimal32()`、`decimal64()` 和 `decimal128()`：精度分别为 7、16、34，半值取偶，启用钳制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1366
msgid "`GdaInterchange` is a decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128 bit pattern in the densely packed decimal (DPD) encoding."
msgstr "`GdaInterchange` 是采用密集压缩十进制（DPD）编码的 decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128 比特模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1377
msgid "`format` returns the format of the pattern."
msgstr "`format` 返回该比特模式的格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1385
msgid "These encode and decode values."
msgstr "这些函数对值进行编码和解码。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1392
msgid "`from_decimal` rounds the value to the format (reporting the rounding, overflow, underflow and clamping flags) and encodes it. `to_decimal` decodes exactly, keeping the exponent and raising nothing; test the result with [`is_subnormal`](#class_name-is_normal-is_subnormal) when the flag is needed."
msgstr "`from_decimal` 将值舍入到该格式（报告舍入、上溢、下溢和钳制标志）并对其编码。`to_decimal` 精确解码，保留指数且不引发任何标志；需要该标志时，请用 [`is_subnormal`](#class_name-is_normal-is_subnormal) 检验结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1397
msgid "A NaN is encoded with its sign, its signaling bit and its payload. The payload of a decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128 pattern has 6, 15 or 33 digits (the trailing significand field, IEEE 754-2019 3.5.2). A payload that is wider keeps its low digits and no flag is raised: IEEE 754-2019 6.2.3 asks that a conversion that cannot preserve the payload return a quiet NaN carrying some language-defined diagnostic information, and names no signal. The decTest interchange rows have no payload wider than their format."
msgstr "NaN 以其符号、信号位和载荷编码。decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128 编码的载荷分别有 6、15 或 33 位数字（后随有效数字字段，IEEE 754-2019 3.5.2）。更宽的载荷保留其低位数字，且不引发任何标志：IEEE 754-2019 6.2.3 要求，无法保留载荷的转换应返回一个带有某种语言自定诊断信息的静默 NaN，并未指定任何信号。decTest 的互换格式行中没有比其格式更宽的载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1407
msgid "These convert between a bit pattern and its hexadecimal text."
msgstr "这些函数在比特模式与其十六进制文本之间转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1414
msgid "The text is `#` (optional on input) followed by exactly 8, 16 or 32 hexadecimal digits; surrounding spaces are ignored and any other input gives `Err(parse_error)`. `to_hex` prints `#` and uppercase digits."
msgstr "文本为 `#`（输入时可选）后跟恰好 8、16 或 32 个十六进制数字；两侧空格被忽略，其他任何输入都得到 `Err(parse_error)`。`to_hex` 打印 `#` 和大写数字。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1420
msgid "These canonicalize an encoding."
msgstr "这些函数将编码规范化。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1427
msgid "`canonical` decodes and re-encodes the pattern, which replaces non-canonical declets and payloads with their canonical form; `is_canonical` tests whether that changes the pattern."
msgstr "`canonical` 对比特模式解码后重新编码，从而将非规范的 declet 和载荷替换为其规范形式；`is_canonical` 检测这样做是否会改变比特模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1433
msgid "These operate on the sign bit of the encoding without decoding it."
msgstr "这些函数直接操作编码的符号位，而无需解码。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1442
msgid "`copy_sign` aborts when the two patterns have different formats."
msgstr "当两个比特模式的格式不同时，`copy_sign` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1462
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` methods of the enums and flag sets."
msgstr "这些是枚举和标志集的派生 `Eq` 方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1477
msgid "They compare field by field (or variant by variant); `GdaContext` has no `Eq`. `Decimal` has its own numeric `Eq`, documented under [`Decimal::equal`](#decimalequal-decimalnot_equal-decimalop_lt-decimalop_le-decimalop_gt-decimalop_ge)."
msgstr "它们逐字段（或逐变体）比较；`GdaContext` 没有 `Eq`。`Decimal` 有自己的数值 `Eq`，见 [`Decimal::equal`](#decimalequal-decimalnot_equal-decimalop_lt-decimalop_le-decimalop_gt-decimalop_ge)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1483
msgid "These implement the `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` contextual traits on top of the package's private engine."
msgstr "这些函数在本包私有引擎之上实现 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 contextual trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1503
msgid "Each converts the arithmetic context to an engine context, runs the operation, and returns `Err(unsupported)` when the operation raises `invalid_context`, `Err(division_by_zero)` when `division_by_zero` is raised, `Err(domain_error)` for any other error flag, and otherwise `Ok` with the value and diagnostics `inexact`, `rounded`, `overflow`, `underflow`, `subnormal` and `clamped`. The rounding is one of the five `ArithmeticContext` modes, and `sqrt_contextual` and `exp_contextual` round with it (not half-even as the GDA functions do)."
msgstr "每个函数都把 arithmetic 上下文转换为引擎上下文并执行运算：若运算引发了 `invalid_context` 则返回 `Err(unsupported)`，若引发了 `division_by_zero` 则返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，若引发了其他错误标志则返回 `Err(domain_error)`，否则返回带值及诊断信息 `inexact`、`rounded`、`overflow`、`underflow`、`subnormal` 和 `clamped` 的 `Ok`。舍入是 `ArithmeticContext` 的五种模式之一，`sqrt_contextual` 和 `exp_contextual` 以该模式舍入（而不像 GDA 函数那样采用半值取偶）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1512
msgid "`exp_contextual` requires the caller to set the exponent bounds. Like the GDA `exp`, it is defined only for precision, $e_{\\max}$ and $-e_{\\min}$ of at most $999\\,999$, and an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` or `e_max` is not given bounds by default: it translates to the full range $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, which is an invalid context for `exp`. The result is `Err(unsupported)` whose message starts with `invalid context:`, states the limit and names the bounds the `ArithmeticContext` does not set, whatever the operand (as `exp(-Infinity)` is `Invalid_context` in the decTest row `expx901`). `ArithmeticContext::new(16)` therefore fails, while `ArithmeticContext::new(16, e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999)` and `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` work."
msgstr "`exp_contextual` 要求调用者设置指数边界。与 GDA 的 `exp` 一样，它只对精度、$e_{\\max}$ 和 $-e_{\\min}$ 都不超过 $999\\,999$ 的上下文有定义；未设置 `e_min` 或 `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 不会得到默认边界，而是转换为完整范围 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$，这对 `exp` 是无效上下文。此时结果为 `Err(unsupported)`，其消息以 `invalid context:` 开头，说明该限制，并指出 `ArithmeticContext` 未设置的边界；与操作数无关（如同 decTest 行 `expx901` 中 `exp(-Infinity)` 为 `Invalid_context`）。因此 `ArithmeticContext::new(16)` 会失败，而 `ArithmeticContext::new(16, e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999)` 和 `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` 可以正常工作。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1545
msgid "These implement `NumericFormatContextual`: they describe the number format of an `ArithmeticContext`."
msgstr "这些函数实现 `NumericFormatContextual`：它们描述 `ArithmeticContext` 的数值格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1558
msgid "`epsilon_contextual` is $\\operatorname{next\\_plus}(1) - 1 = 10^{1-p}$, `min_normal_contextual` is $10^{e_{\\min}}$ and `max_finite_contextual` is $(10^p - 1) \\cdot 10^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$."
msgstr "`epsilon_contextual` 为 $\\operatorname{next\\_plus}(1) - 1 = 10^{1-p}$，`min_normal_contextual` 为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$，`max_finite_contextual` 为 $(10^p - 1) \\cdot 10^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1564
msgid "These implement the checked traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`: they return `Result` instead of flags."
msgstr "`parse_checked` 将 arithmetic 上下文转换为 `DecimalContext` 并使用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx`；上下文的精度、舍入方向、指数边界和 clamp 设置均会生效。它返回转换后的值；溢出等条件仍可从 `from_string_ctx` 获取。语法无效时返回 `Err(parse_error)`。 `sqrt_checked` 对负操作数返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`pow_int_checked` 和 `pow_nat_checked` 以精确转换的整数指数（至少十位数字，足以容纳每个可接受的指数）调用 `power_ctx`，因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`；它们对零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`；当 `power` 引发 `invalid_context` 时（在指数边界不在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内的上下文下使用大于 999,999,999 的正指数，如 decTest 行 `powx1183` 和 `powx1184`）返回带 `invalid context:` 消息的 `Err(unsupported)`；对其他无效结果返回 `Err(domain_error)`；且 `pow_nat_checked` 对大于 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`DivChecked::div_checked` 在给定上下文下做除法，其错误与 [`Decimal::div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-decimalsqrt) 相同。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1579
msgid "`parse_checked` converts the arithmetic context to an engine context and converts the string under it; the context's precision, rounding direction, exponent bounds and clamp setting apply. It returns the converted value; conditions such as overflow are available from [`to_number`](#to_number). Invalid syntax returns `Err(parse_error)`. `sqrt_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)` for negative operands. `pow_int_checked` and `pow_nat_checked` call the power operation with the integer exponent converted exactly (with at least ten digits, which hold every accepted exponent), so at precision 7 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` is `-1`; they return `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero base with a negative exponent, `Err(unsupported)` with an `invalid context:` message when `power` raises `invalid_context` (a positive exponent above 999,999,999 under a context without exponent bounds within $\\pm 999\\,999$, as in the decTest rows `powx1183` and `powx1184`), `Err(domain_error)` for other invalid results, and `pow_nat_checked` returns `Err(unsupported)` for exponents above 999,999,999. `DivChecked::div_checked` divides under the given context and returns `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero divisor and `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid division."
msgstr "`parse_checked` 将 arithmetic 上下文转换为引擎上下文，并在其下转换字符串；上下文的精度、舍入方向、指数边界和 clamp 设置均会生效。它返回转换后的值；溢出等条件可从 [`to_number`](#to_number) 获取。语法无效时返回 `Err(parse_error)`。 `sqrt_checked` 对负操作数返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`pow_int_checked` 和 `pow_nat_checked` 以精确转换的整数指数（至少十位数字，足以容纳每个可接受的指数）调用乘幂运算，因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`；它们对零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`；当 `power` 引发 `invalid_context` 时（在指数边界不在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内的上下文下使用大于 999,999,999 的正指数，如 decTest 行 `powx1183` 和 `powx1184`）返回带 `invalid context:` 消息的 `Err(unsupported)`；对其他无效结果返回 `Err(domain_error)`；且 `pow_nat_checked` 对大于 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`DivChecked::div_checked` 在给定上下文下做除法，对零除数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效除法返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1598
msgid "`FromNat`, `FromInteger` and the `luna-generic` algebra traits"
msgstr "`FromNat`、`FromInteger` 与 `luna-generic` 代数 trait"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1600
msgid "These let generic algebra code use `Decimal`."
msgstr "这些实现使泛型代数代码能够使用 `Decimal`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1614
msgid "`FromNat::from_natural` and `FromInteger::from_integer` are the canonical maps out of the naturals and the integers; `Decimal` has no inherent method of those names, call the trait method, or `Decimal::from_bigint(n).normalized()`, which is what they compute. They convert with `Decimal::from_bigint` (34 digits, trailing zeros removed), so they are exact only for integers of at most 34 significant digits. To convert another Luna-Flow integer type, pick its representative with `Integral::normalize` first, or use `lift_to`. `Zero::zero` and `One::one` are `Decimal::zero()` and `Decimal::one()`. The ring structure uses the context-free operators; because `+` rounds to the operand precision, the ring laws hold exactly only while sums stay within that precision."
msgstr "`FromNat::from_natural` 和 `FromInteger::from_integer` 是从自然数和整数出发的典范映射；`Decimal` 没有这些名字的固有方法，请调用 trait 方法，或 `Decimal::from_bigint(n).normalized()`，它们计算的就是这个。它们用 `Decimal::from_bigint` 转换（34 位，去除尾随零），因此只对至多 34 位有效数字的整数是精确的。要转换其他 Luna-Flow 整数类型，请先用 `Integral::normalize` 取其代表元，或使用 `lift_to`。`Zero::zero` 和 `One::one` 即 `Decimal::zero()` 和 `Decimal::one()`。环结构使用无上下文的运算符；由于 `+` 会舍入到操作数精度，只有当和保持在该精度之内时，环公理才精确成立。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1623
msgid "`Decimal::to_repr` and the `@def.Floating`, `Show` and `Debug` implementations"
msgstr "`Decimal::to_repr` 以及 `@def.Floating`、`Show` 与 `Debug` 的实现"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1625
msgid "`Decimal` implements the floating vocabulary of the `def` package, `Show` (see [`Decimal::to_string`](#decimalto_string-decimaloutput)) and `Debug`."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `def` 包的浮点词汇、`Show`（参见 [`Decimal::to_string`](#decimalto_string-decimaloutput)）以及 `Debug`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1633
msgid "The `Floating` methods are `classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized`, documented above. `to_repr` is the structural `Debug` representation."
msgstr "`Floating` 方法为 `classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized`，均已在上文说明。`to_repr` 是结构化的 `Debug` 表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda_checked API"
msgstr "decimal_gda_checked API"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:5
msgid "`decimal_gda_checked` provides `GdaDecimalChecked`, a pipeline over the General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA) operations of [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md). It holds exactly one `GdaOutcome[Decimal]`: the current defined value, the next context (whose sticky `status` accumulates every signal raised so far), the signals raised by the latest operation, and, if a trap fired, the trapped signal. An operation on a completed state runs the GDA operation with the stored context; an operation on a trapped state does nothing. `resume_defined()` is the only way to continue after a trap. The right operand of a binary operation is a pipeline too: its conditions join the result and its trap short-circuits (see [Operations](#operations)). The package never produces an `ArithmeticError`. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md) walks through traps and recovery; the [design page](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) models the pipeline as a state monad with an absorbing trap and proves the sticky-status laws."
msgstr "`decimal_gda_checked` 提供 `GdaDecimalChecked`，即基于 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 中通用十进制算术（GDA）运算的流水线。它恰好持有一个 `GdaOutcome[Decimal]`：当前的定义值、下一个上下文（其粘滞的 `status` 累积迄今为止引发的所有信号）、最近一次运算引发的信号，以及（若有陷阱触发）被捕获的信号。对已完成状态执行运算时，会在所存储的上下文下执行相应的 GDA 运算；对已陷入陷阱的状态执行运算则不做任何事。`resume_defined()` 是陷阱触发后继续执行的唯一途径。二元运算的右操作数也是流水线：其条件并入结果，其陷阱会使运算短路（见[运算](#operations)）。本包从不产生 `ArithmeticError`。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md) 逐步讲解陷阱与恢复；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) 将该流水线建模为带吸收性陷阱的状态单子，并证明了粘滞状态的定律。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:22
msgid "Add both packages to your `moon.pkg`; the pipeline takes `decimal_gda` values and contexts:"
msgstr "将这两个包都添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中；该流水线接受 `decimal_gda` 的值和上下文："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:32
msgid "The examples call the packages through the aliases `@decimal_gda.` and `@decimal_gda_checked.`, and list GDA flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@decimal_gda.` 和 `@decimal_gda_checked.` 调用这些包，并用以下辅助函数列出 GDA 标志："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:56
msgid "`GdaDecimalChecked` wraps one `GdaOutcome[@decimal_gda.Decimal]`."
msgstr "`GdaDecimalChecked` 包装一个 `GdaOutcome[@decimal_gda.Decimal]`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:64
msgid "The outcome is either `Completed(value, next_context, raised)` or `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`; see `GdaOutcome` in the [`decimal_gda` API](decimal_gda.md)."
msgstr "结果为 `Completed(value, next_context, raised)` 或 `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)` 之一；参见 [`decimal_gda` API](decimal_gda.md) 中的 `GdaOutcome`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:72
msgid "`from_outcome(outcome)` wraps the outcome of any `decimal_gda` operation."
msgstr "`from_outcome(outcome)` 包装任意 `decimal_gda` 运算的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:78
msgid "A `Trapped` outcome gives a trapped pipeline."
msgstr "`Trapped` 结果会得到一个已陷入陷阱的流水线。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:82
msgid "`from_decimal(value, context)` rounds a value into the context with the GDA `apply` operation (the *plus*-like conversion to the context)."
msgstr "`from_decimal(value, context)` 通过 GDA `apply` 运算将值舍入到上下文中（即类似 *plus* 的、转换到该上下文的操作）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:89
msgid "The signals of the rounding are raised, merged into the status and checked against the traps, so construction itself can trap."
msgstr "舍入所引发的信号会被引发、合并到状态中并与陷阱比对，因此构造本身也可能触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:94
msgid "`to_number(source, context)` is the GDA *to-number* conversion of a string."
msgstr "`to_number(source, context)` 是 GDA 中字符串的 *to-number* 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:100
msgid "An invalid string gives NaN with `conversion_syntax`; because GDA treats conversion syntax as an invalid-operation condition, a context that traps `InvalidOperation` (such as `GdaContext::basic_default()`) traps it."
msgstr "无效字符串会得到 NaN 并伴随 `conversion_syntax`；由于 GDA 将转换语法错误视为一种无效运算条件，捕获 `InvalidOperation` 的上下文（例如 `GdaContext::basic_default()`）会对其触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:108
msgid "These methods return the wrapped outcome and its components."
msgstr "这些方法返回所包装的结果及其各组成部分。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:118
msgid "`value()` is the defined result, also when trapped. `context()` is the next context, including its updated status and its traps. `raised()` holds the signals of the latest operation only. `status()` is `context().status()`, the sticky union of everything raised since the context's status was last cleared; whenever any invalid-operation condition (`conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined`, `invalid_context`) is raised, the status also gets `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "`value()` 是定义结果，在陷入陷阱时亦然。`context()` 是下一个上下文，包括其更新后的状态及陷阱设置。`raised()` 仅保存最近一次运算的信号。`status()` 为 `context().status()`，即自上下文状态上次清除以来所引发的全部信号的粘滞并集；每当引发任何无效运算条件（`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined`、`invalid_context`）时，状态中也会加入 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:128
msgid "These report whether a trap fired and which signal it was."
msgstr "这些方法报告是否有陷阱触发以及触发的是哪个信号。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:137
msgid "`error()` is the trapped signal or `None`; `result()` is `Ok(value)` for a completed pipeline and `Err(signal)` for a trapped one (`value()` still gives the defined result of a trapped pipeline). The error type is `GdaSignal`, not `ArithmeticError`: a trap is the failure channel of this tier, and the signal says which of the nine signals it was. These are the names `DecimalChecked` uses. When several raised signals are trapped at once, the reported one is the first in the priority order `InvalidOperation`, `DivisionByZero`, `Overflow`, `Underflow`, `Subnormal`, `Inexact`, `Rounded`, `Clamped`, `LostDigits`."
msgstr "`error()` 是被捕获的信号，或为 `None`；`result()` 对已完成的流水线为 `Ok(value)`，对已陷入陷阱的流水线为 `Err(signal)`（`value()` 仍给出已陷入陷阱的流水线的定义结果）。错误类型是 `GdaSignal`，而不是 `ArithmeticError`：陷阱是本层的失败通道，信号说明触发的是九种信号中的哪一种。这些是 `DecimalChecked` 使用的名字。当多个引发的信号同时被捕获时，报告的是优先级顺序 `InvalidOperation`、`DivisionByZero`、`Overflow`、`Underflow`、`Subnormal`、`Inexact`、`Rounded`、`Clamped`、`LostDigits` 中的第一个。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:146
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "恢复"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:150
msgid "`resume_defined()` continues a trapped pipeline with its defined result."
msgstr "`resume_defined()` 以已陷入陷阱的流水线的定义结果继续执行。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:156
msgid "On `Trapped(signal, value, context, raised)` it returns `Completed(value, context, GdaFlags::new())`: the value and the context (with its status, which already contains the trapped signal) are kept, the trap marker and the latest-step flags are dropped. On a completed pipeline it does nothing. Traps stay enabled in the context, so the same condition traps again if it recurs."
msgstr "对于 `Trapped(signal, value, context, raised)`，它返回 `Completed(value, context, GdaFlags::new())`：值和上下文（其状态中已包含被捕获的信号）被保留，陷阱标记和最近一步的标志被丢弃。对于已完成的流水线，它不做任何事。陷阱在上下文中保持启用，因此同一条件若再次出现会再次触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:193
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:42
msgid "Operations"
msgstr "运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:195
msgid "Every operation method applies the `decimal_gda` function of the same name to the current value under the stored context; `remainder` is the GDA `remainder` (truncating) and `remainder_near` the nearest one."
msgstr "每个运算方法都在所存储的上下文下，对当前值应用 `decimal_gda` 中的同名函数；`remainder` 是 GDA 的 `remainder`（截断），`remainder_near` 是最近的余数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:199
msgid "On `Completed(v, c, _)` the method returns the outcome of `@decimal_gda.op(v, …, c)`; on `Trapped` it returns the state unchanged. The other operands (`other`, `multiplier`, `addend`, `exponent`, `quantum`, `divisor`, `target`, `count`) are pipelines too, so that the conditions of the pipeline that produced them are not lost. Rules for a binary operation `a.op(b)`:"
msgstr "对于 `Completed(v, c, _)`，该方法返回 `@decimal_gda.op(v, …, c)` 的结果；对于 `Trapped`，它原样返回状态。其他操作数（`other`、`multiplier`、`addend`、`exponent`、`quantum`、`divisor`、`target`、`count`）也是流水线，这样产生它们的流水线所引发的条件就不会丢失。二元运算 `a.op(b)` 的规则："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:204
msgid "If `a` is trapped, the result is `a`."
msgstr "若 `a` 已陷入陷阱，结果就是 `a`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:205
msgid "Otherwise, if `b` is trapped, no operation runs: the result keeps the value and the context of `a`, the conditions of `b` join `raised` and the status, and the trap of `b` is the trap of the result."
msgstr "否则，若 `b` 已陷入陷阱，则不执行运算：结果保留 `a` 的值和上下文，`b` 的条件并入 `raised` 和状态，`b` 的陷阱就是结果的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:208
msgid "Otherwise the operation runs under the context of `a`, and the conditions that `b` raised join `raised` of the result and the status of its context. The traps of `a` are not tested against the conditions of `b`: `b` decided its own."
msgstr "否则，运算在 `a` 的上下文下执行，`b` 引发的条件并入结果的 `raised` 及其上下文的状态。`a` 的陷阱不会对 `b` 的条件进行检测：`b` 已自行决定了它的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:212
msgid "`fma` applies the same rules to its two operands. The GDA operation computes the result under `c`'s precision, rounding, exponent limits, clamping and extended mode; if it raises no signal the context is passed on unchanged with empty `raised`; otherwise the raised signals are merged into the status of the next context and, if one of them is enabled in `c.traps()`, the outcome is `Trapped`. The mathematical functions `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` with a non-integer exponent need precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$; otherwise they return NaN with `invalid_context`, which an `InvalidOperation` trap catches."
msgstr "`fma` 对它的两个操作数应用同样的规则。GDA 运算在 `c` 的精度、舍入、指数界限、钳制和扩展模式下计算结果；若未引发任何信号，则上下文原样传递且 `raised` 为空；否则，引发的信号会合并到下一个上下文的状态中，若其中有信号在 `c.traps()` 中启用，结果即为 `Trapped`。数学函数 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 以及带非整数指数的 `power` 要求精度和指数界限位于 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 之内；否则返回 NaN 并伴随 `invalid_context`，`InvalidOperation` 陷阱会捕获它。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:222
msgid "The operations that return a number are all here: `apply`, `plus`, `minus`, `abs`, `add`, `subtract`, `multiply`, `divide`, `divide_integer`, `fma`, `remainder`, `remainder_near`, `power`, `sqrt`, `exp`, `ln`, `log10`, `quantize`, `rescale`, `reduce`, `round_to_integral_exact`, `round_to_integral_value`, `scaleb`, `shift`, `rotate`, `logb`, `logical_and`, `logical_or`, `logical_xor`, `logical_invert`, `next_minus`, `next_plus`, `next_toward`, `compare`, `compare_signal`, `max`, `min`, `max_magnitude` and `min_magnitude`. The functions of `decimal_gda` that return a string, a boolean or an integer (`class_name`, `is_normal`, `is_subnormal`, `compare_total`, `compare_total_magnitude`) and the `try_` forms are called on `value()` and `context()`."
msgstr "返回数的运算在这里都有：`apply`、`plus`、`minus`、`abs`、`add`、`subtract`、`multiply`、`divide`、`divide_integer`、`fma`、`remainder`、`remainder_near`、`power`、`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln`、`log10`、`quantize`、`rescale`、`reduce`、`round_to_integral_exact`、`round_to_integral_value`、`scaleb`、`shift`、`rotate`、`logb`、`logical_and`、`logical_or`、`logical_xor`、`logical_invert`、`next_minus`、`next_plus`、`next_toward`、`compare`、`compare_signal`、`max`、`min`、`max_magnitude` 和 `min_magnitude`。`decimal_gda` 中返回字符串、布尔值或整数的函数（`class_name`、`is_normal`、`is_subnormal`、`compare_total`、`compare_total_magnitude`）以及 `try_` 形式，请对 `value()` 和 `context()` 调用。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:259
msgid "These round or change the sign of the current value: `apply` is the GDA conversion to the context, `plus` is $0 + x$, `minus` is $0 - x$ and `abs` is $|x|$."
msgstr "这些函数对当前值进行舍入或改变其符号：`apply` 是到上下文的 GDA 转换，`plus` 为 $0 + x$，`minus` 为 $0 - x$，`abs` 为 $|x|$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:272
msgid "These combine the current value with the pipelines `b` and `c`; `fma(b, c)` is $v \\times b + c$ with one rounding."
msgstr "这些函数将当前值与流水线 `b` 和 `c` 组合；`fma(b, c)` 为只舍入一次的 $v \\times b + c$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:285
msgid "These are the GDA elementary functions of the current value; `power(y)` is $v^y$."
msgstr "这些是当前值的 GDA 初等函数；`power(y)` 为 $v^y$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:298
msgid "These set the exponent, take a remainder or remove trailing zeros. The other operations of the list above have the shape of these: one pipeline for a unary one and `(Self, Self) -> Self` for a binary one."
msgstr "这些函数设置指数、取余数或去掉尾随零。上面列表中的其他运算与它们形状相同：一元运算接受一个流水线，二元运算是 `(Self, Self) -> Self`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:310
msgid "These step to an adjacent representable value."
msgstr "这些函数步进到相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/def.md:1
msgid "def API"
msgstr "def API"

#: manual/api/def.md:5
msgid "`def` is the shared vocabulary of the `floating` packages. It defines the sign classification `Sign`, the ten-valued IEEE class `IeeeClass`, the four-way comparison result `PartialOrder`, the `Floating` trait that every scalar representation of this repository implements, four generic predicates built on that trait, and re-exports the context, rounding, classification and error types of [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) so that callers need only one import. It contains no arithmetic. The [tutorial](../tutorial/def.md) shows the vocabulary in use; the [design page](../design/def.md) states the trait laws and explains why `PartialOrder` is not a total order."
msgstr "`def` 是 `floating` 各包的共享词汇。它定义了符号分类 `Sign`、十值的 IEEE 类别 `IeeeClass`、四路比较结果 `PartialOrder`、本仓库中每种标量表示都实现的 trait `Floating`、基于该 trait 构建的四个泛型谓词，并重新导出 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 中的上下文、舍入、分类和错误类型，使调用者只需一次导入。它不包含任何算术运算。[教程](../tutorial/def.md) 展示了这些词汇的用法；[设计页面](../design/def.md) 陈述了 trait 定律，并解释了为何 `PartialOrder` 不是全序。"

#: manual/api/def.md:18
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`, next to the representation you use:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中，与你所用的表示放在一起："

#: manual/api/def.md:27
msgid "The examples on this page are complete tests. They call the package as `@def.`, the representations as `@bin_float.`, `@decimal.`, `@decimal_gda.` and `@ball_float.`, and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@lf_arith.`."
msgstr "本页示例都是完整的测试。它们以 `@def.` 调用该包，以 `@bin_float.`、`@decimal.`、`@decimal_gda.` 和 `@ball_float.` 调用各表示，并以 `@lf_arith.` 调用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:31
msgid "Sign and comparison results"
msgstr "符号与比较结果"

#: manual/api/def.md:35
msgid "`Sign` is the three-way sign classification returned by `Floating::sign`."
msgstr "`Sign` 是 `Floating::sign` 返回的三路符号分类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:45
msgid "`Zero` is returned for both signed zeros, so `Sign` does not distinguish $-0$ from $+0$; use the concrete package (for example `BinFloat::is_negative_zero`) when the sign bit of a zero matters. The scalar implementations also return `Zero` for every NaN (see [`Floating::sign`](#floatingsign)). `Sign` is also the payload of `SemanticScalar::Infinity` in the [`semantic`](semantic.md) package and the argument of constructors such as `BinFloat::inf`."
msgstr "两种带符号零都返回 `Zero`，因此 `Sign` 不区分 $-0$ 与 $+0$；当零的符号位很重要时，请使用具体的包（例如 `BinFloat::is_negative_zero`）。标量实现对每个 NaN 也返回 `Zero`（参见 [`Floating::sign`](#floatingsign)）。`Sign` 也是 [`semantic`](semantic.md) 包中 `SemanticScalar::Infinity` 的载荷，以及 `BinFloat::inf` 等构造函数的参数。"

#: manual/api/def.md:64
msgid "`IeeeClass` is the ten-valued `class` of IEEE 754-2019 clause 5.7.2. Unlike `FpClass` it separates the two NaNs, the sign of every class and the normal, subnormal and zero cases."
msgstr "`IeeeClass` 是 IEEE 754-2019 第 5.7.2 条的十值 `class`。与 `FpClass` 不同，它区分两种 NaN、每个类别的符号，以及正规、次正规和零。"

#: manual/api/def.md:83
msgid "`BinFloat::class_of` and `Decimal::class_of` return it. Normal and subnormal depend on the format's $e_{\\min}$, so both take the context that fixes it."
msgstr "`BinFloat::class_of` 和 `Decimal::class_of` 返回它。正规与次正规取决于格式的 $e_{\\min}$，所以两者都接受确定它的上下文。"

#: manual/api/def.md:98
msgid "`PartialOrder` is the result of an IEEE 754 comparison: exactly one of the four mutually exclusive relations *less*, *equal*, *greater* and *unordered* holds between two floating-point data."
msgstr "`PartialOrder` 是 IEEE 754 比较的结果：两个浮点数据之间恰好成立 *小于*、*等于*、*大于* 和 *无序* 这四种互斥关系之一。"

#: manual/api/def.md:111
msgid "`Unordered` holds exactly when at least one operand is NaN; $-0$ and $+0$ compare `Equal`. The type is returned by `BinFloat::compare_quiet` and `BinFloat::compare_signaling` in [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) (each paired with the flags of the comparison). It is a value type only; `def` performs no comparison itself. Why four results and not a `Compare` instance is derived in the [design page](../design/def.md#partialorder-is-the-ieee-four-way-relation)."
msgstr "当且仅当至少一个操作数为 NaN 时 `Unordered` 成立；$-0$ 和 $+0$ 比较 `Equal`。该类型由 [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) 中的 `BinFloat::compare_quiet` 和 `BinFloat::compare_signaling` 返回（各自附带该比较的标志）。它仅是一个值类型；`def` 本身不执行任何比较。为何是四种结果而非 `Compare` 实例，其推导见[设计页面](../design/def.md#partialorder-is-the-ieee-four-way-relation)。"

#: manual/api/def.md:136
msgid "The `Floating` trait"
msgstr "`Floating` trait"

#: manual/api/def.md:140
msgid "`Floating` is the observation and re-precision interface shared by every representation in this repository."
msgstr "`Floating` 是本仓库中所有表示共享的观察与重设精度接口。"

#: manual/api/def.md:153
msgid "`Floating` is implemented by the scalar types of this library only: `@bin_float.BinFloat`, `@decimal.Decimal` and `@decimal_gda.Decimal`. `@ball_float.BallFloat` does not implement it (see [Intervals are not `Floating`](../design/def.md#intervals-are-not-floating)). It is not an extension point: implementing it for a type outside this module is not supported and is not covered by the compatibility promise, because methods may be added to the trait in a minor release. It is declared `pub(open)` only because the implementations are in other packages of this module (the [design page](../design/def.md#why-floating-is-declared-open) gives the reason). Since the MoonBit 0.10 migration trait methods are not promoted automatically, so generic code calls them in the qualified form `@def.Floating::classify(x)`; the concrete types also provide inherent methods with the same names (`x.classify()`). The laws every implementation is expected to satisfy are listed in the [design page](../design/def.md#the-floating-laws)."
msgstr "`Floating` 只由本库的标量类型实现：`@bin_float.BinFloat`、`@decimal.Decimal` 和 `@decimal_gda.Decimal`。`@ball_float.BallFloat` 不实现它（参见[区间不是 `Floating`](../design/def.md#intervals-are-not-floating)）。它不是扩展点：为本模块之外的类型实现它不受支持，也不在兼容性承诺之内，因为 trait 可能在次版本中增加方法。它被声明为 `pub(open)`，只是因为这些实现位于本模块的其他包中（原因见[设计页面](../design/def.md#why-floating-is-declared-open)）。自 MoonBit 0.10 迁移以来，trait 方法不再自动提升，因此泛型代码以限定形式 `@def.Floating::classify(x)` 调用它们；具体类型也提供同名的固有方法（`x.classify()`）。每个实现应满足的定律列于[设计页面](../design/def.md#the-floating-laws)。"

#: manual/api/def.md:170
msgid "`classify` returns the class of a value: `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`."
msgstr "`classify` 返回值的类别：`Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:176
msgid "For the scalar types this is the IEEE class with signalling and quiet NaNs merged. Total; never aborts."
msgstr "对标量类型，这是 IEEE 类别，其中信号 NaN 与安静 NaN 合并。它是全函数，从不中止。"

#: manual/api/def.md:181
msgid "`sign` returns the sign classification of a value."
msgstr "`sign` 返回值的符号分类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:189
msgid "`BinFloat`, both `Decimal`s"
msgstr "`BinFloat`，两种 `Decimal`"

#: manual/api/def.md:189
msgid "value $< 0$, including $-\\infty$"
msgstr "值 $< 0$，包括 $-\\infty$"

#: manual/api/def.md:189
msgid "$\\pm 0$ and every NaN"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$ 及所有 NaN"

#: manual/api/def.md:189
msgid "value $> 0$, including $+\\infty$"
msgstr "值 $> 0$，包括 $+\\infty$"

#: manual/api/def.md:193
msgid "`precision` returns the working precision stored on the value."
msgstr "`precision` 返回值上存储的工作精度。"

#: manual/api/def.md:199
msgid "It counts significant bits for `BinFloat` and significant decimal digits for both `Decimal` types. Every constructor clamps the stored precision to at least $1$, so the result is always at least $1$."
msgstr "对 `BinFloat`，它计算有效二进制位数；对两种 `Decimal` 类型，它计算有效十进制位数。每个构造函数都会将存储的精度限制为至少 $1$，因此结果总是至少为 $1$。"

#: manual/api/def.md:205
msgid "`with_precision(x, p)` returns `x` re-expressed at precision $q = \\max(1, p)$."
msgstr "`with_precision(x, p)` 返回以精度 $q = \\max(1, p)$ 重新表示的 `x`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:212
msgid "For a finite scalar the value is rounded to $q$ significant digits of its radix, to nearest with ties to even (IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1). The trait method has no rounding parameter, because it cannot return an error; the inherent `with_precision` of each scalar type takes a rounding mode. No context exponent bounds apply and no flags are reported (use the `*_ctx` APIs of the concrete package for both). The decimal types have no other exponent limit. `BinFloat` keeps its implementation range: a result whose exponent leaves $\\pm(2^{30} - 1)$ (`binary_implementation_e_max`, `binary_implementation_e_min`) overflows to an infinity or to the largest finite value, or underflows, as in IEEE 754. Zeros keep their sign. Infinities and NaNs keep their class, sign and payload and only change the stored precision."
msgstr "对有限标量，值就近舍入（偶数优先，IEEE 754-2019 4.3.1）到其基数下的 $q$ 位有效数字。trait 方法没有舍入参数，因为它无法返回错误；各标量类型自己的 `with_precision` 接受舍入模式。不应用上下文的指数界限，也不报告标志（两者都需要时请使用具体包的 `*_ctx` API）。十进制类型没有其他指数限制。`BinFloat` 保留其实现范围：指数超出 $\\pm(2^{30} - 1)$（`binary_implementation_e_max`、`binary_implementation_e_min`）的结果会像 IEEE 754 中那样上溢为无穷或最大有限值，或者下溢。零保留其符号。无穷和 NaN 保留其类别、符号和载荷，只改变存储的精度。"

#: manual/api/def.md:227
msgid "`normalized` returns the canonical representative of a value."
msgstr "`normalized` 返回值的规范代表。"

#: manual/api/def.md:233
msgid "For `BinFloat` this is the representation with an odd coefficient (or zero); for both `Decimal` types it removes trailing zeros of the coefficient, so `1.500` becomes `1.5` (the cohort changes, the value does not) and `-0.000` becomes `-0`. Non-finite scalars are returned unchanged. On the scalar types `normalized` keeps the value and is idempotent."
msgstr "对于 `BinFloat`，这是系数为奇数（或为零）的表示；对于两种 `Decimal` 类型，它去除系数末尾的零，因此 `1.500` 变为 `1.5`（同值类改变，值不变），`-0.000` 变为 `-0`。非有限标量原样返回。在标量类型上，`normalized` 保持值不变，并且是幂等的。"

#: manual/api/def.md:288
msgid "Generic predicates"
msgstr "泛型谓词"

#: manual/api/def.md:292
msgid "These functions test the class of any `Floating` value."
msgstr "这些函数检测任意 `Floating` 值的类别。"

#: manual/api/def.md:310
msgid "Exactly one of the first three is true for every value. `is_zero` is true for both signed zeros and false for NaN."
msgstr "对每个值，前三者恰有一个为真。`is_zero` 对两种带符号零都为真，对 NaN 为假。"

#: manual/api/def.md:324
msgid "Re-exported types"
msgstr "重新导出的类型"

#: manual/api/def.md:326
msgid "`def` re-exports these types with `pub using`, so `@def.RoundingMode` and `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` name the same type and no conversion is needed. Their definitions and full semantics are documented by [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)."
msgstr "`def` 以 `pub using` 重新导出这些类型，因此 `@def.RoundingMode` 与 `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` 指同一类型，无需任何转换。它们的定义和完整语义由 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 文档说明。"

#: manual/api/def.md:333
msgid "`ArithmeticContext` is the precision, rounding direction and optional exponent bounds passed to the contextual traits of Luna-Flow/arithmetic."
msgstr "`ArithmeticContext` 是传递给 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 上下文 trait 的精度、舍入方向及可选指数界限。"

#: manual/api/def.md:340
msgid "`BinaryContext` and `DecimalContext` are built from it by their `from_arithmetic_context` constructors."
msgstr "`BinaryContext` 和 `DecimalContext` 由各自的 `from_arithmetic_context` 构造函数从它构建。"

#: manual/api/def.md:345
msgid "`ArithmeticError` is the structured error of every `Result`-returning (`*_checked`, `try_*`) API and of the checked wrapper packages; `ArithmeticErrorKind` is its kind."
msgstr "`ArithmeticError` 是所有返回 `Result` 的 API（`*_checked`、`try_*`）以及各 checked 包装包的结构化错误；`ArithmeticErrorKind` 是其种类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:354
msgid "The kinds are `DivisionByZero`, `ParseError`, `DomainError`, `FormatError`, `UnsupportedOperation`, `UnorderedComparison` and `CertificationFailure(detail)`; `ArithmeticError` has one `is_*` predicate per kind and a `message`."
msgstr "种类有 `DivisionByZero`、`ParseError`、`DomainError`、`FormatError`、`UnsupportedOperation`、`UnorderedComparison` 和 `CertificationFailure(detail)`；`ArithmeticError` 为每个种类提供一个 `is_*` 谓词，并提供 `message`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:361
msgid "These types are the payload of an `ArithmeticError` of kind `CertificationFailure`: an elementary function whose correctly rounded result could not be certified within its refinement budget."
msgstr "这些类型是种类为 `CertificationFailure` 的 `ArithmeticError` 的载荷：表示某个初等函数的正确舍入结果未能在其细化预算内完成认证。"

#: manual/api/def.md:371
msgid "The detail records the operation, the stage and reason, the target precision, and the final working precision and refinement count (see `certified_failure` in the [internal API](internal.md))."
msgstr "详情记录运算、阶段和原因、目标精度，以及最终的工作精度和细化次数（参见[内部 API](internal.md) 中的 `certified_failure`）。"

#: manual/api/def.md:377
msgid "`FpClass` is the result of `Floating::classify`: `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`."
msgstr "`FpClass` 是 `Floating::classify` 的结果：`Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:386
msgid "`RoundingMode` lists the five rounding directions accepted by the inherent `with_precision` methods and by the concrete constructors (not by the trait method `Floating::with_precision`): `ToNearestEven`, `TowardZero`, `TowardPositive`, `TowardNegative` and `AwayFromZero`."
msgstr "`RoundingMode` 列出具体类型自身的 `with_precision` 方法及各具体构造函数接受的五种舍入方向（trait 方法 `Floating::with_precision` 不接受）：`ToNearestEven`、`TowardZero`、`TowardPositive`、`TowardNegative` 和 `AwayFromZero`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:397
msgid "`BigInt` is the arbitrary-precision integer of `moonbitlang/core/bigint`, used for coefficients and exact values."
msgstr "`BigInt` 是 `moonbitlang/core/bigint` 的任意精度整数，用于表示系数和精确值。"

#: manual/api/def.md:418
msgid "These methods are the derived `Eq` instance, promoted explicitly so that `a.equal(b)` remains available; prefer `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "这些方法是派生的 `Eq` 实例，经显式提升以使 `a.equal(b)` 仍然可用；请优先使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:1
msgid "differential API"
msgstr "differential API"

#: manual/api/differential.md:5
msgid "`differential` is the executable of the seeded random differential campaign (`random-diff`). It reads a generated corpus of MPFR (binary, IEEE `decimal`) or libmpdec (`decimal_gda`) rows, validates them against `floating` in batches through the [mare_mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/) runner and prints the append-only JSONL record of the run on standard output. The package has no public MoonBit items; this page documents its command line and its record. The [tutorial](../tutorial/differential.md) shows a campaign end to end and the [design page](../design/differential.md) explains why the harness validates batches and how a failing batch is minimized. The row formats and the oracle programs are described in [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md) and [`testdata/decimal/README.md`](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md) (IEEE `decimal`) and [`testdata/decimal_gda/README.md`](../../../testdata/decimal_gda/README.md) (`decimal_gda`)."
msgstr "`differential` 是带种子的随机差分测试活动（`random-diff`）的可执行程序。它读取生成的 MPFR（二进制、IEEE `decimal`）或 libmpdec（`decimal_gda`）行语料，通过 [mare_mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/) 运行器按批对 `floating` 进行验证，并把本次运行的追加式 JSONL 记录打印到标准输出。该包没有公开的 MoonBit 项；本页记录它的命令行和记录格式。[教程](../tutorial/differential.md)完整演示一次测试活动，[设计页](../design/differential.md)解释为何按批验证以及失败批如何被最小化。行格式与预言机程序见 [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md) 、[`testdata/decimal/README.md`](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)（IEEE `decimal`）和 [`testdata/decimal_gda/README.md`](../../../testdata/decimal_gda/README.md)（`decimal_gda`）。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:21
msgid "`differential` is an executable package (`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`) and cannot be imported. It builds for native, JavaScript, Wasm and LLVM; it is excluded from Wasm-GC because the mare_mark runner uses `moonbitlang/async`, which has no Wasm-GC runtime. It is only the entry point: its `moon.pkg` imports the library [`differential/harness`](differential/harness.md), which holds the behaviour described below, and the async runtime:"
msgstr "`differential` 是可执行包（`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`），不能被导入。它可为 native、JavaScript、Wasm 和 LLVM 构建；因 mare_mark 运行器使用没有 Wasm-GC 运行时的 `moonbitlang/async`，所以不为 Wasm-GC 构建。它只是入口：其 `moon.pkg` 导入库 [`differential/harness`](differential/harness.md)（下文描述的行为都在其中）和异步运行时："

#: manual/api/differential.md:46
msgid "the corpus: `mpfr-random-v1` rows, `mpfr-decimal-random-v2` rows or a `.decTest` file whose header says `libmpdec-random-v1`; the format is detected from the text"
msgstr "语料：`mpfr-random-v1` 行、`mpfr-decimal-random-v2` 行，或头部写有 `libmpdec-random-v1` 的 `.decTest` 文件；格式由文本内容自动识别"

#: manual/api/differential.md:47
msgid "cases validated together; default 1000"
msgstr "一起验证的用例数；默认 1000"

#: manual/api/differential.md:48
msgid "the mare_mark run seed, below 2^31; it seeds the balanced block order and is recorded in every failure"
msgstr "mare_mark 的运行种子，小于 2^31；它决定平衡分块的顺序，并记录在每个失败记录中"

#: manual/api/differential.md:49
msgid "provenance id written into the environment snapshot and the summary"
msgstr "写入环境快照和摘要的来源标识"

#: manual/api/differential.md:50
msgid "the backend name recorded in the environment snapshot (it does not select the backend: the binary you run does)"
msgstr "记录在环境快照中的后端名称（它并不选择后端：由你运行的二进制决定）"

#: manual/api/differential.md:51
msgid "the command stored in each `validation_failure` for `mare-mark replay`; default `python3`"
msgstr "存入每个 `validation_failure` 供 `mare-mark replay` 使用的命令；默认为 `python3`"

#: manual/api/differential.md:52
msgid "a leading argument of that command, repeatable; the harness appends `--target T` and the failing case id or `first..last` range"
msgstr "该命令开头的一个参数，可重复；运行器会追加 `--target T` 以及失败用例的 id 或 `first..last` 范围"

#: manual/api/differential.md:54
msgid "Arguments before the first `--option` are ignored, because a Node.js or Wasm host puts the program or script path first. Every option takes one value."
msgstr "第一个 `--option` 之前的参数会被忽略，因为 Node.js 或 Wasm 宿主会把程序或脚本路径放在最前面。每个选项都带一个值。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:57
msgid "Exit status: `0` when every batch agreed with its oracle; `1` when a batch failed or a case was not executable; `2` for a usage error, an unreadable file or a file that is not a random differential corpus."
msgstr "退出状态：每个批都与其预言机一致时为 `0`；有批失败或有用例无法执行时为 `1`；用法错误、文件无法读取或文件不是随机差分语料时为 `2`。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:61
msgid "The record"
msgstr "记录"

#: manual/api/differential.md:63
msgid "The harness writes mare_mark JSONL (`mmka_1`) to standard output, one event per line, nothing else:"
msgstr "运行器把 mare_mark JSONL（`mmka_1`）写到标准输出，每行一个事件，没有其他内容："

#: manual/api/differential.md:66
#: manual/design/ball_float.md:728
msgid "When"
msgstr "何时"

#: manual/api/differential.md:68
#: manual/api/differential.md:70
msgid "once per batch"
msgstr "每批一次"

#: manual/api/differential.md:68
msgid "`status` (`valid`, `invalid` with a `reason`, `infrastructure_failure`), `operands` = `[first id, last id, case count]`, `scale` = the corpus header line (family, seed, range, oracle version), `dataset_id` = the batch number"
msgstr "`status`（`valid`、带 `reason` 的 `invalid`、`infrastructure_failure`），`operands` = `[第一个 id, 最后一个 id, 用例数]`，`scale` = 语料头部行（族、种子、范围、预言机版本），`dataset_id` = 批编号"

#: manual/api/differential.md:69
msgid "once per invalid batch"
msgstr "每个无效批一次"

#: manual/api/differential.md:69
msgid "the same fields plus `seed`, the `shrink_path` (each step of the delta debugging, as an id range), `minimal_input` (the failing case, as its row) and the `replay_command` with its arguments"
msgstr "同样的字段，再加上 `seed`、`shrink_path`（差分最小化的每一步，以 id 范围表示）、`minimal_input`（失败用例，以其行表示）以及带参数的 `replay_command`"

#: manual/api/differential.md:70
msgid "the timing of the batch; one iteration per block"
msgstr "该批的计时；每个块一次迭代"

#: manual/api/differential.md:71
msgid "last"
msgstr "最后"

#: manual/api/differential.md:71
msgid "`validation_count`, `passed_count`, `failed_count`, the protocol and the environment"
msgstr "`validation_count`、`passed_count`、`failed_count`、协议和环境"

#: manual/api/differential.md:73
msgid "The protocol is fixed: `MultipleDatasetsSingleMeasurement`, no warm-up, one iteration per batch, `EveryDataset` validation, balanced blocks seeded by `--seed`. Timing is a by-product; correctness is the verdict."
msgstr "协议是固定的：`MultipleDatasetsSingleMeasurement`，无预热，每批一次迭代，`EveryDataset` 验证，由 `--seed` 决定种子的平衡分块。计时只是副产品；判定依据是正确性。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:77
msgid "A case is identified by its id, `<seed>.<family>.<index>` for MPFR rows and `d<seed>.<family>.<index>` for libmpdec rows. The id is all that `tools/random_differential.py replay` needs, because both generators are pure functions of seed, family and index."
msgstr "用例由其 id 标识：MPFR 行为 `<seed>.<family>.<index>`，libmpdec 行为 `d<seed>.<family>.<index>`。`tools/random_differential.py replay` 只需要这个 id，因为两个生成器都是种子、族和索引的纯函数。"

#: manual/api/differential.md:82
msgid "Replaying a failure"
msgstr "重放失败"

#: manual/api/differential.md:84
msgid "The `validation_failure` event carries the replay command, so the record can be replayed by the mare_mark command line:"
msgstr "`validation_failure` 事件携带重放命令，因此可以用 mare_mark 命令行重放记录："

#: manual/api/differential.md:92
msgid "The command it prints is `python3 tools/random_differential.py replay --target native <id or range>`, which regenerates the rows and runs them through the frontends. Without mare_mark, run that command directly or `just random-diff replay <id>`."
msgstr "它打印出的命令是 `python3 tools/random_differential.py replay --target native <id 或范围>`，它会重新生成行并通过前端运行。没有 mare_mark 时，可直接运行该命令或 `just random-diff replay <id>`。"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:1
msgid "differential/ball_mpfr API"
msgstr "differential/ball_mpfr API"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:5
msgid "`differential/ball_mpfr` is the test side of the untimed differential stage of `BallFloat` against MPFR (`tools/ball_diff.py`). It is a test-only package and exports no MoonBit items. Its one test reads a file of operand rows and the oracle file written by `tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c`, runs every row on `BallFloat` (`add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div`, `sqr`, `sqrt`, `fma`, `exp`, `ln`) and compares both bounds of the result, and the operands as the library read them, with the oracle's, as canonical text; for `exp` and `ln` the result must enclose the oracle's and not be wider than 1,024 units of the last place. The [tutorial](../../tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md) shows how to run it and the [design page](../../design/differential/ball_mpfr.md) explains the comparison."
msgstr "`differential/ball_mpfr` 是 `BallFloat` 对照 MPFR 的不计时差分阶段（`tools/ball_diff.py`）的测试一侧。它是只含测试的包，不导出任何 MoonBit 项。它唯一的测试读取一个操作数行文件和 `tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c` 写出的预言机文件，在 `BallFloat` 上运行每一行（`add`、`sub`、`mul`、`div`、`sqr`、`sqrt`、`fma`、`exp`、`ln`），并把结果的两个端点、以及库读入的操作数，与预言机的值按规范化文本比较；对 `exp` 和 `ln`，结果必须包含预言机的结果，并且不比它宽出 1,024 个末位单位。[教程](../../tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md) 说明如何运行，[设计页](../../design/differential/ball_mpfr.md) 解释比较的方式。"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:9
msgid "The package is test-only and exports no items, so there is nothing to import from it. Its tests import the packages under test and the file and environment access of the runner:"
msgstr "这个包只含测试且不导出任何项，所以没有什么可导入。它的测试导入被测的包以及运行器使用的文件和环境访问："

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:22
msgid "Environment and output"
msgstr "环境与输出"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:24
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:26
msgid "the row file (`id op size class operand...`, an operand is `lo:hi`)"
msgstr "行文件（`id op size class operand...`，操作数是 `lo:hi`）"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:27
msgid "the oracle file (`id lo hi flags echo lohex hihex`), same ids in the same order"
msgstr "预言机文件（`id lo hi flags echo lohex hihex`），id 与顺序和行文件相同"

#: manual/api/differential/ball_mpfr.md:29
msgid "Without the two variables the test does nothing. It prints `BALLDIFF_FAIL id op size class expected lo hi got lo hi` for a differing row, `BALLDIFF_UNDECIDED id` for a row the oracle marked undecided, and `BALLDIFF_SUMMARY rows=N failed=K undecided=U`; it fails when any row differs. `tools/ball_diff.py run` reads these lines."
msgstr "两个变量都没有设置时，测试什么也不做。对结果不同的行它输出 `BALLDIFF_FAIL id op size class expected lo hi got lo hi`，对预言机标为无法判定的行输出 `BALLDIFF_UNDECIDED id`，最后输出 `BALLDIFF_SUMMARY rows=N failed=K undecided=U`；任何一行不同时测试失败。`tools/ball_diff.py run` 读取这些行。"

#: manual/api/differential/harness.md:1
msgid "differential/harness API"
msgstr "differential/harness API"

#: manual/api/differential/harness.md:5
msgid "`differential/harness` holds the behaviour of the seeded random differential executable: it parses the command line, splits a corpus into batches, runs each batch through the matching frontend under the mare_mark runner and writes the JSONL record. The package `differential` is only the entry point that calls `run` with `@env.args()`. The command line and the workflow are documented on the [`differential` page](../differential.md); the [tutorial](../../tutorial/differential/harness.md) shows what the package is for and the [design page](../../design/differential/harness.md) explains the split."
msgstr "`differential/harness` 承载带种子随机差分可执行文件的行为：它解析命令行，把语料拆分成批，让每一批在 mare_mark 运行器下经相应前端执行，并写出 JSONL 记录。包 `differential` 只是入口，以 `@env.args()` 调用 `run`。命令行与工作流见 [`differential` 页面](../differential.md)；[教程](../../tutorial/differential/harness.md)说明本包的用途，[设计页](../../design/differential/harness.md)解释这一拆分。"

#: manual/api/differential/harness.md:23
msgid "The package needs `moonbitlang/async` and is built for native, JavaScript, Wasm and LLVM, not for wasm-gc."
msgstr "本包需要 `moonbitlang/async`，为 native、JavaScript、Wasm 和 LLVM 构建，不为 wasm-gc 构建。"

#: manual/api/differential/harness.md:34
msgid "`run(args)` takes the program arguments (the program name, and under Node.js the script path too, come first). It exits the process with `2` for a bad command line or corpus and with `1` when a batch disagrees with its oracle; otherwise it returns after the record is written."
msgstr "`run(args)` 接收程序参数（程序名在最前，在 Node.js 下脚本路径也在前）。命令行或语料有误时以 `2` 退出进程，某一批与其预言不一致时以 `1` 退出；否则在记录写完后返回。"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:1
msgid "doc_examples API"
msgstr "doc_examples API"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:5
msgid "`doc_examples` is a test-only package. Its only source is `tooling/src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md`, whose `moonbit check` blocks are compiled and run as tests; it exports no MoonBit items. The blocks are short, executable versions of the main workflows of the public packages (binary contexts and interchange, GDA sticky status, IEEE decimal flags, intervals and decorations, checked pipelines, semantic comparison, `numeric_expr`, and the four conformance frontends). See the [tutorial](../tutorial/doc_examples.md) and the [design page](../design/doc_examples.md)."
msgstr "`doc_examples` 是一个仅用于测试的包。它唯一的源文件是 `tooling/src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md`，其中的 `moonbit check` 代码块会作为测试被编译和运行；它不导出任何 MoonBit 项。这些代码块是各公开包主要工作流程的简短可执行版本（二进制上下文与交换格式、GDA 粘滞状态、IEEE 十进制标志、区间与装饰（decoration）、checked 流水线、语义比较、`numeric_expr`，以及四个符合性前端）。参见[教程](../tutorial/doc_examples.md)和[设计页面](../design/doc_examples.md)。"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:16
msgid "Nothing can be imported from `doc_examples`. Its `moon.pkg` imports the packages its examples use, for tests only:"
msgstr "无法从 `doc_examples` 导入任何内容。它的 `moon.pkg` 导入其示例所用的包，且仅用于测试："

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:40
msgid "The README holds eleven `moonbit check` tests, one per workflow: binary context and interchange, GDA sticky status, IEEE decimal status, interval and decorated semantics, checked pipelines, the semantic projection, `numeric_expr` callbacks, and one inline document for each of the GDA, ITL, MPFR and TestFloat frontends."
msgstr "README 包含十一个 `moonbit check` 测试，每个工作流程一个：二进制上下文与交换格式、GDA 粘滞状态、IEEE 十进制状态、区间与装饰语义、checked 流水线、语义投影、`numeric_expr` 回调，以及 GDA、ITL、MPFR 和 TestFloat 前端各一个内联文档。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/gda_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/gda_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/gda_expr` reads General Decimal Arithmetic test files (the `.decTest` format of Cowlishaw's decimal specification) and executes their rows against `decimal_gda`. Parsing turns every row into a `GdaCase` with its context and a [`numeric_expr`](../numeric_expr.md) expression; execution evaluates the expression and compares the result and the status flags with the row. The package does no file or process IO; the command-line runner is [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md) shows the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md) specifies the row mapping and the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/gda_expr` 读取 General Decimal Arithmetic 测试文件（Cowlishaw 十进制规范的 `.decTest` 格式），并针对 `decimal_gda` 执行其中的行。解析将每一行转换为一个 `GdaCase`，附带其上下文和一个 [`numeric_expr`](../numeric_expr.md) 表达式；执行时对表达式求值，并将结果和状态标志与该行进行比较。该包不进行任何文件或进程 IO；命令行运行器是 [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md)展示工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md)规定行映射和通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:18
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:14
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:17
msgid "Add the package to the `import` block of your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 的 `import` 块中："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:26
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@gda_expr`. They need no other package: rows are written as text and the results are read through the accessors below."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@gda_expr` 调用它。它们不需要其他包：行以文本形式书写，结果通过下面的访问器读取。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:30
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:25
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:141
msgid "Parsing"
msgstr "解析"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:34
msgid "`parse_dectest(source, text)` parses a whole `.decTest` document."
msgstr "`parse_dectest(source, text)` 解析一个完整的 `.decTest` 文档。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:40
msgid ""
"`source` is a name used in spans (normally the file path) and `text` is the file content. The text is split at `\\n"
"`; line numbers start at 1. Each line is handled as follows:"
msgstr ""
"`source` 是用于跨度（span）中的名称（通常为文件路径），`text` 是文件内容。文本在 `\\n"
"` 处切分；行号从 1 开始。每一行的处理方式如下："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:44
msgid "`--` outside quotes starts a comment; the rest of the line is dropped. Leading and trailing white space is trimmed and empty lines are skipped."
msgstr "引号之外的 `--` 开始一段注释；该行的其余部分被丢弃。首尾空白被修剪，空行被跳过。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:46
msgid "A line without `->` outside quotes is a directive `name: value`. The name is compared case-insensitively with `-`, `_`, spaces and tabs removed: `precision`, `rounding`, `minexponent`, `maxexponent`, `clamp`, `extended` and `dectest` update the context; `version` and unknown names are ignored. `precision`, `minExponent` and `maxExponent` must be integers, otherwise the line is a diagnostic. `clamp` is on only for the value `1`; `extended` is off only for the value `0`. A line without `:` is a diagnostic."
msgstr "引号之外不含 `->` 的行是指令 `name: value`。名称在去除 `-`、`_`、空格和制表符后按不区分大小写的方式比较：`precision`、`rounding`、`minexponent`、`maxexponent`、`clamp`、`extended` 和 `dectest` 会更新上下文；`version` 和未知名称被忽略。`precision`、`minExponent` 和 `maxExponent` 必须是整数，否则该行成为一条诊断。`clamp` 只有在值为 `1` 时才开启；`extended` 只有在值为 `0` 时才关闭。不含 `:` 的行是一条诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:54
msgid "A line with `->` is a test row. The left side is tokenized into `id operation operand…` (at least two tokens), the right side into `expected condition…` (at least one token). Tokens are separated by spaces, tabs or line breaks; a token enclosed in `'…'` or `\"…\"` may contain spaces and loses its quotes. A quote also ends the token before it, so `ab'cd'` is the two tokens `ab` and `cd`. Inside a quoted token the delimiting quote written twice is one literal quote and does not end the token, as the decTest format specifies: `'1E''1'` is the operand `1E'1` and `\"1E\"\"\"\"\"` is `1E\"\"`. An unterminated quote after `->` is the diagnostic `unterminated quoted token`; a quote opened before `->` hides the arrow, so the line is reported as `expected directive or testcase row`. Fewer tokens than required give `malformed testcase row`."
msgstr "含有 `->` 的行是测试行。左侧被切分为记号 `id operation operand…`（至少两个记号），右侧被切分为 `expected condition…`（至少一个记号）。记号以空格、制表符或换行分隔；用 `'…'` 或 `\"…\"` 括起来的记号可以包含空格，并会去掉引号。引号也会结束它之前的记号，因此 `ab'cd'` 是两个记号 `ab` 和 `cd`。按照 decTest 格式的规定，在带引号的记号内部，连写两次的定界引号表示一个字面引号，不会结束该记号：`'1E''1'` 是操作数 `1E'1`，`\"1E\"\"\"\"\"` 是 `1E\"\"`。`->` 之后未闭合的引号产生诊断 `unterminated quoted token`；在 `->` 之前打开的引号会遮蔽箭头，因此该行被报告为 `expected directive or testcase row`。记号数少于要求时产生 `malformed testcase row`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:67
msgid "The result is `Ok(document)` when no diagnostic was produced, and otherwise `Err` with every diagnostic of the document in line order."
msgstr "没有产生诊断时结果为 `Ok(document)`，否则为 `Err`，其中按行序包含该文档的所有诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:70
msgid "Documents and rows"
msgstr "文档与行"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:74
msgid "`GdaDocument` is a parsed file: its source name and its rows in file order."
msgstr "`GdaDocument` 是一个已解析的文件：包含其源名称和按文件顺序排列的行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:84
msgid "These methods return the source name, a copy of the rows and the number of rows."
msgstr "这些方法返回源名称、行的副本以及行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:95
msgid "`GdaCase` is one test row together with the context in force on its line."
msgstr "`GdaCase` 是一个测试行，连同其所在行生效的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:105
msgid "These methods return the row id, the operation as written, and the operation name used for dispatch: lower case, with `-`, `_`, spaces and tabs removed."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、按原样书写的运算，以及用于分派的运算名：小写，并去除 `-`、`_`、空格和制表符。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:116
msgid "These methods return the operand tokens, the expected-result token and the condition tokens, unquoted and otherwise exactly as written."
msgstr "这些方法返回操作数记号、期望结果记号和条件记号，均已去掉引号，其余与原文完全一致。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:125
msgid "The arrays are copies."
msgstr "这些数组都是副本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:129
msgid "These methods return the directive context of the row, its span (source, line, column 1), and the row as an expression."
msgstr "这些方法返回该行的指令上下文、其跨度（源、行、第 1 列），以及该行对应的表达式。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:138
msgid "The expression is `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(normalized_operation), …)` applied to one `Expr::literal` per operand, all carrying the row's span."
msgstr "该表达式为 `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(normalized_operation), …)`，作用于每个操作数各一个 `Expr::literal`，它们都带有该行的跨度。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:143
msgid "`GdaContext` is the directive state of a document at a given row."
msgstr "`GdaContext` 是文档在某一行处的指令状态。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:151
msgid "It is a record of the directive values as written, not a `@decimal_gda.GdaContext`; execution converts it."
msgstr "它是按原样书写的指令值的记录，而不是 `@decimal_gda.GdaContext`；执行时会对其进行转换。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:156
msgid "`GdaContext::default()` is the context before the first directive."
msgstr "`GdaContext::default()` 是第一条指令之前的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:162
msgid "Precision 34, rounding `\"half_even\"`, `min_exponent` $-999999999$, `max_exponent` $999999999$, `clamp` off, `extended` on, `dectest` empty."
msgstr "精度 34，舍入 `\"half_even\"`，`min_exponent` 为 $-999999999$，`max_exponent` 为 $999999999$，`clamp` 关闭，`extended` 开启，`dectest` 为空。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:167
msgid "These accessors return the directive values."
msgstr "这些访问器返回指令值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:179
msgid "`rounding` is the directive text as written (for example `\"half_up\"` or `\"05up\"`); it is only interpreted at execution time. `precision`, `min_exponent` and `max_exponent` are not range-checked when parsed: a `precision: 0` directive is accepted here, and `execute_documents` makes the rows under it `Diagnostic` (see below)."
msgstr "`rounding` 是按原样书写的指令文本（例如 `\"half_up\"` 或 `\"05up\"`）；它只在执行时才被解释。解析时不对 `precision`、`min_exponent` 和 `max_exponent` 做范围检查：`precision: 0` 指令在这里会被接受，而 `execute_documents` 会把其下的行设为 `Diagnostic`（见下文）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:187
msgid "`ParseDiagnostic` is one parse error with its location."
msgstr "`ParseDiagnostic` 是一条带位置的解析错误。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:197
msgid "These methods return the location (source, line, column 1) and the message, for example `\"unterminated quoted token\"`, `\"malformed testcase row\"`, `\"expected directive or testcase row\"` or `\"invalid precision directive\"`."
msgstr "这些方法返回位置（源、行、第 1 列）和消息，例如 `\"unterminated quoted token\"`、`\"malformed testcase row\"`、`\"expected directive or testcase row\"` 或 `\"invalid precision directive\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:230
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:82
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:240
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "执行"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:234
msgid "`execute_documents(documents, options?)` executes the selected rows of the documents, in order, and summarizes the results."
msgstr "`execute_documents(documents, options?)` 按顺序执行各文档中被选中的行，并汇总结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:241
msgid "Rows are visited document by document in file order. A row whose id does not match `options.case_filter()` is ignored entirely; the remaining rows are numbered $0, 1, 2, \\dots$ and row $k$ is executed when $k \\bmod n = i$ for shard count $n$ and shard index $i$. Each executed row first gets a disposition:"
msgstr "行按文档逐个、按文件顺序访问。id 与 `options.case_filter()` 不匹配的行被完全忽略；其余的行编号为 $0, 1, 2, \\dots$，对于分片数 $n$ 和分片索引 $i$，当 $k \\bmod n = i$ 时执行第 $k$ 行。每个被执行的行首先获得一个处置结果："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:247
msgid "`Diagnostic` if the context is invalid (precision not positive, or `minexponent` above `maxexponent`), an operand is exactly `#` or `?`, or the expected result is exactly `#`;"
msgstr "若上下文无效（精度不为正，或 `minexponent` 大于 `maxexponent`）、某个操作数恰为 `#` 或 `?`，或期望结果恰为 `#`，则为 `Diagnostic`；"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:250
msgid "`Unsupported` if a condition is not one of the thirteen GDA conditions, the operation is not implemented, or the rounding directive is not recognized;"
msgstr "若某个条件不属于十三种 GDA 条件之一、运算尚未实现，或舍入指令无法识别，则为 `Unsupported`；"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:253
msgid "`Executable` otherwise."
msgstr "否则为 `Executable`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:255
msgid "Only `Executable` rows are evaluated. Operands are decoded as described on the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#rows-as-operations); plain decimal operands are read with every digit, so only the result is rounded. The row passes when the result matches the expected token and the raised conditions are exactly the listed ones; the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#the-pass-rule) gives the full rule. Non-executable rows get `passed() == false` and the message `\"skipped\"`, and are counted as skipped, not failed. Unreadable operands and operations that reject their operands give a failed row, not an abort."
msgstr "只有 `Executable` 行会被求值。操作数按[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#rows-as-operations)所述解码；普通十进制操作数会保留每一位数字读取，因此只有结果被舍入。当结果与期望记号匹配，且引发的条件恰好是所列的条件时，该行通过；完整规则见[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#the-pass-rule)。不可执行的行得到 `passed() == false` 和消息 `\"skipped\"`，并计为跳过而非失败。无法读取的操作数以及拒绝其操作数的运算会使该行失败，而不会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:267
msgid "`RunOptions` selects which rows `execute_documents` runs."
msgstr "`RunOptions` 选择 `execute_documents` 运行哪些行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:277
msgid "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?, strict_supported?, case_filter?, deviations?)` builds the options."
msgstr "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?, strict_supported?, case_filter?, deviations?)` 构建选项。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:284
msgid "Defaults: one shard, index 0, `strict_supported` off, empty filter (all rows). Aborts unless `shard_count > 0` and `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`."
msgstr "默认值：一个分片，索引 0，`strict_supported` 关闭，过滤器为空（所有行）。除非 `shard_count > 0` 且 `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`，否则中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:287
msgid "`case_filter` is a comma-separated list of selectors, each trimmed. A selector `id` matches that id exactly. A selector `first..last` matches every id that has the same length as `first` and `last` and lies between them in string order, so `add001..add099` selects a numbered block."
msgstr "`case_filter` 是逗号分隔的选择器列表，每个选择器都会被修剪。选择器 `id` 精确匹配该 id。选择器 `first..last` 匹配所有与 `first` 和 `last` 长度相同、且按字符串顺序位于两者之间的 id，因此 `add001..add099` 选择一个编号区段。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:292
msgid "`deviations` records deviations of the corpus as `(key, corpus value, held value)` with `key` written `file:id`, the file name without its directory and the row id. A listed row is judged against the held value when its result token is still the corpus value (a changed token fails the row, naming the record) and counts as the verdict `deviation`; the default is none."
msgstr "`deviations` 以 `(key, 语料值, 所持值)` 记录语料的偏差，其中 `key` 写作 `file:id`，即不含目录的文件名和行 id。当某一行的结果记号仍是语料值时，按所持值评判该行（记号变化则该行失败并指明该记录），并计为判定种类 `deviation`；默认没有记录。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:298
msgid "`strict_supported` is stored for callers; `execute_documents` itself does not read it. The CLI uses it to turn unsupported rows into a failing exit code."
msgstr "`strict_supported` 仅为调用方保存；`execute_documents` 本身并不读取它。CLI 用它将不受支持的行转换为失败的退出码。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:303
msgid "These accessors return the option values."
msgstr "这些访问器返回选项值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:313
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:160
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:299
#: manual/getting_started.md:13
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:317
msgid "`CaseDisposition` says whether a row was executed and, if not, why."
msgstr "`CaseDisposition` 说明一行是否被执行，若未执行则说明原因。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:328
msgid "The string is a short reason such as `\"diagnostic interchange/non-scalar row\"` or `\"unsupported operation frobnicate\"`. `Legacy` exists for the shared result model; the current executor never assigns it."
msgstr "字符串是一个简短的原因，例如 `\"diagnostic interchange/non-scalar row\"` 或 `\"unsupported operation frobnicate\"`。`Legacy` 是为共享的结果模型而存在的；当前的执行器从不赋予它。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:335
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one selected row."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一个被选中行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:345
msgid "These methods return the row id, its disposition, whether it passed, and a message: empty for a pass, `\"skipped\"` for a non-executable row, `\"evaluation failed\"` when an operand could not be decoded or the operation rejected its operands, and otherwise a `\"result mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` or `\"status flags mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` text."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、其处置结果、是否通过，以及一条消息：通过时为空，不可执行的行为 `\"skipped\"`，操作数无法解码或运算拒绝其操作数时为 `\"evaluation failed\"`，否则为 `\"result mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` 或 `\"status flags mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` 文本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:361
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates the results of a run."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一次运行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:371
msgid "`total_cases` returns the number of rows that match the filter, counted over all shards; `selected_cases` returns the number of rows this shard executed or skipped."
msgstr "`total_cases` 返回与过滤器匹配的行数（所有分片合计）；`selected_cases` 返回本分片执行或跳过的行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:380
msgid "Every shard of one run reports the same `total_cases`. Rows removed by the filter are counted nowhere."
msgstr "同一次运行的每个分片都报告相同的 `total_cases`。被过滤器移除的行不计入任何计数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:385
msgid "These methods return the number of selected rows that were evaluated, and how many of them passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回被求值的选中行数，以及其中通过和失败的行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:396
msgid "These methods return the number of selected rows that were not evaluated, in total and by disposition."
msgstr "这些方法返回未被求值的选中行数，包括总数和按处置类别划分的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:406
msgid "`legacy_cases` is always 0 with the current executor. The counters of one summary satisfy"
msgstr "在当前执行器下，`legacy_cases` 始终为 0。同一个汇总的各计数器满足"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:419
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the per-row results in execution order; `success` is true when no executable row failed."
msgstr "`results` 返回按执行顺序排列的每行结果的副本；当没有可执行行失败时，`success` 为真。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:427
msgid "Skipped rows do not affect `success`."
msgstr "跳过的行不影响 `success`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:431
msgid "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` combines the summaries of the shards of one run."
msgstr "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` 合并一次运行中各分片的摘要。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:437
msgid "All counters except `total_cases` are added; `total_cases` is the maximum of the parts (every shard reports the same total). Results are concatenated in the order of `parts`. Merging the $n$ shards of a run gives the same counters as an unsharded run."
msgstr "除 `total_cases` 之外的所有计数器都相加；`total_cases` 取各部分的最大值（每个分片报告的总数相同）。结果按 `parts` 的顺序拼接。合并一次运行的 $n$ 个分片，得到的计数器与不分片运行相同。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:466
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:363
msgid "These methods come from `derive(Eq, @debug.Debug)`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法来自 `derive(Eq, @debug.Debug)`。新代码请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:471
msgid "`equal` compares all seven directive fields, `not_equal` is its negation and `to_repr` renders the record for `Debug`."
msgstr "`equal` 比较全部七个指令字段，`not_equal` 是其否定，`to_repr` 为 `Debug` 渲染该记录。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:480
msgid "`execute_documents` uses this equality to reuse the converted context of the previous row."
msgstr "`execute_documents` 利用这种相等性来复用上一行已转换的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:485
msgid "`equal` compares span and message; `to_repr` renders both."
msgstr "`equal` 比较源范围和消息；`to_repr` 渲染两者。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:495
msgid "`equal` compares the shard, the strict flag and the filter text; `to_repr` renders them."
msgstr "`equal` 比较分片、严格标志和过滤器文本；`to_repr` 渲染它们。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/itl_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/itl_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/itl_expr` parses interval test cases in the ITL format of the ITF1788 suite (test data for the IEEE 1788-2015 interval standard) and executes them against `ball_float`. It is a pure library: the command-line runner is [`cli/itl_expr_cli`](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md) walks through the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/itl_expr.md) gives the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/itl_expr` 解析 ITF1788 套件（IEEE 1788-2015 区间标准的测试数据）中 ITL 格式的区间测试用例，并针对 `ball_float` 执行它们。它是一个纯库：命令行运行器是 [`cli/itl_expr_cli`](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md)逐步介绍工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/itl_expr.md)给出通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:22
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@itl_expr`; cases are written as ITL text, so no interval package needs to be imported."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@itl_expr` 调用它；用例以 ITL 文本书写，因此无需导入任何区间包。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:29
msgid "`parse_itl(source)` parses ITL text into cases."
msgstr "`parse_itl(source)` 将 ITL 文本解析为用例。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:35
msgid "The text is read line by line, each line trimmed:"
msgstr "文本被逐行读取，每行都会被修剪："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:37
msgid "`//` starts a comment that runs to the end of the line, so a statement may end in `; // note`; empty lines (also after removing the comment) are skipped; a line starting with `/*` starts a block comment that ends on the first later line containing `*/` (or on the same line);"
msgstr "`//` 开始一个延续到行尾的注释，因此语句可以以 `; // note` 结尾；空行（包括去除注释后为空的行）被跳过；以 `/*` 开头的行开始一个块注释，该注释结束于其后第一个包含 `*/` 的行（或同一行）；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:41
msgid "`testcase NAME …` starts a new block; `NAME` is the word after `testcase` and must be followed by a space, otherwise the diagnostic `\"invalid testcase declaration\"` is recorded; the statement counter restarts at 0;"
msgstr "`testcase NAME …` 开始一个新块；`NAME` 是 `testcase` 之后的单词，其后必须跟一个空格，否则记录诊断 `\"invalid testcase declaration\"`；语句计数器从 0 重新开始；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:45
msgid "a line equal to `}` is skipped;"
msgstr "等于 `}` 的行被跳过；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:46
msgid "every other line is appended (with a space) to the current statement, and a line ending in `;` completes it."
msgstr "其他每一行都（以一个空格）追加到当前语句中，以 `;` 结尾的行使语句完成。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:49
msgid "A completed statement `left = expected` is split at the first `=`. The left side is split into words at spaces and tabs outside square brackets; the first word is the operation and the rest are operands. The case id is `NAME:k`, where `k` counts statements in the block from 1 (statements before the first `testcase` use the name `anonymous`). A statement without `=` or without an operation is a diagnostic `\"NAME:k: missing '='\"` or `\"NAME:k: missing operation\"`; text left after the last `;` gives `\"unterminated ITL statement\"`. The result is `Ok(cases)` when there is no diagnostic and `Err(diagnostics)` otherwise."
msgstr "一个已完成的语句 `left = expected` 在第一个 `=` 处切分。左侧在方括号之外按空格和制表符切分为单词；第一个单词是运算，其余为操作数。用例 id 为 `NAME:k`，其中 `k` 从 1 开始统计块内的语句（第一个 `testcase` 之前的语句使用名称 `anonymous`）。不含 `=` 或不含运算的语句分别产生诊断 `\"NAME:k: missing '='\"` 或 `\"NAME:k: missing operation\"`；最后一个 `;` 之后剩余的文本产生 `\"unterminated ITL statement\"`。没有诊断时结果为 `Ok(cases)`，否则为 `Err(diagnostics)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:61
msgid "`ItlCase` is one parsed statement."
msgstr "`ItlCase` 是一条已解析的语句。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:71
msgid "These methods return the id `NAME:k`, the operation word, a copy of the operand words and the expected text (trimmed, including any decoration suffix)."
msgstr "这些方法返回 id `NAME:k`、运算单词、操作数单词的副本，以及期望文本（已修剪，包含任何装饰后缀）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:86
msgid "`execute_case(case, precision?)` executes one case and returns its result."
msgstr "`execute_case(case, precision?)` 执行一个用例并返回其结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:92
msgid "`precision` (default `53`, must be positive) is the significand precision of the interval format the case runs in: bounds are read at `precision` bits and interval and number results are rounded with `@ball_float.BallContext::new(precision=precision)`, which has the binary64 exponent range. The default `53` is `BallContext::binary64()`, the format of the ITF1788 data."
msgstr "`precision`（默认 `53`，必须为正）是用例所在区间格式的有效数字精度：端点以 `precision` 位读取，区间结果和数值结果使用 `@ball_float.BallContext::new(precision=precision)` 舍入，其指数范围与 binary64 相同。默认值 `53` 即 `BallContext::binary64()`，也就是 ITF1788 数据所用的格式。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:99
msgid "Operands and expected values are read as follows. An interval literal is `[lo,hi]`, `[empty]`, `[entire]` or `[nai]`, optionally followed by `_dec` with `dec` one of `com`, `dac`, `def`, `trv`, `ill` (default `com`). A bound is `inf`/`infinity` with an optional sign, a hexadecimal float `0x…p…`, or decimal text. Decimal and hexadecimal bounds are rounded to nearest-even at `precision` bits, the lower bound as well as the upper one. This is the ITF1788 convention: its generator passes `[lo,hi]` to the inf-sup constructor of the target type as two floating constants, so a bound is the nearest number of the format, not the outward rounding that IEEE 1788 `textToInterval` applies to an interval literal string; the corpus relies on it (`isSingleton [17.1, 17.1] = true`). A decimal bound is first read as a decimal of $2p + 16$ significant digits; a literal with more digits is rounded twice."
msgstr "操作数和期望值按如下方式读取。区间字面量为 `[lo,hi]`、`[empty]`、`[entire]` 或 `[nai]`，后面可选地跟 `_dec`，其中 `dec` 为 `com`、`dac`、`def`、`trv`、`ill` 之一（默认 `com`）。端点为可带符号的 `inf`/`infinity`、十六进制浮点数 `0x…p…`，或十进制文本。十进制和十六进制端点以 `precision` 位按就近舍入（偶数优先）舍入，下端点和上端点都是如此。这是 ITF1788 的约定：其生成器把 `[lo,hi]` 作为目标类型的两个浮点常量传给 inf-sup 构造函数，因此端点是该格式中最接近的数，而不是 IEEE 1788 `textToInterval` 对区间字面量字符串所做的向外舍入；测试语料依赖这一点（`isSingleton [17.1, 17.1] = true`）。十进制端点首先被读取为具有 $2p + 16$ 位有效数字的十进制数；位数更多的字面量会被舍入两次。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:113
msgid "The case is dispatched on its operation and expected value:"
msgstr "用例根据其运算和期望值进行分派："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
#: manual/performance_audit.md:25
msgid "Expected"
msgstr "预期"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
#: manual/numeric_semantics.md:578
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "比较"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
#: manual/design/frontend/gda_expr.md:95
msgid "boolean"
msgstr "布尔"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
msgid "`true` or `false`"
msgstr "`true` 或 `false`"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
msgid "equal booleans"
msgstr "布尔值相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "overlap"
msgstr "重叠"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "an overlap state name (`before`, `meets`, `overlaps`, `starts`, `containedBy`, `finishes`, `equals`, `after`, `metBy`, `overlappedBy`, `startedBy`, `contains`, `finishedBy`, `bothEmpty`, `firstEmpty`, `secondEmpty`, `undefined`)"
msgstr "一个重叠状态名（`before`、`meets`、`overlaps`、`starts`、`containedBy`、`finishes`、`equals`、`after`、`metBy`、`overlappedBy`、`startedBy`、`contains`、`finishedBy`、`bothEmpty`、`firstEmpty`、`secondEmpty`、`undefined`）"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "equal names"
msgstr "名称相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "numeric"
msgstr "数值"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "a bound"
msgstr "一个端点"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "equal numbers"
msgstr "数值相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
msgid "unary"
msgstr "一元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "interval"
msgstr "区间"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "equal sets"
msgstr "集合相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
msgid "ternary"
msgstr "三元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
msgid "integer power"
msgstr "整数幂"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
msgid "`pown` (second operand an integer)"
msgstr "`pown`（第二个操作数为整数）"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "binary"
msgstr "二元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:125
msgid "\"Equal sets\" means: both NaI, or both empty, or equal lower bounds and equal upper bounds (compared numerically, so $-0 = +0$). When the expected text contains `_`, the decorations must also be equal. The boolean dispatch is chosen whenever the expected text is `true` or `false`."
msgstr "“集合相等”的含义是：两者都是 NaI，或都为空，或下端点相等且上端点相等（按数值比较，因此 $-0 = +0$）。当期望文本包含 `_` 时，装饰也必须相等。只要期望文本是 `true` 或 `false`，就选择布尔分派。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:130
msgid "Dispositions:"
msgstr "处置结果："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:132
msgid "`Executable` when the case was run; `passed()` tells the outcome;"
msgstr "用例已运行时为 `Executable`；`passed()` 给出结果；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:133
msgid "`Unsupported(reason)` for an unknown operation, whatever its operands and expected value, a binary-dispatch case whose expected value is not an interval (for example one followed by a `signal` annotation), a binary-dispatch case with other than two operands, or a boolean predicate other than the five unary ones whose second operand is missing or unreadable;"
msgstr "以下情况为 `Unsupported(reason)`：未知运算（无论其操作数和期望值如何）；二元分派的用例其期望值不是区间（例如后面跟有 `signal` 注记的期望值）；二元分派的用例其操作数不是两个；或除五个一元谓词之外的布尔谓词，其第二个操作数缺失或无法读取；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:139
msgid "`Diagnostic(reason)` when the first operand of a boolean case, an operand of `isMember`, or an operand or the expected value of the overlap, numeric, unary, ternary or integer-power dispatch, cannot be read, or an operand of the binary dispatch is not an interval literal."
msgstr "以下情况为 `Diagnostic(reason)`：布尔用例的第一个操作数无法读取；`isMember` 的某个操作数无法读取；重叠、数值、一元、三元或整数幂分派中的某个操作数或期望值无法读取；或二元分派的某个操作数不是区间字面量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:144
msgid "Support is decided from the operation name before any operand is read, so `nums2interval 1.0 2.0`, `rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` and `sqrRev [0.0,1.0]` are unsupported and do not count against `RunSummary::success`."
msgstr "是否支持在读取任何操作数之前就根据运算名决定，因此 `nums2interval 1.0 2.0`、`rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` 和 `sqrRev [0.0,1.0]` 都不受支持，且不会影响 `RunSummary::success`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:148
msgid "`execute_case` does not abort on case content."
msgstr "`execute_case` 不会因用例内容而中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:152
msgid "`summarize_results(results)` counts a list of results."
msgstr "`summarize_results(results)` 对一组结果进行计数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:158
msgid "`total_cases` is the length of the list."
msgstr "`total_cases` 是列表的长度。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:164
msgid "`ItlDisposition` says whether a case was executed."
msgstr "`ItlDisposition` 说明一个用例是否被执行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:176
msgid "`ItlResult` is the outcome of one case."
msgstr "`ItlResult` 是一个用例的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:186
msgid "These methods return the case id, the disposition, whether the case passed, and a message: empty on success, `\"expected E, got A\"` on a mismatch (intervals printed by `BallFloatDecorated::to_string`), and a short reason or the offending text otherwise."
msgstr "这些方法返回用例 id、处置结果、该用例是否通过，以及一条消息：成功时为空，不匹配时为 `\"expected E, got A\"`（区间由 `BallFloatDecorated::to_string` 打印），其他情况下为简短的原因或出错的文本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:200
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates a list of results."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一组结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:210
msgid "These methods return the number of results, the number of executed cases, and how many of those passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回结果数、已执行的用例数，以及其中通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:222
msgid "These methods return the number of cases that were not executed, by disposition."
msgstr "这些方法按处置类别返回未执行的用例数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:232
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the results in the order they were given; `success` is the overall verdict."
msgstr "`results` 按给定顺序返回结果的副本；`success` 是总体判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:240
msgid "$\\text{total} = \\text{executable} + \\text{unsupported} + \\text{diagnostic}$ and $\\text{executable} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$. `success()` is true when no executable case failed **and** there is no diagnostic case; unsupported cases do not affect it."
msgstr "$\\text{total} = \\text{executable} + \\text{unsupported} + \\text{diagnostic}$ 且 $\\text{executable} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$。当没有可执行用例失败**并且**没有诊断用例时，`success()` 为真；不受支持的用例不影响它。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:267
msgid "These methods compare all fields of two cases and render a case for `Debug`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法比较两个用例的所有字段，并为 `Debug` 渲染一个用例。新代码中请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/mpfr_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/mpfr_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/mpfr_expr` parses reference data produced with GNU MPFR and executes it against `bin_float`. Six formats are supported: MPFR's square-root `data_check` files, integer-power rows, an elementary-function matrix with exception flags, two corpora for decimal character conversion (`mpfr_strtofr` and `mpfr_get_str`), and the seeded random differential rows (`mpfr-random-v1`) and their decimal counterpart (`mpfr-decimal-random-v2`). The package does no IO; the runner is [`cli/mpfr_expr_cli`](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md). See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md) for the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/mpfr_expr.md) for the pass rules."
msgstr "`frontend/mpfr_expr` 解析由 GNU MPFR 生成的参考数据，并对照 `bin_float` 执行。支持六种格式：MPFR 的平方根 `data_check` 文件、整数幂行、带异常标志的初等函数矩阵、两个十进制字符转换语料（`mpfr_strtofr` 与 `mpfr_get_str`），以及带种子的随机差分行（`mpfr-random-v1`）及其十进制对应物（`mpfr-decimal-random-v2`）。该包不做 IO；运行器是 [`cli/mpfr_expr_cli`](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)。工作流程见[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md)，通过规则见[设计页](../../design/frontend/mpfr_expr.md)。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:25
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@mpfr_expr`; rows are written as text, so `bin_float` does not need to be imported."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@mpfr_expr` 调用它；行以文本形式书写，因此无需导入 `bin_float`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:28
msgid "Common row syntax"
msgstr "通用行语法"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:30
msgid ""
"All five parsers split the text at `\\n"
"`, trim each line, and skip empty lines and lines starting with `#`. Fields are separated by spaces, tabs or carriage returns. Line numbers start at 1. A rounding field is one of"
msgstr ""
"五个解析器都在 `\\n"
"` 处切分文本，修剪每一行，并跳过空行和以 `#` 开头的行。字段以空格、制表符或回车符分隔。行号从 1 开始。舍入字段为以下之一"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:43
msgid "and a number is read by `@bin_float.BinFloat::from_hex` (`0x…p…` with an integer hexadecimal significand and no point, `inf`, `-inf`, `nan`) at the precision named for that field; a significand with more bits than that precision is rounded to nearest-even. Each parser returns `Ok(document)` when every line is valid and otherwise `Err` with one `ParseDiagnostic` per invalid line."
msgstr "数值由 `@bin_float.BinFloat::from_hex` 以该字段所指定的精度读取（`0x…p…`，其有效数为不带小数点的十六进制整数；以及 `inf`、`-inf`、`nan`）；位数多于该精度的有效数按就近舍入（偶数优先）舍入。每个解析器在所有行都有效时返回 `Ok(document)`，否则返回 `Err`，其中每个无效行对应一个 `ParseDiagnostic`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:49
msgid "Square-root data"
msgstr "平方根数据"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:53
msgid "`parse_sqrt_data(source, text)` parses rows of five fields: `input_precision output_precision rounding input expected`."
msgstr "`parse_sqrt_data(source, text)` 解析由五个字段组成的行：`input_precision output_precision rounding input expected`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:60
msgid "The input is read at `input_precision` bits and the expected value at `output_precision` bits. Row ids are `sqrt:LINE`."
msgstr "输入以 `input_precision` 位读取，期望值以 `output_precision` 位读取。行 id 为 `sqrt:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:65
msgid "`execute_sqrt_data(document)` computes `input.sqrt_ctx(ctx)` for every row, where `ctx` is `BinaryContext::new(precision=output_precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_sqrt_data(document)` 为每一行计算 `input.sqrt_ctx(ctx)`，其中 `ctx` 为 `BinaryContext::new(precision=output_precision, rounding~)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:72
msgid "A row passes when the result is equal (`==`) to the expected `BinFloat`. Flags are not compared."
msgstr "当结果与期望的 `BinFloat` 相等（`==`）时该行通过。不比较标志。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:77
msgid "`MpfrDocument` is a parsed square-root file; `MpfrCase` is one of its rows and has no public methods."
msgstr "`MpfrDocument` 是一个已解析的平方根文件；`MpfrCase` 是其中的一行，没有公开方法。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:92
msgid "`source` returns the name given to the parser and `case_count` the number of rows."
msgstr "`source` 返回传给解析器的名称，`case_count` 返回行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:100
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:687
#: manual/tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:81
msgid "Integer powers"
msgstr "整数次幂"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:104
msgid "`parse_pow_data(source, text)` parses rows of ten fields."
msgstr "`parse_pow_data(source, text)` 解析由十个字段组成的行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:110
msgid "The fields are `precision rounding input_coefficient_hex input_exponent2 input_negative exponent expected_coefficient_hex expected_exponent2 expected_negative inexact`, where the two numbers are $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot \\text{coefficient} \\cdot 2^{\\text{exponent2}}$, the signs and `inexact` are `0` or `1`, and `exponent` is the integer power. The input is read at 512 bits and the expected value at `precision` bits. Row ids are `pow:LINE`. The coefficient fields are bare hexadecimal digits; the parser builds `0xCOEFFpEXP` from them."
msgstr "字段为 `precision rounding input_coefficient_hex input_exponent2 input_negative exponent expected_coefficient_hex expected_exponent2 expected_negative inexact`，其中两个数均为 $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot \\text{coefficient} \\cdot 2^{\\text{exponent2}}$，各符号位和 `inexact` 为 `0` 或 `1`，`exponent` 是整数幂指数。输入以 512 位读取，期望值以 `precision` 位读取。行 id 为 `pow:LINE`。系数字段是不带前缀的十六进制数字；解析器由它们构造 `0xCOEFFpEXP`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:121
msgid "`execute_pow_data(document)` computes `input.pown_ctx(exponent, ctx)` with `ctx = BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_pow_data(document)` 计算 `input.pown_ctx(exponent, ctx)`，其中 `ctx = BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:128
msgid "A row passes when the result is equal (`==`) to the expected value, the inexact flag equals the row's flag, and no underflow, overflow, division by zero or invalid flag is raised."
msgstr "当结果与期望值相等（`==`）、不精确标志等于该行的标志，并且没有引发下溢、上溢、除以零或无效标志时，该行通过。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:134
msgid "`MpfrPowDocument` is a parsed power file; `MpfrPowCase` is one row and has no public methods."
msgstr "`MpfrPowDocument` 是一个已解析的幂文件；`MpfrPowCase` 是其中的一行，没有公开方法。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:149
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:214
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser and the number of rows."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称以及行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:160
msgid "`parse_elementary_data(source, text)` parses rows of ten fields: `op precision rounding x y n expected inexact invalid divbyzero`."
msgstr "`parse_elementary_data(source, text)` 解析由十个字段组成的行：`op precision rounding x y n expected inexact invalid divbyzero`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:169
msgid "`op` is one of `exp`, `exp2`, `exp10`, `expm1`, `exp2m1`, `exp10m1`, `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `log1p`, `log2p1`, `log10p1`, `sqrt`, `rsqrt`, `rootn`, `pown`, `compound`, `pow`, `powr`, `hypot`, `sin`, `cos`, `tan`, `sinpi`, `cospi`, `tanpi`, `asin`, `acos`, `atan`, `atan2`, `asinpi`, `acospi`, `atanpi`, `atan2pi`, `sinh`, `cosh`, `tanh`, `asinh`, `acosh`, `atanh`. `x` and `y` are operands read at 512 bits (`y` is `-` when unused), `n` is the integer argument of `rootn`, `pown` and `compound`, `expected` is read at `precision` bits, and the last three fields are `0` or `1`. Row ids are `op:LINE`."
msgstr "`op` 为 `exp`、`exp2`、`exp10`、`expm1`、`exp2m1`、`exp10m1`、`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`log1p`、`log2p1`、`log10p1`、`sqrt`、`rsqrt`、`rootn`、`pown`、`compound`、`pow`、`powr`、`hypot`、`sin`、`cos`、`tan`、`sinpi`、`cospi`、`tanpi`、`asin`、`acos`、`atan`、`atan2`、`asinpi`、`acospi`、`atanpi`、`atan2pi`、`sinh`、`cosh`、`tanh`、`asinh`、`acosh`、`atanh` 之一。`x` 和 `y` 是以 512 位读取的操作数（未使用时 `y` 为 `-`），`n` 是 `rootn`、`pown` 和 `compound` 的整数参数，`expected` 以 `precision` 位读取，最后三个字段为 `0` 或 `1`。行 id 为 `op:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:179
msgid "A row of the two-operand functions `pow`, `powr`, `hypot`, `atan2` and `atan2pi` whose `y` is `-` is the diagnostic `\"invalid MPFR elementary field\"`."
msgstr "双操作数函数 `pow`、`powr`、`hypot`、`atan2` 和 `atan2pi` 中 `y` 为 `-` 的行是诊断 `\"invalid MPFR elementary field\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:184
msgid "`execute_elementary_data(document)` evaluates every row with the checked `try_*_ctx` method of `BinFloat` for its operation (`sqrt_ctx` and `pown_ctx` for `sqrt` and `pown`) in `BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_elementary_data(document)` 在 `BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)` 中，用 `BinFloat` 对应其运算的 checked 方法 `try_*_ctx`（对 `sqrt` 和 `pown` 则为 `sqrt_ctx` 和 `pown_ctx`）对每一行求值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:194
msgid "A row passes when the result compares equal to the expected value (`compare == 0`, so every NaN equals every NaN) with the same sign when it is zero, the inexact, invalid and division-by-zero flags equal the row's flags, and neither underflow nor overflow is raised. If a `try_*_ctx` method returns `Err` (for example a certification failure) the row fails with the message `\"certification failure for MPFR differential case\"`."
msgstr "当结果与期望值比较相等（`compare == 0`，因此任意 NaN 都与任意 NaN 相等）且结果为零时符号相同，不精确、无效和除以零标志等于该行的标志，并且既没有引发下溢也没有引发上溢时，该行通过。若某个 `try_*_ctx` 方法返回 `Err`（例如认证失败），该行以消息 `\"certification failure for MPFR differential case\"` 失败。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:204
msgid "`MpfrElementaryDocument` is a parsed elementary file."
msgstr "`MpfrElementaryDocument` 是一个已解析的初等函数文件。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:221
msgid "Decimal character conversion"
msgstr "十进制字符转换"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:225
msgid "`parse_strtofr_data(source, text)` parses rows of seven fields: `precision rounding input expected inexact overflow underflow`."
msgstr "`parse_strtofr_data(source, text)` 解析含七个字段的行：`precision rounding input expected inexact overflow underflow`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:232
msgid "`input` is a decimal literal kept as text, `expected` is the `mpfr_strtofr` result read at `precision` bits, and the last three fields are `0` or `1`. Row ids are `strtofr:LINE`."
msgstr "`input` 是按文本保留的十进制字面量，`expected` 是以 `precision` 位读取的 `mpfr_strtofr` 结果，最后三个字段为 `0` 或 `1`。行 id 为 `strtofr:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:238
msgid "`execute_strtofr_data(document)` evaluates `BinFloat::from_string_ctx(input, ctx)` with `ctx = BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_strtofr_data(document)` 以 `ctx = BinaryContext::new(precision=precision, rounding~)` 计算 `BinFloat::from_string_ctx(input, ctx)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:245
msgid "A row passes when the result compares equal to the expected value, with the same sign (including zero) and class, the inexact, overflow and underflow flags equal the row's flags, and neither invalid nor division by zero is raised. A literal rejected by the parser fails the row."
msgstr "当结果与期望值比较相等、符号（含零）和类别相同、inexact、overflow 与 underflow 标志等于该行的标志，且未引发 invalid 或除零时，该行通过。被解析器拒绝的字面量会使该行失败。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:252
msgid "`MpfrStrtofrDocument` is a parsed file; the methods return the name given to the parser and the number of rows."
msgstr "`MpfrStrtofrDocument` 是一个已解析的文件；这些方法返回传给解析器的名称和行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:266
msgid "`parse_decimal_output_data(source, text)` parses two row kinds."
msgstr "`parse_decimal_output_data(source, text)` 解析两种行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:272
msgid "`fixed digits precision rounding value expected_digits expected_exponent10 inexact` (eight fields) is a value printed with `digits` significant digits: `expected_digits` is the digit string and `expected_exponent10` the decimal exponent of its first digit. `shortest precision value expected_digit_count` (four fields) is the number of significant digits of the shortest round-trip form. Values are read at `precision` bits. Row ids are `fixed:LINE` and `shortest:LINE`."
msgstr "`fixed digits precision rounding value expected_digits expected_exponent10 inexact`（八个字段）是以 `digits` 位有效数字打印的值：`expected_digits` 是数字串，`expected_exponent10` 是其首位数字的十进制指数。`shortest precision value expected_digit_count`（四个字段）是最短往返形式的有效数字个数。值以 `precision` 位读取。行 id 为 `fixed:LINE` 和 `shortest:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:282
msgid "`execute_decimal_output_data(document)` runs `BinFloat::to_decimal_string_ctx` for a `fixed` row and `BinFloat::to_shortest_string` for a `shortest` row."
msgstr "`execute_decimal_output_data(document)` 对 `fixed` 行运行 `BinFloat::to_decimal_string_ctx`，对 `shortest` 行运行 `BinFloat::to_shortest_string`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:289
msgid "A `fixed` row passes when the printed digits, the exponent and the sign match and the inexact flag equals the row's flag (no overflow or underflow). A `shortest` row passes when the text has exactly `expected_digit_count` significant digits (leading zeros and the trailing zeros of positional notation are not counted) and `BinFloat::from_string(text, precision~)` returns the same value."
msgstr "当打印的数字、指数和符号都匹配，且 inexact 标志等于该行的标志（无上溢或下溢）时，`fixed` 行通过。当文本恰有 `expected_digit_count` 位有效数字（不计前导零和位置记法的尾随零），且 `BinFloat::from_string(text, precision~)` 返回相同的值时，`shortest` 行通过。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:307
msgid "Seeded random rows"
msgstr "带种子的随机行"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:309
msgid "`mpfr-random-v1` rows come from `tools/generate_mpfr_random_oracle.c`: one row per case, with precisions up to 10,000, six rounding directions, an optional exponent range with its tininess rule, up to three exact operands and the MPFR result with its flags. The full field list is in [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md)."
msgstr "`mpfr-random-v1` 行来自 `tools/generate_mpfr_random_oracle.c`：每个用例一行，精度最高 10,000，有六种舍入方向、可选的带 tininess 规则的指数范围、最多三个精确操作数，以及带标志的 MPFR 结果。完整字段列表见 [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md)。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:325
msgid "Parses the text (the first argument names the source). Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are skipped. Every other line must have thirteen fields, a known operation (`add sub mul div sqrt fma strtofr getstr shortest` or one of the elementary names), a rounding of `n na z u d a`, a positive precision, an exponent range that is either `- - -` or two integers and `a`/`b`, exact operands (`[-]0x<hex>p<exp>`, `inf`, `-inf`, `nan`, `-`) and `flags` equal to `-` or a subset of `xouvz`. Operands and results are read at least at the row's precision, because reading a value below the smallest subnormal of a lower precision would flush it to zero. Each bad row is one diagnostic."
msgstr "解析文本（第一个参数为来源名）。空行和以 `#` 开头的行被跳过。其余每行必须有十三个字段、一个已知运算（`add sub mul div sqrt fma strtofr getstr shortest` 或某个初等函数名）、取值为 `n na z u d a` 的舍入、正的精度、要么是 `- - -` 要么是两个整数加 `a`/`b` 的指数范围、精确操作数（`[-]0x<hex>p<exp>`、`inf`、`-inf`、`nan`、`-`），以及等于 `-` 或 `xouvz` 子集的 `flags`。操作数和结果至少按该行的精度读取，因为以较低精度读取低于其最小次正规数的值会把它清零。每个错误行产生一条诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:341
msgid "Runs every row with the row's `BinaryContext` (bounded when the row has an exponent range, `unbounded` otherwise) and passes a row only when the value and the flags agree. Values are compared with their sign for zeros and infinities; a NaN result must be a quiet NaN. A domain error of the elementary functions (`ArithmeticError::is_domain_error`) counts as the invalid operation: a quiet NaN with flag `v`; any other error fails the row with the error message. The row id is the first field of the row."
msgstr "用该行的 `BinaryContext` 运行每一行（有指数范围时为有界，否则为 `unbounded`），只有当值和标志都一致时该行才通过。比较值时区分零和无穷的符号；NaN 结果必须是安静 NaN。初等函数的定义域错误（`ArithmeticError::is_domain_error`）视为无效操作：带标志 `v` 的安静 NaN；任何其他错误都以错误信息使该行失败。行 id 是该行的第一个字段。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:349
msgid "Seeded random decimal rows"
msgstr "带种子的随机十进制行"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:351
msgid "`mpfr-decimal-random-v2` rows come from `tools/generate_mpfr_decimal_random.py`: one row per case for the IEEE decimal elementary functions (`exp exp2 exp10 expm1 ln log2 log10 log1p sin cos tan sinpi cospi tanpi asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh asinh acosh atanh pow hypot atan2 rootn pown`), with a decimal context (precision and exponent range of an IEEE format, one of the five IEEE rounding directions: `half_even`, `half_up`, `down`, `ceiling`, `floor`), exact decimal operands and the expected value with its flags. The expected value is the rounding of a rigorous 768-bit MPFR enclosure, never one MPFR result, and a row exists only when both enclosure endpoints round alike and the rounded value lies outside the enclosure (the true value is not representable), so exact results are not sampled by this corpus."
msgstr "`mpfr-decimal-random-v2` 行由 `tools/generate_mpfr_decimal_random.py` 生成：每个用例一行，用于 IEEE 十进制初等函数（`exp exp2 exp10 expm1 ln log2 log10 log1p sin cos tan sinpi cospi tanpi asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh asinh acosh atanh pow hypot atan2 rootn pown`），带十进制上下文（IEEE 格式的精度和指数范围，IEEE 的五种舍入方向之一：`half_even`、`half_up`、`down`、`ceiling`、`floor`）、精确十进制操作数，以及期望值和标志。期望值是对一个严格的 768 位 MPFR 包络舍入的结果，而不是 MPFR 的单个结果；只有当包络两端舍入一致且舍入值落在包络之外（真值不可表示）时才产生一行，因此这个语料不抽取精确结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:372
msgid "Parses the text (the first argument names the source). Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are skipped. Every other line must have ten fields: an identifier, a known operation, a rounding of `half_even half_up down ceiling floor` (the five rounding-direction attributes of IEEE 754-2019 4.3), a positive precision, an integer `emax` that forms a valid `DecimalContext` (the IEEE format of the precision and `emax`: `emin = 1 - emax`, tininess before rounding), one operand, a second operand or `-` (required by `pow`, `hypot` and `atan2`), an integer (`rootn` and `pown`; `0` otherwise), the expected value and `flags` equal to `-` or a subset of `xouvz` (inexact, overflow, underflow, invalid operation, division by zero) in that order. Every digit written in an operand or the expected value is kept. Each bad row is one diagnostic."
msgstr "解析文本（第一个参数是来源名）。空行和以 `#` 开头的行被跳过。其余每一行必须有十个字段：标识符、已知的运算、`half_even half_up down ceiling floor` 之一的舍入（IEEE 754-2019 4.3 的五种舍入方向属性）、正的精度、构成合法 `DecimalContext` 的整数 `emax`（精度与 `emax` 所确定的 IEEE 格式：`emin = 1 - emax`，舍入前检测微小性）、一个操作数、第二个操作数或 `-`（`pow`、`hypot` 与 `atan2` 必需）、一个整数（`rootn` 与 `pown` 使用，否则为 `0`）、期望值，以及等于 `-` 或 `xouvz` 的子集（inexact、overflow、underflow、invalid operation、division by zero，按此顺序）的 `flags`。操作数和期望值中写出的每一位数字都会保留。每个错误行产生一条诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:391
msgid "Runs every row through the `try_*_ctx` form of the operation with the row's context, so a certification failure fails the row instead of becoming a quiet NaN. A row passes only when the result has the expected value *and* cohort (`total_order_compare` equal, so `1.0` and `1.00` differ) and the flags agree. The row id is the first field of the row."
msgstr "用行的上下文，通过运算的 `try_*_ctx` 形式运行每一行，因此认证失败会使该行失败，而不是变成静默的 NaN。只有当结果的值与 cohort 都等于期望（按 `total_order_compare` 比较，所以 `1.0` 与 `1.00` 不同）且标志一致时，该行才通过。行 id 是该行的第一个字段。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:399
msgid "`MpfrDecimalRandomDocument` is a parsed `mpfr-decimal-random-v2` corpus (IEEE `decimal` elementary functions against MPFR); `source` is the label it was parsed from, `case_count` the number of rows and `case_ids` their ids in order."
msgstr "`MpfrDecimalRandomDocument` 是解析后的 `mpfr-decimal-random-v2` 语料（IEEE `decimal` 初等函数对照 MPFR）；`source` 是解析时使用的标签，`case_count` 是行数，`case_ids` 按顺序给出各行的 id。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:414
msgid "`MpfrRandomDocument` is a parsed `mpfr-random-v1` corpus (binary operations against MPFR) with the same three accessors."
msgstr "`MpfrRandomDocument` 是解析后的 `mpfr-random-v1` 语料（二进制运算对照 MPFR），提供同样的三个访问器。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:423
msgid "`case_ids` lists the row ids in order, which the differential harness uses to name the failing case of a batch."
msgstr "`case_ids` 按顺序列出各行的 id，差分运行器用它来命名一个批中的失败用例。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:426
msgid "Diagnostics and results"
msgstr "诊断与结果"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:430
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:221
msgid "`ParseDiagnostic` is one invalid line."
msgstr "`ParseDiagnostic` 是一个无效行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:440
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:231
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser, the 1-based line number and the message."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称、从 1 开始的行号和消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:449
msgid "Messages name the problem, for example `\"MPFR pow row must contain ten fields\"`, `\"invalid MPFR pow field\"` or `\"invalid MPFR elementary expected value\"`."
msgstr "消息指明问题所在，例如 `\"MPFR pow row must contain ten fields\"`、`\"invalid MPFR pow field\"` 或 `\"invalid MPFR elementary expected value\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:455
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one row."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:465
msgid "These methods return the row id, whether the row passed, and a message."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、该行是否通过，以及一条消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:473
msgid "The message is empty for a pass and otherwise shows expected and actual values in hexadecimal (and the compared flags for power and elementary rows)."
msgstr "通过时消息为空，否则以十六进制显示期望值和实际值（对于幂行和初等函数行，还显示所比较的标志）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:478
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates the rows of one document."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一个文档中的各行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:488
msgid "These methods return the number of rows, and how many passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回行数，以及通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:498
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the per-row results; `success` is the verdict."
msgstr "`results` 返回逐行结果的副本；`success` 是判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:505
msgid "Every row is executed, so $\\text{total} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$; `success` is true when no row failed. `results` returns the results in row order."
msgstr "每一行都会被执行，因此 $\\text{total} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$；当没有行失败时 `success` 为真。`results` 按行序返回结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:528
msgid "These methods compare location and message and render a diagnostic for `Debug`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法比较位置和消息，并为 `Debug` 渲染诊断。新代码中请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/testfloat_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/testfloat_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/testfloat_expr` parses Berkeley TestFloat test vectors and executes them against `bin_float` in the binary16, binary32, binary64 and binary128 interchange formats. A `TestFloatSpec` describes the function, rounding mode, tininess rule and exactness that produced a vector file; `parse_testfloat` reads the vectors and `execute_document` runs them. The package does no IO; the runner is [`cli/testfloat_expr_cli`](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md) shows the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/testfloat_expr.md) specifies the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/testfloat_expr` 解析 Berkeley TestFloat 测试向量，并在 binary16、binary32、binary64 和 binary128 交换格式下针对 `bin_float` 执行它们。`TestFloatSpec` 描述生成向量文件时所用的函数、舍入模式、微小性（tininess）规则和精确性；`parse_testfloat` 读取向量，`execute_document` 运行它们。该包不进行任何 IO；运行器是 [`cli/testfloat_expr_cli`](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md)展示工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/testfloat_expr.md)规定通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:17
msgid "Add the package to the `import` block of your `moon.pkg`; import `bin_float` as well when you compare the format or rounding mode of a specification:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 的 `import` 块中；若要比较规格的格式或舍入模式，还需导入 `bin_float`："

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:27
msgid "The examples use the aliases `@testfloat_expr` and `@bin_float`."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@testfloat_expr` 和 `@bin_float`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:33
msgid "`TestFloatOperation` lists the TestFloat functions the executor supports."
msgstr "`TestFloatOperation` 列出执行器支持的 TestFloat 函数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "TestFloat name"
msgstr "TestFloat 名称"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "Operands"
msgstr "操作数"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "`bin_float` method"
msgstr "`bin_float` 方法"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:64
msgid "`to_integral_exact_ctx` if exact, else `to_integral_value_ctx`"
msgstr "精确时为 `to_integral_exact_ctx`，否则为 `to_integral_value_ctx`"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:65
msgid "`to_int_ctx`, `to_int64_ctx`, `to_uint_ctx`, `to_uint64_ctx` with `exact~`"
msgstr "带 `exact~` 的 `to_int_ctx`、`to_int64_ctx`、`to_uint_ctx`、`to_uint64_ctx`"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:66
msgid "`convert_format` (operand in the format of the function name, result in `format`)"
msgstr "`convert_format`（操作数使用函数名前缀的格式，结果使用 `format`）"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:72
msgid "`TestFloatSpec` is the configuration of one TestFloat run."
msgstr "`TestFloatSpec` 是一次 TestFloat 运行的配置。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:82
msgid "`TestFloatSpec::parse(function_name, rounding, tininess?, exact?)` builds a specification from TestFloat names."
msgstr "`TestFloatSpec::parse(function_name, rounding, tininess?, exact?)` 根据 TestFloat 名称构建一个规格。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:89
msgid "`function_name` is `FORMAT_OPERATION`: the part before the first `_` is the format (`f16`, `f32`, `f64`, `f128`) and the rest is the operation (`add`, `mulAdd`, `to_ui64`, `to_f32`, `le_quiet`, …). Names are matched case-insensitively with `-`, `_` and spaces removed. TestFloat functions outside the supported operations, such as `i32_to_f64` or `f64_to_i32_r_minMag`, are rejected; `f64_to_f32` is the conversion of a binary64 operand to binary32 (the first column is read in the format of the name's prefix, the result column in the destination format). `rounding` is one of `rnear_even`, `rnear_maxMag`, `rminMag`, `rmin`, `rmax` (also accepted without the leading `r`, or as the IEEE names `roundTiesToEven`, `roundTiesToAway`, `roundTowardZero`, `roundTowardNegative`, `roundTowardPositive`). `tininess` is `\"after\"` (default) or `\"before\"` (also `tininessAfter`, `tininessBefore`). `exact` (default `false`) selects TestFloat's `-exact` variants of `roundToInt` and the integer conversions. Errors are `\"unsupported TestFloat function name …\"`, `\"… format …\"`, `\"… operation …\"`, `\"… rounding mode …\"` and `\"… tininess mode …\"`."
msgstr "`function_name` 的形式为 `FORMAT_OPERATION`：第一个 `_` 之前的部分是格式（`f16`、`f32`、`f64`、`f128`），其余部分是运算（`add`、`mulAdd`、`to_ui64`、`to_f32`、`le_quiet`、…）。名称在去除 `-`、`_` 和空格后按不区分大小写的方式匹配。受支持运算之外的 TestFloat 函数，例如 `i32_to_f64` 或 `f64_to_i32_r_minMag`，会被拒绝；`f64_to_f32` 是把 binary64 操作数转换为 binary32（第一列按名称前缀的格式读取，结果列按目标格式读取）。`rounding` 为 `rnear_even`、`rnear_maxMag`、`rminMag`、`rmin`、`rmax` 之一（也接受去掉开头 `r` 的形式，或 IEEE 名称 `roundTiesToEven`、`roundTiesToAway`、`roundTowardZero`、`roundTowardNegative`、`roundTowardPositive`）。`tininess` 为 `\"after\"`（默认）或 `\"before\"`（也接受 `tininessAfter`、`tininessBefore`）。`exact`（默认 `false`）选择 TestFloat 中 `roundToInt` 及整数转换的 `-exact` 变体。错误为 `\"unsupported TestFloat function name …\"`、`\"… format …\"`、`\"… operation …\"`、`\"… rounding mode …\"` 和 `\"… tininess mode …\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:126
msgid "These accessors return the parsed configuration."
msgstr "这些访问器返回解析后的配置。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:137
msgid "`function_name` is the name as given. `exact` is stored for every operation but only changes the result of `roundToInt` and the four integer conversions."
msgstr "`function_name` 是按给定形式保存的名称。`exact` 对每个运算都会存储，但只改变 `roundToInt` 和四种整数转换的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:145
msgid "`parse_testfloat(source, text, spec)` parses the vectors of one function."
msgstr "`parse_testfloat(source, text, spec)` 解析一个函数的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:151
msgid "Lines are trimmed; empty lines and lines starting with `#` are skipped. A vector has $k + 2$ white-space separated fields, where $k$ is the operand count of the operation: $k$ operand encodings, the expected result and a two-digit hexadecimal flag mask. Operand encodings are hexadecimal bit patterns of `spec.format()`. The expected result is an encoding for arithmetic operations, a hexadecimal integer of at most 16 digits for conversions, and `0` or `1` for comparisons. A wrong field count gives `\"unexpected TestFloat field count\"`, an unreadable field `\"invalid TestFloat hexadecimal field\"`. The result is `Ok` only when no line is invalid."
msgstr "各行会被修剪；空行和以 `#` 开头的行被跳过。一个向量有 $k + 2$ 个以空白分隔的字段，其中 $k$ 是该运算的操作数个数：$k$ 个操作数编码、期望结果，以及一个两位十六进制的标志掩码。操作数编码是 `spec.format()` 的十六进制位模式。对于算术运算，期望结果是一个编码；对于转换，是至多 16 位的十六进制整数；对于比较，是 `0` 或 `1`。字段数错误产生 `\"unexpected TestFloat field count\"`，字段无法读取产生 `\"invalid TestFloat hexadecimal field\"`。只有当没有无效行时结果才为 `Ok`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:164
msgid "`TestFloatDocument` is a parsed vector file."
msgstr "`TestFloatDocument` 是一个已解析的向量文件。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:174
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser, the specification, a copy of the vectors in file order, and their number."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称、规格、按文件顺序排列的向量的副本，以及向量的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:186
msgid "`TestFloatCase` is one vector."
msgstr "`TestFloatCase` 是一个向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:196
msgid "These methods return the id `FUNCTION:LINE`, for example `f64_mulAdd:17`, and the 1-based line number of the vector in the parsed text."
msgstr "这些方法返回 id `FUNCTION:LINE`（例如 `f64_mulAdd:17`），以及该向量在被解析文本中从 1 开始的行号。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:244
msgid "`execute_document(document, options?)` executes the selected vectors."
msgstr "`execute_document(document, options?)` 执行被选中的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:250
msgid "Vector $k$ (counting from 0 in file order) is executed when $k \\bmod n = i$ for shard count $n$ and index $i$. Operands are decoded to `BinFloat` and the operation runs in `spec.format().context(rounding~, tininess~)`. The vector passes when:"
msgstr "对于分片数 $n$ 和索引 $i$，当 $k \\bmod n = i$ 时执行第 $k$ 个向量（按文件顺序从 0 开始计数）。操作数被解码为 `BinFloat`，运算在 `spec.format().context(rounding~, tininess~)` 中执行。向量在以下情况下通过："

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:255
msgid "**arithmetic:** the result, re-encoded in the format with the same rounding and tininess, has exactly the expected bit pattern, or the expected result is any NaN and the actual result is a quiet NaN; and the SoftFloat mask of the operation's flags combined with the encoding flags equals the expected mask;"
msgstr "**算术运算**：结果以相同的舍入和微小性规则重新编码到该格式后，其位模式与期望值完全一致，或者期望结果是任意 NaN 而实际结果是静默 NaN；并且运算标志与编码标志合并后的 SoftFloat 掩码等于期望掩码；"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:260
msgid "**integer conversion:** if the expected mask has the invalid bit `10`, the conversion must report invalid (`None`) and its value field is ignored; otherwise the conversion must return the expected integer (signed results compared as two's-complement bit patterns); in both cases the flag masks must be equal;"
msgstr "**整数转换**：若期望掩码含有无效位 `10`，则转换必须报告无效（`None`），其值字段被忽略；否则转换必须返回期望的整数（有符号结果按二进制补码位模式比较）；两种情况下标志掩码都必须相等；"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:265
msgid "**comparison:** the boolean and the flag mask are equal."
msgstr "**比较**：布尔值与标志掩码都相等。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:267
msgid "Every selected vector is executable; there are no skipped vectors."
msgstr "每个被选中的向量都是可执行的；不存在被跳过的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:271
msgid "`RunOptions` selects a shard."
msgstr "`RunOptions` 选择一个分片。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:281
msgid "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?)` builds the options."
msgstr "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?)` 构建选项。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:287
msgid "Defaults: one shard, index 0. `RunOptions::new` aborts unless `shard_count > 0` and `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`."
msgstr "默认值：一个分片，索引 0。除非 `shard_count > 0` 且 `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`，否则 `RunOptions::new` 中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:292
msgid "These accessors return the shard count and index."
msgstr "这些访问器返回分片数和分片索引。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:303
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one vector."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一个向量的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:313
msgid "These methods return the vector id, whether it passed, and a message."
msgstr "这些方法返回向量 id、它是否通过，以及一条消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:321
msgid "Messages: empty for a pass; `\"value mismatch: expected HEX, actual HEX\"`, `\"integer mismatch: …\"`, `\"comparison mismatch: …\"`, or `\"flags mismatch: expected M, actual M\"` (masks in decimal)."
msgstr "消息：通过时为空；否则为 `\"value mismatch: expected HEX, actual HEX\"`、`\"integer mismatch: …\"`、`\"comparison mismatch: …\"` 或 `\"flags mismatch: expected M, actual M\"`（掩码以十进制表示）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:327
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates a run."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一次运行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:337
msgid "These methods return the number of vectors in the document, the number this shard executed, and how many of those passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回文档中的向量数、本分片执行的数目，以及其中通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:349
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the results in vector order; `success` is the verdict."
msgstr "`results` 按向量顺序返回结果的副本；`success` 是判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:357
msgid "`total_cases` is the number of vectors in the document, `selected_cases = passed_cases + failed_cases` the number executed by this shard, and `success` is true when none failed."
msgstr "`total_cases` 是文档中的向量数，`selected_cases = passed_cases + failed_cases` 是本分片执行的向量数，当没有向量失败时 `success` 为真。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:368
msgid "`equal` compares constructors; `to_repr` renders the constructor name."
msgstr "`equal` 比较构造器；`to_repr` 渲染构造器名称。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:378
msgid "`equal` compares all six fields, including `function_name` as written, so `f64_mul` and `F64_MUL` give unequal specifications with the same behaviour."
msgstr "`equal` 比较全部六个字段，包括按书写形式比较的 `function_name`，因此 `f64_mul` 和 `F64_MUL` 给出行为相同但不相等的规格。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:389
msgid "`equal` compares location and message; `to_repr` renders both."
msgstr "`equal` 比较位置和消息；`to_repr` 渲染两者。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:1
msgid "internal API"
msgstr "internal API"

#: manual/api/internal.md:5
msgid "`internal` holds exact integer and rational helpers for the numeric cores: powers of 2, 5 and 10, digit counting, removal of trailing factors, integer division with an explicit rounding mode, a decimal string splitter, reduced rationals, dyadic enclosures and the refinement budget of the certified elementary functions. It is an internal package: it cannot be imported from outside `Luna-Flow/floating`, and its interface may change without notice. The [design page](../design/internal.md) proves the rounding and enclosure invariants; the [tutorial](../tutorial/internal.md) shows how the helpers combine."
msgstr "`internal` 包含供各数值核心使用的精确整数与有理数辅助函数：2、5 和 10 的幂，数字位数计数，去除尾部因子，带显式舍入模式的整数除法，十进制字符串拆分器，最简有理数，二进有理数包络，以及经认证初等函数的细化预算。它是一个内部包：无法从 `Luna-Flow/floating` 之外导入，其接口可能在不另行通知的情况下变更。[设计页面](../design/internal.md)证明舍入与包络不变式；[教程](../tutorial/internal.md)展示这些辅助函数如何组合使用。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:15
msgid "Not every helper is used by every core. On the current branch the library code uses:"
msgstr "并非每个核心都使用每个辅助函数。在当前分支上，库代码的使用情况如下："

#: manual/api/internal.md:18
#: manual/getting_started.md:13
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/api/internal.md:18
msgid "Helpers it uses"
msgstr "所用的辅助函数"

#: manual/api/internal.md:23
msgid "The binary and decimal cores round their own coefficients with their own kernels. The remaining helpers (`round_shift`, `remove_factor10`, `trim_trailing_decimal_zeros`, `exact_divide_by_power_of_ten`, `compare_abs` and the `CertifiedDyadic` family) are exercised by the tests of this package and of the cores only. `semantic` no longer uses `internal`: it owns its exact rational (`ExactRational`) and its normalization."
msgstr "二进制和十进制核心使用各自的内核来舍入自己的系数。其余的辅助函数（`round_shift`、`remove_factor10`、`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros`、`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten`、`compare_abs` 以及 `CertifiedDyadic` 系列）仅由本包的测试和各核心的测试使用。`semantic` 不再使用 `internal`：它自己拥有精确有理数（`ExactRational`）及其规范化。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:30
msgid "Decimal exponent bounds"
msgstr "十进制指数边界"

#: manual/api/internal.md:32
msgid "`DecimalExponentBounds` validates the adopted decNumber `decContext.h` limits used by both decimal cores and computes the context-derived exponent endpoints without `Int` wraparound. Precision must be in `1..=999,999,999`, `e_min` in `-999,999,999..=0`, and `e_max` in `0..=999,999,999`. GDA 1.70 specifies no fixed context limits and requires a balanced exponent range; that separate balance rule is not enforced here."
msgstr "`DecimalExponentBounds` 用于验证两个十进制核心采用的 decNumber `decContext.h` 限制，并在不发生 `Int` 回绕的情况下计算由上下文导出的指数端点。precision 必须在 `1..=999,999,999` 范围内，`e_min` 在 `-999,999,999..=0` 范围内，`e_max` 在 `0..=999,999,999` 范围内。GDA 1.70 未规定固定的上下文限制，并要求指数范围平衡；这里不强制该单独的平衡规则。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:51
msgid "For valid inputs, `etiny` is $e_{\\min} - p + 1$ and `etop` is $e_{\\max} - p + 1$. Invalid inputs set `is_valid()` to false; the returned endpoints are clamped only to keep this internal value total, and callers must reject the context before using them."
msgstr "对于有效输入，`etiny` 为 $e_{\\min} - p + 1$，`etop` 为 $e_{\\max} - p + 1$。对于无效输入，`is_valid()` 返回 `false`；为使此内部值对所有输入都有定义，返回的端点仅会在必要时钳制，调用方必须先拒绝无效上下文，不能使用这些端点。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:58
#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:25
#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:17
#: manual/api/internal/decimal_kernel.md:20
#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:16
msgid "Inside the module, add the package to `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在模块内部，将该包添加到 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/internal.md:66
msgid "The examples call the package as `@internal.` and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@lf_arith.`; `BigInt` literals are written `12N`. The interface prints `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@arithmetic` (`RoundingMode`, `ArithmeticError`, `CertificationStage`, `CertificationFailureReason`) and uses `@def.Sign`."
msgstr "示例以 `@internal.` 调用该包，以 `@lf_arith.` 调用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`；`BigInt` 字面量写作 `12N`。接口将 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 显示为 `@arithmetic`（`RoundingMode`、`ArithmeticError`、`CertificationStage`、`CertificationFailureReason`），并使用 `@def.Sign`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:71
msgid "Integer basics"
msgstr "整数基础"

#: manual/api/internal.md:75
msgid "These functions return the `BigInt` constants $0$ and $1$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 `BigInt` 常量 $0$ 和 $1$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:84
msgid "`abs_bigint(x)` is $|x|$, and `compare_abs(a, b)` compares $|a|$ with $|b|$."
msgstr "`abs_bigint(x)` 为 $|x|$，`compare_abs(a, b)` 比较 $|a|$ 与 $|b|$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:91
msgid "`compare_abs` returns a negative, zero or positive `Int` (the result of `BigInt::compare` on the magnitudes)."
msgstr "`compare_abs` 返回负数、零或正数的 `Int`（即对两者绝对值调用 `BigInt::compare` 的结果）。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:102
msgid "Powers"
msgstr "幂"

#: manual/api/internal.md:106
msgid "These functions return $5^n$ and $10^n$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 $5^n$ 和 $10^n$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:113
msgid "They abort when $n < 0$. `pow5` and `pow10` read a process-wide cache that starts with $n \\le 18$ and is extended on demand up to $n = 4096$; larger powers are computed each time without caching."
msgstr "当 $n < 0$ 时它们会中止。`pow5` 和 `pow10` 读取一个进程级缓存，该缓存初始包含 $n \\le 18$ 的幂，并按需扩展到至多 $n = 4096$；更大的幂每次都重新计算，不做缓存。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:119
msgid "`digits10(x)` is the number of decimal digits of $|x|$, with `digits10(0) == 1`."
msgstr "`digits10(x)` 是 $|x|$ 的十进制位数，且 `digits10(0) == 1`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:126
msgid ""
"For $x \\n"
"e 0$ it returns the unique $d$ with $10^{d-1} \\le |x| < 10^{d}$, starting from an estimate based on the bit length and correcting it with comparisons against powers of ten (no decimal string is built)."
msgstr ""
"对于 $x \\n"
"e 0$，它返回满足 $10^{d-1} \\le |x| < 10^{d}$ 的唯一 $d$：先根据位长给出估计，再通过与 10 的幂比较加以修正（不构造十进制字符串）。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:140
msgid "Trailing factors"
msgstr "尾部因子"

#: manual/api/internal.md:144
msgid "`remove_factor10(coeff, exp)` removes all factors 10 from `coeff`, adjusting the decimal exponent."
msgstr "`remove_factor10(coeff, exp)` 从 `coeff` 中去除所有因子 10，并相应调整十进制指数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:151
msgid "The value $\\mathit{coeff} \\cdot 10^{\\mathit{exp}}$ and the sign are preserved and the new coefficient is not divisible by 10. Zero gives $(0, 0)$."
msgstr "值 $\\mathit{coeff} \\cdot 10^{\\mathit{exp}}$ 和符号保持不变，且新的系数不能被 10 整除。零得到 $(0, 0)$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:156
msgid "`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros(coeff, exp, max_drop?)` removes up to `max_drop` trailing decimal zeros."
msgstr "`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros(coeff, exp, max_drop?)` 去除至多 `max_drop` 个十进制尾随零。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:163
msgid "It returns $(c', e', k)$ with $c = c' \\cdot 10^{k}$, $e' = e + k$, and $k$ maximal subject to $k \\le$ `max_drop`. A negative `max_drop` (the default $-1$) sets the limit to `digits10(c) - 1`, which never binds because a non-zero integer with $k$ trailing zeros has at least $k + 1$ digits; so the default removes every trailing zero. Zero gives $(0, 0, 0)$. A limit lets a caller stop at a target exponent, as decNumber-style trimming to an ideal exponent does."
msgstr "它返回 $(c', e', k)$，满足 $c = c' \\cdot 10^{k}$、$e' = e + k$，且 $k$ 在 $k \\le$ `max_drop` 的约束下取最大。负的 `max_drop`（默认 $-1$）将限制设为 `digits10(c) - 1`，该限制永远不会起作用，因为带有 $k$ 个尾随零的非零整数至少有 $k + 1$ 位数字；因此默认情况下会去除所有尾随零。零得到 $(0, 0, 0)$。设置限制可让调用方在某个目标指数处停下，正如 decNumber 风格的、截尾到理想指数的做法那样。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:173
msgid "`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten(coeff, shift)` is `Some(coeff / 10^shift)` when the division is exact and `None` otherwise."
msgstr "当除法精确时，`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten(coeff, shift)` 为 `Some(coeff / 10^shift)`，否则为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:180
msgid "The sign is kept. Zero gives `Some(0)` for every `shift`; for a non-zero coefficient a negative `shift` aborts."
msgstr "符号保持不变。对于任意 `shift`，零都得到 `Some(0)`；对于非零系数，负的 `shift` 会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:195
msgid "Rounding integer quotients"
msgstr "整数商的舍入"

#: manual/api/internal.md:199
msgid "`round_positive_div(n, d, negative, mode)` rounds the quotient $n/d$ to an integer magnitude."
msgstr "`round_positive_div(n, d, negative, mode)` 将商 $n/d$ 舍入为一个整数量值。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:206
msgid "Requires $n \\ge 0$ and $d > 0$ (aborts otherwise). `negative` is the sign of the real quotient whose magnitude is $n/d$; the result is $|\\circ_{\\text{mode}}((-1)^{\\text{negative}}\\, n/d)|$, where $\\circ$ rounds to an integer:"
msgstr "要求 $n \\ge 0$ 且 $d > 0$（否则中止）。`negative` 是量值为 $n/d$ 的实数商的符号；结果为 $|\\circ_{\\text{mode}}((-1)^{\\text{negative}}\\, n/d)|$，其中 $\\circ$ 表示舍入到整数："

#: manual/api/internal.md:211
msgid "result for $n = qd + r$, $0 \\le r < d$"
msgstr "对 $n = qd + r$、$0 \\le r < d$ 的结果"

#: manual/api/internal.md:219
msgid "The result is exact (equal to $n/d$) exactly when $r = 0$."
msgstr "结果是精确的（等于 $n/d$）当且仅当 $r = 0$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:240
msgid "`round_shift(m, s, negative, mode)` is `round_positive_div(m, 2^s, negative, mode)` computed with shifts."
msgstr "`round_shift(m, s, negative, mode)` 即用移位计算的 `round_positive_div(m, 2^s, negative, mode)`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:247
msgid "For $s \\le 0$ it returns $m$ unchanged (it never shifts left). $m$ should be non-negative; this is not checked. For a negative $m$ the quotient is the floor $\\lfloor m / 2^{s} \\rfloor$ of an arithmetic shift and the remainder is non-negative, so the table above no longer describes the rounding of $|m|$: `round_shift(-5N, 1, false, TowardZero)` is $-3$, not $-2$."
msgstr "对于 $s \\le 0$，它原样返回 $m$（从不左移）。$m$ 应为非负数；这一点不会被检查。对于负的 $m$，商是算术移位的下取整 $\\lfloor m / 2^{s} \\rfloor$，余数为非负，因此上表不再描述 $|m|$ 的舍入：`round_shift(-5N, 1, false, TowardZero)` 为 $-3$，而不是 $-2$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:253
msgid "Decimal strings"
msgstr "十进制字符串"

#: manual/api/internal.md:257
msgid "`split_decimal_string(text)` splits a finite decimal literal into sign, digits and exponent; `split_decimal_string_wide` returns the exponent as an `Int64`."
msgstr "`split_decimal_string(text)` 将一个有限十进制字面量拆分为符号、数字串和指数；`split_decimal_string_wide` 以 `Int64` 返回指数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:266
msgid "The accepted grammar is"
msgstr "所接受的语法为"

#: manual/api/internal.md:272
msgid "The result $(\\mathit{neg}, D, q)$ satisfies $\\text{value} = (-1)^{\\mathit{neg}} \\cdot D \\cdot 10^{q}$, where $D$ is the string of all mantissa digits (leading zeros kept) and $q$ is the written exponent minus the number of fraction digits. In the wide form the written exponent is exact up to $10^{18}$ in magnitude and saturates there, which is far outside every exponent range. `split_decimal_string` returns `None` when $q$ does not fit `Int`. Anything else, including whitespace, `_`, `inf` and `nan`, gives `None`."
msgstr "结果 $(\\mathit{neg}, D, q)$ 满足 $\\text{value} = (-1)^{\\mathit{neg}} \\cdot D \\cdot 10^{q}$，其中 $D$ 是全部尾数数字组成的字符串（保留前导零），$q$ 是书写的指数减去小数部分的位数。在宽版本中，书写的指数在绝对值不超过 $10^{18}$ 时是精确的，超出则饱和于此，这远在任何指数范围之外。当 $q$ 不能放入 `Int` 时，`split_decimal_string` 返回 `None`。其他任何输入，包括空白、`_`、`inf` 和 `nan`，都得到 `None`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:295
#: manual/design/internal.md:48
msgid "Dyadic enclosures"
msgstr "二进有理数包络"

#: manual/api/internal.md:299
msgid "`CertifiedDyadic` is the dyadic rational $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$, where $n$ is `numerator_` and the scale $s$ = `scale_` is non-negative."
msgstr "`CertifiedDyadic` 是二进有理数 $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$，其中 $n$ 为 `numerator_`，标度 $s$ = `scale_` 非负。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:309
msgid "The fields are readable but the struct cannot be built literally outside the package; build values with `new` or `from_int`."
msgstr "这些字段可读，但无法在包外以字面量方式构建该结构体；请用 `new` 或 `from_int` 构建值。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:314
msgid "`new(n, s)` is $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$ (aborts if $s < 0$); `from_int(k)` is $k \\cdot 2^{0}$; the accessors return the fields."
msgstr "`new(n, s)` 为 $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$（若 $s < 0$ 则中止）；`from_int(k)` 为 $k \\cdot 2^{0}$；访问器返回各字段。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:324
msgid "The representation is not normalized: $2 \\cdot 2^{-1}$ and $1 \\cdot 2^{0}$ are different values of the struct with the same number."
msgstr "该表示未经规范化：$2 \\cdot 2^{-1}$ 和 $1 \\cdot 2^{0}$ 是该结构体的两个不同的值，但表示同一个数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:329
msgid "These methods are exact arithmetic and comparison of dyadic numbers."
msgstr "这些方法是二进有理数的精确算术与比较。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:339
msgid "`add` and `sub` align to the larger scale; `mul` adds the scales; `compare` compares the numbers (not the representations), so `new(2N, 1).compare(from_int(1))` is `0`."
msgstr "`add` 和 `sub` 对齐到较大的标度；`mul` 将标度相加；`compare` 比较的是数值（而非表示），因此 `new(2N, 1).compare(from_int(1))` 为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:345
msgid "`x.round_down(s)` and `x.round_up(s)` are the largest dyadic $\\le x$ and the smallest dyadic $\\ge x$ with scale $s$: $\\lfloor x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rfloor \\cdot 2^{-s}$ and $\\lceil x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rceil \\cdot 2^{-s}$."
msgstr "`x.round_down(s)` 和 `x.round_up(s)` 分别是标度为 $s$ 的二进有理数中 $\\le x$ 的最大者和 $\\ge x$ 的最小者：$\\lfloor x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rfloor \\cdot 2^{-s}$ 与 $\\lceil x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rceil \\cdot 2^{-s}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:355
msgid "Abort if $s < 0$. When $s$ is at least the current scale the value is re-expressed exactly (the numerator is shifted left). Both directions are true floor and ceiling for negative numbers too: $-5/4$ rounds down to $-2$ and up to $-1$ at scale $0$."
msgstr "若 $s < 0$ 则中止。当 $s$ 不小于当前标度时，值被精确地重新表示（分子左移）。对于负数，两个方向也都是真正的下取整和上取整：在标度 $0$ 下，$-5/4$ 向下舍入为 $-2$，向上舍入为 $-1$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:362
msgid "`CertifiedInterval[T]` is an ordered pair `lower <= upper` used as an enclosure."
msgstr "`CertifiedInterval[T]` 是一个满足 `lower <= upper` 的有序对，用作包络。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:374
msgid "`new(lower, upper, compare)` checks the order with the given comparison and builds the pair; `lower` and `upper` return the endpoints."
msgstr "`new(lower, upper, compare)` 用给定的比较函数检查顺序并构建该二元组；`lower` 和 `upper` 返回端点。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:383
msgid "When `compare(lower, upper) > 0`, `new` returns a certification-failure error for the operation `\"interval\"` with stage `EnclosurePropagation`, reason `InvalidEnclosure`, target and working precision 1 and 0 refinements."
msgstr "当 `compare(lower, upper) > 0` 时，`new` 返回一个针对运算 `\"interval\"` 的认证失败错误，其阶段为 `EnclosurePropagation`，原因为 `InvalidEnclosure`，目标精度和工作精度为 1，细化次数为 0。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:389
msgid "`certified_dyadic_fraction(n, d, s)` encloses $n/d$ between two dyadics of scale $s$."
msgstr "`certified_dyadic_fraction(n, d, s)` 用两个标度为 $s$ 的二进有理数包络 $n/d$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:396
msgid "The result is $[\\lfloor n 2^{s}/d \\rfloor 2^{-s},\\ \\lceil n 2^{s}/d \\rceil 2^{-s}]$ for either sign of $n$: it contains $n/d$, has width $0$ or $2^{-s}$, and is a point exactly when $d \\mid n 2^{s}$. A non-positive $d$ gives a domain error."
msgstr "无论 $n$ 的符号如何，结果都为 $[\\lfloor n 2^{s}/d \\rfloor 2^{-s},\\ \\lceil n 2^{s}/d \\rceil 2^{-s}]$：它包含 $n/d$，宽度为 $0$ 或 $2^{-s}$，且当且仅当 $d \\mid n 2^{s}$ 时为单点。非正的 $d$ 产生定义域错误。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:403
msgid "`certified_dyadic_div(a, b, s)` encloses the quotient $a/b$ of two dyadics at scale $s$."
msgstr "`certified_dyadic_div(a, b, s)` 以标度 $s$ 包络两个二进有理数的商 $a/b$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:410
msgid "$b = 0$ gives a division-by-zero error. Otherwise the result is `certified_dyadic_fraction` applied to $a/b$ written with a positive denominator."
msgstr "$b = 0$ 产生除以零错误。否则，结果是将 `certified_dyadic_fraction` 作用于写成正分母形式的 $a/b$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:430
msgid "Refinement budgets"
msgstr "细化预算"

#: manual/api/internal.md:434
msgid "`CertifiedRefinementBudget` tracks the working precision and the number of refinements of a Ziv-style evaluation loop."
msgstr "`CertifiedRefinementBudget` 跟踪 Ziv 式求值循环的工作精度和细化次数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:448
msgid "`new(p, limit?)` starts at working precision $\\max(1, p)$ with zero refinements. `limit` is `Some(n)`, a limit of $\\max(1, n)$ refinements (default `Some(12)`), or `None`, no count limit. `next()` increases the precision by $\\max(32, \\lfloor p/2 \\rfloor)$ and counts one refinement. `available()` is true while fewer than `n` refinements were made, and, for `None`, while the working precision does not exceed `certified_unbounded_work_cap` of the starting precision."
msgstr "`new(p, limit?)` 以工作精度 $\\max(1, p)$、零次细化开始。`limit` 为 `Some(n)`，即细化次数上限 $\\max(1, n)$（默认 `Some(12)`），或为 `None`，即没有次数限制。`next()` 将精度增加 $\\max(32, \\lfloor p/2 \\rfloor)$，并计入一次细化。只要已进行的细化次数少于 `n`，`available()` 就为真；对 `None`，则只要工作精度不超过起始精度对应的 `certified_unbounded_work_cap`，它就为真。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:464
msgid "`next` does not check `available`; a loop must test `available()` itself."
msgstr "`next` 不检查 `available`；循环必须自行检测 `available()`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:483
msgid "`certified_refinement_continues(limit, attempt, work, precision)` tells a hand-written refinement loop whether it may run another step: `Some(n)` allows `attempt < max(1, n)`, `None` allows the step while `work` does not exceed `certified_unbounded_work_cap(precision)`. That cap is the larger of 8,000,000 and 256 times `precision`, at most 1,000,000,000."
msgstr "`certified_refinement_continues(limit, attempt, work, precision)` 告诉手写的细化循环是否还可以再运行一步：`Some(n)` 允许 `attempt < max(1, n)`，`None` 则在 `work` 不超过 `certified_unbounded_work_cap(precision)` 时允许。该上限取 8,000,000 与 `precision` 的 256 倍中较大者，至多为 1,000,000,000。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:496
msgid "`certified_failure(operation, stage, reason, target_precision, budget)` builds the `ArithmeticError` a certified operation returns when it gives up."
msgstr "`certified_failure(operation, stage, reason, target_precision, budget)` 构建经认证运算放弃时返回的 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:503
msgid "The error's detail records the operation name, stage, reason, target precision, and the budget's current working precision and refinement count."
msgstr "该错误的详情记录运算名、阶段、原因、目标精度，以及预算当前的工作精度和细化次数。"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:1
msgid "internal/bin_kernel API"
msgstr "internal/bin_kernel API"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:5
msgid "`internal/bin_kernel` holds the integer arithmetic on the coefficients of `BinFloat`: a non-negative arbitrary-precision integer `Coeff`, its comparison, addition, subtraction, shifts and bit operations, the multiplication algorithms (schoolbook, Karatsuba, Toom-3 and the two-prime NTT), division (Knuth's algorithm D and Burnikel-Ziegler), the integer square root, the GCD, and the conversions to and from bytes and text in any radix, with the per-target thresholds that choose between the algorithms. Every function is an exact function of its arguments. The package raises no condition and has no notion of a rounding mode, a context or a flag; those belong to `bin_float`. `internal/bin_kernel` also declares the internal enum `BinRepr`, the representation of `BinFloat` (one file per target: `repr_nonjs.mbt` and `repr_js.mbt`); see the design page of `bin_float`, section \"Representation of a value\". It is an internal package: code outside `Luna-Flow/floating` cannot import it. The public coefficient type `BinCoeff` of `bin_float` is a newtype over `Coeff` whose methods (construction, conversion, comparison and queries) forward to this package; the arithmetic exists only here. The name `Coeff` appears in the interface of `BinCoeff`, but a user outside the module cannot import this package and so cannot call or compare anything on it. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md) and the [design page](../../design/internal/bin_kernel.md)."
msgstr "`internal/bin_kernel` 提供 `BinFloat` 系数所需的整数算术：非负任意精度整数 `Coeff`，及其比较、加法、减法、移位和位运算；乘法算法（朴素乘法、Karatsuba、Toom-3 和双素数 NTT）；除法（Knuth 算法 D 与 Burnikel-Ziegler）；整数平方根；GCD；以及与字节和任意进制文本之间的转换，并带有在各算法之间选择的分目标阈值。每个函数都是其参数的精确函数。本包不抛出任何状况，也没有舍入模式、上下文或标志的概念，这些都属于 `bin_float`。`internal/bin_kernel` 还声明内部枚举 `BinRepr`，即 `BinFloat` 的表示（每个目标一个文件：`repr_nonjs.mbt` 和 `repr_js.mbt`）；参见 `bin_float` 设计页的“值的表示”一节。它是内部包：`Luna-Flow/floating` 之外的代码无法导入。`bin_float` 的公共系数类型 `BinCoeff` 是 `Coeff` 之上的 newtype，其方法（构造、转换、比较和查询）转发到本包；算术只存在于这里。`Coeff` 这个名字出现在 `BinCoeff` 的接口中，但模块之外的用户无法导入本包，因此无法对它调用或比较任何东西。参见[教程](../../tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md)和[设计页](../../design/internal/bin_kernel.md)。"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:33
#: manual/api/internal/decimal_kernel.md:28
msgid "and bring the names a package uses into scope once, for example in a file of its own:"
msgstr "然后把包用到的名字一次性引入作用域，例如放在单独的文件里："

