msgstr "本手册的示例检查器没有内部子包的别名，所以这些示例标为 `nocheck`。"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:44
#: manual/api/internal/decimal_kernel.md:43
msgid "The coefficient type"
msgstr "系数类型"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:48
msgid "A non-negative integer. On Native, LLVM, Wasm and Wasm-GC it is a newtype over `CoeffRepr`; on JavaScript it is a host `bigint`. The value is persistent: no function mutates an operand."
msgstr "非负整数。在 Native、LLVM、Wasm 和 Wasm-GC 上它是 `CoeffRepr` 之上的 newtype；在 JavaScript 上它是宿主 `bigint`。值是持久的：没有任何函数会修改操作数。"

#: manual/api/internal/bin_kernel.md:54
msgid "The storage on the targets that are not JavaScript: `Inline64(low)` and `Inline128(high, low)` for values below $2^{64}$ and $2^{128}$, and `Heap(words, len)` for larger ones, with `len` little-endian 64-bit limbs of which the top one is nonzero. The constructors are readable because the word-sized fast paths of `bin_float` pattern-match on them; build values with the functions below."
msgstr "非 JavaScript 目标上的存储：低于 $2^{64}$ 和 $2^{128}$ 的值分别用 `Inline64(low)` 和 `Inline128(high, low)`，更大的值用 `Heap(words, len)`，其中有 `len` 个小端 64 位肢，最高肢非零。构造器可读是因为 `bin_float` 的单字快速路径会对它们做模式匹配；构造值请使用下面的函数。"

