#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:32
msgid "This is the tightness documentation that §12.10.3 requires, for the inf-sup type with `p`-bit `BinFloat` endpoints and the binary64 exponent range (`BallContext::new(precision=p, e_max=1023)`; `p = 53` is the binary64 inf-sup type of the ITF1788 corpus). *Tightest* means the result is the hull of the exact range in that type (§12.10.1, (27)); *valid* means it contains the exact range ((26)). No operation claims the intermediate *accurate* mode. Every operation returns Empty for an Empty input. The ITF1788 phases cited below compare both endpoints for equality with the corpus's tightest binary64 result, so a passing phase is tightness evidence for every case it runs, not only containment."
msgstr "这是 §12.10.3 要求的紧性说明，针对端点为 `p` 位 `BinFloat`、指数范围为 binary64 的 inf-sup 类型（`BallContext::new(precision=p, e_max=1023)`；`p = 53` 即 ITF1788 语料所用的 binary64 inf-sup 类型）。*最紧*（tightest）指结果等于该类型下精确值域的 hull（§12.10.1，式 (27)）；*有效*（valid）指结果包含精确值域（式 (26)）。没有运算声称达到中间的 *accurate* 模式。对 Empty 输入，所有运算都返回 Empty。下文引用的 ITF1788 阶段会把两个端点与语料给出的 binary64 最紧结果做相等比较，因此一个通过的阶段对其运行的每个用例都是紧性证据，而不只是包含关系的证据。"

