#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:83
msgid "Expected results are compared by set meaning: endpoint containment, set relations, boolean relations, overlap states, numeric observations, and decorations use operation-specific comparators. A conservative interval may be valid when the contract permits widening; an enclosure that excludes an exact result is never valid."
msgstr "预期结果按集合意义比较：端点包含、集合关系、布尔关系、overlap state、数值观察和 decoration 分别使用操作专用比较器。合同允许放宽时，更宽区间可以正确；排除精确结果的包络永远错误。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:85
msgid "Supported phases"
msgstr "支持的阶段"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:87
msgid "The strict matrix covers sets, relations, observations, cancellation, add/subtract/multiply/divide, elementary core, exponential/logarithmic functions, general power, trigonometric functions, `atan2`, hyperbolic functions, inverse trigonometric functions, FMA, integer power, extrema, the integer functions, reverse multiplication (`mulRev`, `mulRevTen`, `mulRevToPair`), the algebraic reverse functions (`sqrRev`, `absRev`, `pownRev`, `coshRev`), the trigonometric reverse functions (`sinRev`, `cosRev`, `tanRev`), `powRev1` and `powRev2` (the generated `atan2Rev1` and `atan2Rev2` cases are a phase of their own and are not part of the ITF1788 count). Phase operation sets are disjoint so a row is never counted twice."
msgstr "strict 矩阵涵盖集合、关系、观察、抵消、加/减/乘/除、初等函数核心、指数/对数函数、一般幂、三角函数、`atan2`、双曲函数、反三角函数、FMA、整数幂、极值、整数函数、反向乘法（`mulRev`、`mulRevTen`、`mulRevToPair`）、代数反向函数（`sqrRev`、`absRev`、`pownRev`、`coshRev`）、三角反向函数（`sinRev`、`cosRev`、`tanRev`）以及 `powRev1` 与 `powRev2`（生成的 `atan2Rev1` 与 `atan2Rev2` 用例是单独的阶段，不计入 ITF1788 总数）。各阶段的运算集合互不相交，因此同一行不会被重复计数。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:89
msgid "Decorations and fallbacks"
msgstr "装饰与回退"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:91
msgid "Empty, Entire, and decorated NaI are separate states. Elementary kernels use directed dyadic certificates. When range reduction cannot be certified, `sin`/`cos` return `[-1,1]` and `tan` returns Entire; that preserves inclusion but does not promise tightness. A passing gate does not cover inputs outside the corpus: the remaining defects listed under [Known limitations](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations) (the decoration of `rootn` with a negative degree) are not exercised by the selected cases."
msgstr "Empty、Entire 和装饰后的 NaI 是彼此独立的状态。初等函数内核使用定向二进有理数证书。当范围约简无法认证时，`sin`/`cos` 返回 `[-1,1]`，`tan` 返回 Entire；这保持了包含性，但不保证紧致性。门禁通过并不覆盖语料之外的输入：[已知局限](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations)中列出的其余缺陷（负次数 `rootn` 的装饰）未被所选用例覆盖。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:93
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "排除范围"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:95
msgid "Reverse interval operations other than `mulRev`, `mulRevToPair`, `sqrRev`, `absRev`, `pownRev`, `coshRev`, `sinRev`, `cosRev`, `tanRev`, `powRev1`, `powRev2`, `atan2Rev1` and `atan2Rev2`, every decoration rule outside the selected phases, arbitrary endpoint formats, and unpinned upstream revisions remain outside the claim."
msgstr "`mulRev`、`mulRevToPair`、`sqrRev`、`absRev`、`pownRev`、`coshRev`、`sinRev`、`cosRev`、`tanRev`、`powRev1`、`powRev2`、`atan2Rev1`、`atan2Rev2` 以外的 reverse interval operation、选定 phase 以外的全部 decoration 规则、任意 endpoint format 和未固定的上游 revision 均不在声明内。"

