msgstr "证据的稳定性"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:169
msgid "The pinned matrix is the release evidence boundary; adding a new operation requires a new corpus contract and independent oracle. Run `just conformance smoke binary` for the checked-in gate and `just gate binary` for the full pinned gate."
msgstr "固定矩阵是发布证据的边界；新增一个运算需要新的语料契约和独立的预言机。运行 `just conformance smoke binary` 执行已提交的门禁，运行 `just gate binary` 执行完整的固定门禁。"

