#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:9
msgid "The committed IEEE corpus covers decimal32/64/128 DPD and BID interchange, canonical and non-canonical encodings, special values, flags, total order, and core arithmetic. The DPD fixture exhaustively checks all 1,024 declets."
msgstr "提交到仓库的 IEEE 语料覆盖 decimal32/64/128 DPD/BID interchange、canonical 与 non-canonical 编码、特殊值、flags、total order 和核心算术。DPD fixture 穷举全部 1,024 个 declet。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:11
msgid "Oracle layers"
msgstr "预言机分层"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:13
msgid "Mandatory operation vectors use exact integer/rational construction and the documented DPD/BID bridge. Elementary families use independent high-precision or interval oracles when available. Values or encoded bits and IEEE flags are recorded independently so a numerically plausible result cannot hide a flag error."
msgstr "mandatory operation vector 使用精确整数/有理数构造和已记录的 DPD/BID bridge。初等函数在可用时使用独立高精度或区间 oracle。结果值或编码 bits 与 IEEE flags 分开记录，避免“数值看似正确”掩盖 flag 错误。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:15
msgid "The committed elementary layer contains 3,060 certified rows. MPFR 4.2.2 produces directed 768-bit dyadic endpoints; exact integer conversion rounds both endpoints into decimal32/64/128 under each of the five `DecimalRoundingMode` values, and the generator rejects a row unless result and flags are unique. Native, Wasm, Wasm-GC, and JavaScript each pass 573/573 public API tests after these rows are materialized (one test per MPFR interval, holding its 15 rows: a Wasm test module cannot register one test per row). The full gate, `just gate decimal 3`, is 64,327/64,323: the 23,031 target-independent checks, the 573 public API tests on each of the four targets, and the 9,691 rows of the `pi_inverse` table and the 60 rows of the `huge_trig` table on each of the four targets. RDFP and Arb remain optional secondary routes and are not counted when unavailable."
msgstr "已提交的 elementary 层包含 3,060 个经认证的行。MPFR 4.2.2 生成 768 位的定向 dyadic 端点；精确整数转换把两端在五种 `DecimalRoundingMode` 值下各舍入到 decimal32/64/128，只有结果与标志唯一时生成器才保留该行。生成这些行后，Native、Wasm、Wasm-GC、JavaScript 各通过 573/573 个公共 API 测试（每个 MPFR 区间一个测试，内含其 15 行：Wasm 测试模块无法为每一行注册一个测试）。完整 gate `just gate decimal 3` 为 64,327/64,327：23,031 个与目标无关的检查，四个目标各 573 个公共 API 测试，以及四个目标各自的 `pi_inverse` 表 9,691 行和 `huge_trig` 表 60 行。RDFP 与 Arb 仍是可选的次要路径，不可用时不计入。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:28
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 saturation regressions for `Decimal::tanh_ctx` and `Decimal::expm1_ctx` are in `library/src/decimal/elementary_extensions_wbtest.mbt`. They check positive and negative `tanh`, negative `expm1`, all five `DecimalRoundingMode` values, and exact `Rounded`/`Inexact` flags. The certified pre-loop bound selects a same-side representative within the proved gap and passes it through the normal context finalizer, which supplies tininess, overflow and clamp flags. These targeted cases are separate from the committed MPFR row count. `decimal_gda` currently exposes neither operation, so this entry makes no GDA conformance claim."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 的饱和回归测试位于 `library/src/decimal/elementary_extensions_wbtest.mbt`，覆盖 `Decimal::tanh_ctx` 和 `Decimal::expm1_ctx`。测试检查正负 `tanh`、负值 `expm1`、全部五种 `DecimalRoundingMode`，并精确核对 `Rounded`/`Inexact` 标志。认证循环前的界限会选取与真实结果同侧且处于已证明误差范围内的代表值，并交由常规上下文终结器处理，以正确产生微小性、溢出和 clamp 标志。这些定向用例不计入已提交的 MPFR 行数。`decimal_gda` 目前没有这两个运算，因此本条不声明 GDA 符合性。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:41
msgid "IEEE Std 754-2019 for `decimal` (decimal32/64/128 and arbitrary precision). Status is `conforming` when the operation exists and the cited evidence exercises it, `partial` when part of the clause is missing or evidence is thin (the cell says which), `not implemented` and `not applicable` otherwise. `Level` is `required` for clauses the standard states with \"shall\", `recommended` for those it states with \"should\" (and for the optional parts), `optional` for features a flavor may leave out. Evidence without a corpus name is a unit test in the repository; \"no external corpus\" marks operations that no independent oracle checks."
msgstr "`decimal` 的 IEEE Std 754-2019（decimal32/64/128 与任意精度）。 当运算存在且所引证据覆盖它时，状态为 `符合`；条款有缺失或证据薄弱时为 `部分符合`（单元格会说明是哪种）；其余为 `未实现` 和 `不适用`。 `Level` 为 `required` 表示标准用 “shall” 表述的条款，`recommended` 表示用 “should” 表述的条款（以及可选部分），`optional` 表示 flavor 可以不提供的特性。 没有语料名称的证据是仓库中的单元测试；“无外部语料”表示没有独立 oracle 检查该运算。"

