#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:82
msgid "The checked matrix is finite and does not claim every IEEE 754 operation, every payload propagation policy, or every possible decimal input. The supplementary `dd*`/`dq*` decTest rows are diagnostics, not an IEEE oracle."
msgstr "固定矩阵是有限的，不声明覆盖 IEEE 754 全部操作、所有 payload 传播策略或所有可能十进制输入。补充的 `dd*`/`dq*` decTest 行只作诊断，不是 IEEE oracle。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:84
msgid "`Decimal::parse_checked` routes through `from_string_ctx`; it applies the ArithmeticContext rounding direction and exponent bounds. This checked API returns only a value or syntax error, so its `Result` does not expose overflow or underflow flags."
msgstr "`Decimal::parse_checked` 通过 `from_string_ctx` 应用 ArithmeticContext 的舍入方向与指数边界。此 checked API 仅返回值或语法错误，因此其 `Result` 不携带溢出或下溢标志。"

