"e 0$ 起作用：下面给出一个或两个分量"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:600
msgid "In the last row let $n$ be the end of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ nearest to zero. The divisor values $y \\in [\\underline{b}, 0)$ give $x \\le n / \\underline{b}$ when $\\boldsymbol{c} > 0$ and $x \\ge n / \\underline{b}$ when $\\boldsymbol{c} < 0$; the values $y \\in (0, \\overline{b}]$ give $x \\ge n / \\overline{b}$ when $\\boldsymbol{c} > 0$ and $x \\le n / \\overline{b}$ when $\\boldsymbol{c} < 0$. A divisor side exists only when $\\underline{b} < 0$, respectively $\\overline{b} > 0$. The quotient $n / \\pm\\infty$ is 0 and is the unattained end of the component, so that component is open there. Each finite quotient is rounded outward, which keeps the closure a valid enclosure and tight in the type (the exact endpoint is attained, because $y = \\underline{b}$ or $\\overline{b}$ is in $\\boldsymbol{b}$)."
msgstr "在最后一行，设 $n$ 为 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 中最靠近零的端点。除数取 $y \\in [\\underline{b}, 0)$ 时，当 $\\boldsymbol{c} > 0$ 给出 $x \\le n / \\underline{b}$，当 $\\boldsymbol{c} < 0$ 给出 $x \\ge n / \\underline{b}$；取 $y \\in (0, \\overline{b}]$ 时，当 $\\boldsymbol{c} > 0$ 给出 $x \\ge n / \\overline{b}$，当 $\\boldsymbol{c} < 0$ 给出 $x \\le n / \\overline{b}$。除数的某一侧只在 $\\underline{b} < 0$、相应地 $\\overline{b} > 0$ 时存在。商 $n / \\pm\\infty$ 为 0，是该分量未达到的一端，因此该分量在此处为开。每个有限商都向外舍入，这使闭包是有效的包含，并且在该类型中是紧的（精确端点能够取到，因为 $y = \\underline{b}$ 或 $\\overline{b}$ 属于 $\\boldsymbol{b}$）。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:612
msgid "`mul_rev_to_pair` closes the components. `mul_rev(b, c, x)` intersects each component, with its open ends, with the closed interval $\\boldsymbol{x}$ and takes the hull of what is nonempty (a lower end $L$ and upper end $U$ meet when $L < U$, or $L = U$ and both ends are closed). This is why the hull of the set and the intersection of $\\boldsymbol{x}$ with its hull differ: for $\\boldsymbol{b} = [-1, 1]$, $\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 1]$ the set avoids $(-1, 1)$, so the prior $[0, 0.5]$ gives Empty. All 533 corpus cases of `mulRev`, `mulRevTen` and `mulRevToPair` agree with the construction."
msgstr "`mul_rev_to_pair` 取各分量的闭包。`mul_rev(b, c, x)` 把每个分量（保留其开端点）与闭区间 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 相交，再对非空部分取区间包（下端 $L$ 与上端 $U$ 相交当且仅当 $L < U$，或 $L = U$ 且两端都为闭）。这就是该集合的区间包与 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 同其区间包之交不同的原因：对 $\\boldsymbol{b} = [-1, 1]$、$\\boldsymbol{c} = [1, 1]$，该集合避开 $(-1, 1)$，所以先验 $[0, 0.5]$ 给出 Empty。语料中 `mulRev`、`mulRevTen` 和 `mulRevToPair` 的全部 533 个用例都与这一构造一致。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:621
msgid "Reverse functions of even and monotone algebraic functions"
msgstr "偶函数与单调代数函数的反向函数"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:623
msgid "`sqr_rev`, `abs_rev`, `cosh_rev` and `pown_rev` (IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4) share one scheme. The preimage of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ under $\\varphi$ is a union of at most two intervals, found from the inverse of $\\varphi$ at the ends of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ after cutting $\\boldsymbol{c}$ to the range of $\\varphi$:"
msgstr "`sqr_rev`、`abs_rev`、`cosh_rev` 与 `pown_rev`（IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4）采用同一方案。$\\boldsymbol{c}$ 在 $\\varphi$ 下的原像是至多两个区间的并，先把 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 截到 $\\varphi$ 的值域内，再由 $\\varphi$ 的反函数在 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的端点处求得："

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:628
msgid "for an even $\\varphi$ ($x^2$, $\\lvert x\\rvert$, $\\cosh$, an even $x^p$) with inverse $r$ on the positive side, and $\\boldsymbol{c}' = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap \\text{range}$: the two pieces $[-r(\\overline{c'}), -r(\\underline{c'})]$ and $[r(\\underline{c'}), r(\\overline{c'})]$;"
msgstr "对偶函数 $\\varphi$（$x^2$、$\\lvert x\\rvert$、$\\cosh$、偶数次 $x^p$），其正侧的反函数为 $r$，令 $\\boldsymbol{c}' = \\boldsymbol{c} \\cap \\text{range}$：两个片段 $[-r(\\overline{c'}), -r(\\underline{c'})]$ 与 $[r(\\underline{c'}), r(\\overline{c'})]$；"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:632
msgid "for an odd $x^p$ with $p > 0$, increasing: $[r(\\underline{c}), r(\\overline{c})]$;"
msgstr "对 $p > 0$ 的奇数次 $x^p$（递增）：$[r(\\underline{c}), r(\\overline{c})]$；"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:633
msgid "for a negative power, $x^p$ is decreasing on each side of the pole 0, so the roles of the two ends swap, $x = 0$ is excluded, and the end of a piece at 0 is open: the unbounded end of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ gives $r = 0$, which is only a limit."
msgstr "对负幂，$x^p$ 在极点 0 的每一侧都递减，所以两个端点的作用互换，$x = 0$ 被排除，片段在 0 处的端点为开：$\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的无界端给出 $r = 0$，它只是一个极限。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:638
msgid "Each finite end is one directed rounding of the exact root of one exact endpoint (`sqrt`, `rootn`, `acosh` of a point interval), so the closed pieces are the tightest in the type. The hull with the prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$ meets each piece, with its open ends, with $\\boldsymbol{x}$ and takes the hull of the nonempty parts, the same routine as `mul_rev`. The trivial decoration (`trv`) is attached by the decorated forms. All 360 corpus cases of these functions in `libieeep1788_tests_rev.itl` and `abs_rev.itl` agree."
msgstr "每个有限端点都是对一个精确端点的精确根做一次定向舍入（对点区间取 `sqrt`、`rootn`、`acosh`），所以闭片段在该类型中是最紧的。与先验 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 取区间包时，把每个片段（保留其开端点）与 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 相交，再对非空部分取区间包，与 `mul_rev` 使用同一个例程。装饰形式附上平凡装饰（`trv`）。`libieeep1788_tests_rev.itl` 与 `abs_rev.itl` 中这些函数的全部 360 个语料用例都与之一致。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:646
msgid "Reverse sine, cosine and tangent"
msgstr "反向正弦、余弦与正切"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:648
msgid "`sin_rev`, `cos_rev` and `tan_rev` (IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4) return the hull of the part of a periodic union of intervals that lies in the prior $\\boldsymbol{x}$. A piece end has the form $t = \\tfrac{m}{2}\\pi + \\sigma\\,\\alpha(s)$ with an integer $m$, $\\sigma = \\pm 1$ and $\\alpha$ one of $\\arcsin$, $\\arccos$, $\\arctan$ of an endpoint $s$ of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ (a pole of $\\tan$ has no $\\alpha$). The result takes the piece ends that matter, so the comparison of a prior end with a piece end has to be exact; a wrong answer there moves a result end by a whole period (for example `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 6])`)."
msgstr "`sin_rev`、`cos_rev` 与 `tan_rev`（IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4）返回区间周期性并集中落在先验 $\\boldsymbol{x}$ 内部分的区间包。片段端点的形式为 $t = \\tfrac{m}{2}\\pi + \\sigma\\,\\alpha(s)$，其中 $m$ 为整数，$\\sigma = \\pm 1$，$\\alpha$ 是 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的某个端点 $s$ 的 $\\arcsin$、$\\arccos$ 或 $\\arctan$（$\\tan$ 的极点没有 $\\alpha$）。结果取决于起作用的片段端点，所以先验端点与片段端点的比较必须是精确的；此处的错误答案会使结果端点偏移整整一个周期（例如 `sin_rev([0, 0], x = [RU(pi), 6])`）。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:656
msgid "*Which piece ends can be floats.* If $t = d$ with $d$ a nonzero float, then $d$ is algebraic, and so is $s$. For $\\sin d = \\pm s$ the Lindemann-Weierstrass theorem says $e^{id}$ is transcendental, so $\\sin d$ cannot be algebraic; the same holds for $\\cos d$ and $\\tan d$. Every end is therefore irrational (a pole $\\pm\\pi/2 + \\pi k$ and the ends from $s = \\pm 1$ are nonzero rational multiples of $\\pi$) except $t = 0$, which needs $m = 0$ and $\\alpha = 0$: $\\arcsin 0$ and $\\arctan 0$, and $\\arccos 1$. Those ends are compared with the prior by an exact test, and every other end has a strict answer for every float $d$. A pole therefore never equals a float, and the trigonometric reverse functions need no open flag."
msgstr "*哪些片段端点可以是浮点数。* 若 $t = d$ 且 $d$ 是非零浮点数，则 $d$ 是代数数，$s$ 也是。对 $\\sin d = \\pm s$，Lindemann-Weierstrass 定理表明 $e^{id}$ 是超越数，所以 $\\sin d$ 不可能是代数数；$\\cos d$ 和 $\\tan d$ 同理。因此每个端点都是无理数（极点 $\\pm\\pi/2 + \\pi k$ 与由 $s = \\pm 1$ 得到的端点是 $\\pi$ 的非零有理倍数），只有 $t = 0$ 例外，它要求 $m = 0$ 且 $\\alpha = 0$：即 $\\arcsin 0$、$\\arctan 0$ 和 $\\arccos 1$。这些端点与先验的比较用精确测试，而其他每个端点对每个浮点数 $d$ 都有严格的答案。因此极点永远不会等于某个浮点数，反向三角函数不需要开端点标志。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:666
msgid "*Comparison and rounding.* Each end is evaluated as an enclosure at a working precision $w$, starting at $p + b + 96$ bits ($b$ the binary exponent of the larger prior end), from the certified enclosure of $\\pi$ and the certified `asin`, `acos`, `atan` of the exact point $s$. A comparison with a prior end $d$ is decided as soon as the enclosure excludes $d$, else $w$ is doubled. The value written for a result end is the outward rounding of an enclosure that contains no float of the result precision, which is exactly $\\operatorname{RD}(t)$ or $\\operatorname{RU}(t)$; here too $w$ is doubled until that holds. The first step is enough for almost every input, and not for all: a float can lie within a small fraction of an ulp of a multiple of $\\pi/2$, which is why the loop is needed. The loop is capped at 12 doublings (the same budget as the certified forward functions). At the cap an undecided comparison counts as met in both conditions (a piece that might meet the prior is never dropped) and the end written for such a piece is the prior's own end, a valid bound of both possibilities; a rounding is that of the last enclosure. The result is then an enclosure of the hull, possibly wider. A white-box test sets the cap to 0 and to 1 and checks, on cases of the reference test, that the result contains the hull and stays inside the prior. The pinned ITF1788 corpus never leaves the first step: its 136 cases need $w = p + b + 96$ at most."
msgstr "*比较与舍入。* 每个端点以工作精度 $w$ 求得包含区间，起始为 $p + b + 96$ 位（$b$ 为较大先验端点的二进制指数），由经认证的 $\\pi$ 包含区间与对精确点 $s$ 的经认证的 `asin`、`acos`、`atan` 得到。与先验端点 $d$ 的比较在包含区间排除 $d$ 时即可确定，否则把 $w$ 加倍。写入结果端点的值是对一个不含结果精度浮点数的包含区间的向外舍入，它恰好是 $\\operatorname{RD}(t)$ 或 $\\operatorname{RU}(t)$；此处同样把 $w$ 加倍直到满足该条件。对几乎所有输入，第一步就足够，但并非对所有输入：浮点数可能与 $\\pi/2$ 的倍数相距不到一个 ulp 的很小一部分，这正是需要该循环的原因。循环至多加倍 12 次（与经认证的前向函数预算相同）。到达上限时，未决的比较在两个条件中都视为相交（可能与先验相交的片段绝不会被丢弃），为这样的片段写入的端点是先验自身的端点，对两种可能性都是有效的界；舍入取最后一个包含区间的舍入。结果此时是区间包的一个包含，可能更宽。白盒测试把上限设为 0 和 1，并在参考测试的用例上检查结果包含区间包且留在先验之内。固定版本的 ITF1788 语料从不越过第一步：其 136 个用例至多需要 $w = p + b + 96$。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:683
msgid "*Pieces and indices.* A piece $[\\mathrm{lo}(k), \\mathrm{hi}(k)]$ belongs to a family with $m = \\text{offset} + \\text{period} \\cdot k$ (period 4 for $\\sin$ and $\\cos$, in units of $\\pi/2$ twice, and 2 for $\\tan$). The first piece that reaches the lower prior end $x_l$ has its upper end in a window of a dozen consecutive values of $m$ around $2 x_l/\\pi$, which is computed exactly in rational arithmetic from the lower and upper bound of the enclosure of $\\pi$, widened by a stated margin: an end lies in $[(m-2)\\pi/2, (m+2)\\pi/2]$ since $\\lvert\\alpha\\rvert \\le \\pi$, so a piece below the window cannot reach $x_l$ and the predecessor of a piece above it already does. The same holds at $x_h$ with the lower ends. Every piece of the window is tested for meeting the prior (`hi >= x_l` and `lo <= x_h`, both exact), the lower end of the result is the minimum over the met pieces of $x_l$ or $\\operatorname{RD}(\\mathrm{lo})$, and the upper end the maximum of $x_h$ or $\\operatorname{RU}(\\mathrm{hi})$; no two transcendental ends are compared with each other, since $\\operatorname{RD}$ is monotone. The work is two searches of a few pieces each, whatever the prior spans, and its cost follows the number of bits of the period index through the working precision. The only limit is the one of the forward functions: an end of the prior at or beyond $2^{\\max(65536, 4p)+1}$ is kept (valid, not tight). It is decided before any work (the working precision comes only from the ends inside it, and a prior whose finite ends are all beyond it is returned at once), so such an end never costs $\\pi$ at its precision."
msgstr "*片段与指标。* 片段 $[\\mathrm{lo}(k), \\mathrm{hi}(k)]$ 属于一个族，其 $m = \\text{offset} + \\text{period} \\cdot k$（$\\sin$ 与 $\\cos$ 的周期为 4，以 $\\pi/2$ 的两倍为单位，$\\tan$ 为 2）。到达下先验端点 $x_l$ 的第一个片段，其上端位于 $m$ 在 $2 x_l/\\pi$ 附近的约十几个连续取值的窗口内；该窗口由 $\\pi$ 的包含区间的下界与上界在有理数运算中精确算出，并留有明确的余量：由于 $\\lvert\\alpha\\rvert \\le \\pi$，端点位于 $[(m-2)\\pi/2, (m+2)\\pi/2]$ 内，所以窗口之下的片段无法到达 $x_l$，而窗口之上片段的前一个片段已经到达。在 $x_h$ 处对下端同样成立。窗口中的每个片段都检验是否与先验相交（`hi >= x_l` 且 `lo <= x_h`，二者都是精确的），结果的下端是相交片段的 $x_l$ 或 $\\operatorname{RD}(\\mathrm{lo})$ 的最小值，上端是 $x_h$ 或 $\\operatorname{RU}(\\mathrm{hi})$ 的最大值；由于 $\\operatorname{RD}$ 单调，从不需要比较两个超越数端点。无论先验跨越多少个周期，工作量都是两次各含几个片段的搜索，其开销通过工作精度随周期指标的位数增长。唯一的限制与前向函数相同：先验端点的量级不小于 $2^{\\max(65536, 4p)+1}$ 时原样保留（有效，但不紧）。该判定在做任何工作之前完成（工作精度只来自限制之内的端点，所有有限端点都在限制之外的先验直接原样返回），所以这样的端点永远不会花费其精度下的 $\\pi$。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:702
msgid "*Tightness against the corpus.* The tests compare the result with an enumeration of every piece (`trig_reverse_reference_wbtest.mbt`), with no index arithmetic in common with the implementation, over 4,200 random cases at precisions 24 and 53 that include priors with an end next to a piece end. Six distinct corpus cases (twelve with the decorated copies) have an expected value that is one or two ulps wider than the hull; they are listed on the [conformance page](../conformance/ball_float.md)."
msgstr "*与语料比较的紧致性。* 测试把结果与对每个片段的枚举（`trig_reverse_reference_wbtest.mbt`）做比较，该枚举与实现没有共用的指标运算，覆盖精度 24 和 53 下的 4,200 个随机用例，其中包括端点紧靠片段端点的先验。有六个不同的语料用例（连同带装饰的副本共十二个）的期望值比区间包宽一到两个 ulp；它们列在[符合性页面](../conformance/ball_float.md)。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:709
msgid "Reverse power with an interval exponent"
msgstr "带区间指数的反向幂"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:711
msgid "`pow_rev1(b, c, x)` (IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4) reduces to the set division of `mul_rev` in logarithm coordinates (see the [API page](../api/ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev1)): the pieces of $\\exp(L /_{\\text{set}} \\boldsymbol{b})$ come from the same case split as $c /_{\\text{set}} b$ (whether $0 \\in L$, that is $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$, and whether $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{b}$), with the sign of an end of $L$ decided by comparing the end of $\\boldsymbol{c}$ with 1. The end $x = 0$ of a piece is open (it comes from $\\ln x \\to -\\infty$); the zero part $\\{0\\}$ is a piece of its own; $x = 1$ is open when it is the limit of a quotient by an unbounded $\\boldsymbol{b}$ and attained when $c_\\text{end} = 1$; every other finite end is attained."
msgstr "`pow_rev1(b, c, x)`（IEEE 1788-2015 10.5.4）在对数坐标下化为 `mul_rev` 的集合除法（见 [API 页面](../api/ball_float.md#ballfloatpow_rev1)）：$\\exp(L /_{\\text{set}} \\boldsymbol{b})$ 的各片段来自与 $c /_{\\text{set}} b$ 相同的分情形（$0 \\in L$，即 $1 \\in \\boldsymbol{c}$，以及 $0 \\in \\boldsymbol{b}$ 是否成立），$L$ 的端点的符号由 $\\boldsymbol{c}$ 的端点与 1 的比较决定。片段的端点 $x = 0$ 为开（来自 $\\ln x \\to -\\infty$）；零部分 $\\{0\\}$ 自成一片；$x = 1$ 在它是被无界 $\\boldsymbol{b}$ 除所得商的极限时为开，在 $c_\\text{end} = 1$ 时被取到；其他每个有限端点都被取到。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:720
msgid ""
"*Exactness of an end* $x = c^{1/\\beta}$, $c > 0$, $\\beta \\n"
"e 0$ finite. Write $\\beta = s\\,u\\,2^j$ and $c = C\\,2^\\gamma$ with $u$ and $C$ odd, $p = 2^{\\max(-j, 0)}$ and $q = u\\,2^{\\max(j, 0)}$. Then $x = c^{s p / q}$ with $\\gcd(p, q) = 1$, and $x$ is rational iff $c$ is a perfect $q$-th power in $\\mathbb{Q}$, that is $C = m^q$ and $q \\mid \\gamma$ (for $C > 1$ this needs $q \\le \\operatorname{bitlen}(C)$, a comparison, and then one integer root; for $C = 1$ it needs $q \\mid \\gamma$, a divisibility test; no power of $c$ is formed). The value is then $(m\\,2^{\\gamma/q})^{s p}$. There are three classes of end and each has its own line in the procedure:"
msgstr ""
"*端点的精确性* $x = c^{1/\\beta}$，$c > 0$，$\\beta \\n"
"e 0$ 有限。记 $\\beta = s\\,u\\,2^j$，$c = C\\,2^\\gamma$，其中 $u$ 与 $C$ 为奇数，$p = 2^{\\max(-j, 0)}$，$q = u\\,2^{\\max(j, 0)}$。则 $x = c^{s p / q}$ 且 $\\gcd(p, q) = 1$，当且仅当 $c$ 是 $\\mathbb{Q}$ 中的完全 $q$ 次幂，即 $C = m^q$ 且 $q \\mid \\gamma$ 时，$x$ 为有理数（对 $C > 1$，这要求 $q \\le \\operatorname{bitlen}(C)$，是一次比较，然后做一次整数开方；对 $C = 1$ 只需整除测试 $q \\mid \\gamma$；不会形成 $c$ 的任何幂）。其值为 $(m\\,2^{\\gamma/q})^{s p}$。端点有三类，每类在流程中各有一行："

