msgid "Correctness and invariants"
msgstr "正确性与不变式"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1144
msgid ""
"**Representation invariant.** A non-empty `BallFloat` has non-NaN endpoints, $\\underline{x} \\le \\overline{x}$, $\\underline{x} \\n"
"e +\\infty$, $\\overline{x} \\n"
"e -\\infty$ and precision $\\ge 1$; every construction path ends in `store_interval`, which checks this and aborts otherwise. Empty is a flag with endpoints $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$."
msgstr ""
"**表示不变式。** 非空的 `BallFloat` 具有非 NaN 端点、$\\underline{x} \\le \\overline{x}$、$\\underline{x} \\n"
"e +\\infty$、$\\overline{x} \\n"
"e -\\infty$ 以及精度 $\\ge 1$；每条构造路径都以 `store_interval` 结束，它检查上述条件，不满足则中止。空区间是一个标志，其端点为 $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1150
msgid "**Inclusion.** Each public operation $F$ of `BallFloat` satisfies $f(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\subseteq F(\\boldsymbol{x})$, by the endpoint formulas and Corollary 2 for arithmetic, by the critical-point analysis and certified endpoint enclosures for elementary functions, and by the fallbacks for uncertified cases (the exceptions are listed under known limitations). By the fundamental theorem, so does every composition."
msgstr "**包含性。** `BallFloat` 的每个公开运算 $F$ 都满足 $f(\\boldsymbol{x}) \\subseteq F(\\boldsymbol{x})$：对算术运算依据端点公式和推论 2，对初等函数依据临界点分析和经认证的端点包络，对未认证的情形依据后备值（例外列于已知局限中）。由基本定理，每个复合运算也满足这一点。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1157
msgid "**Tightness.** Basic arithmetic, `sqr`, `pown`, `fma`, `abs`, `min`, `max`, `intersection`, `convex_hull` of non-empty operands and `sqrt` return the outward rounding of the exact hull, so each endpoint is within one ulp of optimal. Trigonometric and arctangent endpoints are correctly directed roundings when certified; the other elementary functions are usually within a few ulps. Not tight: fallbacks; `pown` with $n < -4096$ and 0 inside (Entire);  `with_precision` and `normalized` round the endpoints outward, which is the tightest enclosure and the identity on an interval already representable at the target precision, so `convex_hull` with an Empty operand and the checked capabilities do not widen either."
msgstr "**紧致性。** 基本算术、`sqr`、`pown`、`fma`、`abs`、`min`、`max`、非空操作数的 `intersection` 和 `convex_hull`，以及 `sqrt` 返回精确凸包的向外舍入，因此每个端点与最优值相差不超过一个 ulp。三角函数和反正切的端点在经过认证时是正确的定向舍入；其他初等函数通常在几个 ulp 之内。不紧致的情形有：回退；$n < -4096$ 且 0 位于内部时的 `pown`（Entire）。`with_precision` 和 `normalized` 将端点向外舍入，这是最紧包络，并且对在目标精度下已可表示的区间是恒等的，因此带 Empty 操作数的 `convex_hull` 和 checked 能力同样不会加宽。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1169
msgid "**Decorations.** The decoration of a result is a true statement about the function evaluated, by the induction argument above."
msgstr "**装饰。** 由上文的归纳论证，结果的装饰是关于所求值函数的一个真命题。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1172
msgid "**Complexity.** Arithmetic performs at most four endpoint products or two sums, $O(M(p))$ for $p$-bit endpoints with multiplication cost $M(p)$, plus alignment of at most about $65536 + p$ bits for sums. Elementary functions cost one or two directed evaluations of the `bin_float` kernels at precision $p$ (see [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) for their cost), plus the index range for the trigonometric functions."
msgstr "**复杂度。** 算术运算至多执行四次端点乘积或两次求和，对于 $p$ 位端点、乘法代价为 $M(p)$ 时为 $O(M(p))$，求和另需对齐至多约 $65536 + p$ 位。初等函数在精度 $p$ 下花费一到两次对 `bin_float` 内核的定向求值（其代价见 [`bin_float`](bin_float.md)），三角函数另需指标范围。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1179
msgid "**Evidence.** Package tests check directed endpoints, the far-addend and exponent-range cases, decorations and relations; the pinned ITF1788 corpus runs 6,632 cases in strict mode (see [conformance](../conformance/ball_float.md))."
msgstr "**证据。** 包测试检查定向端点、相距很远的加数与指数范围的情形、装饰和关系；固定版本的 ITF1788 语料在 strict 模式下运行 6,632 个用例（参见[符合性](../conformance/ball_float.md)）。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1183
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "已知局限"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1185
msgid "The following inputs currently lose part of the input set, round or flag a result incorrectly, or return a set other than the specified one. Each is tracked in an issue with a proposed fix that is not merged yet; they are documented here so that callers can avoid them."
msgstr "以下输入目前会丢失输入集合的一部分、对结果做出错误的舍入或设置错误的标志，或返回与规定不同的集合。每一项都有对应的 issue 跟踪，并附有尚未合并的修复提案；它们记录于此，以便调用者避开。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1190
msgid "No limitation is open at present. Decorated `rootn` with a negative degree lowers the decoration to `trv` when 0 is in the argument, as the decoration rules of IEEE 1788-2015 §11 require; `library/src/ball_float/ball_float_decorated_wbtest.mbt` checks degrees `-1`, `-2` and `-3`."
msgstr "目前没有未解决的限制。负次数的装饰 `rootn` 在参数含 0 时会把装饰降为 `trv`，这正是 IEEE 1788-2015 §11 的装饰规则所要求的；`library/src/ball_float/ball_float_decorated_wbtest.mbt` 检查了次数 `-1`、`-2` 和 `-3`。"

