#: manual/design/bin_float.md:70
msgid "a NaN"
msgstr "NaN"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:72
msgid "The form of a finite value is a function of its coefficient, so the representation stays unique and the structural equality of the stored data is still the equality of the datum. A result of at most 128 bits costs one allocation, where a record of seven fields plus a coefficient object cost two; a result of more than 128 bits is the value object, a `Coeff` and its limb array. On the JavaScript target a coefficient is a host bigint and there is no word path, so the type has only `FinBig`, `Inf` and `NaN`. Only `bin_repr_nonjs.mbt` and `bin_repr_js.mbt` (the constructors and the accessors) and the `_nonjs` fast paths match on it; every other reader uses an accessor. Accessors that only need a test or a length (`coefficient_is_zero`, `coefficient_bits`, `is_word`, `word_`, `is_pair`, `pair_high`, `pair_low`) return scalars: a function on a hot path never returns an option of a scalar or a tuple, because both are heap objects. The general readers get the coefficient as a `Coeff`, which a value of at most 128 bits builds on demand."
msgstr "有限值的形式是其系数的函数，因此表示保持唯一，所存数据的结构相等仍然就是数据本身的相等。不超过 128 位的结果只需一次分配，而七个字段的记录加一个系数对象需要两次；超过 128 位的结果是值对象、一个 `Coeff` 及其 limb 数组。在 JavaScript 目标上，系数是宿主 bigint，没有字位路径，因此该类型只有 `FinBig`、`Inf` 和 `NaN`。只有 `bin_repr_nonjs.mbt` 和 `bin_repr_js.mbt`（构造子与访问器）以及 `_nonjs` 快速路径会对其进行匹配；其余读取者都使用访问器。只需要判断或长度的访问器（`coefficient_is_zero`、`coefficient_bits`、`is_word`、`word_`、`is_pair`、`pair_high`、`pair_low`）返回标量：热路径上的函数从不返回标量的 option 或元组，因为二者都是堆对象。通用读取者以 `Coeff` 形式获取系数，不超过 128 位的值会按需构建它。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:87
msgid "The IEEE 754 binary formats"
msgstr "IEEE 754 二进制格式"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:89
msgid "A binary interchange format with $k$ bits has a sign bit, a $w$-bit biased exponent field $E$ and a $(p-1)$-bit trailing significand field $T$ (IEEE 754-2019 clause 3.4).[^ieee] With $e_{\\max} = 2^{w-1} - 1$, the bias $e_{\\max}$ and $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$, an encoding means"
msgstr "具有 $k$ 位的二进制交换格式包含一个符号位、一个 $w$ 位的带偏置指数字段 $E$ 和一个 $(p-1)$ 位的尾随有效数字段 $T$（IEEE 754-2019 第 3.4 条）。[^ieee] 设 $e_{\\max} = 2^{w-1} - 1$，偏置 $e_{\\max}$ 且 $e_{\\min} = 1 - e_{\\max}$，则一个编码表示"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:103
msgid "IEEE Std 754-2019, *IEEE Standard for Floating-Point Arithmetic*: clause 3 (formats), 4.3 (rounding-direction attributes), 5 (operations), 6 (infinities, NaNs, signed zero), 7 (default exception handling)."
msgstr "IEEE Std 754-2019，*IEEE Standard for Floating-Point Arithmetic*：第 3 条（格式）、4.3（舍入方向属性）、5（运算）、6（无穷、NaN、带符号零）、7（默认异常处理）。"

