msgstr "RZ"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:254
#: manual/design/bin_float.md:2013
#: manual/design/bin_float.md:2015
#: manual/design/decimal.md:200
msgid "never"
msgstr "从不"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:255
msgid "RU"
msgstr "RU"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:256
msgid "RD"
msgstr "RD"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:257
msgid "RA"
msgstr "RA"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:259
msgid ""
"*Derivation.* $f > \\frac12 \\iff g \\wedge t$, $f = \\frac12 \\iff g \\wedge \\n"
"eg t$, and $f > 0 \\iff g \\vee t$. RNE rounds the magnitude up when $f > \\frac12$, or when $f = \\frac12$ and $q$ is odd; that is $(g \\wedge t) \\vee (g \\wedge \\n"
"eg t \\wedge q_0) = g \\wedge (t \\vee q_0)$. The directed rows round the magnitude up exactly when $f > 0$ and the direction points away from zero for the sign $s$. Inexactness is $g \\vee t$."
msgstr ""
"*推导。* $f > \\frac12 \\iff g \\wedge t$、$f = \\frac12 \\iff g \\wedge \\n"
"eg t$ 以及 $f > 0 \\iff g \\vee t$。RNE 在 $f > \\frac12$ 时，或在 $f = \\frac12$ 且 $q$ 为奇数时将绝对值向上舍入；即 $(g \\wedge t) \\vee (g \\wedge \\n"
"eg t \\wedge q_0) = g \\wedge (t \\vee q_0)$。定向舍入各行恰在 $f > 0$ 且舍入方向对符号 $s$ 而言是远离零时将绝对值向上舍入。不精确性即 $g \\vee t$。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:266
msgid "**Why.** Because $\\sigma$ already includes the subnormal shift, a tiny result is rounded once, directly from $m$, to the grid $\\eta \\mathbb{Z}$. Rounding first to $p$ bits and then to the subnormal grid would be a double rounding: a value just above a midpoint of the coarse grid can be pushed onto that midpoint by the first rounding and then rounded the wrong way by the second. A carry out of $q$ (when $q + 1 = 2^p$) only raises $\\operatorname{top}$ by one; the result is re-normalized and the overflow test below is applied to the rounded value."
msgstr "**原因。** 由于 $\\sigma$ 已包含次正规移位，极小的结果直接由 $m$ 一次舍入到网格 $\\eta \\mathbb{Z}$。若先舍入到 $p$ 位再舍入到次正规网格，就成了双重舍入：略高于粗网格中点的值可能被第一次舍入推到该中点上，再被第二次舍入朝错误方向舍入。从 $q$ 产生的进位（当 $q + 1 = 2^p$ 时）只会使 $\\operatorname{top}$ 加一；结果随后重新规范化，并对舍入后的值施加下文的上溢检查。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:275
msgid "**The three paths of the finalizer, and why the normalization chain is skipped.** `binary_round_dyadic` takes one of three paths. (1) *Exact exit:* if $\\operatorname{bits}(m) \\le p$ and $e_{\\min} \\le \\operatorname{top} \\le e_{\\max}$ (the context range, clamped to the implementation range), then $r = m 2^{e}$ is representable: $e \\ge e_{\\min} - p + 1$, so the shift $\\sigma$ is $0$, nothing is rounded and no flag is raised; this holds for bounded and unbounded contexts alike. (2) *Precision path:* if the shift onto the subnormal grid is not larger than the precision shift, the precision rounding already uses the final $\\sigma$, so its result is the final result and the rounding is done once; its top bit is also the \"rounded top\" that the tininess rule after rounding and the overflow test need. (3) *Range path:* otherwise the value is split again at the range shift, and the precision rounding is kept only to supply the rounded top. In all three paths the stored value is built by `binary_finite_in_range`: the coefficient has at most $p$ bits (a carry out of $q$ gives a power of two, which is even and is stripped to $1$), its top bit is at least $e_{\\min} - p + 1$ and at most $e_{\\max}$ (overflow is tested first), so the general normalization has nothing left to do except stripping trailing zeros: the implementation-range underflow, the re-rounding of excess bits and the overflow test of `normalize_finite` cannot fire. The tests keep copies of the old core and compare value and flags on random corpora and at the exponent limits."
msgstr "**终结函数的三条路径，以及为什么可以跳过规范化链。** `binary_round_dyadic` 走三条路径之一。（1）*精确出口：* 若 $\\operatorname{bits}(m) \\le p$ 且 $e_{\\min} \\le \\operatorname{top} \\le e_{\\max}$（上下文范围，并限制在实现范围内），则 $r = m 2^{e}$ 可精确表示：$e \\ge e_{\\min} - p + 1$，所以移位 $\\sigma$ 为 $0$，不做舍入也不产生标志；有界与无界上下文都是如此。（2）*精度路径：* 若落到次正规网格的移位不大于精度移位，则精度舍入用的已经是最终的 $\\sigma$，其结果就是最终结果，只舍入一次；它的最高位也正是“舍入后最高位”，舍入后判定的 tininess 规则和上溢检查都需要它。（3）*范围路径：* 否则按范围移位再拆分一次，保留精度舍入只是为了得到舍入后的最高位。三条路径存储的值都由 `binary_finite_in_range` 构造：系数至多 $p$ 位（从 $q$ 进位得到 2 的幂，它是偶数，去掉末尾零后为 $1$），最高位不低于 $e_{\\min} - p + 1$ 且不高于 $e_{\\max}$（先检查上溢），所以通用的规范化除了去掉末尾零之外无事可做：`normalize_finite` 中的实现范围下溢、多余位的再舍入和上溢检查都不会触发。测试保留旧核心的副本，在随机语料和指数极限处比较值与标志。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:277
msgid "Finishing a wide result in place"
msgstr "原地完成宽结果的舍入"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:279
msgid "**Problem.** The plain `add`, `mul`, `div` and `sqrt` of operands wider than one word end in a rounding to nearest even. Done on the whole coefficient, it copied the kept bits into a new array, incremented it, and shifted it a second time to strip the trailing zero bits: three passes over the result and an array of the same size each time."
msgstr "**问题。** 宽于一个字的操作数的普通 `add`、`mul`、`div` 和 `sqrt` 都以舍入到最近偶数收尾。若在整个系数上做，要把保留的位复制进新数组、再加一，然后第二次移位以去掉末尾的零位：对结果遍历三次，每次都要一个同样大小的数组。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:281
msgid "**Choice.** The fast path hands the finisher the magnitude as a limb array $W$ (little-endian, the top limbs may be zero), the exponent of bit 0, the precision, a sticky flag and the rounding direction. With $b = \\operatorname{bits}(W)$ and $\\sigma = b - p$, the finisher reads the round bit, the last kept bit and (only when the decision needs it, and stopping at the first non-zero limb) the lower bits, decides the increment with the table above, and finds the position $q$ of the lowest set bit of the rounded value without forming it. Let $K = \\lfloor W / 2^{\\sigma} \\rfloor$ be the kept bits."
msgstr "**选择。** 快速路径把大小写作肢数组 $W$（小端，高位肢可以为零）的幅值、第 0 位的指数、精度、粘滞标志和舍入方向交给收尾函数。记 $b = \\operatorname{bits}(W)$，$\\sigma = b - p$，收尾函数读取舍入位、最后一个保留位，以及（仅在判定需要时，并在第一个非零肢处停止）更低的位，用上表决定是否加一，并且不构造舍入后的值就找出它的最低置位位置 $q$。设 $K = \\lfloor W / 2^{\\sigma} \\rfloor$ 为保留位。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:283
msgid "No increment: $q$ is the position of the lowest set bit of $W$ at or above $\\sigma$, and the coefficient is $W \\gg q$."
msgstr "不加一：$q$ 是 $W$ 在 $\\sigma$ 及以上的最低置位的位置，系数为 $W \\gg q$。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:284
msgid "Increment: $K + 1$ has as many trailing zeros as $K$ has trailing ones, say $t$, and $(K + 1) \\gg t = (K \\gg t) \\mid 1$ because bit $t$ of $K$ is zero. So $q$ is the position of the lowest zero bit of $W$ at or above $\\sigma$ (at most $b$, since bit $b$ is zero) and the coefficient is $(W \\gg q) \\mid 1$; when every kept bit is set, $q = b$ and the coefficient is $1$, which is $2^p$ stripped. No carry is ever propagated."
msgstr "加一：$K + 1$ 的末尾零个数等于 $K$ 的末尾一个数，记为 $t$，并且因为 $K$ 的第 $t$ 位为零，$(K + 1) \\gg t = (K \\gg t) \\mid 1$。所以 $q$ 是 $W$ 在 $\\sigma$ 及以上的最低为零的位的位置（至多为 $b$，因为第 $b$ 位为零），系数为 $(W \\gg q) \\mid 1$；当所有保留位都为 1 时，$q = b$，系数为 $1$，即去掉末尾零的 $2^p$。全程不传播进位。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:286
msgid "The coefficient is then $W \\gg q$ written into the same array: the destination index never exceeds the source index, so one forward loop suffices, and the result keeps the array. The sticky flag stands for \"the exact value is $W$ plus an amount in $(0, 1)$ units of bit 0\". It is allowed only when $b > p$, and then it changes the decision only through $t$, because the discarded part $d + \\varepsilon$ with integer $d < 2^{\\sigma}$ and $0 < \\varepsilon < 1$ is below, at or above the half $2^{\\sigma - 1}$ exactly as $d$ is, except that $d = 2^{\\sigma - 1}$ is above it. This is what lets a caller truncate a quotient, a square root or an aligned sum at $p + 2$ bits and pass the rest as one bit."
msgstr "随后系数 $W \\gg q$ 写回同一个数组：目标下标从不超过源下标，所以一次向前的循环就够了，结果直接持有该数组。粘滞标志表示“精确值是 $W$ 加上第 0 位单位的 $(0, 1)$ 内的一个量”。它只在 $b > p$ 时允许，此时它只通过 $t$ 影响判定：被舍弃部分 $d + \\varepsilon$（整数 $d < 2^{\\sigma}$，$0 < \\varepsilon < 1$）与半值 $2^{\\sigma - 1}$ 的大小关系和 $d$ 相同，只是 $d = 2^{\\sigma - 1}$ 时它大于半值。因此调用者可以把商、平方根或对齐后的和截断在 $p + 2$ 位，把其余部分作为一个比特传入。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:288
msgid "**Why.** The result array is the only allocation besides the value itself, and the rounding is one probe of a few limbs plus one shifting loop. The finisher takes the direction as a parameter so that the contextual operations can use it; the plain operators pass round to nearest even. The tests keep the previous finisher and the contextual rounding as references and compare value, sign, exponent and precision bit for bit in every direction, on ties, on all-ones carries and on cancelled leading limbs."
msgstr "**为什么。** 除值本身外，结果数组是唯一的分配；舍入就是对几个肢的一次探测加一次移位循环。收尾函数把方向作为参数，以便上下文运算以后使用；普通运算符传入舍入到最近偶数。测试保留了先前的收尾函数和上下文舍入作为参照，在每个方向上逐位比较值、符号、指数和精度，覆盖平局、全 1 进位和被抵消的高位肢。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:290
msgid "**Who owns the array.** The product (exact or short), the scaled and the short quotient and the packed square root of the coefficient kernel return a heap coefficient whose array nothing else refers to (the contract is stated in the kernel design page), so the fast paths of `mul`, `div` and `sqrt` hand it to the finisher as it is and it is rounded in place, with no copy. A coefficient of at most 128 bits has no array and takes the copying path; so does the rare division through a general quotient and remainder, whose array is not covered by the contract. The tests run each operation twice on the same operands, on a value with itself and on a copy of it, and check that no operand word changed."
msgstr "**数组归谁所有。** 系数内核返回的乘积（精确乘积与短乘积）、缩放商与短商以及打包的平方根，是一个没有任何其他对象引用其数组的堆系数（约定写在内核设计页），所以 `mul`、`div`、`sqrt` 的快速路径把它原样交给收尾函数，原地舍入，不再复制。不超过 128 位的系数没有数组，走复制路径；偶尔经由通用商与余数的除法也走复制路径，因为它的数组不在约定之内。测试对同样的操作数把每个运算做两遍，对一个值与自身以及与它的副本也做，并检查没有任何操作数的字被改动。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:292
msgid "Division from quotient and remainder"
msgstr "由商和余数实现除法"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:294
msgid "**Problem.** $a/b$ with $a = c_a 2^{e_a}$, $b = c_b 2^{e_b}$ is a rational $N/D \\cdot 2^{e}$ ($N = c_a$, $D = c_b$, $e = e_a - e_b$) whose binary expansion is usually infinite."
msgstr "**问题。** 满足 $a = c_a 2^{e_a}$ 的 $a/b$，$b = c_b 2^{e_b}$ 是有理数 $N/D \\cdot 2^{e}$（$N = c_a$、$D = c_b$、$e = e_a - e_b$），其二进制展开通常是无限的。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:298
msgid "**Choice.** First the exact leading exponent: with $k = \\operatorname{bits}(N) - \\operatorname{bits}(D)$, $\\lfloor \\log_2 (N/D) \\rfloor$ is $k$ if $N \\ge D 2^{k}$ and $k - 1$ otherwise, one integer comparison. That fixes the target exponent $\\tau = \\max(\\operatorname{top} - p + 1,\\ e_{\\min} - p + 1)$, and then one integer division"
msgstr "**选择。** 首先确定精确的最高位指数：设 $k = \\operatorname{bits}(N) - \\operatorname{bits}(D)$，若 $N \\ge D 2^{k}$ 则 $\\lfloor \\log_2 (N/D) \\rfloor$ 为 $k$，否则为 $k - 1$，只需一次整数比较。这确定了目标指数 $\\tau = \\max(\\operatorname{top} - p + 1,\\ e_{\\min} - p + 1)$，随后一次整数除法"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:309
msgid "gives $q$ directly, and the remainder gives the rounding data: $f = r/D$, so"
msgstr "直接给出 $q$，余数则给出舍入数据：$f = r/D$，因此"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:316
msgid "No approximation of $N/D$ is involved; the rounding is decided by the sign of $2r - D$. When $e - \\tau < 0$ the shift is moved to the denominator, and a quotient below one unit is decided by comparing $2N$ with $D 2^{\\tau - e}$ without forming it."
msgstr "不涉及对 $N/D$ 的任何近似；舍入由 $2r - D$ 的符号决定。当 $e - \\tau < 0$ 时，移位被移到分母上；小于一个单位的商通过比较 $2N$ 与 $D 2^{\\tau - e}$ 来判定，而无需构造它。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:321
msgid "Square root from an integer root and a midpoint test"
msgstr "由整数平方根和中点测试实现平方根"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:323
msgid "**Problem.** $\\sqrt{c 2^{e}}$ is irrational unless $c 2^{e}$ is a square."
msgstr "**问题。** 除非 $c 2^{e}$ 是平方数，否则 $\\sqrt{c 2^{e}}$ 是无理数。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:325
msgid "**Choice.** The leading exponent is $\\lfloor \\operatorname{top}(x)/2 \\rfloor$ (floor division), which fixes $\\tau$ as above. Write the radicand as $X = c\\, 2^{e - 2\\tau}$, so $\\sqrt{x} = \\sqrt{X}\\, 2^{\\tau}$. An exact integer square root gives $s = \\lfloor \\sqrt{X} \\rfloor$ with remainder $X - s^2$; the root is exact iff the remainder is zero. Otherwise the rounding data come from the midpoint $s + \\frac12$:"
msgstr "**选择。** 最高位指数为 $\\lfloor \\operatorname{top}(x)/2 \\rfloor$（向下取整除法），由此如上确定 $\\tau$。将被开方数写作 $X = c\\, 2^{e - 2\\tau}$，从而 $\\sqrt{x} = \\sqrt{X}\\, 2^{\\tau}$。精确的整数平方根给出 $s = \\lfloor \\sqrt{X} \\rfloor$ 及余数 $X - s^2$；当且仅当余数为零时平方根是精确的。否则，舍入数据来自中点 $s + \\frac12$："

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:336
msgid ""
"an exact comparison of integers (with the power of two moved to the other side when $X$ is fractional). So $g = [4X \\ge (2s+1)^2]$ and $t = \\n"
"eg\\text{exact} \\wedge [4X \\n"
"e (2s+1)^2]$. When $X$ is an integer the right side is odd and the left even, so the root is never exactly a midpoint; this is the classical fact that $\\sqrt{x}$ of a $p$-bit number is never a $(p+1)$-bit midpoint.[^muller-sqrt] The equality branch is still kept, because an operand with more bits than the context precision can make $\\sqrt{X}$ an exact midpoint (for example $\\sqrt{9/4} = 3/2$ rounded to one bit)."
msgstr ""
"这是一次精确的整数比较（当 $X$ 为分数时，将 2 的幂移到另一侧）。因此 $g = [4X \\ge (2s+1)^2]$ 且 $t = \\n"
"eg\\text{exact} \\wedge [4X \\n"
"e (2s+1)^2]$。当 $X$ 为整数时，右边为奇数而左边为偶数，因此平方根从不恰好是中点；这就是经典事实：$p$ 位数的 $\\sqrt{x}$ 从不是 $(p+1)$ 位中点。[^muller-sqrt] 相等分支仍然保留，因为位数多于上下文精度的操作数可能使 $\\sqrt{X}$ 恰好成为中点（例如 $\\sqrt{9/4} = 3/2$ 舍入到一位）。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:346
msgid "Muller et al., *Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*, §5.3 and §7.6."
msgstr "Muller 等，*Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*，§5.3 与 §7.6。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:349
msgid "Exponent range, overflow and underflow"
msgstr "指数范围、上溢与下溢"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:351
msgid "**Overflow** is decided on the rounded value: if the rounded result has $\\operatorname{top} > e_{\\max}$, the operation overflows, which is IEEE 754's \"after rounding\" rule (clause 7.4). From the rounding table this happens at the thresholds"
msgstr "**上溢**依据舍入后的值判定：若舍入后的结果满足 $\\operatorname{top} > e_{\\max}$，则运算上溢，这就是 IEEE 754 的\"舍入后\"规则（第 7.4 条）。由舍入表可知，这发生在以下阈值处"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:364
msgid "because a value in $(\\Omega, \\Omega + \\frac12\\operatorname{ulp})$ rounds to nearest down to $\\Omega$, while the tie $\\Omega + \\frac12\\operatorname{ulp}$ goes to the even neighbour $2^{e_{\\max}+1}$, which lies outside $F$. An overflowing result is $\\pm\\infty$ for the first two groups and $\\pm\\Omega$ for the third, always with `overflow` and `inexact`. In binary16, $\\Omega = 65504$ and $\\frac12\\operatorname{ulp}(\\Omega) = 16$:"
msgstr "因为 $(\\Omega, \\Omega + \\frac12\\operatorname{ulp})$ 中的值就近舍入时向下舍入到 $\\Omega$，而平局值 $\\Omega + \\frac12\\operatorname{ulp}$ 则舍入到偶数邻值 $2^{e_{\\max}+1}$，它位于 $F$ 之外。上溢结果对前两组为 $\\pm\\infty$，对第三组为 $\\pm\\Omega$，并总是伴随 `overflow` 和 `inexact`。在 binary16 中，$\\Omega = 65504$ 且 $\\frac12\\operatorname{ulp}(\\Omega) = 16$："

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:382
msgid "**Tininess.** A nonzero result is tiny when it lies strictly between $\\pm 2^{e_{\\min}}$. IEEE 754-2019 (clause 7.5) allows two readings, and `TininessDetection` selects one:"
msgstr "**微小性。** 非零结果严格位于 $\\pm 2^{e_{\\min}}$ 之间时称为微小的。IEEE 754-2019（第 7.5 条）允许两种解读，由 `TininessDetection` 选择其一："

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:390
msgid "where $\\circ_{p,\\infty}$ rounds to $p$ bits with an unbounded exponent range. The finalizer computes $\\operatorname{top}(r)$ exactly and, for the after-rounding rule, a second split of the same magnitude at the precision shift alone. The two readings differ only for $r$ just below $2^{e_{\\min}}$ that rounds up to it at $p$ bits: for binary16, $r = 2^{-14} - 2^{-27}$ is tiny before rounding but rounds at 11 bits to $2^{-14}$, which is not tiny."
msgstr "其中 $\\circ_{p,\\infty}$ 在无界指数范围下舍入到 $p$ 位。终结器精确计算 $\\operatorname{top}(r)$，并且对于舍入后规则，再仅按精度移位对同一绝对值做第二次拆分。两种解读仅对略低于 $2^{e_{\\min}}$、且在 $p$ 位下向上舍入到它的 $r$ 有所不同：对于 binary16，$r = 2^{-14} - 2^{-27}$ 在舍入前是微小的，但在 11 位下舍入为 $2^{-14}$，后者并不微小。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:397
msgid "**Underflow flag.** Under default exception handling the underflow flag is raised for a tiny result only when it is also inexact. The finalizer returns no flags at all for an exact result, so an exact subnormal (for example any subnormal difference, as shown above) raises nothing. The `binary16` product $2^{-14} \\times (1 - 2^{-11})$ shows the full rule: the exact value $2^{-14} - 2^{-25}$ is tiny under both readings, lies halfway between two subnormals of spacing $2^{-24}$, rounds to the even neighbour $2^{-14}$, the smallest normal, and raises `underflow` and `inexact`, although the encoded result `0x0400` is normal."
msgstr "**下溢标志。** 在默认异常处理下，仅当微小结果同时不精确时才引发下溢标志。终结器对精确结果完全不返回任何标志，因此精确的次正规数（例如如上所示的任意次正规差）不引发任何标志。`binary16` 乘积 $2^{-14} \\times (1 - 2^{-11})$ 展示了完整规则：精确值 $2^{-14} - 2^{-25}$ 在两种解读下都是微小的，它恰好位于间距为 $2^{-24}$ 的两个次正规数的正中间，舍入到偶数邻值 $2^{-14}$（即最小正规数），并引发 `underflow` 和 `inexact`，尽管编码后的结果 `0x0400` 是正规数。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:423
msgid "**Far below the range.** A result certainly smaller than $\\eta/2$ in magnitude (decided from exponent bounds without forming it, for example $2^{-10^9} \\cdot 2^{-10^9}$) rounds to $\\pm 0$ or $\\pm\\eta$ according to the direction, with `underflow` and `inexact`. A result certainly above the range goes to the overflow result."
msgstr "**远低于范围。** 绝对值必然小于 $\\eta/2$ 的结果（由指数界判定，无需构造它，例如 $2^{-10^9} \\cdot 2^{-10^9}$）根据舍入方向舍入为 $\\pm 0$ 或 $\\pm\\eta$，并伴随 `underflow` 和 `inexact`。必然高于范围的结果则取上溢结果。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:429
msgid "**Exact results in the subnormal range.** An elementary function whose exact result is the dyadic $m \\cdot 2^{n}$ ($2^{n}$ for `exp2` of an integer, the exact power of `pow` with a dyadic result) passes it to the finalizer as the pair $(m, n)$. It does not build a `BinFloat` first: a `BinFloat` made from $(1, n)$ at one bit has its smallest value at $2^{e_{\\min}}$, so $2^{n}$ with $n < e_{\\min}$ was flushed to zero before any context could round it, although it is exactly representable at $p \\ge 2$. The after-rounding rule uses $\\circ_{p,\\infty}$ with no exponent range at all, not an unbounded context, which still has gradual underflow at the implementation limit $2^{e_{\\min}}$."
msgstr "**次正规范围内的精确结果。** 若某个初等函数的精确结果是二进有理数 $m \\cdot 2^{n}$（对整数做 `exp2` 得到的 $2^{n}$，或 `pow` 得到二进有理数结果的精确幂），它会把这一对 $(m, n)$ 直接交给终结器，而不是先构造一个 `BinFloat`：由 $(1, n)$ 以 1 位精度构造的 `BinFloat`，其最小值是 $2^{e_{\\min}}$，因此 $n < e_{\\min}$ 的 $2^{n}$ 会在任何上下文对它舍入之前就被冲刷为零，尽管它在 $p \\ge 2$ 时是精确可表示的。舍入后规则使用完全没有指数范围的 $\\circ_{p,\\infty}$，而不是无界上下文，因为后者在实现极限 $2^{e_{\\min}}$ 处仍有渐进下溢。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:440
msgid "**One layer for the new recommended functions.** The defects of the range audit (an exact power of two flushed by a one-bit `BinFloat::make`, a shortcut returning before a signaling NaN is seen, an unbounded context used as a range-free rounding) were each a pattern that a function could write again. `exp2m1`, `exp10m1`, `log2p1` and `log10p1`, and the families that follow in [#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235), therefore take four decisions from one internal file (`elementary_range.mbt`): the NaN and pole results (`binary_nan_unary`, `binary_pole_result`, a signaling NaN first); an exact result rounded as a dyadic by the finalizer, never built as a `BinFloat` (`binary_integer_result`, `binary_pow2_minus_one_integer`); the overflow decision of $b^x - 1$ from certified bounds of $\\log_2 b$ (`binary_positive_exp_minus_one_overflow`, including the window $x \\log_2 b \\in [e_{\\max} + 1, e_{\\max} + 2)$ and, for base 2, $x > e_{\\max} + 1$ with $x - (e_{\\max} + 1) \\ge 2^{-(e_{\\max} + 1) + 1}$); and one Ziv driver (`binary_ziv_round`). For an integer $n$ with $n \\ge p + 2$ the value $2^n - 1$ lies in the open interval between the midpoint under $2^n$ and $2^n$, where every value rounds alike in each direction, so a representative of the same binade stands for it and the huge integer is never formed; below $p + 2$ bits it is exact or a tie and is rounded as it is."
msgstr "**新推荐函数共用的一层。** 范围审查中的缺陷（被 1 位 `BinFloat::make` 冲刷的精确 2 的幂、在看到信号 NaN 之前就返回的捷径、被当作无范围舍入的无界上下文）都是函数可能再写一遍的模式。因此 `exp2m1`、`exp10m1`、`log2p1`、`log10p1` 以及 [#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235) 之后的各族函数，从同一个内部文件（`elementary_range.mbt`）取四类决定：NaN 与极点结果（`binary_nan_unary`、`binary_pole_result`，信号 NaN 优先）；精确结果由终结器作为二进有理数舍入，而不是先造成 `BinFloat`（`binary_integer_result`、`binary_pow2_minus_one_integer`）；由 $\\log_2 b$ 的认证界判定 $b^x - 1$ 的上溢（`binary_positive_exp_minus_one_overflow`，包括 $x \\log_2 b \\in [e_{\\max} + 1, e_{\\max} + 2)$ 这一窗口，以及对底数 2 的 $x > e_{\\max} + 1$ 且 $x - (e_{\\max} + 1) \\ge 2^{-(e_{\\max} + 1) + 1}$ 的情形）；以及唯一的 Ziv 驱动（`binary_ziv_round`）。对整数 $n \\ge p + 2$，$2^n - 1$ 位于 $2^n$ 之下的中点与 $2^n$ 之间的开区间，区间内每个值在各舍入方向下舍入结果相同，因此用同一二进制阶内的一个代表值代替它，从不构造那个巨大的整数；不到 $p + 2$ 位时它精确或恰为平局，按原值舍入。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:460
msgid "`rsqrt`, `compound` and `powr` (second family of [#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235)) add no new rounding logic: each reduces to an operation that already owns the exact cases and the range decision, after the special values of §9.2.1. $1/\\sqrt{x}$ is `rootn(x, -2)`, $x^y$ for $x > 0$ is `pow`, and $(1 + x)^n$ is `pown` of the exact sum $1 + x$ whenever that sum fits in $2^{26}$ bits. The one decision of its own is the tiny rule of `compound`: for $|n x| < 2^{-(p + 9)}$ the exact value is $1 + \\delta$ with $|\\delta| < 2^{-(p+8)}$, far inside the window around $1$ bounded by the breakpoints $1 - 2^{-(p+1)}$ and $1 + 2^{-p}$, so the result is $1$ or its neighbour by direction alone and equals the rounding of the surrogate $1 \\pm 2^{-(p+3)}$, which `binary_round_dyadic` takes through the same finalizer as any exact value."
msgstr "`rsqrt`、`compound` 和 `powr`（[#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235) 的第二个族）不增加新的舍入逻辑：在 §9.2.1 的特殊值之后，每个函数都归结为已经掌管精确情形和范围判定的运算。$1/\\sqrt{x}$ 是 `rootn(x, -2)`，$x > 0$ 时的 $x^y$ 是 `pow`，$(1 + x)^n$ 是在该和不超过 $2^{26}$ 位时对精确和 $1 + x$ 做的 `pown`。它自己的唯一判定是 `compound` 的微小规则：当 $|n x| < 2^{-(p + 9)}$ 时，精确值为 $1 + \\delta$，$|\\delta| < 2^{-(p+8)}$，远在以断点 $1 - 2^{-(p+1)}$ 和 $1 + 2^{-p}$ 为界的 $1$ 附近窗口之内，所以结果仅由方向决定，是 $1$ 或其邻值，并等于替代值 $1 \\pm 2^{-(p+3)}$ 的舍入；`binary_round_dyadic` 让它经过与任何精确值相同的终结器。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:473
msgid "`asinpi`, `acospi`, `atanpi` and `atan2pi` (third and last family of [#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235)) are $\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$, $\\operatorname{acos}(x)/\\pi$, $\\operatorname{atan}(x)/\\pi$ and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$: the existing certified enclosures of the angle divided by a certified enclosure of $\\pi$, rounded by the Ziv driver. By Niven's theorem the only exact (dyadic) values are the constants of §9.2.1 and $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/4$, $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(\\pm a, \\pm a) = \\pm 1/4, \\pm 3/4$, which are rounded as dyadics; $1/6$, $1/3$ and $2/3$ are rational but not breakpoints, so the loop terminates on them. The range hazards are anchors, decided before the loop by `binary_tiny_argument_result` from a certified distance: $\\operatorname{atanPi}(x) = \\pm(1/2 - \\delta)$ with $\\delta < 2^{-t}$ for $|x| \\ge 2^t$, $t \\ge p + 8$; $\\operatorname{acosPi}(x) = 1/2 \\mp \\delta$ with $\\delta < |x|/2$ for a tiny $|x|$; and $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$ at $\\pm 1/2$ ($D \\ge p + 8$) and $\\pm 1$ ($D \\le -(p + 8)$, $x < 0$), where $D$ is the difference of the leading-bit exponents, so that the ratio $y/x$ (whose exponent can be $\\pm 2^{31}$) is never formed. For $x > 0$ and a ratio so small that $t/\\pi$ lies below a quarter of the smallest subnormal the result is the tiny nonzero result of the direction. Everything else is the enclosure $\\operatorname{atan}(t)/\\pi$ (or $1 - \\operatorname{atan}(t)/\\pi$) at a working precision above the operands'."
msgstr "`asinpi`、`acospi`、`atanpi` 和 `atan2pi`（[#235](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/235) 的第三个也是最后一个族）分别是 $\\operatorname{asin}(x)/\\pi$、$\\operatorname{acos}(x)/\\pi$、$\\operatorname{atan}(x)/\\pi$ 和 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)/\\pi$：即已有的角度认证包络除以 $\\pi$ 的认证包络，由 Ziv 驱动器舍入。由 Niven 定理，仅有的精确（二进有理）值是 §9.2.1 的常量以及 $\\operatorname{atanPi}(\\pm 1) = \\pm 1/4$、$\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(\\pm a, \\pm a) = \\pm 1/4, \\pm 3/4$，它们按二进有理数舍入；$1/6$、$1/3$ 和 $2/3$ 是有理数但不是断点，所以循环会在它们处终止。范围上的风险是锚点，在循环之前由 `binary_tiny_argument_result` 根据认证的距离判定：$|x| \\ge 2^t$、$t \\ge p + 8$ 时 $\\operatorname{atanPi}(x) = \\pm(1/2 - \\delta)$，$\\delta < 2^{-t}$；微小 $|x|$ 时 $\\operatorname{acosPi}(x) = 1/2 \\mp \\delta$，$\\delta < |x|/2$；以及 $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$ 在 $\\pm 1/2$（$D \\ge p + 8$）和 $\\pm 1$（$D \\le -(p + 8)$，$x < 0$）处，其中 $D$ 是最高位指数之差，这样比值 $y/x$（其指数可达 $\\pm 2^{31}$）从不被构造。对 $x > 0$ 且比值小到 $t/\\pi$ 低于最小次正规数的四分之一时，结果是方向所决定的微小非零结果。其余情形是包络 $\\operatorname{atan}(t)/\\pi$（或 $1 - \\operatorname{atan}(t)/\\pi$），工作精度高于操作数的精度。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:494
msgid "Handover: the range layer and how to add a function"
msgstr "交接说明：范围层以及如何添加函数"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:496
msgid "The recommended functions of §9.2 were added in three families on one layer (`library/src/bin_float/elementary_range.mbt`) and the helpers it builds on (`binary_round_dyadic` and `binary_round_precision_only` in `context_arithmetic.mbt`; `binary_certified_inexact_target_rounding`, `binary_inexact_inner_endpoint` and `binary_tiny_argument_result` in `elementary_certified.mbt`). Their purpose is to make the defect class of the range audit ([#271](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/271) to [#316](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/316)) impossible to write again: `BinFloat::make(c, e, w)` at a width $w$ flushes every value below $2^{e_{\\min} - (w - 1)}$, so a result or a helper value must never be built that way; exact results are rounded as dyadics, and a value that clusters at a representable anchor is decided by its certified distance to it."
msgstr "§9.2 的推荐函数分三个族加在同一个层（`library/src/bin_float/elementary_range.mbt`）及其所依赖的辅助函数之上（`context_arithmetic.mbt` 中的 `binary_round_dyadic` 与 `binary_round_precision_only`；`elementary_certified.mbt` 中的 `binary_certified_inexact_target_rounding`、`binary_inexact_inner_endpoint` 与 `binary_tiny_argument_result`）。其目的是让范围审计（[#271](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/271) 到 [#316](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/316)）的缺陷类别不可能再被写出：宽度为 $w$ 的 `BinFloat::make(c, e, w)` 会丢弃所有小于 $2^{e_{\\min} - (w - 1)}$ 的值，所以结果或辅助值绝不能这样构造；精确结果作为二进有理数舍入，聚集在可表示锚点处的值由它到锚点的认证距离决定。"

