msgstr "`Coeff` 定义在这里；`bin_float` 中的 `BinCoeff` 是 newtype `struct BinCoeff(@bin_kernel.Coeff)`"

#: manual/design/internal/bin_kernel.md:37
msgid "A re-export of an internal type (`pub using`) does not give another module (the tools module) the methods of the type; a newtype does, and it is erased."
msgstr "对内部类型的重新导出（`pub using`）不会让另一个模块（工具模块）获得该类型的方法；newtype 可以，而且它会被擦除。"

#: manual/design/internal/bin_kernel.md:38
