#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:59
msgid "Each case is one operation at one precision with eight different operand sets read from the same file by both sides (`inputs.txt`, written by one seeded generator; checksums are in `machine.json`). One timed iteration is one pass over the eight sets, so a time per operation is the batch time divided by the iterations and by eight."
msgstr "每个用例是在一种精度下的一种操作，有八组不同的操作数，两侧从同一个文件中读取（`inputs.txt`，由一个带种子的生成器写入；校验和在 `machine.json` 中）。一次被计时的迭代是对这八组的一遍处理，因此每次操作的时间是批次时间除以迭代次数再除以八。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:65
msgid "**Binary.** Operands and results have the case precision in bits. MPFR: `mpfr_add`, `mpfr_mul`, `mpfr_div`, `mpfr_sqrt`, `mpfr_exp`, `mpfr_log`, `mpfr_sin` with `MPFR_RNDN`. `floating`: the `BinFloat` methods `add`, `mul`, `div`, `sqrt`, `exp`, `ln`, `sin` on operands of that precision (round to nearest even, unbounded exponent range)."
msgstr "**二进制。** 操作数和结果的精度为该用例的位数。MPFR：`mpfr_add`、`mpfr_mul`、`mpfr_div`、`mpfr_sqrt`、`mpfr_exp`、`mpfr_log`、`mpfr_sin`，使用 `MPFR_RNDN`。`floating`：在该精度的操作数上调用 `BinFloat` 方法 `add`、`mul`、`div`、`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln`、`sin`（舍入到最近偶数，指数范围无界）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:70
msgid "**`decimal_gda`.** Operands and results have the case digit count, rounding half even, exponent range ±999999. libmpdec: `mpd_qadd`, `mpd_qmul`, `mpd_qdiv`, `mpd_qsqrt`, `mpd_qexp`, `mpd_qln` with `allcr = 1`. `floating`: `decimal_gda` `add`, `multiply`, `divide`, `sqrt`, `exp`, `ln` in a context of that precision. libmpdec has no `sin`, so `decimal_gda` has six operations."
msgstr "**`decimal_gda`。** 操作数和结果的数字位数为该用例的位数，舍入为 half even，指数范围 ±999999。libmpdec：`mpd_qadd`、`mpd_qmul`、`mpd_qdiv`、`mpd_qsqrt`、`mpd_qexp`、`mpd_qln`，`allcr = 1`。`floating`：在该精度的上下文中调用 `decimal_gda` 的 `add`、`multiply`、`divide`、`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln`。libmpdec 没有 `sin`，因此 `decimal_gda` 有六种操作。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:75
msgid "**Included in the time.** The library call itself, with whatever temporary storage it allocates internally. For `floating` this includes constructing the immutable result value. The loop around the call, and for `floating` Maremark's per-iteration bookkeeping, are in the raw time and are removed in the net time by the null of the case (see the [design page](../../design/bench/external.md#the-null-of-a-case-the-same-loop-without-the-library-call) for what the null contains and what it cannot remove)."
msgstr "**计入时间的部分。** 库调用本身，包括它在内部分配的任何临时存储。对 `floating` 来说，这包括构造不可变的结果值。调用外围的循环，以及对 `floating` 而言 Maremark 的逐次迭代记账，计入原始时间，并在净时间中由用例的 null 去掉（null 包含什么、不能去掉什么，见[设计页面](../../design/bench/external.md#the-null-of-a-case-the-same-loop-without-the-library-call)）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:82
msgid "**Excluded.** Parsing operands, creating contexts, `mpfr_t` and `mpd_t` initialisation and result buffers (MPFR and libmpdec write into results allocated before timing), reading files, and printing. Process start-up and the first warm-up passes are outside the measured blocks."
msgstr "**不计入的部分。** 解析操作数、创建上下文、`mpfr_t` 和 `mpd_t` 的初始化以及结果缓冲区（MPFR 和 libmpdec 写入计时前已分配的结果）、读取文件以及打印。进程启动和最初的预热遍数在被测量的块之外。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:86
msgid "**Correctness.** Before it is timed, every `floating` output is compared with the MPFR or libmpdec result for the same operand, as canonical text: the reference text (`%Ra` of MPFR, `mpd_to_sci` of libmpdec) and the text the library prints are each reduced by one small parser of the benchmark package (binary: sign, odd integer significand and exponent, or `0`, `-0`, `inf`, `nan`; decimal: sign, coefficient with its trailing zeros, exponent), so the sign of zero, the decimal cohort, infinities and NaN are compared and no reader of the library stands between the reference and the verdict. A case checks its 8 distinct operand sets; the rounds and blocks repeat the same check, so the published run (59 cases, 7 rounds) makes 8 checks per case, not one per round (an earlier version of this page counted 427 comparisons that way). A run without a reference file (`quick`) is not validated and says so (`EXTBENCH_NOT_VALIDATED`, never `EXTBENCH_FAILED=0`). Both libraries round every result correctly (MPFR always; libmpdec with `allcr = 1`; `floating` by certified refinement), so at equal precision the results are identical and the ratio compares equal work. The reference side is another implementation (level A); the benchmark specs of the other `bench` packages compare the library with itself or with its own sibling and are timing harness checks, not validation."
msgstr "**正确性。** 计时之前，每个 `floating` 输出都与同一操作数的 MPFR 或 libmpdec 结果按规范化文本比较：参考文本（MPFR 的 `%Ra`，libmpdec 的 `mpd_to_sci`）和库打印的文本，都由基准包里一个小型解析器各自化简（二进制：符号、奇整数有效数和指数，或 `0`、`-0`、`inf`、`nan`；十进制：符号、保留末尾零的系数、指数），因此零的符号、十进制同类（cohort）、无穷和 NaN 都被比较，库自己的读取函数不在参考结果与判定之间。一个用例检查它的 8 组不同操作数；各轮和各块重复的是同一次检查，所以已发布的运行（59 个用例、7 轮）每个用例做 8 次检查，而不是每轮一次（本页早先的版本这样数出过 427 次比较）。没有参考文件的运行（`quick`）不算验证，并且会明说（`EXTBENCH_NOT_VALIDATED`，绝不输出 `EXTBENCH_FAILED=0`）。两个库都对每个结果正确舍入（MPFR 始终如此；libmpdec 在 `allcr = 1` 下；`floating` 靠带证明的细化），所以在同等精度下结果相同，比值比较的是相同的工作量。参考一侧是另一个实现（A 级）；其他 `bench` 包的基准规格是把库与它自己或它的同族实现相比，属于计时工具的自检，不算验证。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:105
msgid "**Not trivially cached.** The operands are 8 distinct random sets per case, every result is overwritten on the next pass, and neither library keeps a result cache. Both keep internal caches of constants such as $\\pi$ and $\\ln 2$ per precision; these are warm during timing on both sides (the warm-up passes fill them), so the numbers are steady-state rates, not cold-start costs."
msgstr "**不是平凡的缓存命中。** 每个用例有 8 组不同的随机操作数，每个结果在下一遍都会被覆盖，两个库都不保留结果缓存。两者都按精度保留 $\\pi$ 和 $\\ln 2$ 等常数的内部缓存；这些缓存在计时期间两侧都是热的（预热遍数会填充它们），所以这些数字是稳态速率，而不是冷启动成本。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:114
msgid "Both sides run the Maremark protocol with the same numbers: 3 warm-up passes and at least 5 ms of warm-up, batches calibrated to about 20 ms (at least one pass of eight operations), 3 exploratory pairs that are discarded and 12 confirmatory pairs. A pair is a block of the case and a block of its null, each with its own calibrated batch, back to back, the order alternating. The two sides alternate over 7 rounds in seeded AB/BA order, each round with its own shuffled case order, so every cell has 84 confirmatory pairs per side from 7 separate processes. The rules of the verdict (84 pairs, the width bound of 1.25 on the ratio interval, the 5% drift and order thresholds, the target of 3) are fixed in the method and written into the `protocol` block of every summary. Before each side starts, the runner waits until other processes use under 150% CPU. The slowest cells (elementary functions at 8192 bits and 1000 digits) take seconds per pass, so their batch is a single pass."
msgstr "两侧使用相同的数字运行 Maremark 协议：3 遍预热和至少 5 ms 的预热，批校准到约 20 ms（至少一遍八次运算），3 个被丢弃的探索性配对和 12 个确认性配对。一个配对是用例的一个块与其 null 的一个块，各自使用校准过的批，紧挨着运行，顺序交替。两侧以带种子的 AB/BA 顺序在 7 轮中交替，每轮有自己打乱的用例顺序，因此每个单元格每侧有来自 7 个独立进程的 84 个确认性配对。判定规则（84 个配对、比值区间的宽度上限 1.25、5% 的漂移与顺序阈值、目标 3）在方法中固定，并写入每份汇总的 `protocol` 块。每一侧开始之前，运行器会等待其他进程使用的 CPU 低于 150%。最慢的单元格（8192 位和 1000 位的初等函数）每遍要数秒，因此它们的批只有一遍。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:128
msgid "Configurations and results"
msgstr "配置与结果"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:130
msgid "The floating side is measured in two configurations of the native build, each published as its own summary and shown in its own section: `native`, with the native limb primitives where the build has them, and `native-portable`, with the portable path forced. The target has to be reached by the portable path too. It is also measured on two other runtimes, `wasm` and `js`, which are judged on the same net ratio to the native reference with two bounds: a case meets the target when the upper end of the interval is at most 5, is tolerated up to 10 and is not met above 10 (the native configurations have the one bound 3). The ratio of a runtime to `native-portable` is a diagnostic and has no verdict. Each runtime section counts its cases met, tolerated and not met. The configuration is chosen when the run starts (`--target`, `--configuration NAME`, `--moon-env KEY=VALUE`) and recorded in the summary. The tables of a configuration are generated by `just bench external publish` between the marker comments below and copied without editing."
msgstr "`floating` 一侧在原生构建的两种配置中测量，各自发布为自己的汇总，并在各自的一节中展示：`native`，构建具备时使用原生 limb 原语；`native-portable`，强制使用可移植路径。目标也必须由可移植路径达到。它还在另外两种运行时 `wasm` 和 `js` 上测量，按同一个对原生参考的净比值判定，但有两个界限：区间上端不超过 5 时用例达标，不超过 10 时为容许，高于 10 为未达标（原生配置只有一个界限 3）。运行时与 `native-portable` 的比值是诊断，没有判定。每个运行时的一节分别统计达标、容许和未达标的用例数。配置在运行开始时选定（`--target`、`--configuration NAME`、`--moon-env KEY=VALUE`），并记录在汇总中。一种配置的表由 `just bench external publish` 生成在下面的标记注释之间，原样复制。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:145
msgid "Configuration `native`"
msgstr "配置 `native`"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:149
msgid "Not measured yet with the net-ratio method. The first measurement with it is published with the next release; until then the results below are those of 0.11.0, measured with the raw method."
msgstr "尚未用净比值方法测量。用它做的第一次测量将随下一个版本发布；在此之前，下面的结果是 0.11.0 用原始方法测得的结果。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:155
msgid "Configuration `native-portable`"
msgstr "配置 `native-portable`"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:159
msgid "Not measured yet with the net-ratio method."
msgstr "尚未用净比值方法测量。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:163
msgid "Runtime `wasm`"
msgstr "运行时 `wasm`"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:165
msgid "`wasm` is expected within 5 times the native reference and may not exceed 10 times: a case meets the target when the upper end of the 95% interval of the net ratio of this library on `wasm` (under `moonrun`) to the native MPFR and libmpdec of the same run is at most 5, is tolerated when it is above 5 and at most 10, and is not met above 10, with the unresolved and borderline rules of the native sections applied to both bounds. That ratio mixes the library and the runtime, so the section also shows the ratio to the same case in `native-portable`, a diagnostic of the cost of the runtime with its interval and no verdict."
msgstr "`wasm` 预期在原生参考的 5 倍以内，且不得超过 10 倍：当本库在 `wasm`（`moonrun` 下）上对同一次运行的原生 MPFR 和 libmpdec 的净比值的 95% 区间上端不超过 5 时，用例达标；高于 5 且不超过 10 时为容许；高于 10 为未达标；未决和临界规则与原生各节相同，并对两个界限都适用。该比值混合了库和运行时，所以该节还给出与 `native-portable` 中同一用例的比值，它是运行时开销的诊断，带区间而没有判定。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:176
#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:187
msgid "Not measured yet."
msgstr "尚未测量。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:180
msgid "Runtime `js`"
msgstr "运行时 `js`"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:182
msgid "As for `wasm`: the same two bounds (5 and 10), and the ratio to `native-portable` as a diagnostic. The runtime is node; its versions are in the summary."
msgstr "与 `wasm` 相同：两个界限相同（5 和 10），与 `native-portable` 的比值作为诊断。运行时是 node；其版本在汇总中。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:193
msgid "Not measured, and not measurable at present: the benchmark driver uses `moonbitlang/async`, which has no wasm-gc runtime (its module initialiser casts between two struct types and the runtime rejects the module at validation; a reduced reproduction with that package alone shows it, and nothing is filed). See the [design page](../../design/bench/external.md#runtimes-other-than-native)."
msgstr "未测量，目前也无法测量：基准测试驱动程序使用 `moonbitlang/async`，该包没有 wasm-gc 运行时（其模块初始化函数在两个结构体类型之间做转换，运行时在验证时拒绝该模块；仅用该包的缩小复现可以证明这一点，也没有提交任何报告）。见[设计页面](../../design/bench/external.md#runtimes-other-than-native)。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:199
msgid "Results of 0.11.0 (raw method)"
msgstr "0.11.0 的结果（原始方法）"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:201
msgid "These are the tables of the release 0.11.0, measured before the net-ratio method existed: the ratio is the median of the case blocks of `floating` over that of the reference, without a null, and the single floor known then was the 9.21 ns of the floating loop. They are kept as the record of that release (`testdata/external_baseline/summary-0.11.0.json`, schema v1) and are replaced by the sections above as the new measurements are published. The tables are the output of `just bench external publish` for that run, copied without editing."
msgstr "这些是 0.11.0 版本的表，测量于净比值方法出现之前：比值是 `floating` 的用例块的中位数除以参考侧的用例块的中位数，没有 null，当时已知的唯一底噪是 `floating` 循环的 9.21 ns。它们作为该版本的记录保留（`testdata/external_baseline/summary-0.11.0.json`，schema v1），随着新测量的发布而被上面各节取代。这些表是该次运行的 `just bench external publish` 的输出，原样复制。"

