#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:291
msgid "What the numbers say"
msgstr "数字说明了什么"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:293
msgid "Everything below is read from the tables above; ratios are rounded and the intervals are in the tables."
msgstr "以下内容均读自上面的表格；比值已经过四舍五入，区间见表格。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:296
msgid "**`floating` is slower than the reference in 56 of the 59 cells and faster in three, all `decimal_gda`.** Excluding those, the smallest ratio is 1.28 (`decimal_gda` `ln` at 16 digits) and the largest 11.4 (`decimal_gda` addition at 34 digits). Four cells are above 10: binary `sqrt` at 53 bits (10.1), binary `ln` and `sin` at 2048 bits (10.9 and 10.1), and `decimal_gda` addition at 34 digits (11.4). Where `floating` is faster, it is `exp` at 1000 digits (0.11, that is 9 times faster: 523 us against 4.69 ms), `ln` at 1000 digits (0.28, 3.6 times faster: 1.45 ms against 5.24 ms) and `ln` at 34 digits (0.96, a difference of 4%, with the interval [0.96, 0.98] below 1)."
msgstr "**在 59 个单元格中，`floating` 有 56 个比参考库慢，3 个更快，且都是 `decimal_gda`。** 除去这三个，最小比值是 1.28（16 位 `decimal_gda` 的 `ln`），最大是 11.4（34 位 `decimal_gda` 的加法）。有四个单元格超过 10：53 位二进制 `sqrt`（10.1）、2048 位二进制 `ln` 与 `sin`（10.9 与 10.1）、34 位 `decimal_gda` 加法（11.4）。`floating` 更快的是 1000 位的 `exp`（0.11，即快 9 倍：523 us 对 4.69 ms）、1000 位的 `ln`（0.28，快 3.6 倍：1.45 ms 对 5.24 ms）以及 34 位的 `ln`（0.96，相差 4%，区间 [0.96, 0.98] 在 1 以下）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:306
msgid "**Basic binary arithmetic: roughly 3 to 9 times slower.** Addition costs 5.2 to 8.7 times MPFR's time at every precision, multiplication 3.8 to 7.6, division 3.2 to 7.9. The gap is widest at 53 bits, where MPFR needs 4.6 ns for an addition and `floating` 40.1 ns; about 9.2 ns of that is the harness (see the `null` row), the rest is allocation and normalisation of an immutable result. At 128 bits and above multiplication stays at 3.8 to 4.0 times (8192 bits: 8.34 us against 2.13 us)."
msgstr "**二进制基本运算：大约慢 3 到 9 倍。** 加法在各个精度下是 MPFR 耗时的 5.2 到 8.7 倍，乘法 3.8 到 7.6 倍，除法 3.2 到 7.9 倍。差距在 53 位最大：MPFR 做一次加法需要 4.6 ns，`floating` 需要 40.1 ns；其中约 9.2 ns 是测试程序本身（见 `null` 行），其余是不可变结果的分配和规格化。从 128 位起乘法保持在 3.8 到 4.0 倍（8192 位：8.34 us 对 2.13 us）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:314
msgid "**Square root is not smooth in precision.** The ratio is 10.1 at 53 bits, 1.9 at 128 bits, 4.6 at 512 bits and 4.1 to 4.3 at 2048 and 8192 bits. From 128 to 512 bits, 4 times the width, the time of `floating` grows from 119 ns to 745 ns (6.3 times) and MPFR's from 62.3 ns to 162 ns (2.6 times)."
msgstr "**平方根的耗时随精度并不平滑。** 比值在 53 位是 10.1，128 位是 1.9，512 位是 4.6，2048 位和 8192 位是 4.1 到 4.3。从 128 位到 512 位，位宽变为 4 倍，`floating` 的耗时从 119 ns 增长到 745 ns（6.3 倍），MPFR 则从 62.3 ns 增长到 162 ns（2.6 倍）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:319
msgid "**Elementary functions: 2.5 to 11 times slower than MPFR in binary.** `exp` is 2.5 to 5.2 times slower at every precision (3.1 at 53 bits, 5.2 at 2048 bits, 3.0 at 8192 bits), `ln` 4.6 to 10.9 times and `sin` 5.2 to 10.1 times. These three have their largest ratios at 2048 bits (5.2, 10.9, 10.1), not at 8192 bits (3.0, 9.5, 5.2); the cost is not a smooth function of the precision. Both libraries are correctly rounded, so the work is equal in specification but not in method. The slowest binary operations measured are `ln` and `sin` at 8192 bits (1.11 ms and 1.03 ms against 116 us and 197 us in MPFR)."
msgstr "**初等函数：二进制下比 MPFR 慢 2.5 到 11 倍。** `exp` 在各个精度下慢 2.5 到 5.2 倍（53 位 3.1，2048 位 5.2，8192 位 3.0），`ln` 慢 4.6 到 10.9 倍，`sin` 慢 5.2 到 10.1 倍。这三个函数的最大比值出现在 2048 位（5.2、10.9、10.1），而不是 8192 位（3.0、9.5、5.2）；成本不是精度的平滑函数。两个库都是正确舍入，所以按规格说工作量相同，但方法不同。测得最慢的二进制运算是 8192 位的 `ln` 与 `sin`（1.11 ms 与 1.03 ms，MPFR 为 116 us 与 197 us）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:328
msgid "**`decimal_gda`: slower for the four basic operations, at par or faster for `exp` and `ln` from about 34 digits.** Against libmpdec, addition is 3.6 to 11.4 times slower, multiplication 1.7 to 5.4, division 3.0 to 6.2 and square root 2.1 to 5.3. Multiplication, division and square root narrow towards the large size: at 1000 digits they are 1.7, 3.1 and 2.1 times libmpdec. `exp` is 2.9, 1.5 and 1.4 times slower at 16, 34 and 100 digits and 0.11 at 1000 digits; `ln` is 1.28, 0.96, 1.17 and 0.28. This comes from libmpdec's side: from 100 to 1000 digits its `exp` time grows 268 times (17.5 us to 4.69 ms) and its `ln` time 121 times (43.2 us to 5.24 ms), against 21.5 times (24.3 us to 523 us) and 29 times (50.4 us to 1.45 ms) for `floating`. These are the measured times; the cause in libmpdec was not investigated here. For scale, against MPFR at binary sizes near 1000 decimal digits (2048 and 8192 bits), the binary `floating` `exp` is 5.2 and 3.0 times slower and `ln` 10.9 and 9.5 times slower, so the `floating` advantage over libmpdec at 1000 digits is not an advantage over a binary library of the same size class."
msgstr "**`decimal_gda`：四种基本运算较慢，`exp` 与 `ln` 从约 34 位起与 libmpdec 相当或更快。** 对比 libmpdec，加法慢 3.6 到 11.4 倍，乘法 1.7 到 5.4 倍，除法 3.0 到 6.2 倍，平方根 2.1 到 5.3 倍。乘法、除法和平方根随位数增大而缩小差距：在 1000 位时分别是 libmpdec 的 1.7、3.1 和 2.1 倍。`exp` 在 16、34、100 位分别慢 2.9、1.5、1.4 倍，在 1000 位是 0.11；`ln` 依次是 1.28、0.96、1.17 和 0.28。原因出在 libmpdec 一侧：从 100 位到 1000 位，它的 `exp` 耗时增长 268 倍（17.5 us 到 4.69 ms），`ln` 耗时增长 121 倍（43.2 us 到 5.24 ms），而 `floating` 分别只增长 21.5 倍（24.3 us 到 523 us）和 29 倍（50.4 us 到 1.45 ms）。这些是测得的耗时；libmpdec 中的原因这里没有调查。作为参照，对比 MPFR 在接近 1000 位十进制的二进制规模（2048 位和 8192 位）下，二进制 `floating` 的 `exp` 慢 5.2 和 3.0 倍，`ln` 慢 10.9 和 9.5 倍，所以 `floating` 在 1000 位上相对 libmpdec 的优势，并不是相对同一量级二进制库的优势。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:344
msgid "**Harness overhead.** The `null` rows show that the timed loop of the `floating` side costs 9.2 ns per operation with the arithmetic removed. That is 23% of the 40.1 ns of a 53-bit addition and 16% of the 57.1 ns of a 53-bit square root, about 1% of 1 us and less above it; it is not subtracted in these tables. The loop of the C side was not measured in that run."
msgstr "**测试程序开销。** `null` 行表明，去掉运算之后，`floating` 一侧的计时循环每次运算花费 9.2 ns。这相当于 53 位加法 40.1 ns 的 23%、53 位平方根 57.1 ns 的 16%，约占 1 us 的 1%，更大时更少；在这些表中没有扣除它。那次运行中没有测量 C 一侧的循环。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:350
msgid "**Dispersion.** Within a process the 20 ms batches vary by under 3.1% (largest median absolute deviation 1.5% for `floating` and 3.1% for the references). Between the seven rounds the medians of one cell spread by at most 6.0% for `floating` and 25.3% for the references (the reference side of `binary/mul/512`, the one cell marked in the table); the bootstrap intervals therefore cover whole-process variation, and the half-widths of the medians are at most 1.7% for `floating` and 3.1% for the references, and at most 3.3% for a ratio."
msgstr "**离散度。** 在单个进程内，20 ms 的批次变化小于 3.1%（中位数绝对偏差最大值：`floating` 为 1.5%，参考库为 3.1%）。七轮之间，同一单元格的中位数散布最多为：`floating` 6.0%，参考库 25.3%（`binary/mul/512` 的参考库一侧，也是表中唯一带标记的单元格）；因此自助法区间涵盖了整个进程之间的变化，中位数的半宽最多为：`floating` 1.7%，参考库 3.1%，比值的半宽最多为 3.3%。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:358
msgid "**Repeatability.** The run was repeated once on the same commit `4a052ed` with a different round-order seed. The run published here is the first one, with the quieter machine: the other processes used 8% to 34% of the CPU before the timed sides (once 122%), against 26% to 110% in the second run. Over the 59 cases the medians of `floating` moved by 0.43% in the median and 2.1% at most, and the ratios by 0.72% in the median. Two ratios moved by more than 3%: `binary/mul/8192` (3.92 to 3.41, entirely on the MPFR side, which was 15% slower in the second run) and `decimal_gda/mul/34` (5.41 to 5.59). Neither run had a validation failure. The second run is not published."
msgstr "**可重复性。** 在同一提交 `4a052ed` 上，用不同的轮次顺序种子又运行了一次。这里发布的是第一次运行，机器更安静：计时侧开始前其他进程占用 8% 到 34% 的 CPU（有一次 122%），第二次运行则是 26% 到 110%。在 59 个用例上，`floating` 的中位数变化的中位数为 0.43%，最大 2.1%，比值变化的中位数为 0.72%。有两个比值变化超过 3%：`binary/mul/8192`（3.92 变为 3.41，完全来自 MPFR 一侧，它在第二次运行中慢了 15%）和 `decimal_gda/mul/34`（5.41 变为 5.59）。两次运行都没有验证失败。第二次运行未发布。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:368
msgid "Follow-ups (not fixed here)"
msgstr "后续事项（此处未修复）"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:370
msgid "No profile was taken for this run, so the list is read from the ratios only and names where the largest gaps are, not their cause."
msgstr "本次运行没有做性能剖析，所以下面的列表只是从比值读出的，指出差距最大的地方，而不是原因。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:373
msgid "**Small binary cases.** At 53 bits `floating` takes 38 to 57 ns for add, mul, div and `sqrt`, 7.6 to 10.1 times MPFR, with 9.2 ns of the harness included; `sqrt` at 53 bits (10.1) stands out against 1.9 at 128 bits."
msgstr "**小规模二进制用例。** 在 53 位，`floating` 做加、乘、除和 `sqrt` 需要 38 到 57 ns，是 MPFR 的 7.6 到 10.1 倍，其中含 9.2 ns 的测试程序开销；53 位的 `sqrt`（10.1）与 128 位的 1.9 形成鲜明对比。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:376
msgid "**`ln` and `sin` at 2048 bits and 8192 bits.** Ratios of 10.9 and 10.1 at 2048 bits and 9.5 at 8192 bits for `ln`, the largest elementary ratios; `exp` is at 2.5 to 5.2 at all sizes."
msgstr "**2048 位与 8192 位的 `ln` 和 `sin`。** `ln` 在 2048 位的比值是 10.9，8192 位是 9.5，`sin` 在 2048 位是 10.1，是初等函数中最大的比值；`exp` 在各个规模下都在 2.5 到 5.2 之间。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:379
msgid "**`sqrt` at 512 bits.** 4.6 times MPFR against 1.9 at 128 bits."
msgstr "**512 位的 `sqrt`。** 是 MPFR 的 4.6 倍，而 128 位是 1.9 倍。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:380
msgid "**`decimal_gda` addition at 34 and 100 digits.** 11.4 and 8.7 times, against 3.6 at 16 digits; the largest basic-operation ratios of the decimal side."
msgstr "**34 位与 100 位的 `decimal_gda` 加法。** 分别是 11.4 倍和 8.7 倍，16 位是 3.6 倍；这是十进制一侧基本运算中最大的比值。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:383
msgid "What is not measured"
msgstr "未测量的内容"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:385
msgid "**Other targets.** JavaScript, WebAssembly and LLVM builds are not measured; the C libraries have no counterpart there."
msgstr "**其他目标。** 未测量 JavaScript、WebAssembly 和 LLVM 构建；C 库在那里没有对应物。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:387
msgid "**Other machines and compilers.** One Apple M4 laptop on AC power, with no frequency or core pinning and some background desktop load; absolute times will differ on other hardware, and ratios shift with the memory system and the CPU's multiplier and SIMD units."
msgstr "**其他机器和编译器。** 一台使用交流电的 Apple M4 笔记本，未固定频率或核心，有一些桌面后台负载；在其他硬件上绝对时间会不同，比值会随内存系统以及 CPU 的乘法器和 SIMD 单元而变化。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:391
msgid "**Tuned library builds.** The MPFR and GMP in use are Homebrew bottles built with `-O2 -march=armv8-a`; a GMP configured for the exact CPU, or a libmpdec with other build options, can be faster."
msgstr "**调优过的库构建。** 所用的 MPFR 和 GMP 是用 `-O2 -march=armv8-a` 构建的 Homebrew 预编译包；针对具体 CPU 配置的 GMP，或使用其他构建选项的 libmpdec，可能更快。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:394
msgid "**Large and special arguments.** Elementary functions are timed on well-conditioned arguments of modest magnitude; argument reduction of huge arguments, arguments near zeros and singularities, subnormal results, overflow, and exceptional values are not timed."
msgstr "**大自变量和特殊自变量。** 初等函数只在量级适中、条件良好的自变量上计时；巨大自变量的自变量规约、接近零点和奇点的自变量、次正规结果、溢出以及异常值都没有计时。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:398
msgid "**Cold start.** Warm caches only; the cost of the first call at a precision is excluded."
msgstr "**冷启动。** 只有热缓存；在某个精度上首次调用的成本不计入。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:400
msgid "**Other operations.** `fma`, `pow`, `hypot`, `cos`, `tan`, the hyperbolic and inverse functions, remainders, conversions, and parsing and printing are not compared. Interval (`ball_float`) arithmetic has no counterpart in MPFR and is not compared (MPFI is not part of this baseline)."
msgstr "**其他操作。** `fma`、`pow`、`hypot`、`cos`、`tan`、双曲函数和反函数、余数、转换以及解析与打印都没有比较。区间（`ball_float`）算术在 MPFR 中没有对应物，因此未作比较（MPFI 不属于本基线）。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:404
msgid "**Memory and threads.** Peak memory and multi-threaded behaviour are not measured."
msgstr "**内存和线程。** 不测量内存峰值和多线程行为。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:406
msgid "**Other rounding modes.** Only round to nearest even."
msgstr "**其他舍入模式。** 只测舍入到最近偶数。"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:408
msgid "Reproduce"
msgstr "复现"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:415
msgid "`run` writes the inputs, the reference results, the raw rounds, the summary and the samples under `.tmp/external`; `publish` copies the compact summary to `testdata/external_baseline/summary-VERSION-CONFIGURATION.json`, the samples (the pairs of every case) to `samples-VERSION-CONFIGURATION.json.gz`, the tables to `summary-CONFIGURATION.md`, and regenerates the tables of that configuration on this page. The raw JSONL (about 12 MB) is not committed; its checksums and the checksums of the operand and reference files are in the published summary. `just bench external recompute SUMMARY SAMPLES` recomputes a summary from its samples; `just bench external compare OLD NEW` compares two summaries (net ratios when both are resolved, raw ratios otherwise) and `just bench external table OLD NEW...` writes the table of a run beside a release, as Markdown and CSV, one section per configuration; see the [tutorial](../../tutorial/bench/external.md) for the commands and the [API page](../../api/bench/external.md) for the benchmark cases."
msgstr "`run` 在 `.tmp/external` 下写出输入、参考结果、原始各轮、汇总和样本；`publish` 把紧凑的汇总复制到 `testdata/external_baseline/summary-VERSION-CONFIGURATION.json`，把样本（每个用例的配对）复制到 `samples-VERSION-CONFIGURATION.json.gz`，把表复制到 `summary-CONFIGURATION.md`，并重新生成本页中该配置的表。原始 JSONL（约 12 MB）不提交；其校验和以及操作数文件和参考文件的校验和都在已发布的汇总中。`just bench external recompute SUMMARY SAMPLES` 由样本重新计算一份汇总；`just bench external compare OLD NEW` 比较两份汇总（两者都已判定时比较净比值，否则比较原始比值），`just bench external table OLD NEW...` 写出一次运行与某个发布并列的表（Markdown 和 CSV，每种配置一节）；命令见[教程](../../tutorial/bench/external.md)，基准测试用例见 [API 页面](../../api/bench/external.md)。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:1
msgid "bin_float performance"
msgstr "bin_float 性能"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:8
msgid "Performance thresholds, limb layout, NTT primes, scratch storage, and fallback selection are implementation details. Public results, flags, and interchange bits must be identical across algorithms and targets."
msgstr "性能阈值、limb layout、NTT primes、scratch storage 和 fallback 选择都是实现细节。不同算法与 target 必须产生完全相同的公开结果、flags 和 interchange bits。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:12
msgid "Non-JS targets use inline 64/128-bit coefficients and little-endian 64-bit limbs above 128 bits; JavaScript uses a hidden host `bigint` adapter. The public `BinCoeff` type keeps that backend choice unobservable. The move from 32-bit to 64-bit limbs (issue #19) is staged: addition, subtraction, comparison, shifts, the schoolbook multiplication and squaring, and the Karatsuba and Toom-3 steps work on 64-bit limbs; division, the square-root kernels and the NTT still read a 32-bit view of the same storage until their stages. A 64-bit limb product needs the high half of a 64 by 64 bit multiplication, which MoonBit has no instruction for, so it is computed from four 32 by 32 bit products on every target; the schoolbook kernel is still 2.7 to 3.7 times faster on Native and 1.7 to 1.9 times on Wasm-GC because it runs a quarter of the limb steps. Paired Native runs of the whole stage: 2,048 to 8,192-bit multiplication 2.2 times faster, 8,192-bit addition 2.3 times, `exp` and `ln` at 2,048 bits 2.0 times. On Wasm and Wasm-GC multiplication below about 6,000 bits is 1.3 to 1.7 times faster; above about 9,000 bits the Karatsuba step, which allocates a coefficient for every intermediate value, is up to 1.8 times slower until the next stage moves it to limb arrays."
msgstr "非 JS 目标把 128 位以内的系数内联存储，更大的系数使用小端 64 位 limb；JavaScript 使用隐藏的宿主 `bigint` 适配器。公开的 `BinCoeff` 类型使后端选择不可观察。从 32 位 limb 到 64 位 limb 的迁移（问题 #19）分阶段进行：加法、减法、比较、移位、schoolbook 乘法与平方，以及 Karatsuba 和 Toom-3 步骤已在 64 位 limb 上工作；除法、平方根内核和 NTT 在各自的阶段之前仍读取同一存储的 32 位视图。64 位 limb 乘积需要 64 乘 64 位乘法的高半部分，MoonBit 没有对应指令，因此在所有目标上都由四个 32 乘 32 位乘积算出；schoolbook 内核因为只执行四分之一的 limb 步骤，在 Native 上仍快 2.7 至 3.7 倍，在 Wasm-GC 上快 1.7 至 1.9 倍。整个阶段在 Native 上的成对运行：2,048 至 8,192 位乘法快 2.2 倍，8,192 位加法快 2.3 倍，2,048 位的 `exp` 与 `ln` 快 2.0 倍。在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上，约 6,000 位以下的乘法快 1.3 至 1.7 倍；约 9,000 位以上，为每个中间值分配一个系数的 Karatsuba 步骤最多慢 1.8 倍，直到下一阶段把它改到 limb 数组上。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:14
msgid "Fixed-point exponential"
msgstr "定点指数函数"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:16
msgid "The certified `exp` enclosure bounds the Taylor series of the reduced argument (at most 1/8) in fixed point with 16 fractional bits beyond the working precision when the argument is exact at the working precision, instead of with one rounded floating-point operation per term. Each computed term rounds down, so their sum is a lower bound; each carries an error below 3 units of the last place, which gives an upper bound with a rigorous tail. The enclosure is about as wide as the floating-point one, the 12-attempt refinement loop and its working precisions are unchanged, and arguments that are not exact at the working precision still use the previous series. White-box tests check that the enclosure contains a much tighter one and that the final correctly rounded results and flags equal those of the previous series. Paired runs: `exp` is 9 to 10 times faster on Native at 53 to 2,048 bits, 7 to 11 times on Wasm and Wasm-GC, and decimal `exp` 1.7 to 2.2 times."
msgstr "当参数在工作精度下精确表示时，认证 `exp` 包络对化简后的参数（不超过 1/8）的泰勒级数采用定点计算，小数部分比工作精度多 16 位，而不是每项做一次带舍入的浮点运算。每个已计算的项都向下舍入，因此它们的和是下界；每项的误差小于 3 个末位单位，由此得到带有严格尾项估计的上界。该包络的宽度与浮点版本大致相同，12 次细化循环及其工作精度均不变；对于在工作精度下不精确的参数，仍使用此前的级数。白盒测试检查该包络包含一个更紧的包络，并检查最终正确舍入的结果与标志与此前的级数一致。成对运行：`exp` 在 Native 上于 53 至 2,048 位快 9 至 10 倍，在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上快 7 至 11 倍，十进制 `exp` 快 1.7 至 2.2 倍。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:18
msgid "Multiplication"
msgstr "乘法"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:20
msgid "Balanced multiplication uses schoolbook below 32 64-bit limbs (2,048 bits on Native, LLVM, Wasm and Wasm-GC), then Karatsuba on limb arrays (a few small temporaries per step, no intermediate `BinCoeff`), Toom-3, and a two-prime Montgomery NTT with CRT when transform bounds fit. Unbalanced inputs use block multiplication or overlap-add. Native and LLVM select Toom-3 and NTT multiplication at 4,096 64-bit limbs and NTT square at 3,584; Wasm and Wasm-GC at 2,048 and 1,536 (the values of the version before the 64-bit limbs, 4,096 and 3,072 in 32-bit limbs, halved; not measured again on those targets). A 64-bit limb product costs four `i64.mul` on Wasm, so from 160 limbs (10,240 bits) Wasm and Wasm-GC split the operands into 32-bit limbs, multiply there with the same Karatsuba and pack the result back (the conversions are linear); squaring uses the 32-bit half-product schoolbook from 80 limbs. Native square dispatch switches from specialized schoolbook to recursive multiplication at 512 limbs; other targets retain the previous 768-limb boundary. Cutoffs measured per target with paired runs of coefficient multiplication at 1,024 to 65,536 bits. Paired runs against the 32-bit implementation: coefficient multiplication is 2 to 3 times faster on Native from 1,024 to 32,768 bits, 1.1 to 2.2 times on Wasm-GC and 1.1 to 2.1 times on Wasm; `BinFloat` `mul` 1.6, 2.5 and 2.9 times faster at 512, 2,048 and 8,192 bits on Native, `add` 1.9 and 2.4 times at 2,048 and 8,192 bits, `sqrt` 1.5 and 2.0 times at 2,048 and 8,192 bits."
msgstr "平衡乘法在少于 32 个 64 位 limb（Native、LLVM、Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上为 2,048 位）时使用 schoolbook，之后依次是在 limb 数组上的 Karatsuba（每步只有几个小临时数组，没有中间的 `BinCoeff`）、Toom-3，以及在变换界限允许时使用的带 CRT 的双素数 Montgomery NTT。不平衡输入使用分块乘法或重叠相加。Native 与 LLVM 在 4,096 个 64 位 limb 处选择 Toom-3 与 NTT 乘法，在 3,584 处选择 NTT 平方；Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 分别为 2,048 与 1,536（64 位 limb 之前版本的取值，即 32 位 limb 下的 4,096 与 3,072，折半而来；在这些目标上没有重新测量）。Wasm 上一个 64 位 limb 乘积需要四次 `i64.mul`，因此从 160 个 limb（10,240 位）起，Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 把操作数拆成 32 位 limb，在其上用同样的 Karatsuba 相乘，再把结果打包回来（转换是线性的）；平方从 80 个 limb 起使用 32 位 limb 的半积 schoolbook。Native 的平方分派在 512 个 limb 处从专门的 schoolbook 切换到递归乘法；其他目标保留此前 768 个 limb 的边界。截止点是在各目标上用 1,024 至 65,536 位系数乘法的成对运行测得的。与 32 位实现的成对运行对比：系数乘法在 Native 上从 1,024 到 32,768 位快 2 至 3 倍，在 Wasm-GC 上快 1.1 至 2.2 倍，在 Wasm 上快 1.1 至 2.1 倍；Native 上 `BinFloat` 的 `mul` 在 512、2,048、8,192 位分别快 1.6、2.5、2.9 倍，`add` 在 2,048 与 8,192 位快 1.9 与 2.4 倍，`sqrt` 在 2,048 与 8,192 位快 1.5 与 2.0 倍。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:22
msgid "Single-word fast paths"
msgstr "单字快速路径"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:24
msgid "`BinFloat::add`, `mul`, `div` and `sqrt` on operands whose coefficients fit one machine word (up to 64 bits) and whose precision is at most 62 bits (60 for `div` and `sqrt`) skip the general path, which builds several coefficient values, a context, a flags record and a result tuple for each operation. The fast path computes on `UInt64` pairs (128-bit sums and products, a 128 by 64 bit division, a double-precision estimate refined by a Newton step and settled by exact comparisons for the square root), rounds to nearest even with the round and sticky bits, and allocates only the result. It declines a NaN, an infinity, a zero, an exact zero sum, wider coefficients or precision, operands whose exponents are far apart or near the implementation limits, and JavaScript, where the general path answers; the results are the same values with the same precision and exponent. White-box tests compare 40,000 random operand pairs per operation, ties, carries, cancellation and perfect squares with the general path. Paired native runs at 53 bits: `add` 2.9 times faster, `mul` 3.0, `div` 4.9, `sqrt` 2.8; on Wasm 3.1 to 5.1 times and on Wasm-GC 3.9 to 7.6 times. Operands of 128 bits and more are unchanged."
msgstr "对系数能放进一个机器字（至多 64 位）且精度不超过 62 位（`div` 与 `sqrt` 为 60 位）的操作数，`BinFloat::add`、`mul`、`div` 和 `sqrt` 跳过通用路径；通用路径每次运算都要构造若干系数值、一个上下文、一个标志记录和一个结果元组。快速路径在 `UInt64` 对上计算（128 位的和与积、128 除以 64 位的除法，平方根则用双精度估计加一步牛顿迭代并以精确比较定稿），用舍入位和粘滞位向最近偶数舍入，只分配结果。遇到 NaN、无穷、零、恰为零的和、更宽的系数或精度、指数相差很远或接近实现极限的操作数，以及 JavaScript，它都放弃，由通用路径回答；结果是同样的值，精度与指数也相同。白盒测试对每种运算比较 40,000 对随机操作数、平局、进位、相消和完全平方数与通用路径的结果。Native 上 53 位的成对运行：`add` 快 2.9 倍，`mul` 快 3.0 倍，`div` 快 4.9 倍，`sqrt` 快 2.8 倍；Wasm 上快 3.1 至 5.1 倍，Wasm-GC 上快 3.9 至 7.6 倍。128 位及以上的操作数不变。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:26
msgid "Two-word and coefficient fast paths"
msgstr "双字与系数级快速路径"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:28
msgid "Above the single-word range, `BinFloat::add` and `mul` on coefficients of up to 128 bits at a precision of at most 128 bits run on `UInt64` words as well: a 192-bit aligned sum or difference and a 256-bit product (four word products, the high halves by 32-bit pieces), rounded to nearest even from the words with the round and sticky bits, and only the result is allocated. Wider operands, and `div` and `sqrt` at any size, go through coefficient-level paths that do the same exact integer arithmetic as the general path but skip its context, flags record, result tuple and repeated rounding decisions: the sum is built in one array (up to 24 words, then whole-coefficient shifts and one addition), the product is the existing `BinCoeff` product, the quotient carries at least two bits more than the precision plus a sticky bit from the remainder, the square root rounds from the integer root and its remainder (`remainder > root` decides, there are no ties), and the kept bits are copied once into the array that becomes the coefficient. Each path declines a NaN, an infinity, a zero, an exact zero sum, coefficients or precisions above 2^20 bits, operands whose exponents are far apart or near the implementation limits, and JavaScript, where the general path answers; the results are the same values with the same precision and exponent. White-box tests compare tens of thousands of random, all-ones, sparse, tie, exact-quotient, perfect-square and cancelling operand sets per operation with the general path on Native, Wasm and Wasm-GC (JavaScript keeps the general path). Paired runs against the previous build: `add` 3.3 times and `mul` 3.5 times faster at 128 bits on Native (2.5 and 3.7 on Wasm-GC, 3.5 and 3.0 on Wasm), 1.9 to 2.2 times at 256 bits, 1.5 to 1.9 times at 512 bits and 1.2 times at 1,024 bits; `sqrt` 1.4 times at 128 bits (1.9 on Wasm-GC) and 1.1 at 512 and 2,048 bits; `div` 1.1 to 1.2 times at 128 to 512 bits, where the Knuth division dominates."
msgstr "在单字范围之上，系数至多 128 位、精度至多 128 位的 `BinFloat::add` 与 `mul` 同样在 `UInt64` 字上运行：对齐后的 192 位和或差、256 位乘积（四个字乘积，高半部分按 32 位片段计算），由这些字用舍入位与粘滞位按就近偶数舍入，只分配结果。更宽的操作数，以及任意大小的 `div` 与 `sqrt`，走系数级路径：其精确整数运算与通用路径相同，但跳过上下文、标志记录、结果元组与重复的舍入判断——和在一个数组中构造（至多 24 个字，更大时用整体系数移位与一次加法），乘积用现有的 `BinCoeff` 乘积，商比精度多至少两位并带有来自余数的粘滞位，平方根由整数根及其余数舍入（`余数 > 根` 即决定进位，不会出现平局），保留的位只复制一次，直接进入成为系数的数组。每条路径都拒绝 NaN、无穷、零、精确为零的和、系数或精度超过 2^20 位、指数相距很远或接近实现极限的操作数，以及 JavaScript，这些由通用路径回答；结果是同一个值，精度与指数也相同。白盒测试对每种运算用数万组随机、全 1、稀疏、平局、精确商、完全平方与相消的操作数与通用路径比较，覆盖 Native、Wasm 与 Wasm-GC（JavaScript 保留通用路径）。与此前构建的成对运行对比：128 位时 `add` 在 Native 上快 3.3 倍、`mul` 快 3.5 倍（Wasm-GC 上 2.5 与 3.7 倍，Wasm 上 3.5 与 3.0 倍），256 位时快 1.9 至 2.2 倍，512 位时快 1.5 至 1.9 倍，1,024 位时快 1.2 倍；`sqrt` 在 128 位时快 1.4 倍（Wasm-GC 上 1.9 倍），在 512 与 2,048 位时快 1.1 倍；`div` 在 128 至 512 位时快 1.1 至 1.2 倍，那里 Knuth 除法占主导。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:30
msgid "Fixed-point sine and cosine"
msgstr "定点正弦与余弦"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:32
msgid "The Taylor series of `sin` and `cos` on the reduced argument (at most 1 in magnitude) is summed in fixed point when the argument is exact at the working precision, with 20 guard bits and, for the sine, the leading zero bits of the argument, so a small argument keeps `precision + 20` significant bits. Each computed term rounds down and is short by at most 4 units, the series alternates with decreasing terms, and so `signed sum +- (4n + 28)` encloses the value, with the sign flipped for a negative sine argument. Arguments that are not exact, or so small that the guard bits would exceed four times the working precision, use the previous floating-point series; the refinement loop and its working precisions are unchanged. White-box tests check containment of a much tighter enclosure, a bound on the width, and the sine and cosine identities. Paired runs on top of the memoized constants (without them the `pi` recomputation hides the series): `sin` is 4.3 to 5.7 times faster on Native at 53 to 2,048 bits and 4.6 times on Wasm-GC; on its own the change gives 1.3 to 1.4 times, because the series is about nine tenths of the time only once `pi` is cached."
msgstr "当参数在工作精度下精确表示时，化简后参数（模不超过 1）的 `sin` 与 `cos` 泰勒级数以定点方式求和，使用 20 位保护位；对正弦还加上参数的前导零位数，因此小参数也保有 `precision + 20` 个有效位。每个已计算的项都向下舍入，至多相差 4 个单位；该级数各项符号交替且逐项递减，所以 `带符号和 +- (4n + 28)` 即包住该值，负的正弦参数则翻转符号。参数不精确，或小到保护位将超过工作精度的四倍时，仍使用此前的浮点级数；细化循环及其工作精度均不变。白盒测试检查该包络包含一个更紧的包络、宽度有界，并检查正弦与余弦恒等式。在已缓存常数的基础上的成对运行（没有缓存时，`pi` 的重复计算会掩盖级数的开销）：`sin` 在 Native 上于 53 至 2,048 位快 4.3 至 5.7 倍，在 Wasm-GC 上快 4.6 倍；单独使用该改动时为 1.3 至 1.4 倍，因为只有在 `pi` 被缓存之后，级数才占用约十分之九的时间。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:34
msgid "Division, square root and GCD"
msgstr "除法、开方与 GCD"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:36
msgid "Division uses a one-limb path, Knuth's algorithm D on 64-bit digits (a 128 by 64 bit quotient estimate and a 128-bit correction test) up to 128 32-bit divisor limbs, and Burnikel–Ziegler from 192. Newton reciprocal division is no longer selected: once multiplication was 2 to 3 times faster it was 3 to 12 times slower than Burnikel–Ziegler from 32,768 bits (4.4 ms against 0.37 ms at 32,768 bits), so the dispatch never reaches it; the routine stays, covered by tests, and the threshold constant is per target. Paired runs against the previous kernels: `div` is 1.5, 2.3 and 2.9 times faster on Native at 512, 2,048 and 8,192 bits, 1.9 and 3.3 times on Wasm-GC and 1.3 and 3.3 times on Wasm at 2,048 and 8,192 bits, and the `sqrt` of 8,192 bits 1.5 to 1.8 times faster on all three; native multiplication switches to the NTT at 8,192 limbs instead of 2,048 now that the Karatsuba is faster. Square root uses fixed-width kernels through 512 bits and divide-and-conquer above that; the recursion stops at the same fixed-width kernels once a block is at most 256 bits on Native/LLVM and 512 bits on Wasm/Wasm-GC (a restoring loop on heap integers at 128 bits before), which makes a 1,024-bit radicand (a 512-bit `sqrt`) about 3.4 times faster on Native and 3.1 to 3.3 times on Wasm in paired runs. The cutoff is per-target policy measured with paired runs; the LLVM value is not measured because that backend is not available in the toolchain used. Large GCD uses Lehmer batching on a common 63-bit window of both operands and takes a single division step when the shorter operand has no bits in that window, so operands of very different lengths are reduced at once."
msgstr "除法使用单 limb 路径、在 64 位数位上的 Knuth 算法 D（128 除以 64 位的商估计与 128 位修正检验，除数最多 128 个 32 位 limb），以及从 192 个 limb 起的 Burnikel–Ziegler。牛顿倒数除法不再被选用：乘法快了 2 到 3 倍之后，它在 32,768 位起比 Burnikel–Ziegler 慢 3 到 12 倍（32,768 位时 4.4 毫秒对 0.37 毫秒），因此分派不会到达它；该例程保留并由测试覆盖，阈值常量按目标设置。与此前内核的成对运行对比：`div` 在 Native 上于 512、2,048、8,192 位分别快 1.5、2.3、2.9 倍，在 Wasm-GC 上于 2,048 与 8,192 位快 1.9 与 3.3 倍，在 Wasm 上快 1.3 与 3.3 倍，8,192 位的 `sqrt` 在三者上快 1.5 到 1.8 倍；乘法更快之后，Native 乘法在 8,192 个 limb（原为 2,048）处才切换到 NTT。平方根在 512 位以内使用定宽内核，超过则使用分治法；当分治递归中的块不超过 Native/LLVM 上的 256 位或 Wasm/Wasm-GC 上的 512 位时，递归在同一组定宽内核处结束（此前是在 128 位处对堆整数使用恢复式循环），这使 1,024 位被开方数（即 512 位 `sqrt`）在成对运行中在 Native 上快约 3.4 倍，在 Wasm 上快 3.1 至 3.3 倍。该截断点是按目标平台测得的策略；LLVM 的取值未经测量，因为所用工具链不提供该后端。大数 GCD 在两个操作数共同的 63 位窗口上使用 Lehmer 批处理；当较短的操作数在该窗口中没有任何位时，执行一次除法步骤，因此长度相差很大的操作数会被一次性约简。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:38
msgid "The integer square root of a value of up to 256 bits (a 128-bit root, the base case of the divide-and-conquer root and the whole root at precisions up to 128 bits) no longer runs a bit-by-bit loop on Native, LLVM and Wasm-GC: up to 128 bits it is a double-precision estimate refined by one Newton step on 128-bit arithmetic and settled by exact comparisons, and up to 256 bits Zimmermann's word-level Karatsuba square root (the root of the upper two words, one 128 by 64 bit division for the low half, an exact settle on the 256-bit square) on a value normalized by an even shift. Values of 257 to 512 bits on Native and LLVM go through the divide-and-conquer root with that base case instead of the 512-bit loop. Linear Wasm keeps the loops (its 64-bit multiplication makes the word kernels no faster there), and the Wasm targets keep the 512-bit base case. Paired runs against the previous kernels (with the coefficient-level paths above): `sqrt` at 100 and 128 bits 2.0 and 2.3 times faster on Native and on Wasm-GC, 1.4 and 1.5 times at 200 and 256 bits, 1.1 times at 512 bits and 1.05 at 2,048 bits on Native; Wasm-GC is unchanged at 256 and 512 bits and linear Wasm everywhere. The larger sizes are dominated by the division and squaring of the recursion, not by its base case. LLVM takes the Native settings, unmeasured because the toolchain used does not provide that backend. White-box tests compare the word kernels with the loops and with a BigInt oracle at every width from 1 to 256 bits (random, all ones, single bits, runs, the neighbours of exact squares near the extreme roots of each width). On Wasm (not on Wasm-GC) these roots still run the restoring loops: the word kernels are not enabled there and were not measured on that target."
msgstr "至多 256 位的值的整数平方根（128 位的根、分治平方根的基本情形，以及精度至多 128 位时的整个平方根），在 Native、LLVM 和 Wasm-GC 上不再运行逐位循环：至多 128 位时，用双精度估计在 128 位算术上做一步牛顿迭代并以精确比较定位；至多 256 位时，用 Zimmermann 的字级 Karatsuba 平方根（上两个字的平方根，低半部分一次 128 除以 64 位除法，在 256 位平方上做精确定位），对象是经偶数移位规范化后的值。Native 与 LLVM 上 257 到 512 位的值改走以该基本情形为基础的分治平方根，不再用 512 位循环。线性 Wasm 保留循环（其 64 位乘法使字级内核在那里并不更快），Wasm 各目标也保留 512 位的基本情形。与此前内核的成对运行（含上文的系数级路径）：`sqrt` 在 100 与 128 位时于 Native 和 Wasm-GC 上快 2.0 与 2.3 倍，在 Native 上 200 与 256 位快 1.4 与 1.5 倍，512 位快 1.1 倍，2,048 位快 1.05 倍；Wasm-GC 在 256 与 512 位不变，线性 Wasm 各处不变。更大的尺寸由递归中的除法与平方主导，而非基本情形。LLVM 采用 Native 的设置，因所用工具链不提供该后端而未测量。白盒测试把字级内核与循环及 BigInt 参照在 1 到 256 位的每个宽度上比较（随机、全 1、单个位、连续位段，以及各宽度极端根附近的完全平方数的邻近值）。在 Wasm（不含 Wasm-GC）上，这些平方根仍然运行逐位恢复循环：那里没有启用按字的内核，也没有在该目标上测量过。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:40
msgid "The last stage of the 64-bit limb work moves the remaining coefficient kernels off the 32-bit view of the storage, so that only the 32-bit-limb routes of Wasm (multiplication, squaring and Knuth division on 32-bit limbs) use it, and every cutoff is named and documented in 64-bit limbs (`bin_coeff_ntt_mul_min_words`, `bin_coeff_ntt_square_min_words`, `bin_coeff_toom3_min_words`, `bin_coeff_bz_division_min_words`, `bin_coeff_bz_leaf_words`, `bin_coeff_radix_format_dc_words`, `bin_coeff_sparse_min_words` and the others of the threshold files, the same values halved). Converted: the multiplication and squaring dispatch, the unbalanced product (the block multiplication of the word Karatsuba replaces the `BinCoeff`-level one), the Burnikel–Ziegler recursion, the NTT digit conversion and overlap-add (the transforms keep their 32-bit Montgomery primes), the one-limb division, the sparse product, the bit operations, the byte and power-of-two radix conversions, the Lehmer threshold and the 256-bit square root kernel. The old divide-and-conquer root, its 512-bit kernel and the restoring loop are test-only references now. Retired instructions per operation on Native against the previous build: a sparse product of 8,192-bit operands 3.3 times fewer (4 and 12 nonzero limbs), `bit_and` plus `bit_xor` at 8,192 bits 2.8 times, a division by a one-limb divisor below $2^{32}$ 2.2 times, `from_bytes_be` 1.2 times, and 1.00 to 1.09 times for the products, divisions, NTT products and gcd measured at 2,048 to 300,000 bits; nothing is slower. Results are unchanged: the regression digests recorded with the 32-bit implementation, the BigInt oracle tests, and new tests of the converted kernels against their 32-bit-limb definitions, the Knuth division, the schoolbook product and each other. The cutoffs keep their values (halved from limbs of 32 bits), except that LLVM now carries the Native cutoffs instead of an old copy of the Wasm ones; the elementary bit-burst precisions depend on multiplication cost, which this stage does not change. On Wasm and Wasm-GC the paired wall-clock runs of the radix conversion (in place against divide and conquer, 4,096 to 131,072 bits) put the parsing cutoff at 4,608 chunks as on Native (in place is 1.2 to 6.5 times faster up to 131,072 bits) and keep the formatting cutoff at 64 limbs (4,096 bits), above which divide and conquer is 1.2 to 3 times faster. The NTT digit conversion stays on the 32-bit view on Wasm and Wasm-GC (`bin_coeff_ntt_limb32_conversion`): with the 64-bit limb conversion a 300,000-bit product measured 0.88 times and a square 0.78 times as fast on Wasm-GC (seven paired runs each, outside the spread)."
msgstr "64 位 limb 工作的最后一个阶段把其余的系数内核移出存储的 32 位视图，使得只有 Wasm 的 32 位 limb 路径（32 位 limb 上的乘法、平方与 Knuth 除法）仍使用它，并且每个截止点都以 64 位 limb 命名和记录（`bin_coeff_ntt_mul_min_words`、`bin_coeff_ntt_square_min_words`、`bin_coeff_toom3_min_words`、`bin_coeff_bz_division_min_words`、`bin_coeff_bz_leaf_words`、`bin_coeff_radix_format_dc_words`、`bin_coeff_sparse_min_words` 以及阈值文件中的其他常量，数值为原值的一半）。已转换：乘法与平方分派，不平衡乘积（字 Karatsuba 的分块乘法取代 `BinCoeff` 级的分块乘法），Burnikel–Ziegler 递归，NTT 的数字转换与重叠相加（变换仍使用其 32 位 Montgomery 素数），单 limb 除法，稀疏乘积，位运算，字节与 2 的幂基数转换，Lehmer 阈值，以及 256 位平方根内核。旧的分治平方根、其 512 位内核与逐位循环现在只是测试用的参照。Native 上每次运算的 retired instructions 与此前构建相比：8,192 位操作数的稀疏乘积（4 个与 12 个非零 limb）少 3.3 倍，8,192 位的 `bit_and` 加 `bit_xor` 少 2.8 倍，除以小于 $2^{32}$ 的单 limb 除数少 2.2 倍，`from_bytes_be` 少 1.2 倍，在 2,048 至 300,000 位上测量的乘积、除法、NTT 乘积与 gcd 少 1.00 至 1.09 倍；没有任何操作变慢。结果不变：用 32 位实现记录的回归摘要、BigInt 参照测试，以及把转换后的内核与其 32 位 limb 定义、Knuth 除法、朴素乘积及彼此比较的新测试。各截止点保持其数值（由 32 位 limb 折半得到），只是 LLVM 现在使用 Native 的截止点，而不再是 Wasm 截止点的旧副本；初等函数的 bit-burst 精度取决于乘法代价，而本阶段不改变它。在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上，基数转换（就地对分治，4,096 至 131,072 位）的成对墙钟运行把解析截止点定在与 Native 相同的 4,608 个块（至 131,072 位就地快 1.2 至 6.5 倍），并把格式化截止点保持在 64 个 limb（4,096 位），高于它时分治快 1.2 至 3 倍。在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上，NTT 的数字转换仍使用 32 位视图（`bin_coeff_ntt_limb32_conversion`）：用 64 位 limb 转换时，Wasm-GC 上 300,000 位乘积的速度为 0.88 倍、平方为 0.78 倍（各七次成对运行，超出波动范围）。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:42
msgid "`BinCoeff::to_radix_string` and `BinCoeff::parse` in a radix that is not a power of two work on one limb array in place below their divide-and-conquer cutoffs. Formatting divides a copy of the 64-bit limbs by the chunk power (9 decimal digits, the largest power of the radix below $2^{32}$) one pass per chunk, and parsing accumulates `value * chunk_power + chunk` in place; each limb is two 32-bit halves with one 64 by 32 bit division or multiplication each, and the digits of a chunk are written into one string builder from a scratch array. Before, every chunk went through the 32-bit limb accessors and allocated a coefficient (about 113 instructions per 32-bit limb step against about 10 now). Chunks of 64 bits (19 decimal digits) are not used: a 128 by 64 bit quotient digit needs two hardware divisions where two 64 by 32 bit steps need one each, so by construction a pass over the limbs costs about the same per digit, and what was wrong was the per-chunk overhead, which is gone either way (not measured separately). The divide-and-conquer conversion starts at 6,144 32-bit limbs (196,608 bits) for formatting and at 4,608 chunks (about 41,000 digits) for parsing on Native and LLVM, measured as the crossover with retired instructions (formatting 65,536 bits 14.5 million against 25.5 million instructions for divide and conquer, 262,144 bits 220 million against 181 million; parsing 131,072 bits 47.2 against 48.3 million, 262,144 bits 201 against 146 million); Wasm and Wasm-GC keep the previous cutoffs of 128 limbs and 64 chunks until measured. Retired instructions per operation on Native, base 10, against the previous build: formatting 4.9, 5.7, 4.2 and 2.0 times fewer at 512, 2,048, 8,192 and 65,536 bits, parsing 6.1, 8.3, 4.7 and 1.5 times; base 16 (a power of two) is unchanged. White-box tests compare both paths with a chunk-by-chunk reference of the previous build for the radixes 3, 5, 7, 10, 12 and 36 at 1 to 513 limbs, with the values $r^{9k}$ and $r^{9k} - 1$ around chunk edges up to 130 chunks, and with each other (in place against divide and conquer, formatting and parsing) on both sides of the old cutoffs."
msgstr "`BinCoeff::to_radix_string` 与 `BinCoeff::parse` 在基数不是 2 的幂时，于各自的分治截止点以下直接在一个 limb 数组上就地进行转换。格式化时对 64 位 limb 的副本逐块（每块 9 位十进制数字，即小于 $2^{32}$ 的最大基数幂）就地做除法，每块一遍；解析时就地累加 `value * chunk_power + chunk`；每个 limb 视为两个 32 位半字，每个半字一次 64 位除以 32 位的除法或乘法，一块的各位数字从一个暂存数组写入同一个字符串构建器。此前每个块都经过 32 位 limb 访问器并分配一个系数（每个 32 位 limb 步骤约 113 条指令，现在约 10 条）。没有使用 64 位的块（19 位十进制数字）：128 除以 64 位的商位需要两次硬件除法，而两个 64 除以 32 位的步骤各需一次，因此按构造，遍历 limb 的每位数字代价大致相同，而此前的问题在于每块的开销，两种方式下它都已消除（未单独测量）。分治转换在 Native 与 LLVM 上，格式化从 6,144 个 32 位 limb（196,608 位）起，解析从 4,608 个块（约 41,000 位数字）起，按 retired instructions 实测的交叉点确定（格式化 65,536 位为 1,448 万对分治的 2,549 万条指令，262,144 位为 2.2 亿对 1.81 亿；解析 131,072 位为 4,720 万对 4,830 万，262,144 位为 2.01 亿对 1.46 亿）；Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 在测量之前保留原先的 128 个 limb 与 64 个块的截止点。Native 上十进制每次运算的 retired instructions 与此前构建相比：格式化在 512、2,048、8,192 与 65,536 位分别少 4.9、5.7、4.2 与 2.0 倍，解析少 6.1、8.3、4.7 与 1.5 倍；十六进制（2 的幂）不变。白盒测试把两条路径与此前构建的逐块参照实现在基数 3、5、7、10、12 与 36 下于 1 至 513 个 limb 上比较，检验围绕块边界至 130 个块的 $r^{9k}$ 与 $r^{9k} - 1$ 取值，并让就地与分治两种实现（格式化与解析）在旧截止点两侧互相比较。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:44
msgid "Above 256 bits the integer square root on every target except JavaScript runs Zimmermann's `SqrtRem` on word arrays instead of the `BinCoeff` divide-and-conquer root, which built about twenty-five temporaries per level (a `BinCoeff` operation on a few limbs costs 600 to 700 instructions, more than the division it surrounds). The radicand is shifted left by an even number of bits, below 128, to an even number $n$ of 64-bit limbs with the top two bits not both zero; each level cuts it into blocks of $n/4$ limbs, takes the root and remainder of the upper part from the recursion, one division by twice that root and one squaring of the quotient through the coefficient dispatch, and corrects the root by at most one; a quotient of a whole block is capped one below, which is the root. The remainder of the original radicand comes back from the normalized one with a one-limb product, $(r' + e(2s' - e)) \\gg 2t$ with $e = s' \\bmod 2^t$ for the shift $2t$. The recursion ends in the fixed-width kernels at 256 bits. Retired instructions of one root on Native (release, radicand of twice the root width, paired with the previous build): 2.0 times fewer for a 512-bit root, 1.85 for 2,048 bits, 1.3 for 8,192 bits and 1.04 for 65,536 bits, where the division and the squaring of the recursion dominate; a root of 256 bits (a 512-bit radicand) 1.8 times. On Wasm-GC paired wall-clock runs of one root (radicand of twice the root width, medians of five) are 4.9 and 2.2 times faster at 512 and 2,048 bits and 1.3 and 1.07 times at 8,192 and 65,536 bits; on linear Wasm 2.2, 2.0, 1.4 and 1.05 times; on Native 2.0, 1.8, 1.3 and 1.05 times, in line with the instruction counts. No size is slower on any target, so the word recursion is selected on every target except JavaScript (the per-target constant `bin_coeff_sqrt_array_enabled` stays, and the previous recursion remains as the test reference). White-box tests compare it with the previous recursion, the restoring loop and a BigInt oracle from 129 to 4,097 bits (random, all ones, single bits, zero limbs inside the value, the neighbours of exact squares), and with the defining inequalities up to 33,000 bits."
msgstr "在除 JavaScript 外的所有目标上，256 位以上的整数平方根改在字数组上运行 Zimmermann 的 `SqrtRem`，不再使用 `BinCoeff` 分治平方根；后者每层要构造约二十五个临时量（对几个 limb 的 `BinCoeff` 运算要 600 到 700 条指令，比它所包围的除法还多）。被开方数先左移一个偶数位（小于 128），得到偶数个 $n$ 个 64 位 limb 且最高两位不全为零；每层把它切成每块 $n/4$ 个 limb，由递归求上半部分的根与余数，再通过系数分派做一次除以该根两倍的除法和一次商的平方，并把根至多修正一次；商为整块时封顶取小一，那就是根。原被开方数的余数由规范化后的余数加一个单 limb 乘积得到，即 $(r' + e(2s' - e)) \\gg 2t$，其中 $e = s' \\bmod 2^t$，移位为 $2t$。递归在 256 位处止于定宽内核。Native 上一次开方的 retired instructions（release，被开方数宽度为根的两倍，与此前构建成对比较）：512 位根少 2.0 倍，2,048 位少 1.85 倍，8,192 位少 1.3 倍，65,536 位少 1.04 倍，那里由递归中的除法与平方主导；256 位根（512 位被开方数）少 1.8 倍。在 Wasm-GC 上，成对墙钟测量（被开方数为根的两倍宽，五次取中位数）显示一次开方在 512 与 2,048 位快 4.9 与 2.2 倍，在 8,192 与 65,536 位快 1.3 与 1.07 倍；线性 Wasm 为 2.2、2.0、1.4 与 1.05 倍；Native 为 2.0、1.8、1.3 与 1.05 倍，与指令数一致。任何目标上都没有更慢的尺寸，因此除 JavaScript 外的所有目标都选用字级递归（按目标的常量 `bin_coeff_sqrt_array_enabled` 保留，此前的递归留作测试参照）。白盒测试在 129 到 4,097 位上把它与此前的递归、逐位循环及 BigInt 参照比较（随机、全 1、单个位、值内部的零 limb、完全平方数的邻近值），并在至多 33,000 位上用定义不等式检验。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:46
msgid "Squaring on Native and LLVM no longer runs the half-product schoolbook (and, from 16,384 bits, the general product) up to the NTT: from 36 64-bit limbs (2,304 bits) a word-range Karatsuba square computes $a_0^2$, $a_1^2$ and $(a_0 - a_1)^2$ on array ranges, with the middle term $a_0^2 + a_1^2 - (a_0 - a_1)^2$ added in place, and the NTT square starts at 7,168 32-bit limbs (229,376 bits) instead of 768, because the Karatsuba square is cheaper up to there (retired instructions of one square: 12,288 bits 1.64 times fewer, 32,768 bits 2.2, 98,304 bits 1.7, 131,072 bits 1.09, 196,608 bits 1.18, equal from 262,144 bits). The Karatsuba multiplication of the word ranges now takes one scratch array per product, carved into the temporaries of each node, instead of five arrays and two copies per node: 1.02 to 1.04 times fewer instructions for a product of 2,048 to 65,536 bits, the same results. The schoolbook square stays below 36 limbs (the paired runs put the crossover between 32 and 40 limbs). Retired instructions per operation on Native, against the previous build: `sqr` 1.00, 1.00, 1.39 and 1.52 times fewer at 512, 2,048, 8,192 and 65,536 bits, `mul` 1.00, 1.02, 1.04 and 1.04 times, and the integer square root of a 65,536-bit root 1.23 times (its recursion squares). Wasm and Wasm-GC keep their squaring (`bin_coeff_square_words_enabled` is false there until paired wall-clock runs decide), and LLVM takes the Native values, unmeasured. White-box tests compare the scratch-buffer product with the allocating Karatsuba of the previous build and the schoolbook product at and around the cutoff with unbalanced shapes, the Karatsuba square with the schoolbook square and the product, and the dispatch against the schoolbook around 36, 64, 128, 256, 384 and 512 limbs and against the NTT and Karatsuba squares at the NTT cutoff."
msgstr "在 Native 与 LLVM 上，平方不再在 NTT 之前运行半乘积朴素算法（以及从 16,384 位起的一般乘积）：从 36 个 64 位 limb（2,304 位）起，字范围 Karatsuba 平方在数组区间上计算 $a_0^2$、$a_1^2$ 与 $(a_0 - a_1)^2$，中间项 $a_0^2 + a_1^2 - (a_0 - a_1)^2$ 就地加入；NTT 平方从 7,168 个 32 位 limb（229,376 位）起，而不再是 768，因为在此之前 Karatsuba 平方更便宜（一次平方的 retired instructions：12,288 位少 1.64 倍，32,768 位少 2.2 倍，98,304 位少 1.7 倍，131,072 位少 1.09 倍，196,608 位少 1.18 倍，262,144 位起持平）。字范围 Karatsuba 乘法现在每个乘积只用一个 scratch 数组，按节点划分其临时量，而不是每个节点五个数组和两次拷贝：2,048 至 65,536 位的乘积少 1.02 至 1.04 倍指令，结果不变。朴素平方保持用于 36 个 limb 以下（成对运行把交叉点定在 32 与 40 个 limb 之间）。Native 上每次运算的 retired instructions，与此前构建相比：`sqr` 在 512、2,048、8,192 与 65,536 位分别少 1.00、1.00、1.39 与 1.52 倍，`mul` 为 1.00、1.02、1.04 与 1.04 倍，65,536 位根的整数平方根少 1.23 倍（其递归要做平方）。Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 保持其平方方式（在成对墙钟测量作出决定之前，`bin_coeff_square_words_enabled` 在那里为 false），LLVM 采用 Native 的值，未经测量。白盒测试把 scratch 缓冲乘积与此前构建的逐节点分配 Karatsuba 及朴素乘积在截止点及其附近（含不平衡形状）比较，把 Karatsuba 平方与朴素平方及乘积比较，把分派与 36、64、128、256、384、512 个 limb 附近的朴素乘积比较，并在 NTT 截止点与 NTT 及 Karatsuba 平方比较。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:48
msgid "Certified constants"
msgstr "认证常数"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:50
msgid "The certified elementary functions memoize the constant enclosures they need (`ln 2`, `ln 10` and `pi`) per working precision, in small per-constant caches of six precisions up to 65,536 bits. A cached enclosure is the value a recomputation returns, so results never depend on cache state or call order. Before this, every `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `sin`, `cos`, `tan` and `atan2` call re-ran an `ln 2` series or an `atan(1)` evaluation that cost as much as the function itself. Paired native runs: `ln` 2.4 to 2.6 times faster at 53 to 512 bits, `sin` 2.4 to 3.7 times, decimal `ln` 2.5 times; on Wasm and Wasm-GC `ln` and `sin` are 1.7 to 2.2 times faster. `exp` has no such constant and is unchanged."
msgstr "认证初等函数按工作精度缓存其所需的常数包络（`ln 2`、`ln 10` 与 `pi`），每个常数一个小缓存，保存六个精度，最高 65,536 位。缓存中的包络就是重新计算会得到的值，因此结果绝不依赖缓存状态或调用顺序。此前每次 `ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`sin`、`cos`、`tan` 与 `atan2` 调用都会重新运行一次 `ln 2` 级数或 `atan(1)` 求值，其代价与函数本身相当。在 Native 上的成对运行中：53 至 512 位的 `ln` 快 2.4 至 2.6 倍，`sin` 快 2.4 至 3.7 倍，十进制 `ln` 快 2.5 倍；在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上 `ln` 和 `sin` 快 1.7 至 2.2 倍。`exp` 没有这类常数，保持不变。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:52
#: manual/performance_audit.md:108
msgid "Measurement"
msgstr "测量"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:54
msgid "The unified Maremark harness under `bench/bin_float` compares coefficient kernels, numeric cores, checked full paths, and semantically equivalent square candidates with balanced blocks. Auto-tune emits a versioned per-scale policy and applies a threshold only to the measured target; every threshold change still requires correctness tests on all targets."
msgstr "统一的 `bench/bin_float` Maremark harness 使用平衡 block 比较系数核、数值核心、checked 全路径与语义等价的平方候选。auto-tune 输出版本化的逐尺度 policy，并且只把阈值应用到实际测量的 target；所有阈值变更仍须通过全 target 正确性测试。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:56
msgid "The elementary release gate separately archives the immutable `0.6.1` commit and the dirty candidate tree, injects one identical add/mul/div/sqrt workload, and collects ten alternating AB/BA native pairs at 53, 128, and 512 bits. Maremark blocks release only when the candidate is at least 3% slower and the 95% bootstrap interval has a positive lower bound. Functions first introduced in `0.7.1` run as a candidate workload; this release becomes their first valid baseline, because inventing `0.6.1` timings for APIs that did not exist would be meaningless."
msgstr "elementary 发布门禁会分别归档不可变的 `0.6.1` commit 与当前 dirty candidate，向两者注入完全相同的 add/mul/div/sqrt workload，并在 53、128、512 bit 收集十组交替 AB/BA native 配对样本。只有 candidate 至少慢 3%，且 Maremark 95% bootstrap 区间下界为正时才阻断发布。`0.7.1` 首次新增的函数只运行 candidate workload；本版本将成为它们的首个合法 baseline，不能为 `0.6.1` 中不存在的 API 伪造耗时。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:65
msgid "Certified series"
msgstr "认证级数"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:67
msgid "The enclosure of `exp` evaluates its Taylor series once, not twice, when the argument is exact at the working precision (the usual case), because the lower and upper endpoints are then the same value and only one bound of each series is read. The trigonometric enclosure evaluates only the sine or cosine series that the requested function and quadrant read, two series instead of four for `sin` and `cos`. Both skips return the exact enclosures of before, which white-box tests check against copies of the previous code. Paired native runs: `exp` 1.8 to 2.0 times faster at 53 to 512 bits, decimal `exp` 1.3 to 1.4 times, `sin` 1.15 to 1.2 times on its own; on Wasm and Wasm-GC `exp` is 1.7 to 1.9 times faster."
msgstr "当参数在工作精度下精确表示（通常如此）时，`exp` 的包络只计算一次泰勒级数而不是两次，因为此时下端点与上端点是同一个值，而每个级数只读取其中一个界。三角函数的包络只计算所请求函数和象限实际读取的正弦或余弦级数，`sin` 与 `cos` 由四个级数减为两个。两种跳过都返回与之前完全相同的包络，白盒测试将其与此前代码的副本逐一比对。在 Native 上的成对运行中：53 至 512 位的 `exp` 快 1.8 至 2.0 倍，十进制 `exp` 快 1.3 至 1.4 倍，仅此一项使 `sin` 快 1.15 至 1.2 倍；在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上 `exp` 快 1.7 至 1.9 倍。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:69
msgid "Trade-offs"
msgstr "取舍"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:71
msgid "Schoolbook minimizes setup and allocation, recursive algorithms reduce asymptotic work, and NTT improves very large balanced inputs at the cost of transforms and temporary storage. Every fast path retains an exact fallback, so performance dispatch cannot alter semantics."
msgstr "schoolbook 降低初始化和分配，递归算法减少渐近工作，NTT 改善超大平衡输入但需要 transform 与临时存储。所有快路径保留精确 fallback，因此性能调度不能改变语义。"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:73
msgid "Fixed-point logarithm"
msgstr "定点对数函数"

#: manual/performance/bin_float.md:75
msgid "The certified `ln` enclosure on the normalized argument in [1, 2] (and the `ln 2` and `ln 10` constants built from it) sums the series `2 * sum z^(2k+1) / (2k+1)`, `z = (v - 1) / (v + 1)`, in fixed point when the argument is exact at the working precision. The fraction has 16 guard bits plus the leading zero bits of `z`, so the enclosure keeps `precision + 16` significant bits even for an argument close to 1; every operation rounds down, which makes the sum a lower bound, and a proven error of less than 2 units per term and a tail bound give the upper bound. Arguments that are not exact, or so close to 1 that the fraction would exceed four times the working precision, use the previous floating-point series, so the refinement loop and its working precisions are unchanged. White-box tests check containment of a much tighter enclosure, a bound on the width, and equality of the final correctly rounded results and flags with those of the previous series. Paired runs without the constant cache: `ln` is 5 to 7 times faster on Native at 53 to 2,048 bits, 5.5 to 7.5 times on Wasm and Wasm-GC, and decimal `ln` 6 times."
msgstr "当参数在工作精度下精确表示时，认证 `ln` 对 [1, 2] 内规范化参数的包络（以及由它构造的 `ln 2` 与 `ln 10` 常数）以定点方式对级数 `2 * sum z^(2k+1) / (2k+1)`（`z = (v - 1) / (v + 1)`）求和。小数部分包含 16 位保护位再加上 `z` 的前导零位数，因此即使参数接近 1，包络也保有 `precision + 16` 个有效位；每一步运算都向下舍入，使和成为下界，每项误差小于 2 个单位的证明以及尾项界给出上界。参数不精确，或接近 1 以致小数位数将超过工作精度的四倍时，仍使用此前的浮点级数，因此细化循环及其工作精度均不变。白盒测试检查该包络包含一个更紧的包络、宽度有界，并检查最终正确舍入的结果与标志与此前的级数一致。不含常数缓存的成对运行：`ln` 在 Native 上于 53 至 2,048 位快 5 至 7 倍，在 Wasm 与 Wasm-GC 上快 5.5 至 7.5 倍，十进制 `ln` 快 6 倍。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:1
msgid "decimal performance"
msgstr "decimal 性能"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:7
msgid "`just bench decimal --target native` runs the current Maremark suite in `tooling/src/bench/decimal` and writes `.tmp/bench/decimal.jsonl` plus its analysis file. This is a reproducible measurement artifact, not an immutable release gate. The current branch has no checked-in decimal performance manifest or threshold workflow; measurements use the Maremark suite below."
msgstr "`just bench decimal --target native` 运行 `tooling/src/bench/decimal` 中当前的 Maremark 基准套件，并写入 `.tmp/bench/decimal.jsonl` 及其分析文件。这是一个可复现的测量产物，而不是不可变的发布门槛。当前分支没有签入的十进制性能清单或阈值流程；测量使用下面的 Maremark 套件。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:15
msgid "The suite measures add, multiply, and divide at 9, 34, 128, and 512 decimal digits. Each cell compares a `BigInt` coefficient baseline (`kernel/coefficient`), the contextual `Decimal` path (`core/decimal`, the `*_ctx` operations) and the full `DecimalChecked` path (`full/checked`), and validates every output against an exact `BigInt` reference. Input creation and expected-value construction stay outside the timed payload."
msgstr "该套件在 9、34、128 和 512 位十进制数字下测量加法、乘法和除法。每个单元格比较 `BigInt` 系数基线（`kernel/coefficient`）、contextual `Decimal` 路径（`core/decimal`，即 `*_ctx` 运算）以及完整的 `DecimalChecked` 路径（`full/checked`），并用精确的 `BigInt` 参考值验证每个输出。输入构造和期望值构造都不计入计时部分。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:22
msgid "The reference exponent and precision limits admit contexts up to `999,999,999`. Such contexts are valid but can require very large coefficient work: debug-native probes at that limit took more than 25 seconds for some `plus`, `min`, and `quantize` cases. Choose a smaller precision for interactive work and treat the large limit as a compatibility boundary."
msgstr "参考指数和精度上限允许上下文达到 `999,999,999`。这些上下文有效，但可能需要大量系数运算：在该上限下进行的 debug-native 探测中，某些 `plus`、`min` 和 `quantize` 用例耗时超过 25 秒。交互式工作建议使用较小精度，并将此上限视为兼容性边界。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:30
msgid "`MAREMARK_JSONL` is the raw versioned event stream and `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT` is the paired layer-overhead analysis. Results describe this tree, toolchain, and target. They are useful for finding a hotspot, but they do not establish a universal crossover or a release-wide latency bound."
msgstr "`MAREMARK_JSONL` 是带版本的原始事件流，`MAREMARK_HOTSPOT` 是成对的分层开销分析。结果只描述当前 tree、toolchain 和 target，可用于定位 hotspot，但不能证明通用 crossover 或 release-wide latency bound。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:42
msgid "The all-suite run also covers binary, GDA, and interval kernels. It is safe to compare artifacts only when the target, toolchain, workload, and benchmark protocol are held constant."
msgstr "all-suite 运行也覆盖 binary、GDA 和 interval kernel。只有在 target、toolchain、workload 和 benchmark protocol 相同的情况下，artifact 才适合比较。"

#: manual/performance/decimal.md:48
msgid "Benchmark equivalence checks are necessary but not sufficient. Optimized decimal routes must also pass coefficient differential tests and the pinned IEEE decimal and GDA conformance gates before they are accepted. See [Conformance](../conformance/decimal.md), [Design](../design/decimal.md), and the [0.7.1 performance and semantic audit](../performance_audit.md)."
msgstr "benchmark equivalence check 是必要条件，但不是充分条件。优化后的 decimal 路径还必须通过 coefficient differential test 以及固定的 IEEE decimal、GDA conformance gate，才能被接受。参见[一致性说明](../conformance/decimal.md)、[设计](../design/decimal.md)和[0.7.1 性能与语义审计](../performance_audit.md)。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda performance"
msgstr "decimal_gda 性能"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:7
msgid "`just bench decimal-gda --target native` runs the current Maremark suite in `tooling/src/bench/decimal_gda` and writes `.tmp/bench/decimal-gda.jsonl` plus its analysis file. The independent quick fixture can be run with `python3 tools/run_gda_benchmark.py`; it writes `.tmp/bench/gda-quick-native.json` and uses three native runs per cell. Neither artifact is a universal speed claim or a substitute for the conformance gate."
msgstr "`just bench decimal-gda --target native` 运行 `tooling/src/bench/decimal_gda` 中当前的 Maremark suite，并写入 `.tmp/bench/decimal-gda.jsonl` 及其 analysis 文件。独立 quick fixture 可用 `python3 tools/run_gda_benchmark.py` 运行，写入 `.tmp/bench/gda-quick-native.json`，每个 cell 使用三个 native run。两个 artifact 都不是通用速度声明，也不能替代 conformance gate。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:16
msgid "The Maremark suite measures add, subtract, multiply, divide, FMA, and parse at 1, 9, 18, 34, and 128 decimal digits. It compares the core `GdaContext` path with the full checked path and validates both against the core result before reporting layer overhead."
msgstr "Maremark suite 在 1、9、18、34、128 位十进制数字上测量 add、subtract、multiply、divide、 FMA 和 parse。它比较核心 `GdaContext` 路径与完整 checked 路径，并在报告分层开销前将两者与 core result 做验证。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Contexts may use the adopted decNumber maximum precision `999,999,999`, but operations at that boundary can be expensive. In debug-native measurements, `1 / 4` in `decimal_gda` did not finish within 40 seconds. Use a smaller precision for interactive work and reserve the maximum for compatibility or conformance checks."
msgstr "上下文可以使用本库采用的 decNumber 精度上限 `999,999,999`，但在该边界执行运算可能代价很高。在 debug-native 测量中，`decimal_gda` 的 `1 / 4` 未能在 40 秒内完成。交互式工作建议使用较小精度，将最大精度留给兼容性或一致性检查。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:29
msgid "`MAREMARK_JSONL` is the raw event stream and `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT` reports paired core-versus-checked overhead. The quick fixture additionally records per- operation medians and dispersion. Interpret these measurements only for the recorded target, toolchain, fixture, and workload; they do not establish a cross-target threshold or a fixed latency bound."
msgstr "`MAREMARK_JSONL` 是原始事件流，`MAREMARK_HOTSPOT` 报告 core 与 checked 的成对开销。 quick fixture 还记录每个 operation 的 median 和 dispersion。结果只适用于记录的 target、 toolchain、fixture 和 workload，不能证明跨 target threshold 或固定 latency bound。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:43
msgid "Use the same target and toolchain when comparing artifacts. Normal benchmark tests compile their plans but skip timing, so an explicit benchmark command is required for measurement."
msgstr "比较 artifact 时保持 target 和 toolchain 相同。普通 benchmark test 只编译 plan 而跳过计时，因此必须显式运行 benchmark command 才会产生测量。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:47
msgid "Small-coefficient fast paths and the exponential"
msgstr "小系数快速路径与指数函数"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:49
msgid "`add`, `subtract`, `multiply` and `divide` on operands whose coefficients are single-limb values (below 10^18) in an extended context of at most 18 digits (17 for `divide`) compute the exact sum, product or guarded quotient on `UInt64` pairs, round once to the precision with the context's rounding mode, and build the result and its flags directly, instead of going through the operand preparation, the normalization chain and the finalizer. The functions decline (and the general path answers) a NaN, an infinity, a zero, a wider coefficient or precision, a non-extended context, `ZeroFiveUp`, an exact zero sum, an exact quotient (whose preferred exponent the general path settles), exponents more than 19 places apart or near the implementation limits, and any result that would be clamped, subnormal, or beyond the exponent range of the context; the value, the flags and the next context are those of the general path. White-box tests compare 60,000 random operand pairs per operation over twelve precisions from 1 to 34, all eight rounding modes, narrow and wide exponent ranges, clamping, extended and basic contexts, all-nines and tie coefficients, cancelling sums and power-of-two and power-of-five divisors with the general path. Paired native runs at 16 digits: `add` 4.6 times, `multiply` 4.0 and `divide` 8.2 times faster; Wasm-GC 9.3, 10.2 and 7.8 times."
msgstr "在扩展上下文中，精度至多 18 位（`divide` 为 17 位）、系数为单 limb 值（小于 10^18）的 `add`、`subtract`、`multiply` 与 `divide`，在 `UInt64` 对上计算精确的和、积或带保护位的商，按上下文的舍入模式一次舍入到该精度，并直接构造结果及其标志，而不经过操作数准备、规范化链与收尾函数。这些函数拒绝并交由通用路径处理：NaN、无穷、零、更宽的系数或精度、非扩展上下文、`ZeroFiveUp`、精确为零的和、精确的商（其优选指数由通用路径确定）、相距超过 19 位或接近实现极限的指数，以及任何会被钳制、次正规或超出上下文指数范围的结果；值、标志与下一个上下文都与通用路径相同。白盒测试对每种运算用 60,000 组随机操作数，覆盖 1 到 34 之间的十二种精度、全部八种舍入模式、窄与宽指数范围、钳制、扩展与基本上下文、全 9 与平局系数、相消的和以及 2 的幂与 5 的幂除数，与通用路径比较。Native 上 16 位的成对运行：`add` 快 4.6 倍，`multiply` 快 4.0 倍，`divide` 快 8.2 倍；Wasm-GC 上分别为 9.3、10.2 和 7.8 倍。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:51
msgid "The certified exponential of an argument below 1000 in magnitude, in a context that holds every result (extended, not clamped, `e_min` at most -999,999 and `e_max` at least 999,999), starts from the binary enclosure alone: its midpoint, converted to decimal and padded to `precision + 8` digits, picks the rounding cell, and the enclosure at about 3.33 bits per digit plus 12 guard bits and 4 per decade of the argument certifies it. Previously only arguments in [1, 10) took this attempt, and every other argument evaluated the Taylor series in decimal arithmetic at four bits per digit plus 64, which dominated the cost. A hard case (an enclosure that straddles a cell boundary) falls back to the conservative precision and the decimal series, as before. White-box tests compare the result with that of the former procedure for 400 random arguments of 1 to 40 digits and adjusted exponents from -40 to 3 and for 150 arguments chosen so that the exponential lies within 10^-60 of a rounding midpoint (6,000 and 2,000 in a one-off run): the value, flags and cohort are the same. Paired native runs of `exp`: 3.9 times faster at 16 digits, 8.2 at 34, 22 at 100 and 305 at 1,000 digits."
msgstr "在能容纳所有结果的上下文（扩展、不钳制、`e_min` 不大于 -999,999、`e_max` 不小于 999,999）中，模小于 1000 的参数的认证 `exp` 仅从二进制包络开始：其中点转换为十进制并补足到 `precision + 8` 位，选出舍入单元，每位约 3.33 比特加 12 个保护位、参数每个十进制量级再加 4 比特的包络对其进行认证。此前只有 [1, 10) 内的参数使用这一尝试，其余参数都按每位 4 比特加 64 在十进制算术中计算泰勒级数，那是主要开销。难例（包络跨越单元边界）仍回到保守精度与十进制级数，与以前一样。白盒测试把结果与以前的流程比较：400 个 1 到 40 位、调整指数从 -40 到 3 的随机参数，以及 150 个使指数值落在舍入中点 10^-60 之内的参数（一次性运行中为 6,000 与 2,000 个）：值、标志与同类（cohort）都相同。Native 上 `exp` 的成对运行：16 位快 3.9 倍，34 位快 8.2 倍，100 位快 22 倍，1,000 位快 305 倍。"

#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:55
msgid "The timing path is accepted only alongside the independent GDA state model and the pinned legal scalar corpus: 64,986/64,986 current rows and 16,124/16,124 legacy rows pass in the 0.7.1 audit. See [Conformance](../conformance/decimal_gda.md), [Design](../design/decimal_gda.md), and the [0.7.1 performance and semantic audit](../performance_audit.md)."
