msgstr "所有目标和运算都具有等价的性能"

#: manual/performance_audit.md:159
msgid "no paired cross-target artifact"
msgstr "没有成对的跨目标产物"

#: manual/performance_audit.md:159
msgid "not claimed"
msgstr "不作此结论"

#: manual/performance_audit.md:160
msgid "`floating` is competitive with MPFR and libmpdec"
msgstr "`floating` 与 MPFR 和 libmpdec 相比具有竞争力"

#: manual/performance_audit.md:160
msgid "[external baseline](performance/bench/external.md): slower in all 59 measured cells on native"
msgstr "[外部基线](performance/bench/external.md)：在 native 上全部 59 个测量单元格中都更慢"

