msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:381
msgid "**`x - x` is not zero.** Interval arithmetic treats the two operands as independent unknowns, so $[1, 2] - [1, 2] = [-1, 1]$. The same holds for `x * x`, which is wider than `x.sqr()` when `x` contains zero:"
msgstr "**`x - x` 不是零。** 区间算术把两个操作数视为相互独立的未知量，因此 $[1, 2] - [1, 2] = [-1, 1]$。`x * x` 同理：当 `x` 包含零时，它比 `x.sqr()` 更宽："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:399
msgid "Rewrite expressions so that each uncertain quantity appears once, and prefer `sqr`, `pown` and the elementary functions over hand-written products."
msgstr "改写表达式，使每个不确定量只出现一次；并优先使用 `sqr`、`pown` 和初等函数，而不是手写乘积。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:402
msgid "**`==` compares sets, not representations.** `a == b` is true when the two intervals are the same set, whatever their precision tags (IEEE 1788-2015 `equal`); use `a.identical(b)` when the precision tag matters too. On decorated intervals `==` is false for NaI, even against itself."
msgstr "**`==` 比较的是集合，而不是表示。** 当两个区间是同一个集合时 `a == b` 为真，与它们的精度标记无关（IEEE 1788-2015 的 `equal`）；当精度标记也重要时，请使用 `a.identical(b)`。在带装饰的区间上，`==` 对 NaI 为假，即使与它自己比较也是如此。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:407
msgid "**`is_member` takes a point.** The method `BallFloat::is_member` tests a `BinFloat` point. Set inclusion is `subset` (or the trait method `@lf_arith.Contains::contains`, which means \"contains as a subset\")."
msgstr "**`is_member` 接收的是点。** 方法 `BallFloat::is_member` 检验一个 `BinFloat` 点。集合包含用 `subset`（或 trait 方法 `@lf_arith.Contains::contains`，其含义是“作为子集包含”）。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:411
msgid "**Intervals are not ordered.** There is no total order on intervals; never sort them with `less` (an IEEE 1788 set relation) as if it were a comparison of numbers."
msgstr "**区间之间没有序。** 区间上不存在全序；切勿用 `less`（一种 IEEE 1788 集合关系）对区间排序，把它当作数的比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:415
msgid "**Unbounded and empty intervals have no useful center.** `midpoint()`, `radius()`, `width()`, `magnitude()` and `mignitude()` are total and follow IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8 instead of aborting: NaN for the empty set, `midpoint()` 0 for the whole line and the largest finite value (with the sign of the unbounded side) for a half-bounded interval, `radius()` and `width()` $+\\infty$ for any unbounded interval. Test `is_empty()` and `is_common_interval()` first when a NaN or an infinity would be a problem; `midpoint_ctx` takes the result format as a `BallContext`."
msgstr "**无界区间和空区间没有有用的中心。** `midpoint()`、`radius()`、`width()`、`magnitude()` 和 `mignitude()` 都是全函数，按 IEEE 1788-2015 12.12.8 给出结果而不会中止：空集为 NaN，整条实轴的 `midpoint()` 为 0，半无界区间为最大有限值（符号与无界的一侧相同），任何无界区间的 `radius()` 和 `width()` 为 $+\\infty$。当 NaN 或无穷会带来问题时，请先检查 `is_empty()` 和 `is_common_interval()`；`midpoint_ctx` 以 `BallContext` 作为结果格式。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:424
msgid "**Integers wider than the precision.** `from_int(n, precision=p)` and `from_coefficient` enclose `n` exactly, but when `n` needs more than $p$ bits the result is the two-point interval of its $p$-bit neighbours, not a point. At the default of 53 bits every `Int32` is a point, but a `BinCoeff` wider than 53 bits, or an explicit small precision, is not: pass a precision at least as large as the bit length of the integer."
msgstr "**比精度更宽的整数。** `from_int(n, precision=p)` 和 `from_coefficient` 能精确地包络 `n`，但当 `n` 需要多于 $p$ 位时，结果是由它的两个 $p$ 位相邻值构成的区间，而不是一个点。在默认的 53 位下每个 `Int32` 都是一个点，但宽于 53 位的 `BinCoeff` 或显式指定的较小精度则不是：请传入不小于该整数位长的精度。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float.md:431
msgid "**Inputs from `Double`.** `from_double(x)` encloses the binary value of `x` exactly; it cannot know which decimal number `x` approximated. Enclose decimal data as in [Enclose a decimal constant](#enclose-a-decimal-constant)."
msgstr "**来自 `Double` 的输入。** `from_double(x)` 精确包络 `x` 的二进制值；它无从知道 `x` 近似的是哪个十进制数。请按[包络十进制常数](#enclose-a-decimal-constant)中的方法包络十进制数据。"

