msgid "meaning: for dataset 2 of `bin-float/mul`, the median paired difference between the `core/bin-float` path and the coefficient kernel is `core_pct` percent of the kernel's median per-call time (negative when the core is faster), and `full_pct` is the same for the checked path against the core."
msgstr "含义是：对于 `bin-float/mul` 的数据集 2，`core/bin-float` 路径与系数内核之间配对差值的中位数，等于内核每次调用中位耗时的 `core_pct` 百分比（core 更快时为负）；`full_pct` 同理，是 checked 路径相对 core 路径的值。"

