#: manual/tutorial/bench/bin_float.md:37
msgid "The analysis file contains `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` for arithmetic, `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…` for elementary functions. A `core_pct` value is the median paired difference between the core path and the kernel, in percent of the kernel's median time; `full_pct` is the same for the checked path against the core path. Positive values mean the higher layer is slower."
msgstr "分析文件包含：算术的 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…`，以及初等函数的 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…`。`core_pct` 值是核心路径相对内核的配对差中位数，以内核中位时间的百分比表示；`full_pct` 是带检查路径相对核心路径的同类差值。正值表示更高的层更慢。"

