#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:1
msgid "bench/decimal tutorial"
msgstr "bench/decimal 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:3
msgid "This page shows how to run the IEEE decimal arithmetic benchmarks and how to read their output. The suite compares implementation paths on identical inputs with paired measurements; see the [bench tutorial](../bench.md) for the toolkit and the artifact format."
msgstr "本页介绍如何运行 IEEE 十进制算术基准测试，并说明如何解读其输出。该套件在相同输入上以配对测量比较不同的实现路径；工具集与产物格式见 [bench 教程](../bench.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:26
msgid "The runner executes the skipped performance tests of `tooling/src/bench/decimal` on the native target in release mode and writes `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl` (all observations) and `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt` (the reduced lines), where `SUITE` is the name given to `just bench`."
msgstr "运行器在 native 目标上以 release 模式执行 `tooling/src/bench/decimal` 中被跳过的性能测试，并写出 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl`（全部观测值）和 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt`（归约后的行），其中 `SUITE` 是传给 `just bench` 的名称。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:35
msgid "The analysis file contains `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…`. A `core_pct` value is the median paired difference between the core path and the kernel, in percent of the kernel's median time; `full_pct` is the same for the checked path against the core path. Positive values mean the higher layer is slower."
msgstr "分析文件包含 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` 行。`core_pct` 值是 core 路径与内核之间配对差值的中位数，以内核中位耗时的百分比表示；`full_pct` 同理，是 checked 路径相对 core 路径的差值。正值表示较高层更慢。"

