msgstr "[bin_float API](../api/bin_float.md)：每个条目及其特殊值。"

#: manual/tutorial/bin_float.md:428
msgid "[bin_float conformance](../conformance/bin_float.md): the TestFloat and MPFR evidence."
msgstr "[bin_float 符合性](../conformance/bin_float.md)：TestFloat 与 MPFR 证据。"

