msgstr "对于完整语料，让 `tools/conformance.py` 来构建可执行文件、获取固定版本的数据、规划各阶段并行运行各分片："

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:66
msgid "Read the exit code"
msgstr "解读退出码"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:68
msgid "`0` means success, `1` means failing cases (for `itl` also diagnostic cases; in strict mode also unsupported cases), `2` means a usage, file or parse error. Scripts should check the code and, with `--json`, parse the single JSON object on standard output."
msgstr "`0` 表示成功，`1` 表示有失败的用例（对 `itl` 还包括诊断用例；在严格模式下还包括不支持的用例），`2` 表示用法、文件或解析错误。脚本应检查退出码；使用 `--json` 时，再解析标准输出上的那一个 JSON 对象。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:75
msgid "Each runner has its own options; see the tutorials for [gda_expr_cli](cli/gda_expr_cli.md), [itl_expr_cli](cli/itl_expr_cli.md), [mpfr_expr_cli](cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and [testfloat_expr_cli](cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "每个运行器都有各自的选项；参见 [gda_expr_cli](cli/gda_expr_cli.md)、[itl_expr_cli](cli/itl_expr_cli.md)、[mpfr_expr_cli](cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) 和 [testfloat_expr_cli](cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md) 的教程。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:79
msgid "To execute corpora in MoonBit code without a process, call the frontends directly, for example [gda_expr](frontend/gda_expr.md)."
msgstr "若要在 MoonBit 代码中执行语料而不启动进程，可直接调用前端，例如 [gda_expr](frontend/gda_expr.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:84
msgid "**`--help` is the dispatcher's.** `--backend gda --help` prints the dispatcher usage and exits with `0`; it does not show the runner's options."
msgstr "**`--help` 属于分发器。** `--backend gda --help` 打印分发器的用法并以 `0` 退出；它不会显示运行器的选项。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:86
msgid "**Relative default paths.** Runners default to files under `testdata/`; run them from the repository root."
msgstr "**默认路径是相对路径。** 运行器默认读取 `testdata/` 下的文件；请在仓库根目录下运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:88
msgid "**One backend per invocation.** `--backend` may be given only once."
