msgid "The package ships inside the tools module `Luna-Flow/floating-tools` (directory `tooling/` of the repository); there is nothing to install. Run its tests from the repository:"
msgstr "该包随工具模块 `Luna-Flow/floating-tools`（仓库中的 `tooling/` 目录）一起提供，无需安装。从仓库运行其测试："

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:24
msgid "Call the dispatcher with the program name first, as in `@env.args()`:"
msgstr "先传入程序名，与 `@env.args()` 相同，然后调用调度器："

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:33
msgid "`dispatch` prints a message and returns the exit code; it never exits the process."
msgstr "`dispatch` 打印消息并返回退出码；它从不退出进程。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:38
msgid "Choose the exit code you expect"
msgstr "确定期望的退出码"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:40
msgid "`0` after `--help` (even after a valid `--backend`), `2` for a missing, repeated, empty or unknown backend, and otherwise the runner's own code:"
msgstr "`--help` 之后为 `0`（即使在有效的 `--backend` 之后），`--backend` 缺失、重复、为空或未知时为 `2`，其余情况为运行器自己的退出码："

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:53
msgid "Forward arguments to a runner"
msgstr "把参数转发给运行器"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:55
msgid "Everything except `--backend` and its value is forwarded, in order, with the program name first, so a runner sees the same vector as when it is called directly (see [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](gda_expr_cli.md) for the options of one runner)."
msgstr "除 `--backend` 及其值以外的所有参数都会按顺序转发，程序名在最前，因此运行器看到的向量与直接调用时相同（单个运行器的选项见 [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](gda_expr_cli.md)）。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:62
msgid "To add a backend, write a runner package `run(arguments) -> Int`, import it in `moon.pkg` of this package and add one arm to the `match backend` of `dispatch`; keep process exit in `cli`, which stays an entry point only."
msgstr "要添加后端，请编写一个运行器包 `run(arguments) -> Int`，在本包的 `moon.pkg` 中导入它，并在 `dispatch` 的 `match backend` 中增加一个分支；进程退出仍放在 `cli` 中，它只保持为入口。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:68
msgid "**Index 0 is skipped.** Pass a program name even when a test has none."
msgstr "**下标 0 会被跳过。** 即使测试里没有程序名，也要传一个。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:69
msgid "**`--help` wins.** `[\"cli\", \"--backend\", \"gda\", \"--help\"]` prints the usage line and returns `0` without running a runner."
msgstr "**`--help` 优先。** `[\"cli\", \"--backend\", \"gda\", \"--help\"]` 会打印用法行并返回 `0`，不运行任何运行器。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:71
msgid "**Relative paths.** The runners read their default corpora relative to the working directory; the tests of the module run in `tooling/`."
msgstr "**相对路径。** 运行器相对于工作目录读取其默认语料；该模块的测试在 `tooling/` 中运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:76
msgid "[cli/dispatch API](../../api/cli/dispatch.md) for the exact contract."
msgstr "[cli/dispatch API](../../api/cli/dispatch.md)给出准确的约定。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/dispatch.md:77
msgid "[cli/dispatch design](../../design/cli/dispatch.md) for why it is a library."
msgstr "[cli/dispatch 设计](../../design/cli/dispatch.md)说明它为什么是一个库。"

