msgstr "[frontend/testfloat_expr 教程](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md)：通过规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency tutorial"
msgstr "consistency 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to run the cross-package consistency tests and how to add a new law when a change touches more than one numeric package."
msgstr "本页的目标是向维护者展示如何运行跨包一致性测试，以及当某项改动涉及多个数值包时如何添加新的定律。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:9
msgid "run the whole suite"
msgstr "运行整个套件"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:9
msgid "[the quick start command](#quick-start)"
msgstr "[快速开始中的命令](#quick-start)"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:10
msgid "run one test"
msgstr "运行单个测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:11
msgid "add a law that spans packages"
msgstr "添加跨包的定律"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:11
msgid "[a white-box test](#add-a-cross-package-law)"
msgstr "[白盒测试](#add-a-cross-package-law)"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:12
msgid "decide whether a test belongs here"
msgstr "判断某个测试是否应放在这里"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:12
msgid "[the placement rule](#decide-where-a-test-belongs)"
msgstr "[放置规则](#decide-where-a-test-belongs)"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:16
msgid "There is nothing to install or import: the package is part of the repository's test suite. Run it from the repository root (the wrapper keeps the build directory clean):"
msgstr "无需安装或导入任何东西：该包是仓库测试套件的一部分。在仓库根目录下运行它（包装脚本会保持构建目录整洁）："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:24
msgid "A passing run ends with `passed: N, failed: 0`. The suite is also part of `just pr`, which runs every native test of the module."
msgstr "通过的运行以 `passed: N, failed: 0` 结尾。该套件也是 `just pr` 的一部分，后者会运行模块的所有 native 测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:29
msgid "Run one test"
msgstr "运行单个测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:36
msgid "Add a cross-package law"
msgstr "添加跨包定律"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:38
msgid "Write a white-box test in `core_wbtest.mbt` (arithmetic laws) or `api_audit_wbtest.mbt` (observable API behaviour). State the law against an exact oracle whenever possible:"
msgstr "在 `core_wbtest.mbt`（算术定律）或 `api_audit_wbtest.mbt`（可观察的 API 行为）中编写白盒测试。尽可能以精确预言（oracle）来表述定律："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:55
msgid "Use official decTest rows as fixed witnesses when you test GDA cohort or flag rules, and quote the row id in the test name."
msgstr "测试 GDA 同值类（cohort）或标志规则时，使用官方 decTest 行作为固定的见证，并在测试名中注明该行的 id。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:58
msgid "Decide where a test belongs"
msgstr "确定测试的归属"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:60
msgid "A law about one package goes into that package's own tests. A test belongs here when it needs two or more packages, or `internal` helpers from outside their package, or an oracle such as `semantic` exact rationals."
msgstr "只涉及单个包的定律放在该包自己的测试中。当测试需要两个或更多包、需要在 `internal` 辅助函数所属包之外使用它们，或者需要诸如 `semantic` 精确有理数这样的预言时，才应放在这里。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:66
msgid "The conformance corpora ([verification](../verification.md)) check each core against external references; this suite checks the cores against each other and against exact arithmetic."
msgstr "符合性语料（[验证](../verification.md)）将每个核心与外部参考进行比对；本套件则将各核心相互比对，并与精确算术比对。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:69
msgid "[internal tutorial](internal.md) shows the helpers several tests exercise."
msgstr "[internal 教程](internal.md) 展示了若干测试所用到的辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:73
msgid "**Run from a workspace.** The package imports sibling Luna-Flow modules; use the repository wrapper or a workspace that resolves them."
msgstr "**在工作区中运行。** 该包导入了同级的 Luna-Flow 模块；请使用仓库的包装脚本，或使用能解析这些模块的工作区。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:75
msgid "**Keep tests deterministic.** Use fixed seeds and explicit contexts; no test may depend on timing or the target's `Double` formatting."
msgstr "**保持测试确定性。** 使用固定的随机种子和显式的上下文；任何测试都不得依赖计时或目标平台的 `Double` 格式化方式。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:80
msgid "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md) for the file layout."
msgstr "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md)：文件布局。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:81
msgid "[consistency design](../design/consistency.md) for what the suite proves."
msgstr "[consistency 设计](../design/consistency.md)：该套件所证明的内容。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:1
msgid "decimal tutorial"
msgstr "decimal 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to compute with decimal numbers that behave the way people write them: `0.1 + 0.2` is exactly `0.3`, `12.30` remembers that it has two decimal places, and every rounding is chosen by you and reported back to you. You will parse and format values, compute under a context and read its flags, round money with `quantize_ctx`, exchange decimal64 bits, and call certified elementary functions. The mathematics behind each step is in the [decimal design](../design/decimal.md); every function is specified in the [decimal API](../api/decimal.md)."
msgstr "本教程展示如何使用行为与人们书写方式一致的十进制数进行计算：`0.1 + 0.2` 恰好等于 `0.3`，`12.30` 记得自己有两位小数，每一次舍入都由你选择并向你报告。你将解析和格式化值，在上下文下计算并读取其标志，用 `quantize_ctx` 对金额舍入，交换 decimal64 位模式，并调用经过认证的初等函数。每一步背后的数学见 [decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)；每个函数都在 [decimal API](../api/decimal.md) 中有规定。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:14
msgid "parse an amount and keep its decimal places"
msgstr "解析金额并保留其小数位数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:15
msgid "compute with a fixed precision and see what was rounded"
msgstr "以固定精度计算并查看哪些被舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:15
msgid "[`*_ctx` operations and `DecimalFlags`](#compute-under-a-context-and-keep-the-flags)"
msgstr "[`*_ctx` 运算与 `DecimalFlags`](#compute-under-a-context-and-keep-the-flags)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:16
msgid "round money to cents, half-even or half-up"
msgstr "把金额舍入到分，采用 half-even 或 half-up"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:17
msgid "get a guaranteed lower and upper bound"
msgstr "获得有保证的下界和上界"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:17
msgid "[directed rounding](#bound-a-result-from-both-sides)"
msgstr "[定向舍入](#bound-a-result-from-both-sides)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:18
msgid "read or write decimal64 bits (DPD or BID)"
msgstr "读写 decimal64 位模式（DPD 或 BID）"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:19
msgid "take a logarithm or an exponential"
msgstr "求对数或指数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:20
msgid "run generic `Ring` code on decimals"
msgstr "在十进制数上运行泛型 `Ring` 代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:20
msgid "[the algebra traits](#generic-code-over-the-algebra-traits)"
msgstr "[代数 trait](#generic-code-over-the-algebra-traits)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:21
msgid "sort stored values deterministically"
msgstr "确定性地对存储的值排序"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:22
msgid "accumulate flags over a long pipeline"
msgstr "在长流水线中累积标志"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:26
#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:27
msgid "Add `floating` to your module:"
msgstr "把 `floating` 加入你的模块："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:32
msgid "and import the package in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:40
msgid "The smallest useful program adds two decimal fractions that a `Double` cannot represent:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序把两个 `Double` 无法表示的十进制小数相加："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:53
msgid "`0.1` is $1/10$, and no power of two is divisible by 5, so binary floating point can only approximate it; decimal floating point stores it exactly."
msgstr "`0.1` 是 $1/10$，而 2 的幂都不能被 5 整除，因此二进制浮点只能近似它；十进制浮点则能精确存储它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:58
msgid "Parse amounts and keep their scale"
msgstr "解析金额并保留其小数位数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:60
msgid "Parsing keeps the exponent of the text. Two values can be equal and still carry different information:"
msgstr "解析会保留文本中的指数。两个值可以相等却携带不同的信息："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:76
msgid "`12.30` and `12.3` are two members of the same *cohort*: numerically equal, written with different exponents. `normalized()` picks the shortest member. Do not call it on amounts whose number of decimal places matters; call it when you want a canonical key."
msgstr "`12.30` 和 `12.3` 是同一个*同值类*（cohort）的两个成员：数值相等，但以不同的指数书写。`normalized()` 选取最短的成员。不要对小数位数有意义的金额调用它；需要规范键时才调用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:81
msgid "Integers are built reduced: `Decimal::from_int(1000)` is stored as $1 \\times 10^{3}$ and prints as `1E+3`. Parse `\"1000\"` when you want the four digits."
msgstr "整数以约简形式构造：`Decimal::from_int(1000)` 存储为 $1 \\times 10^{3}$，打印为 `1E+3`。需要四位数字时请解析 `\"1000\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:84
msgid "Compute under a context and keep the flags"
msgstr "在上下文下计算并保留标志"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:86
msgid "A `DecimalContext` fixes the precision, rounding mode and exponent range. Each `*_ctx` operation returns the result and the flags it raised. Combine the flags as you go:"
msgstr "`DecimalContext` 确定精度、舍入模式和指数范围。每个 `*_ctx` 运算都返回结果及其引发的标志。边计算边合并标志："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:105
msgid "`inexact` tells you that $100/3 \\cdot 3$ was not computed exactly; it is not an error, so `has_error()` stays false. `has_error()` reports invalid operations, unparsable text, division by zero, impossible divisions and invalid contexts. Check the individual flags (`overflow`, `underflow`, `inexact`) when your application cares about them."
msgstr "`inexact` 告诉你 $100/3 \\cdot 3$ 没有被精确计算；它不是错误，因此 `has_error()` 仍为 false。`has_error()` 报告无效运算、无法解析的文本、除以零、不可能的除法和无效上下文。当你的应用关心 `overflow`、`underflow`、`inexact` 这些标志时，请逐个检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:112
msgid "Round money with `quantize_ctx`"
msgstr "用 `quantize_ctx` 对金额舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:114
msgid "`quantize_ctx` gives a value the exponent of a template value. Choose the rounding mode in the context; commercial rounding is `RoundTiesToAway`:"
msgstr "`quantize_ctx` 让一个值取得模板值的指数。在上下文中选择舍入模式；商业舍入是 `RoundTiesToAway`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:134
msgid "Half-even (\"banker's\") rounding sends the tie `2.345` to the even last digit `4`; half-up sends it away from zero. `quantize_ctx` never silently picks another exponent: if the result would need more digits than the precision, you get NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "半偶（“银行家”）舍入把平局 `2.345` 送到末位为偶数的 `4`；半上舍入则把它送向远离零的方向。`quantize_ctx` 从不悄悄选择另一个指数：如果结果所需的位数超过精度，你会得到带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:139
msgid "Convert to an integer"
msgstr "转换为整数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:141
msgid "`to_int_ctx`, `to_int64_ctx`, `to_uint_ctx` and `to_uint64_ctx` round to a fixed-width integer in the context's direction and return `None` with `invalid_operation` for a NaN, an infinity or a value out of range. Pass `exact=true` to get `inexact` when rounding changed the value:"
msgstr "`to_int_ctx`、`to_int64_ctx`、`to_uint_ctx` 和 `to_uint64_ctx` 按上下文的方向舍入为定宽整数，对 NaN、无穷或超出范围的值返回 `None` 并带 `invalid_operation`。传入 `exact=true`，舍入改变了值时就会得到 `inexact`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:164
msgid "Convert between formats"
msgstr "在格式之间转换"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:166
msgid "`convert_format` moves a value to another decimal interchange format and `to_bin_float_ctx` and `from_bin_float_ctx` cross to and from the binary formats, all with the flags of the rounding:"
msgstr "`convert_format` 把值移到另一个十进制交换格式，`to_bin_float_ctx` 和 `from_bin_float_ctx` 则跨到二进制格式以及从二进制格式回来，都带有舍入的标志："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:188
msgid "Bound a result from both sides"
msgstr "从两侧界定结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:190
msgid "Directed rounding gives guaranteed bounds. Rounding the same quotient toward $-\\infty$ and toward $+\\infty$ brackets the exact value:"
msgstr "定向舍入给出有保证的界。把同一个商分别向 $-\\infty$ 和向 $+\\infty$ 舍入，即可夹住精确值："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:206
msgid "The two results are adjacent decimal32 values, and $1/7$ lies strictly between them."
msgstr "两个结果是相邻的 decimal32 值，$1/7$ 严格位于它们之间。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:209
msgid "Exchange decimal64 bits"
msgstr "交换 decimal64 位模式"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:211
msgid "Interchange formats are what databases, files and other languages exchange. Encode in the encoding your peer expects, and decode with the same one:"
msgstr "交换格式是数据库、文件和其他语言之间交换数据所用的格式。请用对方期望的编码进行编码，并用同一编码解码："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:232
msgid "Both encodings keep the exponent, so `19.99` comes back with two decimal places. Bits you did not produce yourself may be non-canonical; keep them in a `DecimalInterchange` and call `canonical()` before comparing bit patterns."
msgstr "两种编码都保留指数，因此 `19.99` 读回时仍有两位小数。不是你自己产生的位模式可能是非规范的；把它们保存在 `DecimalInterchange` 中，并在比较位模式之前调用 `canonical()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:236
msgid "Call an elementary function"
msgstr "调用初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:238
msgid "Logarithms, exponentials, powers and trigonometric functions are certified: the result is the correctly rounded value in every rounding mode, or an explicit failure. They need a context with a bounded exponent range, such as a format preset:"
msgstr "对数、指数、幂和三角函数都经过认证：结果在每种舍入模式下都是正确舍入的值，或者是一个明确的失败。它们需要一个指数范围有界的上下文，例如某个格式预设："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:259
msgid "`try_ln_ctx` returns `Err` only if the result could not be certified within the refinement limit of the context (twelve steps by default; `ctx.with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` allows more and `ctx.with_refinement_limit(None)` removes the count limit, at the cost of a longer evaluation for a hard-to-round input); `ln_ctx` turns that case into NaN with `invalid_operation`. Exact results such as $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$ come back without `inexact`."
msgstr "`try_ln_ctx` 只在结果无法在上下文的细化限制内认证时返回 `Err`（默认十二步；`ctx.with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` 允许更多步，`ctx.with_refinement_limit(None)` 取消步数限制，代价是难舍入输入的求值更久）；`ln_ctx` 把这种情形变为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。$\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$ 这类精确结果返回时不带 `inexact`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:267
msgid "For a small rate or a small exponent, use the functions that keep the part near zero instead of computing `exp2(x) - 1` or `log2(1 + x)`: those lose the digits of $x$ when $1 + x$ is rounded. `exp2m1_ctx`, `exp10m1_ctx`, `log2p1_ctx` and `log10p1_ctx` compute $2^x - 1$, $10^x - 1$, $\\log_2(1 + x)$ and $\\log_{10}(1 + x)$ from $x$ itself:"
msgstr "对于很小的增长率或很小的指数，请使用保留零附近部分的函数，而不要计算 `exp2(x) - 1` 或 `log2(1 + x)`：后者在舍入 $1 + x$ 时会丢失 $x$ 的数字。`exp2m1_ctx`、`exp10m1_ctx`、`log2p1_ctx` 与 `log10p1_ctx` 直接由 $x$ 计算 $2^x - 1$、$10^x - 1$、$\\log_2(1 + x)$ 与 $\\log_{10}(1 + x)$："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:286
msgid "Compound interest is `compound_ctx`: $(1 + r)^n$ for an integer number of periods, computed from the rate itself, exact when the power is a short decimal and keeping the scale of the rate:"
msgstr "复利就是 `compound_ctx`：对整数个期数计算 $(1 + r)^n$，直接由利率本身计算；当幂是较短的十进制数时结果精确，并保持利率的小数位："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:301
msgid "Angles measured in half-revolutions avoid the rounded value of $\\pi$: `atan2pi_ctx` gives the direction of a point as a fraction of a half turn, and the quarter turns are exact."
msgstr "以半圈为单位度量角度可以避开舍入后的 $\\pi$ 值：`atan2pi_ctx` 把一个点的方向表示为半圈的几分之几，四分之一圈是精确的。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:319
msgid "Generic code over the algebra traits"
msgstr "基于代数 trait 的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:321
msgid "`Decimal` implements `Ring` from [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) through its plain operators, so generic code runs on it unchanged:"
msgstr "`Decimal` 通过其普通运算符实现了 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 的 `Ring`，因此泛型代码无需修改即可在其上运行："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:341
msgid "The plain operators have no context argument: each is the matching `*_ctx` operation in a private context of the larger operand precision (34 digits by default), round half even, with the storage range of a value, and returns the cohort member IEEE 754-2019 asks for (`1.20 + 3.40` is `4.60`). Code that needs a precision, an exponent range or flags should take a `DecimalContext` and call the `*_ctx` operations."
msgstr "普通运算符没有上下文参数：每个运算符都是对应的 `*_ctx` 运算在一个私有上下文（取较大的操作数精度，默认 34 位）中的结果，半值取偶舍入，采用值的存储范围，并返回 IEEE 754-2019 所要求的同值类成员（`1.20 + 3.40` 是 `4.60`）。需要精度、指数范围或标志的代码应接收一个 `DecimalContext` 并调用 `*_ctx` 运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:348
msgid "The shared contextual traits"
msgstr "共享的 contextual trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:350
msgid "Code written against [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) uses `ArithmeticContext` and gets an `ArithmeticOutcome` with diagnostics:"
msgstr "针对 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 编写的代码使用 `ArithmeticContext`，并得到带诊断信息的 `ArithmeticOutcome`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:369
msgid "Errors (`invalid_operation`, `division_by_zero`, …) become `Err`; inexactness and range events become diagnostics."
msgstr "错误（`invalid_operation`、`division_by_zero`……）变为 `Err`；不精确和范围事件变为诊断信息。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:372
msgid "Pipelines, GDA status and intervals"
msgstr "流水线、GDA 状态与区间"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:374
msgid "[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) wraps a value, its context and its accumulated flags, so a long pipeline does not need explicit `combine` calls."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) 包装一个值、它的上下文及其累积的标志，因此长流水线无需显式调用 `combine`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:377
msgid "[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) implements the General Decimal Arithmetic model with sticky status and traps. Its values are a separate type; use it when you need `.decTest` behaviour, not IEEE per-operation flags."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 实现了带粘滞状态和陷阱的通用十进制算术模型。它的值是一个独立的类型；当你需要 `.decTest` 的行为而不是 IEEE 的逐运算标志时，请使用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:380
msgid "To enclose a decimal value in a binary interval, convert it twice with `to_bin_float(precision=p, mode=RoundTowardNegative)` and `to_bin_float(precision=p, mode=RoundTowardPositive)` and build a [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) ball from both bounds."
msgstr "要把十进制值包络在二进制区间中，可分别用 `to_bin_float(precision=p, mode=RoundTowardNegative)` 和 `to_bin_float(precision=p, mode=RoundTowardPositive)` 转换两次，再以这两个界构造一个 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 球。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:384
msgid "A deterministic order for storage"
msgstr "用于存储的确定性顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:386
msgid "`total_order_compare` orders every representation, including cohorts, signed zeros and NaNs, so it is the right key for sorting stored values or deduplicating bit-exact records:"
msgstr "`total_order_compare` 对每种表示（包括同值类、带符号零和 NaN）都给出顺序，因此它是对存储值排序或对逐位相同的记录去重的合适键："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:402
msgid "**Elementary functions need an exponent range within 999,999.** `DecimalContext::new()` is the format $(34,\\ 999\\,999)$, which they accept; a context with `e_max` above 999,999, or a precision of 1000 digits or more with the default range, makes them return NaN with `not_computed` (not `invalid_operation`, which is for results IEEE 754 defines as invalid). Use `decimal32()`/`decimal64()`/`decimal128()` or pass `e_max` up to 999,999."
msgstr "**初等函数需要不超过 999,999 的指数范围。** `DecimalContext::new()` 是格式 $(34,\\ 999\\,999)$，初等函数接受它；`e_max` 超过 999,999 的上下文，或精度为 1000 位及以上且使用默认范围的上下文，会使它们返回带 `not_computed` 的 NaN（不是 `invalid_operation`，后者用于 IEEE 754 定义为无效的结果）。请使用 `decimal32()`/`decimal64()`/`decimal128()`，或传入不超过 999,999 的 `e_max`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:407
msgid "**Operators are not context operations.** They round half-even to the larger operand precision and apply only the storage range of a value, so a result beyond it is an infinity or a zero. Use `mul_ctx` and `div_ctx` when the result must be bounded by a format, rounded in another mode, or reported through flags."
msgstr "**运算符不是上下文运算。** 它们按半值取偶舍入到较大的操作数精度，且只应用值的存储范围，因此超出该范围的结果是无穷或零。当结果必须受某个格式约束、以其他模式舍入或通过标志报告时，请使用 `mul_ctx` 和 `div_ctx`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:412
msgid "**`==` is not IEEE equality.** `Eq` and `compare` treat every NaN as equal to every NaN and greater than every number, so sorting works. Use `compare_checked` or `is_nan` when a NaN must be unordered."
msgstr "**`==` 不是 IEEE 相等。** `Eq` 和 `compare` 把每个 NaN 视为与每个 NaN 相等且大于每个数，这样排序才能正常工作。当 NaN 必须无序时，请使用 `compare_checked` 或 `is_nan`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:415
msgid "**`has_error()` is narrow.** It ignores `inexact`, `overflow` and `underflow`. Check those flags yourself when they matter, for example `overflow` after a long product."
msgstr "**`has_error()` 的范围很窄。** 它忽略 `inexact`、`overflow` 和 `underflow`。当这些标志重要时，请自行检查，例如在长乘积之后检查 `overflow`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:418
msgid "**The checked powers convert the exponent at context precision.** `pow_int_checked` and `pow_nat_checked` turn the integer exponent into a `Decimal` with the context precision, so an exponent with more digits than the precision is rounded before the power is taken. Keep $|n| < 10^{p}$ or call `pown_ctx`, which converts the exponent exactly."
msgstr "**checked 幂运算按上下文精度转换指数。** `pow_int_checked` 和 `pow_nat_checked` 会把整数指数转换为具有上下文精度的 `Decimal`，因此位数超过精度的指数会在求幂之前被舍入。请保持 $|n| < 10^{p}$，或调用会精确转换指数的 `pown_ctx`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:423
msgid "**A context has the five rounding-direction attributes of IEEE 754-2019 §4.3 and no more.** `HalfDown`, `Up` and `ZeroFiveUp` of GDA are in `decimal_gda` only; commercial rounding is `RoundTiesToAway`."
msgstr "**上下文拥有 IEEE 754-2019 §4.3 的五种舍入方向属性，仅此而已。** GDA 的 `HalfDown`、`Up` 和 `ZeroFiveUp` 只在 `decimal_gda` 中；商业舍入是 `RoundTiesToAway`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:426
msgid "**Binary conversions lose decimal meaning.** `from_double(0.1)` is the exact binary value `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827` (rounded to 34 digits), not `0.1`; parse text instead."
msgstr "**二进制转换会丢失十进制含义。** `from_double(0.1)` 是精确的二进制值 `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`（舍入到 34 位），而不是 `0.1`；请改为解析文本。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:432
msgid "[decimal API](../api/decimal.md): every type and function with its exact semantics."
msgstr "[decimal API](../api/decimal.md)：每个类型和函数及其精确语义。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:434
msgid "[decimal design](../design/decimal.md): formats, cohorts, encodings, rounding, error bounds and certification."
msgstr "[decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)：格式、同值类、编码、舍入、误差界与认证。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:436
msgid "[decimal conformance](../conformance/decimal.md) and [decimal performance](../performance/decimal.md): the finite evidence and the measurement method."
msgstr "[decimal 符合性](../conformance/decimal.md)和 [decimal 性能](../performance/decimal.md)：有限的证据与测量方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:439
msgid "[`decimal_checked` tutorial](decimal_checked.md) and [`decimal_gda` tutorial](decimal_gda.md) for pipelines and GDA status."
msgstr "关于流水线与 GDA 状态，见 [`decimal_checked` 教程](decimal_checked.md)和 [`decimal_gda` 教程](decimal_gda.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_checked tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to run an IEEE decimal calculation as one pipeline that remembers every exceptional condition: you fix a `DecimalContext`, start a `DecimalChecked` from a string or number, apply operations, and at the end read the value together with the union of all flags raised on the way. The typical use is an auditable calculation (money, measurements) where \"was anything rounded?\" or \"did anything overflow?\" must be answered for the whole computation, not for the last step. Arithmetic comes from [`decimal`](decimal.md); the [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md) gives the algebra of flag accumulation; the [API reference](../api/decimal_checked.md) lists every method."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把一次 IEEE 十进制计算作为一条记住每个异常情形的流水线来运行：你确定一个 `DecimalContext`，从字符串或数开始一个 `DecimalChecked`，依次应用运算，最后读取值以及途中引发的所有标志的并集。典型用途是可审计的计算（金额、测量值），其中“是否有任何舍入？”或“是否有任何上溢？”必须针对整个计算而不是最后一步来回答。算术来自 [`decimal`](decimal.md)；[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md)给出了标志累积的代数；[API 参考](../api/decimal_checked.md)列出了所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:16
msgid "start a pipeline from text or a number"
msgstr "从文本或数值开始一条流水线"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:17
msgid "know whether any step rounded"
msgstr "知道是否有任何步骤发生了舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:18
msgid "see what only the last step did"
msgstr "只查看最后一步做了什么"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:19
msgid "continue after a division by zero"
msgstr "在除以零之后继续"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:19
msgid "[flagged values](#keep-going-after-a-division-by-zero)"
msgstr "[带标志的值](#keep-going-after-a-division-by-zero)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:20
msgid "start a new audit period"
msgstr "开始新的审计周期"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:21
msgid "call `ln`, `exp` or `pow` in a pipeline"
msgstr "在流水线中调用 `ln`、`exp` 或 `pow`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:21
msgid "[a bounded context](#elementary-functions-need-a-bounded-context)"
msgstr "[有界上下文](#elementary-functions-need-a-bounded-context)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:22
msgid "use an `ArithmeticContext`"
msgstr "使用 `ArithmeticContext`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:23
msgid "hand the result to the contextual traits"
msgstr "把结果交给上下文 trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:33
msgid "and import both packages in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:42
msgid "Divide 10 by 4 in decimal64 and check that the result is exact:"
msgstr "在 decimal64 下计算 10 除以 4，并检查结果是否精确："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:58
#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:60
msgid "The examples list flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例使用如下辅助函数列出标志："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:74
msgid "Audit a price calculation"
msgstr "审计价格计算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:76
msgid "Compute a price with tax, rounded to cents. `raised()` describes the last step and `flags()` the whole pipeline:"
msgstr "计算含税价格并舍入到分。`raised()` 描述最后一步，`flags()` 描述整条流水线："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:92
msgid "The multiplication is exact ($19.99 \\times 1.0825 = 21.639175$); only the quantization to cents rounds, and the pipeline records that."
msgstr "乘法是精确的（$19.99 \\times 1.0825 = 21.639175$）；只有量化到分时发生了舍入，流水线记录了这一点。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:95
msgid "Find out that an earlier step rounded"
msgstr "发现先前某一步发生了舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:97
msgid "Flags of earlier steps stay in `flags()` even when later steps are exact:"
msgstr "即使后续步骤是精确的，先前步骤的标志也会保留在 `flags()` 中："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:112
msgid "Keep going after a division by zero"
msgstr "除以零之后继续执行"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:114
msgid "IEEE decimal arithmetic defines a result for every operation. Dividing by zero gives an infinity and the `division_by_zero` flag; the pipeline continues and the flag is kept:"
msgstr "IEEE 十进制算术为每个运算都定义了结果。除以零得到无穷和 `division_by_zero` 标志；流水线继续执行，标志被保留："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:131
msgid "Decide at the end what the flags mean for your application, for example with `DecimalFlags::has_error`, which is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `not_computed` or `division_by_zero` is set."
msgstr "最后再决定这些标志对你的应用意味着什么，例如使用 `DecimalFlags::has_error`，只要 `invalid_operation`、`not_computed` 或 `division_by_zero` 中任一被设置，它就为真。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:135
msgid "Start a new audit period"
msgstr "开始新的审计周期"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:137
msgid "`clear_flags` resets both the raised and the accumulated flags without touching the value:"
msgstr "`clear_flags` 同时重置最近引发的标志和累积的标志，而不改动值："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:156
msgid "Multiplying the 16-digit quotient by `1E+1` is exact and its exponent fits, so the second phase reports no flags although the first one was inexact."
msgstr "把 16 位的商乘以 `1E+1` 是精确的，且其指数可容纳，因此尽管第一阶段不精确，第二阶段也不报告任何标志。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:161
msgid "Elementary functions need a bounded context"
msgstr "初等函数需要有界上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:163
msgid "Mathematical functions (`exp`, `ln`, `pow`, the trigonometric family, …) follow the General Decimal Arithmetic restriction to precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$. Use one of the interchange contexts or explicit bounds; with a range above 999,999 they return NaN with `invalid_operation`:"
msgstr "数学函数（`exp`、`ln`、`pow`、三角函数族……）遵循通用十进制算术的限制，精度和指数界须在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内。请使用某个交换格式上下文或显式的界；范围超过 999,999 时，它们会返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:186
msgid "Start from a Luna-Flow/arithmetic context"
msgstr "从 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 上下文开始"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:188
msgid "Code that is generic over Luna-Flow/arithmetic carries an `ArithmeticContext`. `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` maps its precision, rounding direction and exponent bounds (`clamp` is ignored: every IEEE format clamps); the predefined `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` maps to the same context as `DecimalContext::decimal64()`:"
msgstr "基于 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的泛型代码携带一个 `ArithmeticContext`。`DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 映射其精度、舍入方向和指数界（`clamp` 被忽略：每个 IEEE 格式都钳制）；预定义的 `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` 映射到与 `DecimalContext::decimal64()` 相同的上下文："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:207
msgid "Hand the result to the contextual traits"
msgstr "把结果交给 contextual trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:209
msgid "`result()` returns `Ok((value, flags))` or the recorded error. The `AddContextual`, `SqrtContextual`, … implementations of `Decimal` in Luna-Flow/arithmetic report diagnostics instead of flags; the shared conditions that `decimal` has (`inexact`, `overflow`, `underflow`) can be carried over field by field:"
msgstr "`result()` 返回 `Ok((value, flags))` 或记录下的错误。`Decimal` 在 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 中的 `AddContextual`、`SqrtContextual`……实现报告的是诊断信息而不是标志；`decimal` 具有的共享情形（`inexact`、`overflow`、`underflow`）可以逐字段转移过去："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:238
msgid "The [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md#from-flags-to-arithmetic-diagnostics) shows why converting the accumulated flags once gives the same diagnostics as combining the per-step diagnostics."
msgstr "[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md#from-flags-to-arithmetic-diagnostics)说明了为什么一次性转换累积的标志与合并逐步的诊断信息结果相同。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:244
msgid "**`raised()` is not the whole story.** It describes the latest step only; audit with `flags()`."
msgstr "**`raised()` 并不是全部。** 它只描述最近一步；审计请用 `flags()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:246
msgid "**Exceptional results are not errors.** NaN, infinities and rounded values are successes with flags. `is_err()` is true only for certification failures of elementary functions."
msgstr "**异常结果不是错误。** NaN、无穷和舍入后的值都是带标志的成功结果。`is_err()` 只在初等函数认证失败时为真。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:249
msgid "**Wide contexts disable the mathematical functions.** See above; this applies to an `e_max` above 999,999."
msgstr "**宽上下文会禁用数学函数。** 见上文；这适用于 `e_max` 超过 999,999 的情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:251
msgid "**Binary sources.** `from_double(0.1, …)` converts the binary value of `0.1` rounded to 17 digits, not one tenth and not the exact binary value (in decimal128 it is `0.10000000000000001`); parse the string `\"0.1\"` instead."
msgstr "**二进制来源。** `from_double(0.1, …)` 转换的是 `0.1` 的二进制值舍入到 17 位数字后的结果，既不是十分之一，也不是精确的二进制值（在 decimal128 中为 `0.10000000000000001`）；请改为解析字符串 `\"0.1\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:255
msgid "**`remainder` is the IEEE remainder.** It rounds the quotient to the nearest integer, so `1` remainder `0.6` is `-0.2`, not `0.4`."
msgstr "**`remainder` 是 IEEE 余数。** 它把商舍入到最近的整数，因此 `1` 对 `0.6` 取余的结果是 `-0.2`，而不是 `0.4`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:257
msgid "**Operands are plain `Decimal` values.** They are not rounded to the context before the operation; the operation rounds the result."
msgstr "**操作数是普通的 `Decimal` 值。** 它们在运算之前不会按上下文舍入；运算会对结果舍入。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:259
msgid "**`clear_flags` also works after an error,** but the error stays."
msgstr "**`clear_flags` 在出错之后也能使用，** 但错误仍然保留。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:263
msgid "[`decimal_checked` design](../design/decimal_checked.md): the state model, the flag monoid and the short-circuit rule."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked` 设计](../design/decimal_checked.md)：状态模型、标志幺半群与短路规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:265
msgid "[`decimal_checked` API](../api/decimal_checked.md): every method."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked` API](../api/decimal_checked.md)：所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:266
msgid "[`decimal` tutorial](decimal.md): contexts, rounding modes and interchange formats."
msgstr "[`decimal` 教程](decimal.md)：上下文、舍入模式与交换格式。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:268
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` tutorial](decimal_gda_checked.md): the same idea for General Decimal Arithmetic with sticky status and traps."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 教程](decimal_gda_checked.md)：同一思路在带粘滞状态和陷阱的通用十进制算术上的应用。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_gda 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:3
msgid "This tutorial teaches you to compute with `decimal_gda`, the package that implements Cowlishaw's General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA): decimal numbers that keep their trailing zeros, a context that fixes precision, rounding and exponent limits, sticky status that records what happened, and traps that stop a calculation while still handing you the defined result. By the end you can thread a context through a calculation, round money, handle traps, overflow and underflow, call the elementary functions and pick the right comparison. The mathematics behind each rule is on the [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md); every public name is on the [API page](../api/decimal_gda.md)."
msgstr "本教程教你使用 `decimal_gda` 进行计算。该包实现了 Cowlishaw 的通用十进制算术（GDA）：保留尾随零的十进制数，确定精度、舍入和指数界限的上下文，记录所发生情况的粘滞状态，以及在终止计算的同时仍把确定结果交给你的陷阱。学完之后，你将能够在计算中传递上下文、对金额舍入、处理陷阱、上溢和下溢、调用初等函数，并选择合适的比较方式。每条规则背后的数学见[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md)；所有公开名称都在 [API 页面](../api/decimal_gda.md)上。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:15
msgid "Read a number under a context"
msgstr "在上下文下读取一个数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:16
msgid "Carry status from one operation to the next"
msgstr "把状态从一个运算传递到下一个运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:17
msgid "Round an amount to cents"
msgstr "把金额舍入到分"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:18
msgid "Stop on a condition but keep the result"
msgstr "在某个条件下停止但保留结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:19
msgid "Control overflow and underflow"
msgstr "控制上溢与下溢"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:19
msgid "[exponent limits and rounding modes](#respect-the-exponent-range)"
msgstr "[指数界限与舍入模式](#respect-the-exponent-range)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:20
msgid "Compute `exp`, `ln`, `log10`, `sqrt` or `power`"
msgstr "计算 `exp`、`ln`、`log10`、`sqrt` 或 `power`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:20
msgid "[elementary functions](#call-the-elementary-functions)"
msgstr "[初等函数](#call-the-elementary-functions)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Compare numbers or representations"
msgstr "比较数值或表示"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:22
msgid "Chain many operations without manual threading"
msgstr "串联多个运算而无需手动传递上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:23
msgid "Encode decimal32/64/128 bit patterns"
msgstr "编码 decimal32/64/128 位模式"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:33
msgid "Import the package in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:41
msgid "Every GDA operation takes its operands and a `GdaContext` and returns a `GdaOutcome`: the result, the context to use next, and the conditions this operation raised."
msgstr "每个 GDA 运算都接收操作数和一个 `GdaContext`，并返回一个 `GdaOutcome`：结果、下一步要使用的上下文，以及该运算引发的情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:58
msgid "`raised()` describes this one operation. `next_context().status()` is sticky: it collects every condition since the context was created or cleared."
msgstr "`raised()` 描述的是这一个运算。`next_context().status()` 是粘滞的：它收集自上下文创建或清除以来的所有情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:63
msgid "Thread the context through a calculation"
msgstr "在计算中传递上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:65
msgid "Status accumulates only when you pass each outcome's `next_context()` to the next operation. The context you started with never changes, because a context is a value, not a mutable object."
msgstr "只有把每个结果的 `next_context()` 传给下一个运算，状态才会累积。你最初使用的上下文永远不会改变，因为上下文是一个值，而不是可变对象。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:88
msgid "Keep and set the quantum"
msgstr "保留并设定量子"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:90
msgid "A GDA number is a coefficient and an exponent, so `2.50` and `2.5` are equal numbers with different exponents (different *quanta*). Arithmetic keeps the exponent that the exact result calls for, and `quantize` sets it explicitly. That is how you round an amount to cents:"
msgstr "GDA 数由系数和指数组成，因此 `2.50` 和 `2.5` 是相等的数，但指数不同（*量子*不同）。算术保留精确结果所要求的指数，而 `quantize` 显式地设定指数。这就是把金额舍入到分的方法："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:118
msgid "`reduce` goes the other way: it removes trailing zeros, so `reduce(7.50)` is `7.5`. Use it only when you really want the shortest cohort member."
msgstr "`reduce` 的作用正相反：它去除尾随零，因此 `reduce(7.50)` 是 `7.5`。只有在确实需要同值类中最短的成员时才使用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:121
msgid "Handle a trap without losing the result"
msgstr "处理陷阱而不丢失结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:123
msgid "Enable a trap by deriving a new context with `trap`. A trapped operation returns `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`: the GDA-defined result is still there, and the sticky status is still updated."
msgstr "用 `trap` 派生出一个新上下文即可启用陷阱。被陷阱捕获的运算返回 `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`：GDA 定义的结果仍然在其中，粘滞状态也照样更新。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:145
msgid "An `InvalidOperation` trap also catches the four detailed invalid conditions (conversion syntax, division impossible, division undefined and invalid context), which are flags of the outcome but not signals: the nine signals of the specification are the only ones with a trap. The basic default context enables `InvalidOperation`, so a malformed literal traps:"
msgstr "`InvalidOperation` 陷阱也会捕获四个细分的无效条件（转换语法错误、除法不可行、除法未定义和无效上下文），它们是结果的标志，但不是信号：只有规范的九种信号才有陷阱。基本默认上下文启用了 `InvalidOperation`，因此格式错误的字面量会触发陷阱："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:167
msgid "When one operation raises several trapped conditions, the package reports one of them by a fixed precedence (listed in the [API page](../api/decimal_gda.md#trap-selection)), so you never have to invent your own order."
msgstr "当一个运算引发多个被陷阱捕获的情形时，本包按固定的优先级（列于 [API 页面](../api/decimal_gda.md#trap-selection)）报告其中之一，因此你无需自行规定顺序。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:171
msgid "Respect the exponent range"
msgstr "遵守指数范围"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:173
msgid "A context bounds the adjusted exponent to `[e_min, e_max]`. Beyond `e_max` the result overflows; what it overflows *to* depends on the rounding mode. Below `e_min` the result becomes subnormal and loses digits:"
msgstr "上下文把调整后的指数限制在 `[e_min, e_max]` 之内。超出 `e_max` 时结果上溢；上溢*成*什么取决于舍入模式。低于 `e_min` 时结果成为次正规数并丢失数字："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:201
msgid "Call the elementary functions"
msgstr "调用初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:203
msgid "`sqrt`, `exp`, `ln` and `log10` are correctly rounded and always round half to even, whatever the context's rounding mode says. `power` with a non-integer exponent is also correctly rounded, but under the context's own rounding mode. `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and non-integer `power` only accept contexts with precision, `e_max` and `-e_min` at most 999,999 (decNumber's limit, which the decTest suite requires and GDA's Invalid context condition permits; the operation text of the specification states no such bound); the decimal32/64/128 presets qualify, but the defaults of `GdaContext::new` and `context` (exponent range ±999,999,999) do not:"
msgstr "`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 是正确舍入的，并且无论上下文的舍入模式如何，总是采用半偶舍入。非整数指数的 `power` 同样是正确舍入的，但使用上下文自身的舍入模式。`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和非整数 `power` 只接受精度、`e_max` 和 `-e_min` 都不超过 999,999 的上下文（这是 decNumber 的限制，decTest 套件要求它，GDA 的 Invalid context 条件允许它；规范的运算正文并未规定这样的界）；decimal32/64/128 预设满足这一条件，而 `GdaContext::new` 和 `context` 的默认值（指数范围 ±999,999,999）不满足："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:237
msgid "A certified elementary function refines its enclosure at most twelve times by default. For a rare argument that sits very close to a rounding boundary, `ctx.with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` allows more steps and `with_refinement_limit(None)` removes the count (the working precision then stops at a cap of at least 8,000,000 bits). `refinement_limit()` reads it."
msgstr "认证初等函数默认至多细化包络十二次。对于极少数非常接近舍入边界的参数，`ctx.with_refinement_limit(Some(24))` 允许更多步，`with_refinement_limit(None)` 取消步数（此时工作精度在至少 8,000,000 位的上限处停止）；`refinement_limit()` 读取该限制。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:243
msgid "Compare and print"
msgstr "比较与打印"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:245
msgid "`compare` is numeric and returns a decimal (`-1`, `0`, `1`, or NaN when an operand is NaN). `compare_total` orders representations, so it tells `2.50` from `2.5`. Printing a value gives its scientific string; `class_name` names its class:"
msgstr "`compare` 按数值比较并返回一个十进制数（`-1`、`0`、`1`，或在某个操作数为 NaN 时返回 NaN）。`compare_total` 对表示进行排序，因此能区分 `2.50` 和 `2.5`。打印一个值会得到其科学记数法字符串；`class_name` 给出其类别名称："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:273
msgid "Long chains with `decimal_gda_checked`"
msgstr "用 `decimal_gda_checked` 构建长链"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:275
msgid "Manual threading is clearest at boundaries. For a long linear pipeline, [`decimal_gda_checked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) keeps one outcome, threads the sticky context for you and stops after the first trap:"
msgstr "手动传递上下文在边界处最为清晰。对于较长的线性流水线，[`decimal_gda_checked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) 只保留一个结果，替你传递粘滞上下文，并在第一个陷阱之后停止："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:293
msgid "Generic code through `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`"
msgstr "通过 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 编写泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:295
msgid "`Decimal` implements the contextual traits of [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/), so code written against `AddContextual`, `DivContextual`, `SqrtContextual` and friends runs on it. These adapters use the five IEEE-style rounding modes of `ArithmeticContext`, report errors as `Err`, and know nothing about traps:"
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的 contextual trait，因此针对 `AddContextual`、`DivContextual`、`SqrtContextual` 等编写的代码可以在其上运行。这些适配器使用 `ArithmeticContext` 的五种 IEEE 风格舍入模式，以 `Err` 报告错误，并且对陷阱一无所知："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:324
msgid "Subset arithmetic and lost digits"
msgstr "子集算术与丢失的数字"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:326
msgid "`GdaContext::basic_default()` is the GDA *basic default context*: precision 9, `HalfUp`, `extended=false`, with the `DivisionByZero`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Underflow` and `Clamped` traps enabled. A non-extended context rounds operands that are longer than the precision before using them and reports `LostDigits` when that loses information:"
msgstr "`GdaContext::basic_default()` 是 GDA 的*基本默认上下文*：精度 9、`HalfUp`、`extended=false`，并启用 `DivisionByZero`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Underflow` 和 `Clamped` 陷阱。非扩展上下文会在使用之前对长于精度的操作数进行舍入，并在因此丢失信息时报告 `LostDigits`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:346
msgid "`GdaInterchange` holds a decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128 bit pattern in the densely packed decimal (DPD) encoding, written as `#` and hexadecimal digits:"
msgstr "`GdaInterchange` 以密集压缩十进制（DPD）编码保存 decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128 位模式，写作 `#` 加十六进制数字："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:361
msgid "**Reusing the original context.** Status only accumulates if you pass `next_context()` on. A trap set or status you put on a context also travels with every context derived from it."
msgstr "**重复使用原始上下文。** 只有把 `next_context()` 传递下去，状态才会累积。你在某个上下文上设置的陷阱集合或状态，也会随从它派生的每个上下文一起传递。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:364
msgid "**Treating `Trapped` as \"no value\".** A trap changes the variant, not the result; read the value with `value()` before you decide to stop."
msgstr "**把 `Trapped` 当作“没有值”。** 陷阱改变的是变体，而不是结果；在决定停止之前，请用 `value()` 读取值。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:366
msgid "**Expecting constructors to keep zeros.** `Decimal::from_int(100)` and `Decimal::make` remove trailing zeros, so `from_int(100)` prints `1E+2`. Use `Decimal::from_string(\"100\")` or `parse` when the quantum matters."
msgstr "**指望构造器保留零。** `Decimal::from_int(100)` 和 `Decimal::make` 会去除尾随零，因此 `from_int(100)` 打印为 `1E+2`。当量子重要时，请使用 `Decimal::from_string(\"100\")` 或 `parse`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:369
msgid "**Using the operators for GDA work.** `+`, `-`, `*` and `/` take no context: they run the package function in a private context (larger operand precision, half-even, no clamp, no traps), so they round every result to that precision, return the GDA cohort member (`1.10 + 3.50` is `4.60`) and never signal. Use the package functions whenever GDA results, flags or traps matter."
msgstr "**用运算符做 GDA 计算。** `+`、`-`、`*` 和 `/` 不接收上下文：它们在私有上下文（较大的操作数精度、半偶舍入、无钳制、无陷阱）中运行包里的函数，因此每个结果都舍入到该精度，返回 GDA 的同值类成员（`1.10 + 3.50` 为 `4.60`），并且从不发出信号。只要 GDA 的结果、标志或陷阱有意义，就请使用包中的函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:375
msgid "**Equality and NaN.** `==` and `compare` put every NaN equal to every other NaN and above every number (a total preorder, so sorting never aborts). Use `compare` (the package function), `compare_signal`, or `Decimal::compare_checked` when NaN must stay unordered."
msgstr "**相等性与 NaN。** `==` 和 `compare` 把每个 NaN 视为与其他所有 NaN 相等，并大于每个数（这是一个全预序，因此排序从不中止）。当 NaN 必须保持无序时，请使用 `compare`（包中的函数）、`compare_signal` 或 `Decimal::compare_checked`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:379
msgid "**Mixing the two decimal packages.** `@decimal_gda.Decimal` and `@decimal.Decimal` are different types with different contracts; cross between them through strings or interchange bits."
msgstr "**混用两个十进制包。** `@decimal_gda.Decimal` 和 `@decimal.Decimal` 是具有不同契约的不同类型；在它们之间转换请通过字符串或交换位模式。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:382
msgid "**Expecting `exp`, `ln`, `log10` or `sqrt` to follow the context rounding.** They always round half to even; only `power` follows the context."
msgstr "**指望 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 或 `sqrt` 遵循上下文的舍入。** 它们总是采用半偶舍入；只有 `power` 遵循上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:384
msgid "**Calling `exp`, `ln`, `log10` or non-integer `power` with a default context.** `GdaContext::new()` and `context()` allow exponents up to ±999,999,999, which is outside the range these functions accept, so they return NaN and raise `InvalidContext` (an `InvalidOperation`). Use a preset or pass `e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999`. The same holds for an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` and `e_max`: no bounds are filled in for you, and `exp_contextual` returns `Err(unsupported)` with an `invalid context:` message naming the missing bounds."
msgstr "**用默认上下文调用 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 或非整数 `power`。** `GdaContext::new()` 和 `context()` 允许指数达到 ±999,999,999，超出了这些函数接受的范围，因此它们返回 NaN 并引发 `InvalidContext`（一种 `InvalidOperation`）。请使用预设，或传入 `e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999`。未设置 `e_min` 和 `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 同样如此：不会替你补上边界，`exp_contextual` 返回 `Err(unsupported)`，其 `invalid context:` 消息会指出缺少的边界。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:395
msgid "[Design](../design/decimal_gda.md): the arithmetic model, ideal exponents, rounding functions, the signal and trap state machine, and how the elementary functions are certified."
msgstr "[设计](../design/decimal_gda.md)：算术模型、理想指数、舍入函数、信号与陷阱状态机，以及初等函数如何认证。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:398
msgid "[API reference](../api/decimal_gda.md): every type, function and method."
msgstr "[API 参考](../api/decimal_gda.md)：每个类型、函数和方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:399
msgid "[Conformance](../conformance/decimal_gda.md) and [performance](../performance/decimal_gda.md): the pinned test-suite result and how to measure speed."
msgstr "[符合性](../conformance/decimal_gda.md)和[性能](../performance/decimal_gda.md)：固定版本测试套件的结果以及如何测量速度。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:402
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` tutorial](decimal_gda_checked.md): trap short-circuiting and recovery in pipelines."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 教程](decimal_gda_checked.md)：流水线中的陷阱短路与恢复。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:404
msgid "[`decimal` tutorial](decimal.md): the IEEE 754 decimal model with per-operation flags."
msgstr "[`decimal` 教程](decimal.md)：带逐运算标志的 IEEE 754 十进制模型。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda_checked tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_gda_checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to run a General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA) calculation as a pipeline that honours GDA traps: you choose a `GdaContext` with the traps your application needs, start a `GdaDecimalChecked`, chain operations, detect the step that trapped, inspect the sticky status, and decide explicitly whether to continue. This is the model of Python's `decimal` module and of the GDA test suites: status flags are sticky, and an enabled trap stops the computation. The operations come from [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md); the [design page](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) proves the status and trap laws; the [API reference](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md) lists every method."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把一次通用十进制算术（GDA）计算作为遵守 GDA 陷阱的流水线来运行：你选择一个带有应用所需陷阱的 `GdaContext`，开始一个 `GdaDecimalChecked`，串联运算，找出触发陷阱的步骤，检查粘滞状态，并显式决定是否继续。这正是 Python 的 `decimal` 模块和 GDA 测试套件所采用的模型：状态标志是粘滞的，已启用的陷阱会终止计算。运算来自 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md)证明了状态与陷阱的定律；[API 参考](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md)列出了所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:15
msgid "Start a pipeline from text or a value"
msgstr "从文本或值开始一条流水线"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:16
msgid "Decide which conditions stop the calculation"
msgstr "决定哪些条件会停止计算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:17
msgid "See what the latest step raised and what happened so far"
msgstr "查看最近一步引发了什么以及迄今为止发生了什么"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:18
msgid "Find the step that trapped"
msgstr "找到触发陷阱的步骤"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:19
msgid "Continue with the defined result after a trap"
msgstr "在陷阱之后用定义的结果继续"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:20
msgid "Run a function that returns no number, or a `try_` form"
msgstr "运行不返回数的函数，或 `try_` 形式"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:20
msgid "[`value()` and `context()`, `from_outcome`](#combine-with-the-plain-gda-functions)"
msgstr "[`value()` 和 `context()`，`from_outcome`](#combine-with-the-plain-gda-functions)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:30
msgid "Import both packages in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:39
msgid "Divide under the GDA *basic* context, which traps division by zero:"
msgstr "在会捕获除以零的 GDA *basic* 上下文下做除法："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:78
msgid "Choose the traps"
msgstr "选择陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:80
msgid "A `GdaContext` carries a trap set. The predefined contexts differ: `GdaContext::basic_default()` (the GDA basic context: precision 9, `HalfUp`) traps `DivisionByZero`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Underflow` and `Clamped`; `decimal32()`, `decimal64()`, `decimal128()` and `new(...)` trap nothing. Add or remove traps with `trap`:"
msgstr "`GdaContext` 携带一个陷阱集合。各预定义上下文有所不同：`GdaContext::basic_default()`（GDA basic 上下文：精度 9、`HalfUp`）捕获 `DivisionByZero`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Underflow` 和 `Clamped`；`decimal32()`、`decimal64()`、`decimal128()` 和 `new(...)` 不捕获任何信号。用 `trap` 添加或移除陷阱："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:109
msgid "Read the sticky status"
msgstr "读取粘滞状态"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:111
msgid "`raised()` holds the signals of the latest operation, `status()` every signal since the context was created or its status was last cleared:"
msgstr "`raised()` 保存最近一次运算的信号，`status()` 保存自上下文创建或其状态上次被清除以来的所有信号："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:130
msgid "Nothing runs after a trap"
msgstr "陷阱之后不再执行任何运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:132
msgid "Once trapped, every further operation returns the pipeline unchanged; the value is the defined result of the trapped step:"
msgstr "一旦被陷阱捕获，后续每个运算都原样返回流水线；值是被捕获步骤的确定结果："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:151
msgid "Resume deliberately"
msgstr "有意识地恢复"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:153
msgid "`resume_defined()` accepts the defined result and continues. The status still records the trapped signal, so the decision is visible afterwards:"
msgstr "`resume_defined()` 接受确定结果并继续执行。状态仍然记录着被捕获的信号，因此这一决定事后可见："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:173
msgid "The traps are still enabled after resuming: dividing by zero again traps again."
msgstr "恢复之后陷阱仍然启用：再次除以零会再次触发陷阱。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:178
msgid "Syntax errors are invalid operations"
msgstr "语法错误属于无效运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:180
msgid "GDA classifies conversion syntax, impossible and undefined divisions and invalid contexts as *invalid-operation conditions*. A context that traps `InvalidOperation` therefore stops on a malformed string, and the status gains `invalid_operation` next to the specific condition:"
msgstr "GDA 把转换语法错误、不可能的除法、未定义的除法和无效上下文归类为*无效运算情形*。因此，捕获 `InvalidOperation` 的上下文会在遇到格式错误的字符串时停止，并且状态中除具体情形外还会加入 `invalid_operation`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:201
msgid "Mathematical functions need bounded contexts"
msgstr "数学函数需要有界上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:203
msgid "`exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` keep decNumber's restriction (an implementation limit that decTest requires) to precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$. The interchange contexts satisfy it; `GdaContext::new` with its default unbounded range does not, and the functions return NaN with `invalid_context` (which traps under `InvalidOperation`):"
msgstr "`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power` 保留 decNumber 的限制（decTest 要求的一项实现限制）：精度和指数界须在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内。交换格式上下文满足这一条件；采用默认无界范围的 `GdaContext::new` 则不满足，这些函数会返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN（在 `InvalidOperation` 下会触发陷阱）："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:226
msgid "Combine with the plain GDA functions"
msgstr "与普通 GDA 函数结合使用"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:228
msgid "Every `decimal_gda` operation that returns a number has a pipeline method. The functions that return a string, a boolean or an integer (`class_name`, `is_normal`, `is_subnormal`, `compare_total`) and the `try_` forms do not: run them on `value()` and `context()`, and wrap the outcome of a `try_` form with `from_outcome`:"
msgstr "`decimal_gda` 中每个返回数的运算都有流水线方法。返回字符串、布尔值或整数的函数（`class_name`、`is_normal`、`is_subnormal`、`compare_total`）和 `try_` 形式没有：请对 `value()` 和 `context()` 运行它们，`try_` 形式的结果用 `from_outcome` 包装："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:251
msgid "Do this only on a pipeline that is not trapped; `from_outcome` does not check the previous state."
msgstr "只在未被陷阱捕获的流水线上这样做；`from_outcome` 不检查先前的状态。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:256
msgid "**`basic_default()` traps, `new()` does not.** Choose the context deliberately."
msgstr "**`basic_default()` 会捕获陷阱，`new()` 不会。** 请审慎选择上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:257
msgid "**`raised()` versus `status()`.** The first is the latest step, the second the sticky history."
msgstr "**`raised()` 与 `status()`。** 前者是最近一步，后者是粘滞的历史。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:259
msgid "**`resume_defined` keeps the status and the traps.** It clears only the trap marker and `raised()`. Clear the status with `GdaContext::clear_status` on a context and start a new pipeline if needed."
msgstr "**`resume_defined` 保留状态和陷阱。** 它只清除陷阱标记和 `raised()`。如有需要，请在上下文上用 `GdaContext::clear_status` 清除状态，并开始一条新的流水线。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:262
msgid "**No errors.** Traps are not converted to `ArithmeticError`; check `is_err()`."
msgstr "**没有错误。** 陷阱不会被转换为 `ArithmeticError`；请检查 `is_err()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:264
msgid "**Two decimal packages.** `decimal_gda.Decimal` is not `decimal.Decimal`; IEEE-style flag accumulation without traps is [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md)."
msgstr "**两个十进制包。** `decimal_gda.Decimal` 不是 `decimal.Decimal`；不带陷阱的 IEEE 风格标志累积见 [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:270
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` design](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md): sticky status as a monoid, the trap predicate and the short-circuit proof."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 设计](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md)：作为幺半群的粘滞状态、陷阱谓词以及短路的证明。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:272
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` API](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md): every method."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` API](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md)：所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:273
msgid "[`decimal_gda` tutorial](decimal_gda.md): contexts, rounding modes and the full GDA operation set."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda` 教程](decimal_gda.md)：上下文、舍入模式以及完整的 GDA 运算集合。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:1
msgid "def tutorial"
msgstr "def 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:3
msgid "The goal of this tutorial is to write code that works with every number type of `floating` at once: you inspect values through the `Floating` trait, test their class with the generic predicates, read IEEE comparison results as `PartialOrder`, and reuse the arithmetic context and error types that `def` re-exports. `def` itself does no arithmetic; the concrete packages ([`bin_float`](bin_float.md), [`decimal`](decimal.md), [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)) do. Intervals ([`ball_float`](ball_float.md)) are not `Floating`. The laws behind the trait are in the [design page](../design/def.md)."
msgstr "本教程的目标是编写能同时适用于 `floating` 所有数值类型的代码：通过 `Floating` trait 检视值，用泛型谓词检验其类别，把 IEEE 比较结果读作 `PartialOrder`，并复用 `def` 重新导出的算术上下文与错误类型。`def` 本身不做任何算术；算术由具体的包（[`bin_float`](bin_float.md)、[`decimal`](decimal.md)、[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)）完成。区间（[`ball_float`](ball_float.md)）不是 `Floating`。该 trait 背后的定律见[设计页面](../design/def.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:14
msgid "ask any value for its class, sign or precision"
msgstr "查询任意值的类别、符号或精度"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:15
msgid "test for NaN, infinity or zero generically"
msgstr "以泛型方式检测 NaN、无穷或零"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:16
msgid "round a value to fewer digits of its own radix"
msgstr "把值舍入到其自身基数下更少的位数"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:17
msgid "read the result of an IEEE comparison"
msgstr "读取 IEEE 比较的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:18
msgid "compare decimal cohorts by their printed form"
msgstr "按打印形式比较十进制同值类"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:19
msgid "handle checked errors without importing `arithmetic`"
msgstr "不导入 `arithmetic` 即可处理 checked 错误"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:23
msgid "Add the module and import `def` next to the representation you use:"
msgstr "添加模块，并在你所用的表示之外再导入 `def`："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:36
msgid "The smallest useful program asks a value what it is:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序询问一个值是什么："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:50
msgid "Write one function for every representation"
msgstr "为所有表示编写同一个函数"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:52
msgid "A function bounded by `F : @def.Floating` accepts binary, IEEE decimal and GDA decimal values. Call the trait methods in their qualified form, `@def.Floating::classify(x)`, because MoonBit no longer turns trait methods into dot methods of a type parameter."
msgstr "以 `F : @def.Floating` 为约束的函数可以接受二进制、IEEE 十进制和 GDA 十进制值。请以限定形式 `@def.Floating::classify(x)` 调用 trait 方法，因为 MoonBit 不再把 trait 方法变成类型参数的点方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:89
msgid "Change precision generically"
msgstr "泛型地改变精度"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:91
msgid "`with_precision` rounds to the requested number of significant digits of the value's own radix, bits for binary and digits for decimal, to nearest with ties to even. The trait method takes no rounding mode; a concrete type has its own `with_precision` method that does:"
msgstr "`with_precision` 舍入到所要求的有效数字位数，位数以值自身的基数计：二进制为位，十进制为十进制数字，就近舍入、偶数优先。trait 方法不带舍入模式；具体类型有自己的、带舍入模式的 `with_precision` 方法："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:111
msgid "Eleven is `1011` in binary; three significant bits round it to `1100`, which `to_string` prints as $3 \\cdot 2^2$."
msgstr "十一的二进制是 `1011`；三位有效位把它舍入为 `1100`，`to_string` 将其打印为 $3 \\cdot 2^2$。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:114
msgid "Read an IEEE comparison"
msgstr "读取 IEEE 比较结果"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:116
msgid "Comparisons that follow IEEE 754 return a `PartialOrder`, whose fourth value `Unordered` reports a NaN operand:"
msgstr "遵循 IEEE 754 的比较返回一个 `PartialOrder`，其第四个值 `Unordered` 表示有 NaN 操作数："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:143
msgid "Normalize before comparing representations"
msgstr "比较表示之前先规范化"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:145
msgid "Decimal values with the same value can differ in their stored exponent (`1.5` and `1.500` belong to one *cohort*). `normalized` picks the canonical member, so the printed forms agree:"
msgstr "值相同的十进制数，其存储的指数可能不同（`1.5` 和 `1.500` 属于同一个*同值类*）。`normalized` 选取规范成员，从而使打印形式一致："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:165
msgid "Use the re-exported arithmetic types"
msgstr "使用重新导出的算术类型"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:167
msgid "`@def.ArithmeticContext`, `@def.ArithmeticError`, `@def.RoundingMode` and the other aliases are the types of [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/). Code that only needs the vocabulary can import `def` instead of `arithmetic`:"
msgstr "`@def.ArithmeticContext`、`@def.ArithmeticError`、`@def.RoundingMode` 以及其他别名都是 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的类型。只需要这套词汇的代码可以导入 `def` 而不是 `arithmetic`："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:197
msgid "`Sign::Zero` does not mean \"the value is zero\". It is also returned for NaN by the scalar types. Test `@def.is_nan` first. `BallFloat` is not `Floating`: ask an interval `is_empty`, `is_common_interval` or `contains`."
msgstr "`Sign::Zero` 并不意味着“值为零”。标量类型对 NaN 也返回它。请先检验 `@def.is_nan`。`BallFloat` 不是 `Floating`：对区间请使用 `is_empty`、`is_common_interval` 或 `contains`。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:200
msgid "`Sign` cannot tell $-0$ from $+0$. Use the concrete package (`BinFloat::is_negative_zero`, `Decimal::is_negative`) when the sign bit matters."
msgstr "`Sign` 无法区分 $-0$ 和 $+0$。当符号位重要时，请使用具体的包（`BinFloat::is_negative_zero`、`Decimal::is_negative`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:203
msgid "`PartialOrder` is not an ordering you can sort with: `Unordered` breaks trichotomy. Use the total orders of the concrete packages (`BinFloat::total_order_compare`, `Decimal::total_order_compare`) for sorting."
msgstr "`PartialOrder` 不是可以用来排序的序：`Unordered` 破坏了三分律。排序请使用具体包提供的全序（`BinFloat::total_order_compare`、`Decimal::total_order_compare`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:206
msgid "`with_precision` reports no flags and ignores context exponent limits (a `BinFloat` still overflows at its implementation range of about $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$). When rounding must be observed, use the `*_ctx` operations of the concrete package."
msgstr "`with_precision` 不报告标志，也忽略上下文的指数界限（`BinFloat` 仍会在其约为 $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$ 的实现范围处上溢）。当舍入必须可观测时，请使用具体包的 `*_ctx` 运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:210
msgid "`with_precision(x, 0)` is not an error: the precision is clamped to 1."
msgstr "`with_precision(x, 0)` 不是错误：精度会被钳制为 1。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:214
msgid "[`def` design](../design/def.md): the trait laws and the order theory of `PartialOrder`."
msgstr "[`def` 设计](../design/def.md)：trait 定律以及 `PartialOrder` 的序理论。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:216
msgid "[`def` API](../api/def.md): every item with its signature."
msgstr "[`def` API](../api/def.md)：每个条目及其签名。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:217
msgid "[`semantic` tutorial](semantic.md): compare values of different representations exactly."
msgstr "[`semantic` 教程](semantic.md)：精确比较不同表示的值。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:219
msgid "[Numeric semantics guide](../numeric_semantics.md) for the shared vocabulary of the repository."
msgstr "本仓库的共享词汇见[数值语义指南](../numeric_semantics.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:1
msgid "differential tutorial"
msgstr "differential 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:3
msgid "This tutorial runs a randomized differential campaign: it generates seeded rows with MPFR (binary, IEEE `decimal`) and libmpdec (`decimal_gda`), validates `floating` against them through the mare_mark runner, reads the JSONL record, and replays and minimizes a failure."
msgstr "本教程运行一次随机差分测试活动：用 MPFR（二进制）和 libmpdec（十进制）生成带种子的行，通过 mare_mark 运行器对 `floating` 进行验证，读取 JSONL 记录，并重放和最小化一个失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:10
msgid "check the committed fixtures"
msgstr "检查已提交的固定样例"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:11
#: manual/tutorial/differential/harness.md:10
msgid "run a campaign"
msgstr "运行一次测试活动"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:12
msgid "read the record"
msgstr "读取记录"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:12
msgid "[the JSONL events](#read-the-record)"
msgstr "[JSONL 事件](#read-the-record)"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:13
msgid "reproduce one case"
msgstr "重现一个用例"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:14
msgid "shrink a failing case"
msgstr "缩减一个失败用例"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:15
msgid "run another backend"
msgstr "运行另一个后端"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:19
msgid "The committed fixtures need no oracle: their expected values are in the rows."
msgstr "已提交的固定样例不需要预言机：它们的期望值就在行里。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:33
msgid "`smoke` builds the synchronous `floating-conformance` executable for the native target and runs the fixture files through it. A known failure recorded in a regression fixture is annotated `xfail` with its issue number; the smoke run requires exactly those rows to fail, so a fix shows up as an unexpected pass."
msgstr "`smoke` 为 native 目标构建同步的 `floating-conformance` 可执行文件，并用它运行各个夹具文件。回归夹具中记录的已知失败带有 `xfail` 和 issue 编号；smoke 运行要求恰好这些行失败，所以一旦修复，就会表现为意外通过。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:41
msgid "Decimal elementary functions against MPFR"
msgstr "对照 MPFR 检查十进制初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:43
msgid "The IEEE `decimal` package's elementary functions have one family each, `decimal-<function>` (`decimal-exp`, `decimal-atan2`, `decimal-pown`, `decimal-exp2m1`, `decimal-log10p1`, ...), checked against certified MPFR enclosures instead of libmpdec. They are not in the default set (there are as many families as functions); name them with `--family`, or add all of them with `--decimal`. A case id reads `m<seed>.<function>.<index>`."
msgstr "IEEE `decimal` 包的每个初等函数各有一个族 `decimal-<function>`（`decimal-exp`、`decimal-atan2`、`decimal-pown`、`decimal-exp2m1`、`decimal-log10p1` 等），对照经过认证的 MPFR 包络而不是 libmpdec 来检查。它们不在默认集合里（族的数量与函数一样多）；用 `--family` 指名，或用 `--decimal` 一次加入全部。用例 id 形如 `m<seed>.<function>.<index>`。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:55
msgid "Operands and contexts are drawn so that results reach overflow, underflow and the subnormal range; exact results are not sampled (an enclosure cannot certify them), and exponent ranges stay within ±20,000 because the cost of the exact endpoint conversion grows steeply beyond that."
msgstr "操作数和上下文的取法使结果能到达上溢、下溢和次正规范围；精确结果不被抽取（包络无法认证它们），指数范围限制在 ±20,000 以内，因为精确端点转换的代价在此之后增长得很陡。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:60
msgid "Run a campaign"
msgstr "运行测试活动"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:62
msgid "A campaign needs the oracles: a C compiler with MPFR and GMP (Homebrew puts them in `/opt/homebrew`; pass `--mpfr-prefix` elsewhere) for the binary families, and Python 3 with the `decimal` module for the decimal families."
msgstr "测试活动需要预言机：二进制族需要带 MPFR 和 GMP 的 C 编译器（Homebrew 把它们放在 `/opt/homebrew`；其他位置请传 `--mpfr-prefix`），十进制族需要带 `decimal` 模块的 Python 3。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:81
msgid "`--family` is repeatable and defaults to every family. The binary families are `add sub mul div sqrt fma strtofr getstr shortest elem elem2 elem3 elem4` (`elem2` holds `exp2m1`, `exp10m1`, `log2p1` and `log10p1`, `elem3` holds `rsqrt`, `compound` and `powr`, `elem4` holds `asinpi`, `acospi`, `atanpi` and `atan2pi`, which `elem` does not draw); the `decimal_gda` families (General Decimal Arithmetic against libmpdec) are `decimal_gda-add decimal_gda-subtract decimal_gda-multiply decimal_gda-divide decimal_gda-squareroot decimal_gda-fma decimal_gda-apply decimal_gda-tosci decimal_gda-toeng decimal_gda-exp decimal_gda-ln decimal_gda-log10 decimal_gda-power`. The `decimal_gda-*wide` families sample the contexts on which the elementary functions refuse by design and are opt-in. The `decimal-<function>` families belong to the IEEE `decimal` package (see above). The former prefixes `dec-` (now `decimal_gda-`) and `decm-` (now `decimal-`), and the option `--decm` (now `--decimal`), are deprecated aliases and still accepted. `--count` is per family, `--shard` bounds the rows generated per file, `--batch` the cases validated together, `--jobs` the parallel shards."
msgstr "`--family` 可重复，默认为每个族。二进制族是 `add sub mul div sqrt fma strtofr getstr shortest elem elem2 elem3 elem4`（`elem2` 包含 `exp2m1`、`exp10m1`、`log2p1`、`log10p1`，`elem3` 包含 `rsqrt`、`compound`、`powr`，`elem4` 包含 `asinpi`、`acospi`、`atanpi`、`atan2pi`，`elem` 不会抽到它们）；`decimal_gda` 族（通用十进制算术，对照 libmpdec）是 `decimal_gda-add decimal_gda-subtract decimal_gda-multiply decimal_gda-divide decimal_gda-squareroot decimal_gda-fma decimal_gda-apply decimal_gda-tosci decimal_gda-toeng decimal_gda-exp decimal_gda-ln decimal_gda-log10 decimal_gda-power`。`decimal_gda-*wide` 族抽样初等函数按设计拒绝的上下文，需要显式选用。`decimal-<function>` 族属于 IEEE `decimal` 包（见上文）。旧前缀 `dec-`（现为 `decimal_gda-`）和 `decm-`（现为 `decimal-`）以及选项 `--decm`（现为 `--decimal`）是已弃用的别名，仍然可用。`--count` 是每个族的用例数，`--shard` 限制每个文件生成的行数，`--batch` 是一起验证的用例数，`--jobs` 是并行分片数。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:95
msgid "The run directory holds `records-<target>.jsonl` (append-only, one file per backend) and `summary.json` with the exact number of cases per backend, family and operation. The command exits with `1` when a batch disagreed."
msgstr "运行目录包含 `records-<target>.jsonl`（追加式，每个后端一个文件）和 `summary.json`，后者给出每个后端、族和运算的确切用例数。当有批不一致时命令以 `1` 退出。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:99
msgid "Read the record"
msgstr "读取记录"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:117
msgid "Each `validation` names the batch by its first and last case id and its size. An `invalid` one is followed by a `validation_failure` that carries the minimized case."
msgstr "每个 `validation` 用其第一个和最后一个用例 id 以及大小来命名该批。`invalid` 之后跟着一个携带最小化用例的 `validation_failure`。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:121
msgid "Replay a case"
msgstr "重放一个用例"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:129
msgid "The generators are pure functions of seed, family and index, so the id is the whole reproduction. The output is the frontend's summary; a failing row is printed with the expected and the actual value and flags."
msgstr "生成器是种子、族和索引的纯函数，所以 id 就是完整的复现信息。输出是前端的摘要；失败的行会连同期望值与实际值及标志一起打印。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:133
msgid "Minimize a failure"
msgstr "最小化一个失败"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:139
msgid "The minimizer tries simpler variants (smaller precision, plain rounding, no clamp, narrower exponent range, shorter operands, operands rewritten as `1E+k`), asks the oracle for the correct answer of each variant, and keeps a variant when the library still disagrees. The result is a row the oracle produced itself, so it is a consistent regression case, not an edited one."
msgstr "最小化器会尝试更简单的变体（更小的精度、普通舍入、无 clamp、更窄的指数范围、更短的操作数、改写为 `1E+k` 的操作数），向预言机询问每个变体的正确答案，并在库仍然不一致时保留该变体。结果是预言机自己生成的一行，因此是一个一致的回归用例，而不是被编辑过的。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:145
msgid "Sweep the range limits"
msgstr "扫描范围极限"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:147
msgid "The random rows rarely land on an underflow or overflow threshold. For the binary elementary functions, `tools/range_boundary_rows.py` writes rows on the thresholds themselves, for every precision in a range, with the oracle columns left as `?`:"
msgstr "随机行很少恰好落在下溢或上溢阈值上。对二进制初等函数，`tools/range_boundary_rows.py` 会直接在阈值上生成行，覆盖一个范围内的每个精度，并把预言机列留作 `?`："

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:158
msgid "The generator binary is built by any `just random-diff run`. A failing row is named with its expected and actual value and flags, so it can be pasted into a regression fixture."
msgstr "任何一次 `just random-diff run` 都会构建这个生成器二进制。失败的行会连同期望值、实际值与标志一起列出，因此可以直接粘贴进回归夹具。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:162
msgid "Other backends"
msgstr "其他后端"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:164
msgid "`--target` selects the backend of the harness: `native`, `wasm`, `js` or `llvm` (the mare_mark runner has no Wasm-GC runtime). For Wasm-GC, run the same fixtures through the synchronous runner:"
msgstr "`--target` 选择运行器的后端：`native`、`wasm`、`js` 或 `llvm`（mare_mark 运行器没有 Wasm-GC 运行时）。对于 Wasm-GC，请通过同步运行器运行同样的固定样例："

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:175
msgid "[API](../api/differential.md): the command line and the record."
msgstr "[API](../api/differential.md)：命令行和记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:176
msgid "[Design](../design/differential.md): the oracle reductions and the batch validation."
msgstr "[设计](../design/differential.md)：预言机的归约和按批验证。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:178
msgid "[Binary test data](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md) and [decimal (IEEE) test data](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md) and [decimal_gda test data](../../../testdata/decimal_gda/README.md): row formats, coverage, the intentional differences and the regression fixtures."
msgstr "[二进制测试数据](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md)、[十进制（IEEE）测试数据](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)和 [decimal_gda 测试数据](../../../testdata/decimal_gda/README.md)：行格式、覆盖范围、有意的差异和回归固定样例。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:182
msgid "[Verification](../verification.md): what has been run, with exact counts."
msgstr "[验证](../verification.md)：运行了什么，附确切计数。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:186
msgid "**A stale `moon` earlier on `PATH`.** The build runs `moon`; make sure the one you meant comes first."
msgstr "**`PATH` 上更靠前的旧版 `moon`。** 构建会运行 `moon`；请确保你想用的那个排在最前面。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:188
msgid "**No MPFR headers.** The generator build fails with `mpfr.h not found`; set `MPFR_PREFIX` or pass `--mpfr-prefix`."
msgstr "**没有 MPFR 头文件。** 生成器构建会失败并提示 `mpfr.h not found`；请设置 `MPFR_PREFIX` 或传 `--mpfr-prefix`。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:190
msgid "**Seeds above 2^31.** The harness takes the seed as a 32-bit integer and the tool reduces it; the case ids keep the full seed."
msgstr "**超过 2^31 的种子。** 运行器把种子当作 32 位整数，工具会对其取模；用例 id 保留完整的种子。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:192
msgid "**Treating a disagreement as a bug.** The oracles are implementations. Read the clause first."
msgstr "**把不一致当作缺陷。** 预言机只是实现。请先阅读条款。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential.md:197
msgid "Run a longer campaign on every backend, then read [verification](../verification.md) for how the published counts were produced."
msgstr "在每个后端上运行更长的测试活动，然后阅读[验证](../verification.md)了解公布的计数是如何得出的。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:1
msgid "differential/ball_mpfr tutorial"
msgstr "differential/ball_mpfr 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:3
msgid "This page shows how to run the differential stage of `BallFloat` against MPFR and how to read its output. The stage does not time anything: it asks whether the interval operations return the tightest result at the ends of the exponent range and in the subnormal band, where the other tests have no oracle of their own."
msgstr "本页说明如何运行 `BallFloat` 对照 MPFR 的差分阶段，以及如何读它的输出。这个阶段不计时：它问的是，在指数范围的两端和次正规带里，区间运算是否返回最紧的结果——别的测试在那里没有自己的预言机。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:7
msgid "run the whole stage"
msgstr "运行整个阶段"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:8
msgid "write the rows only"
msgstr "只写出行"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:9
msgid "run one class of rows"
msgstr "运行某一类行"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:9
msgid "[`--classes` and `--ops`](#everyday-tasks)"
msgstr "[`--classes` 和 `--ops`](#everyday-tasks)"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:10
msgid "read a failing row"
msgstr "读一个失败的行"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:10
msgid "[`BALLDIFF_FAIL` lines](#read-the-output)"
msgstr "[`BALLDIFF_FAIL` 行](#read-the-output)"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:14
msgid "From the repository root, with MPFR and GMP installed under `/opt/homebrew` (`--prefix` selects another prefix):"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行，MPFR 和 GMP 装在 `/opt/homebrew` 下（`--prefix` 可选别的前缀）："

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:20
msgid "The script writes the rows, computes the oracle in Python integers (every arithmetic row, nothing but CPython), builds `tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c` and computes the MPFR oracle when the MPFR and GMP headers are found, checks that the two agree, runs the test of this package on native in release mode against each, and prints which oracles ran with their row counts, the rows not checked, and the verdict. The exit status is 0 when no row differs except the rows listed in `tools/ball_diff_known.txt`, and 1 otherwise. `--no-mpfr` runs the integer oracle only (the rows that only MPFR decides, `exp` and `ln`, are reported as not checked); `--require-mpfr` makes a missing MPFR an error."
msgstr "脚本写出各行，用 Python 整数（每个算术行，只需要 CPython）计算预言机；找到 MPFR 和 GMP 的头文件时，构建 `tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c` 并计算 MPFR 预言机，检查两者一致，在 native 上以 release 模式对每个预言机运行这个包的测试，并打印哪些预言机运行了及其行数、未检查的行和结论。除了 `tools/ball_diff_known.txt` 列出的行之外没有行不同时，退出状态为 0，否则为 1。`--no-mpfr` 只运行整数预言机（只有 MPFR 能判定的行，即 `exp` 和 `ln`，被报告为未检查）；`--require-mpfr` 使缺少 MPFR 成为错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:24
msgid "Run a part of the rows"
msgstr "运行一部分行"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:30
msgid "A cell keeps its seeded stream when other cells are selected, so a row id means the same operands in every run."
msgstr "选择其他单元时，每个单元保持自己带种子的流，所以一个行 id 在每次运行里都表示同样的操作数。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:32
msgid "Read the output"
msgstr "读输出"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:34
msgid "The first table counts, per class, operation and precision, the rows and how many reached an overflow, a subnormal result, a subnormal operand or an underflow to zero according to the oracle's flags. `BALLDIFF_FAIL id op size class expected LO HI got LO HI` is a row whose bounds differ; the texts are canonical (`0b<odd integer>p<exponent>`, `inf`, `-inf`, `0`). Take the id to `inputs.txt` in the output directory (`.tmp/ball_diff`) for the operands."
msgstr "第一张表按类、运算和精度统计行数，以及按预言机的标志有多少行到达了上溢、次正规结果、次正规操作数或下溢到零。`BALLDIFF_FAIL id op size class expected LO HI got LO HI` 是端点不同的行；文本是规范化的（`0b<odd integer>p<exponent>`、`inf`、`-inf`、`0`）。拿 id 到输出目录（`.tmp/ball_diff`）的 `inputs.txt` 里找操作数。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:36
msgid "A row that differs today"
msgstr "今天仍然不同的行"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:38
msgid "File an issue, then add `<row id> #<issue>` to `tools/ball_diff_known.txt`. The run reports it as known; when the library is fixed the row agrees, the run reports it as stale and fails until the line is removed."
msgstr "先提 issue，再把 `<row id> #<issue>` 加到 `tools/ball_diff_known.txt`。运行把它报告为已知；库修好之后这一行重新一致，运行会把它报告为过期并失败，直到这一行被删掉。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:42
msgid "Add a class in `tools/ball_diff.py` (`CLASSES`, a generator in `GENERATORS`); give it the oracle flag it must reach, so that a class that misses its band fails the run."
msgstr "在 `tools/ball_diff.py` 里增加一个类（`CLASSES`，在 `GENERATORS` 里加一个生成器）；给它指定它必须到达的预言机标志，这样没有到达自己那个带的类会使运行失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:43
msgid "The header `tools/mpfr_ours.h` is shared by every C program that needs MPFR in the range of `bin_float`."
msgstr "头文件 `tools/mpfr_ours.h` 由所有需要在 `bin_float` 的范围里使用 MPFR 的 C 程序共享。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:47
msgid "The test needs the two environment variables; started by plain `moon test` it does nothing."
msgstr "测试需要那两个环境变量；用普通的 `moon test` 启动时它什么也不做。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:48
msgid "A row marked undecided is one where MPFR's `mpfr_sqrt` failed an exact check; it is not compared."
msgstr "标为无法判定的行，是 MPFR 的 `mpfr_sqrt` 没有通过精确检查的行；它不参与比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:49
msgid "Without the MPFR headers the stage runs with the integer oracle only and says so; it is part of `just gate interval`, not of `just pr`."
msgstr "没有 MPFR 头文件时，这个阶段只用整数预言机运行并明说这一点；它属于 `just gate interval`，不属于 `just pr`。"

