msgid "[differential/ball_mpfr API](../../api/differential/ball_mpfr.md)"
msgstr "[differential/ball_mpfr API](../../api/differential/ball_mpfr.md)"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:54
msgid "[differential/ball_mpfr design](../../design/differential/ball_mpfr.md)"
msgstr "[differential/ball_mpfr 设计](../../design/differential/ball_mpfr.md)"

#: manual/tutorial/differential/ball_mpfr.md:55
