msgid "[differential tutorial](../differential.md) for the workflow."
msgstr "工作流见 [differential 教程](../differential.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/doc_examples.md:1
msgid "doc_examples tutorial"
msgstr "doc_examples 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/doc_examples.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to run and extend the executable examples in `tooling/src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md`."
msgstr "本页的目标是向维护者展示如何运行和扩展 `tooling/src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md` 中的可执行示例。"

#: manual/tutorial/doc_examples.md:8
msgid "run the whole documentation gate"
msgstr "运行完整的文档关卡"

#: manual/tutorial/doc_examples.md:9
