#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to use the coefficient kernel when they add or change a binary operation, and how to keep a change to it safe for every target. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`; the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页向维护者说明：在添加或修改二进制运算时如何使用系数内核，以及如何让对它的修改在所有目标上保持安全。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包；示例是为模块内部代码编写的，不会被手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:11
msgid "compute with exact coefficients in `bin_float`"
msgstr "在 `bin_float` 中用精确系数计算"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:11
