msgstr "运行内核测试"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:17
msgid "Use the kernel from bin_float"
msgstr "在 bin_float 中使用内核"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:19
msgid "`bin_float` imports the kernel and brings the names it uses into scope with `using` (in `kernel_imports.mbt`, and `kernel_imports_nonjs.mbt` for the names that exist only where a coefficient has 64-bit limbs):"
msgstr "`bin_float` 导入内核，并用 `using` 把用到的名字带入作用域（在 `kernel_imports.mbt` 中；只在系数有 64 位肢时才存在的名字在 `kernel_imports_nonjs.mbt` 中）："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:28
msgid "A `BinFloat` stores its coefficient as a private `Coeff` field. The public type `BinCoeff` is a newtype over it (`value.0` unwraps it and `BinCoeff(c)` wraps a result), so the kernel type shows in a public interface only as the field of `BinCoeff`, which is opaque outside the module, and the wrapping costs neither an allocation nor a call. A typical use computes the exact quotient and remainder and leaves rounding to `bin_float`:"
msgstr "`BinFloat` 把系数存为私有的 `Coeff` 字段。公共类型 `BinCoeff` 是其上的 newtype（`value.0` 解包，`BinCoeff(c)` 包装结果），因此内核类型在公共接口中只作为 `BinCoeff` 的字段出现，而它在模块之外是不透明的，并且包装既不产生分配也不产生调用。典型用法是计算精确的商和余数，把舍入留给 `bin_float`："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:44
#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:43
msgid "Decide where new code belongs"
msgstr "决定新代码该放在哪里"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:46
msgid "Put code in the kernel when it is a function from coefficients (and plain integers) to coefficients or integers. Keep it in `bin_float` when it mentions a rounding mode, a precision, an exponent, a class, a flag or a `BinFloat`. The test is simple: the function must give the same answer for the same integers whoever calls it. `tools/check_imports.py` enforces the dependency half of the rule: the kernel imports nothing of this module."
msgstr "当代码是从系数（和普通整数）到系数或整数的函数时，放进内核。当它涉及舍入模式、精度、指数、类别、标志或 `BinFloat` 时，留在 `bin_float`。判断很简单：无论谁调用，对相同的整数函数必须给出相同的答案。`tools/check_imports.py` 强制执行规则的依赖部分：内核不导入本模块的任何东西。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:53
#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:54
msgid "Change the kernel"
msgstr "修改内核"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:55
msgid "Write the change as an exact integer function."
msgstr "把修改写成精确的整数函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:56
msgid "Add or extend a white-box test next to the others in the package that compares the result with `BigInt` at the limb boundaries (64, 128 and 192 bits), at the threshold lengths of every target, and on operands of ones, powers of two and sparse limbs."
msgstr "在包内与其他测试放在一起添加或扩展白盒测试：在肢边界（64、128 和 192 位）、每个目标的阈值长度处，以及全 1、2 的幂和稀疏肢的操作数上，与 `BigInt` 比较结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:60
msgid "Run `just bin-kernel-ci`, then `just gate binary 3` and `just gate interval 3`."
msgstr "运行 `just bin-kernel-ci`，然后运行 `just gate binary 3` 和 `just gate interval 3`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:61
msgid "Measure retired instructions with the benchmark rows of the pull request against the previous build; a change that helps one operation and slows another needs a reason in the pull request."
msgstr "用拉取请求的基准行与之前的构建比较已退休指令数；若修改使一个运算变快而另一个变慢，需要在拉取请求中说明原因。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:65
#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:67
msgid "Tune a threshold"
msgstr "调整阈值"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:67
msgid "The crossovers between schoolbook, Karatsuba, Toom-3, the NTT, Knuth's division and Burnikel-Ziegler live in `coeff_thresholds_native.mbt`, `_llvm`, `_wasm` and `_wasm_gc`; `moon.pkg` selects the file by target. JavaScript has no kernel: its `Coeff` is a host `bigint`. A threshold only changes which exact algorithm runs. Change it with paired old and new builds on the target, and keep the dispatch tests that cross every threshold exactly. The cutoffs of the elementary functions (`binary_exp_burst_min_precision` and its siblings) are thresholds of `bin_float`, in `elementary_thresholds_<target>.mbt`."
msgstr "朴素乘法、Karatsuba、Toom-3、NTT、Knuth 除法和 Burnikel-Ziegler 之间的分界点位于 `coeff_thresholds_native.mbt`、`_llvm`、`_wasm` 和 `_wasm_gc` 中；`moon.pkg` 按目标选择文件。JavaScript 没有内核：它的 `Coeff` 是宿主 `bigint`。阈值只改变运行哪个精确算法。请在目标上用新旧构建配对来修改，并保留恰好跨过每个阈值的分派测试。初等函数的分界点（`binary_exp_burst_min_precision` 及其同类）是 `bin_float` 的阈值，位于 `elementary_thresholds_<target>.mbt`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:76
#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:76
msgid "Run the tests"
msgstr "运行测试"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/bin_kernel.md:83
msgid "The `internal/bin_kernel` tests carry the algorithm cross-checks, the dispatch tests and the regression digests that used to live in `bin_float`. `bin_float` keeps the tests that need a `BinFloat`."
msgstr "`internal/bin_kernel` 的测试包含原先位于 `bin_float` 的算法交叉检查、分派测试和回归摘要。`bin_float` 保留需要 `BinFloat` 的测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:1
msgid "internal/conformance tutorial"
msgstr "internal/conformance 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to help maintainers who add or change a conformance frontend: it shows how a frontend records per-case results, summarizes a run, splits it into shards and merges the shards back, using the shared model of `internal/conformance`. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`, so the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页的目标是帮助添加或修改符合性前端的维护者：介绍前端如何借助 `internal/conformance` 的共享模型记录每个用例的结果、汇总一次运行、将其拆分为分片并把各分片合并回来。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包，因此这些示例是为模块内部代码编写的，不会由手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:12
msgid "record the outcome of one case"
msgstr "记录单个用例的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:13
msgid "say why a case was not run"
msgstr "说明某个用例为何未被运行"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:14
msgid "count a run"
msgstr "统计一次运行"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:15
msgid "run one shard of a corpus"
msgstr "运行语料的一个分片"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:16
msgid "combine shard summaries"
msgstr "合并分片摘要"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:17
