#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:1
msgid "internal/decimal_kernel tutorial"
msgstr "internal/decimal_kernel 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to use the shared coefficient kernel when they add or change a decimal operation, and how to keep a change to it safe for both standards. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`; the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页的目标是向维护者说明：在添加或修改十进制运算时如何使用共享的系数内核，以及如何让对它的修改对两个标准都是安全的。该包属于 `Luna-Flow/floating` 内部；示例是为模块内的代码写的，不由手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:11
msgid "compute with exact coefficients in `decimal` or `decimal_gda`"
msgstr "在 `decimal` 或 `decimal_gda` 中对精确系数做运算"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:11
msgid "[the `dec_coeff_*` functions](#use-the-kernel-from-a-decimal-package)"
msgstr "[`dec_coeff_*` 函数](#use-the-kernel-from-a-decimal-package)"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:14
msgid "[kernel or finalizer](#decide-where-new-code-belongs)"
msgstr "[内核还是最终化例程](#decide-where-new-code-belongs)"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:17
msgid "Use the kernel from a decimal package"
msgstr "在十进制包中使用内核"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:19
msgid "Both packages import the kernel and bring the names they use into scope with `using`:"
msgstr "两个包都导入内核，并用 `using` 把用到的名字引入作用域："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:31
msgid "A `Decimal` stores its coefficient as a private `DecCoeff` field, so the type never appears in the public interface of the package. A typical use builds the exact quotient and remainder, and leaves the rounding decision to the package:"
msgstr "`Decimal` 把系数存为私有的 `DecCoeff` 字段，所以该类型从不出现在包的公开接口中。典型的用法是构造精确的商和余数，把舍入决策留给包自己："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:45
msgid "Put code in the kernel when it is a function from coefficients (and plain integers) to coefficients or integers, and when `decimal` and `decimal_gda` would compute it identically. Keep it in the decimal package when it mentions a rounding mode, a precision, an exponent range, a flag, a trap, a `Decimal` or a context, because those are where the two standards differ. The test is simple: the function must give the same answer if the same integers are fed to it from either standard. `tools/check_imports.py` enforces the dependency half of the rule (the kernel cannot import `decimal` or `decimal_gda`)."
msgstr "当代码是从系数（以及普通整数）到系数或整数的函数，并且 `decimal` 与 `decimal_gda` 会以相同方式计算它时，把它放进内核。当它涉及舍入模式、精度、指数范围、标志、陷阱、`Decimal` 或上下文时，把它留在十进制包里，因为这些正是两个标准不同的地方。判断很简单：把同样的整数从任何一个标准送进去，这个函数必须给出同样的答案。`tools/check_imports.py` 强制执行规则中关于依赖的那一半（内核不能导入 `decimal` 或 `decimal_gda`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:56
msgid "Write the change as an exact integer function and keep it free of clauses: no `if` on a standard, no hidden state."
msgstr "把改动写成精确的整数函数，并且不带条件子句：不对标准做 `if` 判断，也没有隐藏状态。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:58
msgid "Add or extend a white-box test in `coeff_kernel_wbtest.mbt` that compares the result with `BigInt` at the limb boundaries (9, 18, 19, 27 digits), at the threshold lengths of every target, and on operands of nines, powers of ten and sparse limbs."
msgstr "在 `coeff_kernel_wbtest.mbt` 中添加或扩展白盒测试，在 limb 边界（9、18、19、27 位）、每个目标平台的阈值长度，以及全 9、十的幂和稀疏 limb 的操作数上，把结果与 `BigInt` 比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:62
msgid "Run `just decimal-kernel-ci`, then the package tests and the two gates: `just gate decimal 3` and `just gate decimal_gda 3`."
msgstr "运行 `just decimal-kernel-ci`，然后运行包测试和两个门禁：`just gate decimal 3` 与 `just gate decimal_gda 3`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:64
msgid "Measure both packages. A change that helps one standard and slows the other needs a reason in the pull request."
msgstr "在两个包上都做测量。若一次改动对一个标准有利而拖慢另一个，需要在拉取请求中给出理由。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:69
msgid "The crossovers between schoolbook, Karatsuba, Toom-3, the NTT, Burnikel–Ziegler and Newton division live in `coeff_thresholds_native.mbt`, `_llvm`, `_wasm`, `_wasm_gc` and `_js`; `moon.pkg` selects the file by target. A threshold only changes which exact algorithm runs. Change it with paired old/new builds on the target, for both `decimal` and `decimal_gda`, and keep the dispatch tests that cross every threshold exactly."
msgstr "教科书算法、Karatsuba、Toom-3、NTT、Burnikel–Ziegler 与 Newton 除法之间的交叉点位于 `coeff_thresholds_native.mbt`、`_llvm`、`_wasm`、`_wasm_gc` 和 `_js` 中；`moon.pkg` 按目标平台选择文件。阈值只改变运行哪种精确算法。修改时要在目标平台上用成对的新旧构建，对 `decimal` 和 `decimal_gda` 都测量，并保留恰好跨越每个阈值的分派测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/decimal_kernel.md:83
msgid "The `internal/decimal_kernel` tests carry the algorithm cross-checks that used to be duplicated in the two decimal packages. The decimal packages keep the tests that need a `Decimal`."
msgstr "`internal/decimal_kernel` 的测试承载着此前在两个十进制包中重复的算法交叉检验。十进制包保留需要 `Decimal` 的测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:1
msgid "internal/runner_cli tutorial"
msgstr "internal/runner_cli 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to write a conformance runner in `cli/` with the shared helpers of `internal/runner_cli`: parse the common options, collect and read corpus files, report diagnostics, print a JSON summary and choose the exit code. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`; the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页的目标是向维护者展示如何借助 `internal/runner_cli` 的共享辅助函数在 `cli/` 中编写符合性运行器：解析通用选项、收集并读取语料文件、报告诊断、打印 JSON 摘要并选择退出码。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包；这些示例是为模块内部代码编写的，不会由手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:12
msgid "parse `--json` and the shard options"
msgstr "解析 `--json` 和分片选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:13
msgid "expand files and directories into a sorted corpus list"
msgstr "把文件和目录展开为排序后的语料列表"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:14
msgid "read a corpus file with a usage-style error"
msgstr "读取语料文件，出错时给出用法类错误"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:15
msgid "print a diagnostic as `file:line:column: message`"
msgstr "以 `file:line:column: message` 格式打印诊断"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:16
msgid "print a stable machine-readable summary"
msgstr "打印稳定的机器可读摘要"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:17
msgid "add my own options"
msgstr "添加自己的选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:18
msgid "choose the exit code"
msgstr "选择退出码"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:18
msgid "[the exit-code convention](#follow-the-exit-code-convention)"
msgstr "[退出码约定](#follow-the-exit-code-convention)"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:29
msgid "Inside the module, import the helpers and a frontend:"
msgstr "在模块内部导入这些辅助函数和一个前端："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:38
msgid "A minimal runner (`run` receives the whole argument vector, program name first):"
msgstr "一个最小的运行器（`run` 接收完整的参数向量，程序名在首位）："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:100
msgid "The runner is an ordinary function, so a test can check its exit status without a process:"
msgstr "运行器是一个普通函数，所以测试无需进程即可检查其退出状态："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:112
msgid "Follow the exit-code convention"
msgstr "遵循退出码约定"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:114
msgid "All runners in `cli/` use the same codes, which `tools/*.py` relies on:"
msgstr "`cli/` 中的所有运行器都使用相同的退出码，`tools/*.py` 依赖于此："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:118
msgid "every executed case passed (and, in strict mode, nothing was unsupported)"
msgstr "所有已执行的用例都通过（并且在严格模式下没有不支持的用例）"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:119
msgid "at least one case failed, or strict mode found unsupported cases (`gda-expr` also counts legacy rows)"
msgstr "至少一个用例失败，或严格模式发现了不支持的用例（`gda-expr` 还会计入 legacy 行）"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:120
msgid "usage error, unreadable file, or parse diagnostic"
msgstr "用法错误、文件无法读取或解析诊断"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:122
msgid "Add a runner-specific option"
msgstr "添加运行器专用选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:124
msgid "`parse_common_options` leaves every argument it does not know in `remaining()`, in order. Parse your own options from that array and treat the rest as paths. Pass `allow_shard=false` if your runner cannot shard; the shard options then stay in `remaining()` and your parser should reject them as unknown."
msgstr "`parse_common_options` 会把它不认识的所有参数按顺序留在 `remaining()` 中。从该数组中解析你自己的选项，其余的视为路径。如果你的运行器不能分片，请传入 `allow_shard=false`；此时分片选项会保留在 `remaining()` 中，你的解析器应将其作为未知选项拒绝。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:130
msgid "Keep output machine-readable"
msgstr "保持输出机器可读"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:132
msgid "Print exactly one JSON object per invocation when `--json` is given. Build it with `json_object` so the key order is the order you list, and use `json_int` for counts so they print as integers."
msgstr "给出 `--json` 时，每次调用只打印一个 JSON 对象。用 `json_object` 构造它，使键的顺序与你列出的顺序一致，并对计数使用 `json_int`，使其打印为整数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:138
msgid "The four runners in `cli/` are complete examples: [gda_expr_cli](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md), [itl_expr_cli](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md), [mpfr_expr_cli](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and [testfloat_expr_cli](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/` 中的四个运行器都是完整的示例：[gda_expr_cli](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md)、[itl_expr_cli](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md)、[mpfr_expr_cli](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) 和 [testfloat_expr_cli](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:143
msgid "Build the native dispatcher with `sh tools/run_moon_clean_exec.sh run --release --target native tooling/src/cli -- --help`."
msgstr "用 `sh tools/run_moon_clean_exec.sh run --release --target native tooling/src/cli -- --help` 构建 native 分发器。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:145
msgid "Run the helper tests from a workspace that contains the module: `moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating-tools/internal/runner_cli`."
msgstr "在包含该模块的工作区中运行辅助函数的测试：`moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating-tools/internal/runner_cli`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:150
msgid "**Program name.** `parse_common_options` skips `arguments[0]`. Pass the full vector, not a slice without the program name, or the first real argument is lost."
msgstr "**程序名。** `parse_common_options` 会跳过 `arguments[0]`。请传入完整的向量，而不是去掉程序名的切片，否则第一个真正的参数会丢失。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:153
msgid "**Directories are not searched recursively.** `collect_files` lists only the direct entries of a directory."
msgstr "**不递归搜索目录。** `collect_files` 只列出目录的直接条目。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:155
msgid "**Named files must have the suffix.** A file argument without the suffix is an error (`not a SUFFIX file: P`), so a mistyped name cannot pass as an empty run."
msgstr "**指定的文件必须带有后缀。** 没有该后缀的文件参数是一个错误（`not a SUFFIX file: P`），因此拼错的名称不会被当作一次空运行而通过。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:158
msgid "**Option values use MoonBit integer syntax.** `0x10` and `1_000` are accepted as 16 and 1000; an argument starting with `--` is never taken as a value, so `--shard-count --json` is a missing count."
msgstr "**选项值使用 MoonBit 整数语法。** `0x10` 和 `1_000` 分别被接受为 16 和 1000；以 `--` 开头的参数绝不会被当作值，因此 `--shard-count --json` 属于缺少计数值。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:161
msgid "**Native only in practice.** File access goes through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the runners are built and run on the native target."
msgstr "**实际上仅支持 native。** 文件访问经由 `moonbitlang/x/fs`；运行器在 native 目标上构建和运行。"

