#: manual/verification.md:30
msgid "`nightly.yml` runs `just gate` for `quick`, `decimal`, `decimal_gda`, `binary` and `interval` as parallel jobs every night and on demand. It caches the SHA-256-pinned upstream corpora by manifest hash (the hashes are still verified after download) and uploads each `summary.json` as an artifact, so the published results are reproduced outside maintainers' machines. It also runs the unit tests of the whole workspace on `js`, `wasm` and `wasm-gc` (the pull-request gate tests native and only type-checks these; `QUICK_TEST_TARGETS` in `tools/run_ci.py` is the one line that adds a target to it), and, on an arm64 macOS runner, the tests of `internal/bin_kernel` and `bin_float` on native with the row primitives portable (`LUNA_FLOATING_PORTABLE=1`), forced to the C tier (`LUNA_FLOATING_LIMBS=c`) and in the default state; `tools/check_limbs_tier.py` fails the job when the runner is not arm64, a state reports another tier than expected, or the switch did not take (`enabled=false` in the portable state, `enabled=true` in the others). The Linux runner is x86-64, so nothing else executes the arm64 code. `wasm-gc` runs the whole workspace except what needs `moonbitlang/async`, which has no wasm-gc runtime (its module initialiser is rejected by the runtime at validation); the workflow states the reason next to the job."
msgstr "`nightly.yml` 每晚并按需把 `quick`、`decimal`、`decimal_gda`、`binary` 和 `interval` 作为并行作业运行 `just gate`。它按清单哈希缓存由 SHA-256 固定的上游语料（下载后仍会校验哈希），并把每个 `summary.json` 作为制品上传，使发布的结果能在维护者的机器之外复现。它还在 `js`、`wasm` 和 `wasm-gc` 上运行整个工作区的单元测试（拉取请求的闸门对这些目标只做类型检查，只在 native 上测试；`tools/run_ci.py` 中的 `QUICK_TEST_TARGETS` 是给闸门加一个目标的那一行），并在 arm64 macOS 运行器上，以行原语为可移植（`LUNA_FLOATING_PORTABLE=1`）、强制使用 C 层（`LUNA_FLOATING_LIMBS=c`）和默认状态三种方式，在 native 上运行 `internal/bin_kernel` 和 `bin_float` 的测试；当运行器不是 arm64、某个状态报告的层级不是预期的层级，或开关未生效（可移植状态下为 `enabled=false`，其余状态下为 `enabled=true`）时，`tools/check_limbs_tier.py` 会使该作业失败。Linux 运行器是 x86-64，所以没有别的东西会执行 arm64 代码。`wasm-gc` 运行整个工作区，只排除需要 `moonbitlang/async` 的部分，该包没有 wasm-gc 运行时（其模块初始化函数在验证时被运行时拒绝）；工作流在该作业旁边写明了原因。"

#: manual/verification.md:49
msgid "`docs.yml` runs the organization's `lunadoc check` workflow."
msgstr "`docs.yml` 运行组织的 `lunadoc check` 工作流。"

#: manual/verification.md:50
msgid "`publish.yml` builds, runs the documentation gate, the format check, an all-target `--deny-warn` check and the tests, then publishes to mooncakes."
msgstr "`publish.yml` 执行构建，运行文档关卡、格式检查、全目标 `--deny-warn` 检查和测试，然后发布到 mooncakes。"

#: manual/verification.md:53
msgid "Quick-gate table of the π-inverse rows"
msgstr "π 反函数行的快速门禁表"

#: manual/verification.md:55
msgid "The rows of `asinpi`, `acospi`, `atanpi` and `atan2pi` are the largest table of the repository. The quick gate (`just pr`, the native test stage of CI) compiles all 9,691 of them into `library/src/decimal/elementary_pi_inverse_rows_wbtest.mbt` (2.2 MB of source), and the same rows are data (`testdata/decimal/ieee/rows/pi_inverse.txt`, `mpfr-decimal-random-v2` rows, see `tooling/src/frontend/mpfr_expr`) that `just gate decimal` and the nightly run feed to the release-built conformance CLI on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript. Both compare value, cohort (`total_order_compare`) and all flags exactly."
msgstr "`asinpi`、`acospi`、`atanpi` 与 `atan2pi` 的行是仓库中最大的表。快速门禁（`just pr`，即 CI 的原生测试阶段）把全部 9,691 行编译进 `library/src/decimal/elementary_pi_inverse_rows_wbtest.mbt`（2.2 MB 源码）；同样的行也是数据（`testdata/decimal/ieee/rows/pi_inverse.txt`，`mpfr-decimal-random-v2` 行，见 `tooling/src/frontend/mpfr_expr`），由 `just gate decimal` 和夜间运行交给 release 构建的一致性 CLI，在原生、Wasm、Wasm-GC 和 JavaScript 上执行。两者都精确比较值、同值类（`total_order_compare`）和全部标志。"

#: manual/verification.md:64
msgid "This was not always so. While about 50 `atan2pi` rows with an operand of `1E-1999996` cost 90 % of a 466 s debug run, the quick gate compiled only a deterministic sample. After the `atan2pi` path for tiny operands was fixed the full table runs in 2.4 s of a debug native build (4,416 sampled rows: 0.5 s) and adds about 1.4 s to the build, under the 5 s the quick gate allows it, so the sample was dropped. The mechanism stays in the generator (`tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py`) as an option: `--sample-step N` compiles every row that is not the rounding of an MPFR enclosure (the exact Niven values and the other cases decided by exact rational arithmetic) and, of the MPFR rows stratified by (operation, rounding mode), one row in N, taken equidistantly in generation order (a stratum shorter than N keeps its middle row). The data file is always the full table."
msgstr "过去并非如此。当时约 50 条操作数为 `1E-1999996` 的 `atan2pi` 行占去 466 秒 debug 运行的 90%，快速门禁只编译一份确定性抽样。修复 `atan2pi` 对极小操作数的路径之后，全表在 debug 原生构建下 2.4 秒即可跑完（4,416 行的抽样为 0.5 秒），构建只多约 1.4 秒，低于快速门禁允许的 5 秒，因此抽样被取消。该机制仍作为生成器（`tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py`）的选项保留：`--sample-step N` 编译所有不是 MPFR 包络舍入结果的行（精确 Niven 值和由精确有理数运算决定的其他情形），并对按（运算，舍入模式）分层的 MPFR 行，按生成顺序等距地每 N 行取一行（短于 N 的层保留其中间行）。数据文件始终是全表。"

