#: manual/verification.md:85
msgid "`python3 tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py --check` fails if either table is stale or if the compiled table is not a subset of the full table, and `--strata` prints the counts of every stratum. Go back to a sample (start with `--sample-step 8` and set `SAMPLE_STEP` in the generator) when the debug native run of the `pi inverse generated rows` test exceeds about 5 s again: measure it with `python3 tools/native_test_timing.py --package library/src/decimal`, not by assumption."
msgstr "若任一表已过期，或编译进去的表不是全表的子集，`python3 tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py --check` 即失败，`--strata` 则打印每一层的行数。当 `pi inverse generated rows` 测试在 debug 原生构建下的运行再次超过约 5 秒时，回到抽样（先用 `--sample-step 8`，并在生成器中设置 `SAMPLE_STEP`）：用 `python3 tools/native_test_timing.py --package library/src/decimal` 测量，而不是凭假设。"

