#: manual/verification.md:101
msgid "`decimal` is the independent IEEE decimal corpus; `decimal_gda` is the GDA `.decTest` corpus; `binary` combines TestFloat and MPFR sources; `interval` uses ITF1788."
msgstr "`decimal` 是独立的 IEEE 十进制语料；`decimal_gda` 是 GDA `.decTest` 语料；`binary` 组合了 TestFloat 与 MPFR 数据源；`interval` 使用 ITF1788。"

#: manual/verification.md:105
msgid "`smoke` runs committed fixtures without downloading anything. `plan` prints the deterministic task list. `fetch` verifies pinned provenance before installing ignored data below `.tmp/`. `run` executes the chosen suite. Backend-specific filters, phases, targets, strict mode, sharding and JSON output are documented in `testdata/bin_float/README.md`, `testdata/decimal/README.md` (IEEE `decimal`), `testdata/decimal_gda/README.md` and `testdata/interval/README.md`."
msgstr "`smoke` 运行已提交的 fixture，不下载任何内容。`plan` 打印确定性的任务列表。`fetch` 先校验固定的来源，再将被忽略的数据安装到 `.tmp/` 之下。`run` 执行所选的测试套件。各后端特有的过滤器、阶段、目标、严格模式、分片以及 JSON 输出见 `testdata/bin_float/README.md`、`testdata/decimal/README.md`（IEEE `decimal`）、`testdata/decimal_gda/README.md` 与 `testdata/interval/README.md`。"

#: manual/verification.md:112
msgid "Published claims"
msgstr "已发布的结论"

#: manual/verification.md:114
msgid "**GDA.** All 64,986 legal executable scalar rows of the 144-file `official` corpus pass, and all 16,124 legal rows of `official0`. The 141 `#` placeholder or non-scalar rows are diagnostic exclusions, not unsupported legal behaviour."
msgstr "**GDA。** 144 个文件的 `official` 语料中全部 64,986 条合法可执行标量行均通过，`official0` 的全部 16,124 条合法行也均通过。141 条 `#` 占位行或非标量行属于诊断性排除，而非未支持的合法行为。"

#: manual/verification.md:118
msgid "**Binary.** The TestFloat level-1 matrix (seed 1) has 254,280,504 vectors in 534 tasks over binary16/32/64/128: 7,461,360 for add, subtract, multiply, divide and square root, 52,632 for the format conversions (each of the four formats to each of the other three, 66 tasks), and 246,766,512 for the IEEE operations mulAdd (245,329,920 of them), rem, roundToInt, the conversions to 32- and 64-bit signed and unsigned integers, and the comparisons eq, le, lt, eq_signaling, le_quiet and lt_quiet. It runs five rounding directions where the operation uses one, both tininess modes for the arithmetic operations, mulAdd and the narrowing format conversions, and both exact and inexact variants for roundToInt and the conversions. Invalid integer conversions are compared by flags only, because SoftFloat returns platform-specific sentinel values where the API returns `None`. The gate judges the operation, not the operation followed by a rounding of the harness: the result is packed into the bit fields of its format by the front end itself and a result that is not a number of the format fails the vector; the flags compared are the operation's own. The MPFR part adds the 1,055 executable rows of the pinned square-root data, 1,740 hash-pinned witnesses covering 29 elementary operations at binary32/64/128 precision under the five `BinaryRoundingMode` values, and the decimal character conversions of IEEE 754-2019 §5.12: 3,699 `mpfr_strtofr` witnesses (decimal text to binary at 11 to 200 bits, including exact halfway points and the exponent limits) and 2,688 `mpfr_get_str` witnesses (fixed digit counts, exact ties and the shortest round-trip digit count)."
msgstr "**二进制。** TestFloat level-1 矩阵（种子 1）在 binary16/32/64/128 上共有 534 个任务、254,280,504 个向量：其中加、减、乘、除和平方根占 7,461,360 个，格式转换（四种格式中每一种到其他三种，66 个任务）占 52,632 个，其余 246,766,512 个用于 IEEE 运算 mulAdd（占其中 245,329,920 个）、rem、roundToInt、到 32 位与 64 位有符号及无符号整数的转换，以及比较运算 eq、le、lt、eq_signaling、le_quiet 和 lt_quiet。对于使用舍入方向的运算，测试覆盖五种舍入方向；算术运算、mulAdd 和窄化的格式转换覆盖两种微小性模式；roundToInt 和各转换覆盖精确与不精确两种变体。无效的整数转换只比较标志，因为在 API 返回 `None` 的地方，SoftFloat 返回的是平台相关的哨兵值。该关卡判定的是运算本身，而不是运算之后再经过测试框架舍入的结果：结果由前端自己打包为其格式的位字段，不是该格式中的数的结果会使向量失败；比较的标志是运算自身的标志。MPFR 部分另外加入了固定版本平方根数据中的 1,055 条可执行行，以及 1,740 个以哈希固定的见证数据，覆盖 29 种初等运算，精度为 binary32/64/128，涵盖全部五种 `BinaryRoundingMode` 值。此外MPFR 部分还加入了十进制字符转换（IEEE 754-2019 §5.12）：3,699 个 `mpfr_strtofr` 见证（11 至 200 位的十进制文本转二进制，含恰好的中点和指数边界）与 2,688 个 `mpfr_get_str` 见证（固定位数、恰好的平局和最短往返位数）。"

#: manual/verification.md:140
msgid "**IEEE decimal.** Committed decimal32/64/128 DPD and BID fixtures cover encoding, special values, flags, core arithmetic and all 1,024 DPD declets on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript; LLVM is outside this gate. A committed elementary oracle adds 3,060 rows computed from 768-bit MPFR enclosures under the five IEEE decimal rounding-direction attributes."
msgstr "**IEEE 十进制。** 已提交的 decimal32/64/128 DPD 与 BID fixture 覆盖编码、特殊值、标志、核心算术以及全部 1,024 个 DPD declet，在 native、Wasm、Wasm-GC 和 JavaScript 上运行；LLVM 不在此关卡范围内。一份已提交的初等函数判定数据另外加入了 3,060 行，由 768 位 MPFR 包络在 IEEE 的五种十进制舍入方向属性下计算得到。"

#: manual/verification.md:145
msgid "**Interval.** The strict ITF1788 phases pass 6,632/6,632 selected cases: sets, relations, numeric observations, cancellation, arithmetic, elementary-core, exponentials and logarithms, general power, trigonometric, hyperbolic, inverse trigonometric, `atan2`, FMA, integer power, extrema, the integer functions, reverse multiplication and the algebraic and trigonometric reverse functions, `powRev1` and `powRev2`. `atan2Rev1` and `atan2Rev2` have no ITF1788 cases; the gate runs 16,260 generated cases of ours (`testdata/interval/generated`, written and validated by `tools/itl_atan2_reverse_oracle.py`) as the separate `atan2-reverse` phase."
msgstr "**区间。** 严格 ITF1788 阶段通过了全部 6,632/6,632 个选定用例：集合、关系、数值观测、消去、算术、初等核心、指数与对数、一般幂、三角函数、双曲函数、反三角函数、`atan2`、FMA、整数幂、极值、整数函数、反向乘法以及代数和三角反向函数、`powRev1` 与 `powRev2`。`atan2Rev1` 与 `atan2Rev2` 没有 ITF1788 用例；门禁运行 16,260 个我们自己生成的用例（`testdata/interval/generated`，由 `tools/itl_atan2_reverse_oracle.py` 写出并验证），作为单独的 `atan2-reverse` 阶段。"

#: manual/verification.md:152
msgid "The committed smoke fixtures that `just pr` runs are subsets of these: the binary smoke, for example, has 8,514 rows (288 TestFloat vectors, 3 square-root witnesses, 96 integer-power witnesses, 1,740 elementary witnesses, 3,699 `strtofr` witnesses and 2,688 decimal output witnesses). These counts are read from the manifests (`testdata/bin_float/corpora.json` and `testdata/bin_float/smoke/manifest.json`) by `tools/check_manual_counts.py`, which runs with the unit tests of `just pr` and fails when a page and a manifest disagree."
msgstr "随 `just pr` 运行的提交冒烟数据是上述语料的子集：例如二进制冒烟数据有 8,514 行（288 个 TestFloat 向量、3 个平方根证据值、96 个整数幂证据值、1,740 个初等函数证据值、3,699 个 `strtofr` 证据值和 2,688 个十进制输出证据值）。这些数目由 `tools/check_manual_counts.py` 从清单（`testdata/bin_float/corpora.json` 和 `testdata/bin_float/smoke/manifest.json`）中读出，它随 `just pr` 的单元测试运行，页面与清单不一致时失败。"

#: manual/verification.md:161
msgid "These are finite claims. They do not imply every IEEE 754 or IEEE 1788 operation, arbitrary resource sizes, every NaN payload policy, or future corpus revisions. The per-package [binary](./conformance/bin_float.md), [IEEE decimal](./conformance/decimal.md), [GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md) and [interval](./conformance/ball_float.md) conformance pages state the exact matrix and its exclusions."
msgstr "这些都是有限的结论。它们并不意味着覆盖 IEEE 754 或 IEEE 1788 的每一个运算、任意的资源规模、每一种 NaN 载荷策略，或将来的语料版本。各包的[二进制](./conformance/bin_float.md)、[IEEE 十进制](./conformance/decimal.md)、[GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md)和[区间](./conformance/ball_float.md)符合性页面给出了确切的矩阵及其排除项。"

#: manual/verification.md:168
msgid "External performance baseline"
msgstr "外部性能基线"

#: manual/verification.md:170
msgid "`just bench external run` times `floating` against MPFR and libmpdec on the same operands and records the ratios; every `floating` result is first compared with the result of the reference library for the same operand. The method, machine and results are on the [external baseline page](./performance/bench/external.md). It is evidence about speed, not a conformance gate, and is not part of `just pr`."
msgstr "`just bench external run` 在相同的操作数上对 `floating` 与 MPFR 和 libmpdec 计时并记录比值；每个 `floating` 结果都先与参考库对同一操作数的结果比较。方法、机器和结果见[外部基线页面](./performance/bench/external.md)。它是关于速度的证据，不是一致性门禁，也不属于 `just pr`。"

#: manual/verification.md:176
msgid "Interval differential stage against MPFR"
msgstr "对照 MPFR 的区间差分阶段"

#: manual/verification.md:178
msgid "`python3 tools/ball_diff.py run` checks `BallFloat` against MPFR with no timing. A seeded generator writes rows of operand intervals for `add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div`, `sqr`, `sqrt`, `fma`, `exp` and `ln`; `tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c` computes the tightest result of every row with MPFR directly (one directed rounding per bound, in the exponent range and with the gradual underflow of `bin_float`, defined once in `tools/mpfr_ours.h`); the test of `tooling/src/differential/ball_mpfr` runs the rows on `BallFloat` and compares both bounds as canonical text. IEEE 1788-2015 12.10.2 makes the first seven operations tightest, so the bounds must be equal; `exp` and `ln` are only required to be valid, so their result must enclose the tightest one and must not be wider than 1,024 units of the last place (the standard says \"should be accurate\"), with `exp` rows at the overflow and underflow thresholds and `ln` rows at the ends of the range. The classes of operands are ordinary values, results one unit from the overflow threshold on both sides, results and operands in the subnormal band, operands whose exponents differ by far more than the precision, operands with fewer bits than the precision, bounds with more bits than the precision (the ball rounds them outward), and intervals with a zero bound. A class that does not reach its band is an error of the generator, decided from the oracle's own flags. The stage is part of `just gate interval`. An oracle in Python integers, which shares nothing with MPFR, decides every arithmetic row with nothing but CPython and is the required one; MPFR decides all rows, `exp` and `ln` included, when its headers are found, and the two must agree on every arithmetic row. The report says which oracles ran and how many rows each decided, and on a machine without MPFR it lists the rows only MPFR decides as not checked. For `exp` and `ln` it also reports the excess over the tightest bound in units of the last place. A row that differs from MPFR today is listed with its issue in `tools/ball_diff_known.txt`; a new difference, or a listed row that agrees again, fails the run."
msgstr "`python3 tools/ball_diff.py run` 不计时地把 `BallFloat` 与 MPFR 对照。种子固定的生成器为 `add`、`sub`、`mul`、`div`、`sqr`、`sqrt`、`fma`、`exp`、`ln` 写出操作数区间的行；`tools/ball_mpfr_oracle.c` 直接用 MPFR 为每一行算出最紧的结果（每个端点一次定向舍入，使用 `bin_float` 的指数范围和渐进下溢，定义在 `tools/mpfr_ours.h` 里一次）；`tooling/src/differential/ball_mpfr` 的测试在 `BallFloat` 上运行这些行，并把两个端点按规范化文本比较。IEEE 1788-2015 12.10.2 要求前七种运算取最紧结果，所以端点必须相等；`exp` 和 `ln` 只要求有效，所以它们的结果必须包含最紧结果，并且不比它宽出 1,024 个末位单位（标准说它们应当是准确的），`exp` 的行在上溢和下溢阈值处，`ln` 的行在范围的两端。操作数分为：普通值、结果在上溢阈值两侧各差一个单位、结果和操作数落在次正规带、指数相差远超精度的操作数、有效位少于精度的操作数、位数多于精度的端点（区间向外取整）、以及带零端点的区间。某一类没有到达它要去的带，是生成器的错误，由预言机自己的标志判定。这个阶段是 `just gate interval` 的一部分。用 Python 整数写成的预言机与 MPFR 不共享任何东西，只需要 CPython 就能判定每一个算术行，是必需的那个；找到 MPFR 的头文件时，MPFR 判定所有行（包括 `exp` 和 `ln`），两者必须在每个算术行上一致。报告说明哪些预言机运行了、各判定了多少行；在没有 MPFR 的机器上，只有它能判定的行会被列为未检查。对 `exp` 和 `ln`，它还报告超出最紧端点的量，以末位单位计。今天与 MPFR 不同的行连同它的 issue 列在 `tools/ball_diff_known.txt` 里；出现新的差异，或某个已列出的行重新一致，运行都会失败。"

#: manual/verification.md:206
msgid "Randomized differential testing"
msgstr "随机差分测试"

#: manual/verification.md:208
msgid "The fixed corpora above check rows someone chose. The randomized campaign (`just random-diff`, [tutorial](./tutorial/differential.md), [design](./design/differential.md)) generates seeded cases and compares the library with two independent implementations: GNU MPFR 4.2.2 (GMP 6.3.0) for `bin_float` and libmpdec 4.0.0 (Python 3.13 `decimal`) for `decimal_gda` (the IEEE `decimal` package is checked against MPFR, below). Both are oracles, not specifications: every disagreement was read against IEEE 754-2019 or the General Decimal Arithmetic 1.70 text before it was called a bug."
msgstr "上面的固定语料检查的是某人选定的行。随机测试活动（`just random-diff`、[教程](./tutorial/differential.md)、[设计](./design/differential.md)）生成带种子的用例，并把库与两个独立实现比较：`bin_float` 对照 GNU MPFR 4.2.2（GMP 6.3.0），`decimal_gda` 对照 libmpdec 4.0.0（Python 3.13 的 `decimal`）（IEEE `decimal` 包对照 MPFR，见下）。两者都是预言机而不是规范：每一个不一致在被称为缺陷之前，都对照 IEEE 754-2019 或通用十进制算术 1.70 的文本读过。"

#: manual/verification.md:217
msgid "**What is varied.** Binary: output precisions 2 to 10,000 (a mix of small, format-sized, log-uniform and large), operand widths independent of the output precision, all five MPFR directions plus the nearest-away wrapper, unbounded contexts and bounded ones (binary16/32/64/128 ranges and random ranges) with both tininess rules, operand exponents at the overflow threshold, the smallest normal number and in the subnormal range, exact halfway and near-halfway results (precision one bit below the exact result), cancellation, alignment gaps around the precision, zeros, infinities and NaNs, decimal text in both directions (`strtofr` with exact halfway literals, `getstr` with 1 to 1,200 digits, the shortest round-trip form) and 28 elementary functions (including `pow`, `pown`, `rootn`, `hypot` and `atan2`). Decimal: decimal32/64/128 contexts and random GDA contexts (precision up to 5,000, Emax up to 999,999,999, all eight rounding modes, clamp on and off), the same structured operands, string conversion (`apply`, `tosci`, `toeng`) and `exp`, `ln`, `log10`, `power`. Every value and every flag (inexact, overflow, underflow, invalid, division by zero; the GDA conditions for decimal) is compared."
msgstr "**变化的内容。** 二进制：输出精度 2 到 10,000（小精度、格式大小、对数均匀和大精度混合），与输出精度无关的操作数宽度，全部五种 MPFR 方向加就近远离包装，无界上下文和有界上下文（binary16/32/64/128 范围与随机范围）以及两种 tininess 规则，位于上溢阈值、最小正规数和次正规范围内的操作数指数，精确平局和近平局结果（精度比精确结果少一位），抵消，围绕精度的对齐间隔，零、无穷和 NaN，两个方向的十进制文本（带精确平局字面量的 `strtofr`、1 到 1,200 位的 `getstr`、最短往返形式）以及 28 个初等函数（包括 `pow`、`pown`、`rootn`、`hypot` 和 `atan2`）。十进制：decimal32/64/128 上下文和随机 GDA 上下文（精度最高 5,000，Emax 最高 999,999,999，全部八种舍入模式，clamp 开与关），同样的结构化操作数，字符串转换（`apply`、`tosci`、`toeng`）以及 `exp`、`ln`、`log10`、`power`。每个值和每个标志（inexact、overflow、underflow、invalid、除零；十进制为 GDA 条件）都参与比较。"

#: manual/verification.md:235
msgid "**Reproducibility.** Case `I` of family `F` under seed `S` is a pure function of `(S, F, I)`; the seed of every run below is 20261118. Each run is recorded as mare_mark JSONL (validations per batch of 1,000 cases, delta-debugged failures, replay commands) and summarized in `summary.json` next to it. The record of a backend stays in `.tmp/random-diff/<run>/records-<backend>.jsonl`."
msgstr "**可重现性。** 种子 `S` 下族 `F` 的用例 `I` 是 `(S, F, I)` 的纯函数；下面每次运行的种子都是 20261118。每次运行都记录为 mare_mark JSONL（每批 1,000 个用例的验证、差分最小化的失败、重放命令），并在旁边的 `summary.json` 中汇总。每个后端的记录保存在 `.tmp/random-diff/<run>/records-<backend>.jsonl`。"

#: manual/verification.md:241
msgid "**Cases run, per operation and backend.** Native: 26,900,000 cases (28,900,000 executed, counting 2,000,000 `sqrt` cases made before the MPFR defect filter); Wasm, JavaScript and Wasm-GC: 2,730,000 each. Wasm-GC has no mare_mark runtime (the runner needs `moonbitlang/async`), so it ran the same corpora through the synchronous `floating-conformance` runner without the JSONL record. The three other backends ran the first 200,000 (binary) or 100,000 (`decimal_gda`) cases of each family of the native run, so their failing batches can be compared with it: Wasm and JavaScript fail on exactly the same batches as native within that range."
msgstr "**按运算和后端统计的用例数。** native：26,900,000 个用例（实际执行 28,900,000 个，包含在 MPFR 缺陷过滤之前运行的 2,000,000 个 `sqrt` 用例）；Wasm、JavaScript 和 Wasm-GC 各 2,730,000 个。Wasm-GC 没有 mare_mark 运行时（运行器需要 `moonbitlang/async`），所以它通过同步的 `floating-conformance` 运行器运行同样的语料，没有 JSONL 记录。其他三个后端运行的是 native 运行中每个族的前 200,000 个（二进制）或 100,000 个（十进制）用例，因此它们的失败批可以与 native 比较：在该范围内，Wasm 和 JavaScript 的失败批与 native 完全相同。"

