#: manual/verification.md:315
msgid "**Names.** The family prefixes `dec-` (`decimal_gda` against libmpdec) and `decm-` (IEEE `decimal` against MPFR), and the option `--decm`, are now `decimal_gda-`, `decimal-` and `--decimal`; the old spellings are deprecated aliases. The run logs below quote the commands as they were run."
msgstr "**名称。** 族前缀 `dec-`（`decimal_gda` 对照 libmpdec）和 `decm-`（IEEE `decimal` 对照 MPFR）以及选项 `--decm`，现在分别是 `decimal_gda-`、`decimal-` 和 `--decimal`；旧写法是已弃用的别名。下面的运行日志按当时运行的命令原样引用。"

#: manual/verification.md:320
msgid "**MPFR enclosures (decimal elementary functions)**, a third corpus (`mpfr-decimal-random-v2`, `just random-diff run --decimal`). The IEEE `decimal` package's elementary functions are checked against MPFR through certified enclosures, not single results: 2048-bit directed operand bounds, 768-bit directed results on every corner, one ulp of slack, both endpoints rounded to the context with Python `decimal`; a row exists only if the endpoints agree and the rounded value lies outside the enclosure (so exact results are not sampled here). Contexts are decimal32/64/128 and random ones (precision 1 to 120, exponent range up to ±20,000; since 0.12 only legal contexts: the five rounding directions of IEEE 754-2019 4.3, `e_min = 1 - e_max`, clamp, tininess before rounding; the campaign counts below are those of the runs before that change); operands are drawn so that results reach overflow, underflow and the subnormal range. Native: 559,979 cases, 20,000 for each of 28 functions (`exp exp2 exp10 expm1 sinh cosh ln log2 log10 log1p sin cos tan sinpi cospi tanpi atan tanh asinh asin acos atanh acosh pow hypot atan2 rootn pown`; `cospi` and `tanh` have a few candidates that never certify within eight attempts); Wasm, JavaScript and Wasm-GC: 55,996 each (the first 2,000 of every function)."
msgstr "**MPFR 包络（十进制初等函数）**，第三个语料（`mpfr-decimal-random-v2`，`just random-diff run --decimal`）。IEEE `decimal` 包的初等函数是通过经过认证的包络而不是单个结果来对照 MPFR 检查的：2048 位定向操作数界，在每个角点上取 768 位定向结果，再留一个 ulp 的余量，两个端点用 Python `decimal` 按上下文舍入；只有当两个端点一致且舍入值落在包络之外时才产生一行（所以这里不抽取精确结果）。上下文包括 decimal32/64/128 和随机上下文（精度 1 到 120，指数范围至 ±20,000；自 0.12 起只用合法的上下文：IEEE 754-2019 4.3 的五种舍入方向，`e_min = 1 - e_max`，clamp，舍入前的微小性；下面的运行次数是该改动之前的运行结果）；操作数的取法使结果能到达上溢、下溢和次正规范围。Native：559,979 个用例，28 个函数（`exp exp2 exp10 expm1 sinh cosh ln log2 log10 log1p sin cos tan sinpi cospi tanpi atan tanh asinh asin acos atanh acosh pow hypot atan2 rootn pown`）各 20,000 个；`cospi` 与 `tanh` 有少量候选在八次尝试内始终无法认证）；Wasm、JavaScript 和 Wasm-GC 各 55,996 个（每个函数的前 2,000 个）。"

#: manual/verification.md:335
msgid "**Outcome.**"
msgstr "**结果。**"

#: manual/verification.md:337
msgid "*Binary arithmetic, string conversion and `shortest`*: no disagreement in 16,500,000 native cases (plus 1,650,000 on each of the other three backends) apart from the MPFR defect below. Every one of the 5 rounding directions, both tininess rules, the exponent limits and the subnormal range were exercised; a mutation check (swapping the two tininess rules, or nearest-even with nearest-away, in the executor) fails 0.15% to 2.8% of the rows, so the rows that decide those cases are present."
msgstr "*二进制算术、字符串转换和 `shortest`*：在 16,500,000 个 native 用例中没有不一致（其他三个后端各另有 1,650,000 个），仅有下面的 MPFR 缺陷。全部 5 种舍入方向、两种 tininess 规则、指数极限和次正规范围都被覆盖；变异检查（在执行器中交换两种 tininess 规则，或交换就近偶与就近远离）使 0.15% 到 2.8% 的行失败，所以决定这些情形的行确实存在。"

#: manual/verification.md:344
msgid "*Decimal elementary functions against MPFR*: 26 of the 28 functions agree with MPFR in value, cohort and flags in every one of their 20,000 native cases, and the same rows pass on Wasm, JavaScript and Wasm-GC. Two disagreements, with the identical failing ids on all four backends: `atan2` returns the zero of an underflowed result with exponent 0 instead of the least exponent `e_min - p + 1` (54 of 20,000 rows, e.g. `atan2(1E-500, 9)` in decimal64 gives `0`, not `0E-398`; IEEE 754-2019 §5.2: an inexact result uses the cohort member of least possible exponent), and `exp` raises no Underflow and Subnormal for a result that underflows to the smallest subnormal when `precision = 1`, the non-standard `AfterRounding` tininess option is selected and the direction is `Up`, `Ceiling` or `ZeroFiveUp` (22 of 20,000 rows; the smallest subnormal equals the smallest normal number then, and the library's own after-rounding rule says the result is tiny; the standard rule for decimal formats, tininess before rounding, was correct). Both are reported separately and become regression rows when fixed."
msgstr "*十进制初等函数对照 MPFR*：28 个函数中的 26 个，在各自 20,000 个 native 用例里，值、cohort 和标志都与 MPFR 一致，同样的行在 Wasm、JavaScript 和 Wasm-GC 上也通过。有两处不一致，四个后端上失败的 id 完全相同：`atan2` 对下溢结果的零返回指数 0，而不是最小指数 `e_min - p + 1`（20,000 行中有 54 行，例如 decimal64 里 `atan2(1E-500, 9)` 给出 `0` 而不是 `0E-398`；IEEE 754-2019 §5.2：不精确的结果使用最小可能指数的 cohort 成员）；以及 `exp` 在 `precision = 1`、选用非标准的 `AfterRounding` tininess 选项、方向为 `Up`、`Ceiling` 或 `ZeroFiveUp` 时，对下溢到最小次正规数的结果不报 Underflow 与 Subnormal（20,000 行中有 22 行；此时最小次正规数等于最小正规数，而库自己的舍入后规则认为该结果是 tiny；十进制格式的标准规则，即舍入前检测 tininess，是正确的）。两者另行报告，修复后成为回归行。"

#: manual/verification.md:359
msgid "*Decimal `exp2m1`, `exp10m1`, `log2p1` and `log10p1`* ([#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)): families `decm-exp2m1`, `decm-exp10m1`, `decm-log2p1` and `decm-log10p1`, seed 20261118, 250,000 native cases each (1,000,000 in all) agree with MPFR in value, cohort and all eight flags, and so do 100,000 cases each on Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript (400,000 per target, 1,200,000 in all, 804 validated batches, run on 2026-11-19 with `just random-diff run --family decm-exp2m1 --family decm-exp10m1 --family decm-log2p1 --family decm-log10p1 --count 100000 --seed 20261118 --target wasm --target wasm-gc --target js`). On the final code the native 1,000,000 cases of seed 20261118 were run again (1,000 validated batches) and a second seed, 20261202, with 100,000 cases per function on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript (400,000 per target, 1,600,000 in all, 1,204 validated batches), both on 2026-11-19 and both without a disagreement. Exact results are not sampled here; they, the clusters near the integers and near -1, the tiny arguments and the tininess and clamp boundaries are the 10,673 rows of `library/src/decimal/elementary_pm1_rows_wbtest.mbt` (exact rational arithmetic and certified MPFR enclosures, `tools/generate_decimal_pm1_rows.py`), which pass on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript."
msgstr "*十进制 `exp2m1`、`exp10m1`、`log2p1` 与 `log10p1`*（[#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)）：族 `decm-exp2m1`、`decm-exp10m1`、`decm-log2p1` 与 `decm-log10p1`，种子 20261118，每个 250,000 个 native 用例（共 1,000,000 个）在值、同值类与全部八个标志上都与 MPFR 一致；Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 上每个函数各 100,000 个用例（每个目标 400,000 个，共 1,200,000 个，804 个经过校验的批次）同样一致，于 2026-11-19 用 `just random-diff run --family decm-exp2m1 --family decm-exp10m1 --family decm-log2p1 --family decm-log10p1 --count 100000 --seed 20261118 --target wasm --target wasm-gc --target js` 运行。在最终代码上，种子 20261118 的 1,000,000 个 native 用例又运行了一遍（1,000 个经过校验的批次），另有第二个种子 20261202：native、Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 上每个函数各 100,000 个用例（每个目标 400,000 个，共 1,600,000 个，1,204 个经过校验的批次）；两者都于 2026-11-19 运行，均无分歧。这里不抽取精确结果；精确结果、整数附近与 -1 附近的聚集情形、微小参数以及微小性与 clamp 的边界由 `library/src/decimal/elementary_pm1_rows_wbtest.mbt` 的 10,673 行覆盖（精确有理数运算与认证的 MPFR 包络，`tools/generate_decimal_pm1_rows.py`），它们在 native、Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 上通过。"

#: manual/verification.md:378
msgid "*Decimal `rsqrt`, `compound` and `powr`* ([#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)): families `decm-rsqrt`, `decm-compound` and `decm-powr`; `compound` rows are certified from exact arithmetic (the rational $(1+x)^n$, an exact decimal $1 + nx \\pm 2(nx)^2$ for $|x| < 10^{-150}$, or libmpdec $\\exp(n\\ln(1+x))$ with a proven slack), never from `mpfr_compound_si`, which MPFR 4.2.2 rounds wrongly for $n < 0$ in the directed modes. Seed 20261118: 250,000 native cases per function (750,000) and 100,000 per function on each of Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript (900,000); seed 20261202: 100,000 per function on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript (1,200,000); all on 2026-11-19 and all in agreement in value, cohort and flags. The 14,267 rows of `library/src/decimal/elementary_rcp_rows_wbtest.mbt` (`tools/generate_decimal_rcp_rows.py`) add the exact cases, the preferred exponents, the `Int32` minimum of `compound`, operands down to $10^{-1\\,999\\,997}$ and the range limits, on all four targets."
msgstr "*十进制 `rsqrt`、`compound` 与 `powr`*（[#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)）：族 `decm-rsqrt`、`decm-compound` 与 `decm-powr`；`compound` 的行由精确运算认证（有理数 $(1+x)^n$；$|x| < 10^{-150}$ 时的精确十进制数 $1 + nx \\pm 2(nx)^2$；或带有已证明余量的 libmpdec $\\exp(n\\ln(1+x))$），从不取自 `mpfr_compound_si`，因为 MPFR 4.2.2 在定向舍入下对 $n < 0$ 舍入错误。种子 20261118：每个函数 250,000 个 native 用例（共 750,000 个），以及 Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 上每个函数各 100,000 个（共 900,000 个）；种子 20261202：native、Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 上每个函数各 100,000 个（共 1,200,000 个）；均于 2026-11-19 运行，在值、同值类与标志上全部一致。`library/src/decimal/elementary_rcp_rows_wbtest.mbt` 的 14,267 行（`tools/generate_decimal_rcp_rows.py`）在全部四个目标上补充了精确情形、首选指数、`compound` 的 `Int32` 最小值、低至 $10^{-1\\,999\\,997}$ 的操作数以及范围边界。"

#: manual/verification.md:393
msgid "*Decimal `exp`, `exp2` and `exp10` at the range limits* ([#363](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/363)): families `decimal-exp`, `decimal-exp2` and `decimal-exp10`, 100,000 native cases per function for seed 334 and for seed 20261120 (600,000) and 20,000 per function on each of Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript for seed 334 (180,000), run on 2026-11-20, in agreement with MPFR in value, cohort and flags. The generator reaches the failing arguments only rarely (case `m334.exp2.30728` is one of them), so the boundaries are covered by deterministic rows: `library/src/decimal/exp_range_rows_wbtest.mbt` (`tools/generate_decimal_exp_range_rows.py`, Python `decimal` at 400 digits, a cross-check only) holds 8,330 rows for the context of the issue, decimal32, decimal64, decimal128 and a wide context, the five rounding directions, at results just inside and outside the range and at the thresholds of the decision; they also cover `expm1`, `exp2m1`, `exp10m1`, `sinh`, `cosh`, `pow`, `powr`, `pown`, `compound` and `rsqrt`, none of which failed before the change."
msgstr "*范围极限处的十进制 `exp`、`exp2` 和 `exp10`*（[#363](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/363)）：族 `decimal-exp`、`decimal-exp2` 和 `decimal-exp10`，种子 334 与种子 20261120 在 native 上每个函数各 100,000 个用例（共 600,000），种子 334 在 Wasm、Wasm-GC 和 JavaScript 上每个函数各 20,000 个（共 180,000），于 2026-11-20 运行，其值、同值类和标志与 MPFR 一致。生成器只是偶尔才会产生出错的参数（用例 `m334.exp2.30728` 就是其中之一），因此边界由确定性的行覆盖：`library/src/decimal/exp_range_rows_wbtest.mbt`（`tools/generate_decimal_exp_range_rows.py`，用 400 位的 Python `decimal`，仅作交叉核对）含有 8,330 行，覆盖该问题的上下文、decimal32、decimal64、decimal128 和一个宽上下文，五种舍入方向，位于刚好在范围内外的结果以及该决策的阈值处；它们也覆盖 `expm1`、`exp2m1`、`exp10m1`、`sinh`、`cosh`、`pow`、`powr`、`pown`、`compound` 和 `rsqrt`，这些函数在改动前都没有失败。"

#: manual/verification.md:408
msgid "*Decimal `asinPi`, `acosPi`, `atanPi` and `atan2Pi`* ([#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)): families `decimal-asinpi`, `decimal-acospi`, `decimal-atanpi` and `decimal-atan2pi`, certified by `mpfr_asinpi`, `mpfr_acospi`, `mpfr_atanpi` and `mpfr_atan2pi`. Seed 20261118: 100,000 native cases per function (400,000) and 20,000 per function on each of Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript (240,000), 564 validated batches, run on 2026-11-19 with `just random-diff run --family decimal-asinpi --family decimal-acospi --family decimal-atanpi --family decimal-atan2pi --count 100000 --seed 20261118 --target native` and the same with `--count 20000 --target wasm --target wasm-gc --target js`, in agreement with MPFR in value, cohort and all eight flags. The 9,691 rows of `testdata/decimal/ieee/rows/pi_inverse.txt` (`tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py`) add the exact Niven values at the preferred exponent 0, the clusters next to $\\pm\\tfrac12$ and $\\pm 1$ in the five rounding directions on both sides, operands down to $10^{-1\\,999\\,996}$ and the range limits of decimal32/64/128. They run in the full gate and the nightly run on all four targets, and all of them run in the quick gate (see [Quick-gate table of the π-inverse rows](#quick-gate-table-of-the-π-inverse-rows))."
msgstr "*十进制 `asinPi`、`acosPi`、`atanPi` 与 `atan2Pi`*（[#236](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/236)）：族 `decimal-asinpi`、`decimal-acospi`、`decimal-atanpi` 与 `decimal-atan2pi`，分别由 `mpfr_asinpi`、`mpfr_acospi`、`mpfr_atanpi` 与 `mpfr_atan2pi` 认证。种子 20261118：每个函数 native 100,000 例（共 400,000），Wasm、Wasm-GC 与 JavaScript 各每个函数 20,000 例（共 240,000），564 个已验证批次，于 2026-11-19 运行，命令为 `just random-diff run --family decimal-asinpi --family decimal-acospi --family decimal-atanpi --family decimal-atan2pi --count 100000 --seed 20261118 --target native`，以及同样的 `--count 20000 --target wasm --target wasm-gc --target js`，在数值、同值类与全部八个标志上与 MPFR 一致。`testdata/decimal/ieee/rows/pi_inverse.txt` 的 9,691 行（`tools/generate_decimal_pi_inverse_rows.py`）补充了首选指数 0 的精确 Niven 值、$\\pm\\tfrac12$ 与 $\\pm 1$ 附近五种舍入方向两侧的聚集情形、小至 $10^{-1\\,999\\,996}$ 的操作数，以及 decimal32/64/128 的范围极限。这些行在完整门禁与夜间运行中于四个目标上执行，快速门禁则运行全部这些行（见 [π 反函数行的快速门禁表](#quick-gate-table-of-the-π-inverse-rows)）。"

#: manual/verification.md:426
msgid "*Binary elementary functions*: one finding in 1,000,000 native cases (and 300,000 on the other backends): `exp2` of exactly −2^30 returned +0 with no flags where the result 2^−1073741824 is an exact subnormal (13 cases, [#271](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/271)). It is fixed, and its rows are regression rows of `testdata/bin_float/random-regressions.txt`. After the fix two seeds (20261118 and 20261201) agree with MPFR in 1,000,000 native `elem` cases each. The random sample reaches the range limits rarely, so `tools/range_boundary_rows.py` generates the thresholds directly: for every precision from 2 to 300, six contexts (unbounded, the binary16, 32, 64 and 128 ranges, `e_min = -6`) and the thresholds log2(result) in {q − 1, q, e_min, e_max, e_max + 1}, the arguments of `exp`, `exp2`, `exp10`, `expm1`, `pow`, `pown` and `rootn` are placed on each threshold and at relative offsets of 2^−20 to 2^−64, rounding direction and tininess rule cycling (1,269,554 rows). That sweep found four more disagreements, all fixed with regression rows or tests: `pow` of an exact power of two below 2^e_min ([#272](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/272)), the underflow flag of `pown` under after-rounding tininess near the implementation limit ([#273](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/273)), `expm1` just past its overflow threshold ([#274](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/274)) and `pown` of a value between half and the whole smallest subnormal, rounded to the wrong neighbour ([#278](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/278)); after the fixes it agrees with MPFR in all 1,269,554 rows. A probe of the neighbouring `hypot` found that operands with an exponent beyond ±2^29 give 0 or infinity without flags ([#275](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/275), open): the random generator does not draw such operands and the sweep does not include that function."
msgstr "*二进制初等函数*：在 1,000,000 个 native 用例（其他后端各 300,000 个）中有一个发现：对 −2^30 整数做 `exp2` 时，结果 2^−1073741824 是精确的次正规数，却返回 +0 且没有任何标志（13 个用例，[#271](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/271)）。该问题已修复，其行成为 `testdata/bin_float/random-regressions.txt` 的回归行。修复之后，两个种子（20261118 与 20261201）在各 1,000,000 个 native `elem` 用例中都与 MPFR 一致。随机样本很少触及范围极限，因此 `tools/range_boundary_rows.py` 直接生成阈值：对 2 到 300 的每个精度、六种上下文（无界、binary16、32、64、128 的范围、`e_min = -6`）以及阈值 log2(结果) ∈ {q − 1, q, e_min, e_max, e_max + 1}，把 `exp`、`exp2`、`exp10`、`expm1`、`pow`、`pown`、`rootn` 的参数放在每个阈值上以及相对偏移 2^−20 到 2^−64 处，舍入方向与 tininess 规则循环取用（1,269,554 行）。该扫描又发现四处不一致，均已修复并附有回归行或测试：`pow` 对低于 2^e_min 的精确 2 的幂（[#272](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/272)）、`pown` 在实现极限附近舍入后 tininess 下的 underflow 标志（[#273](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/273)）、`expm1` 刚过上溢阈值时的结果（[#274](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/274)），以及 `pown` 对介于最小次正规数的一半与整个最小次正规数之间的值舍入到了错误的邻点（[#278](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/278)）；修复后它与 MPFR 在全部 1,269,554 行上一致。对相邻的 `hypot` 做的探测发现，指数超出 ±2^29 的操作数会得到 0 或无穷且没有标志（[#275](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/275)，尚未修复）：随机生成器不会产生这样的操作数，扫描也不包含该函数。"

#: manual/verification.md:454
msgid "*`rSqrt`, `compound` and `powr`* (family `elem3` of the generator): 1,000,000 native cases and 100,000 on each of Wasm, JavaScript and Wasm-GC agree with MPFR 4.2.2, and so do 718,824 range-boundary rows (precisions 2 to 300, six contexts, both tininess rules; the thresholds of $1/\\sqrt{x}$, $(1 + x)^n$ for $n \\in \\{\\pm 3, \\pm 7, \\pm 100\\}$ and $x^y$ with $y$ placed on $\\log_2$ of each threshold). The comparison needed two corrections of the oracle, both documented in `testdata/bin_float/README.md`: `mpfr_compound_si` is wrong for a negative `n` in the directed modes and near the range limits (proved with exact rational arithmetic on all 2,017 boundary rows; the rows use the exact rational instead), and `mpfr_rec_sqrt(-0)` is +inf where the standard says -inf. The library had no disagreement in either case."
msgstr "*`rSqrt`、`compound` 和 `powr`*（生成器的 `elem3` 族）：原生 1,000,000 个用例，以及 Wasm、JavaScript 和 Wasm-GC 各 100,000 个用例都与 MPFR 4.2.2 一致，718,824 行范围边界行也一致（精度 2 到 300，六种上下文，两种 tininess 规则；覆盖 $1/\\sqrt{x}$ 的阈值、$n \\in \\{\\pm 3, \\pm 7, \\pm 100\\}$ 时 $(1 + x)^n$ 的阈值，以及 $y$ 取在各阈值 $\\log_2$ 上的 $x^y$）。比较需要对预言做两处修正，均记录在 `testdata/bin_float/README.md`：`mpfr_compound_si` 在 $n$ 为负的定向舍入以及范围极限附近是错的（对全部 2,017 个边界行用精确有理数运算证明；这些行改用精确有理数），`mpfr_rec_sqrt(-0)` 返回 +inf 而标准要求 -inf。两种情况下库都没有不一致。"

#: manual/verification.md:465
msgid "*`asinPi`, `acosPi`, `atanPi` and `atan2Pi`* (family `elem4` of the generator): 1,000,000 native cases and 100,000 on each of Wasm, JavaScript and Wasm-GC agree with MPFR 4.2.2 (`mpfr_asinpi`, `mpfr_acospi`, `mpfr_atanpi`, `mpfr_atan2pi`), and so do 1,654,315 range-boundary rows (precisions 2 to 300, six contexts, both tininess rules): the underflow thresholds ($\\operatorname{asinPi}(x) \\approx x/\\pi$ at $x = \\pi 2^{k}$), the anchors $\\pm 1/2$ and $\\pm 1$ for $\\operatorname{atanPi}$ of a huge argument, $\\operatorname{acosPi}$ of a tiny one and $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}$ of an extreme ratio (leading-exponent difference $D$ from $\\pm(p + 4)$ to $\\pm(p + 12)$, around the point $|D| = p + 8$ where the library switches to the anchor rule), and arguments next to $\\pm 1$. 11,661 `atan2pi` rows with operands more than 100,000 binades apart are not oracle rows: `mpfr_atan2pi` of MPFR 4.2.2 slows down with the exponent difference (5 s at 2^(2*10^7)), so they are skipped and covered by `library/src/bin_float/pi_inverse_wbtest.mbt` against an independent model and against `atanpi` of an exact power of two. The library had no disagreement."
msgstr "*`asinPi`、`acosPi`、`atanPi` 和 `atan2Pi`*（生成器的 `elem4` 族）：原生 1,000,000 个用例，以及 Wasm、JavaScript 和 Wasm-GC 各 100,000 个用例都与 MPFR 4.2.2（`mpfr_asinpi`、`mpfr_acospi`、`mpfr_atanpi`、`mpfr_atan2pi`）一致，1,654,315 行范围边界行也一致（精度 2 到 300，六种上下文，两种 tininess 规则）：下溢阈值（$x = \\pi 2^{k}$ 处 $\\operatorname{asinPi}(x) \\approx x/\\pi$）、巨大参数的 $\\operatorname{atanPi}$、微小参数的 $\\operatorname{acosPi}$ 以及极端比值的 $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}$ 在 $\\pm 1/2$ 和 $\\pm 1$ 处的锚点（最高位指数差 $D$ 从 $\\pm(p + 4)$ 到 $\\pm(p + 12)$，覆盖库切换到锚点规则的 $|D| = p + 8$ 附近），以及 $\\pm 1$ 附近的参数。11,661 个操作数相差超过 100,000 个二进制数量级的 `atan2pi` 行不是预言行：MPFR 4.2.2 的 `mpfr_atan2pi` 随指数差变慢（2^(2*10^7) 时 5 秒），所以被跳过，改由 `library/src/bin_float/pi_inverse_wbtest.mbt` 对照独立模型以及精确 2 的幂的 `atanpi` 来覆盖。库没有不一致。"

#: manual/verification.md:481
msgid "*Decimal arithmetic*: `multiply`, `divide`, `squareroot`, `apply`, `tosci` and `toeng` agreed with libmpdec in all 6,000,000 native cases. `add`, `subtract` and `fma` disagreed in 83 of 3,000,000 (overflow reported when an operand rounds past Nmax: [#264](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/264)). The campaign's first run had 10 further disagreements whose operand was above Emax; decTest converts operands subject to the directives, so they are a property of the rows, not findings (the generator now keeps operands within Emax)."
msgstr "*十进制算术*：`multiply`、`divide`、`squareroot`、`apply`、`tosci` 和 `toeng` 在全部 6,000,000 个 native 用例中与 libmpdec 一致。`add`、`subtract` 和 `fma` 在 3,000,000 个中有 83 个不一致（当操作数舍入越过 Nmax 时报告溢出：[#264](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/264)）。测试活动的第一次运行还有 10 个操作数高于 Emax 的不一致；decTest 按指令转换操作数，所以它们是这些行的性质，而不是发现（生成器现在把操作数保持在 Emax 之内）。"

#: manual/verification.md:489
msgid "*Decimal `power`*: 100,000 native cases disagreed with libmpdec in at least 300 of them; four defects are filed: the sign of an overflowing result ([#265](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/265)), trailing zeros of inexact results ([#266](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/266)), a spurious Clamped ([#267](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/267)) and missing Subnormal and Underflow ([#268](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/268)). One more symptom (the exact result `power(0.05, -8) = 2.56E+10` raises Rounded) is not filed yet. `exp`, `ln` and `log10` agreed in all 300,000 native cases."
msgstr "*十进制 `power`*：100,000 个 native 用例中至少有 300 个与 libmpdec 不一致；已提交四个缺陷：溢出结果的符号（[#265](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/265)）、不精确结果的尾随零（[#266](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/266)）、多余的 Clamped（[#267](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/267)）以及缺失的 Subnormal 和 Underflow（[#268](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/268)）。另有一个现象（精确结果 `power(0.05, -8) = 2.56E+10` 带有 Rounded）尚未提交。`exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 在全部 300,000 个 native 用例中一致。"

#: manual/verification.md:499
msgid "**Known intentional differences, filtered where the rows are generated.** The numbers above exclude, and the test-data READMEs document, these cases: MPFR has no subnormals (emulated with `mpfr_subnormalize`; nearest-away rows that would be subnormal are drawn in nearest-even) and its range is one binade narrower than BinFloat's at the extreme limits (the rows set MPFR's range to the row's own range, so those limits are compared); NaN payloads are not compared; the decimal elementary functions answer `Invalid_context` when |Emax| or |Emin| reaches 10^6 (the decNumber `DEC_MAX_MATH` limit the package adopts as a deliberate implementation limit, which decTest requires and GDA 1.70's Invalid context condition permits, but which the operation text does not state; opt-in `decimal_gda-*wide` families sample those contexts); libmpdec decides Subnormal and Underflow of `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` after rounding where GDA 1.70 says before any rounding, so elementary rows keep Emin below 0; `apply` of a signaling NaN is not specified; `tosci` and `toeng` apply the context precision as decTest specifies."
msgstr "**已知的有意差异，在生成行时过滤。** 上述数字排除了下列情形，测试数据 README 也有记录：MPFR 没有次正规数（用 `mpfr_subnormalize` 仿真；会成为次正规数的就近远离行改用就近偶抽取），并且它的范围在极限处比 BinFloat 窄一个二进制位（行把 MPFR 的范围设为该行自己的范围，因此这些极限是被比较的）；不比较 NaN 载荷；当 |Emax| 或 |Emin| 达到 10^6 时，十进制初等函数回答 `Invalid_context`（这是该包采用的 decNumber `DEC_MAX_MATH` 限制，是一项有意的实现限制，decTest 要求它，GDA 1.70 的 Invalid context 条件允许它，但运算正文并未规定；可选的 `decimal_gda-*wide` 族会抽样这些上下文）；对 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power`，libmpdec 在舍入后判定 Subnormal 和 Underflow，而 GDA 1.70 说的是任何舍入之前，所以初等函数行把 Emin 保持在 0 以下；signaling NaN 的 `apply` 没有规定；`tosci` 和 `toeng` 按 decTest 的规定应用上下文精度。"

#: manual/verification.md:513
msgid "**An oracle defect.** `mpfr_sqrt` of MPFR 4.2.2 (Homebrew bottle, arm64) reports an exact result, or a result on the wrong side of the root, for some operands with an odd binary exponent whose precision is near the output precision (`tools/mpfr_sqrt_ternary_repro.c` is a standalone reproducer). The first run of 2,000,000 `sqrt` cases had 22 failing batches from it; the generator now checks each `sqrt` row with exact arithmetic and draws the case again when MPFR is wrong, and the final run of 2,000,000 `sqrt` cases agreed in all cases. This is a claim about the Homebrew build I used, not about every MPFR release."
msgstr "**一个预言机缺陷。** MPFR 4.2.2（Homebrew 瓶装版，arm64）的 `mpfr_sqrt`，对某些二进制指数为奇数、精度接近输出精度的操作数，会报告精确结果或给出在根错误一侧的结果（`tools/mpfr_sqrt_ternary_repro.c` 是一个独立的复现程序）。首次运行的 2,000,000 个 `sqrt` 用例中有 22 个失败批源于此；生成器现在用精确算术检查每个 `sqrt` 行，并在 MPFR 出错时重新抽取该用例，最终运行的 2,000,000 个 `sqrt` 用例全部一致。这是关于我所用 Homebrew 构建的说法，不是关于每个 MPFR 版本的说法。"

#: manual/verification.md:522
msgid "**Not covered.** Operations the oracles lack (`rem`, `roundToIntegral`, the integer conversions, `scaleB`/`logB`, decimal operations other than the thirteen families); NaN payload policy; nearest-away results in the subnormal range; decimal contexts with |Emax| or |Emin| of 10^6 or more for the elementary functions; precisions above 700 for the binary elementary functions; the LLVM backend; interval arithmetic. The campaign samples a finite space with fixed seeds: the counts are what was run, not a proof of absence."
msgstr "**未覆盖。** 预言机不提供的运算（`rem`、`roundToIntegral`、整数转换、`scaleB`/`logB`、十三个族之外的十进制运算）；NaN 载荷策略；次正规范围内的就近远离结果；初等函数 |Emax| 或 |Emin| 达到 10^6 或更大的十进制上下文；二进制初等函数中大于 700 的精度；LLVM 后端；区间算术。该测试活动用固定种子抽样一个有限空间：计数是实际运行的数量，不是不存在缺陷的证明。"

#: manual/verification.md:530
msgid "Reproducibility"
msgstr "可复现性"

#: manual/verification.md:532
msgid "External artifacts are pinned by revision and SHA-256 in each corpus manifest (`testdata/*/corpora.json`). Builds use backend-named outputs and isolated target directories so that parallel jobs do not overwrite each other. Shards select deterministic case indices, and merged summaries keep exact totals and failed IDs. Large generated fixtures are split across files (the IEEE decimal public-API fixture is written 400 tests per file) so that every toolchain compiles them."
msgstr "外部产物在各语料清单（`testdata/*/corpora.json`）中按版本和 SHA-256 固定。构建使用以后端命名的输出和隔离的目标目录，使并行任务不会相互覆盖。分片选取确定性的用例索引，合并后的汇总保留精确的总数和失败 ID。大型生成 fixture 被拆分到多个文件中（IEEE 十进制公开 API fixture 每个文件写入 400 个测试），以便每种工具链都能编译。"

#: manual/verification.md:540
msgid "The MoonBit frontends parse and execute numeric rows. Python orchestrates downloads, task planning, subprocesses, target selection and aggregation. An optional oracle is never silently replaced by a weaker one; a missing requirement is reported explicitly."
msgstr "MoonBit 前端负责解析并执行数值行。Python 负责编排下载、任务规划、子进程、目标选择和结果汇总。可选的判定实现（oracle）绝不会被悄悄替换为更弱的实现；缺失的前提条件会被明确报告。"

#: manual/verification.md:545
msgid "Performance evidence is separate from semantic conformance. Benchmark manifests pin the baseline source, dependencies, toolchain, target, schedule, sample count and dispersion limits, and a performance threshold never changes correctness. See [performance audit](./performance_audit.md) and the per-package performance pages."
msgstr "性能证据与语义符合性相互独立。基准测试清单固定了基线源码、依赖、工具链、目标、调度、样本数和离散度上限，且性能阈值从不改变正确性。参见[性能审计](./performance_audit.md)以及各包的性能页面。"

#: manual/verification.md:551
msgid "Failure triage"
msgstr "失败排查"

#: manual/verification.md:553
msgid "Re-run the failing backend with the smallest case, ID filter, phase or shard that reproduces it."
msgstr "用能复现问题的最小用例、ID 过滤器、阶段或分片重新运行失败的后端。"

#: manual/verification.md:555
msgid "Distinguish parse diagnostics, unsupported cases, legacy classifications, executable mismatches and infrastructure failures."
msgstr "区分解析诊断、不受支持的用例、旧有分类、可执行结果不匹配以及基础设施故障。"

#: manual/verification.md:557
msgid "Record the expected value, actual value, flags, context, target, corpus revision and command."
msgstr "记录期望值、实际值、标志、上下文、目标、语料版本和命令。"

#: manual/verification.md:559
msgid "Run the matching white-box package test to decide whether the defect is in parsing, arithmetic, interchange or aggregation."
msgstr "运行对应的白盒包测试，以判断缺陷位于解析、算术、交换格式还是汇总环节。"

#: manual/verification.md:561
msgid "After a fix, run the focused case, the committed smoke fixture, the backend gate, and finally `just pr` or `just ci`."
msgstr "修复后，依次运行针对性用例、已提交的冒烟 fixture、后端关卡，最后运行 `just pr` 或 `just ci`。"

#: manual/verification.md:564
msgid "Do not weaken strict support, discard flags, or change the denominator to make a failing gate pass."
msgstr "不得通过降低 strict support、丢弃 flags 或改写分母让失败 gate 变绿。"

#: manual/verification.md:567
msgid "Release gate"
msgstr "发布关卡"

#: manual/verification.md:569
msgid "Before publishing:"
msgstr "发布前："

#: manual/verification.md:571
msgid "align `library/moon.mod`, `library/README.md`, the manual and `library/CHANGELOG.md`;"
msgstr "使 `library/moon.mod`、`library/README.md`、手册与 `library/CHANGELOG.md` 保持一致；"

#: manual/verification.md:572
msgid "run `just docs`, `lunadoc check`, and inspect generated interface differences;"
msgstr "运行 `just docs`、`lunadoc check`，并检查生成接口的差异；"

#: manual/verification.md:574
msgid "run `just pr` while iterating;"
msgstr "迭代期间运行 `just pr`；"

#: manual/verification.md:575
msgid "run `just ci` on the release candidate;"
msgstr "对候选发布版本运行 `just ci`；"

#: manual/verification.md:576
msgid "publish through the repository's `publish.yml` GitHub Actions workflow."
msgstr "通过仓库的 `publish.yml` GitHub Actions 工作流发布。"

#: manual/verification.md:578
msgid "Local `moon publish` is not the Luna-Flow release path, because the organization's credentials are supplied by the workflow."
msgstr "本地 `moon publish` 不是 Luna-Flow 的发布途径，因为组织的凭据由工作流提供。"

#: manual/verification.md:581
msgid "Conformance checklist"
msgstr "一致性清单"

#: manual/verification.md:583
msgid "One line per row of the clause traceability tables of the conformance pages ([binary](./conformance/bin_float.md#clause-traceability), [IEEE decimal](./conformance/decimal.md#clause-traceability), [GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md#clause-traceability), [interval](./conformance/ball_float.md#clause-traceability)). A checked box is a `conforming` row; an unchecked box names its state (`partial`, `not implemented`, `not applicable`) and carries the clause level in brackets: `required` (the standard says \"shall\"), `recommended` (\"should\") or `optional`. The counts separate gaps in required clauses from gaps in recommended or optional ones. The block is generated by `tools/conformance_checklist.py` and `just docs` fails when it is stale."
msgstr "条款追溯表（见各一致性页面）的每一行对应一行。已勾选的框表示状态为 `conforming` 的行；未勾选的框写明其状态（`partial`、`not implemented`、`not applicable`），并在方括号中标注条款级别：`required`（标准用 “shall”）、`recommended`（“should”）或 `optional`。计数把必须条款的缺口与推荐或可选条款的缺口分开。该块由 `tools/conformance_checklist.py` 生成，过期时 `just docs` 会失败。 ([binary](./conformance/bin_float.md#clause-traceability), [IEEE decimal](./conformance/decimal.md#clause-traceability), [GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md#clause-traceability), [interval](./conformance/ball_float.md#clause-traceability))"

