msgid "IEEE 754 §4.1, §9.3"
msgstr "IEEE 754 §4.1, §9.3"

#: manual/verification.md:728
msgid "How attributes are specified"
msgstr "属性如何指定"

#: manual/verification.md:728
msgid "Static: a context value passed to each operation; there are no dynamic modes and no global state."
msgstr "静态：把上下文值传给每个运算；没有动态模式，也没有全局状态。"

