msgstr "IEEE 754 §9.2"

#: manual/verification.md:730
msgid "Accuracy of recommended functions"
msgstr "推荐函数的精度"

#: manual/verification.md:730
msgid "Correctly rounded in every rounding direction (certified enclosures refined until the rounding is unique). When the refinement budget is exhausted `try_*_ctx` returns `Err` and the plain form returns NaN; decimal contexts with a precision or an exponent bound beyond 999,999 in magnitude return `invalid_context`."
msgstr "在每种舍入方向下都正确舍入（认证的包络不断细化，直到舍入结果唯一）。细化预算耗尽时，`try_*_ctx` 返回 `Err`，普通形式返回 NaN；精度或指数界的绝对值超过 999,999 的十进制上下文返回 `invalid_context`。"

