#~ msgid "**Correctness.** Before it is timed, every `floating` output is compared with the MPFR or libmpdec result for the same operand (all 427 comparisons, 61 cases in 7 rounds, were equal). Both libraries round every result correctly (MPFR always; libmpdec with `allcr = 1`; `floating` by certified refinement), so at equal precision the results are identical and the ratio compares equal work."
#~ msgstr "**正确性。** 计时之前，每个 `floating` 输出都与 MPFR 或 libmpdec 对同一操作数的结果进行比较（全部 427 次比较，即 7 轮中的 61 个用例，结果均相等）。两个库对每个结果都是正确舍入的（MPFR 始终如此；libmpdec 在 `allcr = 1` 时；`floating` 通过经证明的逐步细化），因此在相同精度下结果完全一致，比值比较的是等量的工作。"

#~ msgid "The mask comparison is an equality, so a missing inexact or an extra underflow fails the vector. Combining the flags of the re-encoding step means that if `bin_float` returned a value that the format cannot hold exactly, the encoding flags expose it."
#~ msgstr "掩码比较是相等比较，因此缺少 inexact 或多出 underflow 都会使向量失败。合并重新编码步骤的标志意味着：若 `bin_float` 返回了该格式无法精确容纳的值，编码标志会将其暴露出来。"

