#~ msgstr "操作数本身"

#~ msgid "Let $t_F$ and $t_R$ be the time per operation of `floating` and of the reference library for one case (operation and precision). Each side yields blocks of per-operation times, $x_{r,j}$ in round $r$ and block $j$. The reported quantities are the pooled medians $\\tilde t_F = \\operatorname{med}_{r,j} x^F_{r,j}$ and $\\tilde t_R = \\operatorname{med}_{r,j} x^R_{r,j}$ and the ratio"
#~ msgstr "设 $t_F$ 和 $t_R$ 分别为 `floating` 和参考库在某个用例（操作与精度）上的每次操作时间。每一侧产生若干块每次操作时间，第 $r$ 轮第 $j$ 块记为 $x_{r,j}$。报告的量是合并后的中位数 $\\tilde t_F = \\operatorname{med}_{r,j} x^F_{r,j}$ 与 $\\tilde t_R = \\operatorname{med}_{r,j} x^R_{r,j}$，以及比值"

#~ msgid "The harness overhead is measured, not assumed"
#~ msgstr "测量框架的开销是测出来的，而不是假设的"

