#~ msgid "`combine` is associative, commutative and idempotent with `new()` as identity. `contains(s)` reads the field for `s`, except that `contains(InvalidOperation)` is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined` or `invalid_context` is set."
