#~ msgid "**`floating` is slower than both C libraries in every one of the 59 cells.** The smallest ratio is 1.77 (`decimal_gda` multiplication at 1000 digits) and the largest 2554 (binary `sin` at 8192 bits)."
#~ msgstr "**在全部 59 个单元格中，`floating` 都比两个 C 库慢。** 最小比值为 1.77（1000 位数字的十进制乘法），最大为 2554（8192 位的二进制 `sin`）。"

#~ msgid "**Square root is not smooth in precision.** The ratio is 7.8 at 128 bits, 49.9 at 512 bits and 27.8 at 2048 and 8192 bits. At 512 bits `floating` takes 8.26 us, 17 times its time at 128 bits for 4 times the width, where MPFR's time grows 2.6 times. The change of algorithm at 512 bits (fixed-width kernels below, divide and conquer above) is the likely cause; see the follow-up list."
#~ msgstr "**平方根随精度并不平滑。** 比值在 128 位时为 7.8，512 位时为 49.9，2048 位和 8192 位时为 27.8。在 512 位时 `floating` 需要 8.26 us，是它 128 位时间的 17 倍，而宽度只增加到 4 倍，MPFR 的时间则增长 2.6 倍。512 位处的算法切换（以下为定宽内核，以上为分治）很可能是原因；见后续事项列表。"

#~ msgid "**Elementary functions: 65 to 2554 times slower, and the gap grows with precision.** `exp` is 65 times slower at 53 bits and 411 times at 8192 bits; `ln` 141 and 2472 times; `sin` 435 and 2554 times. At 53 bits a `sin` takes 218 us in `floating` and 0.5 us in MPFR. Both are correctly rounded, so the work is equal in specification but not in method: `floating` certifies each result by interval arithmetic and a Ziv refinement loop, and the cost grows faster than MPFR's with the precision. `exp` at 8192 bits (87 ms against 213 us) and `ln` and `sin` at 8192 bits (286 ms and 507 ms) are among the slowest operations measured."
#~ msgstr "**初等函数：慢 65 到 2554 倍，且差距随精度增大。** `exp` 在 53 位时慢 65 倍，在 8192 位时慢 411 倍；`ln` 为 141 倍和 2472 倍；`sin` 为 435 倍和 2554 倍。在 53 位时，一次 `sin` 在 `floating` 中耗时 218 us，在 MPFR 中为 0.5 us。两者都是正确舍入的，所以按规格看工作量相同，但方法不同：`floating` 通过区间算术和 Ziv 细化循环来证明每个结果，其成本随精度增长得比 MPFR 更快。8192 位的 `exp`（87 ms 对 213 us）以及 8192 位的 `ln` 和 `sin`（286 ms 和 507 ms）属于测得最慢的操作。"

#~ msgid "**`decimal_gda`: closer, but still slower everywhere.** Against libmpdec, addition is 6.7 to 16 times slower, multiplication 1.8 to 16, division 3.1 to 22 and square root 2.1 to 6.0. The gap narrows with the digit count for these four operations: at 1000 digits multiplication is 1.8 times, square root 2.1 and division 3.1 times libmpdec. `ln` is 15 to 24 times slower and `exp` 37 to 96 times. The `exp` ratio is not monotone in the digit count: `floating` takes about 250 to 290 us at 16 and 34 digits, a floor that does not shrink with fewer digits, while libmpdec's time grows from 2.9 us to 8.0 us."
#~ msgstr "**十进制：更接近，但处处仍然更慢。** 对比 libmpdec，加法慢 6.7 到 16 倍，乘法慢 1.8 到 16 倍，除法慢 3.1 到 22 倍，平方根慢 2.1 到 6.0 倍。这四种操作的差距随数字位数增加而缩小：在 1000 位数字时，乘法是 libmpdec 的 1.8 倍，平方根是 2.1 倍，除法是 3.1 倍。`ln` 慢 15 到 24 倍，`exp` 慢 37 到 96 倍。`exp` 的比值随数字位数并不单调：`floating` 在 16 位和 34 位数字时耗时约 250 到 290 us，这是一个不随位数减少而降低的下限，而 libmpdec 的时间从 2.9 us 增长到 8.0 us。"

#~ msgid "**Measurement history.** A first five-round run was discarded, not selected against: the machine switched from battery to AC power during it and another session on the same machine kept about six processes at full CPU, and round medians of one cell differed by up to a factor of two, so every cell was marked noisy. Its ratios differ from this run's by 21% in the median cell and by up to 49% (`decimal_gda/ln/16`), and its intervals are 7 to 250 times wider (median 62 times). The reported run added the quiet-machine gate, the power-source check, and a larger number of shorter rounds."
#~ msgstr "**测量历史。** 第一次五轮运行被丢弃，不是出于选择性取舍：运行期间机器从电池供电切换为交流电，并且同一台机器上的另一个会话让大约六个进程满负荷占用 CPU，同一单元格各轮的中位数相差多达两倍，所以每个单元格都被标记为有噪声。其比值与本次运行相比，中位数单元格相差 21%，最多相差 49%（`decimal_gda/ln/16`），其区间宽 7 到 250 倍（中位数 62 倍）。本次报告的运行增加了安静机器门控、电源检查，以及更多次、更短的轮次。"

#~ msgid "A short `sample` profile of the `floating` test binary (4 seconds on `binary/sqrt/512` and on `binary/sin/128`; indicative, not a rigorous profile) shows the following. No library code was changed for this baseline."
#~ msgstr "对 `floating` 测试二进制文件做了一次简短的 `sample` 分析（在 `binary/sqrt/512` 和 `binary/sin/128` 上各 4 秒；仅供参考，不是严格的性能剖析），结果如下。本基线没有修改任何库代码。"

#~ msgid "**Allocation and reference counting dominate the small cases.** The top frames are `moonbit_drop_object`, `mi_malloc`, `moonbit_make_int32_array` and, for the elementary functions, `scan_regular_object` (the cycle scan of the reference counter) and thread-local lookups of the allocator. Every `BinCoeff` intermediate is a heap array of 32-bit limbs. Fewer intermediate `BinCoeff` values in the contextual rounding path (`binary_round_rational`, `normalize_finite`, `add_heap`) would help add, mul and div at 53 to 512 bits, where `floating` is 10 to 33 times slower."
#~ msgstr "**分配和引用计数主导了小规模用例。** 最靠前的栈帧是 `moonbit_drop_object`、`mi_malloc`、`moonbit_make_int32_array`，对初等函数还有 `scan_regular_object`（引用计数器的环扫描）以及分配器的线程局部查找。每个 `BinCoeff` 中间量都是由 32 位肢组成的堆数组。在上下文舍入路径（`binary_round_rational`、`normalize_finite`、`add_heap`）中减少 `BinCoeff` 中间量，会改善 53 到 512 位的加法、乘法和除法，那里 `floating` 慢 10 到 33 倍。"

#~ msgid "**`sqrt` at 512 bits.** The profile is led by `compare`, `shift_left` and `test_bit` inside `bin_coeff_sqrt_rem_divide_conquer`: bit-level work on heap coefficients. The jump from 493 ns at 128 bits to 8.26 us at 512 bits suggests the divide-and-conquer threshold is too low, or its base case too slow, at this size."
#~ msgstr "**512 位的 `sqrt`。** 剖析结果以 `bin_coeff_sqrt_rem_divide_conquer` 内的 `compare`、`shift_left` 和 `test_bit` 为主：这是对堆上系数的位级操作。从 128 位的 493 ns 跳到 512 位的 8.26 us，说明分治阈值在这个规模上偏低，或者它的基本情形太慢。"

#~ msgid "**Elementary functions.** The start precision of the certification loop is at least 128 bits (`max(128, 4D + 64)` for `decimal_gda`), which puts a floor of roughly 220 to 350 us on `decimal_gda` `exp` and `ln` at 16 and 34 digits and 36 to 55 us on binary `exp` and `ln` at 53 bits, where MPFR needs 0.4 to 0.6 us. A cheaper first attempt at the target precision plus a few guard bits, falling back to the existing loop, would address the low-precision end. The growth towards 8192 bits needs a different algorithm (argument reduction and series evaluation on `BinCoeff` with bit-burst or binary splitting) and is a larger piece of work."
#~ msgstr "**初等函数。** 证明循环的起始精度至少为 128 位（十进制为 `max(128, 4D + 64)`），这使得 16 位和 34 位数字的十进制 `exp` 和 `ln` 有大约 220 到 350 us 的下限，53 位二进制 `exp` 和 `ln` 有 36 到 55 us 的下限，而 MPFR 只需要 0.4 到 0.6 us。先以目标精度加少量保护位做一次更便宜的尝试，失败时回退到现有循环，可以改善低精度一端。向 8192 位增长则需要不同的算法（在 `BinCoeff` 上做自变量规约和级数求值，采用 bit-burst 或二进制分裂），是更大的工作。"

#~ msgid "**Multiplication at 8192 bits.** 27.3 us against 2.14 us; 8192 bits is 256 limbs of 32 bits, below the native Toom-3 and transform thresholds (2048 limbs), so the Karatsuba range and its allocations are where the time goes. This is an inference from the thresholds, not a measurement."
#~ msgstr "**8192 位的乘法。** 27.3 us 对 2.14 us；8192 位是 256 个 32 位肢，低于 native 上的 Toom-3 和变换阈值（2048 个肢），所以时间花在 Karatsuba 范围及其分配上。这是根据阈值作出的推断，不是测量结果。"

