#~ msgstr "规范化有理数"

#~ msgid "`ExactRat::new` divides by $\\gcd(n, d)$ and makes the denominator positive. With a canonical form, derived structural equality *is* equality of rational numbers, which is what `semantic` needs to compare values across binary and decimal representations."
#~ msgstr "`ExactRat::new` 会除以 $\\gcd(n, d)$ 并使分母为正。有了规范形式，派生的结构相等*就是*有理数相等，而这正是 `semantic` 在二进制与十进制表示之间比较数值时所需要的。"

#~ msgid "`semantic` uses `ExactRat` as the canonical exact value of finite binary and decimal numbers."
#~ msgstr "`semantic` 使用 `ExactRat` 作为有限二进制数和十进制数的规范精确值。"

