#~ msgid "`nan_payload` returns the payload of a NaN and 0 for any other value. `get_payload` returns the payload of a NaN and `-1` for any other value, as IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 getPayload does. `set_payload` and `set_payload_signaling` return a quiet (respectively signaling) NaN with the given payload and the receiver's sign when the argument is a non-negative integer of at most `precision - 1` digits (the receiver's `precision`), and `+0` otherwise, whatever the receiver is."
#~ msgstr "`nan_payload` 返回 NaN 的载荷，对其他值返回 0。`get_payload` 对 NaN 返回其载荷，对其他任何值返回 `-1`，与 IEEE 754-2019 §9.7 的 getPayload 一致。当参数是不超过 `precision - 1` 位（接收者的 `precision`）的非负整数时，`set_payload` 与 `set_payload_signaling` 返回带该载荷和接收者符号的静默（相应地，信号）NaN，否则返回 `+0`，与接收者是什么无关。"

