#~ msgid "*Tiny results.* For $|x| \\le 10^{-4}$, $\\operatorname{asin}(x)/x \\in [1, 1 + x^2]$ and $\\operatorname{atan}(x)/x \\in [1 - x^2, 1]$, and the same holds for $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$ with $x > 0$ and the ratio $y/x$. Once $x^2 < 2^{-(8\\max(D,p)+400)}$ the loop encloses the moderate value $(s/\\pi)(1 \\pm 2^{-k})$ with $s = x\\,10^{-\\operatorname{adj}(x)}$ (or the quotient of the two scaled mantissas) and shifts the endpoints by $10^{\\operatorname{adj}(x)}$ before the context rounds them, as for `rsqrt` (`decimal_certified_scaled_result`): an operand $10^{-1\\,999\\,996}$ costs what $10^{-300}$ costs, where the exact decimal endpoints of a binary number near $2^{-6.6\\cdot 10^6}$ have about two million digits (an unscaled `asinpi(7E-9999)` took more than a minute in a debug build before this path existed)."
#~ msgstr "*微小结果。* 当 $|x| \\le 10^{-4}$ 时，$\\operatorname{asin}(x)/x \\in [1, 1 + x^2]$，$\\operatorname{atan}(x)/x \\in [1 - x^2, 1]$；对 $x > 0$ 的 $\\operatorname{atan2Pi}(y, x)$，以比值 $y/x$ 代入同样成立。一旦 $x^2 < 2^{-(8\\max(D,p)+400)}$，循环就包络中等大小的值 $(s/\\pi)(1 \\pm 2^{-k})$（$s = x\\,10^{-\\operatorname{adj}(x)}$，或两个缩放尾数之商），并在上下文舍入之前把端点平移 $10^{\\operatorname{adj}(x)}$，做法与 `rsqrt` 相同（`decimal_certified_scaled_result`）：操作数 $10^{-1\\,999\\,996}$ 的代价与 $10^{-300}$ 相当，而接近 $2^{-6.6\\cdot 10^6}$ 的二进制数的精确十进制端点有约两百万位（在这条路径出现之前，未缩放的 `asinpi(7E-9999)` 在调试构建中耗时超过一分钟）。"

#~ msgid "**π.** Machin's formula $\\pi = 16\\arctan\\tfrac15 - 4\\arctan\\tfrac1{239}$ with alternating series, whose truncation error is bounded by the first omitted term."
#~ msgstr "**π。** 使用 Machin 公式 $\\pi = 16\\arctan\\tfrac15 - 4\\arctan\\tfrac1{239}$ 及交错级数，其截断误差以第一个省略项为界。"

#~ msgid "**`sin`, `cos`, `tan` (`try_` forms).** Each endpoint value is the correctly rounded value of the binary kernel in the directed mode, which is the value the exact-rational series produced (it rounded an enclosure that rounded uniquely). The enclosure of $\\pi$ is needed only for the index range $K$ (the critical points and the poles) and is computed once at the initial working precision instead of on every refinement round. A range that is too large (an endpoint within $2^{-w}$ of a multiple of $\\pi/2$ at working precision $w$) widens the result to $\\pm 1$ or an unbounded tangent, which keeps the inclusion property. The non-`try` `sin_interval`, `cos_interval` and `tan_interval` stay on the exact-rational path: they return a conservative result for an argument the series cannot certify, which the `try_` forms report as an error."
#~ msgstr "**`sin`、`cos`、`tan`(`try_` 形式)。** 每个端点值是二进制核在定向模式下的正确舍入值,也就是精确有理级数曾给出的值(它对一个唯一舍入的包络进行舍入)。$\\pi$ 的包络只用于指标范围 $K$(临界点与极点),并在初始工作精度上只计算一次,而不是每轮细化都重算。过大的范围(端点在工作精度 $w$ 下与 $\\pi/2$ 的倍数相差不超过 $2^{-w}$)会使结果放宽为 $\\pm 1$ 或无界的正切,从而保持包含性。非 `try` 的 `sin_interval`、`cos_interval` 和 `tan_interval` 仍走精确有理路径:对级数无法认证的参数它们返回保守结果,而 `try_` 形式会报告错误。"

#~ msgid "powers $p_0 = 2^F$, $p_1 = a$, $p_j = \\lfloor p_{\\lceil j/2 \\rceil} p_{\\lfloor j/2 \\rfloor} / 2^F \\rfloor$, $j \\le m$. By induction $p_j \\le 2^F r^j$ and $e_j := 2^F r^j - p_j < 1 + (e_u + e_v) 2^{-K} + e_u e_v 2^{-F} < 2$ (every product loses less than one unit, the factors' errors are scaled by $r^u, r^v < 2^{-K}$);"
#~ msgstr "幂 $p_0 = 2^F$，$p_1 = a$，$p_j = \\lfloor p_{\\lceil j/2 \\rceil} p_{\\lfloor j/2 \\rfloor} / 2^F \\rfloor$，$j \\le m$。由归纳，$p_j \\le 2^F r^j$ 且 $e_j := 2^F r^j - p_j < 1 + (e_u + e_v) 2^{-K} + e_u e_v 2^{-F} < 2$（每次乘积损失不到一个单位，因子的误差被 $r^u, r^v < 2^{-K}$ 缩小）；"

#~ msgid "integer coefficients $C_i = N'!/i!$ (computed once per $N'$); $P_\\beta = \\sum_{j<m} C_{\\beta m + j}\\, p_j$ for blocks $\\beta = 0 .. b-1$;"
#~ msgstr "整数系数 $C_i = N'!/i!$（每个 $N'$ 只算一次）；对块 $\\beta = 0 .. b-1$，$P_\\beta = \\sum_{j<m} C_{\\beta m + j}\\, p_j$；"

#~ msgid "Horner in $y = p_m$: $\\mathrm{Acc}_{b-1} = P_{b-1}$, $\\mathrm{Acc}_\\beta = P_\\beta + \\lfloor p_m \\mathrm{Acc}_{\\beta+1} / 2^F \\rfloor$;"
#~ msgstr "以 $y = p_m$ 做 Horner：$\\mathrm{Acc}_{b-1} = P_{b-1}$，$\\mathrm{Acc}_\\beta = P_\\beta + \\lfloor p_m \\mathrm{Acc}_{\\beta+1} / 2^F \\rfloor$；"

#~ msgid "one division, $E = \\lfloor \\mathrm{Acc}_0 / N'! \\rfloor$."
#~ msgstr "一次除法，$E = \\lfloor \\mathrm{Acc}_0 / N'! \\rfloor$。"

#~ msgid "**Out-of-range results.** An enclosure such as $[0, \\text{tiny}]$ has endpoints that round with different flags. Any value $\\ge 10^{e_{\\max}+2}$ overflows identically, and any non-zero value $\\le 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-2} < \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ rounds identically (to zero or to the smallest subnormal, depending only on the mode and sign), so far endpoints are replaced by such representatives; the binary test uses $3.322 > \\log_2 10$ so the replacement is conservative. For `exp`, $x \\ge 3(e_{\\max}+1)$ overflows because $x \\log_{10} e \\ge 3 \\cdot 0.434\\,(e_{\\max}+1) > e_{\\max}+1$, and $x \\le -3\\,|E_{\\text{tiny}} - 1|$ underflows below $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-1}$ by the same estimate. `power` bounds $y \\log_2 x$ with directed 128-bit arithmetic for the same purpose."
#~ msgstr "**超出范围的结果。** 像 $[0, \\text{tiny}]$ 这样的包络，其端点在舍入时会产生不同的标志。任何 $\\ge 10^{e_{\\max}+2}$ 的值都以相同方式上溢，任何非零且 $\\le 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-2} < \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ 的值都以相同方式舍入（舍入为零或最小次正规数，仅取决于模式和符号），因此远处的端点会被替换为这样的代表值；二进制测试使用 $3.322 > \\log_2 10$，以保证替换是保守的。对于 `exp`，$x \\ge 3(e_{\\max}+1)$ 会上溢，因为 $x \\log_{10} e \\ge 3 \\cdot 0.434\\,(e_{\\max}+1) > e_{\\max}+1$；由同样的估计，$x \\le -3\\,|E_{\\text{tiny}} - 1|$ 会下溢到 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-1}$ 以下。出于同样的目的，`power` 用定向的 128 位算术界定 $y \\log_2 x$。"

