#~ msgid ""
#~ "[!WARNING] **Exact non-integral powers.** When $x^y$ with a non-integral $y \\n"
#~ "e 0.5$ is a representable decimal but not a binary fraction, the enclosure never shrinks to a point. In the half modes both endpoints round to the right value, so it is returned, but with `inexact` and `rounded` raised and with all $p$ digits: in decimal64, `power_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` is `0.2000000000000000` and `power_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` is `0.008000000000000000`, both flagged inexact. In the directed modes the endpoints round to neighbours, the refinement budget runs out, and the result is a certification failure (NaN with `invalid_operation` from `power_ctx`). Tracked in [#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53); a fix is proposed in [#99](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/99)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "[!WARNING] **非整数次幂的精确结果。** 当非整数 $y \\n"
#~ "e 0.5$ 的 $x^y$ 是一个可表示的十进制数、但不是二进制分数时，包络永远不会收缩为一个点。在 half 模式下，两个端点都舍入到正确的值，因此会返回该值，但会引发 `inexact` 和 `rounded`，并带有全部 $p$ 位数字：在 decimal64 中，`power_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` 为 `0.2000000000000000`，`power_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` 为 `0.008000000000000000`，二者都被标记为不精确。在定向模式下，端点舍入到相邻值，细化预算耗尽，结果为认证失败（`power_ctx` 返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN）。由 [#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53) 跟踪；修复已在 [#99](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/99) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "The IEEE `decimal` package does not yet decide exact non-integral powers such as $4^{1.5}$ first ([#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53)); `decimal_gda` does."
#~ msgstr "IEEE `decimal` 包尚未事先判定非整数次的精确幂，例如 $4^{1.5}$（[#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53)）；`decimal_gda` 已经这样做。"

#~ msgid "The matrix passes on the current branch although the branch has the deviations listed in [decimal design: known deviations](../design/decimal.md#known-deviations) (`inexact` or a certification failure for exact decimal results of non-integral powers; tracked in [#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53)). Those cases are therefore not covered by its rows, and passing the gate is evidence for the covered rows only."
#~ msgstr "尽管当前分支存在[decimal 设计：已知偏差](../design/decimal.md#known-deviations)中列出的偏差（非整数次幂的精确十进制结果带有 `inexact` 或认证失败；由 [#53](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/53) 跟踪），该矩阵在当前分支上仍然通过。因此这些情形不在其各行的覆盖范围内，通过门禁仅是所覆盖各行的证据。"

