#~ msgid "`DecCoeff` is package-private; the public representation boundary is `BigInt`. Additional public entry points that must remain visible in the generated interface are `Decimal::{from_string_ctx,parse,apply_ctx,div_checked,compare_checked,compare_total_ctx,compare_total_magnitude_ctx}` and `DecimalInterchange::to_decimal_ctx`."
